Q[7507]={d="你找到了一些非常重要的东西。这本书和你看到过的其它的书不太一样。\n\n某些人或者某些东西将图书馆的封印揭掉了，这本书中的文字十分混乱，根本无法辨识。",dEN="You have uncovered something of great importance. This book is unlike any that you have seen.\n\nIt would appear as if someone or something has managed to shatter the seal of Athenaeum. The text within is garbled and barely legible.",o="将《弗洛尔的屠龙技术纲要》还回图书馆。",oEN="Return Foror's Compendium of Dragon Slaying to the Athenaeum.",p="啊，我们最伟大的书籍中的一卷。它已经遗失很久很久了。",pEN="Ah, one of our greatest compilations. This one has been missing for ages.",c="你原本可以在黑市上把这本书卖个好价钱，$n。尤其是保护这本书的封印已经被破坏，这使得任何具备必要知识的研究者都可以了解书中包含的屠龙秘密。\n\n也许我们应该给你一份丰厚的奖励……好吧，你必须付出巨大的努力才可以获得这份奖励。\n\n<莱德罗斯对着你咧嘴笑着。>",cEN="You could have gotten quite a lot of gold for this book on the black market, <name>. Especially since the protective seal has been broken, leaving the secrets of dragon slaying viewable to any with the requisite intellect to consume the knowledge held within the sacred pages.\n\nPerhaps a grand reward is in order... Well, a reward that will require enormous effort to obtain.\n\n<Lydros grins.>"}
Q[7508]={d="如果你想要接手这个任务，那就把这把黯淡的精灵剑交给莱德罗斯吧。",dEN="If you wish to take on this task, present Lydros with the dull blade.",o="把黯淡的精灵剑交给博学者莱德罗斯。",oEN="Give the Dull and Flat Elven Blade to Lorekeeper Lydros.",p="太好了，让我们开始吧……",pEN="Excellent, let us begin...",c="如果你能想办法进入黑龙的巢穴，以她的火焰气息加热这把剑，然后用她的鲜血为它淬火，我就可以为你复原它。",cEN="If you manage to enter the lair of the dragon, heat the blade under her fiery breath, and ultimately temper it in her blood, I shall bind the blade for your use.\nRelated"}
Q[7509]={d="带着未淬火的古老之刃前往奥妮克希亚的巢穴，向她发起挑战。\n\n淬炼这把剑需要一些诡计。战斗中，她肯定会试图用火焰吐息把你烧成灰烬。当她这样做时，把未淬火的古老之刃插在她附近，让她的烈焰为它加热。如果你还$g活着:活着;，就捡起现在已经加热的古老之刃，结果那头巨龙。\n\n把这把加热的古老之刃刺入她闷烧的尸体，就能锻造出经过处理的古老之刃。",dEN="Take the unfired ancient blade to the lair of Onyxia and engage her in battle.\n\nSome trickery must be utilized for the heating of the blade. While in combat, she will surely try to incinerate you with her fiery breath. You must plant the unfired ancient blade nearby and hope that the fiery breath heats the blade. If you live beyond this, pick up the now heated ancient blade and finish off the dragon.\n\nPlunge the heated ancient blade into her smoldering corpse to fashion the treated ancient blade.",o="你必须设法让奥妮克希亚对这把未淬火的上古之刃喷射火焰。完成之后，捡起加热过的上古之刃。你要注意的是，加热过的上古之刃不会一直保持被加热的状态，时间非常紧迫。\n\n在把它给我拿回来之前的最后一步是杀掉那条龙，并将加热过的上古之刃插入她的尸体中。\n\n完成这些之后，奎尔塞拉就是你的了。",oEN="You must get Onyxia to breathe fire on the Unfired Ancient Blade. Once this is done, pick up the now Heated Ancient Blade. Be warned, a Heated Ancient Blade will not remain heated forever - time is of the essence.\n\nThe last step before returning to me is to slay the beast and drive the Heated Ancient Blade into her corpse.\n\nDo this and Quel'Serrar will be yours.",p="也许有一天，会有一位勇士重新挥舞这把棱彩古剑。",pEN="Perhaps one day, another will wield the prismatic blade.",c="<莱德罗斯低声咕哝着什么，听不清楚。>\n\n如我所承诺的，$n，奎尔塞拉之剑。",cEN="<Lydros murmurs something unintelligible.>\n\nAs promised, <class>, the blade of Quel'Serrar."}
Q[7522]={d="去查看一下他的复生之瓶，凡人。逐风者会在那儿重生！",dEN="Examine the vessel of his rebirth, mortal. It is from this that the Windseeker shall be reborn!\nRelated",o="查看复生之瓶，然后回到德米提恩那里去。",oEN="Examine the Vessel of Rebirth and return it to Highlord Demitrian."}
Q[7541]={c="我们的学者要花一些时间来研究你带来的这个坠饰，但是为了感谢你对部落做出的贡献，请你收下这个。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你为你自己——也为我们——赢得了荣誉。",cEN="It will take time for our scholars to study the pendant you brought us. But for your service to the Horde I would like to offer you a small token.\n\nThank you, <name>. Your acts bring honor to you, and to us."}
Q[7562]={d="$n，你在黑暗艺术上的钻研已经相当深入。你对异界生物的掌控也已变得如此强大……也许你已经$g准备好:准备好;，可以束缚一匹臭名昭著的恐惧战马了。\n\n从它的家园召唤这头野兽的仪式需要强大的力量和大量资源，但如果你想驯服那匹史诗坐骑，就去和莫尔祖尔·血之使者谈谈吧。他扎营在燃烧平原的风暴祭坛附近。\n\n去吧，$n。这个任务会很危险——但你这种层次的术士绝不能因危险而退缩！",dEN="<name>, your delvings into the dark arts are deep. Your mastery over otherworldly denizens has grown so strong... perhaps you are ready to bind to you one of the infamous dreadsteeds.\n\nThe ritual to summon the beast from its home requires great power and resources, but if you desire to dominate that epic mount, then speak with Mor'zul Bloodbringer. He is camped near the Altar of Storms in the Burning Steppes.\n\nGo, <name>. This quest will be perilous, but a Warlock of your stature does not shy from danger!",o="与燃烧平原的莫苏尔·召血者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mor'zul Bloodbringer at the Altar of Storms in the Burning Steppes.",c="你好，$n，$g欢迎:欢迎;。你是像我一样来这里研究风暴祭坛的，也许想利用它的能量达成某种隐秘的目的？\n\n还是……你是来找我说话的？是的，我想是这样。\n\n你想驯服一匹恐惧战马？这可不是件容易的事。你要付出大量的鲜血、汗水……当然，还有金币。但克索诺斯的恐惧战马是值得赢取的奖赏，所以如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;，就听下去……",cEN="Greetings, <name>, and welcome. Are you here to study near the Altar of Storms as I am, perhaps to harness its energy for some hidden purpose...\n\nOr... are you here to speak with me? Yes, I believe you are.\n\nYou want to master a dreadsteed? Such is no easy task. It will cost you no small amounts of blood, sweat... and of course gold. But a dreadsteed of Xoroth is a prize well worth winning so if interested, listen on..."}
Q[7563]={d="恐惧战马居住在一个名叫克索诺斯的异世界中，它们奔驰在那里的火光冲天的平原上，想要控制这样一头野兽，你就必须吟唱蕴含强大能量的符文。我可以为你在羊皮纸上书写这样的符文，但是首先，我需要一种特殊的墨水。\n\n在遥远的冬泉谷中居住着一种枭兽。它们曾经是纯洁的生物，但是由于受到暗语峡谷中的恶魔力量的影响，它们变得十分疯狂，开始在雪地中游荡。\n\n它们的血正是我制作墨水所必需的材料。",dEN="The dreadsteeds dwell on another world, on the fiery Plains of Xoroth, and to bind one of those famed beasts you must invoke powerful glyphs. I can scribe the glyphs on a parchment for you, but first I will need a special ink.\n\nIn distant Winterspring there dwells a race of owl beasts. Once pure creatures, they were turned mad by the demonic emanations of the Darkwhisper Gorge and now roam the snows in a frenzy.\n\nTheir blood is what I need to ink your parchment. Bring it to me.",o="把30瓶狂暴野兽的血交给燃烧平原的莫苏尔·召血者。",oEN="Bring 30 bottles of Raging Beast's Blood to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.",p="你找到那些疯狂的枭兽了吗，$n？那些生物拥有很强大的魔法能量，而它们那饱经折磨的躯体中流淌的血液就是这种能量的载体。",pEN="Have you seen the raging owl beasts, <name>? The magic of those creatures is strong, and it concentrates in the blood that flows through their torturted forms.",c="啊，非常好。我会把这些血液蒸馏制成墨水，然后用它来撰写羊皮纸。也许我还会留下一些给自己，因为据说它们的味道不错……",cEN="Ah, very good. I will have this blood distilled into an ink and use it for the parchment I promised you. And perhaps I will save just a little for myself, as I hear its taste is quite euphoric..."}
Q[7564]={d="我的仆人戈瑟奇是个不错的炼金师。他可以为我准备撰写羊皮纸所需的墨水。我把你收集的血液包在了一起，把它交给戈瑟奇，然后他就可以进行下一步的工作了。",dEN="My servant, Gorzeeki, is an alchemist of some skill. He can prepare the ink I will need for your parchment. I gathered together the blood you acquired; take it to Gorzeeki so that he can begin his work.",o="把血箱交给燃烧平原的戈瑟奇·邪眼。",oEN="Bring the Case of Blood to Gorzeeki Wildeyes at the Altar of Storms in the Burning Steppes.",p="你有东西要给我？难道是一只巨大而多汁的蜘蛛？或者是一只蟑螂？我希望它还是活的……我很喜欢嚼活蜘蛛或者蟑螂……",pEN="You have something for me? It's not a big, juicy spider, is it? Or maybe a roach? I hope it's still alive... I so love chewing on them when they're still alive...",c="哦，是血。那一定是从莫尔祖尔大师那里来的。他如此迷恋这种东西，还喜欢看它洒出来。而我呢，更喜欢让它在小啮齿动物的血管里流动。这样它能一直保持温热……直到你想要它为止。\n\n这是强大的血液。莫尔祖尔一定又在制作召唤恐惧战马的羊皮纸了！太令人兴奋了！\n\n如果真是这样，而你要举行那个仪式，那么……你需要的远不止是血，$g朋友:朋友;。",cEN="Oh, it's blood. It must be from master Mor'zul then. He is so enamored with the stuff, and loves to see it spilled. I, however, prefer it coursing through the veins of a small rodent. It stays warm that way... until you want it.\n\nThis is powerful blood. Mor'zul must be making another parchment to summon a dreadsteed! How exciting!\n\nIf that's true, and you're going to perform the ritual, then... you're going to need a lot more than blood, my friend."}
Q[7581]={d="你必须从低级恶魔身上找到特定的材料，才能开始制作关押末日守卫的监牢。\n\n厄运之槌中的荒野萨特身上的血液正合适，那些血液凝固之后就可以把赫达琳碎片连接起来，强化水晶监牢。",dEN="You must retrieve bindings for the prison of the Doomguard from lesser demons.\n\nThe blood of the Wildspawn satyr that occupy Dire Maul should do nicely. The coagulated blood will bond the Hederine shards and power the crystal prison.",o="前往菲拉斯的厄运之槌，从栖息在扭木区的野性萨特身上取得 15 份萨特之血。完成之后，去腐化之痕找达约。|n",oEN="Travel to Dire Maul in Feralas and recover 15 Satyr Blood from the Wildspawn Satyr that inhabit the Warpwood Quarter. Return to Daio in the Tainted Scar when this is done.",p="只有荒野萨特之血才能满足要求。",pEN="Only the blood of Wildspawn satyr will suffice.",c="啊，太棒了。这些血可以让末日守卫的魔法防御结界彻底失效。",cEN="Ah, a most excellent recovery. The blood will suppress the Doomguard's magical defenses."}
Q[7582]={d="那些盘踞在海加尔山脚下的赫达琳恶魔正在秘密地研制强大而邪恶的毒药，这种毒药经过慢火熬制之后会形成一块致密的抗魔水晶——赫达琳之泪。\n\n即使是最强大的末日守卫也无法将一块由赫达琳之泪组成的监牢击碎。\n\n到冬泉谷的暗语峡谷去寻找赫达琳之泪吧。",dEN="The Hederine demons that occupy the foothills of Mount Hyjal secrete powerful fel poisons, which if left to mature, harden into a dense anti-magic crystal. These crystals have come to be known as Tears of the Hederine.\n\nNot even the immense power of a Doomguard could break the walls of a prison constructed from this material.\n\nTravel to Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring and recover the Tears.",o="到冬泉谷的暗语峡谷去，从盘踞在峡谷中的赫达琳恶魔身上找到5块赫达琳之泪。完成任务之后回到腐烂之痕的戴奥那里。",oEN="Travel to Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring and recover 5 Tears of the Hederine from the Hederine demons that occupy the gorge. Return to Daio in the Tainted Scar when you have completed this task.",p="赫达琳恶魔绝对不会轻易放弃它们珍贵的宝石，$n。",pEN="The Hederine will not give up their precious gems without a fight, <name>.",c="我只需将荒野之血和这些水晶融合，就可以完成监牢的制造了。",cEN="I merely need to combine the blood of the Wildspawn with these crystals and the prison shall be ready for use."}
Q[7583]={d="牢笼已经准备好了。现在进入这项任务最艰难的部分。\n\n你必须利用这个水晶牢笼，在腐化之痕找到并捕获一名末日守卫指挥官。\n\n小心！末日守卫是狡猾而致命的对手，当你开始囚禁仪式时，它会试图置你于死地。它会疯狂挣扎，拼命想要逃出牢笼。\n\n你将成为它注意的焦点，$n。因此我建议你带上能帮你防御的同伴。",dEN="The prison is ready. Now for the most difficult portion of this task.",o="前往腐化之痕，找到一名末日守卫指挥官。\n\n使用闪亮的水晶牢笼捕获末日守卫指挥官。要做好迎接一连串攻击的准备，因为这个恶魔会试图逃跑。\n\n如果成功，就把被囚禁的末日守卫指挥官带给腐化之痕的达约。",oEN="Venture forth into the Tainted Scar and locate a Doomguard Commander.",p="嗯？干得怎么样了？",pEN="Hrm? Well?",c="你按我的要求做了。你已经$g准备好:准备好;接受召唤并控制那头野兽的知识了。",cEN="You have done as I have asked. You are ready to be given the knowledge to conjure and control the beast."}
Q[7601]={d="如果要我向你传授召唤地狱火仆从的秘密，那么你就必须干掉克罗苏斯，然后把它那灼热的尸体中的恶魔之核交给我。这个任务其实并不是像它听上去的那么简单，因为克罗苏斯已经完全燃尽了。你必须将它的尸体重新点燃，让他在烈焰中重生。因此你就得从其它恶魔身上采集材料来完成这个任务。\n\n我的小鬼伊普斯会告诉你该怎么做的。",dEN="If I am to teach you the secrets of summoning an infernal servant, you must destroy Kroshius and bring me the infernal core from his burning remains. This, however, is not as easy as it sounds. Kroshius has all but burned out completely. You must reignite his corpse and raise him from the rubble. To do this, however, you must gather some components from other demonic entities.\n\nMy imp, Impsy, shall set you on your way.",o="与费伍德森林的伊普斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Impsy in Felwood.",c="唉，$g小子:丫头;，又来了。",cEN="Oh boy, here we go again."}
Q[7602]={d="如果你要复活克罗苏斯，那就必须用到魔火。我可以制作魔火，不过我需要一些材料。\n\n你必须从三个遥远的地方收集无暇的恶魔精华，并把它们交给我。\n\n在艾萨拉的雷加斯萨特身上可以找到第一种精华；费伍德森林的加德纳尔军团士兵有第二种精华；而诅咒之地的地狱卫士斥候身上有第三种。\n\n把每种精华都拿一份来给我，然后我会为你制作魔火，这样克罗苏斯就可以重生了。",dEN="If you're going to reanimate Kroshius, you're going to need Fel fire. I can make Fel fire but it's going to require some components.\n\nYou need to bring me flawless Fel essences from three distinct regions of the world.\n\nThe Legashi Satyrs of Azshara will have the first essence type; the Jaedenar legionnaires of Jaedenar the second type and the felguard sentries of the Blasted Lands the third.\n\nBring me back one of each essence type and I will create the Fel fire, allowing you to reanimate Kroshius.",o="费伍德森林的伊普斯要你给他带去 3 份来自三个不同地点的无瑕的恶魔精华。\n\n艾萨拉的雷加什萨特身上有当地的无瑕的恶魔精华。加德纳尔的加德纳尔军团士兵身上有当地的无瑕的恶魔精华。诅咒之地的恶魔卫士哨兵身上有当地的无瑕的恶魔精华。\n\n收集这些无瑕的恶魔精华，然后回到费伍德森林去找伊普斯。",oEN="Impsy in Felwood has asked that you bring him three Flawless Fel Essences originating from three distinct locations.\n\nThe Legashi Satyrs of Azshara hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Jaedenar Legionnaires of Jaedenar hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Felguard Sentries of the Blasted Lands hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region.\n\nRecover the Flawless Fel Essences and return to Impsy in Felwood.",p="不要告诉别人，其实尼比是个傻瓜。",pEN="Don't tell anyone this but Niby is daft.",c="给我一分钟，我会帮你把这些精华做成魔化火焰。",cEN="Give me a minute and I'll combine the essences into Fel fire."}
Q[7603]={d="克罗修斯倒在东北方的碎裂伤痕谷里。带上这团恶魔之火，用在它的残骸上。火焰应该能让这个倒下的地狱火重新苏醒。\n\n一旦它苏醒，我当然希望它会杀了你。杀了你，还有你的仆从。\n\n如果你奇迹般地杀死了克罗修斯，就取出它的地狱火之核，带给尼比。",dEN="Kroshius lays in a heap to the northeast, in the Shatter Scar Vale. Take this Fel fire and use it on his remains. The fire should reanimate the fallen infernal.",o="在费伍德森林的碎裂伤痕谷寻找克罗修斯的残骸。找到残骸后，在附近使用恶魔之火，等待克罗修斯归来。当地狱火苏醒后，消灭它，并从它的尸体上取出克罗修斯的地狱火之核。\n\n把克罗修斯的地狱火之核带给费伍德森林的无所能尼比。",oEN="Search Shatter Scar Vale in Felwood for the remains of Kroshius. When you locate the remains, use the Fel Fire near them and await Kroshius' return. When the infernal has awoken, slay him and take from his corpse Kroshius' Infernal Core.",p="你是不是迷路了？",pEN="Did you get lost?",c="交易是要讲诚信的！快，拿着这个，把这个写下来。我可没有时间！我即将进行我有生以来最伟大的召唤！",cEN="A deal is a deal! Quickly, take this and write this down. I don't have time! My greatest conjuration is upon us!"}
Q[7604]={d="签署人在此声明，其交付给瑟银兄弟会（TB 有限公司）的萨弗隆铁锭是真品，而非仿制品。签署人同时声明，因尝试建造、锻造、寻找、创造、出售或食用萨弗拉斯而可能造成的任何伤害，均不归咎于 TB 有限公司。\n\n签署本合同即表示你同意其中列明的所有条款。\n\n_________________\n\n签名",dEN="The undersigned hereby declares that the Sulfuron ingot they are delivering to the Thorium Brotherhood (TB Ltd.) is genuine and not a facsimile thereof. The undersigned also acknowledges that any harm that should come to <him/her> as a result of attempting to build, forge, find, create, sell, or eat Sulfuras, is not the responsibility or fault of TB Ltd.\n\nBy signing this contract, you are agreeing to all terms listed herein.\n\n_________________\n\nSignature",o="如果你愿意接受萨弗隆的设计图，请将瑟银兄弟会契约交给罗克图斯·暗契。",oEN="Turn the Thorium Brotherhood Contract in to Lokhtos Darkbargainer if you would like to receive the plans for Sulfuron.",p="我们之间有商业往来吗？",pEN="Do we have a deal?",c="很高兴和你做生意，$n！\n\n我谨代表瑟银兄弟会祝你在寻找萨弗拉斯的路上一路顺风！",cEN="It has been a pleasure doing business with you, <name>!\n\nOn behalf of TB Ltd., I wish you luck in your search for Sulfuras!"}
Q[7621]={c="$n，你即将经历一系列严苛的考验，它们将检验你所有的能力。\n\n我建议你听一听我必须讲述的故事。\n\n要当心，你必须$g独自:独自;完成这项任务。建议你的盟友保持距离。外部力量的干扰将招致极其严厉的惩罚。\n\n命运将你，且只有你，引领至此。光荣地战斗吧。善用圣光。",cEN="<class>, you are about to undergo a rigorous series of events which shall test all of your abilities.\n\nI suggest that you listen to the story that I have to tell.\n\nBe warned, you must complete this task alone. It is recommended that your allies remain at a distance. Interference by outside agents will result in a most severe punishment.\n\nDestiny has led you and you alone here. Battle with honor. Harness the Light."}
Q[7622]={d="你必须完成我没有能够做到的事情：拯救那些未能逃出斯坦索姆的农夫。\n\n他们将向着光明前进，你的职责就是保证他们的存活。如果过多的农夫倒下，那我们仍将继续被诅咒，而你则会可耻地失败。\n\n你所学到的每项技能、每句祷言和每个法术都会经受考验。愿圣光护佑你，$n。",dEN="You must do what I could not: Save the peasants that were cut down while fleeing from Stratholme.\n\nThey will walk towards the light, you must ensure their survival. Should too many fall, our cursed existence shall continue - you will have failed.\n\nEvery ability, prayer, and spell that you have learned will be tested. May the Light protect you, <name>.",o="在总计有15个农夫被杀死之前拯救50个农夫。完成任务之后与艾瑞斯·哈文法谈谈。\n\n你可以通过浏览死亡布告来了解自己拯救了多少农夫。",oEN="Save 50 Peasants before 15 are slain. Speak with Eris Havenfire should you accomplish this task.\n\nYou may view the Death Post to view how many Peasants have been slain.",c="你的坚韧与勇气令人惊叹，$g牧师:牧师;。你已经赢得了持有诺达希尔碎片的权利。只剩下一项任务：必须找回暗影之眼。走遍这个世界去寻找它吧。",cEN="Your tenacity and courage are astounding, priestess. You have earned the right to hold the Splinter of Nordrassil. Only one task remains: The Eye of Shadow must be recovered. Scour the world."}
Q[7623]={d="莫苏尔说你需要一扇通往克索诺斯的传送门。如果是这样的话，你就得用到克索诺斯星尘。在艾泽拉斯大陆上找到这种星尘可不容易！\n\n但是我知道谁手中有星尘——加德纳尔的魔王贝恩霍勒，他就在暗影议会那里！和他谈谈，也许他会给你一些星尘。\n\n但是在你去加德纳尔之前，你必须用暗影议会的邪恶气息来伪装自己。也就是说，你需要一些暗影药水，我这里就有暗影药水，不过这可不是免费的……",dEN="Mor'zul says that you want to open a portal to Xoroth. To do that, you'll need Xorothian stardust. That's not easy to find on Azeroth!\n\nThere is one being who might have some: Lord Banehollow in Jaedenar, the seat of the Shadow Council! Speak with him and he might part with the stardust.\n\nBut if you're going to Jaedenar, then you'll need to cloak yourself in the Shadow Council's own flavor of evil. That will require some of my shadowy potions, and that will cost you...",o="从燃烧平原的戈瑟奇那里购买暗影药水。\n\n使用这种药剂进入加德纳尔，然后与魔王贝恩霍勒谈一谈。",oEN="Purchase Shadowy Potions from Gorzeeki Wildeyes at the Altar of Storms in the Burning Steppes.\n\nUse the potions to travel through Jaedenar in Felwood, and speak with Lord Banehollow inside the Shadow Hold.",c="我的耐心跨越了数千年，$n。但别以为这能让你占用我超过一瞬的时间……",cEN="My patience spans the millenia, <class>. But do not think that allows you more than an instant of my time..."}
Q[7624]={d="你想要得到我的帮助？那么就为我而战吧。\n\n我的奴仆乌拉泰克跪在我面前的时候表现出无比的可怜和谦卑，但其实他只不过是在为克索诺斯位面的赫尔努拉斯工作。赫尔努拉斯想要夺取我在这里的位置和权力，而乌拉泰克就是他的间谍……\n\n如果你想要证明你效忠的是我而不是我的对手，就去找到乌拉泰克，它就在西边的暗影堡里。告诉他我已经知道了他的秘密，然后就看着恐惧吞噬他吧。把那个叛徒的心脏给我带回来！",dEN="You wish to enter my good graces? Then kill for me.\n\nMy servant, Ulathek, is pathetic how he grovels before me, all the while plotting with Lord Hel'nurath on Xoroth. Hel'nurath plans to usurp my power here, and Ulathek is his spy...\n\nProve that you serve me and not my rivals. Confront Ulathek in his quarters, in the Shadow Hold to the west. Tell him that I know his secret and watch as fear grips him. Then, bring me the traitor's heart!",o="找到并杀死乌拉泰克，然后把叛徒之心交给加德纳尔的魔王贝恩霍勒。",oEN="Confront Ulathek, then bring The Traitor's Heart to Lord Banehollow in Jaedenar.",p="我仿佛已经可以尝到乌拉泰克心脏的味道了。叛徒的血肉真是美味……",pEN="I can already taste the heart of Ulathek on my lips. So sweet is the flesh of a traitor...",c="啊，太棒了！腐烂一周之后，这颗心脏将成为一道多汁的美味！也许我会派人去取乌拉泰克的头颅，在我进食时把它摆在我面前……\n\n你为我效了力，$n，所以我对你的耐心增加了。略微增加。",cEN="Ah, how splendid! After rotting a week, this heart will prove a succulent treat! Perhaps I will send for Ulathek's head and place it before me as I eat...\n\nYou have done me a service, <class>, and so my patience for you has grown. Marginally."}
Q[7625]={d="你到我这里是要找克索诺斯星尘的？你希望开启一个通往克索诺斯——也就是我的对手赫尔努拉斯所在的世界的传送门？也许你是想要从他那里偷取他宝贵的恐惧战马？\n\n非常好。我的仆人乌尔丹有很多克索诺斯星尘。你可以从他那里得到它……当然，你必须付出足够的代价。",dEN="So you come to me seeking Xorothian stardust? You wish to open a portal to Xoroth, the domain of Hel'nurath my rival? Perhaps you plan to steal from him one of his precious dreadsteeds?\n\nVery well. My servant Ur'dan has a supply of Xorothian stardust. You may obtain it from him... if you can pay the price.",o="从乌尔丹那里购买克索诺斯星尘，把它交给燃烧平原的戈瑟奇·邪眼。",oEN="Purchase Xorothian Stardust from Ur'dan inside the Shadow Hold at Jaedenar in Felwood. Bring it to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",p="你去过加德纳尔了吗，$n？你有没有从贝恩霍勒领主那里弄到星尘？",pEN="Have you been to Jaedenar, <name>? Did you get the stardust from Lord Banehollow?",c="就是这个！我简直不敢相信你弄到它了！你一定在瞭望那里碰到了不少麻烦，也许还付出了很大的代价，或者两者皆是！\n\n莫苏尔马上就可以得到他的墨水，然后开始动手制作雕文，最终，你将去打开通往克索诺斯的传送门，并找到一匹恐惧战马！",cEN="There it is! I can hardly believe you got it! You must have struck a big deal with that Dreadlord or else paid a large sum, or both!\n\nMor'zul will have his ink very soon and then he can finally make the glyph parchment, so you can open a portal to Xoroth and pull through it one of the famed dreadsteeds!"}
Q[7626]={d="达斯莫拉之铃是三件制造强力召唤法阵所必需的物品之一，它的名字来源于著名的术士达斯莫拉·暗眼。当它与黑暗战车之轮和末日蜡烛共同激活之后，它们就会引导出强大的魔法力量。\n\n我的仆人戈瑟奇可以为你铃铛，但是他需要大量的暗影之力药剂。让一个炼金师帮你制作这些药剂，然后把它们交给戈瑟奇。",dEN="A Bell of Dethmoora, named after the late warlock Dethmoora Darkeyes, is one of the three tools needed to create a Circle of Greater Summoning. When properly atuned with the Wheel and the Candle, these items conduct vast stores of arcane power.\n\nMy servant Gorzeeki can construct such a bell, but to do so he will need a large supply of elixirs of shadow power. Procure the elixirs from an alchemist and bring them to Gorzeeki.",o="把2瓶暗影之力药剂交给燃烧平原的戈瑟奇·邪眼。",oEN="Bring 2 Elixirs of Shadow Power to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",p="你拿到那些药剂了吗，$n？莫苏尔说你需要一只达斯莫拉之铃，我需要那些药剂才能制造充满暗影力量的东西！",pEN="You have those elixirs, <name>? Mor'zul told me you need a Bell of Dethmoora, and making one of those takes a lot of shadow power!",c="很好！希望弄到这些药剂没让你费太多力气。有时候炼金师对自己的作品实在吝啬得很……\n\n我会做好那只铃铛并保管起来，直到你$g准备好:准备好;举行仪式。",cEN="Very good! I hope these elixirs weren't too hard to get. Sometimes alchemists can be so miserly with their creations...\n\nI'll make the bell and keep it until you're ready for your ritual."}
Q[7627]={d="黑暗战车之轮可以为强力召唤法阵提供并控制它所需要的能量。如果你需要戈瑟奇制造的黑暗战车之轮，他就需要一些附魔师提供的大块魔光碎片，以及高级矿工可以提供的黑铁矿石。\n\n去弄到那些东西，然后把它们交给我的仆人。",dEN="A Wheel of the Black March contains and directs the violent energies required for the Circle of Greater Summoning. For Gozeeki to construct a wheel, he will need both large brilliant shards from an enchanter, and dark iron ore from a master miner.\n\nAcquire these and bring them to my servant.",o="把6份大块魔光碎片和25块黑铁矿石交给燃烧平原的戈瑟奇·邪眼。",oEN="Bring 6 Large Brilliant Shards and 25 Dark Iron Ore to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.",p="黑暗战车之轮并不容易制造，而且它也需要很多材料。你收集到了我所需的材料了吗？",pEN="The Wheel of the Black March isn't easy to make, and takes a lot of materials. Have you gathered them yet?",c="它们在这儿！我听说黑铁矿石只在黑石山的深处才能找到，而这些碎片想必也不好找。你们术士的执着总是让我惊叹。如果你把那份精力全都用在捕捉虫子这门技艺上，哦……你就能享受一场盛宴了！\n\n抱歉，扯远了。我会做好那个轮盘并替你保管，直到你$g准备好:准备好;举行仪式。",cEN="There they are! I hear that dark iron ore is only found in the depths of Blackrock, and I'm sure these shards weren't easy to find either. I am often awed at the dedication you warlocks have. If you instead bent all that energy into the art of bug catching, oh... such a feast you would enjoy!\n\nSorry, a small digression. I'll create the wheel and keep it for you until you're ready for your ritual."}
Q[7628]={d="末日蜡烛汇集了火焰的力量，并将其倾斜在那些胆敢打断你的召唤仪式的蠢货身上。当你制造了一个强力召唤法阵并点燃蜡烛之后，任何胆敢闯入结界的恶魔都会被烧成灰烬！\n\n但是想要保存这样的火焰可不容易，你必须有黑龙鳞片中的精华成分。收集这些鳞片，然后把它们交给戈瑟奇·邪眼。",dEN="A Doomsday Candle stores fire and directs it at those who would disrupt your ritual. When creating your Circle of Greater Summoning, if your candle is lit then any wayward demons will be burned by its flames!\n\nContaining that fire is not easy, and requires the essence within the scales of a black dragon. Acquire those scales from a skinner and bring them to Gorzeeki Wildeyes.",o="把3块黑龙鳞片交给燃烧平原的戈瑟奇·邪眼。",oEN="Bring 3 Black Dragonscales to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",p="你把龙鳞带来了吗，$n？在你带来鳞片之前我不会开始制作蜡烛……否则整个营地都会被炸上天的！",pEN="Did you bring the dragonscales, <name>? I don't want to start on the candle until I have them... or I might blow up the whole camp!",c="啊，很好。我需要这些来容纳蜡烛的火焰。既然我有了鳞片，我就会制作那支蜡烛并保管好，直到你$g准备好:准备好;开始你为高等召唤法阵举行的仪式。",cEN="Ah, very good. I'll need these to contain the fires of the candle. Now that I have the scales, I'll make the candle and hold onto it until you're ready to begin your ritual for the Circle of Greater Summoning."}
Q[7629]={d="只需一步就能完成莫苏尔的羊皮纸了。我需要一张注入克索诺斯星尘力量的纸，另外……我恐怕我无法在这里完成工作，因为我没有必需的设备！\n\n不过我知道有一座炼金实验室，那里有我所需的一切东西。它就在西瘟疫之地凯尔达隆岛上的通灵学院里。\n\n我自己没法亲自去那里，不过你可以。拿着这只瓶子，这里面有一个非常聪明的小鬼。在实验室里把它放出来，然后它就会帮你搞定羊皮纸。",dEN="There is one more process required for Mor'zul's parchment; I need paper infused with Xorothian stardust. And... I'm afraid I can't do that here. I don't have the equipment!\n\nThere is an alchemy lab, however, with everything needed. It's in the Scholomance, on the isle of Caer Darrow in the Plaguelands.\n\nI can't make the trip, but here - take this jar. There's an imp inside who is quite clever. Let him out at the alchemy lab and he'll infuse the parchment.",o="把瓶中的小鬼带到通灵学院的炼金实验室中。在小鬼制造出羊皮纸之后，把瓶子还给戈瑟奇·邪眼。",oEN="Bring the Imp in a Jar to the alchemy lab in the Scholomance. After the parchment is created, return the jar to Gorzeeki Wildeyes.",p="你去过通灵学院了没有，$n？小鬼有没有用星尘制作羊皮纸？",pEN="Have you been to the Scholomance, <name>? Has the imp yet infused the parchment with the stardust?",c="啊，干得好。耶维尔完成了羊皮纸的制作。你认为通灵学院怎么样？那是个让人着迷的地方，你说呢？还有那里的虫子……我听说它们的味道很不错！\n\n感谢你把我的瓶子带回来，$n。我对它有着很深的感情……我决不会把它卖了的！",cEN="Ah, good. J'eevee created the parchment. How was the Scholomance? Charming, don't you think? And the bugs there... I hear they're delicious!\n\nWell done, <name>, and thank you for returning my jar. I've had it for a long time... and it's not for sale!"}
Q[7630]={d="现在达斯莫拉之铃、黑暗战车之轮和末日蜡烛都已经准备好了，我还得给你准备一块黑色磁石。在仪式进行的过程中，你必须不断用黑色磁石激活那些失效的物品才能维持法阵。\n\n因此，我需要一些奥金锭。你有奥金锭吗？如果没有的话……那么，去找个炼金师问一问吧。\n\n当你拿到奥金锭之后再回来，我会用它制作黑色磁石。",dEN="Now that the Bell, Wheel and Candle are made, I should make a black lodestone. During your ritual, you'll need that lodestone to maintain the other ritual objects if they should fail.\n\nTo make the lodestone, I require arcanite. Do you have any? If not, then... you'll have to get the arcanite from an alchemist.\n\nReturn to me when you have the arcanite, and then I'll make the black lodestone.",o="把1块奥金锭交给燃烧平原的戈瑟奇·邪眼。",oEN="Bring 1 Arcanite Bar to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.",p="你拿到奥金了吗，$n？我需要这种材料来制作黑色磁石。",pEN="Do you have the arcanite, <name>? Once I have it I can make you the black lodestone.",c="你终于弄到奥金锭了！太好了！现在我可以制作一块黑色磁石，当你开始进行强力召唤法阵之后，你就得用它来保证法阵不会失效！",cEN="You got it! Nicely done! Now I can create the lodestone. When you're finally ready for your ritual to create the Circle of Greater Summoning, you'll want a lodestone to make sure the ritual doesn't fizzle out!"}
Q[7631]={d="所有东西都准备好了。现在，你必须施展仪式制造出强力召唤法阵，然后再使用卷轴和克索诺斯星尘来打开通向克索诺斯的传送门。\n\n我已经把施展仪式的具体步骤写在了一张卷轴上。仔细读一读卷轴，然后严格按照上面所述的步骤来做，否则你就无法成功施展仪式。\n\n祝你好运，$n。愿你的背包中装满了敌人的灵魂碎片。",dEN="All the preparations are made. Now, you must perform the ritual to create a Circle of Greater Summoning, then use the parchment infused with Xorothian stardust... to open a portal to Xoroth.\n\nI have written the instructions for the ritual onto a scroll. Study it closely, for you must perform each step exactly if you wish to succeed.\n\nFortune to you, <name>. And may the souls of your enemies swiftly find their way into your shard pouch.",o="阅读莫苏尔的指南，并召唤出一匹克索诺斯恐惧战马，击败它，然后控制它的灵魂。",oEN="Read Mor'zul's Instructions. Summon a Xorothian Dreadsteed, defeat it, then bind its spirit to you.",c="克索诺斯恐惧战马的灵魂被击败了。虽然它显得十分愤怒，但是你知道这头野兽的灵魂已经是属于你的了……\n\n它吟唱着黑暗的魔法，充满强大能量的咒语深深印入你的脑海，你已经学会了召唤恐惧战马的方法。",cEN="The Xorothian Dreadsteed's spirit is beaten. Although rage pulses through its ghostly flanks, you know that the beast's soul is yours...\n\nIt whispers dark magic into your mind and instills within you the knowledge to summon a dreadsteed."}
Q[7633]={c="你的勤勉与正直已被注意到了，$n。\n\n我们是远古守护者：这片曾经繁茂森林的守护者。一万年前，当阿克蒙德和燃烧军团向海加尔山进军时，我们的实体被摧毁了。然而，我们的灵魂依然完好。\n\n有些任务我们可以交付。完成这些任务，古树的秘密就将向你敞开。\n\n请记住：若你完成了这些任务，只需回到这块岩石前，我们便会回应你的呼唤。",cEN="Your diligence and integrity has been noted, <class>.\n\nWe are Ancients: Protectors of this once great forest. Our physical forms were destroyed 10,000 years ago when Archimonde and the Burning Legion marched upon Hyjal. Our spirits, however, remain intact.\n\nThere are tasks that we can offer. Tasks that if completed will open up the secrets of the Ancients to you.\n\nKnow this, should you complete these tasks, merely return to this rock and we shall answer the calling."}
Q[7634]={d="你好，$c。我是知识古树哈斯塔特。我这里保管着很久以前就消逝了的知识。\n\n在适当的条件之下，我的一片树叶可以变成一只近万年来都没有出现过的箭袋。这只箭袋配合上古之弓就将发挥无穷的力量。\n\n将一头成年蓝龙的肌腱交给我，这只箭袋就是你的了。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. I am Hastat, Ancient of Lore. I hold knowledge lost eons ago.\n\nWith the proper binding, one of my leaves can serve as a quiver the likes of which has not been seen in 10,000 years. A quiver that when accompanied by a bow of Ancients, could grant untold powers.\n\nReturn here with sinew from an adult blue dragon and this quiver shall be yours.",o="费伍德森林的古树哈斯塔特要求你带回一块成年蓝龙的肌腱。",oEN="Hastat the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Blue Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Hastat in Felwood.",p="$g欢迎回来:欢迎回来;，年轻的$n。",pEN="Welcome back, young <class>.",c="愿我的树叶为你的弓箭提供保护。愿你的每支箭都能射穿敌人的心脏。愿我们这个世界中的一切邪恶都受到惩戒。",cEN="May my leaves provide your arrows protection from harm. May your arrows strike true. May the enemies of our world be smitten."}
Q[7635]={d="瓦特鲁斯可以提供给你一根手杖来制作上古之弓，但是只有当我给弓弦附了魔法之后，你才能得到完整的弓。\n\n这是个简单的任务，小东西。杀掉一头成年的黑龙，然后从它的骨头上割下一块肌腱。把它交给我，然后我就可以对弓弦进行附魔，使其变成一根坚固无比的弓弦。",dEN="Vartrus may offer you the stave to create a bow of Ancients but only I can enchant the string required to complete the bow.\n\nIt is a simple task, puny one. Slay a mature black dragon and remove the sinew from its bones. Return that sinew to me and I shall enchant the material into an almost indestructible bow string.",o="费伍德森林的古树斯托玛要求你带给他一块成年黑龙的肌腱。",oEN="Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood.",p="我确信找一头黑龙然后干掉它并没有什么难度，$n。不要浪费我的时间。",pEN="I am certain that you will have little difficulty in finding and slaying a black dragon, <name>. Do not waste my time with idle chatter.",c="这是一条邪恶无比的龙，它的肌腱散发着邪恶的味道。\n\n给我一点时间，让我来净化这块肌腱，然后就可以进行附魔工作了。",cEN="A most foul dragon this one was. The sinew reeks of evil.\n\nGive me a moment to cleanse the filth from this flesh and apply the proper enchantments."}
Q[7636]={d="燃烧军团的爪牙仍然活跃在我们的世界上，$c。这些爪牙会腐化它们接触到的一切。光是它们的存在，就足以让自然颤抖哭泣。\n\n你必须找到这些恶魔腐化者并消灭它们，$n。但要小心：你必须$g独自:独自;面对它们，否则它们会逃跑。只要它们看到你$g独自:独自;一人，就会试图摧毁你。那时你就出击，把它们的傲慢化为痛苦。\n\n我给你一块我的树皮；上面的铭文会指引你找到目标。把它们的头颅带回来给我。",dEN="Agents of the Burning Legion are still active in our world, <class>. These agents corrupt all that they touch. Nature wilts and weeps in their presence.\n\nYou must track down these demonic corrupters and destroy them, <name>. Be warned, you must engage them by yourself or they will flee. As long as you are alone, they will try and destroy you. You must strike at them, turning their arrogance into misery.\n\nI grant you a piece of my bark, the inscriptions shall lead you to your targets. Retrieve their heads.",o="你必须找到并消灭这 4 个恶魔腐化者：\n\n魅惑者西蒙妮。\n\n疯狂的克林弗兰。\n\n屠戮者索莱诺尔。\n\n厄运使者阿托里乌斯。\n\n消灭这些生物，回到费伍德森林，把它们的头颅交给远古守护者瓦特鲁斯。\n\n查看你背包中的石化树皮，寻找它们下落的线索。\n\n你必须$g独自:独自;完成这项任务。",oEN="You must find and destroy these four demonic corrupters:\n\nSimone the Seductress.\n\nKlinfran the Crazed.\n\nSolenor the Slayer.\n\nArtorius the Doombringer.\n\nDestroy these creatures and return to Vartrus the Ancient in Felwood with their heads.\n\nRefer to the Petrified Bark in your inventory for clues as to their whereabouts.\n\nYou MUST complete this task by yourself.",p="不要被它们的伪装所迷惑！",pEN="Do not be fooled by their disguises!",c="你干得很漂亮，$n！拿着这根手杖，将它和斯托玛制作的弓弦组合起来。这样，它们就将合成一把最强大的武器。",cEN="You have served us well, <name>! Take this stave and combine it with the bow string that Stoma is able to create. Together, they form a most formidable weapon."}
Q[7637]={d="为了做好迎接这个挑战的准备，你必须首先展示自己的牺牲和公正……主要是牺牲。\n\n你必须从高阶牧师洛汉那里取得驱魔香炉，才能进行下一步的任务。不过，虽然你的目标是正义的，但你仍然需要为驱魔香炉提供一定的补偿。\n\n去铁炉堡和高阶牧师谈谈吧。给他足够的金钱来换取驱魔香炉，这将会体现出你的牺牲精神。\n\n现在就去吧，$n，时间紧迫。",dEN="In order to prepare yourself for this task, you must first show due sacrifice and judgment... with an emphasis on sacrifice.\n\nYou must acquire High Priest Rohan's exorcism censer for your task. Even though its use will be for good and just reasons, due compensation must be given for it.\n\nProceed to Ironforge and speak with the High Priest. By bringing ample coin with you to help offset the loss of his censer, it will show your due sacrifice.\n\nGo now <name>, time is of the essence.",o="到铁炉堡去找高阶牧师洛汉，从他那里拿到驱魔香炉。你需要捐赠150金币来获得它。",oEN="Travel to Ironforge and get High Priest Rohan's Exorcism Censer. You will need to make a donation of 150 gold in order to secure it.",p="你好，高贵的$c！我已经用最新鲜的香料备好了我信赖的香炉，并为你的使用祝福了三次。你的捐赠不仅能帮助我们在铁炉堡制作一个新的香炉，还能为我们那些贫困同胞补充日渐减少的食物储备。",pEN="Greetings, noble <class>! I have prepared my trusted censer with the freshest of incense and blessed it thrice for your use. Your donation will help us in Ironforge not only create a new censer, but also to bolster sagging reserves of food for our needy.",c="愿祝福降临于你，$g朋友:朋友;$c！你的捐赠远远超出了所需。你的牺牲不仅会帮助我们找回失去的东西，还会帮助我们帮助铁炉堡这里最需要帮助的人。\n\n现在，让我确保这个香炉已经为你的后续需要妥善准备好……",cEN="Blessings onto you, friend <class>! Your donation goes far beyond what was needed. Your sacrifice will not only help us recover what we have lost, but also help us to help those most in need here in Ironforge.\n\nNow, let me make sure I've suitably prepared this censer for your future needs..."}
Q[7638]={d="这个伟大的时刻终于到来了，$n，接下来你就将获得你渴望已久的东西——你的战马。\n\n去和暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵谈谈吧。他将指引你完成必需的任务，令你获得一匹圣骑士最可信任的坐骑。\n\n我祝你在这次试炼中好运，为了圣光而战，我的$g兄弟:姐妹！",dEN="The time has come, <name>, for you to learn about what it will take for you to acquire something you have no doubt waited on for some time... your charger.\n\nSpeak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker here in Stormwind's Cathedral District. It is he who will guide you not only though the legerdemain of a Paladin's most trusted mount, but the tasks before you to acquire one of your own.\n\nI wish you the best in this trial. For the Light, noble <brother /sister>!",o="与暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District.",c="很高兴见到你，$n。我知道你急切地想要知道如何才能获得你的战骑，现在这个时刻终于来临了。\n\n你需要经过许多试炼，但是最重要的是，你的信念将通过克服这些困难得到最大程度的提升。这些并不是教课书式的试炼——你必须全身心地投入，才能克服即将到来的挑战。在拯救你未来的伙伴之前，你必须与无数邪恶的力量抗衡。\n\n现在，我们开始吧！",cEN="I am glad to see you <name>. I know that you have awaited word as to how to acquire your charger, and now that time has come.\n\nYou will be surely tested in many different ways, but most importantly in your willingness to rise above numerous obstacles thrust before you. These are not done as a learning exercise - your stature is beyond simple educational tests. You must save your future companion from the clutches of the evil you have spent your life fighting.\n\nTake heed, your time has come!"}
Q[7639]={d="请拿着这只驱魔香炉，我祝福你一路顺风。我自己曾多次使用它驱除了邪恶，而且我相信它一定会帮助你完成艰巨的任务。\n\n回到暴风城去找格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵吧，$n。他将告诉你接下来该怎么做。",dEN="With my blessings, take the censer. I myself have used it in several exorcisms, and it should serve you well for the arduous tasks that lie ahead.\n\nReturn now to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind, <name>. Your quest continues with him.",o="把驱魔香炉交给暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵。",oEN="Return the Exorcism Censer to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",p="欢迎回来，$n。你得到驱魔香炉了吗？",pEN="Welcome back, <name>. Have you acquired the exorcism censer?",c="嗯，很好。你还将继续进行这样的牺牲，我很高兴看到你很乐意这么做。牺牲是圣骑士众多职责中最重要的一部分……但是我想我不需要为此而专门对你进行说教。\n\n现在，$n，你将会开始进行审判。这只香炉将会指引你去我们失落的土地上，审判那些饱受折磨的灵魂。",cEN="Yes, this will do. You will be called upon more than once during this process to make acts of sacrifice; I am glad to see that you are willing to do just that. Sacrifice is a key component in what it takes to uphold the duties of being a Paladin... but I don't have to lecture you on that.\n\nNow <name>, you will need to show due judgment in your actions. To that end, this censer will act as your vessel to dispense such judgment on tortured spirits of lands lost to us."}
Q[7640]={d="我在香炉中加入了一撮来自东瘟疫之地恐惧谷受污染土地的泥土。现在你要用这个香炉去寻找那些显现出灵魂动荡与骚乱迹象的区域。当灵魂界的折磨让物质世界扭曲变形时，土地上会弥漫出绿色的光环，找到它们，然后用香炉驱除那些邪恶的灵魂。\n\n当你对那些灵魂做出了足够的审判之后，你就$g准备好:准备好;继续前进了。",dEN="I have added a pinch of dirt from the tainted ground of Terrordale in the Eastern Plaguelands to the censer. You will now use this censer to find areas there that show signs of spiritual turmoil and disturbance. Look for green auras that permeate the ground as the physical world buckles under the torment of the spirit realm and use the censer to drive out the evil spirits.\n\nWhen you have passed sufficient judgment on the spirits there, you will be ready to proceed.",o="使用驱魔香炉召唤恐惧谷中的灵魂。当你杀掉25个恐惧谷的灵魂之后，回到暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵那里复命。",oEN="Use the Exorcism Censer to drive out the spirits that torment Terrordale. When you have slain 25 Terrordale Spirits, return to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",p="很高兴再次见到你，$n。你在恐惧谷的工作完成了？",pEN="It is good to see you again <name>. Is your work done in Terrordale?",c="干得好，$n。我们必须对那些躲藏在黑暗中的邪恶力量进行审判，这是我们应该极力完成的职责。你已经完成了牺牲和对恐惧谷灵魂的审判。\n\n你的下一步将是对一匹堕落的战骑的灵魂进行牺牲和审判，它现在是死亡骑士达克雷尔的坐骑。",cEN="Well done, <name>. To render the judgment of the Light on those that dwell in darkness is a task we must approach with vim and zeal; you have done just that with your sacrifice in Ironforge and your judgments of the spirits in Terrordale.\n\nYour next steps will call on both sacrifice and judgment again as you now strive to reclaim the spirit of a fallen charger who now serves a Death Knight known as Darkreaver."}
Q[7641]={d="圣骑士的坐骑如果没有合适的马饰，那它就和运货的畜牲没有什么区别。你所使用的马饰不仅需要使用最好的材料来制作，而且还需要与灵魂世界进行密切的沟通。\n\n首先，$n——让我们来搞定马饰的问题。在暴风城的矮人区里面有一位顶级铁匠，格瑞曼德·艾尔默。他的开价不会低，但是他的质量正是我们所追求的。去和他谈谈吧。",dEN="A paladin's charger is nothing more than a pack animal without proper barding for it. The barding used by your charger not only needs to be of the finest materials possible, but because of the circumstances involved it must also be sufficiently attuned to the spirit realm.\n\nFirst things first, <name> - let's get your barding made. In Stormwind's Dwarven District is one of the finest craftsmen living today, Grimand Elmore. His work will not be cheap, but his quality is what we seek. Speak with him.",o="与暴风城矮人区的格瑞曼德·艾尔默谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Grimand Elmore in Stormwind's Dwarven District.",c="你好——破影领主提前传信给我，说你会来这里找我。我愿意为你制作你需要的马铠，但这既不便宜也不容易；这一点我们先把话说在前头。\n\n我可以这么说，而且格雷森也会为我这句话作证……走遍整个艾泽拉斯，你也找不到比这里更好的马铠。",cEN="Hello there - Lord Shadowbreaker sent me word ahead of time that you'd be coming around this way to see me. I'm willing to make the barding you need, but it won't be either cheap or easy; let's get that out in the open first and foremost.\n\nI will say this much, and Grayson will back me up when I make this claim... you'll not find better barding made anywhere in all of Azeroth than right here."}
Q[7642]={d="你需要为马饰准备四样东西——做内衬用的符文布，做铠甲用的奥金锭，调和灵魂所需的阿尔萨斯之泪，以及灌入灵魂时要用到的斯坦索姆圣水。实际上，你还需要一样东西……就是为我支付酬劳的金币，这其中包括了我的辛苦钱，外加马鞍和马镫的费用。\n\n在你拿齐了所有东西之后，我就可以动手给你打造马饰了。在你收集到那些我要的东西之前，我还有些准备工作要做。",dEN="You'll need four things for the barding - runecloth for the lining, arcanite bars for the plating, Arthas' Tears for the spiritual attunement, and Stratholme holy water for the spiritual imbuement. Actually, you need five things... gold for my fee. That fee includes all labor as well as a handcrafted saddle and stirrups.\n\nOnce you've got all that, I'll be able to finish your barding. Until then, there are some things I can get started on for you while you assemble your collection of goods.",o="把40块符文布、6块奥金锭、10棵阿尔萨斯之泪、5瓶斯坦索姆圣水和150枚金币交给暴风城矮人区的格瑞曼德·艾尔默。",oEN="Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water vials, and 150 gold to Grimand Elmore in the Dwarven District of Stormwind.",p="啊，$n。如果没有我说的那些东西，我是无法完成你的马饰的。你拿到所有东西了吗？",pEN="Ah, <class>. I won't be able to finish your barding without the things I mentioned. Have you gotten everything together?",c="这个……嗯，这正是我需要的东西。你真是个$g足智多谋:足智多谋;的家伙，$n，不是吗？\n\n那好吧，我们这就把你的马铠做完！",cEN="This... well, this is exactly what I needed. You're quite the resourceful <class>, aren't you?\n\nAll right then, let's get this barding finished up for you!"}
Q[7643]={d="你的马饰需要一种特殊的祝福，一个来自特定灵魂的祝福。在厄运之槌有这样一个灵魂，上古圣马之魂。现在它被一个堕落的树人特迪斯·扭木控制着。审判这个堕落的野兽吧，$n。\n\n你要了解这一点——单单给它带来自由是不够的。你必须在接受这个灵魂的祝福之前安抚它。因此，你需要特殊的饲料。到南海镇去，和那里的梅丽德丝·卡尔森谈谈……准备付出更多的牺牲吧。",dEN="Your barding needs a special form of blessing, one from an appropriate spirit. In Dire Maul is such a spirit, the Ancient Equine Spirit. It is currently held by a corrupt treant, Tendris Warpwood. Pass judgment upon this foul beast, <name>.\n\nKnow this - freedom alone is not enough. You must soothe the spirit before receiving its blessing. For that, special horse feed is needed. Travel to Southshore first and speak with Merideth Carlson on this... and prepare for more sacrifice.",o="你需要特殊的饲料来喂养灵魂马。南海镇的梅丽德丝·卡尔森可以为你提供这样的粮草。\n\n到菲拉斯的厄运之槌去，杀掉特迪斯·扭木，释放上古圣马之魂。用特殊的粮草喂养它，这样可以安抚它的灵魂。最后，把奥金马铠交给它就可以完成祝福。",oEN="Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse. Merideth Carlson in Southshore apparently is the source for such food.\n\nTravel to the Dire Maul dungeon in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood. Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit. Feed it the special horse feed, thereby soothing the spirit. Finally, give it the Arcanite Barding so it may bless it.",p="上古圣马之魂期盼地看着你，好像它希望从你这里得到什么。",pEN="The Ancient Equine Spirit looks at you expectantly, as though it wants something from you.",c="远古马魂接受了这份玛纳强化马饲料的供奉，它蹭着容器，自行享用那些特制的燕麦和谷粒。吃了一些之后，它看了看你持有的马铠，并摆好姿势，仿佛想让你把它放上自己的背……",cEN="The Ancient Equine Spirit accepts the offering of the Manna-Enriched Horse Feed, nuzzling the container as it helps itself to the special oats and grains. After it has eaten a little, it looks at the barding you possess and positions itself as though it wants you to place it upon its back..."}
Q[7644]={d="当马饰被放在上古圣马之魂的背上时，它开始微微发光。周围的空气开始凝结，然后马饰就从上古圣马之魂的背上消失，回到了你的背包里。\n\n看来马饰已经受到了祝福。根据沙东布瑞克公爵的指引，你应该带着马饰回暴风城去找他。",dEN="As the barding rests on the back of the Ancient Equine Spirit, it glows ever so slightly. The air is thick with power for a brief moment, and then the barding disappears from the back of the horse and is now secure in your backpack.\n\nIt would seem that the barding has been blessed. As per Lord Shadowbreaker's instructions, you should now return with it to him in Stormwind.",o="将被祝福的奥金马铠交给暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵。",oEN="Return with the Blessed Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",p="$n，你回来了！你有没有搞定梅丽德丝·卡尔森和特迪斯·扭木？老实说，我现在还不能确定哪一个威胁更大……",pEN="<name>, you're back! Were you able to successfully deal with Merideth Carlson and Tendris Warpwood? Honestly, I'm not sure which one is a greater threat at times...",c="你已经走了很远，$g朋友:朋友;。你的马铠现在已经为最后一项任务准备妥当了。\n\n当救赎任务完成后，你将用这副马铠来驾驭你的战马。但在此之前，你必须克服一场艰巨的考验。你的时刻临近了——呼哈！\n\n在我们开始之前，还有最后一件东西需要制作，$n。希望自从你做好马铠之后，你的机智还没有离你而去……",cEN="You've come far, my friend. Your barding is now suitably prepared for the last task at hand.\n\nYou will be using this barding to harness your charger once the task of redemption is complete. Before that, however, you will have a monumental struggle to overcome. Your time draws near - huzzah!\n\nThere is one last item that needs to be made before we begin this, <name>. Hopefully your resourcefulness has not departed you since you had your barding made..."}
Q[7645]={d="当初我告诉白银之手我能做出一种喂养灵魂战马的特殊马饲料时，他们觉得我疯了。所有人都觉得我疯了！哈，现在是我报仇的时候了！\n\n我会给你做你需要的东西，圣骑士……所谓的「勇士」……但这会让你付出代价。我需要一种特别的饼干——只有银色黎明出售的玛纳强化饼干——来调配这个东西。我还要，没错，我要求黄金作为我这些年所受苦难的补偿！\n\n让我看看你一直挂在嘴边的牺牲，圣骑士。",dEN="The Silver Hand thought me MAD when I told them that I could make a special horse feed that could nourish spiritual horses. EVERYONE thought I was mad! Well, now it's payback time!\n\nI'll make what you need, PALADIN... so-called CHAMPION... but it will cost you. I need special biscuits - Enriched Manna Biscuits sold only by the Argent Dawn - for this blend. I also demand, yes DEMAND gold as compensation for the misery I have endured!\n\nShow me the sacrifice you tout so much, PALADIN.",o="把制作魔法粮草所需要的重要材料：20块可口的魔法点心带给希尔斯布莱德丘陵的梅丽德丝·卡尔森。据说银色黎明会出售这种饼干。\n\n你还需要给她50金币来对她进行安抚。",oEN="Retrieve 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits - the key ingredient in making Manna-Enriched Horse Feed - for Merideth Carlson at Southshore in the Hillsbrad Foothills. The Argent Dawn is known as the sole purveyor of the biscuits.\n\nYou also need to give her 50 gold to soothe her ruffled sensibilities.",p="怎么样，我证明你是错的了，是不是？我证明你们都错了！我一直以来都是正确的！",pEN="Yes, I've proved you wrong now, haven't I? I've proved them all wrong! I WAS RIGHT ALL ALONG!!!",c="是啊，现在谁——等等——你连金币也一起给我？当初又不是你骂我疯的（其实他们骂我是个疯子、神经病）……即便如此，你仍然$g愿意:愿意;为并非你所犯下的过错做出牺牲？\n\n我……我错看你了，$n。如果你还需要更多的马饲料，就来找我。我会免费给你。谢谢你……高贵的$n。\n\n不过，这笔钱我要留下——我还没疯到把一笔财富白白让出去的地步。",cEN="YES, NOW WHO - wait - you're giving me the gold too? You weren't the one who called me mad (actually they called me a fruitcake nut-job)... still, you're willing to show sacrifice even for wrongs you've not committed?\n\nI... I misjudged you, <name>. Should you need more horse feed, come see me. I will give it to you free of charge. Thank you... noble <class>.\n\nI am going to keep the money though - I'm not that much of a nut-job as to give up a fortune."}
Q[7646]={d="你现在必须制作出一颗预言水晶球，只有用它，你才能开始救赎堕落战马的试炼。你的预言水晶球实际上已经快要完成了。在恐惧谷中用过的驱魔香炉其实是它的催化剂，另外我还会专门为这个装置制作一个外壳。\n\n我最后需要的材料是两块钻石，也就是一块艾泽拉斯钻石和一块原始黑钻石。这两块钻石将被放在预言水晶球中，让它射出足以撕破黑暗的光芒！",dEN="We now must assemble a Divination Scryer - this will begin the trial that will allow you to redeem the fallen charger. Your scryer, actually, is almost done. The exorcism censer used in Terrordale is the catalyst for it, and I will fashion a suitable housing for the device.\n\nThe last components needed, though, are two diamonds. They must be as juxtaposed in brilliance as they are in purpose - an Azerothian and a Pristine Black. These two will be the beacon by which the scryer will pierce the shadows!",o="把一块艾泽拉斯钻石和一块原始黑钻石交给暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵。",oEN="Bring an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",p="你已经走到了这一步，$n。你为它所做的一切牺牲都将为你带来伟大的成就。我可以向你保证这一点。",pEN="You have come so very far, <name>. Your final act of worldly-item sacrifice will be the genesis for one of your greatest accomplishments. I can feel it in the very fiber of my being!",c="非常完美，$n——现在最后一块东西也准备好了。你即将大功告成了！\n\n在通灵学院的尸骨储藏所中有许多生物的骨骸，其中就有一匹高贵的战骑。这匹战骑的灵魂现在成了死亡骑士达克雷尔的坐骑。你要击败他，并对这匹战骑进行审判。只有你，$n，能够救赎它的灵魂，并将它从痛苦的折磨中拯救出来。",cEN="These are fine specimens, <name> - the final pieces are now in place. At long last, your time has come!\n\nIn the depths of the Great Ossuary of Scholomance are the skeletal remains of many beings. Amongst them is a once-noble charger. The hollowed soul of this charger now serves as the steed for Death Knight Darkreaver. It is he whom you will face, and it is this steed that you will pass judgment upon. Only you, <name>, can redeem its soul and save it from the torment of its servitude."}
Q[7647]={d="拿着这个背包，里面是你任务所需的物品。\n\n使用大藏骨堂地下室中央的占卜水晶，召唤出那些必须接受审判的受诅咒的灵魂。在这场试炼中明智地运用你的审判——它们会比你想象的更加强大。灵魂之后，死亡骑士就会出现；击败他，夺回战马失落的灵魂。只有到那时，$n，你才能救赎它，并把你的马铠披上你的新坐骑。\n\n祝你好运！",dEN="Take this satchel - in it are the items you will need for your task.\n\nUse the divination scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement to bring forth accursed spirits that must be judged. Use your judgments wisely during this trial - they will prove more potent than you realize. After the spirits, the death knight will appear; defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the charger. Only then <name>, will you be able to redeem it and place your barding upon your new steed!\n\nGood luck!",o="在通灵学院尸骨储藏所地下室的中心使用预言水晶球。将你要审判的灵魂引领出来。将这些灵魂击败然后死亡骑士达克雷尔就将被召唤出来。将其击败然后获得堕落战马的灵魂。\n\n把赎罪的战马之魂和被祝福的奥金马铠一起附在达克雷尔的堕落战马身上。",oEN="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver. Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger.\n\nGive the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger.",p="堕落的战骑之灵用悲哀的眼神凝视着你。它空洞的双眼中充满了绝望。",pEN="The spirit of the fallen charger looks upon you with a mournful gaze. Sad, almost hollow eyes look at you as though all hope was lost to it.",c="当你把这匹战马受审判的灵魂交还给它时，它眼中闪过许久未曾有过的生命之光。当你在它背上放上马铠、宣告这匹战马已获救赎时，你感到一股神圣的力量之潮在你周围涌动。战马蹭着你的手，往日的重负已从这头野兽身上卸下。现在你觉得自己可以在需要的时候召唤这头野兽，让它作为你的坐骑为你效力。\n\n你已经得到了你的史诗战马，$n！恭喜！",cEN="A glimmer of life - long vacant from the poor beast - shines in its eyes as you hand its judged soul back to it. You feel a holy rush of power surge around you as you place the barding on its back, having judged the charger redeemed. The charger nuzzles your hand as the burdens of the past are lifted from the beast. You now feel as though you could call upon this beast to serve as your steed, should the need arise.\n\nYou have claimed your epic charger, <class>! Congratulations!"}
Q[7648]={d="<格瑞曼德擦了擦额角的汗，露出非常自豪的笑容。>　\n\n给你，我的朋友。这是我能打造出来的最好的作品——它的质量和我亲手为沙东布瑞克公爵的坐骑制作的马饰不相上下。感谢你对我的手艺的信任。\n\n毫无疑问，葛瑞森也想亲自看看这个作品。把你的马饰交给它，然后替我感谢他交给我这个光荣的任务。",dEN="<Grimand wipes sweat from his brow, beaming with a sense of pride.>\n\nThere you are, my friend. This is some of my finest work - as good as the barding I personally made for Lord Shadowbreaker when he went for his own charger. I thank you for your trust in me to provide for you the best.\n\nNo doubt Grayson will want to see the work for himself as well. Take your barding to him, and give him my thanks for his honorable business.",o="把奥金马铠交给暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵。",oEN="Take the Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District for his inspection.",p="你的任务进展得不错，$n。一旦你完成了马饰，就可以进入任务的下一步了。",pEN="You're progressing along nicely, <name>. Once you have made your barding, you'll be well on your way to the next task.",c="这活儿真是令人赞叹。看来随着格里曼德年纪渐长，他的手艺还在不断精进。要知道当年他为我做马铠时，他的手艺就已经是天下少有的上乘之作了，这可真是了不起。\n\n虽然这副马铠配在任何普通坐骑上都很不错，但我们面对的不是那么平凡的野兽。你需要让一位合适的存在为这副马铠赐福，它才配得上安放在$g一位:一位;$c的战马背上。到那时之前，我会替你保管它。",cEN="This is most impressive work. It seems that as Grimand gets older, his craftsmanship continues to improve. That's quite the feat when his work was already some of the finest you'd find anywhere when he made my barding back in the day.\n\nWhile this barding would be a fine addition to any normal steed, we are not dealing with such a mundane beast. You'll need this barding blessed by an appropriate source for it to be worthy of resting on a <class>'s charger. I'll hold onto it for you until then."}
Q[7649]={d="这本典籍印有图书馆的标记。",dEN="The tome carries the mark of the Athenaeum.",o="将这本典籍交给它的主人。",oEN="Return the book to its rightful owners.",p="你找到了一本书！",pEN="You have recovered a tome!",c="干得好，我的$g孩子:孩子;。\n\n<博学者莱德罗斯从书中撕下一页。>\n\n我相信这份配方对你会派上用场。",cEN="Well done, my <boy/girl>.\n\n<Lorekeeper Lydros tears out a page from the book.>\n\nI am sure you can make use of this recipe."}
Q[7650]={d="这本典籍印有图书馆的标记。",dEN="The tome carries the mark of the Athenaeum.",o="将这本典籍交给它的主人。",oEN="Return the book to its rightful owners.",p="你找到了一本书！",pEN="You have recovered a tome!",c="干得好，我的$g孩子:孩子;。\n\n<博学者莱德罗斯从书中撕下一页。>\n\n我相信这份配方对你会派上用场。",cEN="Well done, my <boy/girl>.\n\n<Lorekeeper Lydros tears out a page from the book.>\n\nI am sure you can make use of this recipe."}
Q[7651]={d="这本典籍印有图书馆的标记。",dEN="The tome carries the mark of the Athenaeum.",o="将这本典籍交给它的主人。",oEN="Return the book to its rightful owners.",p="你找到了一本书！",pEN="You have recovered a tome!",c="干得好，我的$g孩子:孩子;。\n\n<博学者莱德罗斯从书中撕下一页。>\n\n我相信这份配方对你会派上用场。",cEN="Well done, my <boy/girl>.\n\n<Lorekeeper Lydros tears out a page from the book.>\n\nI am sure you can make use of this recipe."}
Q[7652]={c="好吧，$g先生:小姐，我有个很好的提议。\n\n我这里有一些帝国铠甲的配方，我想要把它们卖掉，换些我用得到的东西。我所需要的只是一些瑟银锭，你觉得怎么样？",cEN="Aright, <mister/lady>, I got a hot deal for ya.\n\nI'm lookin' to offload some of these here Imperial plate armor recipes and need someone willing to take on the burden. All I want in exchange is some thorium bars. Sound good?"}
Q[7653]={p="你想得到腰带的设计图，就给我拿10块瑟银锭来。",pEN="For the belt plans, I'll be needin' 10 thorium bars.",c="很高兴和你做生意。\n\n另外，$n，你能不能不要把那讨厌的表情挂在脸上？",cEN="A pleasure doin' business with ya.\n\nAnd <name>, wipe that look of disgust off yer face."}
Q[7654]={p="你想得到靴子的设计图，就给我拿20块瑟银锭来。对，20块。你是不是要哭了？你要不要手帕？\n\n<德罗泰恩大笑着。>",pEN="For the boot plans, I'll be needin' 20 thorium bars. Yep, 20. Are you gonna cry? Would you like a hanky?\n\n<Derotain laughs.>",c="很高兴和你做生意。\n\n另外，$n，你能不能不要把那讨厌的表情挂在脸上？",cEN="A pleasure doin' business with ya.\n\nAnd <name>, wipe that look of disgust off yer face."}
Q[7655]={p="要拿到护腕的图纸，我需要 10 块瑟银锭。\n\n你没事吧，$g孩子:孩子;？你全身都$g变红了:变红了;。",pEN="For the bracer plans, I'll be needin' 10 thorium bars.\n\nAre you alright, sonny? Yer getting' all red.",c="很高兴和你做生意。\n\n另外，$n，你能不能不要把那讨厌的表情挂在脸上？",cEN="A pleasure doin' business with ya.\n\nAnd <name>, wipe that look of disgust off yer face."}
Q[7656]={p="要拿到胸甲的图纸，我需要 30 块瑟银锭。\n\n哦，$g小子:丫头;，你又来了。你打算跑去找你那些蓝色的神，问他们为什么抛弃你吗？振作点，南希！没人说过生活是公平的。",pEN="For the chest piece plans, I'll be needin' 30 thorium bars.\n\nOh boy, there you go again. Are you gonna be runnin' to yer blue Gods, askin' why they have forsaken you?!? Toughen up, Nancy! Nobody ever said life's fair.",c="很高兴和你做生意。\n\n另外，$n，你能不能不要把那讨厌的表情挂在脸上？",cEN="A pleasure doin' business with ya.\n\nAnd <name>, wipe that look of disgust off yer face."}
Q[7657]={p="只要给我25块瑟银锭，头盔的设计图就是你的了。",pEN="Just hand over 25 thorium bars and the helm plans are yers.",c="很高兴和你做生意。\n\n另外，$n，你能不能不要把那讨厌的表情挂在脸上？",cEN="A pleasure doin' business with ya.\n\nAnd <name>, wipe that look of disgust off yer face."}
Q[7658]={p="只要交来 30 块瑟银锭，护腿的图纸就是你的了。\n\n我知道，我这是要把你逼得破产！这些话我早就听腻了，所以省省你那套可怜的故事吧，$g软脚虾:软脚虾;。",pEN="Just hand over 30 thorium bars and the leg plans are yers.\n\nI know, I'm driving you into bankruptcy! I've heard it all before so you can save your sob story, weakling.",c="很高兴和你做生意。\n\n另外，$n，你能不能不要把那讨厌的表情挂在脸上？",cEN="A pleasure doin' business with ya.\n\nAnd <name>, wipe that look of disgust off yer face."}
Q[7659]={p="你想得到护肩的设计图，就给我拿10块瑟银锭来。",pEN="For the shoulder plans, I'll be needin' 10 thorium bars.",c="很高兴和你做生意。\n\n另外，$n，你能不能不要把那讨厌的表情挂在脸上？",cEN="A pleasure doin' business with ya.\n\nAnd <name>, wipe that look of disgust off yer face."}
Q[7660]={p="如果你把原本供你骑乘的高速座狼给我带来，我就可以让你从新的狼中选择一头。新的狼将和你原来的狼拥有同样的速度，但是其外观将会有所不同，看看周围的这些迅捷座狼就可以知道它们大概是什么样子了。",pEN="If you bring me your old fast wolf, I will trade it in for one from the new pack. The new wolf will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it. You can look at the swift wolves we already have around the yard here to see what it will look like."}
Q[7661]={p="如果你把原本供你骑乘的高速座狼给我带来，我就可以让你从新的狼中选择一头。新的狼将和你原来的狼拥有同样的速度，但是其外观将会有所不同，看看周围的这些迅捷座狼就可以知道它们大概是什么样子了。",pEN="If you bring me your old fast wolf, I will trade it in for one from the new pack. The new wolf will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it. You can look at the swift wolves we already have around the yard here to see what it will look like."}
Q[7662]={p="如果你把原本供你骑乘的高速科多兽给我带来，我就可以让你从新的科多兽中选择一头。新的科多兽将和你原来的科多兽拥有同样的速度，但是其外观将会有所不同，看看周围的这些科多兽就可以知道它们大概是什么样子了。",pEN="If you bring me your aging kodo, I will trade it in for one from the new herd. The new kodo will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it. You can look at the great kodos we already have around the yard here to see what you will have to choose from."}
Q[7663]={p="如果你把原本供你骑乘的高速科多兽给我带来，我就可以让你从新的科多兽中选择一头。新的科多兽将和你原来的科多兽拥有同样的速度，但是其外观将会有所不同，看看周围的这些科多兽就可以知道它们大概是什么样子了。",pEN="If you bring me your aging kodo, I will trade it in for one from the new herd. The new kodo will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it. You can look at the great kodos we already have around the yard here to see what you will have to choose from."}
Q[7664]={p="如果你把原本供你骑乘的高速迅猛龙给我带来，我就可以让你从新的迅猛龙中选择一头。新的迅猛龙将和你原来的迅猛龙拥有同样的速度，但是其外观将会有所不同，看看周围的这些迅猛龙就可以知道它们大概是什么样子了。",pEN="You bring me your old raptor, I give you new one with freshly sharpened claws! The new raptor will be just as fast as your old one, but with a new look to him. You can look at the swift raptors here to see what you will have to choose from."}
Q[7665]={p="如果你把原本供你骑乘的高速迅猛龙给我带来，我就可以让你从新的迅猛龙中选择一头。新的迅猛龙将和你原来的迅猛龙拥有同样的速度，但是其外观将会有所不同，看看周围的这些迅猛龙就可以知道它们大概是什么样子了。",pEN="You bring me your old raptor, I give you new one with freshly sharpened claws! The new raptor will be just as fast as your old one, but with a new look to him. You can look at the swift raptors here to see what you will have to choose from."}
Q[7666]={c="你准备再次进入通灵学院了吗，$n？你已经为使用预言水晶球付出了很大的代价——也许你希望再得到一颗。使用它之后，你就可以再次面对尸骨储藏所中的恶灵。\n\n不管怎么样，拿着它吧。",cEN="Are you headed back into the Scholomance, <name>? You've already paid such a great price for the use of the Divination Scryer - perhaps you'd like to take another one with you. With it, you'd be able to face the perils of the Great Ossuary once more.\n\nBy all means, have it. You've certainly earned it."}
Q[7667]={d="$n，这是一件我希望能得到你帮助的事情，一件重要的事情……请允许我解释一下。\n\n在洛丹伦的通灵学院中有一个被称为尸骨储藏所的房间。我要制造一个能够洞穿那个房间中的邪恶力量的装置，因此我需要两块钻石：一块艾泽拉斯钻石和一块原始黑钻石。我知道这两样东西都不是那么容易得到的，而且我自己没有办法得到。\n\n你能帮我拿来这两样东西吗？",dEN="<name>, there is a pressing matter I hope you can help with... both materially and spiritually. Allow me to explain.\n\nWithin the depths of the Scholomance in Lordaeron is a chamber called the Great Ossuary. I need to complete a device that would pierce the shadows of this horrid room. To finish what I have started, I need two diamonds: an Azerothian and a Pristine Black. These are not trivial items, I know - I just don't have the resources myself.\n\nCould you provide me with one of each?",o="如果你愿意帮助奥格瑞玛智慧谷的萨格尼，就将一块艾泽拉斯钻石和一块原始黑钻石交给他。",oEN="If you are interested in helping Sagorne Crestrider in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom, bring him an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond.",p="我知道开口要这些材料并不好，但是我的预言水晶球——就是我想要制作的装置——必须用到它们。如果你不能帮助我的话，我也可以理解。",pEN="I feel awkward asking for material assistance, but my divination scryer - the device I hope to finish - requires one of each. If you cannot help me, I'd certainly understand.",c="你真的是非常慷慨，$n。我感谢你的好意。\n\n现在我终于可以完成我的预言水晶球了，而且我还可以进一步地改善它……也许你可以帮我使用它？这是一个非常重要的任务，我向你保证……如果这个任务无法完成的话，那么灵魂世界将会面临令人无法想象的灾难！",cEN="Your generosity is unrivaled, <name>. I thank you for your kindness.\n\nI will be able to finish my divination scryer now, and I should be able to fashion more without further need of diamonds... perhaps you would be interested in helping me in its use? It is for a most important task, I assure you... one that left unchecked could spell unmitigated disaster for the spirit realm!"}
Q[7670]={d="这个伟大的时刻终于到来了，$n，接下来你就将获得你渴望已久的东西——你的战马。\n\n去和暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵谈谈吧。他将指引你完成必需的任务，令你获得一匹圣骑士最可信任的坐骑。\n\n我祝你在这次试炼中好运，为了圣光而战，我的$g兄弟:姐妹！",dEN="The time has come, <name>, for you to learn about what it will take for you to acquire something you have no doubt waited on for some time... your charger.\n\nSpeak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District. It is he who will guide you not only though the legerdemain of a Paladin's most trusted mount, but the tasks before you to acquire one of your own.\n\nI wish you the best in this trial. For the Light, noble <brother /sister>!",o="与暴风城教堂区的格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District.",c="很高兴见到你，$n。我知道你急切地想要知道如何才能获得你的战骑，现在这个时刻终于来临了。\n\n你需要经过许多试炼，但是最重要的是，你的信念将通过克服这些困难得到最大程度的提升。这些并不是教课书式的试炼——你必须全身心地投入，才能克服即将到来的挑战。在拯救你未来的伙伴之前，你必须与无数邪恶的力量抗衡。\n\n现在，我们开始吧！",cEN="I am glad to see you <name>. I know that you have awaited word as to how to acquire your charger, and now that time has come.\n\nYou will be surely tested in many different ways, but most importantly in your willingness to rise above numerous obstacles thrust before you. These are not done as a learning exercise - your stature is beyond simple educational tests. You must save your future companion from the clutches of the evil you have spent your life fighting.\n\nTake heed, your time has come!"}
Q[7701]={d="工头玛托留斯原本是瑟银兄弟会的潜行者密探，现在却在熔渣之池中担任黑铁矮人的指挥官。根据工头奥菲斯特的命令，杀死工头玛托留斯并将他的头颅带回来即可领取奖赏。\n\n请向侦查队长洛洛尔领取奖励。",dEN="By order o' 'is eminence, Overseer Oilfist, the rogue Thorium Brotherhood agent an' newly hired commander o' the Dark Iron Slag Pit crew o' the Cauldron, Overseer Maltorius, is to be killed an' 'is head brung back as proof o' the deed.\n\nSee Lookout Captan Lolo Longstriker fer the reward on this bounty.",o="那个叫做工头玛托留斯的黑铁矮人叛徒就藏在大熔炉的熔渣之池深处。\n\n杀死工头玛托留斯，将他的头颅交给灼热峡谷的侦查队长洛洛尔以换取你的奖励。",oEN="Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.\n\nSlay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.",p="你没看见我正忙着吗？你*嗝*想要什么？*嗝*",pEN="Can't ya shee I'm bushy? What *hic* ish it ya be wantin? *hic*",c="我……呃，真没想到还能再见到这张丑脸！\n\n他没……没了身子之后，看着倒是顺眼多了。\n\n这是你的奖赏，嗝，$r。",cEN="I never thunk I'd be lookin' at thish ugly mug again!\n\nHe acshually looksh better without the resht o' him attached.\n\nHere's yer reward *hic*, <race>."}
Q[7702]={d="如果你想要破坏黑铁矮人在熔渣之池的生产活动，就必须抓住其弱点给予致命一击。\n\n众所周知，矮人——特别是黑铁矮人——需要休息！需要充足的休息！\n\n我问你，他们睡觉难道不用枕头吗？对，$n，他们不能没有枕头。你必须小心翼翼地潜入熔渣之池，偷走他们的枕头。",dEN="If we want to put a dent in the productivity of the Dark Iron forces working out of the Slag Pit, we have to hit them where it's going to hurt the most.\n\nIt's a little known fact but dwarves, particularly of the Dark Iron variety, need rest! Lots of rest!\n\nNow I ask you; How can they sleep without pillows? Exactly, <name>, they can't. This is why you must weasel your way into the Slag Pit and steal their pillows.",o="在大熔炉的熔渣之池深处，你可以发现黑铁矮人的休息区。\n\n到休息区去偷走20只黑铁枕头。当你完成任务后就回到灼热峡谷的艾沃奈斯那里复命。",oEN="Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, you will find the sleeping quarters of the Dark Iron dwarves.\n\nTravel to the sleeping quarters and steal 20 Dark Iron Pillows. Return to Evonice Sootsmoker in the Searing Gorge when you have accomplished this task.",p="别被这古怪的护目镜迷惑了，$n。我是这儿最聪明的。",pEN="Don't let the crazy goggles fool you, <name>. I'm the smart one here.",c="棒极了！那些困乏的黑铁矮人会回家去休息，这样就可以大大降低他们熔渣之池中的生产效率。",cEN="Wonderful! Those sleepy Dark Irons will head back to their homes in the Depths to get some rest, greatly slowing down the productivity of the Slag Pit."}
Q[7703]={d="现在你是国王……那也许你就去从那个自称\"王子\"的讨厌精灵手里夺回戈多克宝物！上一任国王失败了，就像托塞德林之后的历代国王一样——那个讨厌的精灵很久以前从老戈多克国王手里偷走了它！\n\n宝物叫做戈多克力量护手。很老很老的故事说，只有戈多克真正的国王才能拿回它。很老很老的故事还说，那个讨厌的精灵还在这附近，你去找，你就能永远戴着强大的护手！呀，我教你！",dEN="Now you da king, so maybe you get prized Gordok artifact back from creepy elf who calls himself Prince! Da king before you failed, just like all da other kings since Tortheldrin - da creepy elf - stole it from old timey Gordok king!\n\nArtifact is called da Gauntlet of Gordok Might. Old timey stories say only da one true king da Gordok can get it back. Old timey story also say creepy elf is still around here - you find it and it will become mighty gauntlet you wear forever! Yar, I show you!",o="找到戈多克力量护手，把它交给厄运之槌的克罗卡斯队长。\n\n据克罗卡斯说，一个\"很久很久以前的故事\"说，一个自称王子的\"讨厌\"精灵托塞德林，从戈多克的一位国王手中偷走了这只护手。",oEN="Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.\n\nAccording to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",p="哈哈，你还没有找到它，是不是，老大？也许那只是一个故事……很难相信那个可恶的精灵居然可以从我们戈多克的大王身边偷走东西！",pEN="Hah, you no find it, do you boss? Maybe old timey story a bad story... hard to believe that creepy elf can steal from Gordok king!",c="哇……你真是真正的$g国王:女王;！我这辈子都没想过能看到这只护手！它看起来已经没有半点魔力了……也许那个讨厌的精灵想毁掉这只护手。哼，我对他只会说：哈！哈！\n\n看——护手上这个印记是很老很老的老魔法印记，据说比戈多克还要古老。作为戈多克的队长，我们一次次学到的只有一件事——让印记活过来，把力量还给护手！\n\n我为你来做，$g国王:女王;！来，拿着护手，永远统治下去！",cEN="Wow... you ARE da true <king/queen>! I never think I see this gauntlet in my life! It look like it got no mojo left anymore... maybe that creepy elf try and ruin gauntlet. Well, I say HAR HAR to him!\n\nLook - this mark on da gauntlet an old old OLD timey magic mark, older than da Gordok they say. Well, as Captain of da Gordok, we all learn one thing over and over - how to make mark come to life and give power back to gauntlet!\n\nI do it for you, <king/queen>! Here, take da gauntlet and rule FOREVER!"}
Q[7704]={d="啧啧……这难道不是个惊喜吗？这实在就是个惊喜啊。比拉凯琳的巨大而精美的枕头现在是你的囊中之物啦。艾沃奈斯肯定很想将她那脏兮兮的小手放在枕头上。把枕头交给她，看看她是否会奖励你点什么。",dEN="Well, well, well... Isn't this a surprise. The Chambermaid had a gigantic ornate pillow and now it's yours. Evonice Sootsmoker will definitely want to get her grubby little hands all over this item. Take it to her and see if she'll offer you any goodies for your trouble.",o="将比拉凯琳的枕头交给灼热峡谷的艾沃奈斯。",oEN="Take Chambermaid Pillaclencher's Pillow to Evonice Sootsmoker in the Searing Gorge."}
Q[7721]={d="如果我违背自己的判断留在被遗忘的海岸开一家工程学商店，我就得应付那些讨厌的元素生物。真该诅咒那些失控的元素之力！\n\n算我走运——现在也算你走运，我寄予厚望的$g密探:密探;——这些元素生物是我超级缩小器绝佳的原始能量来源。让它们的人生有点意义吧！不过，缩小它们的时候，记得把水元素之核留给我！",dEN="If I bet against my own better judgment and stay to run an engineering shop along the Forgotten Coast, I will need to deal with these pesky elementals. Curse the powers of elementalism unchecked, I say!\n\nFortunately for me, and now for you my hopeful agent provocateur, the elementals represent an ideal source of raw power for my Ultra-Shrinker refinement - give them the what-for I say! When doing this though, be sure to save me the water elemental cores!",o="从菲拉斯被遗忘的海岸那里的海元素和巨型海元素身上获取10块水元素核心，把它们交给码头附近的索尔宾·范达瑟。",oEN="Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",p="也许你会对那些技术细节感到厌烦，但是我所准备付出的报酬一定会让你动心的。怎么样，你完成任务了没有？",pEN="While I could bore you with the technical details of the utility behind elemental cores, I will instead tempt you to completion of this important task by offering valuable coin and prizes for doing so. Yon verily, are you finished?",c="太棒了！这些水元素核心可以让我使用好长一段时间了。另外海岸边的元素生物也少了很多，我不必再担心自己选错了开店的地方了！\n\n谢谢你，$n，感谢你为我做的一切。虽然给你奖励会让我囊中羞涩，但是请一定收下这些……收下吧！",cEN="Scrumdillyriffic! These cores will keep me working for some time. Add to that the benefit of there now being fewer elementals along the coast, and I might no longer cry myself to sleep at the prospect of having set up shop in perhaps the worst place imaginable!\n\nThank you, <name>, for your efforts on my behalf. While it certainly straps me financially to do this, allow me to show you some gratitude you may understand and appreciate... loot!"}
Q[7722]={d="当那个混账玛托留斯离开我们的部族时，他还带走了比无暇的奥术水晶更加宝贵的东西——我们制作炽热助熔剂的配方！我相信他一定在利用这个配方从黑铁矮人那里获取利益。\n\n我希望你拿回我们的秘密配方，$n。我确信它们就在玛托留斯身边，而他正躲在熔渣之池的深处。",dEN="When that traitor, Maltorius, left our clan, he left with something more valuable than a pristine arcane crystal: Our recipe for fiery flux! I'd bet anything that the recipe was part of the deal in his new promotion amongst the Dark Irons.\n\nI want you to get our secret plans back, <name>. I'm sure they're somewhere near Maltorius, deep inside the Slag Pit.",o="去灼热峡谷大熔炉的熔渣坑寻找被工头玛托留斯偷走的秘密图纸：炽热助熔剂。把图纸交给灼热峡谷的大铁匠伯奈特。|n",oEN="Somewhere in the Slag Pit of the Cauldron you will find the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux that Overseer Maltorius stole. Find those plans and return them to Master Smith Burninate in the Searing Gorge.",p="你找到那些设计图了吗？",pEN="Did you find the plans?",c="我希望你把那个混蛋的牙齿都给打落了，$n。拉格纳罗斯在上，他罪有应得。\n\n现在我们可以继续进行我们的交易了。",cEN="I hope you kicked his teeth in too, <name>. Ragnaros knows, he deserved it.\n\nNow we can get down to business."}
Q[7723]={d="真糟糕，由于我近来变得越来越胖，我已经不能像以前那样大吃大喝啦。你瞧瞧这儿的气候，而且气压还很低，我的手指都肿胀起来啦，看上去就像是粗大的塞尔萨玛血肠……\n\n你得帮我做点事情。\n\n让我看看我的日程安排，第一件事情是……杀死峡谷中的重型作战傀儡。把它们全都干掉。",dEN="Unfortunately, I can't dish out the beats like I used to, due to this here fat finger problem. Ye see, the climate out here combined with the lack o' air pressure makes me fingers expand. They're like gigantic Thelsamar Blood Sausages, they are...\n\nYe're gonna have to carry out me orders of business and what have ye.\n\nFirst on me agenda: Poundin' the livin' daylights out o' the heavy war golems o' the Gorge. Get crackin'.",o="汉瑟尔·重拳让你杀掉20个重型作战傀儡。\n\n重型作战傀儡就在灼热峡谷的大熔炉附近。当你杀死足够多的傀儡后，就回去找汉瑟尔·重拳。",oEN="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems.\n\nThe Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge.",p="你杀死它们了吗？",pEN="Did ye pound 'em?",c="你干得很不错。看，你为自己赢得了一份小礼物。",cEN="Ye're a good <lad/lass>, ye are. I got ye a lil' present fer yer troubles."}
Q[7724]={d="你不知道吗，每次汉瑟尔想要放松放松，反思他的人生的时候，上面就会给他指派新的工作。\n\n我要思考！你知道我在说什么吗？知道吗？\n\n巨型熔岩蜘蛛在这儿引起了一些麻烦，奥菲斯特说他跟这些畜牲势不两立……嗯，无论如何，这些蜘蛛让孩子们感到不安。\n\n我想我们得杀掉它们，你正是最佳人选。",dEN="Wouldn't ye know it, every time ol' Hansel wants to take a moment to relax and reflect upon his life, the powers that be give him another job.\n\nMe gots to think, come on! Ye know what I be saying? Come. On.\n\nSo, these here greater lava spiders are causin' a ruckus o' some sort. Oilfist says they shoot fire out their... erm, yea well, anyway, such things upset the children.\n\nI guess we gots to kill 'em. Rather, ye gots to kill 'em.",o="汉瑟尔·重拳要你杀死灼热峡谷中的20只巨型熔岩蜘蛛。你可以在灼热峡谷的高地和熔岩池里找到巨型熔岩蜘蛛。\n\n当你杀死足够的巨型熔岩蜘蛛之后，回到汉瑟尔·重拳那里复命。",oEN="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.\n\nReturn to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders.",p="奥菲斯特说的是真的吗？那些蜘蛛真的是从屁股里吐丝的吗？",pEN="Was he right? Does it come out their rumps?",c="<汉瑟尔打了个喷嚏。>\n\n我想我感冒了。这寒冷的气候真该死！",cEN="<Hansel sneezes.>\n\nI think I'm gettin' a cold. Damn this frigid climate!"}
Q[7725]={d="我知道你已经替我收集过残渣了……但如果你觉得这段经历很有趣，想再来一场加演，我随时欢迎你多带些残渣给我。\n\n这次的报酬同样给不了你什么像样的东西，但我很乐意在我认识的所有有耳朵的地精朋友中间宣传你帮过我的忙。\n\n相信我，那些地精当中，有些人的耳朵可大得很。",dEN="I know you've gathered residue for me already... but should you find yourself for want of an encore performance to a fun-time activity, I can always use more residue.\n\nWhile I can't offer nearly as much in the way of compensation again, I'll be more than happy to spread the good word of your service to all my goblin friends with ears.\n\nBelieve me <sir /madam> when I say that these goblins have quite large ears.",o="使用索尔宾的超级压缩器来缩小菲拉斯的任意种类的巨人，将他们缩小到更容易控制的体积。从缩小过的巨人身上收集10份微缩残渣，把它们交给菲拉斯被遗忘的海岸码头的索尔宾·范达瑟。",oEN="Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 10 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.",p="啊，微缩残渣，甜蜜的结晶！好吧，老实说，我不会在进行研究的时候尝它的味道。\n\n基本不会……",pEN="Ah, the fruits of research and utilization in the form of sweet, sweet residue. Well, that is to say, I don't taste it or anything when I study it.\n\nMuch.",c="实在是太棒了，$n！你又帮了我的忙，谢谢你。\n\n非常感谢！\n\n也许我给的报酬比不上你从别人那里得到的，但是你在热砂企业地精社群中的声望将大大提升。如果你还有什么事，尽管找我说就好了！",cEN="Inconceivably fantastical, <name>! You've come through for me again, and for that I thank you.\n\nThank you!\n\nWhile you may find this coin to be a little less than you're accustomed to, rest assured your great deeds on the field of goblindom are echoing through the halls of power in the Steamwheedle Cartel. Should you need something else to do, then by all means talk to me!"}
Q[7726]={d="你需要更多的工作，是吗？难道我让你去收集元素生物体内的粘液的宏伟任务还无法满足你的冒险欲望？也许我要找到无数类似的事情让你做才行……\n\n好吧，不说废话了，我需要更多的水元素核心。我正想尽办法在这里开店，所以我给你的奖励并不会很丰厚……但是我向你保证，我会把你的热心和勇敢告诉所有人。你要相信我——我在热砂集团里认识很多人！",dEN="More work, you say? Did my heroic mission of collecting bits of goo found inside elemental beings not slake your thirst for adventure? Perhaps more of the same will vainly try to fill the bottomless well of questing you possess...\n\nOK, melodrama aside, I do need more water elemental cores. I'm trying desperately to set up shop here, so the rewards won't be as great... but I promise you I'll tell everyone in earshot how you've helped me. Trust me on this - I know people in the Cartel!",o="从菲拉斯被遗忘的海岸那里的海元素和巨型海元素身上获取6块水元素核心，把它们交给码头附近的索尔宾·范达瑟。",oEN="Collect 6 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",p="你有没有找到我要的水元素核心？",pEN="Have you managed to find the elemental cores I need?",c="太棒了，$n，太棒了！我给你的报酬也许算不得太多，但是你的壮举将在热砂企业中广为传颂！\n\n如果你想要找些别的事情来做，请尽管告诉我。我还需要更多的水元素核心。",cEN="Top notch, <name>, top notch! While the coin I give you might not be the most you'll ever receive for such work, rest assured my comrades in the Steamwheedle Cartel will hear about your efforts!\n\nIf you are looking for anything else to do, then let me know. I can always use more elemental cores and such."}
Q[7727]={d="拇趾囊肿，$G小伙子:姑娘。我的拇趾了出现囊肿。难道在这种混乱的情况下我只能砍下自己的脚来解除痛苦吗？这就是我请求你帮助我的原因。\n\n斯克兰格和博恩奈特让我杀掉这些家伙，这样他们就能派出探险队进入熔渣之池进行探索了，我说的就是那种叫做熏火龙还是什么玩艺的麻烦家伙。现在去杀了它们吧，在消灭熏火龙之前别回来找我。",dEN="Bunions, <lad/lass>. Me bunions got bunions. How am I supposed to do any sort of killin' with me feet in such disarray? That's why ye're gonna help.\n\nScrange and Burninate tasked me to kill these things so they can send some expeditionary teams down into the Slag Pit lava pools to do some explorin'. Supposedly some incendosaurs or some such nonsense down there causin' all kinds o' problems. Now move along an' don't come back 'til the incendosaur population be extinct.",o="汉瑟尔·重拳让你去杀掉20个熏火龙。\n\n熏火龙侵占了熔渣之池中的那些岩浆池。熔渣之池就在灼热峡谷的大熔炉中。\n\n当你杀死足够数量的熏火龙后，就回去找汉瑟尔·重拳。",oEN="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Incendosaurs.\n\nYou will find Incendosaurs occupying the lava pools inside the Slag Pit. The Slag Pit can be found in the Cauldron of the Searing Gorge.\n\nReturn to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Incendosaurs.",p="<汉塞尔正忙着揉搓他的拇趾囊肿。>\n\n别傻站着，$g愣着:愣着;，拿点油和丝瓜络来，把这些囊肿好好搓一搓。\n\n你没有丝瓜络？那好吧！也许该派你出去找一条丝瓜络了？\n\n嘿，你要去哪儿？",pEN="<Hansel is busily rubbing his bunions.>\n\nDon't just stand there, grab some oil and a luffa and get to scrubbin' these bunions.\n\nYe don't have a luffa? Well then! Perhaps it's time I sent you out to find a luffa?\n\nHey, where are ye goin'?",c="哦，我的脚趾痛死啦。\n\n我说，既然你没有丝瓜……",cEN="Oh me achin' feets.\n\nI figured since ye didn't have a luffa..."}
Q[7728]={d="下列物品已被盗走：\n\n*一台黑铁鼓风机。\n\n一支侦查员的望远镜。\n\n找到并归还这些被盗物品者将获得奖励。\n\n瑟银兄弟会相信，这些物品是被那些居住在灼热峡谷中的该死的黑铁矮人偷走的。\n\n那支望远镜是侦查员的有力工具，而鼓风机则是宝贵的冶铁设备。\n\n如果你找到丢失的物品，请将它们交给斯克兰格。",dEN="The following items have been stolen:\n\n*One Dark Iron Tuyere.\n\n*One Lookout's Spyglass.\n\nA reward is being offered to individuals who find and return these pilfered items.\n\nThe Thorium Brotherhood is certain that these items were stolen by unscrupulous and jealous Dark Iron dwarves that inhabit the Searing Gorge.\n\nThe spyglass in question was an excellent tool for the lookouts and the tuyere was an irreplaceable smithing tool.\n\nShould you find the missing items, return them to Scrange.",o="找到冶炼鼓风机和侦查员的望远镜，把它们还给灼热峡谷的监工斯克兰格。\n\n你所知道的关于这些物品的惟一信息是：它们肯定是被黑铁矮人偷走的。冶炼鼓风机是铁匠用的锻造工具，侦查员的望远镜是侦查员所需的侦查工具。",oEN="Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.\n\nThe only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts.",p="如果你是来领取奖励的，那么你必须把被盗的物品交给我。",pEN="If you're here for the reward, you're gonna have to give me the stolen goods.",c="棒极了！这是你应得的奖励。",cEN="Fantastic work! Now for your reward."}
Q[7729]={d="监工斯克兰格正在寻找一些优秀的冒险者深入灼热峡谷。\n\n如果你对此感兴趣的话，就到灼热峡谷去，杀死你见到的所有黑铁工头和黑铁奴隶贩子。\n\n当你全身都沾满那些家伙的鲜血之后，就回到监工斯克兰格那儿去。\n\n你自己应该知道什么叫“全身沾满他们的鲜血”，所以别问来问去的。",dEN="Taskmaster Scrange is looking for a few good men and women to help 'cull the competition' in the Searing Gorge.\n\nIf you are interested in this position, venture out into the Searing Gorge and slaughter every Dark Iron Taskmaster and Dark Iron Slaver that you see.\n\nReturn to Taskmaster Scrange when your clothes are bloody enough.\n\nYou'll know when they're bloody enough so don't ask.",o="杀死15个黑铁工头和15个黑铁奴隶贩子。完成任务之后就回去找监工斯克兰格。",oEN="Slay 15 Dark Iron Taskmasters and 15 Dark Iron Slavers. Return to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge once you have accomplished this task.",p="我们得比较你穿上衣服时和脱下衣服后的体重。",pEN="We're gonna need to weigh you with and without clothes to be sure.",c="15·9磅！这一定是沾在衣服上的血液重量的最新记录！恭喜你，$c！",cEN="15.9 pounds! That may be a new record for blood and gut weight on apparel! Congratulations, <class>!"}
Q[7730]={d="根据有限的侦查，我们得出结论，豺狼人南面的敌人是一个类似昆虫的物种。坦率地说，它们是否具有智慧现在已经不重要了。如果是它们将豺狼人逼得疯狂进犯我们的领地，那么这些虫子就是比豺狼人还要巨大的威胁。\n\n杀入那些祖卡什虫类的巢穴，那个地方被称作痛苦深渊。削减它们的数量，然后把你发现的情报给我带回来，另外别忘了拿回它们的甲壳作为你的努力的证明。",dEN="From what scouting we have managed to muster, we believe that the foe south of the gnolls is an insect-like race. Frankly, it is irrelevant whether or not if they're sentient. If they are driving the gnolls to frenzy against us, then they are as big of a threat - if not more - than the gnolls.\n\nDrive deep into where these Zukk'ash insects dwell; it is known as the Writhing Deep. Thin their numbers and report back to me what you find, bringing back their carapaces as evidence of your handiwork.",o="把20块祖卡什虫壳交给菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的哈杜肯·迅蹄。",oEN="Bring 20 Zukk'ash Carapaces to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",p="你的狩猎进行得怎么样了，$n？你是不是要向我报告你成功的消息？",pEN="How goes the hunt, <name>? Are you here to report your success?",c="干得好，$c。虽然祖卡什虫类现在还没有对我们发动全面的进攻，但你至少为我们赢得时间来策划妥当的应对方法。\n\n我一定会好好分析这些虫壳的，我们必须全方位地了解它们，然后再想办法解决这个比我们预想中的还要大得多的麻烦。",cEN="Well done, <class>. Though the extensiveness of the Zukk'ash presence will not be thwarted with anything less than a full-scale invasion, you have bought us some time so we can devise a proper strategy.\n\nI will be sure to have these carapaces analyzed; we'll need to learn everything about them before we deal with what has unfortunately turned into a much larger issue than we had anticipated."}
Q[7731]={d="在调查痛苦深渊的时候，我们的斥候发现了一只巨型昆虫——它的体积比我们见过的所有昆虫都要巨大，眼下它就在那里游荡。它不仅体积很大，而且它身上似乎还有其它昆虫所不具备的某种气息。我们给它取了一个名字——毒刺鞭笞者。\n\n它的内脏可以帮助我们研究出对付这个新威胁的方法，把它的分泌腺割下来，然后立刻回来！",dEN="In surveying the Writhing Deep, one of our scouts reported seeing a giant insect - much larger than the other insects spotted - wandering about the twisted terrain. Not only is it larger, it also seems to secrete some sort of aura that the other insects don't. We've given it a name - Stinglasher.\n\nThe innards of this beast would be invaluable to study as we figure out the best way to deal with this new threat. Cut out its secretion glands and bring it back to me immediately!",o="击败痛苦深渊中的毒刺鞭笞者，把它的腺体交给菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的哈杜肯·迅蹄。",oEN="Defeat Stinglasher in the Writhing Deep, bringing its glands back to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",p="你有没有把毒刺鞭笞者干掉？",pEN="Have you managed to bring down Stinglasher yet?",c="太好了，$c……你干得太出色了！如果毒刺鞭笞者确实是那些虫子里面最强的一个，那么对于它的研究将会对现在的局势非常有帮助。现在我的责任就是在确保我们安全的同时想出利用它的办法。\n\n请收下这些钱币作为整个营地对你的感谢，$n。干得好。",cEN="Impressive, <class>... most impressive! If Stinglasher is indeed one of their strongest creatures, the study of the beast will prove to be quite valuable in time. It's now my charge to make sure we defend ourselves long enough to take advantage of it.\n\nPlease accept this coin bounty as a token of the entire camp's thanks, <name>. Well done."}
Q[7732]={d="在解决祖卡什虫类的威胁这个问题上，你表现得非常出色。但是这个威胁远未得到彻底的解决，我希望能再次请求你为了部落的利益而战。\n\n这份文件中记录了所有与祖卡什虫类有关的信息。我希望把它交给奥格瑞玛暗巷区的基尔兹宾·鼓眼。他是个异型生物专家，希望他能从我们的发现中找到一些有价值的信息。",dEN="You've done doubly well in addressing the threat that the Zukk'ash insects pose to Camp Mojache. The threat these things pose is far from over, and I'd like to ask you for one last task on behalf of the Horde.\n\nThis is a document that details all the information we have learned about these Zukk'ash insects. I want you to deliver it to Zilzibin Drumlore in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He's an expert on alien creatures like these; I hope he can do something with the lore we've obtained.",o="把莫沙彻营地祖卡什报告交给奥格瑞玛暗巷区的基尔兹宾·鼓眼。",oEN="Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar.",p="你好，$g朋友:朋友;……你看起来有急事在身。有什么我能帮上忙的吗？",pEN="Greetings friend... you look as though you are on urgent business. Is there something I can help you with?",c="啊，我正等着这个呢。这些你面对的生物……它们是部落一直以来都忽略的威胁。哈杜肯把这份文件——还有你——送到我这里来，这是个很明智的决定。\n\n祖卡什虫类是属于异种蝎的一支，有些人认为它们是没有智慧的虫子，但是我可以向你保证——它们对我们而言，远远比联盟更有威胁。\n\n如果你愿意的话，我可以协助你开始铲除这个威胁的行动。",cEN="Ah, I've been expecting this. These creatures you faced... they are an ancient threat that the Horde continues to choose to ignore. Hadoken was wise to bring this - and you - to me.\n\nThe Zukk'ash are nothing more than creatures called the silithid. Some would think that they are a mindless nuisance, but let me assure you - they are a far, far worse threat than anything the Alliance could muster.\n\nIf you're willing and strong enough, I could use your aid in bringing this threat to light."}
Q[7733]={d="我找到了一个更好的雪人毛皮来源，这真令人难以置信！在菲拉斯北部的怒痕堡中有另外一批雪人，它们比你遇到过的雪人可要难对付多了，如果你想要尝试更大的挑战，就去那里吧！\n\n如果你可以给我弄来一些它们的毛皮，我会给你丰厚的奖励！",dEN="I have a lead on an even BETTER source of hides, if that's even possible to believe! In the northern parts of Feralas - deep within Rage Scar Hold - are another throng of yetis. They're much tougher than the ones you dealt with before, so if you're up for a bigger challenge you'd best be on your toes!\n\nI would reward you handsomely for a stack of ten of their hides; bring them to me here, and we'll finish our business.",o="把10块怒痕雪人的毛皮交给菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比。",oEN="Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",p="如果怒痕雪人的毛皮的品质可以和那些深痕谷中的雪人相媲美，那么它们一定像瑟银一样具有韧性！\n\n想象一下吧！",pEN="If these Rage Scar yeti hides are anything like the quality displayed by their Feral Scar counterparts, they could very well be as resilient as thorium!\n\nImagine that!",c="太好了，太好了！这些绝对能派上大用场——只要经过适当的工艺处理，它们就会变得更加厚实。\n\n再次感谢你的帮助，$n。拿着这个——这是我的最新产品。",cEN="Excellent, excellent! These are going to work out incredibly well - I can already tell that they're going to be much harder when properly cured.\n\nThanks again for your help <name>. Here - please take one of my latest creations."}
Q[7734]={d="我找到了一个更好的雪人毛皮来源，这真令人难以置信！在菲拉斯北部的怒痕堡中有另外一批雪人，它们比你遇到过的雪人可要难对付多了，如果你想要尝试更大的挑战，就去那里吧！\n\n如果你可以给我弄来一些它们的毛皮，我会给你丰厚的奖励！",dEN="I have a lead on an even BETTER source of hides, if that's even possible to believe! In the northern parts of Feralas - deep within Rage Scar Hold - are another throng of yetis. They're much tougher than the ones you dealt with before, so if you're up for a bigger challenge you'd best be on your toes!\n\nI would reward you handsomely for a stack of ten of their hides; bring them to me here, and we'll finish our business.",o="把10块怒痕雪人的毛皮交给菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄。",oEN="Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",p="如果怒痕雪人的毛皮的品质可以和那些深痕谷中的雪人相媲美，那么它们一定像瑟银一样具有韧性！\n\n想象一下吧！",pEN="If these Rage Scar yeti hides are anything like the quality displayed by their Feral Scar counterparts, they could very well be as resilient as thorium!\n\nImagine that!",c="太好了，太好了！这些绝对能派上大用场——只要经过适当的工艺处理，它们就会变得更加厚实。\n\n再次感谢你的帮助，$n。拿着这个——这是我的最新产品。",cEN="Excellent, excellent! These are going to work out incredibly well - I can already tell that they're going to be much harder when properly cured.\n\nThanks again for your aid, <name>. Here - please take one of my latest creations."}
Q[7735]={d="你找到了一块原始雪人毛皮。它非常厚实——比那些怒痕雪人的毛皮要厚实许多。\n\n羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比是专门做雪人毛皮生意的，这些毛皮一定可以引起他的兴趣。",dEN="You have found a pristine yeti hide that is exceptionally thick and sturdy - more so than even the ones you've seen from the yeti in Rage Scar.\n\nConsidering that Pratt McGrubben at the Feathermoon Stronghold is in the market for yeti hides, this particular one may be of considerable interest to him.",o="把原始雪人毛皮交给菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比。",oEN="Bring the Pristine Yeti Hide to Pratt McGrubben at the Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",p="嗯……$n？你有什么特别的东西要给我吗？",pEN="What's this, <name> - you've got something special for me?",c="不可思议！我想你找到了所有雪人皮里的王中之王！\n\n你$g尽管放心:尽管放心;，我会为它付你一个好价钱。通常我单张皮子不会付这么多钱，但我很确定能用它做出点特别的东西。谢谢你想到我，$n！",cEN="Incredible! You may have found the granddaddy of all yeti hides with this!\n\nYou better believe I'll pay you for it. I normally don't pay that much for a single hide, but I'm pretty sure I can make something special from it. Thanks for thinking of me on this, <name>!"}
Q[7736]={p="我没时间跟你扯东扯西的，$r。现在是补充我们日益减少的炽热助熔剂储备的时候了。\n\n我需要的物品有：\n\n*熏火龙的鳞片。\n\n*皇血草。\n\n*煤块。\n\n凡是你能给我的，我都要！\n\n如果你想要跟兄弟会搞好关系的话，就最好快点去找。",pEN="Let's not waste more of my precious time with jibber jabber, <race>. It's time to focus on replenishing our dwindling fiery flux supply.\n\nWhat I'm gonna need from you is the following:\n\n*Incendosaur scales.\n\n*Kingsblood.\n\n*Coal.\n\nI'll take all that you can offer!\n\nAnd you'll do it fast if you wanna get in good with the Brotherhood.",c="炽热助熔剂的数量总是不够。继续收集吧……除非我叫你停止。",cEN="There's always room for more fiery flux, junior. Keep it comin'... unless I tell you to stop."}
Q[7737]={p="你已经达到了可以和兄弟会进行合作的层次了，$r。我们开始对你另眼相看。干得很不错！\n\n如果你希望能赢得我们更多的尊敬，那就听好了。\n\n我们可以通过在炽热助熔剂中添加黑铁残油的方式来进一步提炼它，到黑石深渊去收集黑铁残油吧。\n\n把你找到的所有黑铁残油都交给我！",pEN="You've worked your way up through the Brotherhood's corporate hierarchy, <race>. We have begun to look favorably upon you. Quite an accomplishment!\n\nIf you're interested in more work and earning more respect amongst us, listen up.\n\nWe can refine the fiery flux by adding a simple Dark Iron residue to the mix. The Dark Iron residue can be found in Blackrock Depths.\n\nBring me all the Dark Iron residue you find!",c="继续拿残油来！",cEN="Keep the residue pouring in!"}
Q[7738]={d="你找到了一块非常完美的雪人毛皮，它非常厚实——比那些怒痕雪人的毛皮要厚实许多。\n\n莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄专门做雪人毛皮的生意，这些毛皮一定可以引起他的兴趣。",dEN="You have found what may very well be a perfect yeti hide. You easily note that it is exceptionally thick and sturdy - more so than even the ones you've seen from the yeti in Rage Scar.\n\nConsidering that Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache is in the market for yeti hides, this particular one may be of considerable interest to him.",o="把完美的雪人毛皮交给菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄。",oEN="Bring the Perfect Yeti Hide to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",p="嗯……$n？你有什么特别的东西要给我吗？",pEN="What's this, <name> - you've got something special for me?",c="这个发现使在是太不可思议了！我相信这是我见过的最完美的雪人毛皮！\n\n我肯定为此付钱的。一般来说，我不会为了一张毛皮付出那么多的钱，但是我可以用这张皮来做一些特别的东西。感谢你把这个给我拿来，$n！",cEN="This is an incredible find! I believe this is the finest yeti hide specimen I have ever seen!\n\nIndeed, this is certainly worthy of an appropriate bounty. I normally don't pay that much for a single hide, but I'm confident I can make something special from it. Thanks for thinking of me on this, <name>!"}
Q[7761]={d="愚蠢的家伙，\n\n对于你的能力我向来不抱什么希望，我不相信你可以阻止外来者进入主人的巢穴。如果你死亡了，那么这颗宝珠内建的安全机制可以防止外来者直接传送到黑翼巢穴中。\n\n只有那些手上烙有达基萨斯徽记的人才能使用这颗宝珠。值得庆幸的是，达基萨斯不像你那么没用，军需官。它会守卫着那枚烙印！\n\n- 大酋长雷德·黑手\n\n备注 ：别忘了毁掉这封信，笨蛋。",dEN="Imbecile,\n\nI hold very little faith in your ability to prevent outsiders from accessing the master's lair. In the very likely event of your death, this orb has its own failsafe built in to prevent outsiders from teleporting directly into Blackwing.\n\nOnly those with the Mark of Drakkisath branded upon their hand may make use of this orb. Thankfully, Drakkisath is not nearly as incompetent as you, Quartermaster. He guards the brand himself!\n\n-Warchief Rend Blackhand\n\nP.S. Destroy this letter, idiot.",o="真是个愚蠢的兽人。看来你需要找到那枚烙印并获得达基萨斯徽记才可以使用命令宝珠。\n\n你从信中获知，达基萨斯将军守卫着烙印。也许你应该就此进行更深入的调查。",oEN="That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command.\n\nThe letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate.",c="当灼热的烙印烫在你的躯体上时，你丝毫没有畏缩。你真是非常坚强！\n\n现在你拥有了达基萨斯的徽记。",cEN="You don't even flinch as the smoldering brand is pressed into your flesh. You are so tough!\n\nYou now hold the Mark of Drakkisath. Have fun storming the castle."}
Q[7782]={d="前往英雄谷，与阿弗拉西亚比元帅谈谈。",dEN="Go to Stormwind Keep and speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.",o="前往暴风城的英雄谷，与阿弗拉西亚比元帅谈谈。",oEN="Seek out Highlord Bolvar Fordragon inside the Stormwind Keep.",p="你那是什么？让我看看。",pEN="What do you have there? Let me see.",c="<艾法希比元帅向你鞠躬。>\n\n选择你的奖赏吧，让我们开始狂欢庆祝！",cEN="<Field Marshal Afrasiabi bows.>\n\nChoose your reward, let the celebration begin!"}
Q[7784]={d="到力量谷去找萨鲁法尔大王。",dEN="Seek out Overlord Runthak in the Valley of Strength.",o="和奥格瑞玛的萨鲁法尔大王谈谈。他在力量谷等你。",oEN="Speak with Overlord Runthak in Orgrimmar. He stands waiting for you in the Valley of Strength.",p="你那是什么？让我看看。",pEN="What do you have there? Let me see.",c="选择你的奖励吧，我会把这个野兽的头颅挂起来，让所有人都看见。",cEN="Choose your reward so that I may mount the head of the beast for all to see."}
Q[7785]={d="去查看一下他的复生之瓶，凡人。逐风者会在那儿重生！",dEN="Examine the vessel of his rebirth, mortal. It is from this that the Windseeker shall be reborn!",o="查看复生之瓶，然后回到德米提恩那里去。",oEN="Examine the Vessel of Rebirth and return it to Highlord Demitrian.",p="你会帮助他从那永恒的牢狱中解脱出来吗？",pEN="Will you release him from his eternal prison?",c="愿你在你的远征中$g受到庇护:受到庇护;。愿主人保佑你的努力。",cEN="May you be protected in your crusade. May the Master bless your efforts.\nRelated"}
Q[7786]={d="我已经把我所知道的一切都告诉你了，$n。必须由你去找到源质，并消灭火焰之王的肉身形态。\n\n如果你做到了，你就会获得桑德兰的祝福。",dEN="As you hold the vessel in your hand you can hear a faint whisper.\n\n\" Release me ... from this ... prison.\"\n\n\"Two that binds us ...\n\nsteel made of four ...\n\nessence ... firelord.\"\n\n\"Demitrian ... Silithus ...\"",o="要把逐风者桑德兰从他的牢狱中解放出来，你必须在希利苏斯向高阶领主德米提安呈上逐风者禁锢之链的左半部分和右半部分、10 块魔化源质锭以及火焰之王的精华。",oEN="To free Thunderaan the Windseeker from his prison, you must present the Vessel of Rebirth, 10 bars of Elementium, and the Essence of the Firelord to Highlord Demitrian in Silithus.",p="即使要毁灭整个世界都在所不惜！",pEN="Bring the world to its knees if you must!",c="即使在梦中，我也没有想到会有这么一天。\n\n看吧，凡人！\n\n见证比这个世界还要古老的力量！\n\n见证这个曾经面对过泰坦和神灵的王者！\n\n复苏吧，我的主人！摆脱你的枷锁和束缚！复苏吧！",cEN="Even in dreams I did not dare foresee this day.\n\nBehold, mortal.\n\nBEHOLD HE WHO IS OLDER THAN EXISTENCE!\n\nBEHOLD HE WHO HAS FACED TITAN AND GOD ALIKE!\n\nRISE MY MASTER! BREAK FROM YOUR BONDS!"}
Q[7787]={d="你已经击败了逐风者，那么，拿上风吻之刃，让那个叛徒德米提恩用你提供的材料唤醒雷霆之怒吧。",dEN="You have defeated the Wind Seeker. Take the dormant blade and force the lying wretch, Demitrian, to use the materials you provided for his betrayal to wake Thunderfury.",o="把风吻之刃交给德米提恩。",oEN="Present the Dormant Wind Kissed Blade to Highlord Demitrian.",p="<德米提恩看到你的时候蜷缩成了一团。>",pEN="<Demitrian cowers in your presence.>",c="请你不要伤害我！拿着这把剑！拿着它！给德米提恩一个改过的机会！",cEN="Please do not harm me! Take it! Take the blade! Leave Demitrian to reshape his pathetic life!"}
Q[7791]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7792]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7793]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="A benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7794]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7795]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7796]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于暴风城的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7798]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="A benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7799]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7800]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7801]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于达纳苏斯的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7802]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth. A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Ironforge for your generous actions. Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7803]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.\n\nA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7804]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks! By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal. Such generosity would not go unnoticed by Ironforge, I assure you!\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7805]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7806]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于铁炉堡的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7807]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth. A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by the Gnomeregan Exiles for your generous actions. Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7808]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.\n\nA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7809]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7811]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7812]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于暴风城的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7813]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7814]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="A benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7815]={d="不要让它们的大眼睛迷惑了你，伙计！那些海水钳嘴龟真是个麻烦。我钓鱼都不能安宁五分钟，那些巨型鱼罐头就会把我的鱼饵给偷吃掉。\n\n帮恶齿巨魔一个忙吧，干掉它们，伙计。\n\n把它们都干掉！",dEN="Don't let their big eyes fool you, mon! Those saltwater snapjaws be a menace. I can't fish for five minutes without getting a broken line from one of those oversized fish vacuums stealing my bait.\n\nDo me and the people of Revantusk Village a service and kill em, mon.\n\nKill the whole lot of em!",o="辛特兰恶齿村的钓鱼者卡图姆要你去杀掉10只海水钳嘴龟。完成任务之后回到他那里去复命。",oEN="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 10 Saltwater Snapjaw turtles. Return to him when you have completed this task.",p="狩猎进行得怎么样？",pEN="How goes the hunt?",c="哦，伙计！我对你感激不尽！希望你喜欢这柄钓鱼竿。",cEN="Oh, mon! I can't thank you enough! Hopefully this here fishing pole will be reward enough for the job."}
Q[7816]={d="嘿，我说，这里的海边有一只特殊的乌龟，她叫加莫里塔，是那帮卑鄙的海水钳嘴龟的头儿。\n\n伙计，她偷了我最好的鱼饵，就在我眼皮底下！而且自从那次以后，鱼儿就再也不咬我的钩了。\n\n找到加莫里塔，把我的鱼饵从她的胃里挖出来！",dEN="Yo! There be a turtle out there not like the others. She be the Gammerita, leader of the saltwater snapjaws - a downright dirty thievin' reptile.\n\nMon, she stole my best lure. Snapped it right off my line! Since then, the fish just aren't biting the same.\n\nFind Gammerita and get my lure out of her stomach.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的钓鱼者卡图姆要你去杀掉加莫里塔，并从它的尸体上找到卡图姆的超级鱼饵。\n\n卡图姆说加莫里塔和其它海龟都在海岸附近活动。",oEN="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill Gammerita and retrieve Katoom's Best Lure from her corpse.\n\nKatoom mentioned that Gammerita hangs out on the coast with the other turtles.",p="你拿到它了吗？",pEN="Did you get it yet?",c="伙计！这太棒了！我现在有了最好的鱼饵，而且海水钳嘴龟的数量也下降了不少，我的钓鱼生意一定会好很多的。",cEN="MON! This is fantastic! With my best lure and the snapjaw population down, the fish will pile up."}
Q[7817]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7818]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7819]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于幽暗城的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Greetings once again, <name>! Our need for runecloth is constant, and we can always use additional resources if you are willing to part with them. For an additional stack of twenty runecloth, I will make sure that you are recognized for your continuing efforts on behalf of the Undercity.\n\nWhenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7820]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth. A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Thunder Bluff for your generous actions. Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7821]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.\n\nA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7822]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks! By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal. Such generosity would not go unnoticed by Thunder Bluff, I assure you!\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7823]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7824]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7825]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于雷霆崖的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7826]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7827]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.\n\nA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7828]={d="许多勇敢的巨魔都在辛特兰的森林中失踪了，$r。银鬃狼对我们的猎人来说是最大的威胁。它们静静地隐藏在灌木丛中，当时机成熟之后就发起突然袭击。\n\n我们一定要阻止这种残忍的行为！\n\n你必须和银鬃狼一样思考。我们要以牙还牙，猎捕它们！把它们全都干掉！",dEN="Many brave trolls have been lost to the harsh wilds of the Hinterlands, <race>. The Silvermane wolves are one of the biggest threats to our hunters. They lay in wait, hiding amongst the bushes and landscape, then strike out when the opportunity presents itself.\n\nThis type of ferocity will not go unchecked!\n\nYou must think like the Silvermane. Stalk the stalkers! Slay them all!",o="辛特兰恶齿村的猎户马克霍尔要求你去杀掉5头银鬃捕猎者和5头银鬃嗥狼。完成任务之后就回到他那里复命。\n\n马克霍尔说过那些狼都躲在辛特兰的野外。",oEN="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 5 Silvermane Stalkers and 5 Silvermane Howlers. Return to him once the task is complete.\n\nMarkhor mentioned that the wolves hide in the wilds of the Hinterlands.",p="让它们尝尝恶齿巨魔的厉害！",pEN="Show them the might of Revantusk!",c="干得好，$r。恶齿部族感谢你的贡献。",cEN="A job well done, <race>. The Revantusk thank you for your contribution."}
Q[7829]={d="辛特兰地区最令人讨厌的生物之一就是那些野蛮的枭兽。很多勇敢的恶齿战士都倒在了那些野兽的利爪和尖嘴之下。\n\n干掉你看到的每个野蛮的枭兽，$r。当你把它们杀得血流成河的时候就回到我这里来，你的贡献一定会得到我们的赞赏。",dEN="Among the more ornery of the wildlife of the Hinterlands are the savage owlbeasts. Many a good Revantusk warrior has been lost to the ferocious claws and beak of the beasts.\n\nKill every savage owlbeast you see, <race>. Return to me when you can stand no more bloodshed. Your contribution will then be weighed, measured, and judged.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的猎户马克霍尔要求你去杀掉10头野蛮的枭兽。完成任务之后就回到他那里复命。\n\n马克霍尔说过那些野蛮的枭兽都躲在辛特兰的野外。",oEN="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 10 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete.\n\nMarkhor mentioned that the Savage Owlbeasts occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.",p="清除你心中的杂念，$r。成为大自然的一部分！",pEN="Clear your head of impure thoughts, <race>. Become one with the wilds!",c="你已经证明了自己对恶齿巨魔来说是个不可多得的盟友，$n。做得好。",cEN="You have proven a worthy ally to the Revantusk, <name>. Well done."}
Q[7830]={d="现在蛮锤部族训练的狮鹫正在肆意屠杀巨魔。这真是太可怕了，但是我知道不久之后正义就将得到伸张。\n\n现在我需要派你去清除那些成年的狮鹫首领，也就是那种翱翔的狮鹫。\n\n干掉它们中的一个，然后把它的羽毛交给我。",dEN="The filth that calls itself Wildhammer trains gryphon to slay troll. Horrible, I know, but worry not, justice will soon be meted out.\n\nFor now, I want you to focus on eradicating the elder gryphons of the region. They are known as Skylords.\n\nSlay one and return to me with its plume.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的猎户马克霍尔要求你杀掉一头翱翔的锋喙狮鹫，并将它的狮鹫长羽拿回去交给他。\n\n马克霍尔说过那些翱翔的锋喙狮鹫就躲在辛特兰的野外。",oEN="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill a Razorbeak Skylord and retrieve its Skylord Plume. Return to him once the task is complete.\n\nMarkhor mentioned that the Razorbeak Skylord are a rare breed that tend to occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.",p="翱翔的锋喙狮鹫是狮鹫中的稀有品种，它的职责是繁衍后代。",pEN="The Razorbeak Skylord is a much rarer breed of gryphon: One responsible for mating and creating murderous offspring.",c="<马克霍尔看了一下羽毛。>\n\n我真想知道这头野兽在被正法之前曾吞噬了我们多少优秀的猎人。",cEN="<Markhor examines the plume.>\n\nI wonder how many of our hunters this beast devoured before you brought it to justice."}
Q[7831]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks! By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal. Such generosity would not go unnoticed by Orgrimmar, I assure you!\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7832]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于暴风城的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7833]={p="如果你身上带着六十块毛料，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7834]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在部落中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.\n\nA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7835]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且$g准备好:准备好;捐赠它们，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks! By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal. Such generosity would not go unnoticed by the Darkspear Trolls, I assure you!\n\nIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[7836]={p="$n，你为我们的布料募捐活动做出了巨大贡献。在我们努力补充储备的同时，有一种布料依然严重短缺——符文布。我们极其需要它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，就把你能省下的符文布带给我。我们最初只接受一次六十块的捐赠，然后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[7837]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于暴风城的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n，如果没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族效力，我们一定会吃很多苦头。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[7838]={p="嘿，傻大个！给我12个竞技场大师饰物，你就可以成为古拉巴什竞技场的宗师！",pEN="Avast Lubber! Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master.",c="你让竞技场的地面洒满了鲜血，我很高兴能宣布你成为竞技场的大师！",cEN="Much blood have you spilt on the Arena floor and I be glad to name you Grandmaster of the Arena!"}
Q[7839]={d="邪枝巨魔入侵了我们的村子，偷走了我的工具！我有备用的工具，但是那套被偷走的工具是当年的一个救了我性命的侏儒送给我的。\n\n我要拿回那套工具，$n——它们对我来说意味着整个世界。\n\n马克霍尔报告说那些工具就在亚戈瓦萨和沙尔瓦萨神庙附近。\n\n那些神庙坐落在辛特兰的东北区域。\n\n找回我的工具！",dEN="Vilebranch scum invaded our village and stole my tools! I have backup tools but the set they stole was a gift given to me by a kind hearted gnome that saved my life when I was a young orc.\n\nI want those tools back, <name> - they mean the world to me.\n\nMarkhor reported that the tools were spotted near the Agol'watha and Shaol'watha temples.\n\nThose temples are in the northeastern region of the Hinterlands.\n\nRecover my tools!",o="辛特兰恶齿村的铁匠斯拉提要你去找到斯拉提的工具。完成任务之后就回到他那里去。\n\n你记得铁匠斯拉提说过，你可以在辛特兰东北部的某个邪枝巨魔神庙中找到它，要不然就是在隐匿石那边。",oEN="Smith Slagtree at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Slagtree's Lost Tools. Return to him once this task is complete.\n\nYou recall Smith Slagtree mentioning that the tools might be at one of the Vilebranch temples in the northeastern region of the Hinterlands. You should also check Skulk Rock.",p="小心邪枝巨魔，$n。他们是一群无情冷血的渣滓。",pEN="Watch out for the Vilebranch trolls of the region, <name>. They are ruthless, murderous filth.",c="我的工具！你找到它们了！哦，多么光辉的一天！感谢你，$n。",cEN="My tools! You found them! Oh glorious day! Thank you, <name>."}
Q[7840]={d="拉尔德在一个秘密的地方享用野餐，这时丑陋的邪枝巨魔一棍打翻了我。拉尔德跑回了恶齿村，但是把午餐留在了那里。拉尔德饿了。也许你可以去那个秘密的地方找回拉尔德的午餐？拉尔德害怕。出发吧！北边的岛就是那个秘密的地方。",dEN="Lard was at secret special spot having picnic when ugly mean Vilebranch hit Lard wit da big stick. Lard run back to Revantusk but forget Lard lunch. Lard hungry. Maybe you go back to secret special spot and get Lard lunch? Lard scared. Go nort! Island der to da nort is da secret special spot.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的拉尔德要求你去找到拉尔德的午餐。完成任务之后就回到他那里去。\n\n拉尔德说他把午餐留在了北面的岛上。当心邪枝巨魔。",oEN="Lard at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Lard's Lunch. Return to him when this task is complete.\n\nLard mentioned that he left it on the island to the north. Watch out for Vilebranch trolls.",p="<拉尔德揉着他硕大的肚子。>\n\n拉尔德好饿。",pEN="<Lard rubs his enormous belly.>\n\nLard so hungry.",c="<拉尔德从你手中夺过巨大的肉块，然后塞进嘴里。>\n\n这太好了！感谢你，小东西。\n\n为了表示感谢，拉尔德特地帮你制作了野餐食物篮。",cEN="<Lard takes the huge haunch of meat from you and stuffs it in his face.>\n\nDis hit da spot! Tanks little one.\n\nLard make you special picnic basket for help Lard."}
Q[7841]={d="蛮锤部族的矮人和我们的敌人联合起来，形成了新的联盟。这一次，他们和高等精灵站在了一起，伙计。\n\n<奥索吐了口唾沫。>\n\n我们必须给那些蛮锤矮人传达一条信息，一条用我们敌人的鲜血书写的警告。杀掉你所看到的所有高原高等精灵，把他们的尸体留在那里作为警告。\n\n永远不要与巨魔为敌！",dEN="The Wildhammer be striking up deals with our enemies, forgin' new alliances. This time, they be workin' with the high elves, mon.\n\n<Otho spits.>\n\nWe be needin' to send those Wildhammer dwarves a message - a message in the blood of our enemies. Slaughter every Highvale high elf that you come across, leave their bodies as a warnin'.\n\nNever mess with trolls!",o="辛特兰恶齿村的奥索·莫吉克要你去杀掉15个高原前锋、15个高原斥候、15个高原神射手和15个高原游侠。任务完成之后回到他那里去复命。\n\n你可以在辛特兰西北部的奎尔丹尼小屋找到那些高原精灵。",oEN="Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to slaughter 8 Highvale Scouts, 5 Highvale Outrunners, 5 Highvale Rangers and 2 Highvale Marksman. Return to him when this task is complete.\n\nYou can find the Highvale high elves at the Quel'Danil Lodge in the northwestern region of the Hinterlands.",p="你太$g干净了:干净了;，朋友。你得混进去，和敌人打成一团，弄得一身脏。",pEN="You be too clean, mon. You gotta mix it up - get down and dirty with the enemy.",c="看来恶齿村也有了新的盟友，伙计！你做得很不错。",cEN="It be lookin' like the Revantusk are forgin' new alliances as well, mon! You done good."}
Q[7842]={d="他们说蛮锤部族和狮鹫的关系就好像情侣一般。这让我感到挺恶心的，但是我们可以利用这一点，伙计。我们可以送给他们另外一条警告。\n\n把你在辛特兰看到的所有狮鹫都干掉，收集它们的羽毛。然后我们就可以发出最后一条警告了。",dEN="They say the Wildhammer and gryphon are as close to each other as troll and mate. Disgusting, but we be able to use this to our advantage, mon. We send them another message.\n\nKill all the gryphons you see in the Hinterlands and collect a long elegant feather! From this we make the final message.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的奥索·莫吉克要你从辛特兰的狮鹫身上收集1根细长的狮鹫羽毛。任务完成之后回到他那里去复命。\n\n在辛特兰各处都有狮鹫出没。",oEN="Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to bring him 1 Long Elegant Feather from the gryphons that inhabit the Hinterlands. Return to him once this task is complete.\n\nGryphons are known to inhabit every region of the Hinterlands.",p="最后一条警告一定会让他们胆战心惊，或者会让他们变得非常非常愤怒。",pEN="The last message gonna scare them off for sure. Either that or make them very, very angry.",c="哦，伙计，太棒了。很快，蛮锤矮人就会发现他们无法与巨魔抗衡！",cEN="Oh, mon, this gonna be good. One more step to go and Wildhammer see that they can't mess with troll!"}
Q[7843]={d="<奥索递给你一柄包在几片狮鹫羽毛中的、浸满血迹的长矛。>\n\n拿着这个，伙计。把它带到鹰巢山去，就去镇子中间的水井旁。把这根长矛插在那里！就插在地上！让矮人知道我们巨魔的厉害！当你完成这个壮举之后就回来吧。希望你能活着回来。",dEN="<Otho hands you a long, blood drenched spear, wrapped in several gryphon feathers.>\n\nYou take this, mon. You take this to Aerie Peak, dead center of town by the well. You plant it! Drive it right into the ground! Show those dwarves that troll mean business! Come back when you do this. Hopefully you come back alive.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的奥索·莫吉克要你去辛特兰西部的鹰巢山，把给蛮锤部族的警告插在城镇中心的水井旁边。任务完成之后回到他那里去复命。\n\n当心那些愤怒的蛮锤矮人以及野蛮的联盟成员。",oEN="Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to travel to Aerie Peak in the western region of the Hinterlands and place the Final Message to the Wildhammer by the well in the center of town. Return to him once this task is complete.\n\nBeware of angry Wildhammer dwarves and unruly members of the Alliance.",p="进行得怎么样，伙计？",pEN="What's the hold up, mon?",c="我真希望能亲临现场看看他们脸上的表情，伙计。他们是不是在急急忙忙地收拾行李，准备逃离镇子？\n\n你做得很好，$n。真的很好。奥索奖励你好东西。",cEN="I wish I coulda been there to see the look on their faces, mon. Are they packing up their bags? Leavin' town?\n\nYou done good, <name>. Real good. Otho reward you with the big mojo."}
Q[7844]={d="三个不同的巨魔部族居住在辛特兰地区，$n。我们之间的共同点是：我们都是巨魔，而且我们都住在辛特兰。\n\n邪枝巨魔——正如他们的名字一样，是一群堕落的巨魔；他们以其他的巨魔和人型生物为食。\n\n如果祖尔金在这里的话，他一定会手腕一抖灭掉这个部族——啊，祖尔金还没有回来，所以我们要自己动手了。\n\n现在，你的职责就是把这帮渣滓给干掉！",dEN="Three different tribes of trolls inhabit the Hinterlands, <name>. That is about as far as the similarities between the tribes extends: We are all trolls and we live in the Hinterlands.\n\nThe Vilebranch - aptly named - are a depraved lot; feeding on other trolls and humanoids.\n\nIf Zul'jin were here, he would have destroyed the whole lot of them with a flick of his wrist - alas, Zul'jin has not yet returned and we are left to our own devices.\n\nIt is up to you to destroy the filth of the region!",o="辛特兰恶齿村的秘法师雅尔金要你去杀掉6个邪枝割颅者和2个邪枝占卜者。任务完成之后回到他那里去复命。\n\n秘法师雅尔金说过，你可以在辛特兰东北部的沙尔瓦萨和亚戈瓦萨神庙附近找到那些巨魔。",oEN="Mystic Yayo'jin at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 6 Vilebranch Scalpers and 2 Vilebranch Soothsayers. Return to her when this task is complete.\n\nYayo'jin indicated that these trolls could be found near the Shaol'watha and Agol'watha temples in the north by northeastern region of the Hinterlands.",p="邪枝割颅者和邪枝预卜者居住在辛特兰的东北部。",pEN="The Vilebranch Soothsayers and Scalpers inhabit the north by northeast region of the Hinterlands.",c="做得好，$c。即使是祖尔金亲自动手，也不一定做得比你好！",cEN="Well done, <class>. Zul'jin himself could not have done a better job!"}
Q[7845]={d="我的爱人在邪枝巨魔发动的一次夜间突袭中被掳走。我们的探子回报说他还活着，并且被关在辛萨罗的顶部。据说邪恶祭司海克斯正准备把他当作祭品献给邪神哈卡。\n\n你必须救救他，$n！我们的村庄不能失去他。",dEN="My mate was taken by Vilebranch savages in a bold midnight raid on our village. Our spies have told me that he is still alive and being held prisoner atop Jintha'alor. The Vile Priestess Hexx is said to be preparing him for a sacrifice to the faceless blood God, Hakkar.\n\nYou must save him, <name>! Our village could not stand a loss this great.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的断齿族长要求你到辛萨罗去拯救她的爱人，断齿长者。\n\n你听说他被关在辛萨罗顶部，辛萨罗位于辛特兰的南部地区，那里是邪枝巨魔的主城。",oEN="Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to rescue her mate, Elder Torntusk, from Jintha'alor.\n\nYou have been told that he is being held prisoner atop Jintha'alor, the Vilebranch capital city located in the southern region of the Hinterlands.",c="你必须快点行动，$n。守卫一定注意到你的出现了。",cEN="You must act quickly, <name>. Surely the guards have been alerted to your presence."}
Q[7846]={d="我的镣铐的钥匙在守护者希坦亚手里，她就在洞穴附近。小心一点，$c，她身边有强悍的守卫。\n\n干掉她，然后用她的钥匙打开我的镣铐。只有这样我才能回家。",dEN="The key to my bindings is held by Hitah'ya the Keeper. She is in the nearby cave. Be careful, <class>, for she is guarded well.\n\nKill her and bring the key back to loosen my shackles. Only then will I be free to return home.",o="辛萨罗的断齿长者要求你杀掉守护者希坦亚，并用她身上的镣铐钥匙打开他的镣铐。当你找到钥匙之后就回到他那里去。",oEN="Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to kill Hitah'ya the Keeper to get the Shackle Key to his bindings. Return to Elder Torntusk when you have recovered the key.",p="你必须马上行动！",pEN="You must hurry!",c="我终于自由了！感谢你，$n。恶齿村感谢你的英勇行为！",cEN="Freedom at last! Thank you, <name>. Revantusk will know your deeds!"}
Q[7847]={d="回到我的爱人——恶齿村的断齿族长那里。告诉她我马上就回去！她一定会奖励你的。",dEN="Return to my mate, Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village. Tell her that I am coming home! She is sure to reward you.",o="辛萨罗的断齿长者要求你将他已经被营救的消息带给恶齿村的断齿族长。",oEN="Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village with news of his rescue.",c="你为恶齿村做出了巨大的贡献，$n！我们欠你一个人情。",cEN="You have done the Revantusk a great service, <name>! We owe you a great debt of gratitude."}
Q[7848]={d="裂隙在我们四周不断张开、撕裂、崩塌，$r。离我站立之处不到两步远的地方就有一道裂隙，它穿过黑石山的深处，直通火焰之王的巨口。\n\n感到惊讶吗？真遗憾……凡人的种族无法理解他们看不见、摸不着、感受不到的东西。\n\n但我向你保证，传送门就在那里，而且可以进入。\n\n我勾起了你的兴趣？调谐很简单。前往黑石深渊，找回一块核心碎片。把它交给我，我就会把你的精华与传送门调谐。",dEN="Rifts stir, tear, and collapse all around us, <race>. Not two paces from where I stand is a tear leading through the depths of Blackrock Mountain, into the maw of the Firelord.\n\nSurprised? Pity... The mortal races cannot comprehend that which they cannot see, touch, or feel.\n\nI assure you, the portal is there and access is possible.\n\nI've piqued your interest? Attunement is simple. Venture into Blackrock Depths and retrieve a core fragment. Return it to me and I shall attune your essence with the portal.",o="进入黑石深渊，在通往熔火之心的传送门附近找到一块熔火碎片，然后回到黑石山脉的洛索斯·天痕那里。",oEN="Venture to the Molten Core entry portal in Blackrock Depths and recover a Core Fragment. Return to Lothos Riftwaker in Blackrock Mountain when you have recovered the Core Fragment.",p="现在跳入裂缝之中将会给你带来无穷的灾难……",pEN="You must attune your soul with the Molten Core before access is granted.",c="步入我右方的裂隙，你就将进入熔火之心。",cEN="I am now able to transport you to the Molten Core. Ask and it shall be done."}
Q[7849]={d="和许多朋友一样，我挚爱的亲人也在野外永远逝去了。啊，我的双胞胎兄弟莫克霍尔——他在邪枝巨魔突袭的那天晚上死了。\n\n他被残忍地处死，他的尸体被软泥怪和邪枝巨魔的狼分食。\n\n现在拯救他的肉体已经太晚了，但我们要拯救他的灵魂。把他的遗体带回来，$n。",dEN="Like many in our village, I too have lost a loved one to the wilds. Alas, it was my twin brother Malkhor - taken in the same raid as Torntusk's mate by the Vilebranch.\n\nSadly, he was not fated to live and was given a swift, brutal execution; his remains fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch.\n\nIt is too late to save his life but not too late to save his soul. Recover his remains, <name>.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的猎户马克霍尔要你去找回他的双胞胎兄弟的尸体。找到它，然后把猎户莫克霍尔的头颅和猎户莫克霍尔的骨头交给猎户马克霍尔。\n\n马克霍尔说过，他兄弟的尸体被软泥怪和邪枝巨魔的狼群分食。他还提到在辛萨罗有个大坑，里面全都是软泥怪，那里还有个狼穴。这两个地方都在靠近辛萨罗神庙顶部的区域。",oEN="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.\n\nMarkhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple.",p="当我看到他的尸体时，我会把它交给雅尔金，并进行一个火葬仪式。",pEN="When I have his remains, I shall take them to Yayo'jin and have them prepared for a proper burial.",c="我最亲爱的兄弟，我非常想念你。\n\n感谢你的帮助，$n。你是真正的英雄。",cEN="My dearest brother, how I will miss you...\n\nThank you for your assistance, <name>. You are truly a hero in my eyes."}
Q[7850]={d="邪枝巨魔正在疯狂地进攻我们，这是因为他们受到了邪恶祭司海克斯的堕落魔法的影响。\n\n你可以在辛萨罗找到腐化之血。那只装着腐化之血的瓶子散发着邪神哈卡的堕落能量，这让邪枝巨魔们充满了力量，并让他们变得疯狂。\n\n把那些腐化之血交给我，这样我就可以去除其中的堕落能量，以此来削弱邪神的力量。",dEN="The Vilebranch fight with supernatural ferocity. This is due to the foul magical weavings of the Vile Priestess Hexx.\n\nThroughout Jintha'alor you will find dark vessels of tainted blood. The vessels radiate the foul magic of the faceless blood God, empowering the Vilebranch and also driving them to madness.\n\nSteal those vessels and return them to me so that I may remove the taint and ultimately loosen the grip of the blood God.",o="辛特兰恶齿村的断齿族长要你在辛萨罗找到5瓶腐化之血。任务完成之后就回到断齿族长那里。",oEN="Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover 5 Vessels of Tainted Blood from Jintha'alor. Return to Primal Torntusk when this task is complete.",p="在和邪枝巨魔作战的时候要多加小心，$n。他们的理智已经丧失了——他们会奋战到底。",pEN="Be cautious in battling the Vilebranch, <name>. Their minds are clouded - they fight to the death.",c="笼罩在邪枝巨魔身上的黑暗能量被消除了——至少现在是这样。我们必须在和邪恶力量战斗的过程中保持警惕，即使邪恶祭司已经被干掉了，很快就会有另一个巨魔替换她的位置。",cEN="The dark energy that compels the Vilebranch has been lifted - for now. We must remain ever vigilant in our battle against evil, as even if the Vile Priestess is destroyed, another soon takes her place."}
Q[7861]={d="根据断齿族长的命令，邪恶祭司海克斯和她的手下必须受到制裁！\n\n如果你能除掉邪恶祭司海克斯和她的精英卫兵，那么你就可以获得丰富的奖励。",dEN="By order of Primal Torntusk, Vile Priestess Hexx and her minions are to be brought to justice!\n\nA grand reward is offered for any that slay the Vile Priestess Hexx and all of her Aman'zasi elite guard.",o="你必须杀掉邪恶祭司海克斯和5名邪枝精英守卫。任务完成之后回到辛特兰的恶齿村，向断齿族长报告。\n\n你可以在辛特兰的邪枝巨魔城市辛萨罗的顶部找到他们。",oEN="You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 5 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.\n\nVile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands.",p="你从辛萨罗那边带来什么消息了吗？",pEN="Do you bring news from Jintha'alor?",c="这真是对邪枝巨魔的一次沉重打击。你应该得到嘉奖，$n。",cEN="A crippling blow to the Vilebranch, indeed. You shall be richly rewarded, <name>."}
Q[7862]={d="在卫兵队长马克霍尔牺牲之后，恶齿村卫兵队长的职位再次空缺。如果你有兴趣成为恶齿村的卫兵队长，就必须完成以下任务，然后向断齿族长提交申请表：\n\n消灭邪枝狂战士。\n\n消灭邪枝暗影猎手。\n\n消灭邪枝饮血者。\n\n消灭邪枝噬魂者。",dEN="With the loss of Guard Captain Malkhor, the position of Guard Captain of Revantusk is once again open. If you are interested in becoming Captain of the Guard for Revantusk, complete the following tasks and submit your application to Primal Torntusk:\n\nExterminate Vilebranch Berserkers.\n\nExterminate Vilebranch Shadow Hunters.\n\nExterminate Vilebranch Blood Drinkers.\n\nExterminate Vilebranch Soul Eaters.",o="你必须消灭5个邪枝狂战士、3个邪枝暗影猎手、3个邪枝饮血者和3个邪枝噬魂者。\n\n完成任务之后向辛特兰恶齿村的断齿族长复命。",oEN="You have been tasked with the decimation of 5 Vilebranch Berserkers, 3 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 3 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 2 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.\n\nShould you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",p="你是来这里申请职位的吗？",pEN="Are you here about the job opening?",c="你是这个职位的理想候选人，$n。请收下这个饰物作为我们对你辛勤工作的奖励吧。我会在明年审阅所有的申请。",cEN="You are indeed a worthy candidate for the new position, <name>. Accept this trinket as a token of our appreciation for your hard work. I will be reviewing all applications next year."}
Q[7863]={c="你向我们证明了你的实力，$n。作为奖励，请收下这个护理包！你可以在里面发现一些补给品和绷带，这些东西只有在战歌峡谷中才能使用。\n\n当你在战歌峡谷的战场上不断证明自己的价值之后，就能找到更多可以购买的东西。当你在我们这里的声望到达友善后，你就能购买这些补给品，而当你的声望达到尊敬后，就可以购买绷带。",cEN="You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, <name>. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Warsong Gulch.\n\nAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Gulch, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored."}
Q[7864]={c="你向我们证明了你的实力，$n。作为奖励，请收下这个护理包！你可以在里面发现一些补给品和绷带，这些东西只有在战歌峡谷中才能使用。\n\n当你在战歌峡谷的战场上不断证明自己的价值之后，就能找到更多可以购买的东西。当你在我们这里的声望到达友善后，你就能购买这些补给品，而当你的声望达到尊敬后，就可以购买绷带。",cEN="You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, <name>. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Warsong Gulch.\n\nAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Gulch, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored."}
