Q[8193]={p="今天下午 2 点到 4 点，我们有一场比赛，要决出谁才是最伟大的钓手！只要你是第一个给我带来 40 条美味鱼的人——从荆棘谷沿岸的美味鱼鱼群中钓上来——你就会被封为$g钓鱼大师:钓鱼大师;！\n\n如果你不是第一个给我带来 40 条鱼的人，我的学徒仍然会按每 5 条美味鱼付给你钱。\n\n对了，别耽搁，美味鱼很快就会变质！",pEN="Today between 2pm and 4pm we have a contest to determine who the greatest angler of them all is! Just be the FIRST PERSON to bring me 40 Tastyfish fished from the Tastyfish schools found along the coast of Stranglethorn before anyone else does and you will be declared the Master Angler!\n\nIf you are not the first person to bring me 40 fish, my apprentice here will still reward you with money for each 5 Tastyfish you bring her.\n\nOh, and don't delay, Tastyfish go bad quickly!",c="快点把它们交上来，如果你想被封为$g钓鱼大师:钓鱼大师;！我在这里站了好几个小时，什么吃的都没有！把那些家伙$g快点:快点;交出来！",cEN="Hurry up and turn those in if you want to be declared the Master Angler! I have been standing around here for HOURS with nothing to eat! Hand those suckers over!"}
Q[8194]={p="虽然比赛冠军已经出来了，但是我仍然会以合理的价格收购你钓到的鱼。怎么样？",pEN="Even though we already have a contest winner, I will still buy your Tastyfish from you at a reasonable price. Whadda ya say!",c="哈哈，皆大欢喜！",cEN="This deal works for me if it works for you!"}
Q[8195]={p="我在寻找被称为部族硬币的权力珍宝。在过去，祖尔格拉布的居民们将它们作为流通货币使用，每一枚硬币都浸入了微量而强效的魔精。\n\n这些硬币分为9种。如果你有多余的硬币，我可以按三枚硬币对应一枚荣誉勋章的价值跟你交换，然后你就可以用勋章跟林沃斯换取某些特殊的物品。",pEN="I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes. They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo.\n\nThere are nine distinct kinds to be found. Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three. You may use the Tokens with Rin'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.",c="棒极了——这套硬币将进一步扩充我们的宝库……并用于抵抗血神哈卡崛起的邪恶势力。$n，你已经获得了荣誉勋章以及整个部族的感谢！",cEN="Excellent - this set of coins will make a fine addition to our growing collection... one that we will use in the tribe's defense against the rise of the Blood God. You've earned this Honor Token, <name>, as well as the thanks of the tribe!"}
Q[8196]={p="南海的许多岛屿上都生长着拥有强效精华的芒果树。吃下芒果的人在身体上和精神上都会有焕然一新的感觉。如果你没有吃过，那真是太可惜了！\n\n这岛上有足够的芒果，你可以用赞达拉荣誉勋章来跟我们交换。如果你想知道如何获得勋章，就去跟温卡萨谈谈。如果你有勋章的话，我们就立即交易吧！",pEN="The extremely potent essence mango grows across many of the islands in the South Seas. A single mango will refresh those who eat it,both physically and mentally. If you've never had one,you do yourself a disservice!\n\nWe have enough of a supply here on the isle to offer you a handful in exchange for a Zandalar Honor Token. Speak with Vinchaxa if you need to learn how to get tokens; otherwise, let's get to the business at hand!",c="一笔公平的交易，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;;请享受南海的美味果实吧，带着部族的祝福。",cEN="A fair trade, my friend - please enjoy the luscious fruits of the South Seas, with the tribe's blessing."}
Q[8201]={d="这是真的。哈卡现在藏身在祖尔格拉布中，他正沐浴在我们的神的力量之下。被迷惑的高阶祭司们正将我们最神圣的能量传输给夺灵者，他的力量即将超过艾泽拉斯世界上所有的生物。我们必须阻止他！\n\n拿着这根神圣之索，将它穿过负责传输我们神的能量的高阶祭司们的头颅。\n\n当你完成了这一步之后，就回到我这里来。",dEN="It is true. Hakkar now dwells in Zul'Gurub, bathing in the power of our gods. Enthralled high priests now channel the energies of our most sacred divinities into the Soulflayer, who will soon have a strength beyond any being of Azeroth. He must be stopped!\n\nTake this sacred cord, and string through it the heads of the high priests responsible for channeling our gods' energy.\n\nWhen you have done this, return to me.",o="将神圣之索穿上5颗导魔师的头颅，然后把这一串头颅交给尤亚姆巴岛上的伊克萨尔。",oEN="String 5 Channeler's Heads, then return the Collection of Troll Heads to Exzhal on Yojamba Isle.",p="你拿到那些头颅了吗，$n？我们必须在哈卡获得更多力量前阻止他！",pEN="Do you have the collection of heads, <name>? We must stop Hakkar from gaining more power!",c="你拿到头颅了！你阻止了哈卡继续劫掠我们的神之力量，并削弱了哈卡！\n\n你做出了英雄般的壮举，$n。愿这些巨魔头颅的主人在他们的鲜血流尽之后得到宽恕。",cEN="You gained the heads! You have halted the plundering of our gods' power, and weakened Hakkar!\n\nYour actions are truly heroic, <name>. May the heads of these troll thralls plead to you for mercy long after their blood chills."}
Q[8221]={p="*吱吱**喀喀*\n\n我在帮钓鱼大师布鲁吉尔寻找世界上的各种稀有鱼类。如果你可以帮我找来一些基佛天使鱼，那么我就把这个很不错的奖励品送给你。\n\n*嘎嘎**吱吱*",pEN="*Whir* *Click*\n\nI seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. If you bring me a Keefer's Angelfish, I will provide you with this fine reward.\n\n*Zzzap* *Whir*",c="*吱吱*\n\n基佛天使鱼鉴定完毕。\n\n现在你可以获得奖励了。\n\n*喀喀**嘶嘶*",cEN="*Whir*\n\nIdentification of Keefer's Angelfish complete.\n\nYour Reward is now available.\n\n*click-click* *Bzzzz*"}
Q[8222]={p="在我为马戏团工作的这段时间中，我学到了很多关于顾客的事情。以下是我的一些经验:顾客喜欢闪光的东西！不管它是什么东西——你甚至可以把一根椅脚拆掉然后使它发光，这样，每个孩子都会从很远的地方赶来要一根。\n\n因此，$n，我需要发光的蝎血。你可以在希利苏斯、燃烧平原或者诅咒之地找到它。",pEN="In all my time working the Faire, I've learned a lot of things about customers. Here's one of those nuggets of wisdom: customers love stuff that glows! It doesn't matter what it is - you could take a broken chair leg and make it glow, and every child will come from miles around to get one!\n\nSo, <name>, I need glowing scorpid blood. You can find it from the scorpids of Sillithus, or the Blasted Lands, or the Burning Steppes.",c="干得好，$n！非常感谢！我会用这种血来把所有廉价的垃圾变成闪光的财宝！\n\n这是你的奖券，再次感谢你！",cEN="Great job, <name>! Thanks a lot! I'm going to make paint from this blood and turn all kinds of cheap junk into glowing treasure!\n\nHere are your tickets, and thanks again!"}
Q[8223]={p="发光的蝎血非常不错，$n！只需要一些闪烁的光芒就可以把一件原本一文不值的垃圾变成价格高昂的商品。所有人都喜欢这样的东西，你不这样认为吗……\n\n你帮我了大忙，$n，虽然不需要更多的发光的蝎血，但是如果你能继续提供给我的话，我将继续给你奖券。",pEN="That scorpid blood is working out great, <name>! It's amazing how a little sparkle and shine can create a prized bauble out of an otherwise piece of junk. The patrons love the stuff, and love is what it's all about, don't you think...\n\nYou've been a big help to me, <name>, and although I don't have a great need for more glowing scorpid blood, if you bring me more then I'll still trade you some tickets.",c="再次感谢你，$n。这是给你的奖券！",cEN="Thanks again, <name>. Here are your tickets!"}
Q[8224]={p="*吱吱**喀喀*\n\n我在帮钓鱼大师布鲁吉尔寻找世界上的各种稀有鱼类。如果你可以帮我找来一些迪森皇后鱼，那么我就把这个很不错的奖励品送给你。\n\n*嘎嘎**吱吱*",pEN="*Whir* *Click*\n\nI seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. If you bring me a Dezian Queenfish, I will provide you with this fine reward.\n\n*Zzzap* *Whir*",c="*吱吱*\n\n迪森皇后鱼鉴定完毕。\n\n现在你可以获得奖励了。\n\n*喀喀**嘶嘶*",cEN="*Whir*\n\nIdentification of Dezian Queenfish complete.\n\nYour Reward is now available.\n\n*click-click* *Bzzzz*"}
Q[8225]={p="*吱吱**喀喀*\n\n我在帮钓鱼大师布鲁吉尔寻找世界上的各种稀有鱼类。如果你可以帮我找来一些布隆奈尔蓝斑鱼，那么我就把这个很不错的奖励品送给你。\n\n*嘎嘎**吱吱*",pEN="*Whir* *Click*\n\nI seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. If you bring me a Brownell's Blue Striped Racer, I will provide you with this fine reward.\n\n*Zzzap* *Whir*",c="*吱吱*\n\n布隆奈尔蓝斑鱼鉴定完毕。\n\n现在你可以获得奖励了。\n\n*喀喀**嘶嘶*",cEN="*Whir* Identification of Brownell's Racer complete. Your Reward is now available. *click* *click* *Bzzzz*"}
Q[8227]={d="在破碎的钓饵和钓具当中，有一卷丝质卷尺。卷尺上系着一张标签，上面写着：\n\n\"纳特·帕格，尘泥沼泽。\"",dEN="Amongst the shattered fishing lures and tackle is a rolled, silken measuring tape. Attached to the tape is a label that reads:\n\n\"Nat Pagle, Dustwallow Marsh.\"",o="将纳特的卷尺交给尘泥沼泽的纳特·帕格。",oEN="Return Nat's Measuring Tape to Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你好，$g小朋友:小姑娘。你是来钓鱼的吗？",pEN="Hello there, <laddie/lassy>. You here to do some fishing?",c="啊，你居然找到我最喜欢的卷尺了！我爱这个卷尺！我用它测量过我钓到的最大的鱼……\n\n但是，我是在祖尔格拉布遗失卷尺的……这么说你去过祖尔格拉布了？你有没有看到传说中的加兹兰卡？\n\n好吧……你想抓到他吗？",cEN="Why, you found my favorite measuring tape! I love this tape! I measured some of the biggest fish I ever caught with it...\n\nBut, I lost this tape in Zul'Gurub... you've been to Zul'Gurub? Did you see the fabled Gahz'ranka?\n\nWell... do you want to catch him?"}
Q[8228]={c="本周日在藏宝海湾有一场钓鱼比赛！这是给你的比赛规则！",cEN="There be a Fishin Contest in Booty Bay this Sunday! Here are the rules for ya!"}
Q[8229]={c="本周日在藏宝海湾有一场钓鱼比赛！这是给你的比赛规则！",cEN="There is a Fishing Contest in Booty Bay this Sunday! Here are the rules for you!"}
Q[8231]={d="碎浪多头怪是一种生活在艾萨拉的海陆两栖生物。它们拥有强大的力量和顽强的生命力。\n\n碎浪多头怪身上的坚硬光滑的鳞片是猎人实力的证明。\n\n猎杀艾萨拉沿岸的碎浪多头怪，给我带回它们的鳞片作为证明吧。",dEN="The wavethrasher is an amphibious beast living only here in Azshara. They are powerful and resilient.\n\nThe tough, reflective scales from a wavethrasher mirror the strength of the hunter.\n\nTrack and hunt wavethrashers along the coast of Azshara, and bring me their scales.",o="将6块碎浪多头怪的鳞片交给艾萨拉的奥汀克。奥汀克居住在埃达拉斯废墟东北部的悬崖顶部。",oEN="Bring 6 Wavethrasher Scales to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",p="你成功了吗？",pEN="Have you met with success?",c="碎浪怪并不容易被击败，在它们的水域环境中更是如此。\n\n你已经证明自己$g准备好:准备好;猎杀更致命的猎物了。",cEN="The wavethrashers are not easily defeated, even more so in their watery environment.\n\nYou have proven yourself ready to hunt even deadlier prey."}
Q[8232]={d="现在我要派你去执行一场危险的狩猎：杀死绿龙莫法兹，并把它的牙齿带给我。莫法兹栖息在阿塔哈卡神庙的最深处，入口位于悲伤沼泽。\n\n如果你想击败它，就不能$g独自:独自;前往。这头龙树敌众多，去寻找那些也想消灭它的人吧。\n\n这头龙的牙齿代表着猎人在同伴陪伴下所能获得的力量。把它带给我，你就会学到很多。",dEN="Now I set you on a dangerous hunt to slay the green drake, Morphaz, and bring his tooth to me. Morphaz dwells deep in Temple of Atal'Hakkar, the entrance to which lies in Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nIf you wish to defeat him, you must not go alone. This drake is an enemy of many -- seek others who wish to destroy him.\n\nThe drake's tooth represents the power a hunter will find in the company of others. Bring it to me and you will have learned much.",o="将摩弗拉斯的牙齿交给艾萨拉的奥汀克。他住在埃达拉斯废墟东北部悬崖的顶端。",oEN="Bring the Tooth of Morphaz to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",p="在你双眼我看到了智慧，$n。你狩猎结束了吗？",pEN="I see wisdom in your eyes, <name>. Has your hunt ended?",c="你已经学会了古老的方式，$n，因此我要送你一份礼物，它来自我作为$n的那些日子。",cEN="You have learned the old ways, <name>, and for that I offer you a gift from my days as a <class>."}
Q[8233]={d="乔拉齐·拉文霍德公爵邀请你到他那儿去。这事儿得保密，我不能再透露更多消息了。\n\n拉文霍德庄园位于希尔斯布莱德丘陵，敦霍尔德城堡的西北方有一条道路通往那儿。",dEN="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt has requested your presence. The matter is secret, and I cannot say any more.\n\nRavenholdt Manor is located in the Hillsbrad Foothills -- look for a path in the mountains northwest of Durnhold Keep.",o="前往拉文霍德庄园，和乔拉齐·拉文霍德公爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lord Jorach Ravenholdt in Ravenholdt Manor.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;，欢迎，欢迎！请坐，$n，和我讨论一件简单的事情。\n\n你看，$n，我最近丢了一件对我很珍贵的东西，直说吧，我不惜一切代价也要把它拿回来。这里面也有你的好处，别担心！哦，是的，非常好的东西。\n\n那么，你说呢，$n……你$g准备好:准备好;来一场冒险了吗？",cEN="Welcome, welcome, welcome! Please, <name>, have a seat and discuss a simple matter with me.\n\nYou see, <name>, I've recently lost something dear to me, and to put it bluntly, I want it back at all costs. There's something in it for you, don't worry about that! Oh yes, something very nice.\n\nNow, what say you <name>... are you up for some adventure?"}
Q[8234]={d="事分轻重缓急。我丢了一个蓝色的小袋子，里面的东西很私密。\n\n但是，你不用追踪那些小偷啦，因为他们已经死了。我所知道的是，那些傻瓜费了九牛二虎之力也没能打开包裹，因此他们将包裹作为“神圣的器物”卖给了艾萨拉的木喉萨满祭司。这些家伙很聪明。\n\n我想让你前往艾萨拉，从萨满祭司那儿凭借智慧取回包裹……当然你也可以凭借武力。我认为第一种方法比较保险。一旦你成功了，就把包裹交给大法师克希雷姆。",dEN="First things first. What I've lost is a small blue bag, the contents of which are a private matter.\n\nDon't bother going after the thieves, because they are already dead. What we do know is the fools couldn't get the bag open. so they sold it to some timbermaw shaman in Azshara as a holy relic. Clever.\n\nI need you to travel to Azshara and retrieve it from the shaman through subtlety... or force. Better luck with the first method, I'd wager. Once acquired, take it to Archmage Xylem.",o="从艾萨拉的木喉萨满祭司那儿取回密封的蓝袋子，将它交给艾萨拉的大法师克希雷姆。",oEN="Retrieve the Sealed Azure Bag from the Timbermaw Shaman in Azshara. Then take the bag to Archmage Xylem, also found in Azshara.",p="我认识你吗？",pEN="Do I know you?",c="你有拉文霍德领主的包裹。你怎么不早说，$g小伙子:姑娘？",cEN="I see you have Lord Ravenholdt's bag. Why didn't you say so, boy?"}
Q[8235]={d="拉文霍德领主请我们俩帮个忙。他希望能解除这个袋子上的附魔。\n\n不幸的是，我最近有一些关于驱散魔法的书被人偷走了，然后被一群野蛮人毁掉了。那些书的残页对我来说仍然有价值。\n\n如果你能给我带足够多的编码碎片，我也许能把它们重新拼起来。你最好的办法是去杀艾萨拉的野兽，因为它们有捡拾几乎任何东西的习性。",dEN="Lord Ravenholdt has asked a favor of us both. He wishes to remove the enchantment from this bag.\n\nUnfortunately, some of my books on the subject of dispelling were taken recently, only to be destroyed by savages. The remains of my books are still valuable to me.\n\nIf you can bring me enough of the encoded fragments, I can piece them back together. Your best chance is to kill the beasts of Azshara, since they have a tendency to pick up just about anything.",o="将10块密文碎片交给艾萨拉的大法师克希雷姆。",oEN="Bring 10 Encoded Fragments to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.",p="你找到够多碎片让我继续我的工作了吗？",pEN="Have you found enough fragments to continue my work?",c="看起来你找到了某些保存较为完好的碎片。或许你也不是那么没用。",cEN="It looks like you picked up some of the better fragments. Perhaps you aren't worthless after all."}
Q[8236]={d="要解读这些碎片并移除魔化效果需要一点时间。当我完成这个工作后，我会亲自将袋子交给拉文霍德公爵。\n\n眼下的问题是钥匙，据说钥匙在绿龙摩弗拉斯手中，而摩弗拉斯则居住在阿塔哈卡神庙的深处，就是那个泡在悲伤沼泽里的神庙。\n\n叫上你的朋友，前往绿龙的巢穴吧。拉文霍德公爵在等你取回钥匙呢。",dEN="It will take some time to decipher the fragments and remove the enchantment. When I am complete, I'll deliver the bag to Lord Ravenholdt personally.\n\nThere is still the matter of the key, said to be held by a green drake known as Morphaz. The drake has made its home deep in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, the entrance to which lies in the Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nGather your friends and venture to his lair. Lord Ravenholdt will await your return with the key.",o="将碧蓝钥匙交给乔拉齐·拉文霍德公爵。",oEN="Return the Azure Key to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt.",p="我已经收到了大法师克希雷姆送来的包裹，你找到钥匙了吗？",pEN="The bag has already arrived from Archmage Xylem, have you found the key?",c="钥匙！我还以为我会永远失去它。请收下这件附魔衣服吧——这些是为那些拥有非凡技能和忠诚的盗贼准备的。$n可不是等闲之辈！\n\n<乔拉齐打开包裹，里面金光闪闪。他睁大了双眼，凝视着眼前的一切……>",cEN="The key! I thought it lost forever. Please, take an enchanted garment from my stores -- they are reserved for rogues of exceptional skill and loyalty. It should be known that <name> is not to be trifled with!\n\n<Jorach opens the bag and is bathed by a golden glow from within. His eyes widen and he stares...>"}
Q[8238]={p="我在寻找被称为部族硬币的权力珍宝。在过去，祖尔格拉布的居民们将它们作为流通货币使用，每一枚硬币都浸入了微量而强效的魔精。\n\n这些硬币分为9种。如果你有多余的硬币，我可以按3枚硬币对应一枚荣誉勋章的价格跟你交换，然后你就可以用勋章去跟林沃斯换取某些特殊的物品了。",pEN="I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes. They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo.\n\nThere are nine distinct kinds to be found. Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three. You may use the Tokens with Rin'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.",c="棒极了——这套硬币将进一步扩充我们的宝库……并用于抵抗血神哈卡崛起的邪恶势力。$n，你已经获得了荣誉勋章以及整个部族的感谢！",cEN="Excellent - this set of coins will make a fine addition to our growing collection... one that we will use in the tribe's defense against the rise of the Blood God. You've earned this Honor Token, <name>, as well as the thanks of the tribe!"}
Q[8239]={p="我在寻找被称为部族硬币的权力珍宝。在过去，祖尔格拉布的居民们将它们作为流通货币使用，每一枚硬币都浸入了微量而强效的魔精。\n\n这些硬币分为9种。如果你有多余的硬币，我可以按3枚硬币对应一枚荣誉勋章的价格跟你交换，然后你就可以用勋章去跟林沃斯换取某些特殊的物品了。",pEN="I seek the Paragons of Power known as the Coins of the Tribes. They are the currency used by the various denizens of Zul'Gurub, and each is imbued with subtle but powerful mojo.\n\nThere are nine distinct kinds to be found. Should you have any extra, I will trade you one of our Honor Tokens for a set of three. You may use the Tokens with Rin'wosho the Trader; he offers our heroes special items for them.",c="棒极了——这套硬币将进一步扩充我们的宝库……并用于抵抗血神哈卡崛起的邪恶势力。$n，你已经获得了荣誉勋章以及整个部族的感谢！",cEN="Excellent - this set of coins will make a fine addition to our growing collection... one that we will use in the tribe's defense against the rise of the Blood God. You've earned this Honor Token, <name>, as well as the thanks of the tribe!"}
Q[8240]={d="摧毁各种哈卡莱宝石对我们至关重要，重要到我们欢迎部族之外的人自己去销毁它们！\n\n把你在祖尔格拉布找到的任何一枚宝石带到赞扎祭坛并摧毁它。仅此一次，我会额外给你一枚我们部族的荣誉徽章。这远远超出你通常能得到的奖励。\n\n去亲眼见证赞扎的祝福吧，$g亲自:亲自;！",dEN="The destruction of the various Hakkari Bijous is of grave importance to us, so much so that we welcome outsiders of the tribe to do so for themselves!\n\nTake any one of the bijous that you find in Zul'Gurub to the Altar of Zanza and destroy it. For this one time alone, I will give you an additional Honor Token from our tribe; this is above and beyond what you would normally receive.\n\nWitness for yourself the blessings of Zanza!",o="将你在祖尔格拉布找到的哈卡莱宝石带往尤亚姆巴岛的赞扎祭坛进行销毁，然后跟祭坛旁边的温卡萨谈一谈。",oEN="Destroy any one of the Hakkari Bijous found in Zul'Gurub at the Altar of Zanza on Yojamba Isle. When done, speak with Vinchaxa nearby.",p="你在赞扎祭坛摧毁那枚宝石了吗？去做吧，之后你就会得到赞扎$g双倍:双倍;的祝福！",pEN="Have you destroyed the bijou at the Altar of Zanza? Do so, and then you will be doubly blessed by Zanza!",c="棒极了……每当我们从血神的爪牙那儿夺得一块宝石，离彻底消灭他们就更近了一步。你高尚的行为为赞达拉以及你本人赢得了无上的荣誉。\n\n记住，$n，你可以继续利用祭坛摧毁在祖尔格拉布找到的宝石。每摧毁一块，你将获得1枚荣誉勋章！要是你还没有获得荣誉勋章，记得在背包中多留些空位。",cEN="Excellent... each bijou we wrest away from the Blood God's minions is one step closer we all are to finally defeating them once and for all. You bring honor to the Zandalar - and yourself - through your noble actions.\n\nRemember <name>, you may always destroy the bijous you find in Zul'Gurub at the altar. For each one, you will gain recognition and an Honor Token! Just remember to have an open space in your inventory if you don't have one of the tokens already."}
Q[8241]={p="我没时间跟你扯东扯西的，$r。现在是补充我们日益减少的炽热助熔剂储备的时候了。\n\n我需要的物品有：\n\n*熏火龙的鳞片。\n\n*铁锭。\n\n*煤块。\n\n凡是你能给我的，我都要！\n\n如果你想要跟兄弟会搞好关系的话，就最好快点去找。",pEN="Let's not waste more of my precious time with jibber jabber, <race>. It's time to focus on replenishing our dwindling fiery flux supply.\n\nWhat I'm gonna need from you is the following:\n\n*Incendosaur scales.\n\n*Iron bars.\n\n*Coal.\n\nI'll take all that you can offer!\n\nAnd you'll do it fast if you wanna get in good with the Brotherhood.",c="炽热助熔剂的数量总是不够。继续收集吧……除非我叫你停止。",cEN="There's always room for more fiery flux, junior. Keep it comin'... unless I tell you to stop."}
Q[8242]={p="我没时间跟你扯东扯西的，$r。现在是补充我们日益减少的炽热助熔剂储备的时候了。\n\n我需要的物品有：\n\n*熏火龙的鳞片。\n\n*重皮。\n\n*煤块。\n\n凡是你能给我的，我都要！\n\n如果你想要跟兄弟会搞好关系的话，就最好快点去找。",pEN="Let's not waste more of my precious time with jibber jabber, <race>. It's time to focus on replenishing our dwindling fiery flux supply.\n\nWhat I'm gonna need from you is the following:\n\n*Incendosaur scales.\n\n*Heavy Leather.\n\n*Coal.\n\nI'll take all that you can offer!\n\nAnd you'll do it fast if you wanna get in good with the Brotherhood.",c="炽热助熔剂的数量总是不够。继续收集吧……除非我叫你停止。",cEN="There's always room for more fiery flux, junior. Keep it comin'... unless I tell you to stop."}
Q[8243]={p="随着你在部族中地位的提升，你可以接触到我们一些更强劲的饮品。看……这些酿品蕴含着强大的魔力，受赞扎祝福，适合来自各行各业的冒险者！\n\n我会允许你从我提供的三种饮品中挑选一种；作为交换，我需要一枚赞达拉荣誉徽章。注意，同一时间只能有一种饮品的效力在你的灵魂中流淌。\n\n当你$g准备好:准备好;交易时就告诉我！",pEN="With your increased status amongst the tribe comes access to some of our more potent potables. Behold... these brews are strong in the mojo - blessed by Zanza and fit for adventurers from all walks of life!\n\nI will allow you to choose one from the three I offer; in exchange, I require one Zandalar Honor Token. Note that only the effects of a single one may course through your spirit at any given time.\n\nLet me know when you're ready to barter!",c="一笔好交易，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;;请享受赞扎的祝福，并接受我诚挚的问候！",cEN="Let me know when you're ready to barter!"}
Q[8246]={p="$n，对于像你这样在赞达拉中$g备受尊崇:备受尊崇;的人来说，我有件非常特别的东西。直接来自我们南海的家园……赞达拉的徽记！这些徽记可以用来强化你拥有的任何肩部装备。无论你追求力量、魔力还是宁静，我都有你需要的！\n\n你可以在徽记中任选一枚，我只要 15 枚赞达拉荣誉徽章。如果你已经备好了徽章，那我们就可以成交了！",pEN="<name> - for someone as exalted among the Zandalar as you are,I have something very special for you. Direct from our home in the South Seas... the Signets of the Zandalar! These signets are used to enhance any shoulder item you may possess. Should you seek might,mojo,or serenity - I have what you need!\n\nI ask for fifteen Zandalar Honor Tokens in exchange for your choice of one signet. If you have the tokens ready,then I'm ready to make a deal!",c="一笔好交易，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;;请收下这枚徽记，以及部族的祝福。",cEN="A fair trade, my friend - please accept your signet with the blessing of the tribe!"}
Q[8249]={p="我们的盗贼需要练习开锁技能，因此我需要有足够挑战性的上锁的箱子——不过我们手头上的箱子难度太低，只适合那些初学者们练手。\n\n如果你能给我5个重垃圾箱，我就送你一把品质极佳的飞刀。\n\n你可以打开箱子，取出里面的东西，但是至少你得留下一点硬币……即使对训练中的盗贼来说，他们也需要动力的。",pEN="My rogues need to hone their lockpicking skills, and I need locks of adequate difficulty -- the stuff Zan makes us is unfit for all but the lowliest neophytes.\n\nTell ya what, if you bring me 5 Heavy Junkboxes, I'll provide you with some of the finest throwing knives known to roguekind.\n\nYou can unlock the boxes and rifle through them, but you'll have to leave at least a few coins in them... even a rogue in training needs motivation.",c="愿这些飞刀能飞到别人的心脏里。\n\n我是说真的。",cEN="May these knives find a place in someone's heart.\n\nLiterally."}
Q[8250]={d="最近经常有人打听大法师克希雷姆……他们都跟你差不多。\n\n如果你想要找他的话，就去艾萨拉吧。克希雷姆居住在高高的悬崖顶端，只有他那傲慢的仆人萨纳斯能利用传送术到达那儿。\n\n萨纳斯就在崖下扎营。你可以在埃达拉斯废墟入口处找到通往艾萨拉的大道，在交叉路口往北直走就是了。",dEN="Archmage Xylem has been asking around lately... for someone of your experience.\n\nIf you wish to seek him out, you can find him in Azshara. His tower is built high atop the cliffs, and the only way up is a teleport spell invoked by his arrogant servant, Sanath Lim-yo.\n\nSanath makes camp below his master's tower. To find him, travel to where Azshara's main road forks at the entrance to the Ruins of Eldarath. From that spot, head directly north until you reach the cliffs.",o="找到萨纳斯，让他将你传送到大法师克希雷姆那儿。",oEN="Seek out Sanath Lim-yo and gain passage to see Archmage Xylem.",c="<萨纳斯对你嗤之以鼻。>\n\n大法师克希雷姆正在等你到来。",cEN="<Sanath sneers at you.>\n\nArch<class> Xylem awaits your arrival."}
Q[8251]={d="艾萨拉的血精灵开发出了一种方法，能把他们获得的魔法物品研磨成粉末。他们制造的这种闪亮的尘埃，与驱散魔法通常获得的材料不同。\n\n当我派学徒去购买那种尘埃时，他们毫不犹豫地杀了他。为此，他们必须付出代价。\n\n谈话的时间结束了，$n。去艾萨拉的悬崖边找到那些血精灵，不必犹豫使用更\"有说服力\"的方法来获取他们那种紫色的粉末。",dEN="The blood elves in Azshara have developed a method for pulverizing the magical items they acquire. This glittering dust they produce differs from the components normally acquired by a disenchantment spell.\n\nWhen I sent my apprentice to trade for the dust, he was killed without hesitation. For that, they must pay.\n\nThe time for talk is over, <name>. Find the blood elves along the cliffs of Azshara and use more \"persuasive\" methods to acquire their glittering dust.",o="为大法师克希雷姆收集10份闪光尘埃。",oEN="Bring 10 Glittering Dust to Archmage Xylem.",p="你找到粉尘了吗？",pEN="Have you the dust?",c="干得好，$n！秘法飞弹的说服能力总能让我感到惊叹。",cEN="Well done, <name>! It never ceases to amaze me how persuasive a volley of arcane missiles can be."}
Q[8252]={d="看看你的四周吧。遗迹和海岸被恶鞭纳迦所占据了。最近，它们开始熟悉这块土地，并开始接触产于艾萨拉的稀有材料。\n\n我说的就是魔化珊瑚——不知道为什么，恶鞭纳迦也盯上了它。海湾中的珊瑚已经所剩无几了，但是它们对于我的研究工作来说是至关重要的。我需要你去从恶鞭海妖那里抢回一些魔化珊瑚，然后把它们带给我。",dEN="Take a look around you. The ruins and beaches are overrun with spitelash. Recently, the wretched creatures have learned to recognize the rare components indigenous to Azshara.\n\nSpecifically, I speak of enchanted coral -- they are drawn to it by reasons unknown to me. Now there is little coral left in the bay, and it is vital to my research. I need you to separate some enchanted coral from the spitelash sirens and bring it to me.",o="收集6块魔化珊瑚，然后把它们交给大法师克希雷姆。",oEN="Collect 6 Enchanted Coral and return them to Archmage Xylem.",p="恶鞭海妖是非常强大的法师。我想，他们不及你强大吧？",pEN="The spitelash sirens are surprisingly adept mages. Not as adept as you, I hope?",c="这是一件绝佳的珊瑚标本，$n。你的技艺无疑精准而致命。\n\n别以为你的努力无人注意。也许你$g配得上:配得上;接受一次真正考验你技艺的挑战……",cEN="This is a superb specimen of coral, <name>. Your skills are unquestionably precise and deadly.\n\nDo not think your efforts have gone unnoticed. Perhaps you are worthy of a true test of your skill..."}
Q[8253]={d="在沉没的阿塔哈卡神庙深处，有一条名叫摩弗拉斯的绿龙。\n\n数年前我受到他的袭击，在我组织起有效的防御之前，他就把我的学徒整个吞了下去。虽然死掉个把学徒对我来说不是很严重的事情，但他身上有一块巨大的、拥有极强能量的奥术碎片。\n\n你必须召集队友，共同深入神庙。去杀死摩弗拉斯，从这家伙的胃中取出我的奥术碎片来。",dEN="There is a green drake deep in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar by the name of Morphaz.\n\nYears ago, he overwhelmed me in a bold ambush and consumed my apprentice whole. While the loss of an apprentice is not unknown to me, this particular one carried an arcane shard of unsurpassed size and quality.\n\nYou must gather powerful allies and delve into the temple. Destroy Morphaz and recover the arcane shard from his ageless stomach.",o="从摩弗拉斯身上取回奥术碎片，然后返回大法师克希雷姆那儿。",oEN="Retrieve the Arcane Shard from Morphaz and return to Archmage Xylem.",p="你杀死了我的敌人吗？",pEN="Have you slain my old nemesis?",c="难以置信。数年来，裂片吸收了绿龙的能量，变得更加强大。\n\n现在我对你没什么要求啦。有了这块裂片，我将再次拥有铸造秘法的能力。我铸造的第一件物品是给你的，$n，你得选择……",cEN="Incredible. The shard has grown as it absorbed the drake's energy over the long years.\n\nThere is no more I can ask of you now. My full ability to forge the arcane has returned with this shard. My first creation is yours, <name>, and you have but to choose..."}
Q[8254]={d="神的道路是帮助那些需要帮助的人。如何去帮助他们，这并不重要；重要的是你为什么要去帮助他们。\n\n塞纳里奥议会需要你的帮助，去和艾萨拉的奥汀克谈一谈吧，他就住在埃达拉斯废墟东北部悬崖的顶部。",dEN="It is the way of the divine to help those in need. The how is insignificant -- only the why matters.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle has such a need. Speak with Ogtinc to lend aid to their plight. He resides atop the cliffs to the northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara.",o="找到艾萨拉的奥汀克。",oEN="Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara.",c="你的到来减轻了我肩头上的重担。我们有好多事情得做。",cEN="Your arrival has lifted a weight from my shoulders. We have much to do."}
Q[8255]={d="艾萨拉的苔蹄快步者是一种曾经居住在费伍德森林的生物，它们对疾病和毒药免疫，因此没有被那里的堕落力量所感染。在它们与生俱来的智慧的指引下，苔蹄快步者简单地选择了离开。\n\n虽然我感到非常遗憾，但是我希望你能帮助我去猎捕这些强大的野兽。收集四份健康的野鹿腺体，这是净化药膏的第一种成分——我们会利用净化药膏来治疗费伍德森林。",dEN="The mosshoof coursers of Azshara are magnificent animals who once lived in Felwood. They naturally resist disease and poison, and were unaffected by the corruption there. In their ancestral wisdom, they simply chose to leave that sickened place.\n\nIt saddens my heart, but I must ask you to hunt these mighty beasts for me. Gather four courser glands as the first ingredient for a restorative salve -- a salve we will use to heal Felwood.",o="收集4份健康的野鹿腺体，把它们交给艾萨拉的奥汀克。奥汀克住在埃达拉斯废墟东北部悬崖的顶部。",oEN="Acquire 4 Healthy Courser Glands and bring them to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",p="你回来了。你成功了没？",pEN="You have returned. Were you successful?",c="神圣的道路引导你来到我们身边，$n。你的信仰与制作药膏的任务并不冲突。\n\n你看，对塞纳里奥议会来说苔蹄快步者是神圣的生物，无论以何种理由猎杀它们都能杀杀它们的威风。",cEN="It is good the divine path has led you to us, <name>. Your beliefs do not interfere with the tasks involved in creating this salve.\n\nYou see, the courser is sacred to the Cenarion Circle, and killing them for any reason, no matter how necessary, weakens their spirit."}
Q[8256]={d="制作净化药膏所需的配方极其简单：一份有毒的药剂，两份治疗药剂。你已经获得了一份治疗药剂，那么你得收集一份毒药。\n\n埃达拉斯废墟附近徘徊的上层精灵充满了邪恶的力量，它们经常会生出一些令人作呕的绿色粘液。这种东西被称为亡灵腐液。\n\n这种东西的邪恶力量非常强大，因此我只需要你带给我一份亡灵腐液就行了。",dEN="For this restorative salve, you must use a simple formula: one part poison, two parts cure. You have acquired one cure, now you must gather the poison.\n\nPowerful undead, such as the lingering highborne who wander the Ruins of Eldarath, are sometimes so infused with evil that it coalesces into a sickly greenish goo. To the living, this substance is known as ichor of undeath.\n\nDue to the potency of this vile element, I require only a single ichor.",o="为艾萨拉的奥汀克带回一份亡灵腐液。奥汀克住在埃达拉斯废墟东北部悬崖的顶端。",oEN="Acquire an Ichor of Undeath for Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",p="我们必须迅速获得腐液。你找到它了吗？",pEN="We must obtain the ichor quickly. Have you found it?",c="获得这样一种邪恶的物质，我并没有感到愉快，但是这东西是必要的。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="I cannot say I'm pleased to receive such a wretched substance, but it is a necessary evil. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[8257]={d="药剂的最后一种成分就是我以前说的第二种治疗药剂。\n\n据说绿龙摩弗拉斯对任何形式的毒药和疾病都免疫——这是无数德鲁伊用生命换来的信息。毫无疑问，他的血液符合我们的要求。\n\n在你收集最后一种成分时，塞纳里奥议会的一名信使将带走你已经收集到的成分。召集你的伙伴，前往沉没的阿塔哈卡神庙中的绿龙巢穴吧。将他的血液交给费伍德森林中的格雷塔·苔蹄。",dEN="Now the last part, the second cure.\n\nThe green drake Morphaz is known to be immune to all forms of poison and disease -- many druids died to bring us this information. There is no doubt his blood is potent for our needs.\n\nA courier from the Cenarion Circle will take the parts you have already collected while you gather the last. Summon your allies and seek out the drake's lair in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar. Bring his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",o="前往沉没的阿塔哈卡神庙，杀死绿龙摩弗拉斯，将他的血液交给费伍德森林中的格雷塔·苔蹄。沉没的神庙的入口就在悲伤沼泽中。",oEN="Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="你把摩弗拉斯的血液带来了吗？",pEN="Do you have the blood of Morphaz?",c="你杀死了莫法兹，并把它的血带给了我们……我几乎不敢相信这个好消息！\n\n我们会立刻把材料调配好，开始治疗费伍德森林的树木与生物。要抹去这里发生过的一切需要一生的时间，但你给了我们这样做的办法。",cEN="You have slain Morphaz and carried his blood to us... I can hardly believe this good news!\n\nWe will combine the ingredients at once and begin healing the trees and creatures of Felwood. It will take a lifetime to undo what has happened here, but you have given us the means to do it."}
Q[8258]={d="死亡骑士达克雷尔主宰了通灵学院的尸骨储藏所。他威胁要扭曲整个灵魂国度来达到他自己的目的，我们必须阻止他！这就是水晶球可以帮助你的地方。\n\n在尸骨储藏所地下室的中心使用预言水晶球，以此来召唤达克雷尔的爪牙。击败这些爪牙，接下来死亡骑士就会出现了。$n，把他的头带给我！只有他的死亡才可以将灵魂国度的局势扭转过来！",dEN="Death Knight Darkreaver lords over the Great Ossuary in the Scholomance. He threatens to twist the spirit realm to do his own bidding, and he must be stopped! This is where the scryer you helped make comes into play.\n\nUse the divination scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement to call forth Darkreaver's spirit minions. Defeat the spirits and the death knight himself will appear. <name>, bring me his head! Only his demise will reverse the damage done to the spirit realm!",o="在斯坦索姆地下室的尸骨储藏所的中心使用预言水晶球。然后你必须与被召唤出来的幽灵作战。击败这些幽灵之后，死亡骑士达克雷尔才会出现，你的任务就是击败他。\n\n把死亡骑士达克雷尔的头颅交给奥格瑞玛智慧谷的萨格尼。",oEN="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.\n\nBring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.",p="时间非常紧迫，$n——你有没有成功解除死亡骑士达克雷尔的威胁？",pEN="Time is critical, <name> - have you succeeded in stopping Death Knight Darkreaver's threat?",c="这是一场值得细细品味的胜利，$n！黑暗掠夺者的消亡应当能修复那些维系灵魂领域的脆弱束缚。\n\n你远远超出了对你的要求，即便当时你并不知道会有什么奖励或补偿。你确实是$g一位:一位;有价值的$n，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;。\n\n我知道，为守护灵魂领域而行动本身就应该是足够的感谢，但还是请你收下这份小小的礼物，连同我的谢意。",cEN="This is a victory to savor, <name>! The demise of Darkreaver should restore the fragile fetters that anchor the spirit realm.\n\nYou have far exceeded what was asked of you, even when you had no notion of reward or compensation. You are truly a <class> of worth, my friend.\n\nI know that acting to preserve the spirit realm should be thanks enough, but please - accept this simple gift with my thanks."}
Q[8260]={c="你向我们证明了自己的实力，$n。作为奖励，请收下这个包裹！里面装满了仅可在阿拉希盆地使用的补给物品和绷带。\n\n随着你在阿拉希盆地取得的进展，你会发现你可以购买这些物品。当你在我们当中的声望达到尊敬时，你即可购买补给物品；达到崇敬时即可购买绷带。",cEN="You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, <name>. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.\n\nAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored."}
Q[8261]={c="你向我们证明了自己的实力，$n。作为奖励，请收下这个包裹！里面装满了仅可在阿拉希盆地使用的补给物品和绷带。\n\n随着你在阿拉希盆地取得的进展，你会发现你可以购买这些物品。当你在我们当中的声望达到尊敬时，你即可购买补给物品；达到崇敬时即可购买绷带。",cEN="You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, <name>. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin.\n\nAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored."}
