Q[8727]={c="天堂，在他们数不尽的星星中有着世间神秘事物的答案，$n。强大，有智慧，幸运的人，能够抬头仰望天空找到答案？",cEN="The heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, <name>. Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?"}
Q[8728]={d="好吧，这比预期的时间稍微长了一些。现在让我看看账本上都写了些什么。\n\n<纳瑞安默默地读着账本，有的时候还喃喃自语。>\n\n好消息是，我可以99%地肯定，我能为你制作一个奥金鱼漂。当然，还有一个坏消息。\n\n坏消息就是，我需要大量的奥金，源质矿石，还有一些珍贵的宝石。\n\n把它们带来，然后我就可以开工了。",dEN="Well that took a little longer than expected. Now let me see what this ledger says.\n\n<Narain silently reads the ledger, periodically mumbling under his breath.>\n\nThe good news is that I am 99% certain that I am capable of creating an arcanite buoy that will function to your specifications. This is, of course, wholly dependant on the bad news.\n\nThe bad news is that I'm going to need a lot of arcanite, elementium ore, and rare gemstones.\n\nBring me what I need and I will craft the buoy.",o="塔纳利斯的纳瑞安要你给他带去20块奥金锭、10块源质矿石、10颗艾泽拉斯钻石，以及10颗蓝宝石。",oEN="Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to bring him 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 Elementium Ore, 10 Azerothian Diamonds, and 10 Blue Sapphires.",p="奥金浮标不会自己制造，$n。还有，你不要指望可以在我这里赊账。",pEN="Arcanite buoys don't just make themselves, <name>. And NO, you cannot borrow some money.",c="就这么说定了。我当然希望你知道自己在做什么，$n。要钓如此大量的鱼是件很麻烦的事。",cEN="A deal is a deal. I sure hope you know what you are getting yourself into, <name>. This is an awful lot of trouble to go through to do some fishing."}
Q[8729]={d="我和你说过坏消息了吗?它的名字叫巨齿鲨:100尺长，死亡和毁灭的化身。我想我忘记和你说这个了。\n\n根据我的超级精准千里眼提供的讯息，你会在艾萨拉的海岸找到最合适使用这个浮标的地方，就在风暴海湾。\n\n你要寻找一个大漩涡，就是附近都是沉船的地方。\n\n另外，我希望你带上你的朋友。\n\n如果你成功的话，那么把权杖碎片带给安纳克罗斯。",dEN="Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit.\n\nAccording to my superior psycho-psionic clairvoyance, you'll find that the best spot to cast this buoy is off the coast of Azshara, in the Bay of Storms.\n\nLook for a swirling maelstrom, most likely cluttered with wreckage.\n\nBy the by, I hope you have friends.\n\nNow if you somehow miraculously succeed, take the scepter shard to Anachronos.",o="在艾萨拉风暴海湾一带的大漩涡使用奥金浮标。",oEN="Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara.",p="El tiempo se acaba, $gcampeón:campeona;.",pEN="Time is running out, champion.",c="干得好，$n。我将马上重新制作流沙权杖。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I will be able to reform the Scepter of the Shifting Sands soon."}
Q[8730]={d="勇士，是你吗？我受命保管这个碎片已经一千年了，在我最黑暗的时候，应该有人站出来替我把它拿回来……但是一切都是任重道远的。\n\n<瓦拉斯塔兹轻轻地咳嗽着。>\n\n耐……耐法里奥斯现在掌握着scepter shard。\n\n时间是最关键的。耐法里奥斯将要摧毁这个scepter。你必须赶快！",dEN="Champion, is it you? A thousand years it has been since I was entrusted the shard and it is at my darkest hour that one should rise to relieve me of it... But what would tragedy be without cruelty?\n\n<Vaelastrasz coughs weakly.>\n\nNe... Nefarius now holds the scepter shard.\n\nTime is of the essence. Nefarius plans to destroy the shard. You must hurry!",o="干掉奈法利安并拿到Red Scepter Shard。把Red Scepter Shard带给塔纳利斯时光之穴门口的阿纳克洛斯。你必须在一个半小时之内完成这个任务。",oEN="Slay Nefarian and recover the Red Scepter Shard. Return the Red Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. You have 5 hours to complete this task.",p="又有一位英雄因为挑战死亡之翼的子嗣而阵亡了。我们将因这样的损失而被永远诅咒……",pEN="Another of our heroes lost to the spawn of Deathwing. We will be cursed with this suffering forever...",c="El alma de Vaelastrasz está en paz, $gcampeón:campeona;. Todos los Aspectos observan tu progreso con gran interés. Debes saber que tiene aliados poderosos.\n\nSe me ordenó que te conceda algo que te ayude en esta lucha. Úsalo bien...",cEN="Vaelastrasz's soul is at ease, champion. The Aspects all watch your progress with great interest. Know that you have powerful allies.\n\nI was commanded to grant you something to aid you in this struggle. Use it well..."}
Q[8731]={d="你好，$n。在我为你布置更重要的任务之前，你需要首先完成一些常规的战地任务。\n\n你可以在佐拉虫穴外找到克鲁格·碎颅的部队。\n\n向他报到，然后拿着你完成任务的证明文件回到我这里来。那时我将会给你下达进一步的指令。\n\n哦，别忘了离铁炉堡军团远一些。由于联盟和部落的志愿兵之间摩擦不断，我们被迫把他们分开来。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Before I assign you to more involved tasks in the war, you'll need to do your share of field duty.\n\nYou will find Captain Skullsplit's Orgrimmar Legion outside Hive'Regal.\n\nReport to him and come back to me with proof of your field service. I shall have a more advanced assignment ready for you.\n\nOh, please do your best to stay away from the Ironforge Brigade. Tensions are high among our Alliance and Horde volunteers.",o="向雷戈虫巢外的奥格瑞玛军团报到，从克鲁格·碎颅那里拿到签过字的战地任务文件，把它交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者卡尔东。\n\n注意：给奥格瑞玛军团的士兵治疗或者施放增益法术会打开你的PvP标志。",oEN="Report to Krug Skullsplit at the Orgrimmar Legion post in front of Hive'Regal. Prepare your Unsigned Field Duty Papers, obtain Signed Field Duty Papers and bring them to Windcaller Kaldon in Cenarion Hold.\n\nNote: Healing or casting beneficial spells on a member of the Orgrimmar Legion will flag you for PvP.",p="你已完成你的战地任务了吗，$n？你可以在雷戈虫巢外面找到劈颅队长。",pEN="You've completed your field duty, <name>? Captain Skullsplit can be found outside of Hive'Regal.",c="看的出来克鲁格不常使用文书工作。他用异种的鲜血签署这份文件！\n\n很好，$n。我安排了一连串适合$c技能的任务给你。\n\n有你和像你一样的人继续努力，我们的敌人很快就会被击垮！",cEN="I can tell that Krug has little use for paperwork. He signed this in silithid blood!\n\nVery well, <name>. I've prepared a set of tasks that should make good use of your skills as a <class>.\n\nWith the continued efforts of you and people like you, our enemy will soon be crushed!"}
Q[8732]={p="Supongo que quiere esos papeles firmados, <chico:chica>",pEN="I take it you want those papers signed, <boy/girl>?",c="啊，我想刚才经历了那场小遭遇战也可以被称为完成了一项“战地任务”吧。把这些带回塞纳里奥要塞去，我相信他们一定会有重要任务给你的。\n\n快出发！",cEN="Yes, I suppose that little skirmish will pass as field duty nowadays. Take these back to Cenarion Hold, I'm sure they'll have a cushy job ready for you.\n\nOff you go!"}
Q[8733]={d="Este es un viaje de redención, $ghéroe:heroína;. Si la muerte viniera a buscarme hoy, habría muerto por una causa justa. Debes recuperar el fragmento de cetro verde. Debes librar a Eranikus de la mácula con la que los dioses antiguos le han mancillado.\n\nViaja a Darnassus. Fuera de la ciudad encontrarás a uno de mis agentes. Este agente pondrá el mecanismo en marcha e informará a Tyrande de nuestros planes sin alertar a Corzocelada.\n\n<Malfurion suspira.>\n\nUna caída en desgracia que lleva fraguándose mil años...",dEN="This is a journey of redemption, hero. Would it be that I was slain today, I would have died for a just and righteous cause. You must recover the green scepter shard. You must cleanse Eranikus of the taint placed upon him by the Old Gods.\n\nTravel to Darnassus. Just outside the city walls you will find one of my agents. This agent will set things in motion for us and inform Tyrande of our plans without alerting Staghelm.\n\n<Malfurion sighs.>\n\nA fall from grace a thousand years in the making...",o="Viaja al continente de Teldrassil y busca al agente de Malfurion. Lo encontrarás a lo largo de los muros de Darnassus.|n",oEN="Travel to the continent of Teldrassil and find Malfurion's agent somewhere outside the walls of Darnassus.",c="幽光沉默着，除了有时会发出一些低沉的哼声。真古怪，它可以借由思想与你沟通。",cEN="The wisp is silent except for a low humming sound. Oddly enough, it is able to communicate with you through thoughts."}
Q[8734]={d="我们会通知泰兰德的，凡人。玛法里奥·怒风已经让我做好应付这次事件的准备了。\n\n现在你必须去月光林地，和雷姆洛斯谈一谈。他会进一步指引你召唤伊兰尼库斯。\n\n祝你好运。",dEN="Tyrande will be notifed, mortal. Shan'do Stormrage has prepared me for this contingency.\n\nNow you must venture to the Moonglade and speak with Remulos. He will have further instruction as to the summoning of Eranikus.\n\nWe all wish you great luck.",o="到月光林地去，和守护者雷姆洛斯谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to the Moonglade and speak to Keeper Remulos.",c="如果伊兰尼库斯拒绝的话，那么我们永远无法将他唤醒。然而，他的企图却让他进入我们的世界。他想要摧毁玛法里奥的肉身。如果成功的话，那么意味着翡翠梦境一个最强大的盟友的终结。如果玛法里奥倒下了，那么梦魇将会吞噬整个世界……",cEN="It would be impossible to pull Eranikus from the Dream should he refuse. His intentions, however, require him to enter our world. He seeks to destroy the living manifestation of Malfurion. To do this successfully would mean an end to one of the most powerful allies of the Dream. The Nightmare would wholly consume all that would remain should Malfurion fall..."}
Q[8735]={d="你必须到艾泽拉斯世界的四个翡翠梦境入口去。在每个入口处，你都可以收集到腐蚀梦魇的碎片。住在这些地区的龙类生物身上会携带着这样的碎片。当你收集到全部四块碎片后就回到我这里来。",dEN="You must travel to the four dream portals of Azeroth. From each you must draw a fragment of the Nightmare's corruption. The dragonkin that inhabit these areas will hold such fragments. Return to me when you have gathered these fragments.",o="Ve a los 4 Portales del Sueño Esmeralda de Azeroth y recoge un fragmento de Corrupción de Pesadilla en cada uno. Habla otra vez con el guardián Remulos en Claro de la Luna cuando hayas completado la tarea.|n",oEN="Travel to the four Emerald Dream portals in Azeroth and collect a Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption from each. Return to Keeper Remulos in the Moonglade when you have completed this task.",p="<雷姆洛斯陷入沉思。>",pEN="<Remulos is lost deep in thought.>",c="¿Estas $gpreparado:preparada;? ¿Está el mundo preparado para lo que vamos a invocar? No lo sé... estoy obligado por el deber hacia Malfurion. Deber y honor...",cEN="Are you prepared? Is the world prepared for what we are about to invoke? I do not know... I am bound by duty to Malfurion. Duty and honor..."}
Q[8736]={d="Debemos restringir el uso de la fuerza contra Eranikus. Queremos redimirlo, no aniquilarlo.\n\nTyrande está de camino para ayudarnos. Hemos de resistir las embestidas del dragón y salvar Amparo de la Noche.\n\n¡No bajes la guardia! Tú y tus aliados sois nuestra única esperanza.|n",dEN="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him.\n\nTyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction.\n\nBe on guard! You and your allies are our only hope.",o="Defiende Amparo de la Noche de Eranikus. No dejes morir al guardián Remulos. No mates a Eranikus. Defiéndete. Espera a Tyrande.|n",oEN="Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",c="他已经获得了救赎，$n。他现在回到梦境中去纠正他所犯下的错误了。伊兰尼库斯对于玛法里奥和我的父亲来说是很强大的盟友。\n\n这些装备是给你的，$n，这是伊瑟拉亲手交给我的。你将在和异种虫群的战斗中用到它们。",cEN="He is redeemed, <name>. He now returns to the Dream to right what he alone has done wrong. Eranikus will be a powerful ally to Malfurion and my father.\n\nThese armaments are for you, <name>; given to me by Ysera herself. You would do well to make use of them in your battles against the Qiraji."}
Q[8737]={d="暮光之锤和深渊议会之间的联系看来比我们想象的还要意义重大。\n\n根据可靠情报，那个被称作灰烬公爵的元素领主将要策动暮光之锤对塞纳里奥要塞实施一次大规模的攻击。设法把他引诱出来，然后击杀他。",dEN="The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus. With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.\n\nFind a way to summon and destroy an Azure Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.",o="设法召唤并击杀灰烬公爵，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角复命。",oEN="Summon and slay an Azure Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",p="你的任务完成了吗，$n？",pEN="Is your task done yet, <name>?",c="干得好，$n。这里是你的下一个任务。",cEN="Good job, <name>. Here's your next assignment."}
Q[8738]={d="我们派出了最好的斥候深入异种虫类的巢穴收集情报。兰迪奥这几天来一直在监视佐拉虫巢，去找到他，拿回他的书面报告。我们需要这些情报来制定战术，要尽快，$n。",dEN="We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence. Scout Landion has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Regal for several days now. Find him and obtain a written report. We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, <name>.",o="在雷戈虫巢内找到塞纳里奥斥候兰迪奥，然后把雷戈虫巢侦查报告交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。你还必须随身带着战术任务简报 VII才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Contact Cenarion Scout Landion inside Hive'Regal and return the Hive'Regal Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.",p="到雷戈虫巢去找斥候兰迪奥，快一点，$n！时间紧迫！",pEN="You'll find Scout Landion inside Hive'regal. Hurry, <name>! Time is of the essence.",c="你的努力获得很大的赞赏，$n。我要立刻显示这些侦察报告，去接你的下一个任务吧。",cEN="Your efforts are greatly appreciated, <name>. I'll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment."}
Q[8739]={d="Hemos enviado a nuestros mejores exploradores a las colmenas de silítidos para reunir información. La exploradora Jalia lleva varios días observando los movimientos de los silítidos en Colmen'Ashi. Encuéntrala y consigue un informe por escrito. Necesitamos esa información lo antes posible para saber cómo actuar, $n.",dEN="We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence. Scout Jalia has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Ashi for several days now. Find her and obtain a written report. We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, <name>.",o="设法召唤并击杀灰烬公爵，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角复命。",oEN="Contact Cenarion Scout Jalia inside Hive'Ashi and return the Hive'Ashi Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",p="到亚什虫巢去找到斥候佳莉亚，快一点，$n！时间紧迫！",pEN="You'll find Scout Jalia inside Hive'Ashi. Hurry, <name>! Time is of the essence.",c="你的努力获得很大的赞赏，$n。我要立刻显示这些侦察报告，去接你的下一个任务吧。",cEN="Your efforts are greatly appreciated, <name>. I'll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment."}
Q[8740]={d="许多幕光之锤的骑兵教徒经常在我们塞纳里奥要塞守卫范围之外的区域游荡，并伺机袭击我们巡逻和商旅小队。\n\n找到并击败twilight marauders和他们的领袖，一个叫做Morna的恐怖战士。当任务完成之后向唤风者梅恩·长角报告。",dEN="Bands of mounted Twilight's Hammer cultists have been spotted riding outside the reach of our forces in Cenarion Hold, picking off our smaller patrols and caravans.\n\nFind and defeat the twilight marauders along with their leader, a terrible warrior by the name of Morna. Report to Windcaller Proudhorn after completing the task.",o="干掉Twilight Marauder Morna和5个Twilight Marauders。当任务完成之后向唤风者梅恩·长角报告。",oEN="Slay Twilight Marauder Morna and 2 Twilight Marauders. Report to Windcaller Proudhorn when your task is finished. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",p="你的任务完成了吗，$n？",pEN="Is your task done yet, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。暮光掠夺者曾经让我们的巡逻队吃尽了苦头，造成伤亡无数。这是你的下一个任务。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The twilight marauders were inflicting an unacceptable number of casualties on our patrols. Here's your next assignment."}
Q[8741]={d="El guardián te espera, $n. Lleva el fragmento de cetro verde a Anacronos, que está en las Cavernas del Tiempo.|n",dEN="The keeper awaits your return, <name>. Take the green scepter shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",o="Lleva el fragmento de cetro verde a Anacronos a las Cavernas del Tiempo, en Tanaris.|n",oEN="Take the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.",c="Tus obras serán conocidas por todos, $gcampeón:campeona;. Cantarán tus alabanzas desde Orgrimmar hasta los confines de los Mares del Sur. Todos sabrán $gdel campeón:de la campeona; del Vuelo de Bronce, $n.",cEN="Your deeds will be known to all, champion. They will sing your praises from Orgrimmar to the far reaches of the South Seas. All will know of the champion of the Bronze Flight, <name>."}
Q[8742]={c="Han pasado mil años y, tal como estaba predestinado, $guno:una; está frente a mí. $gUno:Una; que guiará a su pueblo a una nueva era.\n\nEl Dios Antiguo tiembla, $n. Oh, sí, teme tu fe. Rompe la profecía de C'Thun.\n\nSabe que vienes, $gcampeón:campeona;, y que contigo viene el poder de Kalimdor. Solo tienes que avisarme cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada; y te concederé el Cetro de las arenas movedizas.",cEN="A thousand years has passed and just as it was fated, one stands before me. One who shall lead their people to a new age.\n\nThe Old God trembles, <name>. Oh yes, it fears your faith. Shatter the prophecy of C'Thun.\n\nIt knows you come, champion - and with you comes the might of Kalimdor. You have only to let me know when you are prepared and I shall grant you the Scepter of the Shifting Sands."}
Q[8743]={p="甲虫之锣嗡嗡作响，给你一种不安的感觉。坚强起来，$n。一旦甲虫之锣被敲响，安其拉的大门就将被打开。\n\n从这扇大门之后涌出来的将会是混乱和毁灭。保护你的人民！",pEN="The Scarab Gong looms ominously before you. Steel yourself, <name>; for once the Scarab Gong is rung, the gates of Ahn'Qiraj will be opened.\n\nFrom the slackened maw of the beast can only come chaos and destruction. Defend your people!",c="在甲虫之锣的下方悬挂着一颗特别的水晶，也许是龙类所留下的？",cEN="From the ground near the gong springs a special crystal. Perhaps favor from the Brood."}
Q[8744]={c="这个礼物上的标签写着：\n\n给$n，\n\n祝你的冬幕节充满快乐及喜悦！",cEN="The tag on this present reads:\n\nTo <name>,\n\nMay your feast of Great-Winter be merry and bright!"}
Q[8746]={d="¡Qué desastre! ¡Han secuestrado a Metzen el Reno!\n\nEs uno de los ocho renos de Padre Invierno y propiedad de Pastos de Bosquehumeante. Creemos que se lo ha llevado el ruin de Grinch el Abominable, que se esconde en las Laderas de Trabalomas. ¡Y precisamente ahora, con la fiesta, andamos ajustados de dinero! Por favor, ¡tráenos a Metzen, derrota a sus captores y tráenoslo de vuelta!",dEN="DISASTER has struck! Metzen the Reindeer has been kidnapped!\n\nMetzen is one of Great-father Winter's eight reindeer - and property of Smokywood Pastures. We've received not one but TWO ransom letters from groups claiming to have Metzen. With the holiday season well under way, we're strapped to the coin box here! Please - find Metzen and return him to us!\n\nCheck out the ransom letters for clues, and sprinkle this reindeer dust on him - it will free him from any of his bonds!\n\nPlease, hurry!",o="Rescata a Metzen el reno de sus captores cerca de la Caverna Estrecha, en las Laderas de Trabalomas.",oEN="Find Metzen the Reindeer. Use the notes provided to you for clues as to where he is being held.\n\nWhen you find Metzen, have the Pouch of Reindeer Dust in your possession so you can sprinkle some of the dust on him; this should free Metzen from his bonds of captivity.\n\nReturn the Pouch of Reindeer Dust to Kaymard Copperpinch in Orgrimmar once Metzen is freed.",p="¿Conseguiste localizar a Metzen con las notas que te di? No quiero ni pensar en cómo lo estarán tratando... ¡Pero no podemos pagar el rescate!",pEN="<name>! Did you find him? Were the notes in the satchel I gave you enough information to locate Metzen? I hate to think of what those cruel thugs might do to him... but there's no way we can afford to pay such an exorbitant ransom!",c="你办到了！万岁！\n\n梅特森已经飞回去冬天爷爷的兽栏里了——是的，梅特森是会飞的——就在不久之前！这个尘土有点像是个符咒；我知道它可以的。你拯救了冬幕节还有烟熏牧场免于疾病的侵袭。谢谢你，$n。\n\n听着……因为你对这里的贡献，我希望你可以拿着这个。这是一个非常特别的东西如果你有坐骑的话，我想你可以好好的试试它。冬幕节快乐！",cEN="You did it! Huzzah!\n\nMetzen flew back into Great-father Winter's stables - yes Metzen can really fly - just a little while ago! The dust worked like a charm; I knew it would. You've saved the Feast of Winter Veil as well as Smokywood Pastures from disaster. Thank you, <name>.\n\nListen... because of what you've done here, I want you to have this. It's something VERY special; if you have a mount, I think you'll get a kick out of it. Happy Winter Veil!"}
Q[8747]={p="Impresionante, $gpequeño:pequeña;. Has pasado por muchos problemas para ganarte el favor del Vuelo de Bronce. Se nota tu dedicación.\n\nEl Sello del Vuelo de Bronce, ofrecerá una protección superior contra las fuerzas del mal.\n\nTen cuidado, una vez que hayas elegido tu camino, no tendrás nada en caso de que cambies de opinión.",pEN="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the defender will offer superior protection against the forces of evil.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.",c="Impresionante, $gpequeño:pequeña;. Has pasado por muchos problemas para ganarte el favor del Vuelo de Bronce. Se nota tu dedicación.\n\nEl Sello del Vuelo de Bronce, ofrecerá una protección superior contra las fuerzas del mal.\n\nTen cuidado, una vez que hayas elegido tu camino, no tendrás nada en caso de que cambies de opinión.",cEN="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the defender will offer superior protection against the forces of evil.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind."}
Q[8748]={p="你一直保护卡利姆多生灵的行为已经被我们认可。把徽记之戒拿来，让我增强它的能量。",pEN="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",c="Tu ascenso en el rango de la Prole es de lo más impresionante, $n. ¡Que nunca te desvíes del camino del protector!",cEN="Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, <name>. May you never stray from the path of the protector!"}
Q[8749]={p="向你致敬，$n。粉碎卡利姆多的敌人！告诉他们污染这片不灭星光照耀下的大陆要付出什么代价！\n\n你又赢得了一个强效施法。请把徽记之戒给我，我来灌注能量。",pEN="You honor my kind, <name>. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.\n\nYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",c="Tu ascenso en el rango de la Prole es de lo más impresionante, $n. ¡Que nunca te desvíes del camino del protector!",cEN="Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, <name>. May you never stray from the path of the protector!"}
Q[8750]={p="Una dedicación de esta magnitud es una rareza. Has demostrado que tu voluntad es inquebrantable, $n. Serás $grecompensado:recompensada; por tu inquebrantable vigilancia de nuestro mundo.\n\nDame tu anillo de sello para que pueda fortalecer su encantamiento.",pEN="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, <name>. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",c="Tu ascenso en el rango de la Prole es de lo más impresionante, $n. ¡Que nunca te desvíes del camino del protector!",cEN="Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, <name>. May you never stray from the path of the protector!"}
Q[8751]={p="我从没看过这样不屈不挠的凡人！青铜龙军团将给你最后的附魔强化。这是永恒之王本人的希望！\n\n请将你的徽记之戒交给我，这样我才能开始施法。",pEN="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",c="¡Arriba, $gprotector:protectora; de Kalimdor! ¡Levántate y obtén tu reconocimiento!",cEN="Rise, Protector of Kalimdor! Rise and be recognized!"}
Q[8752]={p="Impresionante, $gpequeño:pequeña;. Has pasado por muchos problemas para ganarte el favor del Vuelo de Bronce. Se nota tu dedicación.\n\nEl Sello del Vuelo de Bronce, ofrecerá una protección superior contra las fuerzas del mal.\n\nTen cuidado, una vez que hayas elegido tu camino, no tendrás nada en caso de que cambies de opinión.",pEN="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the conqueror will greatly enhance your physical attacks.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.",c="Impresionante, $gpequeño:pequeña;. Has pasado por muchos problemas para ganarte el favor del Vuelo de Bronce. Se nota tu dedicación.\n\nEl Sello del Vuelo de Bronce, ofrecerá una protección superior contra las fuerzas del mal.\n\nTen cuidado, una vez que hayas elegido tu camino, no tendrás nada en caso de que cambies de opinión.",cEN="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the conqueror will greatly enhance your physical attacks.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind."}
Q[8753]={p="你一直保护卡利姆多生灵的行为已经被我们认可。把徽记之戒拿来，让我增强它的能量。",pEN="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",c="你的兴起是所有人之中最出色的，$n。愿你永远不会在征服者之路上迷失！",cEN="Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, <name>. May you never stray from the path of the conqueror!"}
