Q[9004]={d="这真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。现在我或许可以安心的入眠了。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="将你的迅影罩帽和迅影外套交给德莉娜。",oEN="Give Deliana your Shadowcraft Cap and Shadowcraft Tunic.",p="Según nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar tus piezas de arte sombrío a cambio de tu nueva almete y túnica Mantoscuro?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Shadowcraft pieces in exchange for your new Darkmantle Cap and Tunic?",c="我会想念你的，$n。我欠你很大一份人情；我想我永远也无法报答你。\n\n希望你喜欢你的新头饰和胸甲，也希望它能保护你很长一段时间。",cEN="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come."}
Q[9005]={d="这真是个不可思议的故事，$n!谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。现在我或许可以安心的入眠了。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="将你的鬼雾面具和鬼雾长袍交给德莉娜。",oEN="Give Deliana your Dreadmist Mask and Dreadmist Robe.",p="Según nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar tus piezas de calígine a cambio de tu nueva máscara y túnica de Brumamorta?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Dreadmist pieces in exchange for your new Deathmist Mask and Robe?",c="我会想念你的，$n。我欠你很大一份人情；我想我永远也无法报答你。\n\n希望你喜欢你的新头饰和胸甲，也希望它能保护你很长一段时间。",cEN="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come."}
Q[9006]={d="这真是个不可思议的故事，$n!谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。现在我或许可以安心的入眠了。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="将你的勇气头盔和勇气胸甲交给德莉娜。",oEN="Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",p="Según nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar tus piezas de Valor a cambio de tu nuevo Yelmo y Peto de heroísmo?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Valor pieces in exchange for your new Helm and Breastplate of Heroism?",c="我会想念你的，$n。我欠你很大一份人情；我想我永远也无法报答你。\n\n希望你喜欢你的新头饰和胸甲，也希望它能保护你很长一段时间。",cEN="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come."}
Q[9007]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的野性之心兜帽和野性之心外衣交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Wildheart Cowl and Wildheart Vest.",p="De acuerdo con nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar tus piezas de Corazón Salvaje a cambio de tu nuevo chaleco y capucha de Cueroferal?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Wildheart pieces in exchange for your new Feralheart Cowl and Vest?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9008]={d="¡Qué historia tan increíble, $n! Tienes mi agradecimiento y la más sentida gratitud de todos los implicados. Gracias a ti, hemos enmendado los errores del pasado.\n\nEn cuanto a tu recompensa, tengo unas cuantas cosas que te has ganado y te van a gustar.",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的野兽追猎者之帽与野兽追猎者外套交给莫克瓦尔。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Beaststalker's Cap and Beaststalker's Tunic.",p="Según nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar tus piezas de acechabestias a cambio de tu nueva gorra y túnica de maestro de bestias?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Beaststalker pieces in exchange for your new Beastmaster's Cap and Tunic?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9009]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的虔诚头冠和虔诚长袍交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Devout Crown and Devout Robe.",p="Según nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar tus piezas de devoto a cambio de tu nueva corona y túnica virtuosas?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Devout pieces in exchange for your new Virtuous Crown and Robe?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
