Q[9013]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n!谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的勇气头盔和勇气胸甲交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",p="Según nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar tus piezas de Valor a cambio de tu nuevo Yelmo y Coraza de heroísmo?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Valor pieces in exchange for your new Helm and Breastplate of Heroism?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9014]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的博学者头冠和博学者长袍交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Magister's Crown and Magister's Robes.",p="Según nuestro trato, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para entregar las piezas de magister a cambio de tu nueva corona y toga de hechicero?",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Magister's pieces in exchange for your new Sorcerer's Crown and Robes?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9015]={d="听好了，$n。为了让这面旗帜运转起来，你必须要进入黑石深渊的竞技场，然后听任裁决者格里斯通宣判你，然后将这面旗子牢牢地插在地面上有处挑战标记的地方。\n\n这时你想挑战的人就会被不可抗拒的力量推入战场，浑身上下只有将你杀死的欲望。当你从他身上找到了你要的东西以后，就回去找安泰恩吧。",dEN="Heed me well, <name>. For the banner to work in the desired way, you will need to step into the Ring of the Law in Blackrock Depths. Allow yourself to be sentenced by High Justice Grimstone and place the banner firmly on the ground in a sign of defiance.\n\nYour victim will not be able to restrain himself and shall enter the fray filled with a desire to fight you. Once you obtain that which you seek, go back to Anthion.",o="到黑石深渊的竞技场去，在你被裁决者格里斯通宣判之后将挑战之旗插在场地中央。杀死塞尔德林和他的角斗士，然后将瓦塔拉克饰品第一部分交给东瘟疫之地的安泰恩·哈尔蒙。",oEN="Travel to the Ring of the Law in Blackrock Depths and place the Banner of Provocation in its center as you are sentenced by High Justice Grimstone. Slay Theldren and his gladiators and return to Anthion Harmon in the Eastern Plaguelands with the first piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet.",p="你回来了，$n！",pEN="You're back, <name>!",c="你取回了部分的勋章了吗，$n？",cEN="You've recovered part of the medallion, <name>?"}
Q[9016]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="Lleva 1 par de botas, 1 falda escocesa y 1 par de bufas Corazón Salvaje a Mokvar a Orgrimmar.|n",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Wildheart Boots, a Wildheart Kilt and Wildheart Spaulders.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9017]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着驭兽者长靴，驭兽者短裤和驭兽者衬肩回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Beaststalker's Boots, Beaststalker's Pants and Beaststalker's Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9018]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的!",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着博学者长靴，博学者护腿和博学者衬肩回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Magister's Boots, Magister's Leggings and Magister's Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9019]={d="瓦塔拉克的灵魂就封印在这枚护符里。因为贪婪，我们愚蠢地将它分成了好几部分，丝毫不了解这会为我们带来怎样残酷的诅咒。\n\n唯一解除瓦塔拉克的法术的办法，就是将这枚勋章重新组合在一起。回到莫克瓦尔那里去，告诉他说，伯德雷已经是他找齐剩余部分的最后希望了。顺便跟他提一下你应得的报酬。\n\n我只希望能从此安息。祝你好运……你会非常需要运气的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带上一双虔诚软鞋、一条虔诚长裙和一副虔诚衬肩，回去向奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔复命。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Devout Sandals, Devout Skirt and Devout Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9020]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的!",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着迅影长靴，迅影短裤和迅影肩甲回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Shadowcraft Boots, Shadowcraft Pants and Shadowcraft Spaulders.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9021]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着鬼雾便鞋，鬼雾护腿和鬼雾衬肩回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9022]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的!",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着勇气战靴，勇气腿铠和勇气肩甲回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Boots of Valor, Legplates of Valor and Spaulders of Valor.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9023]={d="我和我的兄弟在拉文霍德庄园外进行毒药研究。\n\n拉文霍德公爵命令我们研制一种极效混合毒药，祖尔格拉布和安其拉废墟出产这种毒药的原料，也就是毒囊。\n\n有两只剧毒的野兽居住在那些可怕的废墟中，它们很可能有我们需要的毒囊。$c，去取回库林纳克斯和温诺希斯的毒囊，我们会永远记得你的恩情的。",dEN="My brother and I run the poison operations out of the manor Ravenholdt.\n\nLord Ravenholdt tasked me to track down a new and extremely effective poison compound that can be crafted from the venom sacs of the inhabitants of Zul'Gurub and the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nThere are two particularly venomous beasts residing in those blasted ruins that possess what it is that we might be looking for, <class>. Bring me a venom sac from the beasts Kurinnaxx and Venoxis and we would be eternally grateful.",o="塞纳里奥要塞的德尔克·雷木让你把温诺希斯的毒囊和库林纳克斯的毒囊交给他。",oEN="Dirk Thunderwood at Cenarion Hold wants you to bring him Venoxis's Venom Sac and Kurinnaxx's Venom Sac.",p="这不是个简单的任务，$n。你需要带些朋友去。",pEN="This ain't no smash and grab job, <name>. You're gonna need to bring friends.",c="拉文霍德感谢你，英雄！带着你的奖励走吧！",cEN="Ravenholdt thanks you, hero! Take your pick!"}
Q[9024]={d="我找到了！你闻到过风中的新香气没有？新的香水现在有那么流行么？我们的卫兵不该这么简单就这样抛弃他们的职责！\n\n嗯，一定是因为他们的理智完全被这些该死的炼金术产品所盖过去了。\n\n要想搞清楚问题，只有一个办法：弄一些香水的样本，把它们交给摩根·匹斯特，并把我的推断告诉他。别担心，你回来的时候我会把买香水的钱付给你的。",dEN="I've got it! Have you smelled the new fragrance on the wind? The new colognes and perfumes that have come into fashion? Our guards wouldn't neglect their duties so easily.\n\nThat is, unless their thinking has been clouded by some foul alchemy.\n\nThere is only one way to be sure - bring a bottle of cologne and perfume to Morgan Pestle, and tell him my suspicions. I will reimburse you for their purchase when you return.",o="将1瓶古龙水和1瓶香水交给暴风城贸易区的摩根·匹斯特。",oEN="Bring 1 Cologne Bottle and 1 Perfume Bottle to Morgan Pestle in the Trade District of Stormwind.",p="有什么能帮你的吗？",pEN="Something I can help you with?",c="我了解艾里斯坦的疑虑，但我真的觉得他反应过度了。让年轻男女做他们想做的事吧。我想艾里斯坦已经忘了年轻和恋爱的感觉。\n\n不过还是不要告诉他比较好。我们就迁就他吧。",cEN="I understand Aristan's concerns, but I really think he's overreacting. Let young men and women do what they will. I think Aristan has forgotten what it means to be young and in love.\n\nBut it would be better not to tell him that. We'll humor him."}
Q[9025]={d="好吧，有问题。看来阿瑞斯坦还真是个很警觉的人。我在香水中发现了一些应用在爱情药水中的物质，以及一些可以影响情绪的危险成分。\n\n在香水中应用这些物质虽然并非是前所未有的，但我从中分析出的一些原料……闻起来很有趣。",dEN="Well, I'll be. It looks like Aristan might be on to something after all. I found traces of substances used in love potions and insidious mind-altering draughts.\n\nIt isn't unheard of for perfumes to have some of them, but a few of the ingredients I detected... Smells funny.",o="回到暴风城银行附近的阿瑞斯坦·莫塔那里。",oEN="Return to Aristan Mottar outside the bank in Stormwind's Trade District.",c="虽然我认为这应该就是事实，但仍未证实我的怀疑是对的。我们要三思而后行。\n\n拿着，酬谢你购买古龙水跟香水。",cEN="While I thought this would be the case, finding out that my suspicions were correct is still unsettling. We must carefully consider our next move.\n\nHere, to repay you for the purchase of the cologne and perfume."}
Q[9026]={d="我们一定得找到源头才行。我看到许多人，包括卫兵，都在镶金玫瑰那里进进出出。跟奥里森谈谈，要是她在卖这些东西，就问问她是从哪里弄来的货。",dEN="We've got to find the source. I've seen a lot more people than usual - guards included - going in and out of The Gilded Rose. Talk to Allison. If she's selling them, she can tell you where they came from.",o="与暴风城贸易区中的镶金玫瑰旅店的老板奥里森谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Innkeeper Allison at The Gilded Rose in Stormwind's Trade District.",c="是的，我最近刚进了香水和古龙水。相当地热卖，我不知道它们还能放在柜子上多久。\n\n如果你问我，其实我觉得有点无聊。每个人身上的味道都一样？不过是真的很好闻啦。",cEN="Oh yes, I just got the perfume and cologne in stock recently. It's been selling so well, I don't know how long I can keep it on the shelves.\n\nIf you ask me, it's kind of boring. Everyone smelling the same? It smells great, but still."}
Q[9027]={d="我的香水有点古怪？有可能。我从来没见过人们对某种产品这样痴迷。\n\n你看，要是有什么古怪的话，我也很想知道。我是从一个叫埃文特·索里萨姆的商人那里进到这批货的。他是新来的。\n\n他提到过说有些货物得送到“最好的线团”那边去。",dEN="Something funny about the cologne? It's possible. I've never seen so many people after one product like this.\n\nLook, if there's something wrong with it, I want to know, too. I bought my supply from a merchant named Evert Sorisam. He's new in town.\n\nHe mentioned he had some goods he was going to deliver to The Finest Thread.",o="与暴风城运河旁的裁缝店“最好的线团”里面的埃文特·索里萨姆谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Evert Sorisam at The Finest Thread along Stormwind's Canals.",c="Sí, estas fragancias son el éxito de la temporada; no deja de venir gente preguntando por ellas.\n\nAquí se han agotado las existencias; prueba con Allison, la posadera de La Rosa Áurea.\n\nPero date prisa; te digo que esas fragancias son irresistibles.",cEN="Yes, of course. Those fragrances are the hottest items this season. You must be the fifth or sixth person this hour to inquire about them.\n\nI'm afraid my supplies are all sold out. If you'd like some, you should speak with Allison, the innkeeper of The Gilded Rose.\n\nYou shouldn't waste any time, though. I think you'll find the perfume will be irresistible."}
Q[9028]={d="什么？叛国罪？不，不，我向你保证，我绝对没有任何的恶意。\n\n难道说帮助那些想轻松度过痛苦的求爱期的年轻人也有错吗？拜托，这绝对不是犯罪。\n\n为了证明我确实没有恶意，我可以告诉你货源。\n\n据说这些香水都是一个叫斯塔弗隆·雷伦特的药剂师制作的，不过我从未与他见过面，也没有说过话。\n\n我们的地精中间人说，他就在希尔斯布莱德地区工作，似乎就是那个神秘的拉文霍德庄园一带。祝你好运！",dEN="What? Treason? No, no. I assure you, my intentions are completely harmless.\n\nIs it so wrong to help those who wish to ease the painful ritual of courtship? Come, that is no crime.\n\nAnd to prove that I mean no harm, I will even tell you my source.\n\nThey were shipped to me by a Staffron Lerent, an apothecary of some sort. I never spoke with him.\n\nOur goblin middle man said that he worked in the foothills over Hillsbrad past that mysterious Ravenholdt Manor. I wish you luck in finding him.",o="到希尔斯布莱德丘陵去，在拉文霍德庄园后面找到药剂师斯塔弗隆·雷伦特。",oEN="Find Apothecary Staffron Lerent in the Hillsbrad Foothills behind Ravenholdt Manor.",c="是的，是我做了那些香水。很香啊，不是吗？另人无法抗拒。\n\n当联盟和部落的战士们都为这些爱的感觉所倾倒，他们就无法抵抗暗影议会的崛起了。\n\n他们会变的衰弱，手足无措。当他们担心着内心所挚爱的人，就会失去他们的优势。\n\n解决的方法很简单。为什么我要花那么久的时间去想呢？弱点就是心啊。会发生的事就是会发生，你无法避免的。",cEN="Yes, I made those fragrances. Wonderful smell, isn't it? Irresistible.\n\nOnce the warriors of Alliance and Horde alike are smitten with these feelings of love, they will be powerless to stop the rise of the Shadow Council.\n\nThey will be weakened, unprepared. As they worry for their loved ones, they will lose their edge.\n\nThe solution was so simple. Why did it take me so long to come upon it? The weakness of all is through the heart. And there is nothing you can do to stop the inevitable."}
Q[9032]={d="¡¿Que el medallón contenía el alma de Valthalak?! No me extraña que tan poderosa maldición lo custodiara.\n\nPara encontrar a Bodley hay un pequeño inconveniente. Lo último que supe de él es que se estaba preparando para aventurarse de nuevo en la Cumbre de Roca Negra. Nunca más se supo de él.\n\nBúscalo en la Montaña Roca Negra, aunque mucho me temo que probablemente haya muerto. Te sugiero que te lleves contigo el dispositivo de los goblins, $gamigo:amiga;.",dEN="The medallion contained Valthalak's soul? It's no surprise it was guarded by such a powerful curse.\n\nLocating Bodley presents a bit of a problem. Last time I heard of him, he was preparing to venture back into Blackrock Spire. He was never heard of again.\n\nSeek him out in Blackrock Mountain, though I'm afraid to say he's probably dead by now. I suggest taking the goblin's device with you, friend.",o="到黑石山并使用超空间鬼魂显像机，去黑石塔附近寻找布德利。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Mountain and use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to find Bodley near Blackrock Spire.",c="我好高兴你能看到我，终于有人能跟我说说话！\n\n你能帮帮我们吗，$n？帮帮我们将以前所犯的错导入正轨？如果你真的有瓦萨拉克领主护符上半块，我就能指引你拿到另外那2块，然后拼凑好就行了。\n\n喔，对了，你好，我叫布德利。很高兴认识你！",cEN="I am so glad that you can see me. Finally someone to talk to!\n\nWill you help us, <name>? Help to undo the wrong that we perpetrated and put things to right? If it's true that you already have the Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet, then I think I can point you in the right direction to acquire the other two parts, reunite them and put an end to all of this.\n\nOh, by the way, hello, my name is Bodley. Nice to meet you!"}
Q[9033]={d="上一次战争距今已有5年了……\n\n数万名士兵战死沙场，他们的牺牲换来了什么？危机远远没有消失。\n\n巫妖王再次蠢蠢欲动……他的走狗克尔苏加德正在集聚军队，准备对我们的家园发动新一轮的袭击。\n\n我们绝不会让他得逞！拿出你的奉献精神吧。勇敢地投入战斗，以此证明你的无畏！银色黎明和血色十字军组成的联军将是你坚强的后盾和战友。\n\n前往纳克萨玛斯的宫殿，打败天灾军团……",dEN="Five years since the last war...\n\nTens of thousands of lives were lost and for what? The threat was never fully extinguished.\n\nAnd so the Lich King stirs once more... His yes-man, Kel'Thuzad, amassing for another attack upon our lands.\n\nWe will not allow it! Prove your dedication. Prove that you are willing to risk life and limb to stop this madness and the combined might of the Dawn and the Crusade will be at your beck and call.\n\nEnter Naxxramas and destroy the Scourge within...",o="El comandante Eligor Albar de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este, quiere que mates 5 monstruosidades vivientes, 5 gárgolas piel de piedra, 8 capitanes caballero de la Muerte y 3 acechadores venenosos.",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to slay 3 Living Monstrosities, 5 Stoneskin Gargoyles, 6 Deathknight Captains and 3 Venom Stalkers.",p="职责，荣誉，奉献……这些字眼对你而言有什么意义？",pEN="Duty, honor, dedication... What do these words mean to you?",c="做得好！你会因为替圣光之愿的男男女女牺牲奉献而获得奖励。",cEN="A job well done! You will be rewarded via the services of the men and women at Light's Hope."}
Q[9034]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este, te hará una coraza acorator si le llevas lo siguiente: 1 coraza profanada, 25 restos de coraza, 4 barras de arcanita y 2 cristales nexo.|n",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Breastplate if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Breastplate, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer una coraza acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Breastplate."}
Q[9035]={d="嘿，叫你呢！你可得帮帮我。\n\n我和我的学徒被那些肮脏的怪物袭击了！他们渴望拥有魔法力量，疯狂地收集法力水晶、魔杖、法术书……所有与魔法相关的东西！\n\n梅雷多尔追他们去了，我只得留在这儿保护好幸存的东西。沿着这条路往前走，看看你能不能帮他一把。",dEN="You, there! You must help me, please!\n\nA fellow apprentice and I were attacked by the Wretched! In their mad hunger for magic, they took everything they could get their hands on: mana crystals, wands, spellbooks... everything!\n\nMeledor gave chase after them; I had to stay behind and look after what they didn't take. Continue down the road and see if you can lend him a hand.",o="出了银月城向南走便是永歌森林，去那儿找学徒梅雷多尔谈谈。",oEN="Speak to Apprentice Meledor in Eversong Woods along the road heading south from Silvermoon City.",c="他们全都逃了。用一枚火球把他们全都吓的屁滚尿流！不幸的是，他们把大部分偷走的东西都丢到河里了。",cEN="They're gone now. Scared the breeches out of them with a well-placed fireball! Unfortunately for me, they threw our precious cargo into the river."}
Q[9036]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腿铠、20块板甲碎片、4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏腿铠。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Legplates if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Legplates, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos quijotes acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Legplates."}
Q[9037]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1顶被玷污的头盔、15块板甲碎片、5块奥金锭和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一顶无畏头盔。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Helmet if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Helmet, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="头部是全身最敏感的位置。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer un casco acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Helmet."}
Q[9038]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠、12块板甲碎片、2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏肩铠。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Pauldrons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Pauldrons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="秘诀就在于团结一致。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos espaldares acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Pauldrons."}
Q[9039]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="Korfax de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este, te hará unos escarpes acorator si le llevas lo siguiente: 1 par de escarpes profanados, 12 restos de coraza, 2 barras de arcanita y 3 pellejos bastos curtidos.|n",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Sabatons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="永远不要低估一双好鞋的价值。尤其是柯菲斯做的鞋子！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos escarpes acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Sabatons."}
Q[9040]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护手、8块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏护手。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Gauntlets if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Gauntlets, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这些护手就是要配上精良的武器。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos guanteletes acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Gauntlets."}
Q[9041]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的护腰、8块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一条无畏护腰。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Waistguard if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="腰带不仅是个时髦的象征也是强大的保护装备。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos guardarrenes acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Waistguard."}
Q[9042]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腕、6块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏护腕。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Bracers if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Bracers, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="手腕是全身第二脆弱的部位……还是第四个？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos brazales acorator.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Bracers."}
Q[9043]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的外套，25块板甲碎片，4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一件救赎外套。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer una Guerrera de redención.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Tunic."}
Q[9044]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腿甲，20块板甲碎片，4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎腿甲。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你不会再找到比这更适合神圣战士的腿甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unas Musleras de redención.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Legguards."}
Q[9045]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的头饰，15块板甲碎片，5块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一件救赎头饰。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="<艾利格抬头看着你又继续说。>",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="<Eligor señala tu cabeza.>\n\nMantenla cubierta, $n.",cEN="<Eligor points to his head.>\n\nKeep it covered, <class>."}
Q[9046]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠，12块板甲碎片，2块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎肩铠。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你没看到我们在忙吗，$n？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="Cualquier $c te dirá que la mayor parte de su poder proviene de los hombros. Cuanto más grande, mejor...",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Spaulders."}
Q[9047]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴，12块板甲碎片，2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一双救赎长靴。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="这双靴子会保护你的双脚不受矮小的天灾军团攻击。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Boots."}
Q[9048]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护手，8块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎护手。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="让圣光引导这些手甲击倒你的敌人！",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Handguards."}
Q[9049]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的束带，8块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一条救赎束带。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="Esta faja tendrá dos funciones: 1) Te protegerá y te guiará contra la Plaga y 2) Te hará lucir 10 kilos más $gliviano:liviana;.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Girdle."}
Q[9050]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腕，6块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎护腕。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="这些东西制作的非常划算，但是请小心，如果你太常让它们溅水的话是会生锈的。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Wristguards."}
Q[9051]={d="这些你帮我制造的毒素有着特殊的用途。环形山里的魔暴龙使得那里的狩猎和生存环境对我来说都变得十分恶劣。即使我足够强壮，杀死一只魔暴龙也只会让另一只游荡入那块带领地而已。\n\n带上这根毒针并将其刺入一只活着的魔暴龙体内。毒素会使它很快就安静下来，不过……我不知道很快有多快……",dEN="The toxin you helped me create is for a special purpose. The great devilsaurs of the crater make it dangerous to hunt and difficult for me to survive. Even if I possessed the necessary strength, killing a devilsaur simply allows another to move into its territory.\n\nTake this poisoned barb and stab it deep into a living devilsaur. The toxin should pacify the creature, though I do not know how quickly...",o="将魔暴龙之刺扎入一只魔暴龙的体内。",oEN="Stab a Devilsaur with the Devilsaur Barb. Return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater when you have completed this task.",p="你驯服那头野兽了吗？",pEN="Were you able to pacify the great beast?",c="感谢你，$n。你很勇敢也很有智慧。\n\n跟我说说看那个恶龙的毒性反应如何？",cEN="Thank you, <name>. You are brave and wise.\n\nTell me, how did the devilsaur react to the toxin?"}
Q[9052]={d="Te pediría ayuda para crear una toxina o algo así para apaciguar a la gran criatura que vive en el cráter. No es muy peligroso y solo los ávidos ojos de $gun:una; $c pueden buscar estos ingredientes.\n\nPuedes encontrar los champiñones de sangre que crecen dentro de los brotes Sangrepétalo a lo largo del cráter. Los aguijones Gorishi los podrás obtener de los insectos que se encuentran dentro y alrededor de La Cicatriz Serpenteante, en la parte sur del cráter.",dEN="I would ask you to help me create a toxin of sorts, to pacify a great creature living here in the crater. It is not deadly, and only the keen eyes of a <class> can hope to collect the ingredients.\n\nYou can find the bloodcap mushrooms growing within the bloodpetal sprouts all across the crater. Gorishi stings are from the insects inside and around the Slithering Scar, located in the southern part of the crater.",o="收集一些血帽和格里什钉刺，然后向托尔瓦·寻路者复命。",oEN="Collect 8 Bloodcap and 8 Gorishi Stings, and return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.",p="成功了吗？",pEN="Have you met with success?",c="终于拿到了材料！\n\n有了安戈洛的这些材料，调制毒素就变的轻而易举……",cEN="The ingredients at last!\n\nWith the Un'Goro soil I have collected, the toxin is easily concocted..."}
Q[9053]={d="这正是我所担心的，看来毒素的力量还是太弱了，无法对这样强大的生物产生影响。\n\n我们必须造出一种更强力的毒素，你需要前往阿塔哈卡神庙的底部，揭开那个祭坛的秘密，并从那里的守卫身上取一些腐烂的藤蔓来。神庙很危险，我建议你带些朋友一起去。\n\n完成之后回到我这里来吧。",dEN="It is as I feared -- the toxin is simply too weak for such a powerful creature.\n\nIf we are to create a toxin of high enough potency, you must venture to the bottom of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, unlock the secrets of the altar and recover a putrid vine from the guardian there. The temple is dangerous, and it would behoove you to bring friends.\n\nReturn to me when this is done.",o="从沉没的神庙底部的守卫身上得到一些腐烂藤蔓，把它们交给托尔瓦·寻路者。",oEN="Retrieve a Putrid Vine from the guardian at the bottom of the Sunken Temple and return to Torwa Pathfinder.",p="你拿回藤蔓了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the vine?",c="Por fin, la toxina se puede crear por completo. No me atrevo a pedirte que se lo vuelvas a aplicar a la criatura, ya te he pedido demasiado.\n\nTienes mi agradecimiento y respeto. Que te vaya bien en tus viajes, $n.",cEN="At last, the toxin can be created in full. I dare not require you to inflict it upon the creature again, as I have asked too much already.\n\nYou have my thanks and respect. May you be well in your travels, <name>."}
Q[9054]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1件被玷污的外套、25块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一件地穴追猎者外套。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你有我要的物品了吗，$c？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="他们会畏惧你，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Tunic."}
Q[9055]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1条被玷污的腿甲、20块锁甲碎片、3块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一条地穴追猎者腿甲。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你有我要的物品了吗，$c？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="当你穿上这件护甲，你就会发现你的人开始改变。你会有不可思议的杀人能力。或许，甚至有一点嗜血。\n\n先说好我不会对你卷入的任何混乱负责……",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Legguards."}
Q[9056]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1件被玷污的头饰、15块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一件地穴追猎者头饰。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你有我要的物品了吗，$c？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="你变成了一个可怕的生物，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Headpiece."}
Q[9057]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩饰、12块锁甲碎片、2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者肩饰。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! tienes todo lo que te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unas Bufas de acechacriptas.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Spaulders."}
Q[9058]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一双地穴追猎者长靴。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="靴子准备好了，$n！好好地穿。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Boots."}
Q[9059]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1副被玷污的手甲、8块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者护手。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="让地穴恶魔带领你的手吧，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Handguards."}
Q[9060]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="El montero Leopold de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este, te hará una faja de acechacriptas si le llevas lo siguiente: 1 faja profanada, 8 restos de malla, 1 barra de arcanita y 3 cristales nexo.|n",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="一个忠诚的束腰！为你准备好了，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Girdle."}
Q[9061]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腕甲、6块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者腕甲。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! tienes todo lo que te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos Guardamuñecas de acechacriptas.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Wristguards."}
Q[9062]={d="Esos malditos desdichados corren que se las pelan cuando alguien les planta cara, pero eso ahora no importa. Tengo que encontrar el grimorio elemental de mi instructor.\n\nEstoy seguro de haber visto a uno de esos cobardes tirarlo al río, pero no lo encuentro. Échame una mano; si lo encuentras, te ganarás unas monedas.",dEN="Those blasted Wretched sure can run fast at the sight of someone who'll stand up to them. But let's not worry about that now. I need to find my instructor's elemental grimoire.\n\nI'm certain I saw one of those cowards throw it into the river but I cannot seem to be able to locate it. I could use another set of eyes. I'll throw in a bit of coin if you spot it.",o="永歌森林的学徒梅雷多尔让你搜寻附近桥梁下的水域，帮他找到安瑟隆的元素魔典。",oEN="Apprentice Meledor in Eversong Woods wants you to search the water beneath the bridge nearby and bring him Antheol's Elemental Grimoire.",p="运气不好？嗯，继续找。那本书极为重要，$c。",pEN="No luck? Well, keep looking. The book is of utmost importance, <class>.",c="这本书已经完全浸湿了。指导者安瑟隆会不高兴的。\n\n来，拿着这些钱。我有个主意。",cEN="The book is completely soaked. Instructor Antheol's not going to like this at all.\n\nHere, take this money. I have an idea."}
Q[9063]={d="有位名叫托尔瓦·寻路者的猎人最近请求德鲁伊的帮助。他说只有我们才具备必要的技巧与对大自然的尊重。\n\n托尔瓦并不难找，他就在由塔纳利斯通往安戈洛环形山的路上，准确的说，是环形山的入口位置。",dEN="A hunter by the name of Torwa Pathfinder has requested the help of a druid. He said only we would possess the necessary skills and respect for nature to help him.\n\nThere is a road that connects the Un'Goro Crater and the desert of Tanaris. As that road enters the crater, you will find Torwa close by.",o="与安戈洛环形山的托尔瓦·寻路者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.",c="你千里迢迢来找我，$c，而且还真花了很多时间。",cEN="You have traveled far to meet with me, <class>, and not a moment too soon."}
Q[9064]={d="Antheol se va a poner hecho una fiera cuando vea lo que le ha pasado al libro. Te propongo un trato.\n\nLlévale este libro y no le digas nada. Si comenta algo, dile que se te ha caído en un charco. No tiene autoridad sobre ti, así que no podrá hacerte nada.\n\nDa sus conferencias en la Charca Plácido Susurro, al sureste de Lunargenta. ¡Te recompensaré bien por este favor!",dEN="Antheol is going to fly off his rocker when he finds out his book is ruined. I've got a little proposal for you; don't worry, I'll make it worth your while.\n\nTake this book to him and tell him nothing of this incident. If he asks, just tell him you dropped the book into a puddle. He has no direct authority over you, so there's not much he can do.\n\nAntheol delivers his lectures at Stillwhisper Pond, southeast of Silvermoon. You'll do this for us, right? I'll reward you handsomely for this favor!",o="将安瑟隆的元素魔典交给永歌森林的萦语水池旁的指导者安瑟隆。",oEN="Bring Antheol's Elemental Grimoire to Instructor Antheol at Stillwhisper Pond in Eversong Woods.",p="有什么事需要打断我的演讲，$c？",pEN="What calls for this interruption to my lecture, <class>?",c="你说那两个无能的蠢蛋收买你来骗我？你来找我做的非常好，$n。",cEN="You say those two incompetent fools bribed you to lie to me? You've done very well in coming to me, <name>."}
Q[9066]={d="希望你能学到一点处事之道，$n。不要相信满嘴谎言的家伙。\n\n现在，我想让你回去找那两个愚蠢的学生，使用这根魔杖召回他们的学徒徽章。这根杖子不仅能取下两人身上的徽章，还会给予他们适当的惩罚。\n\n做完这事儿就来找我吧。我会酬谢你的。",dEN="I hope you learn a valuable lesson today, <name>. Never trust someone else to lie for you.\n\nNow I want you to go back to my two dimwitted students and discipline them using this wand. My magic tells me that you'll find them along the road to the west on the other side of the Dead Scar.\n\nCome back to me after you've done this. I'll give you a small reward for your troubles.",o="对指导者安瑟隆的两名学生：学徒拉尔雷和学徒梅雷多尔使用他交给你的魔杖。然后将安瑟隆的训诫棒还给永歌森林萦语水池旁的安瑟隆。",oEN="Use Antheol's Disciplinary Rod on his two students: Apprentice Ralen and Apprentice Meledor. Return to Antheol at Stillwhisper Pond in Eversong Woods with the rod after this.",p="你做了我要你做的事吗，$n？",pEN="Did you do what I asked of you, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。别担心，他们不会永远变成那个样子。不过，他们的学徒资格在他们自己把它挣回来之前是不会再出现的。",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. Don't worry, they're not stuck in that form permanently. Their apprenticeship, however, won't be restored until they earn it back."}
Q[9067]={d="我最喜欢举办舞会和酒会了……这都是为伟大而辉煌的奎尔萨拉斯庆贺与祝福！\n\n但……但是，我手头上还有别的事，所以我希望你能帮我带过来一些货物。\n\n请你帮我从银月城旅店的调酒师桑塔基德那里买一瓶日光陈酿，从远行者居所的萨蕾妮·晨光那里买一些魔泉美味回来，然后再从晴风村的哈里斯·晨行者那里买点烟花。\n\n快点，别让我等急了！",dEN="I like to throw parties... just a little something to celebrate the magnificence that is Quel'Thalas!\n\nBut, I'm in a bit of a bind. I need you to gather up more party supplies.\n\nFrom Vinemaster Suntouched at the Silvermoon City inn, bring me a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve. From Zalene Firstlight at Farstrider Retreat acquire more of those delicious Springpaw Appetizers. And you can pick up my delivery of fireworks from Halis Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village.\n\nBe quick about it!",o="购买一瓶日光陈酿、一些魔泉美味和一捆烟花，然后向永歌森林萨瑟利尔庄园的萨瑟利尔男爵复命。",oEN="Acquire a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve, Springpaw Appetizers and a Bundle of Fireworks, and return them to Lord Saltheril at Saltheril's Haven in Eversong Woods.",p="我不是派你去为派对收集更多食物吗？是你吗？喔，我不可能永远记住每个人的长相，对吧？我见过太多……有趣的人。\n\n你想要什么？",pEN="Didn't I just send you out to gather up more party supplies? Was that you? Oh, I can't be expected to remember everyone's face, now can I? I meet so many... interesting people.\n\nWhat is it that you want?",c="Eres $gun hombre:una mujer; bastante $genérgico:enérgica;, ¿no?\n\nTodo esto parece muy adecuado. Ciertamente mereces una compensación por reunir todo esto para mí, y creo que algo más.\n\nOh, casi lo olvido, aquí tienes una invitación a la fiesta. Y, $c, la próxima vez que vengas asegúrate de vestirte con algo un poco más... festivo.",cEN="You're quite the energetic young <man/woman>, aren't you?\n\nThis all looks very adequate. You certainly deserve compensation for gathering up all of this for me, and something a little extra I think.\n\nOh, I almost forgot, here's an invitation to the party. And, <class>, next time that you drop in make sure to dress up in something a little more... festive."}
Q[9068]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者外套，只要你将下列物品带给他：1件被亵渎的外衣，25个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，4个奥金锭和3块熟化毛皮。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="<林布拉特对你嗤之以鼻。>",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="碎地者是最强大且引人敬畏的护甲。我的祖先会为你的成就而微笑的，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Tunic."}
Q[9069]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者护腿，只要你将下列物品带给他：1对被亵渎的腿甲，20个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，3个奥金锭和5块熟化毛皮。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="不论如何，我们一定要拯救这块土地。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="我希望你不会和之前来这里的人有一样的命运，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Legguards."}
Q[9070]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者头盔，只要你将下列物品带给他：1个被亵渎的头甲，15个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，4个奥金锭和2个联结水晶。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! tienes todo lo que te pedí y ahora puedo hacer una Celada Rompeterra.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Headpiece."}
Q[9071]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者肩甲，只要你将下列物品带给他：1套被亵渎的护肩，12个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，2个奥金锭和2块月布。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Mooncloth.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! tienes todo lo que te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unas Bufas Rompeterra.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Spaulders."}
Q[9072]={d="你能将那些战死沙场的英雄的护甲给我带回来吗？\n\n那些护甲被邪恶的敌人夺去，早已被玷污了，但是护甲碎片能彻底清洁它们，让我们重新穿着它们杀入战场。\n\n将阵亡英雄的遗物以及那些净化所需的材料交给我，我会为你打造碎地者的套装。\n\n到纳克萨玛斯去寻找吧！",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一双碎地者长靴。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! tienes todo lo que te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unas Botas Rompeterra.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Boots."}
Q[9073]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗？\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者护手，只要你将下列物品带给他：1套被亵渎的护手，8个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，1个奥金锭和5块熟化毛皮。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought me that which I require?",c="这些手甲引导元素的能量！",cEN="These handguards channel the power of the elements!"}
Q[9074]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗？\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者束腰，只要你将下列物品带给他：1个被亵渎的束腰，8个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，1个奥金锭和3个联结水晶。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! tienes todo lo que te pedí y ahora puedo hacer una Faja Rompeterra.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Girdle."}
Q[9075]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗？\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="Rimblat Rompeterra de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz en las Tierras de la Peste del Este te hará unos guardamuñecas Rompeterra si le llevas lo siguiente: 1 par de guardamuñecas profanados, 6 restos de malla, 1 barra de arcanita y 2 pellejos bastos curtidos.|n",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought me that which I require?",c="腕甲准备好了，$n。\n\n<林布拉特鞠躬。>",cEN="The wristguards are ready, <name>.\n\n<Rimblat bows.>"}
Q[9076]={d="那些失心者囫囵吞枣似的研究着低劣的魔法，尚未察觉我们已经取回了大部分武器。但是，我们不能指望他们一直这么愚钝。现在是时候策划一场决定性的突袭了，目标就锁定他们的首领奥尔达隆吧。他就在船坞旁边那幢建筑物的顶层。把他的徽记交给我，我会酬谢你的。",dEN="The Wretched are so oblivious, gorging on foul magic, that they haven't realized we've recovered most of our weapons. We can't expect them to remain in their stupor, though. Now is the time for a decisive attack. Let us make an example of their leader, Aldaron. He was spotted on the top floor of the building by the anchorage. Bring me his head; I'll reward you suitably.",o="将奥尔达隆的徽记交给永歌森林阳帆港附近的维雷迪斯·雪晨。",oEN="Bring Aldaron's Head to Velendris Whitemorn near Sunsail Anchorage in Eversong Woods.",p="嗯，你拿到他的头了吗？我没时间浪费，$n。",pEN="Well, do you have his head or not? I've no time to waste, <name>.",c="¡Lo derrotaste! Claro que mis hombres lo habían ablandado un poco antes.\n\nEs broma, $c. Lo hiciste muy bien. No te metas en líos y te harás de una buena reputación.",cEN="You defeated him after all! Undoubtedly my men softened him up for you.\n\nI jest, <class>. You've done well. You'll make a name for yourself if you keep your nose clean."}
Q[9077]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的胸甲、25块皮甲碎片、2块奥金锭和6个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一件骨镰胸甲。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Breastplate if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Breastplate, 25 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 6 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! tienes todo lo que te pedí y ahora puedo hacer una Coraza Segahuesos.",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n,you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Bonescythe Breastplate."}
Q[9078]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腿铠、20块皮甲碎片、1块奥金锭、8个熟化毛皮和100金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一副骨镰腿铠。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Legplates if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legplates, 20 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar, 8 Cured Rugged Hides and 100 gold pieces.",p="<罗汉笑着。>\n\n我了解了这整个事情的讽刺之处。",pEN="<Rohan laughs.>\n\nI just realized the irony in all of this.",c="戴着这东西要小心一点。你可能会伤了自己。",cEN="Be careful walking around in those things. You might cut yourself."}
Q[9079]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="Rohan el Asesino de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este, te hará un casco Segahuesos si le llevas lo siguiente: 1 casco profanado, 15 restos de cuero, 8 pellejos bastos curtidos, 1 cristal nexo y 75 piezas de oro.|n",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Helmet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Helmet, 15 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 8 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 75 gold pieces.",p="Te faltan algunas piezas para la misión, ¡por favor ve y consíguelas todas!",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="我的骨镰盔帽和胡力欧的不同之处在于格调，$n。格调……",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n,you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Bonescythe Helmet."}
Q[9080]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠、12块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮、1块连结水晶和50金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一副骨镰肩铠。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Pauldrons if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Pauldrons, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 50 gold pieces.",p="<罗汉很怀疑地看着你。>\n\n你最近去过提尔之手？",pEN="<Rohan eyes you suspiciously.>\n\nBeen to Tyr's Hand lately?",c="<Rohan se seca el sudor de la frente>.\n\n¡Estos hombros requirieron algo de trabajo! No salgas y te maten como a un matorral, $n.",cEN="<Rohan wipes the sweat from his brow.>\n\nThese shoulders took some work! Don't go out and get yourself killed like a scrub, <name>."}
Q[9081]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的马靴、12块皮甲碎片、3个熟化毛皮、2块连结水晶和25金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一双骨镰马靴。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Sabatons if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Cured Rugged Hides, 2 Nexus Crystals and 25 gold pieces.",p="Solo tráeme los materiales y deja de perder mi tiempo, $n.",pEN="Just bring me the materials and stop wasting my time, <class>.",c="他们穿在你脚上很适合。对了，你最近没有再去提尔之手了吧？",cEN="They go on your feet. Say, you haven't been nosing around in Tyr's Hand again, have you?"}
Q[9082]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的护手、8块皮甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一双骨镰护手。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Gauntlets if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gauntlets, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="没有我需要的物品，你要我怎么做出什么东西来？",pEN="How do you expect me to get anything done without the items I requested?",c="这些护手必要时可能可以替换武器。骄傲的穿戴上它们吧！",cEN="These gauntlets could probably substitute as weapons if absolutely necessary. Wear them with pride!"}
Q[9083]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的护腰、8块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮、1块连结水晶和15金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一条骨镰护腰。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Waistguard if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 15 gold pieces.",p="没有我需要的物品，你要我怎么做出什么东西来？",pEN="How do you expect me to get anything done without the items I requested?",c="腰带准备好了，$n。你有看过这样高品质的物品以如此低价出售吗？",cEN="The belt is ready, <name>. Have you ever seen such a high-quality item sold for so little?"}
Q[9084]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腕、6块皮甲碎片、1块奥金锭、2个熟化毛皮和10金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一副骨镰护腕。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Bracers if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bracers, 6 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar, 2 Cured Rugged Hides and 10 gold pieces.",p="没有我需要的物品，你要我怎么做出什么东西来？",pEN="How do you expect me to get anything done without the items I requested?",c="护腕准备好了，$n。\n\n<罗汉鞠躬。>",cEN="The bracers are ready, <name>.\n\n<Rohan bows.>"}
Q[9085]={d="Después de reducir las defensas de un círculo de invocación de la Plaga, debes enfrentarte a los acólitos que los protegen.\n\nEn realidad, no se trata de hombres. Son sombras, una de las criaturas más temidas del Rey Exánime. Pueden dejarse ver si usas las runas necróticas que llevan y destruirlas con magia o la fuerza de las armas.",dEN="The forces of the Scourge are comprised of many horrors -- but few are more harrowing than Broodwatcher Akhenat.\n\nBroodwatcher Akhenat is but one of the Scourge commanders overseeing the invasions we're currently experiencing across Azeroth.\n\nIf the Argent Dawn is to prevail, this monstrosity MUST be destroyed.\n\nIn truth, I do not envy your task. You will be facing one of Anub'Rekhan's most loyal and trusted servants.\n\nMay the Light give you strength, <name>. You'll need it.",o="Ve a un Círculo de Invocación, mata a una Sombra de fatalidad e informa al comandante Thomas Helleran en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este.",oEN="Find an active level 60 Scourge Invasion and defeat Broodwatcher Akhenat, then return to Commander Thomas Helleran at Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="运气如何，$n？",pEN="Have you had any luck, <name>?",c="Excelente trabajo, $n. Con las sombras destruidas, nuestra esperanza de victoria contra el Rey Exánime sobrevive.",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. With that Nerubian monstrosity destroyed, our hope of victory against Kel'Thuzad survives."}
Q[9086]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的外套、25块皮甲碎片、6个熟化毛皮和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者外套。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Tunic if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者外套准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Tunic is ready, <name>."}
Q[9087]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的腿甲、20块皮甲碎片、8个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者腿甲。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Legguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 8 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="如我所允诺的，梦行者腿甲。\n\n<瑞恩将护甲交给你。>",cEN="As promised, Dreamwalker Legguards.\n\n<Rayne hands you the armor.>"}
Q[9088]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的头饰、15块皮甲碎片、6个熟化毛皮和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者头饰。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Headpiece if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者首盔准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Headpiece is ready, <name>."}
Q[9089]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩饰、12块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者肩饰。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Spaulders if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者肩甲准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Spaulders are ready, <name>."}
Q[9090]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块皮甲碎片、3张月布和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一双梦游者长靴。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Boots if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者长靴准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Boots are ready, <name>."}
Q[9091]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护手、8块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者护手。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Handguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者手甲准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Handguards are ready, <name>."}
Q[9092]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的束带、8块皮甲碎片、3张月布和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一条梦游者束带。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Girdle if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者束腰准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Girdle is ready, <name>."}
Q[9093]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腕甲、6块皮甲碎片、1块奥术水晶和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者腕甲。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Wristguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者腕甲准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Wristguards are ready, <name>."}
Q[9095]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的长袍、25块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一件霜火长袍。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Frostfire Robe if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="ou got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer una Toga de Fuego de Escarcha.",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Robe."}
Q[9096]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腿、20块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一副霜火护腿。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Leggings if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos Leotardos de Fuego de Escarcha.",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Leggings."}
Q[9097]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1个被玷污的头环、15块布衣碎片、3张月布和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一个霜火头饰。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Frostfire Circlet if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer un Aro de Fuego de Escarcha.",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Circlet."}
Q[9098]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="La archimaga Angela Dosantos de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este, te hará unas hombreras de Fuego de Escarcha si le llevas lo siguiente: 1 par de hombreras profanadas, 12 restos de ropa, 2 piezas de tela lunar y 3 pellejos bastos curtidos.|n",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Shoulderpads if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unas Hombreras de Fuego de Escarcha.",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Shoulderpads."}
Q[9099]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的便鞋、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一双霜火便鞋。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Sandals if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos Botines de Fuego de Escarcha.",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Sandals."}
Q[9100]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的手套、8块布衣碎片和4张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一双霜火手套。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Gloves if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="¡Excelente $n! obtuviste todo tal como te pedí y ahora puedo hacer unos Guantes de Fuego de Escarcha.",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Gloves."}
