Q[12411]={d="求求你了，$n。我知道你在寻找阿鲁高的踪迹。我以我父亲的名义发誓，一定会帮助你杀掉他。\n\n但……但我必须先求求你，安娅是无辜的，我们不能把她留在这群野兽身旁。\n\n请你先帮我救出妹妹，之后我一定会全力帮助你对付阿鲁高的。\n\n我知道阿纳托雷所说的那个洞穴在哪里，我们从山的另一侧爬上去就能找到。快走吧，我妹妹现在很危险。",dEN="Please, <name>. I know it is Arugal you're after. I swear on my father's memory I will help you take him down.\n\nBut I must beg you... Anya is completely innocent, we cannot leave her with these savages.\n\nHelp me rescue my sister and you'll have me at your side when you face Arugal.\n\nI know the den Anatoly spoke of. We'll find it on the other side of this hill. Let's go, my sister's in danger.",o="在冬至村附近的暗嚎兽穴中寻找安娅。",oEN="Look for Anya in the Duskhowl Den near Solstice Village.",c="我再也不敢来这里了，这些狼人好坏喔。",cEN="I don't want to be here anymore. The worgen-men are mean."}
Q[12412]={d="如果只能向你脑袋里灌输一件事的话，那么我一定会说：必须把联盟从灰熊丘陵彻底赶出去。\n\n这里太重要了，无数的木材，矿石，还有战略缓冲地，这个地方简直是寸土寸金。\n\n当前我们的行动还算成功……但是现在发生了一件事，可能会让胜利的天平略微倒向敌人那边。\n\n遥远的东边有一处林边哨站，那里的猎户竟然想加入联盟。击败他们，不要给他们提供任何威胁到我们的机会。",dEN="If there is one thing I can get through your head, let it be this: the Alliance will be crushed in the Grizzly Hills.\n\nThere is far too much lumber, ore, game and strategic territory for us to give up on any single battlefront here.\n\nSo far we've been successful... but there's something that could tip the scales in our enemy's favor.\n\nFar to the east of here, at the Forest Edge's Post, local trappers seek to join the Alliance. Slaughter them before they have the chance to do so.",o="征服堡的征服者克雷娜要你转至林边哨站，击败8名银溪镇猎人及他们的领袖弗拉德克。",oEN="Conqueror Krenna in Conquest Hold wants you to slay 8 Silverbrook Hunters and their leader, Vladek, at the Forest's Edge Post.",p="任务完成了吗？如果没有的话，那你还待在这儿干嘛？",pEN="Did you complete your task? If not, what are you doing here?",c="你活着回来了。\n\n狼人又做了什么蠢事？",cEN="You're back. And you're alive.\n\nNow what's this nonsense about worgen?"}
Q[12413]={d="几个小时以前，那群猎户还只不过是一群整天威胁说要加入联盟那边的乡巴佬而已。\n\n可现在，他们变成了某种……某种神秘的东西。我不喜欢神秘主义，不喜欢装神弄鬼。我要你转至灰熊丘陵北部的银溪镇，他们就聚集在镇子外面的丘陵上，帮助我的人把他们都清除掉。",dEN="A few hours ago, the trappers were nothing but peasants threatening to add their number to the Alliance's.\n\nNow they've become something else... an uncertainty. I do not like uncertainties. Go to the hills outside their main town in northern Grizzly Hills, Silverbrook, and help my men crush them.",o="征服堡的征服者克雷娜要你转至银溪丘陵，杀死8名银溪镇防御者。",oEN="Conqueror Krenna at Conquest Hold wants you to slay 8 Silverbrook Defenders in the Silverbrook Hills.",p="¿Ya has completado tu tarea, <name>?",pEN="Have you completed your task yet, <name>?",c="Nada mal, <name>. Puede que seas algo más útil de lo que pensé inicialmente.",cEN="Not bad, <name>. You might be slightly more useful than I initially thought."}
Q[12414]={d="斯托曼上尉一直不让我们这些骑……骑兵……好吧……养马的去参加风险湾一带的战斗。\n\n无所事事的我们只好把营地扎到了这处好地方，你看，周围漫山遍野都是高地野马在跑来跑去，从巨石丘陵到东北边，全都是！队长要我负责抓几只野马来补充坐骑。\n\n你愿意帮个忙吗？你看，绳子和棍子都有了，营地周围的土里还长满了野生胡萝卜。你只要拔上几根胡萝卜然后把它用绳子捆在棍子上，一路把野马引回到这里来，就搞定啦，轻松愉快！",dEN="Cap'n Stoutmantle left most of our calvary... cavlary... uh, horsemen at the fight for Venture Bay.\n\nWe chose a good place to put the camp 'cause there are tons of highland mustangs running around near here and in the Boulder Hills to the northeast. The Cap'n put me in charge of capturing some of 'em.\n\nWill you help? I've got a stick and some string, and there are loads of wild carrots growing near the camp. Pick the carrots and use them with the stick to lure in the mustang, then ride it back here.",o="驱赶5匹高地野马回到月溪旅营地的侍从皮尔斯那里。",oEN="Ride 5 Highland Mustangs back to Squire Percy at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",p="你把我们要的野马抓起来了没？",pEN="Did you get all the mustangs we'll need?",c="哇呜！真是好马！我想上尉知道我们的成果一定会很开心的。",cEN="Wow! These sure are good horses! I think the Cap'n will be real pleased with our work."}
Q[12415]={d="La \"Brigada de los Páramos de Poniente\" de la Alianza está acampada muy al norte, cerca de Thor Modan. Han dividido, neciamente, sus fuerzas para combatir nuestro control de Bahía Ventura y se han quedado sin caballería.\n\nAhora están intentando capturar y domar a los mesteños salvajes de las Tierras Altas que corren por la zona que rodea al Campamento de la Brigada de los Páramos de Poniente y las Colinas Pedrusco. Debemos detenerlos antes de que puedan reemplazar a sus monturas perdidas. Coge esto y lánzalo cerca de los caballos para espantarlos.",dEN="The Alliance's 'Westfall Brigade' is camped far to the north, near Thor Modan. They have foolishly divided their forces to contest our control of Venture Bay, and they have been left without cavalry.\n\nThey're now trying to capture and tame the wild highland mustangs that roam the area around the Westfall Brigade Encampment and Boulder Hills. We must stop them before they're able to replace their lost mounts. Take this and throw it near the horses to drive them away.",o="惊吓15匹高地野马，然后向欧尼瓦营地的索鲁克·雷怒复命。",oEN="Scare 15 Highland Mustangs and return to Soulok Stormfury at Camp Oneqwah.",c="<Soulok asiente con aprobación.\n\nBien hecho, <name>. No debemos permitir que la Alianza obtenga ningún tipo de ventaja.",cEN="<Soulok nods in approval.>\n\nWell done, <name>. We must not let the Alliance gain any kind of advantage."}
Q[12416]={d="La Plaga ha invadido el santuario. La vigilante del santuario, Dahlia Toque Solar, ha desaparecido. Los dragones Rojos que defienden el santuario ahora nos invaden en forma de vermis de brasas esqueléticas retorcidas. La situación es grave, $r.\n\nEl capitán Iskandar lidera un grupo de los de tu raza para mantener el río de la Plaga fuera del santuario.\n\nVe en su ayuda... pero, por favor, permanece detrás de sus hombres. Los miembros de la Plaga son infinitos y no me gustaría perderte en alguno de esos perjudicados cañones.",dEN="The Scourge have overrun the shrine. The shrine's keeper, Dahlia Suntouch, is nowhere to be found. The red wyrms that fell in the shrine's defense now beset us in the form of twisted skeletal emberwyrms. The situation is dire, <race>.\n\nCaptain Iskandar leads a group of your kind in stemming the flow of the Scourge out of the shrine.\n\nGo to his aid... but please stay behind his men. The flow of Scourge is endless and I don't want to lose you in one of those scarred canyons.",o="Ayuda al capitán Iskandar en la resistencia en los cañones ayudando a matar a 12 agresores necrófagos gélidos, 8 agresores geists gélidos y 1 agresor abominación gélida.\n\nVuelve junto a Ceristrasz cuando hayas terminado esta tarea.",oEN="Aid Captain Iskandar in holding the canyons by participating in the death of 12 Frigid Ghoul Attackers, 8 Frigid Geist Attackers, and 1 Frigid Abomination Attacker.\n\nReturn to Ceristrasz once you have finished this task.",p="Me alegra que sigas con nosotros, <race>.",pEN="I'm glad you're still with us, <race>.",c="这个任务令人作呕，但我为你的付出表示感激。\n\n天灾军团不能向龙眠神殿推进任何一步，否则我们一定会失守的。",cEN="It is a disgusting task, but I thank you dearly for doing it.\n\nThe Scourge cannot be permitted to push any further towards Wyrmrest or we are sure to lose it."}
Q[12417]={d="还有件事要交给你办。我有很多兄弟都在激烈的空战中阵亡了。如果我们不赶快行动的话，他们就会加入灰烬之龙的队伍。\n\n请你从南面或北面的小路进入圣地……那里的天灾军团应该比较少。\n\n在圣地里寻找从树上掉下来的红玉橡果，然后把它们种在我死去的同胞们的尸体旁。这样他们就能获得新生……这是红龙氏族的高贵宿命。",dEN="I have another task that needs attention. I have brothers who are falling in the battle overhead and if we do not act quickly, they will only bolster the emberwyrm ranks.\n\nGet into the shrine through one of the other passes to the south or north... the Scourge presence should be lighter there.\n\nSearch the shrine for ruby acorns that have fallen from the tree and plant them near the bodies of my fallen brood. Through this, they can give new life... a proud fate for any of my kind.",o="从南面或北面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地并寻找红玉橡果。对死去的红龙使用红玉橡果，让他们的尸体回归大地。完成任务后向塞雷斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through one of the northern or southern passes and search for Ruby Acorns. Use the Ruby Acorns on the fallen red dragons to return their bodies to the earth. Return to Ceristrasz once the task is complete.",p="我都已经开始担心龙殿里的天灾军团夺走了你。你还活着真好。",pEN="I started to worry that the Scourge in the shrine had claimed you. It is good that you yet live.",c="En la tierra, mis hermanos pueden otorgar vida de nuevo. Los has salvado de un destino mucho peor que la muerte.\n\nNo conozco ni una palabra en tu lengua que pueda expresar lo mucho que esto significa para los míos. Gracias, <race>.",cEN="In the earth, my brothers can grant life anew. You have saved them from a fate far worse than death.\n\nI don't know a word in your tongue that could express how much this means to my kind. Thank you, <race>."}
Q[12418]={d="我还有最后一个任务要给你，$r……一个足以扭转战局的任务。\n\n请你回到圣地，去杀死那些指挥战斗的通灵师。只要他们死了，我们就能击退天灾的军队，并慢慢夺回圣地。\n\n我还要你去找到圣地下面的堕落之源并摧毁它。\n\n我知道我要你做的事情太多了，但如果你能做到的话，我们就可以赢得这场战斗。",dEN="I have one final task for you, <race>... one that should turn the tide of this fight.\n\nReturn to the shrine and kill the necromancers that are fueling this onslaught. With them dead, we should be able to beat these forces back and eventually retake the shrine.\n\nI also need you to find the source of the corruption under the shrine and put an end to it.\n\nI know I have asked a lot of you, but if you do this for me, we will win this battle.",o="从南面或北面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地，杀死6个冰冷通灵师并摧毁圣地下面的堕落之源。完成任务后向塞雷斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through one of the northern or southern passes, then kill 6 Frigid Necromancers and eliminate the source of the corruption under the shrine. Return to Ceristrasz once the task is complete.",p="你回来了！你完成了我要求的事情吗？",pEN="You've returned! Have you don as I've asked of you?",c="Dahlia... ¿la han transformado?\n\nDahlia nos ha sido leal durante mucho tiempo... si pueden corromper a un ser con su devoción, no es un buen augurio para el resto de las razas jóvenes. Gracias por liberarla. Espero que haya encontrado algo de paz.\n\nNos has honrado con tu ayuda desinteresada hoy, <race>. Enviaré noticias al consejo sobre lo que los tuyos han logrado aquí. Ve con nuestra bendición.",cEN="Dahlia... they turned her?\n\nDahlia has been loyal to us for a very long time... if they can corrupt a being of her devotion, it does not bode well for the rest of the young races. Thank you for freeing her. I hope she has found some peace.\n\nYou have honored us with your selfless assistance today, <race>. I will send word to the council of what your kind have accomplished here. Go with our blessing."}
Q[12419]={d="你捡起这只胸针之后，发现它所发出的微弱光芒又黯淡了一些。\n\n克拉苏斯一定很关心达莉亚的命运。把这只胸针带回龙眠神殿交给他吧。",dEN="As you pick up the brooch, its faint glow brightens slightly.\n\nKrasus will want to know of Dahlia's fate. Take the brooch to him at Wyrmrest.",o="将达莉亚的红玉胸针带回龙眠神殿的议会大厅交给克拉苏斯，并将她的命运告诉他。",oEN="Bring Dahlia Suntouch's Ruby Brooch to Krasus in the Ruling Council Chamber at Wyrmrest and inform him of Dahlia's fate.",p="Hola, <race>. Siento la presencia de mi broche de rubí. Dámelo.\n\n¿Qué ha sido de Dahlia?",pEN="Hello, <race>. I sense the presence of my Ruby Brooch. Hand it here.\n\nWhat has become of Dahlia?",c="达莉亚陷落于天灾军团之手？对我们所有人来说，这真是悲伤的一天。\n\n我们夺回龙眠神殿之后我会重新找一个看守者。感谢你的努力……红玉巨龙圣地对我们来说是个圣地，你们族类所做的努力不会轻易地被遗忘的。\n\n知道还有像你这样的英雄真好——将来有一天我会召唤你来。直到那天到来，祝你冒险顺利、成果丰硕。",cEN="Dahlia was taken by the Scourge? This is a sad day for all of us.\n\nI will look to finding a new keeper once the shrine is retaken. Thank you for your efforts... the Ruby Dragonshrine is a sacred place to us, and the sacrifices your kind have made will not be easily forgotten.\n\nIt is good to know there are still heroes such as you - I will call upon you one day. Until that day comes, may your adventures be fruitful."}
Q[12420]={d="Ser miembro tiene sus ventajas. Formar parte del Club de la \"Cerveza del Mes\" significa saber dónde conseguir la última y mejor cerveza.\n\nLlévale tu formulario de socio del Club de la \"Cerveza del Mes\" a Larkin Cebatruenos en la Taberna Roca de Fuego en Forjaz.",dEN="Membership has its privileges. Being part of the \"Brew of the Month\" club means knowing where to get the latest and greatest brew.\n\nBring your \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge.",o="Llévale el formulario de socio del Club de la \"Cerveza del Mes\" a Larkin Cebatruenos en la Taberna Roca de Fuego en Forjaz.",oEN="Bring the \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge.",p="你填妥会员表格了吗？",pEN="Do you have your membership forms filled out?",c="Tus papeles parecen estar en orden. ¡Bienvenido al club, <name>!\n\nPuedes esperar recibir nuestro correo al principio de cada mes. Si te gusta lo que has recibido, pásate y podremos venderte más. Este es el club que no deja de dar.",cEN="Your paperwork looks to be in order. Welcome to the club, <name>!\n\nYou can expect to get our mail at the start of every month. If you like what you got, stop by and we can sell you some more. This is the club that keeps on giving."}
Q[12421]={d="La unión hace la fuerza, $n. Formar parte del Club de la \"Cerveza del Mes\" significa saber que tú y los tuyos podréis conseguir siempre la mejor cerveza.\n\nLlévale tu formulario de socio del Club de la \"Cerveza del Mes\" a Ray'ma en Orgrimmar.",dEN="There is strength in numbers, <name>. Being part of the \"Brew of the Month\" club means knowing you and your brethren will always have access to the best brew.\n\nBring your \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",o="Llévale el formulario de socio del Club de la \"Cerveza del Mes\" a Ray'ma en Orgrimmar.",oEN="Bring the \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",p="你填妥会员表格了吗？",pEN="Do ya have your membership forms filled out?",c="¿Así que te vas a unir a nuestras filas, <name>? Aquí te tratamos bien. ¡Solo recibes lo mejor cuando formas parte de este club!\n\nTe enviaremos cerveza al principio de cada mes. Si te gusta lo que recibes y quieres más, vuelve por aquí. Nos aseguraremos de que recibas más de la cerveza que te gusta.",cEN="So you be joinin' our ranks, <name>? We treat ya nice here. You only get the best when you part of dis club!\n\nWe be sendin' out brew to you at da start of every month. If you like what you got, and you be wantin' more, head back over here. We make sure you get more of da brew you like."}
Q[12422]={d="听着，$n。我要求你立刻前去执行一项需要高度判断力与效率的任务。\n\n克雷娜手下的一位高级士官在银溪镇外围获取了一名猎户流亡者。如果按照他们以往的方式来行事，那么这名战俘将在日落之前被处死。\n\n但我们不能让他们这么简单地把她处决掉。你看，这名战俘看起来跟米克哈尔日记中所描述的长女非常相似。\n\n如果我们放了她，并暗地跟踪她的话，就可以轻松地找到控制着那些猎户的真正幕后黑手。快，带着这封信去找她。",dEN="Listen, <name>. I need you to act with discretion and speed.\n\nOne of Krenna's top sergeants has captured a trapper outcast outside of Silverbrook. Now, if things turn out the way they usually do, the prisoner is going to be executed before the day is over.\n\nWe can't let that happen. You see, the prisoner matches the description of Mikhail's older daughter in his diary.\n\nIf we set her loose and follow her closely, she'll lead us to whoever's controlling the trappers. Take this letter to her.",o="带着特赦信转至银溪丘陵，将信交给被囚禁的猎户。",oEN="Deliver the Letter of Amnesty to the Captured Trapper in Silverbrook Hills.",p="你是来杀我的吗？",pEN="Are you here to kill me?",c="你是来放我走的……就这样？听着，我不想跟你有任何瓜葛……这些浑球杀了我的父亲，带走了我的姊姊。我现在有别的事要操心。",cEN="You're going to let me go... just like that? Listen, I don't want any trouble with you... these monsters killed my father and took my sister. I have other things on my mind right now."}
Q[12423]={d="根据你所掌握的情况，你认为这本日记是一个名叫米克哈尔的银溪镇居民写下的。\n\n他想必使用了人类通用语的某种变体或是方言，以防被人读懂其中的内容。或许你应该将这本书交给征服者克雷娜。",dEN="From what you can gather, this journal was written by a denizen of Silverbrook named Mikhail.\n\nIt is written in some variant of the common human tongue. Perhaps you should bring this back to Conqueror Krenna.",o="将米克哈尔的日记交给征服堡的征服者克雷娜。",oEN="Bring Mikhail's Journal to Conqueror Krenna in Conquest Hold.",p="你手上拿着什么？",pEN="What's that you've got there?",c="哈！这是某种笑话吗？\n\n我能读得懂的书几乎都对我没什么用。",cEN="Hah! Is this some sort of joke?\n\nI barely have any use for books I can actually understand."}
Q[12424]={d="嗯，没错，这日记的确是人类所用的猪一般的语言写成的。直接烧了吧，没什么价值。\n\n把它交给我妹妹高戈娜，别浪费我的时间了。",dEN="This book is written in the pig-tongue the humans use. It needs to be burned immediately.\n\nHand it to my sister Gorgonna and do not waste my time.",o="将米克哈尔的日记交给征服堡的高戈娜。",oEN="Bring Mikhail's Journal to Gorgonna in Conquest Hold.",p="你有东西要给我看？",pEN="You have something to show me?",c="¿Podría ser? El hombre que escribió este diario temía por la vida de sus hijas, así que las envió lejos de Silverbrook.\n\nAcabamos de capturar a un paria en las afueras del pueblo de una edad similar a la de la hija mayor.\n\nEscucha, <name>. Aquí está pasando más de lo que parece... no podemos simplemente quemar este diario.",cEN="Could it be? The man who wrote this journal feared for his daughters' lives so he sent them away from Silverbrook.\n\nWe just captured an outcast in the outskirts of town about the same age as the eldest daughter.\n\nListen, <name>. There's more happening here than meets the eye... we can't just burn this diary."}
Q[12425]={d="看来那帮猎户的事闹得比我们之前所估计的更严重了。\n\n如果没有和联盟勾搭上的话，这很有可能意味着他们投靠了天灾军团，那可就更麻烦了。\n\n不过，我们的努力也没有白费。我们发现之前放走的那个战俘跑去和一名占卜师碰面了，可惜我们把她给跟丢了。\n\n我敢肯定她可以让我们重新找到敌人的领袖，但前提是我们必须先找到她。去拜访那个盲眼卢娜，看看能了解到什么消息。",dEN="This trapper business has the potential to be more important than we've accounted for.\n\nIf they're not with the Alliance, there's a good chance they're with the Scourge, which could mean trouble.\n\nOur previous efforts might've paid off, though. We spotted our former captive meeting with a fortune teller of some sort before we lost track of her.\n\nI'm almost certain now that she will take us to their leader if we can find her again. Find Ruuna the Blind and see what you can find out.",o="转至沃达希尔小径附近的卢娜的营地，与盲眼卢娜谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ruuna the Blind at Ruuna's Camp near Vordrassil Pass.",c="你寻求你所接触不到的知识，所以你来找我。我必须警告你，陌生人，我给的答案也许你不会喜欢。",cEN="You seek knowledge beyond your reach so you've come to me. I must warn you, stranger, the answers I provide might not be to your liking."}
Q[12427]={d="Así que te interesan las peleas, ¿verdad? Bueno, Krenna ha prohibido las peleas en el foso a todos los combatientes alistados. Pero tú, $gamigo:amiga; $gmío:mía; eres técnicamente $gun:una; agente libre y la prohibición no te incluye.\n\nVaya agujero legal, ¿verdad?\n\nBueno, si quieres puedo hacer que empieces contra algo fácil, un oso pequeño. ¡Hasta te dejaré que te traigas amigos!",dEN="So you're interested in the fights, eh? Well, Krenna has outlawed pit-fighting for all enlisted combatants. But you, my friend, are technically a free agent and are not included in this prohibition.\n\nNice loophole, eh?\n\nAnyway, if you're interested I can start you off with something easy, a measly bear. I'll even let you bring friends along!",o="击败征服斗兽场内的铁皮，然后找赌徒维尔金领取奖赏。",oEN="Defeat Ironhide inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",p="直到你跟这头熊其中一个倒下以后才算结束，朋友！",pEN="It's not over until you or the bear tips over, friend!",c="做得好，老兄！这是你的份。",cEN="Nice work, mon! Here's your cut."}
Q[12428]={d="你不错嘛。相当不错嘛。\n\n不过，你敢弄翻一头熊怪吗？敢吗？诺森德本地的超大体型熊怪哦？\n\n好，很好，非常好，来，叫上你的伙伴，进竞技场吧。让那些观众们好好高兴高兴……没准我们等下就能赚一笔啦。",dEN="You're not bad. Not bad at all.\n\nThink you can take a furbolg? What about one of those extra-large crazed Northrend furbolgs?\n\nGood, good. Get your crew together, and head to the ring. Let's give these folks a show... maybe we can earn some more coin while we're at it.",o="Derrota a Torgg Tótem Relámpago en el Foso de la Conquista y habla con el corredor Vel'jen para conseguir una recompensa.|n",oEN="Defeat Torgg Thundertotem inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",c="真是犀利的动作，朋友！很多人赌你输，这真是个利多的好消息！",cEN="Those were some sharp moves, friend! Lots of bets against you, which is good news cash-wise!"}
Q[12429]={d="Está bien tener a un $gluchador:luchadora; de verdad por aquí... las últimas semanas solo hemos tenido prisioneros y bestias enjauladas. La gente se aburría, ¿sabes?\n\nBueno, tu próximo desafío es un gólem de hierro auténtico robado de las profundidades de Thor Modan... ¿crees que podrás con ello?",dEN="It's nice to have a real fighter around these parts... we'd only had prisoners and caged beasts for the past few weeks. The people get bored, ya know?\n\nAnyhow, your next challenge is a genuine iron golem stolen from the depths of Thor Modan... think you can swing it?",o="Derrota a Sangre Oxidada en el Foso de la Conquista y habla con el corredor Vel'jen para conseguir una recompensa.|n",oEN="Defeat Rustblood inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",c="我的心跳几乎都漏了一拍！还以为那堆铁要把你放倒了呢，老兄！",cEN="My heart nearly skipped a beat there! Thought that mound of metal was gonna get ya, mon!"}
Q[12430]={d="Voy a ser directo contigo, $gchico:chica;. El siguiente contendiente es un asesino.\n\nLiteralmente.\n\nIba a ser ejecutado la semana pasada, pero estranguló al ahorcador con su mano izquierda, así que los guardias de Krenna han dejado que me lo quede.\n\nSi esta vez quieres pasar, lo entenderé. No te culparía.",dEN="I'm gonna shoot straight with ya, kid. This next contender's a murderer.\n\nLiterally.\n\nHe was to be executed last week, but he strangled the hangman with his left hand, so Krenna's guards sort of let me have him.\n\nFeel free to pass on this one. I wouldn't blame ya.",o="Derrota a Horgrenn Garra Infernal en el Foso de la Conquista y habla con el corredor Vel'jen para conseguir una recompensa.|n",oEN="Defeat Horgrenn Hellcleave inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",c="花俏的步法，花俏的步法。你真的很快就解决掉那个疯兽人了，朋友。\n\n赌你输的赔率是七赔一我可真是赚了不少！",cEN="Fancy footwork, fancy footwork. You really made quick work of that crazy orc, friend.\n\nOdds were against you seven-to-one; made some nice coin on that one!"}
Q[12431]={d="你这下肯定把克雷娜给惹怒啦。她跟高戈娜吵了一架，而且要求你立刻去那里面应战。\n\n有传闻说，这次要打，那可是至死方休！对你来说绝对是个坏消息，但对我们的商业利益来说可再好不过啦！\n\n怎么说呢……你的确是太背运了点……好了好了，赶紧进去吧，挺过去就没事了。",dEN="You must've really upset Krenna. She and Gorgonna have had a spat and you're wanted in the pit immediately.\n\nThere are some wild rumors that it's a fight to the death! That would be bad news for you, but great news for our business venture!\n\nAt any rate, you can't run away from fate... best get in there on the quick and get it over with.",o="击败征服斗兽场内的克雷娜，然后找高戈娜领取奖赏。",oEN="Defeat Krenna in the Conquest Pit and speak to Gorgonna for a reward.",c="\"Lo que ha pasado hoy... tenía que pasar. No significa que tenga que alegrarme por ello.\n\nHe liberado a mi pueblo de un tirano, pero también he perdido a una hermana. Te agradezco tu ayuda, <name>. Ahora deseo estar sola.\"",cEN="What happened today... had to happen. It doesn't mean I have to be happy about it.\n\nI've freed my people from a tyrant, but I've also lost a sister. I thank you for your help, <name>. I wish to be alone now."}
Q[12432]={d="¡Oye, tú, $r! ¡Trae tu vago cuerpo hasta aquí!\n\nLa Alianza tiene un cargamento de madera preparado para transportarlo al noreste de aquí. Como no podemos echarle el guante a esa madera, solo se puede hacer una cosa: ¡destruirla!\n\nEl goblin al final del muelle tiene unos torpedos preparados para lanzarlos. Tiene todo el combustible para ellos almacenado en el barco goblin atracado al norte.\n\nHazte con algo de combustible, requisa uno de los torpedos y estámpalo contra su nave.\n\n¡Rompan filas!",dEN="You there, <race>! Get your lousy carcass over here!\n\nThe Alliance have a shipment of lumber all ready for transport just northeast of here. Since getting our hands on that wood is out of the question, there's only one thing to do - destroy it!\n\nThe goblin at the end of the dock here has some torpedoes all ready to go. He's got all the fuel for them on the docked goblin ship to the north.\n\nGet some fuel, then commandeer one of the torpedoes and ride it into their ship.\n\nDismissed!",o="风险湾灯塔的高洛克将军希望你去摧毁联盟的木材运输船。\n\n只有在部落占领灯塔的时候，高洛克将军才会出现。",oEN="General Gorlok at the lighthouse in Venture Bay wants you to destroy the Alliance Lumber Boat.\n\nGeneral Gorlok will only be present at the lighthouse when the Horde has it in their possession.",p="¿Se ha quemado ya esa madera de la Alianza, <class>?",pEN="Has that Alliance lumber been burned yet, <class>?",c="¡Ja, ja! ¡Qué viaje, eh <class>?\n\nSi no podemos controlar los recursos aquí, ¡entonces nadie podrá!\n\n¿Cuándo se darán cuenta esas insignificantes plagas de la Alianza de que no son rival para el poder de la Horda?",cEN="Ha hah! What a ride, eh <class>?\n\nIf we can't control the resources here, then no one can!\n\nWhen will those puny Alliance pests realize that they are no match for the might of the Horde?"}
Q[12433]={d="不会吧！又坏了一个垫圈……\n\n每次有垫圈坏掉，润滑剂都会流得到处都是。如果没有溶解剂的话，就得折腾好几个小时才能清理干净。\n\n我跟你说啊，在风险投资公司闯入的那个港口里有一种奇特的火箭燃料——我想他们把它称为“115号元素”。那东西可是很猛的溶解剂哦。\n\n帮我弄些过来，我不会让你白辛苦的。",dEN="Gah! Not again. Another blown gasket....\n\nEvery time one of these goes, lubricant gums up all of the gears. Without solvent, it takes hours to clean.\n\nTell ya what, <race>. There's some fancy rocket fuel on the Venture Company barge in the dock there - element 115 I think they call it. That stuff makes for a great solvent.\n\nGet me one of those and I'll make it worth your trouble.",o="风险湾部落基地的古图尔要你取回一罐115号元素。",oEN="Gurtor at the Venture Bay Horde base wants you to bring him a canister of Element 115.",p="¿Has conseguido algo de ese elemento 115, <name>?",pEN="You got some of that element 115, <name>?",c="啊，没错，可以替我节省下许多时间了。\n\n收下这个，当作我麻烦你的回报，朋友。帮我多找一些115号元素来，你找到多少我收多少。",cEN="Ahh yes. That'll save me hours.\n\nTake this for your trouble, friend. And keep an eye out for more element 115. I'll take all you can find."}
Q[12435]={d="我讨厌生命的消逝……任何生命都一样。但我不会放弃抵抗，我不会让玛里苟斯杀死我们并玷污神殿！\n\n我已经指派阿弗拉沙斯塔兹全权负责龙眠神殿的防御事宜。\n\n去找托拉斯塔萨谈谈，让他派一条幼龙载你去找阿弗拉沙斯塔兹吧。\n\n请你帮助他，$n。你是守卫龙眠神殿、挫败蓝龙军团的关键。",dEN="I abhor the loss of life... any life. But I will not stand idly by and allow Malygos to kill us and defile the temple!\n\nI have appointed Lord Afrasastrasz as the commander of Wyrmrest's defenses.\n\nSpeak with Torastrasza to ride a drake down to him.\n\nPlease lend him your aid, <name>. Your involvement with the defense of Wyrmrest will be critical to us prevailing against the blue dragonflight.",o="与龙眠神殿的阿弗拉沙斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lord Afrasastrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="Debes de ser <name>. La reina me informó de que vendrías.\n\nSi estás dispuesto, necesitamos mucho tu ayuda.",cEN="You must be <name>. The queen informed me that you would be coming.\n\nIf you are willing, we are in great need of your assistance."}
Q[12436]={d="向你致敬，$c。不知道你有没有发现，在征服堡这个地方，一切都在克蕾娜的控制之下，我们买克蕾娜让我们买的，卖克蕾娜让我们卖的，连价格都是克蕾娜规定好的。\n\n这一些都在让这里的经济死亡！我决定偷偷赚一笔小钱，顺便让步兵小伙子们饱点口福。你不如去猎几头鹿，然后给我弄点鹿肉回来，怎么样？\n\n这附近的鹿可真是漫山遍野，所以呢，你必须只挑选最好的肉。",dEN="Hail, <class>. You'll find that here at Conquest Hold, we buy and sell what Krenna wants us to buy and sell... at the price that Krenna wants us to buy and sell.\n\nAll this is stifling business. I'm hoping to make a little bit of coin on the side and feed our grunts at the same time. Why don't you go hunt down some stag and bring me the venison?\n\nThey're numerous in the area, so bring me only the best meat.",o="征服堡的粮食商人洛克兰要求你从附近的耸角雄鹿身上采集5块肥美的鹿肉。",oEN="Provisioner Lorkran at Conquest Hold wants you to obtain 5 Succulent Venison from the nearby Tallhorn Stag.",p="¿Has conseguido ya ese venado, <name>?",pEN="You get that venison yet, <name>?",c="Buen trabajo, <name>. Estos alimentarán a dos o tres gruñidos cada uno. Nada mal.",cEN="Nice job, <name>. These will feed two or three grunts each. Not bad."}
Q[12437]={d="听着，$n。这场战斗说穿了无非就是在比谁的资源多。\n\n我有一个计划，可以让我们对部落占有更大的优势。\n\n在码头尽头停泊着一些鱼雷，我们可以利用它们击毁部落停泊在西北面的木材运输船。\n\n你去北边港口里的地精船只那里弄些燃料，然后骑在一枚鱼雷上，直接冲进他们的运输船里去！",dEN="Listen, <name>. This battle is as much over resources as tactical supremacy.\n\nI have a mission that could turn the tide in our struggle against the Horde here.\n\nThere are torpedoes at the end of the dock that we can use to take down the Horde's lumber ship to the northwest.\n\nYou'll need to get some of the fuel that's stored on the docked goblin ship just north of here, then ride one of the torpedoes into their transport!",o="风险湾灯塔的霍瑟尔司令希望你去摧毁部落的木材运输船。\n\n只有在联盟占领灯塔的时候，霍瑟尔司令才会出现。",oEN="Commander Howser at the lighthouse in Venture Bay wants you to destroy the Horde lumber shipment.\n\nCommander Howser will only be present at the lighthouse when the Alliance has it in their possession.",p="¿Ya han quemado ese barco de madera de la Horda, <name>?",pEN="Has that Horde lumber ship been burned yet, <name>?",c="Me alegra ver que has sobrevivido a ese impacto. ¡Menuda explosión!\n\nNo podemos permitir que la Horda se lleve toda esa madera.\n\nBien hecho, <class>.",cEN="Good to see that you survived that impact. Quite the explosion!\n\nWe can't afford for the Horde to make off with all that lumber.\n\nWell done, <class>."}
Q[12438]={d="悬赏发布人伊露希亚·卢恩\n\n一个名叫克留格·碎誓者的天灾军团血肉巨人杀死了我的丈夫、孩子和我最好的朋友，韦斯帕尔一家。敢于揭下这张布告的勇士可以在腐臭平原东南边的海岸附近找到克留格。\n\n我要为死者讨回公道！去杀死克留格·碎誓者！\n\n杀死克留格的勇士可以去向李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取金钱和物品奖赏。\n\n请为我们伸张正义！",dEN="Posted by: Illusia Lune\n\nThe Scourge flesh giant known as Kreug Oathbreaker was responsible for the deaths of my husband, children and my dear friends, the Whisperveils. Those brave enough to take on this bounty will find Kreug in the southeastern reaches of the Carrion Fields.\n\nI demand justice! Kill Kreug Oathbreaker!\n\nIn the event that Kreug is slain, I have pooled money and items together and given them to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to give out as a reward.\n\nPlease vindicate us!",o="杀死克留格·碎誓者，然后转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，向李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取奖赏。",oEN="Kill Kreug Oathbreaker and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",p="你是来领赏的吗，盟友？",pEN="Are you here to collect a bounty, ally?",c="Bien hecho, <name>. ¡Le notificaré a Illusia que un héroe ha escuchado su llamada de auxilio y ha surgido para afrontar el desafío! Aquí tienes tu recompensa.",cEN="Well done, <name>. I will notify Illusia that a hero has heard her call for help and risen to meet the challenge! Here is your reward."}
Q[12439]={d="有一股力量正在试图毁灭我们所珍惜的一切，$n。你必须转至西方的群星之墓。大法师茉德拉感觉到我们这个世界的魔法基础正在动摇，我们必须立刻解决这个问题！\n\n现在就出发吧，$n！去和暮冬要塞狮鹫站的罗尼·威尔士谈一谈，把你的任务告诉他。他会让最快的狮鹫送你转至群星之墓。到达目的地以后，去找大法师茉德拉谈一谈。",dEN="Another force threatens to destroy all that we have worked for, <name>. You must head westward to Stars' Rest. Archmage Modera has sensed a great disturbance in the magical ley lines of our world that must be dealt with immediately!\n\nGo now, <name>! Speak to Rodney Wells at the gryphon station here in Wintergarde and let him know the nature of your mission. He will place you on his fastest gryphon to deliver you to Stars' Rest. Speak with Archmage Modera when you arrive.",o="去和暮冬要塞的罗尼·威尔士谈一谈，向他要一头坐骑，转至龙骨荒野西部的群星之墓。",oEN="Speak to Rodney Wells at Wintergarde Keep to secure a ride to Stars' Rest in western Dragonblight.",c="我们绝对不能承受另一次分裂了，朋友。我会尽我一切努力帮助你完成任务。",cEN="We definitely don't want another sundering, friend. I'll do all that I can to help you on your mission."}
Q[12440]={d="Cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;, te pondré sobre mi grifo más veloz hacia Reposo Estelar. Cuando llegues allí, busca a la archimaga Modera.\n\n¡Buena suerte, $galiado:aliada;!",dEN="When you are ready I will place you on my fastest gryphon to Stars' Rest. Once you get there, find and speak with Archmage Modera.\n\nGood luck, ally!",o="Habla con la imagen de la archimaga Modera en Reposo Estelar al oeste del Cementerio de Dragones.|n",oEN="Speak with the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest in western Dragonblight.",c="瓦思听见我的哀号了吗？即使是一瞬间也好，朋友。",cEN="Vas heard my distress call then, eh? Not a moment too soon, friend."}
Q[12441]={d="悬赏发布人：德洛菲\n\n我和我的表亲，斯克罗提和布鲁特，在埃尔德齐断崖遭到了一群邪恶的血爪氏族狼獾人的袭击。我们逃走了，但斯克罗提和布鲁特恐怕被他们抓住了。\n\n我要报仇雪恨！在此招募无畏的勇士转至龙骨荒野东南部的埃尔德齐断崖，杀死高阶萨满祭司德金·血爪和他的爪牙。\n\n杀死这个恶棍的勇士可以向李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取大笔赏金！",dEN="Posted by: Drolfy\n\nWhile out in the Eldritch Heights with my cousins, Skrotee and Brote, a vicious band of wolvar from the Bloodpaw tribe attacked us. We attempted to flee, but I fear they got Skrotee and Brote.\n\nI demand retribution! Is there someone brave enough to venture to the southeastern reaches of Dragonblight, to the Eldritch Heights, and kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and his cronies?\n\nI have given a hefty sum of gold to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to disperse to anyone that claims this bounty!",o="杀死高阶萨满祭司德金·血爪，然后转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，找李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取奖赏。",oEN="Kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",p="你解决血掌了吗？",pEN="Have you faced Bloodpaw?",c="¡Un trabajo excepcional, <name>! ¡Le notificaré a Drolfy que un héroe se alzó para enfrentar su desafío y que el cruel Bloodpaw ya no existe!",cEN="Outstanding work, <name>! I will notify Drolfy that a hero did rise to meet his challenge and that the cruel Bloodpaw is no more!"}
Q[12442]={d="Enviado por el Alto señor Leoric Von Zeldig\n\nUn batallón de la Séptima Legión fue asesinado en una emboscada del Comandante del Embate Iustus y un ejército de zelotes sin cerebro de El Embate Escarlata en el sendero del noreste de Hibergarde. ¡Tenemos que hacerles pagar estos ataques tan fríos y calculados!\n\n¡Hibergarde pide justicia! Busca al Comandante del Embate Iustus en el campamento del Embate al noreste y acaba con su miserable existencia.\n\n¡Recompensaré a cualquiera que se atreva con esta tarea!|n",dEN="Posted by: Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig\n\nUpon the northeastern path from Wintergarde a battalion of 7th Legion were ambushed and slain by Onslaught Commander Iustus and an army of mindless Scarlet Onslaught zealots. Such cold and calculated actions must be met with force!\n\nWintergarde demands justice! Seek out Onslaught Commander Iustus at Onslaught Base Camp to the northeast and end his miserable existence.\n\nI will hand out the reward for this bounty to any who would dare take up the task!",o="Mata al Comandante del Embate Iustus y vuelve a ver al alto señor Leoric Von Zeldig en la Fortaleza de Hibergarde del Cementerio de Dragones para recoger tu recompensa.|n",oEN="Kill Onslaught Commander Iustus and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",p="<李奥瑞克咬牙切齿说道。>\n\n那个自负的蠢蛋死了没？",pEN="<Leoric grits his teeth.>\n\nIs that pompous fool dead?",c="Al menos por ahora, el Embestida Escarlata sufre un revés en sus nefastos planes. Has prestado un gran servicio a Wintergarde, <name>.",cEN="At least for now the Scarlet Onslaught suffers a setback in their nefarious plans. You have done Wintergarde a great service, <name>."}
Q[12443]={d="不会吧！又坏了一个垫圈……\n\n每次有垫圈坏掉，润滑剂都会流得到处都是。如果没有溶解剂的话，就得折腾好几个小时才能清理干净。\n\n我跟你说啊，在风险投资公司闯入的那个港口里有一种奇特的火箭燃料——我想他们把它称为“115号元素”。那东西可是很猛的溶解剂哦。\n\n帮我弄些过来，我不会让你白辛苦的。",dEN="Gah! Not again. Another blown gasket....\n\nEvery time one of these goes, lubricant gums up all of the gears. Without solvent, it takes hours to clean.\n\nTell ya what, <race>. There's some fancy rocket fuel on the Venture Company barge in the dock there - element 115 I think they call it. That stuff makes for a great solvent.\n\nGet me one of those and I'll make it worth your trouble.",o="风险湾联盟基地的巴布芬克要你取回一罐115号元素。",oEN="Barblefink at the Alliance base in Venture Bay wants you to bring him a canister of Element 115.",p="¿Has conseguido algo de ese elemento 115, <name>?",pEN="You got some of that element 115, <name>?",c="啊，没错，可以替我节省下许多时间了。\n\n收下这个，当作我麻烦你的回报，朋友。帮我多找一些115号元素来，你找到多少我收多少。",cEN="Ahh yes. That'll save me hours.\n\nTake this for your trouble, friend. And keep an eye out for more element 115. I'll take all you can find."}
Q[12444]={d="风险投资公司正在撤离灰熊丘陵。他们以前在这里运作着木材生意，但眼下的形势对他们来说有点太危险了。\n\n他们放弃的伐木场现在很容易就能占领，我们肯定不能让部落占领它们。\n\n黑水伐木场是这一地区的三处伐木场中最小的一个，但我们仍然需要它。你的任务就是去赶走部落的部队，他们从这里获得的任何木材都将是在别处对抗我们的武器。",dEN="The Venture Company's on its way out of Grizzly Hills. They used to run logging operations here, but things got a little too dangerous for them.\n\nTheir abandoned sites are up for grabs and we sure as hell can't let the Horde get their hands on them.\n\nThe Blackriver Logging Camp is the smallest of the three logging sites in this zone, but we still need it. Do your part and fend off the Horde forces. Any lumber they get here will be made into weapons to be used against us elsewhere.",o="斥候队长卡特尔希望你在黑水伐木场击杀10名部落士兵或者玩家。",oEN="Scout Captain Carter wants you to kill 10 Horde units or players in the Blackriver Logging Camp.",p="狩猎情形如何？",pEN="How's the hunt going?",c="Buen trabajo, <name>. Nos vendrían bien más gente como tú por aquí. Podríamos demostrarle a la Horda que no debe meterse con nosotros.",cEN="Nice work, <name>. We could use a few more folks like you up here. We could really show the Horde not to mess with us."}
Q[12447]={d="La Plaga se acerca. Korialstrasz llama a sus aliados en un vano intento de salvar su Santuario de Dragones Rubí, pero parece que la gentileza del Vuelo Rojo no se extiende a la salvación de los santuarios del resto de Vuelos.\n\n¿$gSorprendido:Sorprendida;? Yo no.\n\nOtro de mi raza se fue a despejar el Santuario de Dragones Obsidiana de las alimañas no-muertas que ahora lo infestan. Todo lo que te costaría demostrar que tienes más nobleza y rectitud que Alexstrasza es una rápida escapadita hasta allí y unos pocos movimientos con tu hoja.\n\nQué divertido.",dEN="The Scourge come. Korialstrasz calls upon his allies in a futile attempt to save their Ruby Dragonshrine, but it seems the good graces of the red flight don't extend to saving the shrines of the other flights.\n\nSurprised? I'm not.\n\nThere is another of my brood who has left to clear our Obsidian Dragonshrine of the undead vermin that now infest it. All it would take to prove yourself more noble and righteous than Alexstrasza herself is a quick jaunt over there and a few swings of a blade.\n\nI'm amused.",o="转至位于龙眠神殿西北方、天灾之门正西方的黑曜石巨龙圣地，找到瑟里纳尔并帮助他。",oEN="Travel to the Obsidian Dragonshrine Northwest of Wymrest and just West of the Wrath Gate. Locate Serinar inside of the shrine and offer him your aid.",c="我得想想哪件事让我比较讶异……是你真的愿意来帮助一只黑龙呢，还是你跟纳莉丝说完话之后居然还能活着。\n\n她连讲话都会滴出毒液，但是我猜龙眠神殿可能可以抑制我们。\n\n也许只是因为红龙军团环伺在她四周罢了。",cEN="I'm trying to decide at which I'm more surprised... that you actually came to the aid of a Black Dragon or that you're still in one piece after speaking with Nalice.\n\nHer words drip venom, but I suppose Wyrmrest can keep even our kind in check sometimes.\n\nOr perhaps it's just the armies of the red dragonflight that are massed around her."}
Q[12448]={d="天灾军团占领了圣地。圣地的守护者达莉亚已经失踪了。在守卫圣地时阵亡的红龙都变成了扭曲的灰烬之龙，转头攻击我们。情况非常危急，$r。\n\n天灾军团如今源源不断地从神殿中涌来，德雷森上尉带着一队你们的人去阻止他们了。\n\n去帮助他……但请你一定要站在士兵身后。我可不希望你抵抗不住潮水般的敌军，牺牲在那些烧焦的峡谷里。",dEN="The Scourge have overrun the shrine. The shrine's keeper, Dahlia Suntouch, is nowhere to be found. The red wyrms that fell in the shrine's defense now beset us in the form of twisted skeletal emberwyrms. The situation is dire, <race>.\n\nCaptain Drayzen leads a group of your kind in stemming the flow of the Scourge out of the shrine.\n\nGo to his aid... but please stay behind his men. The flow of Scourge is endless and I don't want to lose you in one of those scarred canyons.",o="Ayuda al capitán Drayzen en la resistencia en los cañones ayudando a matar a 12 agresores necrófagos gélidos, 8 agresores geists gélidos y 1 agresor abominación gélida.\n\nVuelve junto a Vargastrasz cuando hayas terminado esta tarea.",oEN="Aid Captain Drayzen in holding the canyons by participating in the death of 12 Frigid Ghoul Attackers, 8 Frigid Geist Attackers, and 1 Frigid Abomination Attacker.\n\nReturn to Vargastrasz once you have finished this task.",c="这个任务令人作呕，但我为你的付出表示感激。\n\n天灾军团不能向龙殿外推进任何一步，否则这片大地都将失守。",cEN="It is a disgusting task, but I thank you for doing it.\n\nThe Scourge cannot be permitted to push any further out of the shrine lest all of these lands be overrun."}
Q[12449]={d="我要交给你另一个任务。我有很多兄弟都在激烈的空战中阵亡了。如果我们不赶快行动的话，他们就会加入灰烬之龙的队伍。\n\n请你从南面的小路进入圣地……那里的天灾军团应该比较少。\n\n在圣地里寻找从树上掉下来的红玉橡果，然后把它们种在我死去的同胞们的尸体旁。这样他们就能获得新生……这是红龙氏族的高贵宿命。",dEN="I have another task that needs attention. I have brothers who are falling in the battle overhead and if we do not act quickly, they will only bolster the emberwyrm ranks.\n\nGet into the shrine through the pass in the south... the Scourge presence should be lighter there.\n\nSearch the shrine for ruby acorns that have fallen from the tree and plant them near the bodies of my fallen brood. Through this, they can give new life... a proud fate for any of my kind.",o="从南面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地并寻找红玉橡果。对死去的红龙使用红玉橡果，让他们的尸体回归大地。完成任务后向瓦加斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through the southern pass and search for Ruby Acorns. Use the Ruby Acorns on the fallen red dragons to return their bodies to the earth. Return to Vargastrasz once the task is complete.",c="En la tierra, mis hermanos pueden otorgar vida de nuevo. Los has salvado de un destino mucho peor que la muerte.\n\nNo conozco ni una palabra en tu lengua que pueda expresar lo mucho que esto significa para los míos. Gracias, <race>.",cEN="In the earth, my brothers can grant life anew. You have saved them from a fate far worse than death.\n\nI don't know a word in your tongue that could express how much this means to my kind. Thank you, <race>."}
Q[12450]={d="我还有最后一个任务要给你，$r……一个足以扭转战局的任务。\n\n请你回到圣地，去杀死那些指挥战斗的通灵师。只要他们死了，我们就能击退天灾的军队，并慢慢夺回圣地。\n\n我还要你去找到圣地下面的堕落之源并摧毁它。\n\n我知道我要你做的事情太多了，但如果你能做到的话，我们就可以赢得这场战斗。",dEN="I have one final task for you, <race>... one that should turn the tide of this fight.\n\nReturn to the shrine and kill the necromancers that are fueling this onslaught. With them dead, we should be able to beat these forces back and eventually retake the shrine.\n\nI also need you to find the source of the corruption under the shrine and put an end to it.\n\nI know I have asked a lot of you, but if you do this for me, we will win this battle.",o="从南面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地，杀死6个冰冷通灵师并摧毁圣地下面的堕落之源。完成任务后向瓦加斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through the southern pass, then kill 6 Frigid Necromancers and eliminate the source of the corruption under the shrine. Return to Vargastrasz once the task is complete.",p="你回来了！你完成我的要求了吗？",pEN="You've returned! Have you done as I've asked of you?",c="Dahlia... ¿la han convertido?\n\nDahlia nos ha sido leal durante mucho tiempo... si pueden corromper a un ser con su devoción, no es un buen augurio para el resto de las razas jóvenes. Gracias por liberarla. Espero que haya encontrado algo de paz.\n\nNos has honrado con tu ayuda desinteresada hoy, <race>. Quizá no todos los de la Horda poseen los corazones negros de sus ancestros. Informaré al consejo de lo que los de tu clase habéis logrado aquí.",cEN="Dahlia... they turned her?\n\nDahlia has been loyal to us for a very long time... if they can corrupt a being of her devotion, it does not bode well for the rest of the young races. Thank you for freeing her. I hope she has found some peace.\n\nYou have honored us with your selfless assistance today, <race>. Perhaps not all of the Horde bear the black hearts of their ancestors. I will send word to the council of what your kind have accomplished here."}
Q[12451]={d="在我们建造征服堡的时候，我派了斥候沃塔肯去与东面我们的同盟牦牛人进行联络。欧尼瓦营地是他们的根据地，就在灰熊丘陵的最东面，灰喉堡的另一边。\n\n去那里走一趟，听一听沃塔肯的报告，给当地的酋长提供一切可能的帮助。你在征服堡所做的贡献可以算是这里的典范了，我想沃塔肯会对你的协助表示感激的。",dEN="While we build Conquest Hold, I sent Scout Vor'takh to make contact with our taunka allies in the east. They're based in Camp Oneqwah, which is in the easternmost part of Grizzly Hills, beyond Grizzlemaw.\n\nMake the journey there, hear Vor'takh's report and offer your assistance with anything he and the local chieftain may need. Your contributions to Conquest Hold have been exemplary and I know Vor'takh will be grateful for the assistance.",o="与欧尼瓦营地的斥候沃塔肯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Scout Vor'takh at Camp Oneqwah.",c="<一段简短的自我介绍解释了纳兹格林将军派你来的原因。>\n\n啊，所以你就是所谓的援军了，很好。\n\n托尔玛克和他的手下会需要你的刀剑的。",cEN="<You offer a short introduction, explaining you were sent by Sergeant Nazgrim.>\n\nAh, so you're something in the way of reinforcements, then. Good.\n\nTormak and his men have need of your blade."}
Q[12453]={d="他们一直要我帮忙对抗联盟。现在我们的军队正在和对手僵持，我们必须尽可能获得优势。\n\n在这片山脉和森林中翱翔的白肩鹰可以成为我们最好的探子。带上这片银色羽毛，用它让我的视界和它们的视界结合。\n\n能够看到敌人的活动无疑会给我们带来巨大的优势。你可以在东面的山中找到大量的白肩鹰。",dEN="I've been asked to lend my support to our efforts against the Alliance. At the moment our military forces are about evenly matched and we're looking for ways to find an edge.\n\nThe imperial eagles that fly over the mountains and trees in this area would make excellent scouts for us. Take this silver feather and use it to bind my sight to that of them.\n\nBeing able to see our enemy's movements will grant us the strategic advantage we need. You'll find abundant eagles in the mountains to the east.",o="风之先知希尔·灰角希望你在灰熊丘陵的6只白肩鹰身上使用银色羽毛。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn wants you to use the Silver Feather on 6 Imperial Eagles in Grizzly Hills.",p="¿Has hecho lo que te pedí, <name>?",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="Te lo agradezco, <name>. Tu ayuda es apreciada.",cEN="I thank you, <name>. Your help is appreciated."}
Q[12454]={d="伊瑟拉在翡翠梦境中沉睡，守护着梦境世界和艾泽拉斯。但是可怕的噩梦入侵了梦境世界，这使得我担心伊瑟拉也受到了影响。\n\n最近，我请求她帮助我们对抗天灾军团——那些亡灵正在各个巨龙圣地中制造冰霜巨龙。可是她误解了我的请求。\n\n她命令我们这个巨龙圣地的守卫攻击所有非绿龙军团的人。\n\n我要你去杀死一些天爪枭，以此来恢复圣地的平衡。",dEN="Ysera sleeps in the Emerald Dream, watching over both the Dream and Azeroth. But a horrible nightmare has taken hold in the Dream, and now I fear that Ysera is being affected by it.\n\nRecently, I asked her to aid in the fight against the Scourge that are raising frostwyrms at the other dragonshrines. She misunderstood.\n\nInstead, she told our dragonshrine's defenders to treat those not of the green dragonflight as enemies.\n\nI need you to slay some of the skytalons. The shrine must regain its balance.",o="翡翠巨龙圣地的护园者尼瑟拉要你去杀死5只翡翠天爪枭。",oEN="Nishera the Garden Keeper at the Emerald Dragonshrine has asked you to slay 5 Emerald Skytalons.",p="越快解决翡翠天爪，越快能将翡翠巨龙圣地的自然平衡恢复。",pEN="The sooner that the ermerald skytalons can be dealt with, the sooner the Emerald Dragonshrine can be returned to its natural balance.",c="不要后悔你在生命的循环中所扮演的角色。出生、死亡、重生都是自然规律中的一部分。",cEN="Do not regret the part that you played in the cycle of life. Birth, death, and rebirth are all part of the natural order."}
Q[12455]={d="La entrega de municiones no fue bien, $gamigo:amiga;. El cargamento de la Fortaleza de la Guardia Oeste fue interceptado por las vermis de escarcha que la sobrevuelan en círculos. Las máquinas voladoras se hicieron pedazos en cuestión de segundos y su cargamento se fue con el viento. La mayor parte aún está arriba... en Los Campos de Carroña.\n\nNecesito que vuelvas allí y recuperes las cajas de municiones que están esparcidas por todo ese maldito sitio.\n\n¡Date prisa! ¡No podemos comenzar esta ofensiva sin armas ni munición, $gamigote:amiguita;!",dEN="The munitions drop went badly, friend. The shipment of ammo from Westguard Keep was intercepted by the frostwyrms circling overhead. The flying machines were torn apart in a matter of seconds and their cargo was scattered to the wind. Most of it is still topside - on the Carrion Fields.\n\nI'm gonna need you to go back up and recover the munitions crates that are scattered all over this damned place.\n\nHurry it up! We can't start this offensive without guns and ammo, <buddy/missy>!",o="龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什要你取回8箱暮冬军需品。",oEN="Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to recover 8 Wintergarde Munitions.",p="¿Dónde están mis municiones, <fella/lady>?",pEN="Where are my munitions, <fella/lady>?",c="还来得及！我的部分士兵热血冲昏了头，决定朝东西两边的墓穴猛攻。不用说，他们很快地就被这些无脑的食尸鬼给击溃了。我们得抢救生还者！",cEN="Just in time! Some of my soldiers got a little overzealous and decided to wade into the crypts directly to the east and west of us. Needless to say, they were quickly overwhelmed by those mindless ghouls. We need to rescue the survivors!"}
Q[12456]={d="我能感觉到圣地并没有完全恢复平衡。翠羽守护者已经被我们的行动激怒了，我预感它不会听我们解释的。\n\n奥雷托斯是一头巨大的天爪枭，它栖息在翡翠巨龙圣地的最南部，控制着整个巨龙圣地的空中防御。恐怕我们也得让它进入轮回了。\n\n把这些天爪枭的绒毛放在它能看见的地方，它就会出现。把它的羽毛给我带来。",dEN="I can feel that the shrine is not completely back in balance. The verdant keeper has been angered by our actions, and I sense that he will not listen to reason.\n\nAlystros is an immense skytalon who perches at the south end of the Emerald Dragonshrine. It is he who is in charge of the dragonshrine's aerial defenses. I fear that we will have to deal with him.\n\nTake these skytalon molts and place them on the ground where he can see them. He will come. Bring me his plume.",o="翡翠巨龙圣地的护园者尼瑟拉要你取得奥雷托斯的羽毛。",oEN="Nishera the Garden Keeper at the Emerald Dragonshrine has asked you to acquire The Plume of Alystros.",p="你准备对付奥雷托斯了吗？要记得向你的朋友求助。\n\n事实上，翠羽守护者很强大，我推荐你结伴而行！",pEN="Have you managed to deal with Alystros? Do not be afraid to ask your friends for assistance.\n\nIn fact, given that the verdant keeper is very powerful, I recommend it!",c="别为奥雷托斯哭泣。他将其永恒的生命奉献给了保卫翡翠巨龙圣地，它即将重生。\n\n但愿当它重返我们身边的时候，不会因为梦境之龙所控制的翡翠梦魇而陷入迷惘。",cEN="Do not weep for Alystros. He has dedicated his eternal life to the defense of the Emerald Dragonshrine and will be reborn.\n\nHopefully when he returns to us, he will not be gripped with the confusion of the Emerald Nightmare that seems to have taken hold of The Dreamer."}
Q[12457]={d="Hemos colocado ametralladoras y barricadas justo al este y al oeste. Nuestros soldados heridos se esconden en ambas estancias intentando no alertar a los necrófagos descerebrados de su presencia.\n\nAhora que tenemos municiones, necesito que manejes una de las ametralladoras y la uses para despejar un camino para nuestros soldados. Cuando estés $gcolocado:colocada;, llama a alguno de los soldados para que salga de su escondite y abre fuego para que la Plaga no le ponga las manos encima.\n\n¡Marchando!",dEN="We've set up chain guns and barricades directly to the east and to the west. Our injured soldiers are hiding in both rooms - trying their best to not alert the mindless ghouls to their presence.\n\nNow that we have ammo, I need you to man one of the chain guns and use it to blast a path clear for our soldiers! Once you're on board, call a soldier out from hiding and then lay down heavy fire to keep the Scourge off him!\n\nGet a move on!",o="龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什要你营救8名受伤的第七军团士兵。",oEN="Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to save 8 Injured 7th Legion Soldiers.",p="你救出我们受伤的士兵了吗？",pEN="Have you rescued our injured soldiers?",c="<name>, ¡no he visto hazañas como esa desde Silithus!\n\n¡Me aseguraré de que todos y cada uno de esos soldados recomienden a Lord Fordragon que te asciendan!\n\nAhora, pasemos a asuntos más urgentes. Nuestros exploradores nos han informado de que Thel'zan está cerca.",cEN="<name>, I haven't seen heroics like that since Silithus!\n\nI'll be sure that each and every one of those soldiers puts in a recommendation to Lord Fordragon that you be promoted!\n\nNow, on to more pressing matters. We've gotten reports back from our scouts that Thel'zan is close."}
Q[12458]={d="我们需要更多对抗天灾军团的武器。东南方的翡翠巨龙圣地也许就是我们要寻找的答案。\n\n所有的亡灵生物——除了希尔瓦娜斯手下的那些——只要踏入圣地就会化为尘土。\n\n我需要你的帮助来完成一个试验，年轻的$r。请你到翡翠巨龙圣地去，拿一些翡翠鞭笞者的种子回来。",dEN="We need more weapons in the fight against the Scourge. The natural properties of the Emerald Dragonshrine to the southeast may be the answer.\n\nAny unliving creature, save those that Sylvanas has redeemed, that steps foot in the dragonshrine falls to dust.\n\nI want to test a theory, and I want you to be my instrument in doing so, young <race>. Go to the Emerald Dragonshrine and take the seeds from the emerald lashers therein.",o="龙眠神殿顶层的伊萨里奥斯勋爵要你去收集3份鞭笞者的种子。",oEN="Lord Itharius at the top of Wyrmrest Temple has asked you to return with 3 Lasher Seeds.",p="截至当前你已经拿到多少颗种子了呢？",pEN="And just how many seeds have you managed to acquire thus far?",c="哪怕是现在，我依然能感受到种子中自然的脉动。\n\n我们一定要善加利用这些种子！",cEN="Even now I can feel the pulse of nature from within these seeds.\n\nWe must put them to good use!"}
Q[12459]={d="Como solo tenemos tres semillas, tenemos que usarlas lo mejor posible.\n\nTus objetivos son una de las vermis de escarcha reanimadas que merodean el norte cerca del Reposo de Galakrond, Turgid el Vil en las barracas destruidas de Los Campos de Carroña al este y el sobrestante Mirada Mortal en Jintha'kalar lejos al noreste.\n\nMientras que las semillas podrían acabar indiscutiblemente con una de las criaturas inferiores de la Plaga, también debilitarán a estos tres. Lo suficiente, de hecho, como para que puedas apañártelas tú $gsolo:sola;.",dEN="Since we only have three seeds, we must put them to the best possible use.\n\nYour targets are one of the reanimated frost wyrms circling to the north near Galakrond's Rest, Turgid the Vile in the ruined barracks at the Carrion Fields to the east, and Overseer Deathgaze at Jintha'kalar far to the northeast.\n\nWhile the seeds would outright destroy one of the lesser Scourge, they will greatly weaken these three. Enough so, in fact, that you should be able to handle them on your own.",o="龙眠神殿顶层的伊萨里奥斯勋爵要你去杀死一头被削弱的冰霜巨龙、被削弱的图尔基德和被削弱的监工戴瑟盖斯。",oEN="Lord Itharius at the top of Wyrmrest Temple has asked you to destroy a Weakened Reanimated Frost Wyrm, Weakened Turgid the Vile, and Weakened Overseer Deathgaze.",p="结果如何？毁掉他们了吗？\n\n我需要答案！",pEN="What were the results? Are they destroyed?\n\nI need answers!",c="Excelente. Tal como sospechaba desde el principio. Tendré que intentar contactar con Ysera y ver si ella lo aprueba.\n\nSi es que puede ser persuadida para salir de su pesadilla, por supuesto.\n\nGracias, <name>. Has sido indispensable.",cEN="Excellent. Just as I suspected all along. I shall have to attempt to contact Ysera and see if she approves.\n\nIf she can be coaxed from her nightmare, of course.\n\nThank you, <name>. You have been indispensable."}
Q[12460]={d="Te necesitamos en el Santuario de Dragones Rubí.\n\nLos dragones se ven acosados en todas partes por el Vuelo Azul y por la Plaga... No están mucho mejor que nosotros. La situación parece grave, pero esto nos brinda una oportunidad insólita para establecer una valiosa alianza.\n\nHe conseguido un regimiento para ayudar al Vuelo Rojo frente a la Plaga en el Santuario de Dragones Rubí. Si hay $gun luchador:una luchadora; en ti, ve a buscar a Ceristrasz en el risco este del santuario y ayúdalo en todo lo que puedas.",dEN="We need you at the Ruby Dragonshrine.\n\nThe dragons are beset on all sides by the blue flight and the scourge... they're in no better a state than we are. The situation seems dire, but this affords us a rare opportunity to establish a valuable alliance.\n\nI secured a regiment to aid the red dragonflight against the Scourge at the Ruby Dragonshrine. If you have a fight in you, please go find Ceristrasz on the ridge east of the shrine and help him in any way that you can.",o="转至红玉巨龙圣地东面的山脊，向塞雷斯塔兹报到。红玉巨龙圣地就在龙眠神殿以西。",oEN="Report to Ceristrasz on the ridge east of the Ruby Dragonshrine, west of Wyrmrest.",c="劳莉耶尔大使派你来的？\n\n如果你再见到她的话，请向她说我非常感激她的协助。我们有太多的战线要维持了。",cEN="Ambassador Lauriel sent you?\n\nIf you talk to her again, please let her know that we are very appreciative of her aid. We are fighting battles on far too many fronts."}
Q[12461]={d="你必须立即转至红玉巨龙圣地。这是命令。\n\n龙族已经完全被蓝龙军团和天灾军团压制住了……他们的情况一点儿也不比我们好。这个机会非常难得，可以让我们为祖先的过错赎罪。\n\n我已经派了一个团的将士转至红玉巨龙圣地，帮助红龙对抗天灾军团。去加入他们吧，把天灾军团踩在脚下！\n\n为了部落！",dEN="You are leaving to the Ruby Dragonshrine. This is not a request.\n\nThe dragons are beset on all sides by the blue flight and the scourge... they're in no better a state than we are. It is not often we are afforded the opportunity to redeem ourselves for the transgressions of our ancestors.\n\nI have secured a regiment to aid the red dragonflight against the Scourge at the Ruby Dragonshrine. Join them and crush the Scourge beneath your boots!\n\nFor the Horde!",o="转至阿格玛之锤以东的红玉巨龙圣地，向圣地外面山脊上的瓦加斯塔兹报到。",oEN="Report to Vargastrasz on a ridge outside of the Ruby Dragonshrine, just east of Agmar's Hammer.",c="葛拉克大使派你来的？\n\n如果你再见到他的话，请向他说我非常感激他的协助。我们有太多的战线要维持了。",cEN="Ambassador Golluck sent you?\n\nIf you talk to him again, please let him know that we are very appreciative of his aid. We are fighting battles on far too many fronts."}
Q[12462]={d="沿着台阶往下走，就是通往被诅咒的地宫的大门：那里聚集着数都数不清的天灾军团士兵，而且他们的数量还在不断增长。我们费尽心思收集到的情报表明，天灾军团的两名通灵领主正在前两座地穴里努力制造新的士兵。在我们攻入塞尔赞所在的核心密室之前，必须除掉这两个家伙和他们手下的天灾军团渣滓。\n\n进入暮冬陵园，杀死通灵领主、纳克萨玛斯恐怖卫士和纳克萨玛斯之影。",dEN="Just down the steps lies the gateway to damnation: Scourge as far as the eye can see and getting thicker with each passing moment. What little intelligence we've been able to gather indicates that two Scourge necrolords are furiously working at emptying the first two crypts down below. Before we can breach the inner chamber to Thel'zan, we'll need to take care of those two clowns and their Naxxramas cronies.\n\nGo down into the mausoleum and take out the necrolords and the Naxxramas dreadguards and shades.",o="Yord Barbahielo \"el Calamidad\" en el Mausoleo de Hibergarde del Cementerio de Dragones quiere que mates al necroseñor X'avius, al necroseñor Horus y a 15 miembros de la Plaga de Naxxramas.|n",oEN="Yord \"Calamity\" Icebeard at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to kill Necrolord X'avius, Necrolord Horus, and 15 Naxxramas Scourge.",p="你搞定了吗？",pEN="Did you break yourself off a piece?",c="这样应该替阿姆博争取了一点处理事情的时间。",cEN="That oughta buy Ambo a little bit of time to get things situated."}
Q[12463]={d="Se rumorea que hay un túnel excavado por la Plaga que conecta las cámaras de embalsamamiento del mausoleo con las grandes criptas, ahora desenterradas por Thel'zan y sus esbirros. Hace poco envié a Barbarrapiña, mi mejor pícaro, en busca de respuestas, pero aún no he tenido noticias suyas. Si yo fuera un hombre de apuestas, diría que está en las últimas.\n\nQuiero que bajes esos peldaños y te dirijas directamente a la cámara de embalsamamiento y encuentres a Barbarrapiña. Vivo o muerto, tendrá respuestas.|n",dEN="There's been talk of a tunnel dug by Scourge that connects the embalming chambers of the mausoleum with the large crypts, now unearthed by Thel'zan and his minions. I recently sent my best rogue, Plunderbeard, in search of answers, but have yet to hear back from him. If I were a betting man I'd wager that he's a goner.\n\nI want you to go down those steps and head straight through the embalming chamber and look for Plunderbeard. Dead or alive, he'll have answers.",o="龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什要你寻找普兰比尔德的下落。",oEN="Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to find Plunderbeard.",c="<Has descubierto un diario en el cadáver de Plunderbeard.>\n\nEntrada uno:\n\nArrastran cadáveres por el túnel hasta la sala de embalsamamiento para experimentar con ellos. Hay un suministro interminable en este mausoleo. Todo lo que no puede ser reanimado se convierte en una construcción de huesos de un tipo u otro.\n\nEntrada dos:\n\nTengo miedo de que este lich, Thel'zan, oculte un oscuro secreto. ¿Quién es él? ¿Fue una vez... uno de los nuestros?\n\nEntrada tres: He descubierto la ubicación del filacterio del lich. Es...\n\n<El resto de las páginas han sido arrancadas.>",cEN="<You discover a journal on Plunderbeard's corpse.>\n\nEntry One:\n\nThey drag corpses through the tunnel to the embalming room for experimentation. There is an endless supply in this mausoleum. Whatever cannot be reanimated is turned into a bone construct of one kind or another.\n\nEntry Two:\n\nI fear that this lich, Thel'zan, hides a dark secret. Who is he? Was he once... one of us?\n\nEntry Three: I have discovered the location of the lich's phylactery. It is...\n\n<The rest of the pages are torn out.>"}
Q[12464]={d="我的老对手，阿比迪斯将军也来到了诺森德。\n\n她在我们对提尔之手的进攻中逃了出来，带着一小队残兵向北逃窜，在这里的南部创建了新壁炉谷。\n\n虽然他们对付天灾军团也很积极，但阿比迪斯太狡猾了，我们不能让这样的敌人继续活着。相信我，如果我们不干掉她，她的剑会在尘埃落定前架上我们的脖子。\n\n所以我们要干掉他们的首领，然后再做自己的事。把她的徽记给我带来。",dEN="My old enemy, High General Abbendis, has come to Northrend.\n\nSomehow she survived the attacks upon Tyr's Hand and brought a small force north. They've established New Hearthglen to the south.\n\nWhile they could prove useful in fighting the Scourge, Abbendis herself is far too shrewd an opponent to let live. Trust me, if we let them stand, she will be at our throats before the dust settles.\n\nSo, we'll deprive them of their leadership and go about our business. Bring me her head as proof.",o="把阿比迪斯将军的徽记交给暮冬要塞的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者。",oEN="Deliver The High General's Head to Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Wintergarde Keep.",p="那么，任务完成了？",pEN="It is done then?",c="对付阿比迪斯是个不幸，但必要的任务。很久很久以前，我曾想象过和她一起并肩作战的可能性。\n\n<指挥官的声音渐止，沉浸在思绪中片刻，然后才继续说。>\n\n我有点在意你口中的这个海军上将。你说的是巴瑞恩·韦斯温？我不敢相信他竟然还活着。他一定年纪很大了。不过，我们晚点再来对付他。\n\n现在，我想你赢得了奖赏和休息时间。",cEN="An unfortunate, but necessary action that we had to take in dealing with Abbendis. In another lifetime, I think I could have imagined fighting side-by-side with her.\n\n<The commander's voice trails off as he reflects a moment before proceeding.>\n\nI'm a little concerned about this grand admiral you describe. Barean Westwind you say? I can't believe that he's still alive. He must be ancient. We'll have to deal with him later, however.\n\nIn the meantime, I think you've earned a reward and a little R & R."}
Q[12465]={d="看来必须找到日记中缺失的书页。袭击普兰比尔德的家伙或许就躲在隧道另一侧的房间中。一定是他们撕掉了后面的书页！\n\n一旦你找到缺失的书页，就把它们交给暮冬陵园入口处的阿姆博·卡什。",dEN="Whatever was written on the remaining pages of Plunderbeard's journal must be recovered. Search the chambers located on the other side of this tunnel for Plunderbeard's assailants. They must be the ones who tore the journal apart!\n\nShould you recover the missing pages, return them to Ambo Cash at the entrance of the Wintergarde Mausoleum.",o="将普兰比尔德的日记的第4页、第5页、第6页和第7页交给龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什。",oEN="Recover Page 4 of Plunderbeard's Journal, Page 5 of Plunderbeard's Journal, Page 6 of Plunderbeard's Journal, and Page 7 of Plunderbeard's Journal and return them to Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight.",p="我当然不觉得自己像个赢家……",pEN="I certainly don't feel like a winner...",c="<阿姆博读完恢复完本的日记。>\n\n有些好消息，也有些坏消息。你想先听哪一个？\n\n啊，该死的，干嘛给你选呢？好消息是：如果我们能弄到塞尔赞的护命匣，我们就能摧毁他；坏消息是：护命匣是在一条相当大的冰霜巨龙身上。",cEN="<Ambo reads through the recovered journal pages.>\n\nThere's some good news and there's some bad news. Which do you want first?\n\nAh hell, why give you a choice? The good news is that if we can get Thel'zan's phylactery, we can destroy him. The bad news is that the phylactery is on a rather large frostwyrm."}
Q[12466]={d="你必须北上，转至龙骨荒野的第七军团前线。返回暮冬要塞，沿着北边的道路离开要塞。在交叉路口往左转，抵达雪线后继续朝西走，直到你踏上泰坦之路。沿着泰坦之路继续北上就是第七军团前线了。\n\n抵达那里之后，与军团司令泰拉里安谈一谈。他一直盼着你呢。\n\n$n，和你相处很愉快。再见。",dEN="You need to get to the 7th Legion Front in northern Dragonblight. Return to Wintergarde Keep and take the north gate out of town. Keep north until you hit a road. Take a left on that road and follow it until you reach the snowline. Once at the snowline keep heading west until you hit the Path of the Titans. Follow that north and it'll lead you right into the 7th Legion Front.\n\nOnce there, speak with Legion Commander Tyralion. He'll be expecting you.\n\nAnd <name> - it has been a pleasure. Farewell.",o="转至龙骨荒野中部的第七军团前线，向军团司令泰拉里安报到。",oEN="Report to Legion Commander Tyralion at the 7th Legion Front in central Dragonblight.",c="现在你知道为什么这里叫做龙骨荒野了吧。视线所及的范围内到处都遍布着这些野兽的骨骸。\n\n我们大概解决了十几只冰霜巨龙，但它们仍旧满布山野。靠着地上这些骨头，天灾军团有源源不绝的原料可用。\n\n<泰拉里安清了清喉咙。>\n\n我不想用细节烦你，英雄。我们有好好盯着你在找的那条龙。",cEN="Now you know why they call this the Dragon Wastes. Bones of the beasts are strewn about as far as the eye can see.\n\nWe've probably taken down a dozen or more frostwyrms and there's still no end in sight. The Scourge's got fuel for ten-thousand more what with all the bones laying about.\n\n<Tyralion clears his throat.>\n\nI don't mean to bore you with the details, hero. We've got the wyrm you're looking for locked in our sights."}
Q[12467]={d="Tu vermis de escarcha está por allí.\n\n<Tyralion apunta hacia el oeste.>\n\n¡Y es una grande!\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista; para luchar, ve a hablar con \"Cebo de vermis\". Él te la \"traerá\". Cuando Tormenta de Hielo esté lo suficientemente cerca, ¡la encadenaremos al suelo y la remataremos! Espero que con tu ayuda podamos derrotarla para que tengas tu filacteria.\n\nCuando la tengas, vuelve hasta la Fortaleza de Hibergarde e informa al alto comandante Halford Aterravermis. Ha estado realizando preparativos para el enfrentamiento final contra Thel'zan.",dEN="Your frostwyrm is out there.\n\n<Tyralion points west.>\n\nAnd it's a big one!\n\nWhen you're ready to fight, go speak with \"Wyrmbait.\" He'll \"fetch\" her. Once Icestorm is close enough we'll chain her to the ground and finish her off! Hopefully, with your help, we'll be able to take her down and get you that phylactery.\n\nOnce you've got the phylactery, return to Wintergarde Keep and report to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane. He's been making preparations for the final showdown with Thel'zan.",o="Recupera la filacteria de Thel'zan de Tormenta de Hielo y llévasela al alto comandante Halford Aterravermis en la Fortaleza de Hibergarde.|n",oEN="Recover Thel'zan's Phylactery from Icestorm and return it to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep.",p="你拿到塞尔赞的护命匣了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered Thel'zan's phylactery?",c="塞尔赞那个混蛋害我们失去了很多好士兵。我真希望当你在他面前粉碎他的护命匣，终结他的性命的时候我能够在场。",cEN="We've lost so many good soldiers to that monster, Thel'zan. I wish I could be there to see you crush his phylactery in front of him and end his existence."}
Q[12468]={d="部落就是一部宏伟的战争机器，而你只是其中的一颗小齿轮。\n\n我在确保着这部机器有足够的燃料供应。如果我失败了，那么机器就会发生故障。\n\n木材，矿石，水……我们需要这里的一切。当然联盟也一样。\n\n在我们能够对抗这些人类垃圾之前，必须得巩固我们对西部本地的控制。\n\n去跟纳兹格利姆中士谈谈消灭沃德伦的维库人的事情，然后——如果你能成功完成任务的话——我们会指派更多的任务给你。",dEN="The Horde is a magnificent war machine and you are nothing but a cog.\n\nI am in charge of securing fuel for this machine. If I fail, the machine fails.\n\nLumber, ore, water... it's all here and we want it. And so does the Alliance.\n\nBefore we can move against the human scum, we need to solidify our control over the western region.\n\nSpeak to Sergeant Nazgrim about eradicating the vrykul in Voldrune and then maybe - if you turn out to not be a complete failure - we'll send you on further tasks.",o="与征服堡的纳兹格利姆中士谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Sergeant Nazgrim in Conquest Hold.",c="所以说克雷娜派你来找我？她一定不是很喜欢你，不过，她又喜欢过谁呢？\n\n进攻这个维库人据点会是个很难很难的工作。",cEN="So Krenna sent you to me? She must've not liked you very much, but then again who does she like?\n\nCracking this vrykul outpost is going to be a tough, tough job."}
Q[12469]={d="经过进一步的调查，那个地精似乎是想要穿越荒地，把一大堆炸药运过去。半埋在附近雪地里的鹰身人羽毛让我们可以猜想他遇到了怎样的悲惨命运。\n\n那地精应该是从东面的某个地方出发，把炸药运向天灾之门。最谨慎的做法就是沿着山脊回到东面，向寄件人通报他们的送货员的遭遇。",dEN="Upon closer examination, the goblin appears to have been running a pack full of explosives across the wastes for delivery. The harpy feathers half-buried in the snow nearby suggest how he met his ill fate.\n\nIt appears that the goblin was bringing the explosives towards the Wrath Gate from somewhere to the east. It seems most prudent to follow the ridge back to the east and inform the sender of their runner's fate.",o="沿着山脊向东面走，将炸药包交给龙骨荒野北部诺兹拉斯哨站的辛克。",oEN="Follow the ridge to the east and deliver the pack of explosives to Xink at Nozzlerust Post in northern Dragonblight.",p="你好啊！",pEN="Hello there!",c="啊？！又损失了一个人，唉，鹰身人真的是越来越烦。\n\n不过无论如何！工作得完成才行。帮个忙怎么样？",cEN="Hah! We lost another one, eh? Those harpies are becoming a real nuisance.\n\nNo matter! There's work to be done. Lend a hand around here, will ya?"}
Q[12470]={d="东北方的青铜巨龙圣地周围的时间风暴会阻止任何永生者进入其中。\n\n永恒之龙正在里面和守卫战斗，试图夺取巨龙圣地的控制权。我们必须利用这个机会获取一些情报。\n\n你不是永生者，因此你可以进入巨龙圣地并使用永恒沙漏。你要保护好这个沙漏，直到永恒之龙的首领显身。\n\n你要小心，永恒之龙会试图阻止你！",dEN="A time storm at the Bronze Dragonshrine to the northeast is keeping immortals from entering.\n\nThe Infinite Dragonflight are in a fight inside with the defenders to wrest control of the dragonshrine. We must take this opportunity to gain information.\n\nYou are not immortal. You can cross into the dragonshrine and use the Hourglass of Eternity. Protect the hourglass for long enough and the leader of the Infinite Dragonflight should be revealed.\n\nBe warned, the Infinite Dragonflight will try to stop you!",o="克罗米要你进入青铜巨龙圣地，将永恒沙漏放在地上。\n\n保护沙漏，直到你获得克罗米想要的情报。完成任务后返回龙眠神殿顶层向她复命。",oEN="Chromie, at the top of Wyrmrest Temple, has asked you to travel to the Bronze Dragonshrine. Once inside, place the Hourglass of Eternity on the ground.\n\nProtect the hourglass for as long as it lasts and then return to her with whatever information you gain.",p="你带来了什么消息？青铜巨龙圣地中发生了什么事情？\n\n你发现永恒之龙的领导者是谁了吗？",pEN="What news do you bring? What happened at the Bronze Dragonshrine?\n\nDid you find out who the leader of the Infinite Dragonflight is?",c="¿Has visto a Nozdormu? Eso no tiene ningún sentido.\n\n<Chromie reflexiona un momento sobre lo que has dicho.>\n\n¡En realidad, son excelentes noticias! No teníamos idea de a dónde o cuándo se había ido el Señor del Tiempo. Solo sabíamos que había desaparecido para ocuparse de asuntos muy importantes.\n\nAsí que, aunque no se ha revelado quién es el líder de la Infinitud de dragones, ¡has descubierto que Nozdormu está vivo y bien, y luchando contra ellos!\n\nGracias, <name>. ¡Nos veremos pronto!",cEN="You saw Nozdormu? That doesn't make any sense.\n\n<Chromie thinks a moment about what you've said.>\n\nActually, that's great news! We had no idea of where or when the Lord of Time had gone to. We just knew that he had disappeared to deal with very important matters.\n\nSo, even though the leader of the Infinite Dragonflight wasn't revealed, you've discovered that Nozdormu is alive and well, and fighting back against them!\n\nThank you, <name>. I'll be seeing you soon!"}
Q[12471]={d="$n，谢谢你救了我。这帮克瓦迪尔的禽兽！\n\n他们强迫我们与其它囚犯角斗，并以此为乐。还不如将我们一刀捅死算了！\n\n年轻的卡鲁克还活着，我见过他。请转告他，他的父亲战斗到了生命的最后一刻。",dEN="I thank you for saving me, <name>. The kvaldir are animals!\n\nThey made us fight the other prisoners. It would've been more merciful to just kill us all.\n\nThe youngling Karuk is still alive -- I noticed him arrive here. Tell him his father fought until the end.",o="将海象人囚犯的情况告诉卡鲁克。",oEN="Speak to Karuk about the Captured Tuskarr Prisoner.",c="Te lo agradezco, <name>. Has mostrado una gran buena voluntad hacia mi clan.",cEN="I thank you, <name>. You've shown a great deal of goodwill towards my clan."}
Q[12472]={d="非常感谢你的义举，弗塔根大人已经下令对塞尔赞发动全面攻击了。第七军团已经开进了陵园的召唤大厅，现在正驻扎在一条仿佛通往地狱的走廊外。现在就缺你一个了。\n\n带着这只护命匣去暮冬陵园那里，向军团司令尤瑞克报到吧。\n\n要塞外面有一条天灾军团挖出的隧道，你可以从那里抄近路。现在就去，$n！带领我们走向胜利吧！",dEN="Thanks to your heroics, Lord Fordragon has given the command to launch a full assault against Thel'zan. 7th Legion have made their way into the summoning chamber of the mausoleum and located what appears to be a gateway to hell. The only piece that's missing now is you.\n\nTake the phylactery and report to Legion Commander Yorik inside the Wintergarde Mausoleum.\n\nThere is a tunnel that the Scourge dug out just outside the keep that you can take to get to Yorik quickly. Go now, <name>! Lead us to victory!",o="带着塞尔赞的护命匣转至龙骨荒野的暮冬陵园，向军团司令尤瑞克报到。",oEN="Take Thel'zan's Phylactery to Legion Commander Yorik inside the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight.",p="<Yorik deja escapar un suspiro de alivio.>\n\nPensábamos que no aparecerías, <name>.",pEN="<Yorik lets out a sigh of relief.>\n\nWe thought you might not show up, <name>.",c="等你准备好以后，我会将护命匣放在门前召唤塞尔赞出来。",cEN="When you're ready I'll place the phylactery out in front of the gateway and call forth Thel'zan."}
Q[12473]={d="Toda buena historia tiene un principio y un final, $n. Aunque tu historia está lejos de terminar, ¡que me maldigan si ya no se está convirtiendo en leyenda! Da igual lo que nos ocurra cuando todo esto termine, lo que has hecho en Hibergarde será una historia que quedará grabada de aquí en adelante.\n\nAhora, $gamigo:amiga;, cuando me digas, usaré la filacteria para obligar a Thel'zan a que salga de su escondrijo.\n\nSi logramos la victoria, informa al alto comandante Halford Aterravermis en la Fortaleza de Hibergarde.",dEN="Every good story has a beginning and an ending, <name>. While your story is far from over, I'll be damned if it's not already turning out to be the stuff of legend! No matter what happens to us when this is all over, what you've done at Wintergarde will be a tale told for years to come.\n\nNow, ally, when you are ready I will use the phylactery to coax Thel'zan out of hiding.\n\nShould we somehow succeed, report the victory to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep.",o="击败塞尔赞，然后转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，向高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩报告。",oEN="Defeat Thel'zan the Duskbringer and report to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",c="Wintergarde se ha salvado gracias a ti, <name>. Pensar que un <hombre/mujer> pudiera cambiar el curso de la batalla tan rápidamente es algo difícil de comprender para la mayoría; y sin embargo, aquí estamos: ¡victoriosos! Has logrado restaurar la fe de esta gente y te has ganado el respeto de tus oficiales superiores.\n\n<Halford saluda.>\n\n¡Lord Fordragon ha regresado a Angrathar para preparar nuestras fuerzas para la destrucción de la Puerta de la Ira y ha solicitado que te unas a él! No podría recomendar a un mejor soldado para el trabajo, <name>.",cEN="Wintergarde is saved because of you, <name>. To think that one <man/woman> could so swiftly turn the tides of battle is hard for most to comprehend; yet here we are - victorious! You have managed to restore the faith of these people and earned the respect of your commanding officers.\n\n<Halford salutes.>\n\nLord Fordragon has returned to Angrathar to prepare our forces for the destruction of the Wrathgate and has requested that you join him! I couldn't recommend a better soldier for the job, <name>."}
Q[12474]={d="随着纳克萨玛斯战争机器的哑火，现在你要去天灾之门安加萨援助我们的部队。我们的指挥部——弗塔根要塞就坐落在龙骨荒野北部的群山环抱之中。弗塔根大人正在那里等着你！立刻就动身吧，$n！\n\n从镇子的北门出去，向西北方向进发。\n\n圣光与你同在！",dEN="With the Naxxramas war machine stopped dead in its tracks the time has come for you to help our forces at Angrathar, the Wrathgate. Nestled against the mountain in northern Dragonblight is our base of operations, Fordragon Hold. It is there that Lord Fordragon awaits your arrival! Go now, <name>!\n\nTake the north gate out of town and travel north by northwest until you arrive at your destination.\n\nLight protect you!",o="Aventúrate en el Bastión Fordragón en el Cementerio de Dragones y habla con el alto señor Bolvar Fordragón.|n",oEN="Venture to Fordragon Hold in Dragonblight and speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.",c="Esta condecoración solo se otorga a quienes han ido más allá del cumplimiento del deber en nombre de la Alianza. Podría contar con una sola mano el número de veces que he entregado esta, <name>, ¡y nadie ha sido más merecedor que tú! ¡Enhorabuena!\n\nAhora, observemos la Puerta de la Ira. ¿Os resulta familiar? Debería. Ese extraño mineral que encontrasteis en la mina de Wintergarde es exactamente de lo que está hecha la Puerta de la Ira. ¡Encontraremos su debilidad y la expondremos para que todos la vean! Pero primero...",cEN="This commendation is only given to those that have gone above and beyond the call of duty in the name of the Alliance. I could count the number of times I've handed this one out on one hand, <name>, and never has anyone been more deserving than you! Congratulations!\n\nNow, let us look upon the Wrathgate. Does it look familiar? It should. That strange ore you found at the Wintergarde Mine is exactly what the Wrathgate is made from. We will find its weakness and expose it for all to see! First, though..."}
Q[12475]={d="自从在遗忘海岸叛变之后，阿尔萨斯王子就开始寻找霜之哀伤，而穆拉丁一直陪着他。藏有霜之哀伤的洞穴会不会就在附近呢？它隐藏着怎样的秘密呢？虽然水晶球不能给我答案，但它确实告诉了我一些信息。\n\n在暮冬要塞的东北方有一座血色先锋军的堡垒，那里面的某处收藏着一份地图。水晶球告诉我，这份地图会给我们提供很大的帮助。\n\n去把它拿来！",dEN="After the betrayal at the Forgotten Shore, Prince Arthas - with Muradin in tow - began his quest for Frostmourne. Could the location of the cavern where Frostmourne was found be near? What secrets could it hold? While the orb has no answers for these questions, it does show me something.\n\nTo the northeast of Wintergarde Keep is an outpost built by the Scarlet Onslaught. Somewhere within that outpost is a map. The orb tells me that this map will be of great use to us.\n\nRetrieve it!",o="暮冬要塞的幻象师瑟里格要你去找到先锋军地图。",oEN="Zelig the Visionary at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to find the Onslaught Map and return it to him.",p="你找到先锋军地图了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the Onslaught map?",c="一个洞窟？有可能吗？这没有任何关联性啊！",cEN="A cave? Could it be? There can be no other correlation!"}
Q[12476]={d="En el noreste de la Fortaleza de Hibergarde hay un nuevo campamento construido por la Cruzada Escarlata o, mejor dicho, El Embate Escarlata, que es como se autodenominan. Mientras que no estamos seguros de porqué están en Rasganorte, seguramente no son menos peligrosos de lo que eran antes. De hecho, desde anoche El Embate Escarlata ha matado a doce de nuestros soldados. Deben aprender una lección, $n.\n\nVe al campamento del Embate y reduce su número. |n",dEN="To the northeast of Wintergarde Keep is a newly built encampment, set up by the Scarlet Crusade - or rather - the Scarlet Onslaught as they now call themselves. While we are unsure as to why they are in Northrend, they are certainly no less dangerous than they were before. As of last night the Scarlet Onslaught has killed twelve of our soldiers. They must be taught a lesson, <name>.\n\nGo to Onslaught Base Camp and thin them out.",o="暮冬要塞的指挥官莱诺尔·风矛要你转至先锋军营地，消灭20个血色先锋军成员。",oEN="Commander Lynore Windstryke at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to kill 20 Scarlet Onslaught at the Onslaught Base Camp.",p="Limpia el campamento base de Onslaught, <name>.",pEN="Clear out the Onslaught Base Camp, <name>.",c="希望对这些先锋军来说，我们的表达的消息已经很清楚了。我希望这些攻击行动足以让他们怀疑是否要继续加入那个组织。",cEN="Hopefully the message is now clear to the Onslaught. I hope it was enough of a beating to make them doubt their affiliations."}
Q[12477]={d="\"El Camino de la Redención\", ¿no has oído nunca a hablar de él? Supuestamente es una publicación con divagaciones proféticas de la alta general Abbendis de El Embate Escarlata. Dentro de este libro puedes encontrar las motivaciones y objetivos de los zelotes Escarlata, además de una gran cantidad de locuras.\n\nAventúrate al campamento del Embate al noreste de la Fortaleza de Hibergarde y recupera una copia de \"El Camino de la Redención\" de uno de los soldados del Embate.",dEN="\"The Path of Redemption,\" ever heard of it? It is allegedly a journal that holds the prophetic ramblings of High General Abbendis of the Scarlet Onslaught. Within that book can be found the motivations and goals of the Scarlet zealots - not to mention a whole lot of insanity.\n\nVenture to Onslaught Base Camp, northeast of Wintergarde Keep, and recover a copy of \"The Path of Redemption\" from one of the Onslaught soldiers.",o="Devuelve \"El Camino de la Redención\" al alto comandante Halford Aterravermis en la Fortaleza de Hibergarde en el Cementerio de Dragones.",oEN="Return \"The Path of Redemption\" to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",p="你找到书了吗？",pEN="Did you find a copy?",c="<Halford lee el diario.>\n\nAbbendis se ha vuelto loca. ¿La Luz le habla ahora?\n\nA pesar de los desvaríos absurdos, este diario nos ofrece una visión nunca antes vista de la mente de los fanáticos escarlatas. Esto ha sido un gran hallazgo, <name>. Lord Fordragon estará complacido.",cEN="<Halford reads the journal.>\n\nAbbendis has gone off the deep end. The Light speaks to her now?\n\nDespite the inane ramblings, this journal gives us a never before seen look into the mind of the Scarlet zealots. This was a great find, <name>. Lord Fordragon will be pleased."}
Q[12478]={d="他们把这处山洞称为霜之哀伤洞穴。我们还不知道为什么血色先锋军会对此感兴趣，但据我们所知，该地区周围都有重兵把守。无论如何，我们必须勇往直前！\n\n带着这颗水晶球从镇子北方出去，然后转至西北方的血色哨站。你要进入洞穴并一直杀到最深处去。到那里以后，使用水晶球，然后回来把你的发现都告诉我。",dEN="They have labeled the cave as Frostmourne Cavern. Why the Scarlet Onslaught is interested in such things is unknown, but by the look of things, the area surrounding the cave is heavily guarded. Nonetheless, we must proceed!\n\nTake this scrying orb and travel north out of town and then northwest towards Scarlet Point. Make your way into the cave and battle your way to the bottom. Once there, use the orb. Return here with what you discover.",o="龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的幻象师瑟里格要你在霜之哀伤洞穴深处使用瑟里格的占卜宝珠，解开尘封的秘密！",oEN="Zelig the Visionary at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to use Zelig's Scrying Orb at the bottom of Frostmourne Cavern. Unlock the secrets of the past!",p="搜过霜之哀伤洞窟了吗？",pEN="Have you searched Frostmourne Cavern?",c="穆拉丁还活着？怎么可能？我得马上通知铜须国王！\n\n我得再检查宝珠，一定还有其它的情报——就在某处！",cEN="Muradin lives? Could it be? I must nofity King Bronzebeard at once!\n\nI need to consult the orb. There must be more information - somewhere!"}
Q[12481]={d="维库人在这事上确实处理得很聪明，幸好我还有其它办法。\n\n他们的首领布约恩非常暴躁。我们用他们的语言拼出了几句脏话，好像提到了他的母亲和大型家畜之类的……我们自己也不是很明白。\n\n把这张纸上内容给他念一念。一旦他追过来，你就把他引到这里来。我们绝对不能让他再活着回去。",dEN="The vrykul are being clever about this. Fortunately I've a trick up my sleeve.\n\nThis leader of theirs, Bjorn, is a real hothead. We've pieced together enough of their language to fashion what we think is a good insult. Something involving his mother and large barnyard animals... we're not quite sure.\n\nTake this piece of paper and read it to him. Once he starts chasing you, lure him back here. We'll make sure he doesn't make it out alive.",o="在拜尔海姆对布约恩·哈古德森朗读维库人的脏话，然后把他引到林德尔的伏击点，帮助林德尔杀了他。",oEN="Read the Vrykul Insult to Bjorn Halgurdsson in Baleheim, then lead him back to Lydell's Ambush and help slay him.",p="刺杀工作其实并不像看起来的那样迷人。",pEN="Assassination work isn't as glamorous as it's made out to be.",c="干的好。那个可怜的呆子完全没发现。",cEN="Nice work. That poor sap never saw it coming."}
Q[12482]={d="我们迫切希望复仇港派来增援，帮助我们对抗尼弗莱瓦。如果我们能够尽早夺得那里的控制权，就能在与联盟的对抗中取得巨大的优势。\n\n去尼弗莱瓦看看你能做点什么吧。",dEN="We await reinforcements from Vengeance Landing to move against Nifflevar. If we were to capture it earlier, though, it would provide us with a great advantage over the Alliance.\n\nHead into town and see if you can put a dent in their numbers.",o="游侠队长艾蕾尔要你转至尼弗莱瓦，杀死5名掠龙战士、4名掠龙符文法师和4条掠龙猎犬。",oEN="Ranger Captain Areiel wants you to go to Nifflevar and slay 5 Dragonflayer Warriors, 4 Dragonflayer Rune-Seers and 4 Dragonflayer Hunting Hounds.",p="Salve, <name>.",pEN="Hail, <name>.",c="Excelente trabajo, <name>. Cuando lleguen nuestras fuerzas de Vengeance Landing, podremos encargarnos de cualquier vrykul que quede.",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. When our forces from Vengeance Landing arrive, we'll be able to take care of any vrykul that are left."}
Q[12483]={d="Oye, mientras estás aquí, ¿qué te parece ayudar al viejo Prigmon en un trabajillo? Tengo un amigo que puede hacer un cocido estupendo, ¡uno como no has probado antes!\n\nPero necesita varios ingredientes que hay por aquí. Están en las ruinas al suroeste y en el campamento justo al norte de aquí.\n\n¿Qué me dices, $gtron:titi;?",dEN="Say, while yer here, how bout ya help ol' Prigmon with a little chore? I got a friend who can make a mean stew - one like ya never tasted before!\n\nThere be a few ingredients found in these parts that he be needin'. They be in ruins to the southwest and the camp just north o' here.\n\nWhatd'ya say, mon?",o="岩石之泉的普雷蒙要你在达克辛废墟中收集5份幽光雪菇和5份冰蛇之眼，再到塞布哈拉克去收集5份甜根茎。",oEN="Prigmon in Granite Springs wants you to collect 5 Shimmering Snowcaps and 5 Ice Serpent Eyes from Drak'Zin Ruins and 5 Sweetroot from Zeb'Halak.",p="¿Consigues esos ingredientes para el viejo Prigmon, <name>?",pEN="You get those ingredients for 'ol Prigmon, <name>?",c="哦，老兄——炖幽光雪菇！我好像都尝到它的味道了……",cEN="Oh, mon - shimmercap stew! I can almost taste it already...."}
Q[12484]={d="呃。\n\n要把这些可怜的巨魔清理掉让我很心疼，但不如我的背疼！\n\n帮老普雷蒙一个忙，把这拖到马克那里去。\n\n如果我们不把它们清理掉，它们很快又会变得活蹦乱跳了。",dEN="Ugh.\n\nWrappin' up these unfortunate trolls be makin' my heart ache, but not so much as my back!\n\nHelp ol' Prigmon out and haul one of these carcasses over to Mack.\n\nIf we don't burn 'em they be walkin' again in no time.",o="岩石之泉的普雷蒙要你把一具僵化的巨魔尸体拖到马克·菲尔森那里，并把它用高温处理掉。",oEN="Prigmon at Granite Springs wants you to bring a Mummified Troll Carcass to Mack Fearsen and place it in the fire.",p="¿Qué tienes ahí, <race>?",pEN="Whatcha got there, <race>?",c="No hay nada mejor que ver arder a esa Plaga... .\n\nEscribí una cancioncilla sobre ello. ¿Quieres oírla? Aquí va....",cEN="Nothin' better than watchin' them shcourge burn... .\n\nWrote a little shong about it. Wanna hear it? Here goes...."}
Q[12486]={d="你感觉到了吗？\n\n<萨乌拉诺克突然开始胡乱地在自己的胸口上乱抓，直到抓出了一道道血痕。>\n\n我刚感觉到……在我的老朋友格雷姆沃克身上发生了一些可怕的事情。\n\n他的一个学生与他一起转至北方，去帮助酋长在索拉查盆地的边缘创建前哨站。\n\n她名叫斯纳尔芬，是个灵语者。\n\n或许她知道发生了些什么事情，至少她能帮你找出原因。",dEN="Did you feel it?\n\n<Sauranok momentarily clutches his chest in confusion. His hand comes away trailing red-hot steam.>\n\nSomething terrible has happened to my old friend, Farseer Grimwalker. I just sensed it.\n\nHe had a pupil that he took with him when he went north. They were going to help the overlord establish an outpost on the edge of Sholazar Basin.\n\nHer name is Snarlfang. She is a spirit talker.\n\nPerhaps she will know what happened. Or, at least, she can help you to find out.",o="与博古洛克前哨站的灵语者斯纳尔芬谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Spirit Talker Snarlfang at Bor'gorok Outpost.",c="秘法师知道了？你说他感觉到有可怕的事情发生在先知厉行者身上？\n\n喔，这正是我所害怕的！",cEN="The mystic knows? You say he felt that something horrible happened to Farseer Grimwalker?\n\nIt is as I feared!"}
Q[12487]={d="我收到了一封来自灰熊丘陵的寻求帮助的信，所以我决定派你去见见征服者克雷娜。\n\n<高级执行官挥舞着一捆羊皮纸，似乎他并不在乎上面写了些什么。>\n\n她正试图保护所有天然资源之类的东西。不过在她周围的时候要小心点，据说即使是对待兽人，她也是毫不客气。\n\n沿着这条路向东走，然后转向东南。跨过龙脊草河上的桥之后，从常青商栈往东走就到了。",dEN="I've received a request for help from our base in the Grizzly Hills. I'm sending you to see Conqueror Krenna.\n\n<The high executor waves a sheaf of parchment in the air as if he could care less what is written on it.>\n\nShe's attempting to secure all of the natural resources or somesuch. Just watch your back around her. The word is that she's aggressive even for an orc.\n\nFollow the road east and then southeast. Cross the bridge at the Dragonspine Tributary and go east from the Evergreen Trading Post.",o="转至灰熊丘陵的征服堡，向征服者克雷娜介绍你自己。",oEN="Present yourself to Conqueror Krenna at Conquest Hold in the Grizzly Hills.",c="你是谁？\n\n告诉我为什么我不该当场把你劈成两半？",cEN="Who are you?\n\nTell me why I shouldn't split you in two where you stand!"}
Q[12488]={d="幸运的是，在这封请求信交到阿格玛大王手上之前，我从高级执行官乌洛斯这里把它截获了下来。乌洛斯在想什么？\n\n<中士把他手里的信件撕得粉碎。>\n\n$C，去看看高级执行官需要些什么。\n\n沿着这条路往东，穿过巨龙废土。你可以在东南边找到一条走出荒地的道路，亡灵城镇怨毒镇就矗立在山脉的南面。",dEN="It's a good thing that I intercepted this request from High Executor Wroth before it got to Overlord Agmar. What is Wroth thinking?\n\n<The sergeant rips up the letter that he's holding.>\n\n<class>, go see what it is that the high executor wants.\n\nFollow the road east and pass through The Dragon Wastes. You'll find a path leading up out of the wastes on the southeast side, and the Forsaken town, Venomspite, will stand before you on the south side of the mountain.",o="与龙骨荒野怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Executor Wroth at Venomspite in Dragonblight.",c="阿格玛之锤那边派你来的？正是时候！\n\n不，我不需要帮忙。我只是腾不出人手了，但你刚好派得上用场。",cEN="You were sent from Agmar's Hammer? It's about time!\n\nNo, the help is not for me. I simply have no one else to spare, but you'll do."}
Q[12489]={d="那么，你是从哪儿来的？该不会是那些白痴大法师把你派到这里来的吧？\n\n听我说，$g小子:小丫头，你现在还没缺胳膊少腿的可真是个奇迹，绝对的奇迹！\n\n这片丛林是块非常非常危险的地方，特别是在风险投资公司掺和进来以后。\n\n不如你去见见我们老大吧，他会安排你的工作的。营地就在西北边道路的尽头。\n\n还不快去！",dEN="So, where did you come from? I don't suppose that fool of an archmage sent you, too?\n\nYou're lucky to be in one piece, <laddie/lass>! They nearly blew you up!\n\nThe jungle here's a darned dangerous place, 'specially with the Venture Company about.\n\nGit you! Go see the boss... he'll sort you out. The camp's at the end of that path to the northwest.\n\nNow, git!",o="沿着西北方的道路转至蒙特提到的营地。",oEN="Follow the path to the northwest to reach the camp that Monte mentioned.",c="¡Ja! No es frecuente encontrarse con un completo extraño en medio de la selva.\n\n¿Eres uno de esos lacayos druidas enviados para \"detenerme a mí y mis malas artes\"? ¡Sí, buena suerte con eso!\n\n<Hemet suelta una carcajada y da una palmada a su arma>.\n\n¡No lo creo! Eres más que bienvenido a unirte a nosotros en la caza, tan pronto como nos hayamos ocupado de esos perros de la Venture Company. Habrá suficiente para todos.",cEN="Hah! It's not often you run into a complete stranger in the middle of the jungle.\n\nYou one those druid lackeys sent to \"stop me and my evil ways?\" Yeah, good luck with that one!\n\n<Hemet lets out a hearty laugh and pats his gun.>\n\nDidn't think so! You're more than welcome to join us in the hunt, soon as we've dealt with those Venture Company dogs. There'll be plenty to go around."}
Q[12491]={d="断气的科林·烈酒手中还紧紧抓着一只小酒桶。这大概就是他所酿造的臭名昭着的烈酒吧！",dEN="Coren Direbrew's corpse clutched this small cask tightly to its gut. This must be his infamous Dire Brew!",o="将科林的烈酒交给铁炉堡附近美酒节营地的埃菲库格·铁桶。",oEN="Give Direbrew's Dire Brew to Ipfelkofer Ironkeg at the Brewfest camp near Ironforge.",p="<name>, tienes una expresión sombría. ¿Traes malas noticias?",pEN="<name>, your face has a grim set to it. Do you have dire news?",c="这就是寇仁·恐酒的饮料？他急着想要在美酒节提交的酒？哎，官方无法认可这次的提交，不过出于对一位逝去酿酒者的尊敬，也许我会尝一尝……",cEN="This is the Coren Direbrew's drink? The brew he wanted more than anything to submit at Brewfest? Well, officially we can't recognize this submission, but out of respect for a fallen brewer, perhaps I'll have a taste..."}
Q[12492]={d="断气的科林·烈酒手中还紧紧抓着一只小酒桶。这大概就是他所酿造的臭名昭着的烈酒吧！",dEN="Coren Direbrew's corpse clutched this small cask tightly to its gut. This must be his infamous Dire Brew!",o="将科林的烈酒交给奥格瑞玛附近美酒节营地的塔波尔·斯威雷格。",oEN="Give Direbrew's Dire Brew to Tapper Swindlekeg at the Brewfest camp near Orgrimmar.",p="<name>, ¡tienes la cara manchada! ¿Has estado en las Profundidades de la Montaña Negra?",pEN="Hey <name>, your face is all smudged! Have you been to Blackrock Depths?",c="啊，所以恐酒最后还是提交了他的酒。真是可惜，他得以性命来完成提交……\n\n喔，这个嘛。干杯吧，嗯？",cEN="Ah, so Direbrew finally submitted his brew. What a pity he had to die to do it...\n\nOh, well. Bottoms up, eh?"}
Q[12495]={d="我们对安加萨的进攻让天灾军团乱了阵脚，但仍然没有露出什么破绽。他们派出了冰霜巨龙向我们狂轰滥炸，使得我们在天灾之门不能再前进半步。我们必须阻止冰霜巨龙的攻击，不过在我们解决这些古代巨龙的骨架之前，必须获得他们女王的许可。\n\n去东南方的龙眠神殿寻找阿莱克丝塔萨女王。告诉她我们必须这么做，并寻求她的指引。\n\n去吧，$n！",dEN="Our assault against Angrathar has staggered the Scourge, but they remain unrelenting. From overhead they send their frost wyrms to strafe the field of battle, making an advance upon the gate itself impossible. The frost wyrm attacks must be stopped, but before we defile the bones of ancient dragons, we must gain permission from their queen.\n\nTravel southeast to Wyrmrest Temple and seek out Queen Alexstrasza. Tell her what we must do and ask her for guidance.\n\nGo now, <name>!",o="在龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿寻找阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Seek out Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",c="你来寻求我的指示，凡人。我知道这点，但你知不知道自己在面对什么呢？\n\n<阿莱克丝塔萨指向北方。>\n\n此地的北方是迦拉克隆之墓……它是龙族的先祖。泰坦们就是依照迦拉克隆造出了守护巨龙，我们是不是就不难想象迦拉克隆的力量了？他的体型比所有的守护巨龙加起来还要大！现在试着理解天灾军团在广袤的龙骨荒野所做的一切。\n\n冰霜巨龙——凡人——并不是你最该关心的问题。",cEN="You have come seeking my council, mortal. This I know, but do you know what it is that you face?\n\n<Alexstrasza points northward.>\n\nNorth of here are the dying grounds of Galakrond - progenitor of dragonkind. It is from Galakrond that the Titans created the Aspects. Imagine, then, the power of Galakrond. His size alone was greater than all of the Aspects combined! Now attempt to understand what the Scourge do in the Great Dragonblight.\n\nFrost wyrms, mortal, should be the least of your concerns."}
Q[12496]={d="尽管我知道你很希望能立即消灭在天灾之门顽抗的天灾士兵，但我们必须首先解决掉盘旋在头顶的威胁。如果冰霜巨龙的轰炸不停止，我们就根本不能前进半步。\n\n不过在我们把那些骨头龙给打下来之前，必须先得到他们女王的许可。现在就转至龙族的圣地——龙眠神殿。等你到了那里之后，找到阿莱克丝塔萨女王。\n\n现在就出发吧，$n！向着东南方的龙眠神殿前进！",dEN="Though I know you hunger to destroy the Scourge that stand before us at the Wrath Gate, we must first deal with the threat that looms overhead. Until the strafing assaults of the frost wyrms are halted, we cannot move forward.\n\nBut before we assault the dying grounds of dragons, we must first be granted permission. Venture now to the hallowed halls of dragonkind: Wyrmrest Temple. Once there, seek out Queen Alexstrasza.\n\nRide now, <name>! Southeast, to Wyrmrest!",o="在龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿寻找阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Seek out Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",c="你来寻求我的指示，凡人。我知道这点，但你知不知道自己在面对什么呢？\n\n<阿莱克丝塔萨指向北方。>\n\n此地的北方是迦拉克隆之墓……它是龙族的先祖。泰坦们就是依照迦拉克隆造出了守护巨龙，我们是不是就不难想象迦拉克隆的力量了？他的体型比所有的守护巨龙加起来还要大！现在试着理解天灾军团在广袤的龙骨荒野所做的一切。\n\n冰霜巨龙——凡人——并不是你最该关心的问题。",cEN="You have come seeking my council, mortal. This I know, but do you know what it is that you face?\n\n<Alexstrasza points northward.>\n\nNorth of here are the dying grounds of Galakrond - progenitor of dragonkind. It is from Galakrond that the Titans created the Aspects. Imagine, then, the power of Galakrond. His size alone was greater than all of the Aspects combined! Now attempt to understand what the Scourge do in the Great Dragonblight.\n\nFrost wyrms, mortal, should be the least of your concerns."}
Q[12497]={d="在邪恶之旋的顶端，天灾军团的通灵主宰安提沃克正坐在经他改造过的风暴巨人之王——西亚斯的肩膀上，指挥着亡灵日以继夜地挖掘迦拉克隆的巨大骨架。如果他们成功地复活了迦拉克隆，你们所有的努力都将化为乌有。\n\n虽然我不能调动红龙的全部力量来帮助你，但我会将我的祝福赐予你。出发吧，去和我的总管托拉斯塔萨谈谈。",dEN="Atop the Wicked Coil, the Grand Necrolord of the Scourge, Antiok, sits upon the shoulders of the reconstructed storm giant lord, Thiassi. From there he commands the armies of undead to work day and night to unearth Galakrond's massive bones. Should they succeed in raising Galakrond, all of your efforts will have been for naught.\n\nWhile I cannot call down the full fury of the Red Dragonflight to assist you in your journey, I will grant you my blessing. Go now and speak with my majordomo, Torastrasza.",o="与龙骨荒野龙眠神殿的托拉斯塔萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Torastrasza at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",c="凡人的勇气总是使我震惊。死亡冰冷地凝视着你们，而你们却起身挑战它！这也是为什么你们这些种族是如此的被深爱着……也被痛恨着。\n\n虽然红龙军团与玛里苟斯的战事胶着，我们还是可以提供一些帮助。",cEN="The bravery of mortals never fails to astound me. Death affixes its cold stare upon you and in return you rise to challenge its assertion! It is why your kind is so loved... and so hated.\n\nEven though the Red Dragonflight is entrenched in a war with Malygos, there is something that we can do to help."}
Q[12498]={d="Utiliza esta baliza para hacer señas a un vencedor del Reposo del Dragón. Monta sobre su lomo y vuela hacia el norte hasta Reposo de Galakrond. Una vez allí, ordena al dragón que acabe con los carroñeros de la Plaga que trabajan desenterrando a Galakrond. Cuando hayas despejado la zona, vuela hasta La Espiral Maldita, que asoma a Reposo de Galakrond, para matar al gran necroseñor Antiok y recuperar la guadaña que usa para controlar a las vermis.\n\nHaz esto y vuelve junto a la reina Alexstrasza para obtener ¡una recompensa de $ghéroe:heroína;!\n\n$n, ¡ten cuidado con los gigantes de tormenta putrefactos de la zona!",dEN="Use this beacon to signal a Wyrmrest vanquisher. Climb upon its back and fly north to Galakrond's Rest. Once there, command the dragon to destroy the Scourge scavengers that work to unearth Galakrond. Once the area has been cleansed, fly to the Wicked Coil, overlooking Galakrond's Rest, to destroy Grand Necrolord Antiok and recover the scythe that he uses to control the wyrms.\n\nDo this and return to Queen Alexstrasza for a hero's reward!\n\n<name>, beware the rotting storm giants that wander the area!",o="消灭30个废土挖掘者并夺取安提沃克的镰刀。完成这个任务之后，回到龙眠神殿去找阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Destroy 30 Wastes Scavengers and recover the Scythe of Antiok. Return to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple should you complete this task.",p="在事情还不是太迟之前消灭迦拉克隆之墓的天灾军团！",pEN="Destroy the Scourge at Galakrond's Rest before it is too late!",c="Sabía que volverías, <name>. Has servido al Acuerdo del Descanso del Dragón y has salvado a tu gente de una muerte segura. ¡Que se sepa por todos y que quede registrado para la posteridad!",cEN="I knew that you would return, <name>. You have served the Wyrmrest Accord and saved your people from certain death. Let it be known to all and let it be recorded for posterity!"}
Q[12499]={d="Con la muerte de Antiok y la guadaña en nuestra posesión, cesarán los asaltos de las vermis de escarcha sobre nuestro ejército en Angrathar. Daremos caza y mataremos a las vermis que queden en el Cementerio de Dragones y sus huesos regresarán a la tierra.\n\nHa llegado la hora de la verdad, $n. Vuelve al Bastión de Fordragón e informa al alto señor Fordragón.|n",dEN="With Antiok slain and the scythe in our possession, the frost wyrm assaults upon your forces at Angrathar will halt. The wyrms that remain in the Dragonblight will be hunted and destroyed, their bones returning to the earth.\n\nThe time to make your final stand is now, <name>. Return to Fordragon Hold and notify Highlord Fordragon.",o="Habla con el alto señor Bolvar Fordragón en el Bastión de Fordragón y cuéntale tu victoria sobre la Plaga.|n",oEN="Speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon at Fordragon Hold and tell him of your victory over the Scourge.",c="记住：你所做的所有事情成就了现在。没有你的努力，我们可能已经被消灭了！现在，当我进入战场并准备终结这一切时，保持警戒！",cEN="Know this: all that you have done has led to this moment. Without your efforts, we would have been finished! Now, stand guard as I take to the field and end this!"}
Q[12500]={d="随着安提沃克被消灭，镰刀也在我们的手中，在安加萨攻击你们的冰霜巨龙也会消停一段时间。龙骨荒野残存的冰霜巨龙将被消灭，他们的骸骨将重归泥土之中。\n\n现在是发动最后一战的时刻了，$n。回到库卡隆先锋营地，向小萨鲁法尔报告吧。",dEN="With Antiok slain and the scythe in our possession, the frost wyrm assaults upon your forces at Angrathar will halt. The wyrms that remain in the Dragonblight will be hunted and destroyed, their bones returning to the earth.\n\nThe time to make your final stand is now, <name>. Return to the Kor'kron Vanguard and notify Saurfang the Younger.",o="回到库卡隆先锋营地，向小萨鲁法尔汇报你对天灾军团取得的胜利。",oEN="Speak with Saurfang the Younger at the Kor'kron Vangaurd and tell him of your victory over the Scourge.",c="Mi padre tenía razón sobre ti, <name>. Todo lo que dijo se ha cumplido; solo queda un último deber sin realizar. Ahora lideraré a los Kor'kron a la línea de frente. El momento de acabar con esta guerra ha llegado. ¡La tiranía del Reylich termina hoy!\n\nToma mi puesto ahora, <name>, y monta guardia sobre nuestras fuerzas.",cEN="My father was right about you, <name>. Everything that he said has come to pass - only one final duty remains unfulfilled. I will now lead the Kor'kron to the front line. The time to end this war is at hand. The Lich King's tyranny ends today!\n\nTake my post now, <name>, and stand guard over our forces."}
Q[12501]={d="拔出你的武器，$r。巡逻的时候到了！\n\n我们要拼死保住手中的四座岗哨，这对我们取得胜利有着关键性的意义。我要你去逐一巡查这几处岗哨，并向他们提供帮助。\n\n你可以从东南方的布兰顿上尉那里开始。等你完成他指派的任务后，他就会指引你去下一座岗哨。\n\n巡查完所有四座岗哨后再回来向我复命。记住——你回来得越快，报酬就越丰厚！所以给我动作麻利一点！\n\n解散！",dEN="Unsheathe that weapon, <race>. It's time to go on patrol!\n\nI've got four posts under my command and it's crucial to our success that they remain in our control. I'm ordering you to visit each of them and offer your assistance.\n\nYou can begin with Captain Brandon southeast of here. He'll direct you to the next post when he's finished with you.\n\nReport back to me once you've assisted each of my men. And remember, you'll be more richly rewarded for returning to me quickly - so double-time it!\n\nDismissed!",o="El comandante Kunz de El Confín Argenta quiere que visites los cuatro puestos de la Cruzada Argenta, cumplas las órdenes de sus capitanes y vuelvas para informarle.\n\nEl capitán Brandon y el capitán Rupert están apostados en Drak'Sotra, el capitán Grondel está apostado en Drak'Agal y el alquimista Finklestein está apostado en Heb'Valok.",oEN="Commander Kunz at the Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their captain's orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Captain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, and Alchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'Valok.",p="¿Qué noticias hay de nuestros puestos, <race>?",pEN="What news from our posts, <race>?",c="Bueno, <name>, al menos has vuelto entero. Supongo que eso vale algo...",cEN="Well, <name>, at least you've made it back in one piece. I suppose that's worth something...."}
Q[12502]={d="听着，$c。我们是银色北伐军。我们的部队会战斗到最后一刻，而且无论环境多么恶劣，我们也不会抱怨。\n\n也就是说，我们在这次的行动中遭受了相当严重的损失。而且这几个月里我们一直在拼命战斗，几乎没有合过眼。无论我们承认与否，这些都会对士气造成打击。\n\n虽然效果可能不是很明显，但能看到我们的旗帜在战场上飘扬，还是会让战士们感到安慰的。拿着这些旗帜，把它们挂到达克索塔的支架上去。",dEN="Listen, <class>. This is the Argent Crusade. Our men will fight to the end and never complain no matter what the conditions.\n\nThat said, we've taken some heavy casualties in this campaign and we've been hitting it hard with little or no sleep for months. That all takes a toll on morale, whether we admit it or not.\n\nIt may not seem like much, but seeing our standard raised over the battlefield is of considerable comfort to a soldier. Take these banners and raise them at the pedestals in Drak'Sotra.",o="布兰顿上尉要你将银色北伐军战旗挂在达克索塔的达卡莱支架上。",oEN="Captain Brandon wants you to place the Argent Crusade Banner in the Drakkari Pedestals at Drak'Sotra.",c="干得好，朋友。\n\n一面旗帜在战场中的效果是很惊人的。\n\n你的下一站是去找鲁伯特上尉。他就驻守在东北边的城墙那。",cEN="Good work, friend.\n\nAmazing what a little of one's colors do for a battleground.\n\nYou'll want to head on over to Captain Rupert next. He's stationed at the wall, just northeast of here."}
Q[12503]={d="A pesar de nuestros importantes éxitos en el tercio inferior de Zul'Drak, aún debemos enfrentarnos a la ofensiva de la Plaga. Así son las cosas en este infierno helado.\n\nLos ataques son constantes, pero mis hombres necesitan descansar. Si estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta;, podrías ayudarnos a reforzarlos.\n\nAbajo, en el patio, la refriega no tiene fin. Enfréntate allí a la Plaga con todo el afán que te sea posible, $c.",dEN="Despite our substantial successes in the lower third of Zul'Drak, we must still face the onslaught of the Scourge. Such is the way in this frigid hell.\n\nThe attacks are unrelenting, yet my men need rest. If you are willing, we could use your aid in reinforcing them.\n\nBelow in the courtyard you'll find no end to the fighting. Dispatch the Scourge there with all the zeal you can muster, <class>.",o="指挥官法斯塔夫要你到银色前沿的庭院中去，消灭任意10个天灾军团士兵。",oEN="Commander Falstaav has tasked you with the destruction of any 10 Scourge in the courtyard at The Argent Stand.",p="或许你可以再多杀一点？",pEN="Perhaps you could destroy a few more?",c="非常感谢你对这件事的帮助。如果没有你的努力，我们可能很难抵抗住那些不死生物的进攻。",cEN="Your assistance in this matter is greatly appreciated. Were it not for your efforts, we would have difficulty in holding the unliving back from our steps."}
Q[12504]={d="<中士很快读完了你交给他的命令，皱起了眉。>\n\n你看，$g小伙子:小姐，我是很愿意卷铺盖走人的，但请你到外面去看看。我的人都在战斗。\n\n我跟你说，既然你已经来了，能帮我一个小忙，把我的士兵聚集起来好吗？\n\n告诉他们说，中士要他们立刻回来复命。如果你愿意的话，可以顺便帮帮他们。",dEN="<The sergeant quickly reads through the orders you've handed him, a frown coming over his face.>\n\nLook, <lad /lass>, I'd love to just up and leave, but take a look out there. All of my people are fighting.\n\nTell you what, you've come this far, you think you're up to doing me a small favor? Head out there and round up my soldiers?\n\nTell 'em that the sergeant orders them to report back immediately. Lend them a hand if you will.",o="西莱图斯祭坛的斯塔哈默中士要你和10个银色士兵交谈，让他们回去向他复命。",oEN="Sergeant Stackhammer at the Altar of Sseratus wants you to speak with 10 of his Argent Soldiers and tell them to report back to him.",p="我需要更多的士兵回来回报。",pEN="I'll need more of them to report back in than that.",c="太好了。我们已经集合剩下的人并准备回到银色前沿。\n\n真是丢脸，我们必须这么快就离开这里。我一点都不觉得在这里的工作已经完成了，坦白的说，我觉得祭坛前的先知将会是个大麻烦！",cEN="Alright then. We'll collect up the rest and head back to the stand.\n\nIt's a shame that we have to leave so soon. Doesn't quite feel like the job's done here, and quite frankly, I get the feeling that prophet in front of the altar is going to be big trouble!"}
Q[12505]={d="$C，你是来帮忙的，对吗？我对部署在北方达卡莱祭坛的部队有新的指示。\n\n那地方很容易找，只要沿着大路走就到了。到那边之后就去找斯塔哈默中士。",dEN="<class>, you're here to help, right? I've got new orders for our forces that are currently deployed at the Drakkari altar to the north.\n\nYou can't miss it. Just head straight up the avenue. Sergeant Stackhammer shouldn't be hard to find.",o="指挥官库恩斯要你把调度命令交给西莱图斯祭坛的斯塔哈默中士。",oEN="Commander Kunz has asked you to deliver the New Deployment Orders to Sergeant Stackhammer at the Altar of Sseratus.",p="这里面是什么？",pEN="What's this all about?",c="<El sargento enano observa con cautela las órdenes que tienes en la mano.>\n\n¿Son esas órdenes nuevas para mí, <mister /miss>?",cEN="<The dwarf sergeant warily eyes the orders in your hand.>\n\nAre those new orders for me, <mister /miss>?"}
Q[12506]={d="蛇神的祭坛那里有些麻烦。\n\n天灾军团的出现削弱了这片土地，$r。而这也削弱了那些原始神灵。\n\n我们知道那些达卡莱巨魔正在利用这个机会对这些神灵做某种邪恶的事。\n\n我要你充当我的耳目。西莱图斯祭坛就在通往北边的大路尽头。你要从背面潜入祭坛的主建筑里去看一眼。\n\n无论你怎么做，一定要避开那个先知！",dEN="There's trouble at the altar of the snake god.\n\nThe presence of the Scourge has weakened the land, <race>. This in turn has weakened the wild gods.\n\nWe know that the Drakkari are taking advantage of this to do evil things to the gods.\n\nI need you to be my eyes and ears. The Altar of Sseratus is at the end of the avenue to the north. Sneak around the back and get a look inside of the main altar building.\n\nWhatever you do, avoid the prophet at all costs!",o="银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈要你去调查西莱图斯祭坛的主建筑。",oEN="Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand has asked you to investigate the main altar building at the Altar of Sseratus.",p="¿Qué has visto, <race>?",pEN="What did you see, <race>?",c="亡灵？\n\n<妖术师的神态明显被你所带来的消息而影响。>\n\n他们杀掉了西莱图斯，并喝了了他的魔精——尤其是先知！\n\n我们必须想出一个方法来除掉他，以免他再喝掉更多的魔精！",cEN="Dead?\n\n<The hexxer's spirit is visibly lowered at the news you bring.>\n\nThey've killed Sseratus and drunk deeply of his mojo; the prophet especially!\n\nWe must figure out a way to put an end to him before he drinks too much more!"}
Q[12507]={d="这瓶奇怪的魔精也许可以解释这里所发生的一切。\n\n银色前沿的赞达拉巨魔——妖术师乌布戈可能会对这东西感兴趣。",dEN="This bottle of strange mojo may be the key to what is truly going on here.\n\nThe Zandalari troll Hexxer Ubungo, back at The Argent Stand, may want to take a look at it.",o="把奇怪的魔精交给银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈。",oEN="Deliver the Strange Mojo to Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand.",p="你找到了什么？",pEN="What's that you have there?",c="¡Ese es el mojo de los dioses salvajes, <class>!\n\n¡Esto no es bueno!",cEN="That's the mojo of the wild gods, <class>!\n\nThis is not good!"}
Q[12508]={d="很抱歉我听到了你和中士的谈话。虽然上面来了命令，但我们在这里仍然有事情要做。\n\n你出去的时候，能帮我们把一些西莱图斯的追随者从痛苦中解放出来吗？",dEN="I couldn't help but overhear what you were talking to the sergeant about. That doesn't change the fact that we still have a job to do here.\n\nWhile you're out there, do you think you could help us to put some of those followers of Sseratus out of their misery?",o="西莱图斯祭坛的玛加下士要你杀死任意10个西莱图斯勇士、西莱图斯祭司或达卡莱驯蛇者。",oEN="Corporal Maga at the Altar of Sseratus wants you to kill any combination of 10 Champions of Sseratus, Priests of Sseratus, or Drakkari Snake Handlers.",p="考虑再多杀一点吗？",pEN="How about killing a few more?",c="Gracias, <class>. Habría odiado irme sin cumplir lo que vinimos a hacer en primer lugar.",cEN="Thanks, <class>. I'd have hated to leave without accomplishing what we came out here for in the first place."}
Q[12509]={d="巡逻员总算来了！\n\n情况是这样的，$r。我们已经在这次行动中损失了许多最精锐的士兵，因此不得不让新兵来填充缺额。\n\n我们刚刚打完了截至当前为止最惨烈的一场战斗，许多新兵当场就吓破了胆。但是将来必然还会有更多战斗，我希望他们届时能做好厮杀的准备。\n\n我最不能容忍的就是懦弱。也许你能帮他们重拾勇气，继续战斗。",dEN="Finally, the patrol arrives!\n\nHere's the situation, <race>. We've lost many of our finest soldiers in this campaign and have had to call upon our recruits to fill in the gaps.\n\nWe've just fought one of our fiercest battles and many of the recruits were simply not prepared to face this enemy. There are more fights ahead, and I need them ready to follow orders.\n\nIf there's one thing I can't stomach, it's cowardice. Perhaps you can help them find the courage to continue.",o="达克索塔的鲁伯特上尉要你去让那些恐惧的北伐军新兵重新振作起来。",oEN="Captain Rupert in Drak'Sotra wants you to restore courage to the cowering Crusade Recruits.",c="Bien hecho, <class>. Y no demasiado pronto. He recibido noticias de que un contraataque es inminente.\n\nDeberías ponerte en marcha. El siguiente puesto está al noreste, cerca del coliseo. El capitán Grondel debería estar esperándote allí.",cEN="Well done, <class>. And not a moment too soon. I've received word that a counter-attack is imminent.\n\nYou should be on your way. The next post is to the northeast, near the coliseum. Captain Grondel should be waiting for you there."}
Q[12510]={d="<妖术师仔细研究了装着魔精的瓶子。>\n\n我知道怎么对付西莱图斯的先知了。但首先，我们需要一些东西。\n\n达克索塔农田就在正南方。由于天灾军团入侵和原始神灵的死亡，诸界间的藩篱已经越来越脆弱了，许多元素生物借此机会涌了进来。\n\n我们要从它们的首领身上弄一些珍贵的元素液体来。如果你能把那些元素生物身上的三条锁链连在一起，它们的某个首领就会出现。",dEN="<The hexxer examines the decanter of mojo.>\n\nI have an idea for how to deal with the prophet of Sseratus. But first, we're going to need some things.\n\nThe Drak'Sotra Fields are directly to the south. Because of the stresses on the land from the Scourge and the deaths of gods, the wall between worlds has weakened and the elementals are flooding in.\n\nWe need the precious fluids of their lords. If you combine three links from the elementals a tether will be made, and one of their lords can be summoned.",o="银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈要你收集3份珍贵的元素液体。",oEN="Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand wants you to acquire 3 Precious Elemental Fluids.",p="你拿到珍贵的元素液体了吗？",pEN="Do you have the precious fluids?",c="太好了。和魔精结合的话，这液体可以稀释魔精的效果却又不会完全消灭它。\n\n现在，还有一件事要做。",cEN="Excellent. When combined with the mojo, these fluids will dilute the effectiveness of the mojo without completely eliminating it.\n\nNow, one more thing."}
Q[12511]={d="在我们把所有的注意力都放在坚守暮冬要塞、处理天灾之门一带的状况时，月溪旅正在努力穿越茂密的森林，与灰熊丘陵的那些不友好的居民进行战斗。他们希望能找到另一条通往冰冠冰川的道路。\n\n驻扎在琥珀松木营地的杜蒙特中尉正在征募无畏的强壮冒险者去探索未知的野外。你愿意去接受这份挑战吗？",dEN="While we focus to hold our ground at Wintergarde and deal with the unfolding events of the Wrathgate, battalions from as far away as Westfall battle their way through the dense foliage and inhospitable denizens of Grizzly Hills. All in hopes of finding an alternate route into Icecrown.\n\nLieutenant Dumont, stationed at Amberpine Lodge, has enlisted the aid of able bodied citizens willing to risk life and limb in the uncharted wilds. Will you rise to meet this challenge?",o="Preséntate ante el teniente Dumont en el refugio Pino Ámbar al oeste de las Colinas Pardas.|n",oEN="Report to Lieutenant Dumont at Amberpine Lodge in western Grizzly Hills.",c="Casi te derriban, ¿eh? Monstruos salvajes, esos de la Horda.\n\nHabrá represalias por lo que han hecho. Puedes contar al menos con eso, <class>.\n\nAhora, es hora de ponerte a trabajar.",cEN="You were almost shot down, eh? Savage monsters - those Horde.\n\nPayback will come for what they've done. You can count on at least that much, <class>.\n\nNow, it's time to put you to work."}
Q[12512]={d="啊，太好了。他们终于派人来了。\n\n听着，$r。我们需要帮助。我们的部队被击退了，达克索塔已经落入了天灾军团手里。没人知道他们是从哪里冒出来的……\n\n关键是，我们需要一切可以找到的人手，但我们最棒的几个士兵还没有从战场上回来。\n\n我要你立刻进入废墟中去，找到那些伤员，帮他们包扎好，然后把他们带回来。他们都是老兵，所以可能会隐蔽起来。找不到他们就别回来见我！\n\n就在达克索塔一带找！他们应该走不远。",dEN="Ahh, good. They sent someone.\n\nListen, <race>. We need a hand here. Our forces were pushed back and we've lost Drak'Sotra to the Scourge. Where they came from is anyone's guess....\n\nThe point is, we need every man we can get here, and some of our best have yet to return from battle.\n\nI need you to enter the ruins now that the fighting has died down and find our wounded, patch them up, and bring them here to me.\n\nScour Drak'Sotra! They couldn't have gone far.",o="达克索塔的罗杰斯博士要你找到北伐军战士拉莫夫、北伐军战士乔纳森和北伐军战士约瑟芬。对他们使用北伐军的绷带，并护送他们安全回来。",oEN="Dr. Rogers at Drak'Sotra wants you to find Crusader Lamoof, Crusader Jonathan, and Crusader Josephine. Use the Crusader's Bandage on them, and escort them safely back to him.",p="¿Has rescatado a nuestros veteranos, <name>?",pEN="Have you rescued our veterans, <name>?",c="全都救回来了，是吗？真厉害！\n\n或许你会想要在岗哨这待下来？我们肯定用得到像你这样的人才……",cEN="Saved them all, did you? Outstanding!\n\nMaybe you'd consider sticking around the post here? We could sure use someone like you...."}
Q[12513]={d="我的帽子？是啊，那顶帽子的款式非同寻常，很早以前的事儿啦……如今可没几个裁缝知道怎么缝制。\n\n年少轻狂的时候，我将它当作身份的象征。很多人想要击败我，赢得那顶帽子……可惜没人成功。\n\n啊，这些都是陈芝麻烂谷子的事了。我已经老了，每天喝喝酒，钓钓鱼，早就不与人决斗啦。",dEN="My hat? Yes, it's an unusual style, I know, from far away... few tailors here know how to make them.\n\nWhen I was young and hot-blooded, I wore it as a standing challenge. Many came seeking to defeat me and win it for themselves... but no one ever did.\n\nAh, but those days are long past. I'm an old man, now: I drink, I fish, but I no longer duel.",o="卡洛斯要你进入旧希尔斯布莱德，击败年轻时候的卡洛斯。然后将他的帽子交给塔纳利斯的卡洛斯。",oEN="Don Carlos has inadvertently challenged you to defeat his younger self in Old Hillsbrad. Afterwards, bring Don Carlos' Hat to him in Tanaris as proof.",p="那时候，我是无人可敌的……如此的骄傲，太骄傲了。从来没有任何挑战者赢得这顶精美的帽子……",pEN="I was unbeatable, in those days... proud, and rightly so. No challenger ever won this fine hat...",c="我……我的帽子！那么……那个人就是你。我就知道。你靠近我的时候，旧疤就隐隐作痛，但是……太年轻了！你一点都没变！\n\n好吧……所以现在你知道我的秘密了。我“曾经”被打败了……来吧，拿着这顶帽子，作为我的酬谢。它本来就是你的。",cEN="My... my hat! But... how did you...?\n\nWell... no matter. So, now you know my secret. I WAS beaten... once. Here: take this hat, in return for mine. You've earned it."}
Q[12514]={d="现在我们要找一种东西，把它混入魔精，让先知喝了它以后非但不会变强，而且被大大削弱。\n\n东边的达克迦尔生长着一种蘑菇，当地的原住民称之为混乱毒菇。我想这就是我们要找的东西。\n\n帮我多采一些混乱毒菇回来，等我们把这些蘑菇混入魔精里面后，喝了它的人就会变得糊里糊涂的。",dEN="Now what we need is something to spike the mojo with. Something that'll make it so that when the prophet drinks it, he'll become less powerful.\n\nDrak'Agal lies to the east. There's a mushroom there that the natives call muddlecap fungus. I think it's exactly what we need.\n\nBring back lots of them. When we mix them into the mojo, the mind of anyone who drinks it will become muddled.",o="收集10份混乱毒菇，将它们交给银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈。",oEN="Collect 10 Muddlecap Fungus and deliver them to Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand.",p="你取得所有的蘑菇了吗？\n\n喔，还有，小心潜伏在那里的蜥蜴。",pEN="Do you have all of the fungus?\n\nOh, and watch out for the basilisks lurking over there.",c="<妖术师点头赞许。>\n\n把那个蘑菇交给我，我会将它混进魔精和元素领主的液体之中。",cEN="<The hexxer nods his approval.>\n\nHand that fungus over and I'll mix it up with the mojo and elemental lord fluids."}
Q[12516]={d="喏，我已经重新调配过这瓶魔精了。现在先知只要喝下它，就会失去一部分力量，而且还会变得昏头昏脑。\n\n至少理论上是这样的。\n\n至于说如何能让他喝下这玩意，我想也许你只需把魔精扔给他就行了？根据他在祭坛上表现出来的傲慢态度来看，他肯定会直接喝下去的。\n\n除非你能杀了他，$c，否则你们的银色北伐军一定会落得无比悲惨的下场。",dEN="There. I've modified the mojo. Now when the prophet drinks it, not only will he lose some of his power, his mind will also be addled by the effects of the fungus.\n\nAt least that's the theory.\n\nAs for how to get him to drink it, might I suggest you simply throw it at him? No doubt he'll catch and drink it given the arrogance that he's displayed at the altar.\n\nUnless you can kill him, <class>, your Argent Crusade is about to come to a terrible end.",o="杀死混乱的西莱图斯先知，然后向银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈复命。",oEN="Slay the Muddled Prophet of Sseratus and then return to Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand.",p="结束了吗？\n\n调整过的魔精有效吗？\n\n你杀掉西莱图斯的预言者替他报仇了吗？",pEN="Is it over?\n\nDid the modified mojo work?\n\nDid you deliver vengeance for Sseratus by slaying his prophet?",c="太惊人了！你拯救了你的人民和诺森德其余的人免于他的疯狂荼毒。\n\n不幸的是，在祖达克更高处仍有更多这类型的疯子存在。",cEN="Amazing! You've saved your people and the rest of Northrend from his madness.\n\nUnfortunately there's more of this insanity occurring up in the higher tiers of Zul'Drak."}
Q[12517]={d="你现在已经收集到了盗贼套牌的所有卡片，一张新的卡片神秘地出现在你手中。卡面上描绘着一位占卜师，无论你把卡片转动到何种角度，占卜师似乎都在盯着你。\n\n你觉得似乎可以用这张卡片来联络某些人，或某些事物。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Rogue cards together into a deck, another card appears on top. It depicts a fortune teller that seems to stare at you no matter how you hold the card.\n\nYou feel the card could be used to communicate with someone or something.",o="使用盗贼套牌召唤一位暗月占卜师，并把套牌交给占卜师。",oEN="Use the Rogues Deck to summon a Darkmoon Fortune Teller and give the deck to them.",p="看来你弄到了整套的盗贼套牌！令人印象深刻。",pEN="I see that you have managed to inscribe a deck of Rogues! I'm impressed.",c="暗月马戏团对这些塔罗牌很有兴趣，如果你收集到更多的卡片，不要犹豫立刻呼唤我们。我们也有自己的商人，所以请让我提供一些东西来与你交换这些卡片。",cEN="Your skill with the quill is already starting to manifest, young scribe. The tarot cards are of great interest to the Darkmoon Faire, so do not hesitate to call upon us if you manage to create more. We are not without our own skilled tradesmen, so please allow us to offer something in trade for the cards."}
Q[12518]={d="你现在已经收集到了法师套牌的所有卡片，一张新的卡片神秘地出现在你手中。卡面上描绘着一位占卜师，无论你把卡片转动到何种角度，占卜师似乎都在盯着你。\n\n你觉得似乎可以用这张卡片来联络某些人，或某些事物。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Mage cards together into a deck, another card appears on top. It depicts a fortune teller that seems to stare at you no matter how you hold the card.\n\nYou feel the card could be used to communicate with someone or something.",o="使用法师套牌召唤一位暗月占卜师，并把套牌交给占卜师。",oEN="Use the Mages Deck to summon a Darkmoon Fortune Teller and give the deck to them.",p="看来你已集满全套的法师套牌！恭喜！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Mages! Congratulations!",c="暗月马戏团对这些塔罗牌很有兴趣，如果你收集到更多的卡片，不要犹豫立刻呼唤我们。我们也有自己的商人，所以请让我提供一些东西来与你交换这些卡片。",cEN="Your skill is most impressive! The tarot cards are of great interest to the Darkmoon Faire, so do not hesitate to call upon us if you manage to create more. We are not without our own skilled tradesmen, so please allow us to offer something in trade for the cards."}
Q[12519]={d="Mírame, $r. ¿Parece que tengo tiempo para escribir informes?\n\nHago todo lo que puedo para que la maldita Plaga no invada este puesto, ¡y quieren que me encargue del papeleo!\n\n<suspiro> Quejarse no sirve de nada. Tengo que darle al comandante alguna clase de recuento de la última escaramuza.\n\n¿Quieres ayudarme? Ve y tráeme todas las medallas que encuentres en los trols muertos de por aquí. Con eso nos haremos una idea.",dEN="Look at me, <race>. Do I look like I have time fer fillin' out reports?\n\nIt be all I can do to keep this post free o' the bloody Scourge, and they want me to mess with paperwork!\n\nNo sense in complainin'. I need to get the commander some kinda kill count from the last skirmish.\n\nYou wanna be helpful? Go and get me all the medals you can find from the dead trolls around here. That'll hafta be close enough.",o="斗兽场外面的格隆迪尔上尉要你从附近的达卡莱尸体上收集7枚达卡莱勋章。",oEN="Captain Grondel outside the Coliseum wants you to gather 7 Drakkari Medallions from the nearby Drakkari Corpses.",p="¿Vas a conseguir esas medallas para mí, <race>?",pEN="You get those medals for me, <race>?",c="¡Vaya, vaya!\n\nYa me has ahorrado un buen montón de trabajo, <lad/lass>. Te lo agradezco. Me aseguraré de mencionarte en mi informe.\n\nVete ya. Es probable que Finklestein te esté esperando un poco al oeste de aquí.",cEN="Well, now!\n\nYa saved me a fair bit o' work there <lad/lass>. I'm grateful. I'll be sure ta make mention of ya in me report.\n\nOff with yeh now. Finklestein'll likely be waitin fer ya a bit west o' here."}
Q[12520]={d="Un aterrizaje brusco no va a impedir que Hemet domine a las mayores piezas de caza que hay en Sholazar. El poderoso rinoceronte Trozocuerno controla las junglas que hay en la zona salvaje al noroeste del campamento. Demuestra a esta expedición lo que vales, $gchaval:chavala;, demostrándome que eres lo suficientemente $gduro:dura; para enfrentarte a esas poderosas bestias.",dEN="No rough landing is going to stop ol' Hemet from mastering the largest game Sholazar has to offer. In the wilds northwest of the camp, the jungles are ruled by the mighty shardhorn rhino. You can prove your worth to the expedition, <lad/lass>, by showing me that you're tough enough to face down those powerful beasts.",o="杀死15头碎角犀牛，然后返回奈辛瓦里营地，向赫米特·奈辛瓦里复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Shardhorn Rhinos and return to Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你制服了犀牛吗，还是你丢毛巾投降了？",pEN="Did you master the rhinos, or are you throwing in the towel?",c="不错，不错，不错，看来你从犀牛角下活了下来，毕竟你看起来还身体完整。不过犀牛狩猎可不只是当犀牛往你冲的时候死盯着它，然后祈祷自己瞄得够准。不，要制服传说中居住在丛林里的犀牛之王，你还需要更多技巧。",cEN="Well, well, well, it looks like you've survived the rhinos, after all, and in pretty good shape if I do say so myself. But there's more to rhino hunting than just staring down the beast as it charges you and hoping your aim is true. No, you'll need more than that to take on the rhino patriarch that's rumored to dwell in the jungle."}
Q[12521]={d="Cuando oí que el legendario Hemet Nesingwary planeaba izar velas y dirigirse a la Cuenca de Sholazar, me ofrecí a financiar su expedición. Sabemos poco de Sholazar, pero dicen que es un paraíso exuberante en medio de este continente helado.\n\nHemet ha aceptado enviar muestras de plantas exóticas, componentes y cristales, pero no he sabido nada de él. Se supone que Monte Tirohocico tenía que llevarles provisiones, pero tampoco ha regresado. Si estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a investigar qué ha pasado, te enviaré con mi máquina voladora.",dEN="When I heard that the legendary Hemet Nesingwary was setting sail for the Sholazar Basin, I offered to help fund his expedition. We know little of Sholazar, but it's said to be a lush paradise in the midst of this frozen continent.\n\nHemet has agreed to send back samples of exotic plants, reagents, and crystals. There hasn't been any word from him. Monte Muzzleshot was supposed to be bringing them supplies, but he hasn't returned, either. If you'll look into it, I'll send you in my flying machine.",o="Habla con el archimago Pentarus cuando estés $glisto:lista; para ir a la Cuenca de Sholazar. Cuando llegues, habla con Monte Tirohocico en el Manglar Silvestre de la Cuenca de Sholazar.",oEN="Talk to Archmage Pentarus when you're ready to leave for Sholazar Basin. When you arrive, speak with Monte Muzzleshot in the Wildgrowth Mangal of Sholazar Basin.",c="Sí, Hemet está aquí. Está en el campamento, solo ve hacia el noroeste, hacia el río, y pronto lo verás. ¡Y por el amor de la Luz, <lad/lass>, haz que envíe a alguien para que me rescate!",cEN="Aye, Hemet's here. He's at the camp, just go northwest toward the river and you'll soon see it. And for the love of the Light, <lad/lass>, have him send someone to cut me down!"}
Q[12522]={d="毁了……全毁了！我早就提醒过船长，让她小心运送精密的仪器，她怎么就不把我的话当回事呢！\n\n由于她的疏忽，导致我的飞行器“诺莫瑞根之魂”在这艘船触礁搁浅时被撞坏了。这下完蛋了吧，我们连报告都没法送出去了！\n\n不过，天无绝人之路！风险投资公司的地精或许能帮上我们。前些日子，他们击落了另一架飞行器。喏，残骸就落在东边的沼泽地里，也就是蒙特跳伞着陆的地方。我要你去回收它的引擎，这很可能是我们唯一的希望了。",dEN="She's ruined... ruined! I told that captain to be careful with such a precious cargo, but would she listen to me? No!\n\nWhen the ship ran aground, it damaged my flying machine, the Spirit of Gnomeregan. Now, we're left without any means to send our reports!\n\nThere is a chance, though, that the Venture Company's antics may work in our favor. They shot down another flying machine right about where Monte parachuted into the swamp to the east. Go there and retrieve the engine. It may be our only hope.",o="奈辛瓦里营地的维斯雷·扭钳要你帮他找到一台飞行器引擎。",oEN="Weslex Quickwrench at the Nesingwary Base Camp wants you to bring him a Flying Machine Engine.",p="哎，你有办法拿到引擎吗？我只知道资助远征队的大法师要紧张了。",pEN="Well, were you able to get the engine? I just know that archmage who funded the expedition is getting nervous.",c="那……把东西放那就好了。小心点！如果你弄坏了这一部，我们就有大麻烦了。现在，看看我能够做些什么。",cEN="There... just set it down there. Be careful! If you ruin this one, we're in big trouble. Now, let's see what I can do."}
Q[12523]={d="很好，我们有了一台能用的引擎。接下来嘛，只要替换飞行器的部分零件，就能让她正常运转啦。别担心，我知道自己在做什么。\n\n优秀的机械师可以使用最烂的材料修复他的发明创造！不过，如果能找到合适的材料，那自然是再好不过啦。\n\n风险投资公司在斯温迪格林挖掘场中作业，那里到处散落着采矿设备的备用零件。喏，挖掘场就在东北方那根黄色水晶柱的另一端。替我弄一些零件回来吧。",dEN="Great, now that we've got an engine, we're going to need an assortment of other parts to get her back in flying condition. Don't worry, I know what I'm doing.\n\nA good mechanic can hold his creations together with anything, but we're better off if it doesn't come to that.\n\nAnyway, those Venture Company dullards have plenty of spare parts for their mining equipment all over Swindlegrin's Dig on the far side of that yellow crystal pillar to the northeast. Scoop up a few and bring them back here.",o="将7份风险投资公司备用零件交给奈辛瓦里营地的维斯雷·扭钳。",oEN="Bring 7 Venture Co. Spare Parts to Weslex Quickwrench at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你拿到零件了吗？",pEN="Did you get those parts?",c="只要小小的调整，应该就能用了。我可怜的飞行器可能到最后看起来会像一台风险投资公司的伐木机。可怜的小女孩，看来得等我们回到达拉然，才有办法变回它应有的样子了。",cEN="With a little work, these should suffice. My poor flying machine might end up looking more like a Venture Company shredder, though. Poor girl will have to wait until we get back to Dalaran to be restored to her rightful form."}
Q[12524]={d="自打我们来到这里，风险投资公司就一直在给我们制造麻烦，营地的安全受到威胁，调查工作更是难以开展。本来呢，我们也不想招惹是非，但是他们竟然袭击我们的斥候，还击落了运送补给物资的飞行器。\n\n我们绝不能容忍这样的侮辱。赫米特·奈辛瓦里的探险队是来这里狩猎的，他们也将成为我们的猎物！\n\n转至东北方的那根水晶柱的另一端，消灭那些在斯温迪格林挖掘场中作业的风险投资公司雇员！",dEN="Ever since we arrived, the Venture Company has hampered our efforts to secure our campsite and survey the area. Normally, we wouldn't care what they were up to, but they've started antagonizing our scouts and shooting down supply flights.\n\nWe can't allow this insult to stand. Hemet Nesingwary's expedition came here to hunt, and hunt it shall.\n\nGo to Swindlegrin's Dig, on the far side of the crystal pillar to the northeast, and kill any Venture Company employee you see!",o="奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔要你去杀死15名风险投资公司雇员，风险投资公司无赖或是风险投资公司挖掘者都可以。",oEN="Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp wants you to kill 15 Venture Company members. You may kill either Venture Co. Ruffians or Venture Co. Excavators.",c="这样应该足以震慑他们了，但我担心工头会带更多的工人来。我们要趁着还来得及的时候，完成我们的工作。",cEN="That should hamper their operations, but I worry that the foreman will try to bring in more workers. We have to complete the job while we can."}
Q[12525]={d="我们必须干掉工头斯温迪格林，才能彻底让他们的矿洞完蛋。但这家伙随身带着一个名叫“肉饼”的食人魔保镖。看来不经过一番激烈的搏斗，你是见不着工头的。\n\n他们很可能呆在高处的平台，监视着风险投资公司在斯温迪格林挖掘场的工作进展。\n\n挖掘场就在东北方的日灼之柱的另一端。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="We must send Foreman Swindlegrin packing if we're going to shut down his mine permanently, but be careful. His bodyguard, Meatpie, is a large, mean ogre, and isn't likely to let you see the foreman without a fight.\n\nThe two probably occupy a platform that would let them look out over the entire Venture Company operation at Swindlegrin's Dig.\n\nRemember, the dig is on the far side of the Suntouched Pillar to the northeast. Good luck, <name>.",o="杀死工头斯温迪格林和肉饼，然后返回奈辛瓦里营地，向蒂巴尔复命。",oEN="Kill Foreman Swindlegrin and Meatpie and return to Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你解决了诈咧与他的保镖吗？",pEN="Have you dealt with Swindlegrin and his bodyguard?",c="听到风险投资公司不会再妨碍我们，可真叫人松了一口气。你处理了这个问题，我和赫米特都很感谢你。一个猎人可不能在举起枪对着别人的时候，还有什么良心之类的问题。",cEN="What a relief to hear that the Venture Company will trouble us no more. You have my thanks, and that of Hemet for dealing with this problem. A game hunter cannot, in good conscience, lift her weapon against another person."}
Q[12526]={d="呃，就这么办吧。我们得找这位土着先知好好谈谈。他多半不会心甘情愿地为我们效劳。\n\n据说他住在诺兹隆之骨附近的一间小屋里，就在南边河流的对岸。找到他之后先做个自我介绍吧，然后问问他要怎么样才肯帮助我们跟踪那头犀牛之王。",dEN="Well, that's settled then. We'll seek out this native sage and have a word with him. He's not likely to volunteer his services, though.\n\nI'm told he keeps a small lean-to near the Bones of Nozronn, just across the river to the south. Seek him out, introduce yourself, and ask what he requires to help us track down this patriarch of the rhinos.",o="与诺兹隆之骨的神谕者索乌拉姆谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Oracle Soo-rahm at the Bones of Nozronn.",c="你为何来到索乌拉姆的圣坛？",cEN="What brings you to Rahm's shrine?"}
Q[12527]={d="我的主人菲肯斯坦正在西北方的赫布瓦罗制作一种真言药剂，他需要大量的石化蜥蜴水晶作为材料。赫布瓦罗就在这条通往北边的西莱图斯祭坛的大道西侧。\n\n幸运的是，东边的达克迦尔就潜伏着不少蜥蜴。\n\n如果你能抓一些祖达克老鼠，把它们扔给蜥蜴吃的话，那些蜥蜴在吃掉五只老鼠以后就会变得很温顺。然后你就可以安全地从它们身上取走水晶了。\n\n杀死蜥蜴是没有用的……那样只会把水晶弄碎。",dEN="My master, Finklestein, is in the shrine at Heb'Valok to the northwest preparing a truth serum, and he needs basilisk crystals. Heb'Valok is on the west side of the road leading north before the Altar of Sseratus.\n\nThere are basilisks to the east at Drak'Agal.\n\nIf you grab the Zul'Drak rats and throw them at the basilisk, they will become gorged and docile after eating five. Then you'll be able to take their crystals.\n\nKilling the basilisk won't do you any good. That'd just break its crystals!",o="将5块石化蜥蜴水晶交给赫布瓦罗神殿的炼金师菲肯斯坦。",oEN="Deliver 5 Basilisk Crystals to Alchemist Finklestein in the shrine at Heb'Valok.",p="这些是什么？\n\n你有看到我那个没路用的学徒匹斯波特吗？\n\n我派他去办点事情，他搞了半天还不回来！",pEN="What's all this?\n\nBy any chance have you seen my no-good apprentice, Pestlepot?\n\nI sent him on an errand quite some time ago and he has yet to return!",c="喔，太棒了！感谢你。水晶看起来的状况很不错！\n\n我一点也不怀疑匹斯波特让你替他做了他的工作。不过，你的协助还是非常有价值！",cEN="Oh, most excellent! Thank you. The crystals appear to be in fine condition!\n\nI have no doubt that Pestlepot put you up to doing his chores for him. Nevertheless, your assistance in this matter is greatly appreciated!"}
Q[12528]={d="¡Mi pieza! ¡Tú llevarte mi pieza!\n\n<Gekgek te pincha con su lanza.>\n\nQué $gtonto:tonta:r;, $r. ¡Ahora deber una a Gekgek! Tú ser cosa esclava de Corazón Frenético. Tú matar a muchas más bestias para Corazón Frenético.\n\nTú ir a Colina Corazón Frenético al noreste y decir al alto chamán Rakjak que tú $gnuevo esclavo:nueva esclava;.\n\n¡Ir, $r! ¡Ir o yo pinchar otra vez!\n\n<Gekgek sacude su lanza de manera amenazante.>",dEN="My kill! You take my kill!\n\n<Gekgek taunts you with his spear.>\n\nYou dumb, <race>. Now you owe Gekgek! You be Frenzyheart slave. You slay many more beasts for Frenzyheart.\n\nYou go Frenzyheart Hill to northeast - you tell High-Shaman Rakjak you the new slave.\n\nGo, <race>! Go or I taunt you a second time!\n\n<Gekgek waves his spear around menacingly.>",o="Preséntate ante el alto chamán Rakjak en la Colina Corazón Frenético como $gel nuevo \"esclavo\":la nueva \"esclava\";.",oEN="Report to High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill as the new \"slave.\"",c="你是新来的奴隶？\n\n很好，因为我们的奴隶快没了。",cEN="You the new slave?\n\nGood. We running out."}
Q[12529]={d="Tú creerte gran $gcazador:cazadora;, ¿eh? Tú no Corazón Frenético, tú no saber cazar.\n\nGoregek ser gran cazador de monos. Él matar tantos monos que tú no poder contar con garras.\n\nTú ir con Goregek y cazar Callonudillos al este. Tú $gel esclavo:la esclava;, $r. Tú hacer lo que Goregek ordene.",dEN="You think you so great hunter, eh? You no Frenzyheart, you not know of hunt.\n\nGoregek is great ape hunter. He slay so many ape you can't count on claws.\n\nYou go with Goregek and hunt hardknuckles to east. You the slave, <race>. You do what Goregek tell you.",o="狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克要你去杀死8只硬皮抢夺者和6只硬皮冲锋者。\n\n如果你弄丢了格拉克伊克的镣铐，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Kill 8 Hardknuckle Foragers and 6 Hardknuckle Chargers for High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Goregek's Shackles, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你还活着！硬皮猩猩还没把你吃了？\n\n也许他们晚点会把你吃了。",pEN="You still alive! Hardknuckles not eat you yet?\n\nMaybe they eat you later.",c="Goregek le enseñará al tonto esclavo <race> cómo se hace.",cEN="Goregek show silly <race> slave how it done."}
Q[12530]={d="嘿！奴隶！\n\n拉克亚克要我带上你外出狩猎硬皮猩猩，换了平常我才不乐意呢。不过今天我的心情很好，所以打算也让你过过瘾。但是，你最好别给我惹麻烦！\n\n拉克亚克还不知道吧，其实我早就想对那只坏坏的雌性硬皮猩猩下手了。我们去东边的硬皮旷野，对软皮猩猩使用软皮木棍，这样就能迫使她显身啦！\n\n<格拉克伊克兴奋地摩挲着双手。>",dEN="Slave thing!\n\nRakjak want me to babysit you while I kill hardknuckles. I feeling generous today, so I let you kill some too, but don't get in Goregek's way!\n\nRakjak not know yet, but Goregek has eye on big bad hardknuckle mama. We go to Hardknuckle Clearing to east and poke softknuckles with poker and she sure to come yelling!\n\n<Goregek rubs his hands together gleefully.>",o="对软皮猩猩使用格拉克伊克给你的软皮木棍，将雌性硬皮猩猩引出来。击败雌性硬皮猩猩，然后向狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克汇报情况。\n\n如果你弄丢了格拉克伊克的镣铐，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Goregek has given you a Softknuckle Poker for use on Softknuckles to draw the Hardknuckle Matriarch out of hiding. Slay the Hardknuckle Matriarch and report her death to High-Shaman Rajak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Goregek's Shackles, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你要做什么，奴隶？",pEN="What you want, slave?",c="格拉克伊克带你去杀死了雌性硬皮猩猩，嗯？你很幸运！\n\n那些愚蠢的软皮猩猩一定大声尖叫！\n\n<拉克亚克大声尖啸，然后突然大笑起来。>",cEN="Goregek take you to kill big mom of hardknuckles, eh? You lucky!\n\nDumb softknuckles squeal good!\n\n<Rakjak squeals loudly and breaks out laughing.>"}
Q[12531]={d="$gMatador:Matadora; de leones, $gperseguidor:perseguidora; de pollos, $gnuevo esclavo:nueva esclava; de Corazón Frenético...\n\nSé que no quieres seguir siendo $gun esclavo:una esclava;, así que te diré lo que tienes que hacer. Demuestra ser mejor que los demás cazadores Corazón Frenético y Rakjak te respetará.\n\nBajo las arenas del río sur hay una bestia que mata avispas, simios y hasta wolvar. Se llama Serfex. Tráele la garra de Serfex a Rakjak y quizás te libere de la esclavitud.\n\nEspero que Dajik te haya enseñado bien y Serfex será fácil.",dEN="Lion killer, chicken chaser, new Frenzyheart slave...\n\nI know you no want to stay slave, so I tell you what to do. Show you better than the other Frenzyheart hunters and then Rakjak respect you.\n\nUnder sands of south river there a beast that kills wasp, apes, and even wolvar. He called Serfex. You bring claw of Serfex to Rakjak and maybe he release you from slaveness.\n\nHope Dajik teaching you good so Serfex be easy stuff.",o="转至南部河流的沙滩，找到并杀死瑟菲克斯，将他的爪子交给狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Locate Serfex under the sands of the southern river, slay him, and bring his claw to High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="No te he preguntado por ti, <race>. ¿Qué quieres?",pEN="I not ask for you, <race>. What you want?",c="你杀死了瑟菲克斯？我打赌你一定跟踪一只杀死瑟菲克斯的强大狼獾人，然后偷走了爪子。\n\n爪子现在是我的了。",cEN="You kill Serfex? I bet you follow mighty wolvar that kill Serfex and take claw.\n\nMy claw now."}
Q[12532]={d="格利基克没头没脑地闯入鸡舍，结果鸡们受到惊吓，全都逃掉了！\n\n它们就在附近——替我把它们抓回来！\n\n<长者哈尔卡克发出嘘声，催你赶紧去抓鸡。>",dEN="Dumb Goregek stumble into chicken house and let all the chickens go!\n\nThey all around hill - go get chickens back!\n\n<Elder Harkek shoos you away.>",o="捕捉12只逃走的小鸡，然后向长者哈尔卡克复命。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Capture 12 Chicken Escapees for Elder Harkek.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你抓到鸡了吗？",pEN="You catch chickens?",c="¡Bien! Estaba preocupado por los alimentos. Ya tengo bastante hambre.\n\nGracias, <race>.",cEN="Good! I was worried about foodstuffs. I already pretty hungry.\n\nThank you, <race>."}
Q[12533]={d="Rakjak no es tonto. Quizás seas $gbueno:buena; matando cosas. Quizás Corazón Frenético puede convertirte en $gun cazador:una cazadora; de verdad.\n\nDajik caza avispas gigantes mejor que todos los wolvar. Ve con Dajik al Enjambre Zafiro al sureste o al río al sur y aprende a cazar.",dEN="Rakjak not dumb. Maybe you good at killing things. Maybe Frenzyheart can make you into real hunter.\n\nDajik hunts giant wasp things better than all wolvar. Go with Dajik to Sapphire Hive to southeast or to river in south and learn the hunt.",o="狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克要你杀死6只蓝玉虫巢巨蜂和9只蓝玉虫巢雄蜂。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Kill 6 Sapphire Hive Wasps and 9 Sapphire Hive Drones for High-Shaman Rakjak in Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你学会狩猎了没有？",pEN="You learn the hunt?",c="我们杀很多蓝蜂。\n\n拉克亚克觉得它们杀不完。",cEN="We kill many many wasps.\n\nRakjak don't think they run out."}
Q[12534]={d="钢刺野猪虽然颇具威胁，但它们大多生活在远离狼獾人的本地。蓝蜂就不同了，这种可怕的巨型蜂接连杀死了狂心氏族的好几名猎手……\n\n拉克亚克一直想除掉蜂后，可是最厉害的猎手也没有勇气踏足她的巢穴。我要你进入东南方的蓝玉虫巢杀死那里的蜂后，然后把她的钉刺交给拉克亚克。我敢打赌拉克亚克会欣喜若狂的。",dEN="Bristlepine can be dangerous, but most stay far away from wolvar. Wasps on other hand not fear the Frenzyheart... they even kill some of our hunters.\n\nI know Rakjak want wasp queen dead, but no wolvar want to go into her hive. You go kill wasp queen in Sapphire Hive to southeast and get stinger for Rakjak. Me bet Rakjak like that.",o="将蓝玉虫巢蜂后的钉刺交给狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Bring the Stinger of the Sapphire Queen to High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你闻起来很像蓝蜂之类的。",pEN="You smell like wasp things.",c="你杀掉蜂后了！你比拉克亚克还强。\n\n也许现在蓝蜂会走开，停止攻击狂心猎人。",cEN="You killed queen wasp! You stronger than Rakjak thought.\n\nMaybe wasps go away now and stop attacking Frenzyheart hunters."}
Q[12535]={d="Tú ser $gbuen cazador: buena cazadora;, pero Corazón Frenético poder hacerte más fuerte. Harkek creer que quizás tú $glisto:lista; para algo más importante.\n\nAntes de que Rakjak enviarte a misión importante, tú necesitar reunir cosas para Rakjak. A lo largo del río hacia el sur haber cristales azules. Rakjak necesitar muchos cristales azules.\n\nTú ir a coger cristales ahora.",dEN="You good hunter, but Frenzyheart can make you stronger. Harkek think maybe you ready for something more important.\n\nBefore Rakjak send you on important mission, you need gather things for Rakjak. All along river to south are blue crystals. Rakjak need lots of blue crystals.\n\nYou go get crystals now.",o="狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克要你去收集8块通天水晶簇。",oEN="High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill wants 8 Skyreach Crystal Clusters.",p="差不多准备好长途旅行了。我们刚刚带了一条鳄鱼回来了。",pEN="Almost ready for long journey. Gekgek come back with crocolisk just moment ago.",c="¡Buen <race>! Vale, todo listo.",cEN="Good <race>! Okay, all ready."}
Q[12536]={d="瑟匹克是狂心氏族最优秀的猎手。他擅长狩猎大舌头怪……嗯，就是沼泽地里那群什么东西都要偷的丑八怪。\n\n瑟匹克打算出趟远门，摧毁大舌头怪的祭坛，把它们统统吓跑。我们要把这些家伙赶出这片土地。\n\n狂心岭的东北边锁着一只鳄鱼，就在大树旁——你和瑟匹克一起去，照他说的做就是了。",dEN="Zepik is best hunter of the Frenzyheart. Zepik hunts big-tongues... ugly things near swamps that try to steal all stuff they can find.\n\nZepik going on long trek to break big-tongue shrine and try to scare them away. We no want big-tongues in this land anymore.\n\nThere a crocolisk chained on northeast side of hill, next to tree - go with Zepik and do what Zepik tell you.",o="骑上被俘虏的鳄鱼转至雾语村，向瑟匹克寻求下一步的指示。\n\n如果你弄丢了瑟匹克的狩猎号角，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Ride the captive crocolisk to Mistwhisper Refuge and then speak to Zepik for further instructions.\n\nIf you lose Zepik's Hunting Horn, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="他们跟瑟匹克说不以狂心族人标准来看的话，你是个好猎人。",pEN="They tell Zepik you good hunter for not being Frenzyheart.",c="我们到了！一定要快。\n\n小心大舌头。",cEN="We here! Must work fast.\n\nWatch out for big-tongues."}
Q[12537]={d="嗯，说到水晶……\n\n大舌头怪使用水晶为天气祭坛充能。瑟匹克并不清楚其中的原理，但是一旦它们用错了水晶，就会风雨大作！\n\n原本呢，瑟匹克打算悄悄地潜入一座祭坛，结果却并不顺利。所以啊，还是拉上你一起去比较好！\n\n把这些水晶放在祭坛附近，然后击碎它们，释放其中的能量。瑟匹克也不确定会发生什么事，打破水晶之后你最好躲远点。",dEN="Okay, the crystal things...\n\nThe big-tongues use the crystals to power their rain shrines. Zepik not know quite how it works, but Zepik does know that if they use wrong crystals, the clouds and the rain go crazy!\n\nZepik tried to sneak in at one of their other rain shrines, but it not go so well. It sure to go much better with two!\n\nTake crystals, place at big stone pillar shrine thing, then smash them to release power. Zepik not sure what will happen, so might want to step back after.",o="瑟匹克要你在雾语天气祭坛前敲碎通天水晶簇。\n\n如果你弄丢了瑟匹克的狩猎号角，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Zepik wants you to smash the Skyreach Crystal Clusters in front of the Mistwhisper weather shrine.\n\nIf you lose Zepik's Hunting Horn, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="瑟匹克觉得有同伴一起顺利多了。以不是狂心族人来说你很强。",pEN="Zepik think this go much better with partner. You strong for not Frenzyheart.",c="真有效！\n\n你看到闪电打中那个神谕者了吗？真棒！\n\n<瑟匹克摩擦着他的双手并且狂乱的笑着。>",cEN="It work so good!\n\nYou see lightning smash that oracle guy? So good!\n\n<Zepik rubs his hands together and chuckles maniacally.>"}
Q[12538]={d="杀些猩猩和蓝蜂有什么意思啊！狩猎大舌头怪才好玩呢！\n\n在我们破坏天气祭坛的同时，不如趁机多杀几只大舌头怪。这样它们就不敢再来我们的地盘惹事啦。\n\n<瑟匹克自信地点了点头。>",dEN="Gorillas and wasps are boring! Big-tongues the only thing fun to hunt.\n\nWhile we mess up rain shrine, we kill lots of mist big-tongues. That sure to make them not want to come back to village thing.\n\n<Zepik nods to himself confidently.>",o="瑟匹克要你去杀死12个雾语鳄鱼人。\n\n如果你弄丢了瑟匹克的狩猎号角，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Zepik wants you to kill 12 Mistwhisper Gorlocs.\n\nIf you lose Zepik's Hunting Horn, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="我们是盆地最棒的猎人！",pEN="We best hunters of basin!",c="我狠狠的戳了那些大舌头一顿。\n\n我想你做的还可以。\n\n不，我只是开玩笑！你是好猎人。我很高兴跟你打猎。",cEN="I stab those big-tongues good.\n\nYou did okay I guess.\n\nNo, I just kidding! You good hunter. I glad to hunt with you."}
Q[12539]={d="搞定啦！我们回去吧，不过这次没有鳄鱼骑了。唉，如果猎人也能像鳄鱼那样划水划得哗哗响，那我们就能自己游回去啦。\n\n这样吧，我们沿着山脊一路往东走，应该就能返回狂心岭。\n\n要是我们不小心偏离了山脊，很可能会撞上那些大舌头怪。瑟匹克觉得它们现在肯定不会善罢甘休。",dEN="Okay, we done! Time to go back. No crocolisk to ride this time though.\n\nIf we go east and stay near ridge, it should lead all the way back near hill.\n\nNeed to be careful not to go far below ridge though or we might go right into big-tongue tree village thing. Zepik not think they like us right now.",o="返回狂心岭，与高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克谈一谈。",oEN="Find your way back to Frenzyheart Hill and speak to High-Shaman Rakjak.",c="被闪电炸翻？\n\n<拉克亚克大笑了一阵。>\n\n你是个好猎人。拉克亚克喜欢你。也许有一天你可以成为光荣的狂心族人！\n\n只是也许啦！",cEN="Blown up by lightning?\n\n<Rakjak breaks out laughing for a moment.>\n\nYou good hunter. Rakjak like you. Maybe one day you can be honorary Frenzyheart!\n\nOnly maybe though!"}
Q[12540]={d="Vale, $ghombre:mujer;, Rakjak tener trabajo muy importante. Tú ir a capturar lengua-grande herido que rastreador encontrar junto a río al norte.\n\nNo llevar cazador esta vez porque quizás querer matarlo. Yo querer esconderlo para verlo y hacer que me diga cosas.\n\nTú ir y traerme presa lengua-grande.",dEN="Okay <guy/lady>, Rakjak have very important job. You go capture injured big-tongue that tracker spotted at river to north.\n\nNot bring hunter this time because they maybe want to just kill it. I want to hide it so that I can poke it and make it tell me things.\n\nGo you and bring me big-tongue prize thing.",o="Encuentra un Oráculo Hablalluvia herido para el alto chamán Rakjak en la Colina Corazón Frenético.|n",oEN="Locate an Injured Rainspeaker Oracle for High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.",c="拜托不要杀我！我们只是在找鱼。我们不想死。",cEN="No kill me please! We was just looking for fish. We not want to die."}
Q[12541]={d="Ah, tú debes de ser la patrulla prometida. No podrías haber llegado en mejor momento. Necesito urgentemente otro par de manos.\n\nTenemos un prisionero Drakkari que nos han enviado para realizar un interrogatorio. Antes de empezar, necesito ayuda para crear un suero de la verdad.\n\nCrear un suero de la verdad es complicado y requiere un fino instinto, una coordinación perfecta y saber improvisar en todo momento.\n\nAvísame cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;, $r. Y recuerda, ¡lo importante es saber elegir el momento justo!|n",dEN="Ahh, you must be the promised patrol. Your timing couldn't be better. I have urgent need of an extra pair of hands.\n\nWe have a Drakkari prisoner who's been sent here to undergo questioning. Before the interrogation begins, I require assistance in the creation of a truth serum.\n\nCreating a truth serum is tricky business, demanding keen instincts, perfect timing, and improvisation at every step.\n\nLet me know when you're ready, <race>. And remember, timing is everything!",o="El alquimista Finklestein en Heb'Valok quiere que lo ayudes en la creación de un suero de la verdad.\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista; para empezar, habla con él y sigue sus instrucciones.",oEN="Alchemist Finklestein at Heb'Valok wants you to assist him in the creation of a truth serum.\n\nWhen you are ready to begin, you are to speak to him and follow his instructions.",p="Verás, <name>, la verdadera alquimia es mucho más que mezclar unos pocos ingredientes...",pEN="You see, <name>, there is far more to true alchemy than mixing a few ingredients....",c="¡Lo has logrado!\n\nLa inteligencia recopilada de ese <race> será, sin duda, de gran valor. Me aseguraré de mencionar tus esfuerzos en mi informe al comandante.\n\nGracias, <name>.",cEN="You've done it!\n\nThe intelligence gathered from that <race> will undoubtedly be of great value. I'll be certain to make mention of your efforts in my report to the commander.\n\nThank you, <name>."}
Q[12542]={d="¡$C! La Cruzada Argenta está buscando soldados robustos que quieran dejar de lado sus diferencias y unir fuerzas para luchar contra el Rey Exánime. ¿Lucharás por nuestra causa?\n\nSi estás $ginteresado:interesada; aventúrate al norte a la Confianza de la Luz y habla con el cruzado Valus.\n\nEncontrarás la Confianza de la Luz en medio de las ruinas de la ciudad trol saqueada llamada Jintha'kalar con frontera en Zul'Drak.\n\nAdiós.",dEN="<class>! The Argent Crusade is looking for able bodied soldiers that are willing to set aside their differences and join forces to battle the forces of the Lich King. Will you take up our cause?\n\nShould you be interested, venture north to Light's Trust and speak with Crusader Valus.\n\nYou will find Light's Trust amidst the ruins of the sacked troll city of Jintha'kalar - bordering Zul'Drak.\n\nFarewell.",o="Preséntate ante el cruzado Valus en la Confianza de la Luz del Cementerio de Dragones.|n",oEN="Report to Crusader Valus at Light's Trust in Dragonblight.",c="此地不仅只是达卡莱帝国的遗迹。\n\n<瓦鲁斯指向东方。>\n\n几千年来达卡莱保持孤立，隐匿在他们连绵的神殿都市与通灵塔之中。碰上这样的失事对他们而言是件非常令人惊讶的事情。而在通往祖达克内部的阶梯之前，横亘着遗迹中的达克萨隆要塞。祖达克的第一层，被摧毁了……\n\n为什么天灾军团要等到这一刻才攻击呢？",cEN="Mere footsteps from here lies the Drakkari empire.\n\n<Valus points east.>\n\nFor thousands of years the Drakkari remained isolated, preferring to keep within the boundaries of their sprawling temple cities and ziggurats. It was surprising then, to come upon this wreckage. Further up, beyond the foreboding stairs leading into Zul'Drak, Drak'Tharon Keep lies in ruin. The entire first tier of Zul'Drak, destroyed...\n\nWhy has the Scourge waited until now to attack?"}
Q[12543]={d="No te conocemos, $gextranjero:extranjera;, pero sabemos que quieres algo.\n\nHablaremos con los Huesos de Nozronn por ti, pero tienes que traernos ofrendas. Necesitamos potentes colmillos de cobra emperador para completar el collar del Oráculo.\n\nVe a Manglar Silvestre, al noreste de esta barraca, busca cobras y tráenos los mejores colmillos. Luego, haremos que los huesos te hablen.",dEN="We not know you, stranger, but we know you want something.\n\nWe will talk to Bones of Nozronn for you, but you must bring us offerings. We need powerful emperor cobra fangs to complete our oracle's necklace.\n\nGo to the Wildgrowth Mangal, northeast of our hut, find cobras and bring back best fangs. Then we make bones speak to you.",o="将5颗完整的眼镜蛇牙交给诺兹隆之骨附近的神谕者索乌拉姆。",oEN="Bring 5 Intact Cobra Fangs to Oracle Soo-rahm, near the Bones of Nozronn.",p="我们得知道——你带牙齿来了吗？",pEN="We must know -- do you bring fangs?",c="<El oráculo inspecciona los colmillos.>\n\n¡Lo aprobamos! ¡Los huesos de Nozronn hablarán con <name>!",cEN="<The oracle inspects the fangs.>\n\nWe approve! Bones of Nozronn will speak to <name>!"}
Q[12544]={d="Huesos de Nozronn, ¡el Oráculo Soo-liloquio enviarte a $n!\n\nNosotros haber preparado incienso para ti. Encender y colocar cerca de la cabeza de Nozronn y oír su voz.\n\n<$gConfuso:Confusa;, le dices a Soo-liloquio que ni siquiera has formulado tu pregunta.>\n\nCierto, nosotros no saberla, pero seguro que Nozronn sí. Sin duda alguna. Nozronn contestar a la pregunta de tu corazón.\n\nIr. Nozronn no esperar mucho.",dEN="Bones of Nozronn, Oracle Soo-rahm sends <name> to you!\n\nWe have prepared incense for you. Light it and place it near Nozronn's head and you will hear his voice.\n\n<Confused, you tell Soo-rahm that you haven't even told him your question.>\n\nTrue, we not know, but mighty Nozronn does. Do not doubt. Nozronn will answer your heart's question.\n\nGo. Nozronn not wait long.",o="在诺兹隆之骨附近使用索乌拉姆的熏香，然后返回奈辛瓦里营地，向赫米特·奈辛瓦里汇报你得到的情报。",oEN="Use Soo-rahm's Incense near the Bones of Nozronn, then return to Hemet Nesingwary at Nesingwary's Base Camp with the information you learned.",p="嗯，你询问过当地的神谕者了吗？",pEN="Well, have you consulted the native oracle?",c="<Hemet escucha mientras describes lo que has aprendido.>\n\nAsí se hace, <muchacho/muchacha>. Ningún rinoceronte muerto le dice a Hemet Nesingwary dónde y qué puede cazar. Ya le enseñaremos a ese montón de huesos.",cEN="<Hemet listens as you describe what you learned.>\n\nWay to go, <lad/lass>. No dead rhino tells Hemet Nesingwary where and what he can hunt. We'll show that heap o' bones."}
Q[12545]={d="我们从一群天灾侵略者手中夺回了这座古老的达卡莱神殿。不到一百码以外，就是金萨卡拉城的废墟。天灾通灵师在那里大肆杀戮，将活着的达卡莱巨魔转变为巫妖王的奴仆。\n\n所有的一切都不再属于圣光了，因此所有的一切都必须得到净化。\n\n<瓦鲁斯无情地看着你。>\n\n所有的一切。",dEN="We wrested this ancient Drakkari temple from a swarm of invading Scourge. Not more than one-hundred paces from where we stand is the ruined city of Jintha'kalar. Scourge necromancers run amok, turning the living Drakkari trolls that remain into servants of the Lich King.\n\nAll are now lost to the Light. All must be purged.\n\n<Valus looks upon you sternly.>\n\nAll.",o="龙骨荒野圣光之望礼拜堂的北伐军战士瓦鲁斯要求你去消灭15个金萨卡拉天灾成员。",oEN="Crusader Valus at Light's Trust in Dragonblight has asked you to slay 15 Jintha'kalar Scourge.",p="不要留下任何东西给巫妖王复活！",pEN="Leave nothing for the Lich King to resurrect!",c="Como puedes ver, la maquinaria de guerra de la Plaga sigue avanzando, pero los ejércitos de la Horda y la Alianza siguen divididos, lo que los convierte en presas fáciles. Es por esta razón que debemos permanecer unidos.\n\n<Valus se queda pensativo por un momento.>\n\nLa Cruzada Argéntea tiene uso para un <hombre/mujer> como tú. ¿Quizás te interesaría unirte a nuestra causa? ¿Para luchar y morir al lado del Rompehuesos?",cEN="As you can see, the Scourge war machine presses onward, yet the armies of the Horde and the Alliance remain divided, making for easy prey. It is for this reason that we must remain united.\n\n<Valus is lost in contemplation for a moment.>\n\nThe Argent Crusade has use for a <man/woman> like you. Perhaps you would be interested in joining our cause? To battle and die at the side of the Ashbringer?"}
Q[12546]={d="时机成熟了，$n。源生石像是泰坦的诸类造物中杀伤力最强的武器之一，我本不愿在这片圣洁的土地上释放他的力量。\n\n但是，我别无选择。入侵者已经将我逼入绝境，就让泰坦的怒火将他们烧得一干二净吧。",dEN="It is time, <name>. The Etymidian is one of the most destructive forces ever created by the titans and I am loathe to unleash him in my lands.\n\nThere is little choice, however. Our enemies have forced my hand and the fury of the titans will cleanse all.",o="Ve a la Avalancha en la Cuenca de Sholazar y usa la runa omega para desplegar a El Etimidiano. Úsalo para matar a 200 esbirros de la Plaga, a Bythius el Formador de carne, a Urgreth de Las Mil Tumbas y a Iragélida.\n\nHabla con el avatar de Freya en la Cuenca de Sholazar cuando hayas terminado la misión.",oEN="Go to the Avalanche in Sholazar Basin and use the Omega Rune to deploy Etymidian. Use him to slay 200 Scourge Minions, Bythius the Flesh-Shaper, Urgreth of the Thousand Tombs and Hailscorn.\n\nSpeak to the Avatar of Freya in Sholazar Basin when you've completed this task.",p="威胁生命的家伙们……你已经解决他们了吗？",pEN="Those who would threaten life... have they been dealt with?",c="Estoy agradecido por tu ayuda, <name>. Es mi deber vigilar estas tierras y toda la vida que habita en ellas.\n\nGracias a ti, esa vida seguirá prosperando mientras las fuerzas de la muerte asolan las regiones fronterizas.\n\nNo olvidaré tus acciones.",cEN="I am grateful for your help, <name>. It is my duty to watch over these lands and all life that dwells on them.\n\nThanks to you, that life will continue to thrive while the forces of death wage in the bordering regions.\n\nYour actions will not be forgotten."}
Q[12547]={d="这尊巨大的石像仿佛陷入了沉睡。你注意到它的胸前有一块符文形状的凹槽。\n\n或许你可以在附近找到那块失踪的符文。",dEN="This colossal being appears to be inactive. You notice an empty rune-shaped slot on its chest.\n\nPerhaps you might be able to find the missing rune inside the nearby overlook.",o="在塑造者之台内找到欧米伽符文，将它带至源生石像身边。",oEN="Obtain the Omega Rune inside the Shaper's Terrace and bring it to The Etymidian.",p="<源生石像胸口的符文状凹槽似乎闪动着微弱的能量光芒。>",pEN="<The rune-shaped slot on The Etymidian's chest appears to glow with faint power.>",c="<当源生石像活动起来的时候你听见石头的摩擦声。>\n\n有哪里需要我吗？",cEN="<You hear the rumbling sound of stone grinding as The Etymidian's limbs come to life.>\n\nI am needed somewhere?"}
Q[12548]={d="时机成熟了，$n。封闭了七个世纪之久的界门已经打开。穿越界门，去寻找我们最后的希望。\n\n将那些企图玷污这片神圣土地的渣滓送入地狱。让我们释放源生石像的力量吧！",dEN="It is time, <name>. The Waygate has been activated for the first time in seven centuries. Use it to travel to where our final hope lies.\n\nLet us put an end to those who would seek to bring the taint of undeath to this pristine land. Let us unleash the Etymidian.",o="穿越索拉查盆地南端的界门，在另一侧寻找那件被称为源生石像的武器。",oEN="Go through the Waygate in the southern end of Sholazar Basin and look for the weapon known as the Etymidian on the other side.",c="<当你读过这座石巨像身上的铭文，你了解到这就是弗蕾亚所说的武器。这就是源生石像。>",cEN="<As you read the engravings on this stone colossus, you realize that this is the weapon that Freya spoke of. This is the Etymidian.>"}
Q[12549]={d="如果你和赫米特一起打过猎的话，就该知道他能轻而易举地应付多种大型猫科动物。但是索拉查盆地的恶刃豹却不然，这种凶残而敏捷的野兽比我见过的所有猫科动物都要凶狠。只有真正的猎手，才能征服这样的猎物。\n\n如果你愿意接受挑战，就勇敢地面对恶刃豹吧。营地四周的荒野以及河流南岸都有它们的踪迹。",dEN="If you've hunted with Hemet before, you know that he's tested his skill against many large cats, but the dreadsabers here in Sholazar are different. They're able to bring down larger game than I've ever seen a cat hunt. To overcome and kill such a predator is the mark of a true hunter.\n\nIf you seek to prove you're up to the challenge, test yourself against the dreadsabers. They live in the wilderness surrounding the camp and south of the river.",o="杀死15只恶刃豹，然后向奈辛瓦里营地的巴克·坎维尔复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Dreadsabers and return to Buck Cantwell at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你在恶刃豹身上测试过你的技巧了吗？",pEN="Have you tested your skills against the dreadsabers?",c="嗯，你已经证明了你是个能干的猎人，但你跟踪的本领又如何呢？",cEN="Well, you've proven yourself a capable hunter, but how are you as a tracker?"}
Q[12550]={d="He oído que los nativos cuentan historias de un gran sable aterrador que llaman Shango. No he visto pruebas de la existencia de Shango, pero mis heridas me han impedido salir del campamento.\n\nSi te consideras $gun buen rastreador:una buena rastreadora;, podrías averiguar la verdad sobre Shango. Debaar dice que vio huellas enormes en su última salida. Ve al norte desde el campamento hacia el lago Olamarga y busca las huellas en la ribera sur.",dEN="I have heard that the natives tell stories of a large dreadsaber they call Shango. I haven't seen any evidence of this Shango's existence, but my injuries have kept me from venturing outside the camp.\n\nIf you fancy yourself something of a tracker, you might be able to find out the truth about Shango. Debaar said she saw some large tracks on her last outing. Go north from the camp toward Bittertide Lake, and search its southern shore for the prints.",o="奈辛瓦里营地的巴克·坎维尔要你从苦潮湖附近的恶刃豹足迹中鉴别出3条杉苟的足迹。",oEN="Buck Cantwell at the Nesingwary Base Camp wants you to identify 3 Shango Tracks from the Dreadsaber Tracks near Bittertide Lake.",p="跟踪进行的如何了？",pEN="How goes the tracking?",c="Creo que puede que hayas encontrado la prueba que necesitamos para este Shango. Y creo que tengo una idea de dónde podemos encontrarlo.",cEN="I think you may have found the proof we need for this Shango. And I think I have an idea as to where we can find him."}
Q[12551]={d="Te lo advierto, $gdesconocido:desconocida;, no hagas comentarios sobre estrellar la nave. Ya tengo bastante con lo que me dice el resto de la expedición.\n\nSi quieres probar a ver qué tal se te da la caza, no obstante, deberías enfrentarte a los astutos crocoliscos del manglar. Viven junto al río, al sur, y en el Manglar Silvestre al este. Demuestra que puedes enfrentarte a ellos y volveremos a hablar, $gcazador:cazadora;.",dEN="I warn you, stranger -- do not make any comments about crashing the ship. I already get enough of it from the rest of the expedition.\n\nIf you're looking to try your hand at hunting, though, you should test your skills against the wily mangal crocolisks. They live all along the river to the south, and in the Wildgrowth Mangal to the east. Prove you can hold your own against them and we'll talk again, hunter.",o="杀死15条蛮藤谷鳄鱼，然后向奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Mangal Crocolisks and return to Debaar at the Nesingwary Encampment.",p="你杀了足够数量了吗？",pEN="Did you make the kills?",c="Impresionante, <class>. ¿Estás seguro de que no eres miembro de la expedición?\n\nNo, estoy seguro. Debería haber habido algún chiste sobre un choque por ahí.",cEN="Impressive, <class>. Are you certain you're not a member of the expedition?\n\nNo, I'm certain of it. There would've been a crash joke in there somewhere."}
Q[12552]={d="当巨魔们推倒科尔拉玛斯的时候，它就倒在我们的东南面。不幸的时候，当它倒塌的时候，里面的天灾军团并没有死绝。\n\n现在他们正在复活我们的士兵，并用他们来对付我们！\n\n我们必须阻止这种事。你一定要杀死他们的通灵师！明白了吗？",dEN="When the trolls brought down Kolramas, it crashed next to us to the southeast. Unfortunately the crash did not destroy all of the Scourge within.\n\nNow they're raising our men from the dead and using them against us!\n\nThis will not be allowed to continue. You will see to it that their necromagi are slaughtered! Do we understand each other?",o="达克索塔的穆尔沙·月影中士要你去杀死8个哈沙尔通灵师。",oEN="Sergeant Moonshard at Drak'Sotra has asked you to destroy 8 Hath'ar Necromagi.",p="No, <class>, aún no has terminado. Sé con certeza que todavía hay necromagos deambulando por Kolramas.",pEN="No, <class>, you're not quite done. I know for a fact that there are still necromagi walking around at Kolramas.",c="这还远远不够！\n\n<中士的声音因为同伴的消亡而哀嚎粗哑。>\n\n我们必须采取更多行动来才能祭奠那些同伴！",cEN="It's not enough!\n\n<The sergeant's voice cracks as he mourns the corruption of his fallen comrades.>\n\nWe must do more to show respect for the memories of those men!"}
Q[12553]={d="为什么最棘手的任务总是派给我？\n\n科尔拉玛斯的天灾军团已经把药剂喷射器派到了离我们很近的地方，这是非常危险的。你不能想象如果他们朝这里来的话，会发生什么事！\n\n我有一个办法可以解决他们，但首先我们需要一些材料……要从天灾军团那里去弄。\n\n哈沙尔撒网者可以织出一种非常坚韧的网，正好为我们所用。给我带一些完整的喷丝头回来。",dEN="Why do I always get the tough tasks to tackle?\n\nThe Scourge at Kolramas have plague sprayers that are getting dangerously close. You don't want to know what's going to happen if they start heading this way!\n\nI've got an idea for how we might bring them down, but first we're going to need something... something from their own creatures.\n\nThe Hath'ar skimmers can spin a very strong web that we can put to good use. Bring back some of their spinnerets.",o="达克索塔的专家考格维尔要你去收集5个完整的撒网者喷丝头。",oEN="Specialist Cogwheel at Drak'Sotra has asked you to collect 5 Intact Skimmer Spinnerets.",p="如果我要组装一个设备给你用的话，非得要用完整的丝囊不可。",pEN="Those spinnerets have to be intact if I'm going to be able to put them together into a device that you can use.",c="这些派的上用场！\n\n现在我们还需要一些原料来替你组装发射设备。",cEN="Those'll do!\n\nNow we're going to need some raw parts so that I can put the launching device together for you."}
Q[12554]={d="$n，去召集一些同伴，至少一个吧，再去科尔拉玛斯走一趟！\n\n科尔拉玛斯的首领，腐蚀者玛拉斯正在浮空城的顶端耀武扬威。\n\n去杀了他，把他的徽记给我带回来！",dEN="<name>, gather at least one other person and head back down there!\n\nYou'll find the leader of Kolramas, Malas the Corrupter, gloating from atop the crashed necropolis.\n\nKill him and bring me his head!",o="达克索塔的穆尔沙·月影中士要你带回腐蚀者的徽记。",oEN="Sergeant Moonshard at Drak'Sotra insists that you return with the Head of the Corrupter.",p="我期待着要把他的头挂在杆子上。让我们看看他这样还能不能复活！",pEN="I look forward to mounting his head on a pike. Let's see him come back from that!",c="Eres el héroe del momento, <name>.\n\n<Moonshard le aparta la cabeza de un puntapié.>\n\nMereces nuestro más profundo respeto, y algo más, creo yo.",cEN="You're the hero of the hour, <name>.\n\n<Moonshard kicks the head away from him.>\n\nYou deserve our deepest respect, and something more I think."}
Q[12555]={d="好了！投网器已经完成，你可以用它去摧毁那些药剂喷射器了。\n\n你只需要瞄准并按下发射键，蛛网就会扰乱它们的浮空法术，直到那些喷雾器像科尔拉玛斯一样坠毁。\n\n多有诗意啊。我喜欢！",dEN="There! One tangled skein thrower ready and waiting for you to take those plague sprayers down.\n\nYou just aim and let loose. The webbing should foul up their hover spells long enough to cause them to crash to the ground just like Kolramas.\n\nKind of poetic. I like that!",o="达克索塔的专家考格维尔要你使用缠绕投网器摧毁5台药剂喷射器。",oEN="Specialist Cogwheel at Drak'Sotra has asked you to use the Tangled Skein Thrower in order to cause the destruction of 5 Plague Sprayers.",p="你确定你击坠够多了吗？我看起来像是很想要瘟疫的样子吗？",pEN="You sure you brought down enough of those things? Do I look like I want the plague?!",c="¡Yupi! ¡Eres el mejor, <name>!\n\n¡No tenía muchas ganas de que me rociaran con cosas de la Plaga, eso seguro! ¡Supongo que ahora será difícil para esos estúpidos nerubianos propagar su maldad!\n\n¿Qué te parece si te doy un regalito por salvarme el pellejo?",cEN="Yay! You're the best, <name>!\n\nI wasn't looking forward to being sprayed with Scourge stuff, that's for sure! I guess it's going to be hard for those stupid nerubians to spread their evil now!\n\nHow about I give you a little something for saving my skin?"}
Q[12556]={d="Ahora que sabemos dónde encontrar a Farunn, solo queda la batalla contra la bestia. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para enfrentarte a ese rinoceronte, $n? A pesar de las bravatas del espíritu, seguro que decía la verdad sobre la fuerza de la bestia.\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista; para enfrentarte a él, ve al norte, más allá del Pilar Toquesol, y busca a Farunn en la ribera noreste del lago Olamarga. Puede que hasta se acerque al Pilar Iluminado. Trae su cuerno para conmemorar su muerte.",dEN="Now that we know where to find Farunn, all that remains is the battle against the great beast. Are you ready to take on this rhino, <name>? For all the spirit's blustering, I'm certain it was telling the truth about the beast's strength.\n\nWhen you're ready to face him, head north past the Suntouched Pillar and look for Farunn on the northeast shore of the Bittertide Lake. It may even venture near the Glimmering Pillar. Bring back its horn to commemorate your kill.",o="将法鲁恩的犄角交给奈辛瓦里营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里。",oEN="Bring Farunn's Horn to Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你杀死那头野兽了吗？",pEN="Did you kill the beast?",c="<Hemet examina el cuerno.>\n\n¡Un trofeo asombroso de un animal increíble! <name>, he estado oyendo rumores de presas aún más grandes y feroces en los confines septentrionales de la cuenca y me gustaría que nos ayudaras a rastrearlas.",cEN="<Hemet examines the horn.>\n\nAn astounding trophy from an amazing animal! <name>, I've been hearing rumors of even bigger, more ferocious game in the northern reaches of the basin and I'd like you to help us track it down."}
Q[12557]={d="我猜，你也是个想成功跻身我的学徒行列的年轻$r吧。\n\n很好，年轻人很有志气……\n\n但是我是否会接受你的申请，取决于你到底都能为我做什么，能在我的实验室里帮到什么忙了。你看，这里面有无数的材料，有些备料充足，有些就短缺了。\n\n那么，$c，你得花点时间帮我找点东西。我要一只泥潭蛆虫、一片干瘪的蝙蝠翼、一粒琥珀种子和一些冰冷的毒蛇粘液。\n\n都找到的话，我就认真考虑你的请求。",dEN="I assume by your interruption that you wish to be numbered among those I am considering for apprenticeship.\n\nA worthy aspiration...\n\nShould I someday choose to accept your petition, I must be confident that you can find your way around my laboratory. I have many ingredients here; some plentiful, and others in short supply.\n\nTake your time, <class>. Find a muddy mire maggot, a withered batwing, an amberseed, and some chilled serpent mucus.\n\nSucceed, and I'll know to take your request seriously.",o="赫布瓦罗的炼金师菲肯斯坦要求你在他的实验室内找到一只泥潭蛆虫、一片干瘪的蝙蝠翼、一粒琥珀种子和一些冰冷的毒蛇粘液。",oEN="Alchemist Finklestein at Heb'Valok wants you to find a Muddy Mire Maggot, a Withered Batwing, an Amberseed, and some Chilled Serpent Mucus from within his laboratory.",p="¿Te has acostumbrado a mi laboratorio, <class>?",pEN="Have you become accustomed to my laboratory, <class>?",c="Sí, sí, es un buen comienzo.\n\nSi tuviera que pedirte ayuda con una receta real, necesitarás localizar los ingredientes a tiempo.\n\nTenlo en cuenta, <class>.\n\nAdiós.",cEN="Yes, yes, that's a good start.\n\nShould I call upon you to help me with an actual recipe, you'll need to locate ingredients in a timely manner.\n\nKeep that in mind, <class>.\n\nFarewell."}
Q[12558]={d="$n，杉苟在等着你呢。只要你的跟踪技术够娴熟，它就不会发现你，这样你就可以取得先手了。\n\n与索拉查盆地的其它恶刃豹相比，杉苟的体型应该更大，性情也更加凶残。往北走，你可以在苦潮湖西岸的瀑布附近找到杉苟的踪迹，向它发起挑战吧。如果你获胜了，就把它的毛皮给我带回来。",dEN="Shango awaits, <name>. If you have succeeded in your tracking, he will not know that you stalk him, and you will need the advantage.\n\nHe is supposed to be bigger, stronger, and more ferocious than the other dreadsabers of the basin. Travel north, to the western shore of Bittertide Lake and near the falls that feed it, do battle with Shango. If you succeed, return with his pelt.",o="将杉苟的毛皮交给奈辛瓦里营地的巴克·坎维尔。",oEN="Bring Shango's Pelt to Buck Cantwell at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你解决杉苟了吗？",pEN="Have you taken on Shango?",c="¡Qué piel tan exquisita de un animal tan noble! Me alegra ver que los rumores sobre Shango eran ciertos, <name>. Tu persecución de la criatura ha sido impecable. Eres un auténtico cazador.",cEN="What an exquisite pelt from such a noble animal! It heartens me to see that the rumors about Shango were indeed true, <name>. Your pursuit of the creature has been flawless. You are a true huntsman."}
Q[12559]={d="是时候了。让我们来引导界门吧。\n\n界门的第一道开关就在盆地西部边界的造物者之座内。\n\n千万小心，$n。那里是泰坦监视诸类造物的地方，如今仍然有许多石质魔像留守。",dEN="It is time then. Let us activate the waygate.\n\nYou will find the first switch inside the Maker's Perch in the western edge of the basin.\n\nBeware, <name>. The titans used the perch to watch over their creations. Many of their stone servants still guard the place.",o="雨声河的弗蕾亚的化身要你转至造物者之座，引导界门开关 - 伽玛。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids wants you to go to the Maker's Perch and use the Activation Switch Gamma.",p="你回来了，小家伙。我都开始担心你的安危了。",pEN="You're back, little one. I was beginning to worry about your well-being.",c="Estamos a mitad de camino, <name>. Hay que activar un interruptor más antes de que podamos recuperar el Etymidian.",cEN="We're halfway there, <name>. One more switch needs to be activated before we can retrieve the Etymidian."}
Q[12560]={d="蛮藤谷鳄鱼擅长偷袭猎物，我打算以牙还牙，就用这招来对付它们。因此，我们得为你制作一件完美的伪装。材料嘛，最好用生长在河边湖畔沙地上的沙蕨。\n\n它非常适合制作伪装。喏，南边的碎浪河，北边的苦潮湖和苦潮瀑布，以及东边的河流之心，这些河流或是湖泊附近的沙地上就有这种植物。",dEN="The mangal crocolisk is a master of the ambush, and I intend to beat the best at his game. To do that, we'll need to construct a convincing camouflage for you. We'll use plants that grow in the sandy soil of the riverbanks and lake beaches.\n\nThe sandfern is best for this purpose. It grows in the sandy areas near the shores of the Seabreach Flow, just to the south, Bittertide Lake and Bittertide Falls, to the north, and the edges of River's Heart, the large lake beyond the mangal to the east.",o="将5片沙蕨叶交给奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔。",oEN="Bring 5 Sandfern fronds to Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你把我们需要的沙蕨叶带来了吗？",pEN="Did you bring all the ferns we'll need?",c="<蒂巴尔接过沙蕨叶然后开始把它们绑在你身上。>\n\n嗯，这样应该可以了。站好别动！我们会把你弄成一丛草！",cEN="<Debaar accepts the sandfern fronds from you and starts bending them around your body.>\n\nYes, this should work. Stand still! We'll make a bush of you yet."}
Q[12561]={d="这一切本不该发生的。亡灵大军如风暴般席卷了这处生命的摇篮！\n\n如果你的来意不是铲除巫妖王的爪牙，就请立即离开。若是再打扰我，必将招致我的愤怒与憎恶。",dEN="This should never have happened. The forces of undeath storm the very cradle of life!\n\nIf you're not here to destroy the minions of the Lich King, then leave at once. Do not incur my wrath by distracting me from my duties.",o="进入迷失之地，消灭6个毁坏的天灾怪和10个骨镰劫掠者，以此获得弗蕾亚的信任。",oEN="Obtain Freya's trust by destroying 6 Blighted Corpses and 10 Bonescythe Ravagers in the Lost Lands.",p="不要浪费我的时间，凡人。泰坦的创作一定得好好守护！",pEN="Do not waste my time, mortal. The titans' creations must be defended!",c="Muy bien, <race>. Me satisface que no seas uno de los esbirros del Rey Exánime... tal vez haya algo que puedas hacer por nosotros después de todo.",cEN="Very well, <race>. I am satisfied that you're not one of the Lich King's minions... perhaps there is something you can do for us after all."}
Q[12562]={d="Nuestros informes indican que desde que esos elementales de agua aparecieron en los Campos de Drak'Sotra, cierto número de chamanes Drakkari han bajado de los niveles superiores de Zul'Drak para controlarlos.\n\nNo puedo dejar de hacer hincapié, $gseñor:señora;, en lo peligroso que sería eso. No queremos que tengan elementales de agua a su disposición.\n\nEl comandante ha ordenado acabar con esos vinculadores de agua Drakkari. Ve al sur cuando estés $glisto:lista;.",dEN="Intelligence reports that ever since those water elementals appeared in the Drak'Sotra Fields, a number of Drakkari shaman have come down from the upper tiers of Zul'Drak to take control of them.\n\nI cannot stress enough, <sir /ma'am>, how dangerous that could prove. We do not want them to have water elementals at their disposal.\n\nThe commander has ordered that these Drakkari water binders are to be put to the sword. Head south when you're ready.",o="银色前沿的亚克斯中尉要求你去消灭10名达卡莱缚水者。",oEN="Sub-Lieutenant Jax at The Argent Stand has asked you to kill 10 Drakkari Water Binders.",p="如果要我说的话，你应该再多对付几个达卡莱缚水者。",pEN="If I may suggest, you might want to take care of a few more of those Drakkari water binders.",c="¡Excelente trabajo, <sir /ma'am>!\n\nMe encargaré de que el comandante sea informado de los resultados de tu misión.",cEN="Excellent work, <sir /ma'am>!\n\nI'll see to it that the commander is apprised of your mission results."}
Q[12563]={d="拔出你的武器，$r。巡逻的时候到了！\n\n我们要拼死保住手中的四座岗哨，这对我们取得胜利有着关键性的意义。我要你去逐一巡查这几处岗哨，并向他们提供帮助。\n\n你可以从东南方的布兰顿上尉那里开始。等你完成他指派的任务后，他就会指引你去下一座岗哨。\n\n巡查完所有四座岗哨后再回来向我复命。记住——你回来得越快，报酬就越丰厚！所以给我动作麻利一点！\n\n解散！",dEN="Unsheathe that weapon, <race>. It's time to go on patrol!\n\nI've got four posts under my command and it's crucial to our success that they remain in our control. I'm ordering you to visit each of them and offer your assistance.\n\nYou can begin with Captain Brandon southeast of here. He'll direct you to the next post when he's finished with you.\n\nReport back to me once you've assisted each of my men. And remember, you'll be more richly rewarded for returning to me quickly - so double-time it!\n\nDismissed!",o="银色前沿的指挥官库恩斯要你拜访四座银色北伐军的岗哨，并完成那里的上尉交给你的任务，然后回去向他复命。\n\n布兰顿上尉和鲁伯特上尉驻扎在达克索塔。格隆迪尔上尉驻扎在达克迦尔。炼金师菲肯斯坦驻扎在赫布瓦罗。",oEN="Commander Kunz at the Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their captain's orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Captain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, and Alchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'Valok.",p="¿Qué noticias hay de nuestros puestos, <race>?",pEN="What news from our posts, <race>?",c="Bueno, <name>, al menos has vuelto entero. Supongo que eso vale algo...",cEN="Well, <name>, at least you've made it back in one piece. I suppose that's worth something...."}
Q[12564]={d="我的弟兄们虽然坚韧勇猛，但他们毕竟是血肉之躯。\n\n受伤和疼痛削弱了他们完成任务的能力，没有什么训练或者诀窍可以改变这一点。\n\n值得欣慰的是，我们的炼金师发明了一种药膏，与我们的绷带一起使用的话，可以大大缓解士兵的疼痛。\n\n药膏需要用到一种特殊的罂粟，正好这里的巨魔在西边的达克索塔农田中种了不少。去采一些罂粟回来，以保证我们的库存充足。",dEN="Gritty as my men are, they're still mortal.\n\nWounds and pain diminish their ability to perform their missions. No amount of training changes that simple fact of life.\n\nThankfully, one of our alchemists has developed a recipe for a salve that binds to our bandages and greatly reduces the pain our soldiers experience.\n\nThe salve requires a special poppy these trolls cultivate just west of here. Go to Drak'Sotra Fields and harvest some of them to keep our stockpiles from running out.",o="达克索塔的布兰顿上尉希望你从达克索塔农田采集5份成熟的水罂粟。",oEN="Captain Brandon at Drak'Sotra wants you to collect 5 Mature Water-Poppies from Drak'Sotra Fields.",p="¿Has recogido las amapolas de agua, <name>?",pEN="Have you collected the water-poppies, <name>?",c="Buenos especímenes, <name>.\n\nEn nombre de mis soldados, te agradezco tus esfuerzos de hoy.\n\nEs probable que el capitán Rupert sea la siguiente parada de tu patrulla. Está apostado en la muralla justo al este de aquí.",cEN="Fine specimens, <name>.\n\nOn behalf of my soldiers, I thank you for your efforts today.\n\nCaptain Rupert is likely the next stop on your patrol. He's stationed at the wall just east of here."}
Q[12565]={d="你们的银色北伐军在消灭天灾这件事情上表现出了极大的热诚，这让我非常感动，$r。我很愿意助你们一臂之力。\n\n达卡莱巨魔曾经在这座盛极一时的城市中定期供奉他们的神灵，而现在他们非但对神灵毫无敬意，甚至表现得更糟糕了。\n\n如果你去供奉神灵的话，他们一定会对你表示感谢的。\n\n希姆埃巴的雕像就在这里的西南面，强大的希姆埃巴会接受你供奉的达卡莱圣物，作为你正在保护祖达克的证明。",dEN="I am heartened to see the zeal with which your Argent Crusade is dealing with the Scourge, <race>. I would like to help with your efforts.\n\nThe Drakkari trolls of this once-great city used to make regular offerings to their gods, but now neglect them, or worse.\n\nIf you were to make offerings to the gods, they would show their appreciation in return.\n\nZim'Abwa's statue is just to the southwest. Zim'Abwa would gladly accept your offerings of Drakkari artifacts as a sign that you are protecting Zul'Drak.",o="银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈要求你在希姆埃巴的雕像前奉上10份达卡莱供品。",oEN="Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand wants you to present 10 Drakkari Offerings to the statue of Zim'Abwa.",p="<希姆埃巴深邃地凝望着北方与南方。>",pEN="<Zim'Abwa stares inscrutably to the north and the south.>",c="<如果希姆埃巴的脸部能动的话，他会对你露出一个凶恶的笑容。>",cEN="<If Zim'Abwa could move his face, Zim'Abwa would make a vicious grin.>"}
Q[12566]={d="Soy el enviado Nanik de los taunka, de parte del cabecilla del Campamento Pezuña Invernal para buscar aliados en nuestra lucha contra los vrykuls. Se congregan al oeste y al sur de nuestro poblado, y aunque matamos a 10 de ellos por cada uno de los nuestros que ha muerto, ya no podemos resistir más.\n\nEl boticario Scyllis nos ha prometido que enviaría $galgún:alguna:c; valiente $c al noroeste para ayudarnos. ¿Ayudarás a nuestro pueblo a rechazar las incursiones de los vrykuls?\n\nSigue el camino que se aleja hacia el noroeste cruzando el río y adéntrate en la falda de la montaña para llegar hasta el Campamento Pezuña Invernal.",dEN="I am Longrunner Nanik of the Taunka, sent by the chieftain of Camp Winterhoof to seek out allies in the fight against the vrykul. They mass to the west and south of our village, and though we slay 10 of them for every one of our dead, we cannot hold.\n\nApothecary Scyllis has promised to send brave <class>s northwest to our aid. Will you help my people fend off the vrykul assaults?\n\nFollow the road far to the northwest, across the river, and into the foothills of the mountains to reach Camp Winterhoof.",o="与冬蹄营地的灰烬图腾酋长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Chieftain Ashtotem at Camp Winterhoof.",c="Entonces, ¿Nanik sí encontró ayuda? Dime, <name>, ¿cómo es que has llegado hasta aquí sin él? Nadie conoce esta tierra mejor que los Taunka.",cEN="So, Nanik did find help then? Tell me, <name>, how is it you made it here without him? None know this land better than the Taunka."}
Q[12567]={p="<希姆埃巴的视线穿透了你的灵魂。\n\n你取悦了希姆埃巴，但是他还想要你给他更多达卡莱供品来表达你的感激与尊敬。\n\n他会好好奖励你的。>",pEN="<Zim'Abwa's stony visage pierces your soul.\n\nZim'Abwa is pleased, but wants you to show more appreciation and respect by giving him more Drakkari offerings.\n\nHe will reward you in kind.>",c="<你感觉到希姆埃巴的赞许。不知怎么，你知道希姆埃巴还想要更多的贡品！>",cEN="<You sense Zim'Abwa's approval. Somehow you know that Zim'Abwa wants more tribute!>"}
Q[12568]={d="相信我，$r，我知道……\n\n焚烧尸体的味道让我，一个被遗忘者，都感到恶心。不过，确保我们的战友永远不会成为天灾的伙伴，这是我们庄严的职责。\n\n把这种焚化油倒在我们倒下的同伴身上，确保他们不会在战场上与我们互相残杀。",dEN="Trust me, <race>. I know....\n\nThe smell of burnt flesh has become sickening to even me, a Forsaken. Nevertheless, it is our solemn duty to ensure that our brethren never walk with the Scourge.\n\nPour this oil on the corpses of our fallen to ensure that we never face them on the battlefield as enemies.",o="鲁伯特上尉希望你转至达克索塔，在5名战死的银色步兵身上使用焚化油。",oEN="Captain Rupert wants you to use the Incinerating Oil on 5 Defeated Argent Footmen in Drak'Sotra.",c="Gracias, <name>.\n\nNo es el trabajo más glorioso en el campo de batalla, pero debe hacerse. Dejaré constancia de tu servicio en mi informe.\n\nEs probable que el Capitán Grondel te esté esperando al noreste, justo fuera del anfiteatro.",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nIt's not the most glorious job on the battlefield, but it must be done. I'll make note of your service in my report.\n\nCaptain Grondel is likely waiting for you to the northeast, just outside the amphitheater."}
Q[12569]={d="Al mayor crocolisco de la cuenca, conocido en la zona como \"Matagolpe\" por su habilidad en las emboscadas, le gusta tomar el sol en las aguas poco profundas del Corazón del Río. Es el lago grande en el centro de la cuenca, al este de nuestro campamento.\n\nQuiero que tomes el camuflaje que te he preparado y te escondas en la playa occidental del Corazón del Río y le tiendas una emboscada a Matagolpe cuando aparezca. Tráeme su poderosa quijada si logras derrotarlo.",dEN="The largest crocolisk in the basin, known around here as \"Bushwhacker\" for his ambush prowess, likes to sun himself in the shallow waters of River's Heart. It's the large lake at the basin's center, and is to the east of our camp.\n\nI want you to take the camouflage I've prepared and hide on the western beach of River's Heart and ambush Bushwhacker when he shows himself. Bring back his mighty jaws if you are able to overcome him.",o="将丛林霸王的颚骨交给奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔。",oEN="Bring Bushwhacker's Jaw to Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="我们的计划成功了吗？",pEN="Did our plan work?",c="<蒂巴尔听你描述了伪装的失败。>\n\n你是说，我们的计划不如预期中的有效？\n\n好吧，至少听你说起来你还是成功杀掉它了。看看这颚骨的尺寸！赫米特会为我们的成果感到骄傲的——这条鳄鱼真是只怪兽。",cEN="<Debaar listens as you describe the failure of the disguise.>\n\nWhat do you mean, our plan didn't work as intended?\n\nWell, you did manage to get the kill, to your credit. Look at the size of this jaw! Hemet will be proud of our efforts. This crocolisk was truly a monster."}
Q[12570]={d="¡Lo siento! ¡No quería meterte en un lío!\n\n<El Oráculo herido te mira sin comprender durante un buen rato.>\n\n¡Me has salvado! Te damos las gracias. Vamos a volver al pueblo. Ven tú también... ¡puedes quedarte con nosotros! Hombres cachorro más bien malos de todos modos.\n\nAvísame cuando estés $glisto:lista; para partir, ¿vale?",dEN="I sorry! I not mean to get you in trouble!\n\n<The injured oracle stares at you blankly for a long while.>\n\nYou save me! We thank you. We going to go back to village now. You come too... you can stay with us! Puppy-men kind of mean anyway.\n\nLet me know when you ready to go, okay?",o="护送受伤的雨声神谕者返回雨声树屋，然后与高阶神谕者索乌塞谈一谈。",oEN="Escort the Injured Rainspeaker Oracle to Rainspaker Canopy and speak to High-Oracle Soo-say.",p="你是谁？你闻起来跟小狗人一样臭。",pEN="Who you? You stink of puppy-men.",c="¿Nos ayudas? Eres bienvenido entonces, <name>.",cEN="You help us? You welcome then, <name>."}
Q[12571]={d="Estábamos aquí mucho antes de que llegaran los hombres cachorro. Este lugar es muy sagrado. No nos marcharemos.\n\nParece que puedes ser $gbueno:buena;, pero Lafoo se queda contigo por si acaso. Creemos que lo entiendes.\n\nHay serpientes que intentan comerse nuestra prole. Ve con Lafoo y haz que paren, ¿de acuerdo? Sobre todo la grande cerca de la cascada al noreste.",dEN="We were here long before the puppy-men came. This is very sacred place - we will not leave.\n\nYou seem like maybe you good, but we have Lafoo stay with you just in case. You understand we think.\n\nThere snakes thing that keeps trying to eat our hatchlings. Go with Lafoo and make them stop, okay? Especially big one near waterfall to northeast.",o="雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞要你杀死毒尖和10条帝王眼镜蛇。\n\n如果你弄丢了拉弗乌的虫袋，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to kill Venomtip and 10 Emperor Cobras.\n\nIf you lose Lafoo's Bug Bag, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="<高阶神谕者索乌塞的视线似乎直直穿过你。>",pEN="<High-Oracle Soo-say seems to stare right through you.>",c="¿Se ha ido la serpiente?\n\nBuen <race>. Te lo agradecemos.",cEN="Snake gone?\n\nGood <race>. We thank you."}
Q[12572]={d="Soo-pinstán nos mandó acompañarte. Sé $gbueno:buena;, ¿vale?\n\n¡Ooh, ooh! ¡Ya sabemos! ¡Soo-pinstán se alegrará si llevamos más ofrendas para el santuario! No tenemos que ir lejos, siempre hay cosas que encontrar cerca del pueblo... ¡solo hay que buscar brillos en la tierra!\n\n¡Vamos! ¡Vamos! ¡Más ofrendas para el santuario!",dEN="Soo-say said we go with you. You be nice, okay?\n\nOoh, ooh! We know! We can make Soo-say happy if we bring back more offerings for shrine! We not need to go far, there's always stuffs to dig up around village... just look for sparkles in dirt!\n\nLet's go! Let's go! More offerings for shrine!",o="收集6份拉弗乌从土堆里挖出的闪闪发亮的宝贝，将它们交给雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。\n\n如果你弄丢了拉弗乌的虫袋，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Collect 6 of the treasures that Lafoo digs up and bring them to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.\n\nIf you lose Lafoo's Bug Bag, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="嗨，干燥皮肤的朋友。你跟拉弗乌相处的好吗？",pEN="Hello dryskin. You get along with Lafoo good?",c="给伟大神祇的亮晶晶！好！很好！\n\n我们立刻把这些献祭。拉弗乌想到的是吗？他是个很聪明的神谕者。",cEN="Shinies for the Great Rain Stone! Good! Good!\n\nWe offer these right away. Lafoo thought of this, yes? He a very smart Rainspeaker."}
Q[12573]={d="Tenemos una gran idea. Eras $gamigo:amiga; de los hombres cachorro y quizás te hagan caso.\n\nQueremos que le lleves una ofrenda al chamán Vekjik. Él al suroeste donde río se convierte en cascada. Dile al hombre cachorro que no queremos pelea. Dile que somos buenos.\n\nEres $gbueno:buena:r;, $r. Sabemos que lo harás bien.",dEN="We have great idea. You were friends with puppy-men, they maybe listen to you.\n\nWe want you to go give offering to Shaman Vekjik. He southwest where river turns into waterfall. Tell puppy-man we no want fight. Tell him we play nice.\n\nYou good <race>. We trust you do this right.",o="雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞要你将雨声议和礼物交给萨满祭司维克伊克，然后转达他的响应。\n\n如果你弄丢了拉弗乌的虫袋，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="High-Oracle Soo-say at Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to give a peace offering to Shaman Vekjik and then return with his response.\n\nIf you lose Lafoo's Bug Bag, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="小狗人好相处吗？",pEN="Puppy-men play nice now?",c="好坏！我们一直好他们一直坏。\n\n他们还想找迷雾巨石麻烦……也许他们不知道迷雾巨石是神圣的。",cEN="So mean! We only be nice and they only be mean.\n\nThey keep messing with great stones... maybe they not know great stones are sacred."}
Q[12574]={d="<高阶神谕者索乌塞盯着你的额头看了好一会儿才开口讲话。>\n\n索乌甘需要帮助。他们可能再次遭到了狗狗人的袭击。\n\n我们决定派你和亚鲁乌特去帮忙……沿着河流一直往西就能抵达雾语村。服从索乌甘的指令……把狗狗人的鼻子都揍歪，看他们以后还敢不敢惹事。\n\n<在你离开前，高阶神谕者索乌塞再次凝视着你的额头。>",dEN="<High-Oracle Soo-say stares at your forehead for a while before speaking.>\n\nSoo-gan ask for help. We think they might have been attacked by puppy-men again.\n\nWe sending you and Jaloot to help... follow west river up to Mistwhisper Refuge. Do what Soo-gan says... hit the puppy-men on the nose if they being mean, they don't like that.\n\n<High-Oracle Soo-say goes back to staring at your forehead as you leave.>",o="转至雾语村，与唤雾者索乌甘谈一谈。\n\n如果你弄丢了亚鲁乌特的宝贝水晶，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Travel to Mistwhisper Refuge and speak to Mistcaller Soo-gan.\n\nIf you lose Jaloot's Favorite Crystal, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",c="我们觉得我们看过你。你曾经来过雾语村？\n\n索乌塞说你好。索乌塞很聪明，所以我们也相信你。\n\n<唤雾者索乌甘露出了一个笨拙的笑容。>",cEN="We think we seen you before. You visit Mistwhisper village sometime already?\n\nSoo-say said you good. Soo-say smart, so we trust you too.\n\n<Mistcaller Soo-gan offers an awkwardly large smile.>"}
Q[12575]={d="狗狗人又来迷雾巨石捣乱了，他们敲碎了蓝色水晶！你瞧这又是暴雨又是闪电的……不能在迷雾巨石使用蓝色水晶啊！狗狗人真该死！\n\n他们还趁乱偷走了我们在大湖中找到的宝藏。我们本来是要将它供奉给迷雾巨石的！迷雾巨石很生气，后果很严重！\n\n就是被那个塔特尔……呃，好像是塔塔克……不对不对……哦，是塔尔特克。哼，就是被塔尔特克偷走的！他逃到北边的营地去了。抢回我们的宝贝！",dEN="So some puppy-men come and smash blue crystals at Great Mist Stone! Lots of rain and lightning and badness... blue is wrong crystal for Great Mist Stone! Dumb puppy-men.\n\nAfter lightning, puppy-men stole big treasure we found in the sea-lake. We need treasure back to give to Great Mist Stone! Mist Stone is angry after what the puppy-men did!\n\nOne who took it named Tarter... no, Tiktak... no, no... Tartek. That it, Tartek! He went to the camp thing to north. Go get treasure back!",o="雾语村的唤雾者索乌甘要你杀死督军塔尔特克，并取回雾语宝物。\n\n如果你弄丢了亚鲁乌特的宝贝水晶，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Kill Warlord Tartek and retrieve the Mistwhisper Treasure for Mistcaller Soo-gan at Mistwhisper Refuge.\n\nIf you lose Jaloot's Favorite Crystal, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="那些笨小狗贼，哼。",pEN="Dumb puppy-thieves.",c="你办到了！你又强又好！真是雾语村的好朋友！\n\n<唤雾者索乌甘露齿大笑。>",cEN="You did it! You strong and nice! Good friend of Mistwhispers!\n\n<Mistcaller Soo-gan lets loose a big toothy grin.>"}
Q[12576]={d="自从狗狗人来到这里，我们就一直想和他们保持友好关系，但是他们却不领情。\n\n本来嘛，狗狗人傻乎乎的，倒不至于造成什么麻烦。可现在他们竟然想打祭坛的主意。神圣的祭坛不容他们侵犯！这些巨石是伟大的造物主在创世的时候为我们竖立在这里的。\n\n要是迷雾巨石被破坏的话，我们该怎么办呀。去北边的狗狗人营地，阻止他们！",dEN="We try to be nice to puppy-men ever since they came, but they nothing but mean.\n\nWe okay with them being dumb - they not do much harm. Now they mess with sacred shrines though. Sacred shrines not for messing with. The Great Stones are here from all the way back when the Great Ones made us.\n\nWe wouldn't know what to do if the Great Mist Stone were hurt. Go to their camp to north... make puppy-men stop and not come back!",o="雾语村的唤雾者索乌甘要你杀死8个狂心持矛者和6个狂心清除者。\n\n如果你弄丢了亚鲁乌特的宝贝水晶，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Kill 8 Frenzyheart Spearbearers and 6 Frenzyheart Scavengers for Mistcaller Soo-gan at Mistwhisper Refuge.\n\nIf you lose Jaloot's Favorite Crystal, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="他们总是想打架！我们不想打架，但我们要保护宝物。",pEN="They always want fight! We no want fight, but we need to protect sacred stuffs.",c="你打得好。谢谢你的帮忙。",cEN="You squash good. Thank you for help."}
Q[12577]={d="Eres $gbuen:buena; piel seca... Susurraneblina a salvo, tesoro a salvo y hombres cachorros seguro dejarnos tranquilos ahora.\n\nVuelve al Canope de Hablalluvia y cuéntale a Soo-pinstán lo bien que lo hiciste.",dEN="You're a good dryskin. Mistwhisper safe, treasure safe, and puppy-men sure to leave us alone now.\n\nYou go back to Rainspeaker Canopy and tell Soo-say you done good.",o="返回雨声树屋。",oEN="Return to Rainspeaker Canopy.",c="你好快就回来了！\n\n那么，很顺利咯？",cEN="You back so soon!\n\nWent good then, yeah?"}
Q[12578]={d="我以为你没这么快回来呢，看来是我错了。我正打算派莫乌德去警告附近苔行村的朋友们，叫他们别过来祭坛这边。苔行村在东边，就在倒塌的大石柱的东北方。\n\n你也一起去吧！莫乌德很聪明……听他的没错啦。",dEN="I not think you be back in time to go out again, but I wrong. I sending Moodle to nearby Mosswalker friends to bop silly Mosswalkers for not coming see shrine. Their village is east, up ridge, northeast of broken pillar.\n\nYou go with Moodle! He extra smart Rainspeaker... you listen to him good-like.",o="抵达苔行村后与莫乌德谈一谈。\n\n如果你弄丢了莫乌德的皮球，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Travel to Mosswalker Village and speak to Moodle once you've arrived.\n\nIf you lose Moodle's Stress Ball, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="Soo-say tartamudea un poco, pero no es tonto. Aunque creo que ha sido demasiado indulgente... los hombres-cachorro no van a parar ni nos van a dejar en paz. La única forma de detenerlos es matándolos... no hay \"paz\".\n\n<Moodle infla el pecho y se señala a sí mismo.>\n\nEn eso soy bueno.",pEN="Soo-say fumbles a bit, but he's not dumb. I do think he's been far too forgiving though... the puppy-men are not going to stop or leave us alone. The only way to stop them is to kill them... there is no \"peace.\"\n\n<Moodle puffs up his chest and points to himself.>\n\nThat I am good at.",c="在你开口说话之前，不要以为我跟你见过的神谕者一样愚蠢。我曾经去世界各地旅行过，也学会了你们的语言，而我并不好骗。\n\n我们来之前我就知道苔行鳄鱼人已经死了，但我并不知道背后的原因是不死生物。\n\n他们应该不能进入这块地方的……一定是源血之柱的毁灭让他们跑了进来。我们必须把他们赶走。",cEN="Before you say anything, do not assume me as foolish as most of the Oracles you've met. I've been into the world a bit, I've learned your language, and I'm not easily duped.\n\nI knew the Mosswalkers were dead before we ever came, though I didn't know that the undead were behind it.\n\nThey are not supposed to be able to enter this land... the destruction of the Lifeblood Pillar must have allowed them in somehow. We must see to it that they leave."}
Q[12579]={d="我早就猜测那些大石柱是导致气候异常温暖的原因，也正是它们的力量替我们抵挡了亡灵的入侵……看来我的观点得到了初步的验证。\n\n不久前，源血之柱在巨大的爆炸声中轰然倒塌。紧接着苔行村就遭遇了不幸，气候也随即突变……转眼之间就有雪花飘落，我们从来没有见过这样的天气。\n\n苔行村的居民为苔藓巨石供奉大量的源血水晶，这才阻止了降雪。如果我们也这么做的话，说不定能抵御亡灵的进犯。",dEN="I've always suspected that the pillars have been the main reason for our weather and seclusion from the undead... this confirms it a bit.\n\nNot terribly long ago, there was a sound of a great explosion when the Lifeblood Pillar fell. The weather changed for the mosswalkers almost immediately... it began to snow, something we never see.\n\nThey were able to stop the snow by bringing more lifeblood crystals to the Great Moss Stone. Perhaps if we can do the same, it will help ward off the undead as well.",o="莫乌德要你去收集10块源血碎片，但是你最好不要进入石柱中的洞穴。\n\n如果你弄丢了莫乌德的皮球，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Moodle wants you to collect 10 Lifeblood Shards, but stay away from the cave inside of the pillar itself.\n\nIf you lose Moodle's Stress Ball, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="苔行鳄鱼人都是好人……他们不该碰上这样的事情。",pEN="The Mosswalkers were good people... they did not deserve this.",c="我们要以碎片来改变现状也许晚了一点，然而我们的选择实在不多。",cEN="We might be too late for the shards to make a difference, but our options are somewhat limited."}
Q[12580]={d="说不定苔行村中还有幸存者……我们不能眼睁睁地看着他们都沦为亡魂。\n\n我们要揪出这场惨剧的主谋，替他们报仇，顺便看看还有没有幸存者。",dEN="There's some small chance that the Mosswalkers are not all dead yet... and at the very least, they deserve to not be butchered like this.\n\nLet's find some revenge for this slaughter and see if there are any to be saved in the process.",o="莫乌德要你转至苔行村搭救6名苔行村受害者。也许有些鳄鱼人已经命在旦夕，难以挽救了。\n\n如果你弄丢了莫乌德的皮球，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Moodle wants you to rescue 6 of the Mosswalker Victims in Mosswalker Village, though some of them may no longer be alive to save.\n\nIf you lose Moodle's Stress Ball, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="我真希望我早一点知道柱子和石头之间的联系……也许我就能预防这一切。",pEN="I wish I had known how key the pillars and the stones were much earlier... perhaps I could have prevented this.",c="我很高兴我们幸运地救到了几个苔行鳄鱼人。他们会平安的回到雨声树屋的。",cEN="I'm very glad there were some to be saved... with luck, they'll make it back to Rainspeaker Canopy safely."}
Q[12581]={d="或许水晶真的可以逐渐恢复抵御亡灵的能力，但有件事还是要我们尽快去处理的。\n\n只有除掉这群亡灵的首领，才能确保我们不会再受侵害。如果我没猜错的话，他应该躲在倒塌的大石柱中……很可能就在崩裂碎片一带。\n\n那附近留有尸体拖拽过的痕迹，足以暗示他的行踪。\n\n我要去供奉水晶碎片，然后向索乌塞汇报消息……所以亡灵首领就交给你对付了，不过你可能需要朋友的帮助。",dEN="Perhaps the crystals will ward off the undead gradually, but there is one more thing that must be done.\n\nWe need to find the leader of these undead and kill him to ensure there's no one to push the wretches back upon us. If my suspicions are correct, he will be somewhere inside the fallen pillar... the Sundered Shard.\n\nThe corpses being dragged there would suggest as much anyway.\n\nI'll place the shards and bring the news to Soo-say... you will need to find other help in the meantime.",o="杀死残忍的阿图里斯。\n\n莫乌德不能陪你执行这项任务，因此你最好召集其它伙伴帮忙。",oEN="Kill Artruis the Heartless.\n\nWhile securing the aid of friends is highly recommended, Moodle will not be able to accompany you on this task.",p="<护命匣掉落在阿图里斯的尸体旁边。>",pEN="<The phylactery rests ominously on the ground next to Artruis's dead form.>",c="<阿图里斯的护命匣里面看起来像是一团无尽的虚空……你觉得你听见了里面远远传来了尖叫声。>\n\n<在你即将离开的时候，你看到一个物体漂浮在虚空中，就在你伸手可触的地方。>",cEN="<Inside Artruis's Phylactery you see what seems like an endless void... and you think you hear screaming in the distance from somewhere inside.>\n\n<As you're about to leave, you see an object floating in the void, just barely in reach.>"}
Q[12582]={c="我知道你不像其它人说的一样是个叛徒。我们一起打过猎……我比他们都了解你。谢谢你救了我。\n\n听起来可能很好笑……我虽然不喜欢大舌头……但看着大舌头那样死去我也觉得有点难过……公平的战斗要好的多。\n\n你想再次跟狂心氏族当好朋友？我想我可以说服他们说你救了我，而且狠狠的打了大舌头。不过我可不想让你把我搞得很愚蠢似的，所以你确定不跟大舌头当朋友了吗？",cEN="I know you weren't traitor thing like others said. We hunt together... I know you better than all of them. Thank you for saving me.\n\nMay sound funny... I not a big fan of big-tongues... but even I feel little bad for big-tongue dying like that though... fair fight much better... they fight good enough they deserve fair fight.\n\nYou want to be friends with Frenzyheart again? I think I can convince them that you save me and got the big-tongues good. I no want you to make me look dumb though, so you sure?"}
Q[12583]={d="我听说有一台药剂喷射器坠毁在西边的达克索塔一带。\n\n你为什么不去试试，看能不能找到它？我可以使用这台喷射器的零件制造一件设备，击落其它的喷射器！",dEN="I know that one of those plague sprayers crashed somewhere within Drak'Sotra to the west of us.\n\nWhy don't you see if you can find it. I can use the parts from the sprayer to create the device that's going to bring those things down!",o="达克索塔的专家考格维尔要求你去收集药剂喷射器零件。",oEN="Specialist Cogwheel at Drak'Sotra has asked you to collect Plague Sprayer Parts.",p="你拿到零件了吗？嗯？拿到没？",pEN="Do you have the parts? Huh? Do you?",c="<你把零件拿给专家看的时候他退后了一点。>\n\n呃，这些东西还真恶心！\n\n好吧，好吧，把东西交给我，我来看看我能做些什么。也许我该叫你先拿去找牧师净化一下再拿来的。",cEN="<The specialist steps back a bit when presented with the parts.>\n\nEw, those things are totally gross!\n\nOkay, okay, hand them over and I'll see what I can do. I probably should have had you take them to a priest first for purification."}
Q[12584]={d="情报指出，被巨魔击坠在东南方的浮空城科尔拉玛斯里面有大量的萨隆邪铁矿石。\n\n我的斥候告诉我，很多矿石就散落在那座要塞的内部。\n\n银色前沿的伊崔格和他的朋友希望能弄到一些萨隆邪铁，以便对它进行研究。\n\n我希望你去跑一趟，看看能否收集到足够多的样本。",dEN="We know that Kolramas, the crashed necropolis to the southeast, was carrying a large amount of an ore known as saronite when the trolls shot it down.\n\nMy scouts tell me that much of the saronite is strewn about within the innards of that thing.\n\nEitrigg and his friends back at The Argent Stand want a bunch of the stuff so that they can study it.\n\nI want you to head in there and see if you can collect enough for them.",o="鲁伯特上尉要求你收集10份大块的萨隆邪铁，并将它们交给银色前沿的伊崔格。",oEN="Captain Rupert has asked you to collect 10 Chunks of Saronite and deliver them to Eitrigg at The Argent Stand.",p="¿Sí, <class>?\n\nPor favor, dime que tienes el saronita que le pedimos al Capitán Rupert que consiguiera.",pEN="Yes, <class>?\n\nPlease tell me that you have the saronite that we requested Captain Rupert to acquire?",c="你没感觉到这东西的纯粹邪恶吗？\n\n我们得利用手头上的专家和魔法，然后结合圣光的力量，才能穿透这缠绕着污秽矿石的邪恶帷幕。我们得确定它的来源。\n\n快，把萨隆邪铁矿石交给我！",cEN="Can you not feel the pure evil of the stuff?\n\nWe must use the expertise and magics at our disposal, combined with the power of the Holy Light, to pierce the veil of iniquity surrounding this tainted ore. We must determine its origins.\n\nQuickly, hand the saronite to me!"}
Q[12585]={d="好吧，这事可能不怎么有趣，但总要有人去做。\n\n我的部队已经在没膝的死水里连续激战数天了。这样对身体可不好。\n\n他们需要的一堆温暖的篝火，不但能把他们自己烤干，还可以鼓舞士气。\n\n这座城市整天都湿漉漉的，但这些荆木树的枯根却有抗潮的能力。\n\n请帮我们收集一些点火的燃料来，我们会非常感谢你的。",dEN="Well, it ain't glamorous, but it needs doin'.\n\nMy troops have been fightin' their hearts out while knee-deep in stagnant water for days on end. That just can't be good fer ya.\n\nWhat they need is a nice fire to dry 'em out and lighten their spirits.\n\nThis part of the city's soaked, but the dead roots of these thornwood trees have a way of resistin' the moisture.\n\nRound us up some fuel for burnin' and we'll be mighty grateful.",o="达克迦尔的格隆迪尔上尉要你为他收集20份枯死的荆木。",oEN="Captain Grondel at Drak'Agal wants you to bring him 20 pieces of Dead Thornwood.",p="¿Ya tienes madera para una hoguera, <race>?",pEN="Ya got the wood fer a fire, <race>?",c="Muy amable de tu parte, <name>. Muy amable, de verdad.\n\nAhora encontrarás al Cap'n Arnath justo al oeste de aquí, tras la colina.",cEN="Mighty kind of ya, <name>. Mighty kind indeed.\n\nNow you'll be findin' Cap'n Arnath due west o' here, just over the rise."}
Q[12587]={d="拔出你的武器，$r。巡逻的时候到了！\n\n我们要拼死保住手中的四座岗哨，这对我们取得胜利有着关键性的意义。我要你去逐一巡查这几处岗哨，并向他们提供帮助。\n\n你可以从东南方的布兰顿上尉那里开始。等你完成他指派的任务后，他就会指引你去下一座岗哨。\n\n巡查完所有四座岗哨后再回来向我复命。记住——你回来得越快，报酬就越丰厚！所以给我动作麻利一点！\n\n解散！",dEN="Unsheathe that weapon, <race>. It's time to go on patrol!\n\nI've got four posts under my command and it's crucial to our success that they remain in our control. I'm ordering you to visit each of them and offer your assistance.\n\nYou can begin with Captain Brandon southeast of here. He'll direct you to the next post when he's finished with you.\n\nReport back to me once you've assisted each of my men. And remember, you'll be more richly rewarded for returning to me quickly - so double-time it!\n\nDismissed!",o="El comandante Kunz de El Confín Argenta quiere que visites los cuatro puestos de la Cruzada Argenta, cumplas las órdenes de sus capitanes y vuelvas para informarle.\n\nEl capitán Brandon y el capitán Rupert están apostados en Drak'Sotra, el capitán Grondel está apostado en Drak'Agal y el alquimista Finklestein está apostado en Heb'Valok.",oEN="Commander Kunz at the Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their captain's orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Captain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, and Alchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'valok.",p="¿Qué noticias hay de nuestros puestos, <race>?",pEN="What news from our posts, <race>?",c="Bueno, <name>, al menos has vuelto entero. Supongo que eso vale algo...",cEN="Well, <name>, at least you've made it back in one piece. I suppose that's worth something...."}
Q[12588]={d="我们的一个士兵在上次进攻时发现了一张古老的藏宝图。如果这玩意是真的，那么在这附近应该埋藏着极其珍贵的巨魔圣物。\n\n我的部队正在达卡莱巨魔和天灾军团的夹击下忙得不可开交，所以只好派你去把这事情查清楚。\n\n拿上这把铲子，在西南面的松土堆上挖挖看，在你完成了一次认真的调查之后回来向我报告。",dEN="One of our troops came across an old treasure map during our last offensive. If what it shows is true, then there are priceless troll artifacts nearby.\n\nMy soldiers have their hands full, pressed between the Drakkari and the Scourge. I need you to follow up on this intelligence.\n\nTake this shovel and use it at the loose dirt mounds to the southwest. Return to me after a diligent search has been conducted.",o="达克索塔的布兰顿上尉希望你转至附近的上古土堆附近，使用钢铲寻找上古达卡莱圣物。",oEN="Captain Brandon in Drak'Sotra wants you to use the Steel Spade on the nearby Ancient Dirt Mounds to recover the Ancient Drakkari Relic.",c="Gracias por investigar esto por mí, <name>. Mencionaré tu servicio en mi informe.\n\nProbablemente querrás visitar al Capitán Rupert después. Está apostado en la muralla al este de aquí.",cEN="Thank you for looking into this for me, <name>. I'll make mention of your service in my report.\n\nYou'll likely want to visit Captain Rupert next. He's stationed at the wall due east of here."}
Q[12589]={d="¿Crees que sabes disparar?\n\nBueno, vamos a verlo. Toma, empezaremos con algo sencillo y suave. No te preocupes, no tiene retroceso alguno. Recuerda, no apuntes a nada si no piensas disparar.\n\nBueno, cuando estés $glisto:lista;, apunta a esa manzana encima de la cabeza de Suertudo Wilhelm ¡y aprieta el gatillo!",dEN="So you think you can shoot?\n\nWell, let's give it a try. Here, we'll start you out with something nice and gentle. Don't worry, it's got no kick to it at all. Remember, don't point that gun at anything you don't intend to fire at.\n\nNow, when you're ready, just take aim at that apple on top o' old Lucky Wilhelm's head and let 'er fly!",o="使用RJR步枪击中幸运的威尔海姆头顶的苹果，然后与德洛斯坦谈一谈。",oEN="Using the RJR Rifle, shoot the apple on top of Lucky Wilhelm's head, then speak with Drostan.",p="结果满意吗？",pEN="Satisfied with the results?",c="你不是个菜鸡射手，不过你还得多练习才能进步。你想要来赌一把吗？",cEN="You're not a bad shot, but you'll get better with practice. How would you like to make a little wager?"}
Q[12591]={d="真聪明啊……\n\n就在我们自以为已经控制了局面的时候，他们悄悄地在我们脚下挖出隧道，占领了圣殿！\n\n现在我们被两支蛛魔部队夹在中间，而且情况还在迅速恶化。\n\n我们的第一步行动是阻止他们的增援，封闭他们的隧道。\n\n拿着这些手雷，把它们扔到西北方的蛛魔隧道里去。",dEN="Clever...\n\nJust when it seemed we were getting things under control, they tunneled right underneath us and secured the shrine!\n\nNow we're caught between two nethurbian armies and our predicament is worsening by the minute.\n\nAs our first course of action, we must stop them from reinforcing. Their tunnels must be sealed.\n\nTake these grenades and throw them down their craters to the northwest.",o="达克索塔的鲁伯特上尉希望你在5个蛛魔隧道附近使用高能冲击手雷。",oEN="Captain Rupert at Drak'Sotra wants you to use High Impact Grenades near 5 Nethurbian Craters.",c="No hemos salido del todo de problemas, pero tus esfuerzos han ayudado a ralentizar al enemigo.\n\nEs probable que el Capitán Grondel, allá en Drak'Agal, necesite tu ayuda.\n\nAdiós, <name>.",cEN="We're not out of the woods by any means, but your efforts have helped to slow the enemy down.\n\nCaptain Grondel up in Drak'Agal will likely have need of you.\n\nFarewell, <name>."}
Q[12592]={d="Parece que tienes cierto instinto de $gcazador:cazadora;. No tienes mala puntería, y Hemet no te ha echado, así que debe estar planeando incluirte en la cacería.\n\n¿Qué te parecería una competición entre tú y yo?\n\nHemet y los demás te pedirán ayuda en la cacería. Los dos contaremos las piezas que nos cobramos para contribuir a sus metas. Eso sí, esto no es algo que se pueda ganar en un santiamén, y tendrás que matar muchos tipos de criaturas. ¡Buena suerte!",dEN="So y'have something of a hunter's instinct. You're not a bad shot, and Hemet hasn't driven you out, so he must be planning on including you in the hunt.\n\nHow'd you like to have a bit of a competition, just me and you?\n\nHemet and the others will ask you to help in their hunting. Along the way, you and I will count up the kills we contribute to their goals. Now, this isn't something you can win in the blink of an eye, and you'll find yourself killing many different kinds of creatures. Good luck!",o="在协助赫米特和探险队其它成员狩猎的过程中，杀死60只猎物。在你达成60个的击杀目标后，回到奈辛瓦里营地，与德洛斯坦比较猎物数量。",oEN="Kill 60 Game Animals while you aid Hemet and his companions in their hunting. When you've killed your 60, return to Drostan at the Nesingwary Base Camp to compare numbers.",p="要来算一算吗？",pEN="Care to count 'em up?",c="¿Así que ya has venido a rendirte?\n\n<A Drostan se le desencaja la mandíbula cuando le dices que ya has realizado todas tus bajas.>\n\n¡No puede ser! ¿Cómo demonios has hecho eso en Azeroth? Yo acabo de hacer mi 58ª. ¡Estaba tan cerca!\n\nPero lo justo es lo justo. Te subestimé, <name>, pero te has ganado esta victoria de forma limpia.",cEN="So, you've come to concede already?\n\n<Drostan's jaw drops as you tell him you've already made all your kills.>\n\nNo way! How in Azeroth did you do that? I just made my 58th. So close!\n\nBut fair's fair. I underestimated you, <name>, but you've earned this victory fair and square."}
Q[12593]={d="我将我拥有的一切——愤怒，力量，意志——全部赐予你，我精心挑选的骑士。我赐予了你生命，使你肩负着为天灾军团创造一个崭新的黑暗时代而战的使命。\n\n凝视我们脚下的这片土地。血色十字军破坏着我所创造的事业，与此同时圣光之愿礼拜堂也在目中无人地对抗我们——这让瘟疫之地上出现了一丝瑕疵。他们必须为这种藐视付出代价。\n\n你将成为我复仇的使者，你所经之处，厄运必然降临。出发吧，去创造你的命运，死亡骑士。",dEN="All that I am: anger, cruelty, vengeance - I bestow upon you, my chosen knight. I have granted you immortality so that you may herald in a new, dark age for the Scourge.\n\nGaze now upon the lands below us. The Scarlet Crusade scurries to undo my work, while Light's Hope stands defiantly against us - a blemish upon these Plaguelands. They must all be shown the price of their defiance.\n\nYou will become my force of retribution. Where you tread, doom will follow. Go now and claim your destiny, death knight.",o="Preséntate ante el instructor Razuvious en El Corazón de Acherus.|n",oEN="Report to Instructor Razuvious in the Heart of Acherus.",c="你听见了巫妖王的召唤，死亡骑士。现在正是你响应你主人的时刻。",cEN="You have heard the call of the Lich King, death knight. Now is the time to answer your master."}
Q[12594]={d="遍地都是我们的岗哨，他们却偏偏把我派到了这里。\n\n这里到处流淌着腐臭的死水，污秽的元素生物还以此为家！\n\n我不知道它们到底是什么东西，又为什么来到这里，而且老实说我也不在乎。我只知道它们把我的辖区搅得一团糟！这些肮脏的家伙整天在附近游来荡去，让我怎么开展军事行动？\n\n你现在就到外面去，$c，到我的辖区去清理掉一些元素生物！",dEN="Of all the posts, they throw me in this one.\n\nThe place is flooded with putrid, stagnant water and now it's host to sewage elementals!\n\nI don't really know what they are or why they're here, and frankly I couldn't care less. What I do know is they're making a mess of my sector! How am I supposed to conduct any dignified military operations with those foul things roaming around?\n\nGet out there, <class>, and don't come back 'til you've cleared your share of 'em off of my battlefield!",o="格隆迪尔上尉要你转至达克迦尔，消灭7只青苔狂暴者。",oEN="Captain Grondel wants you to kill 7 Mossy Rampagers in Drak'Agal.",c="¿Estás seguro de eso, <race>?\n\n¡A mí me parece que hay más de esas cosas ahí fuera ahora que cuando empezaste!",cEN="You sure about that, <race>?\n\nSeems to me like there are more of them things out there now than when you started!"}
Q[12595]={d="Bueno, $n, has demostrado tu valía como $gcazador:cazadora; de toda clase de animales: rinocerontes, felinos y crocoliscos. Para algunos miembros de la expedición, esas criaturas bastan para poner a prueba sus habilidades de caza, pero otros, como yo, buscan desafíos mayores.\n\nDorian Asoladracos ha ido al norte, más allá del lago Olamarga, y ha establecido allí un campamento. Ha oído rumores de dracos primordiales gigantescos. ¡Imagina qué presas serían! Ve a hablar con Dorian a ver si ha tenido suerte.",dEN="Well, <name>, you've certainly proven your mettle as a hunter of all kinds of game animals -- rhinos, cats, and crocolisks. For some members of the expedition, these creatures are sufficient to test their hunting skills, but others, like myself, crave larger challenges.\n\nDorian Drakestalker went north, across Bittertide Lake and established a camp there. He's heard rumors of gigantic primordial drakes. Just imagine what a quarry they would be! Go check up on Dorian and see if he's had any luck.",o="与索拉查盆地中多里安营地的多里安·达克斯托谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost in Sholazar Basin.",c="所以老赫米特总算没把我给忘了。我猜他是打算等我把所有困难的工作都完成之后，再来参加这场狩猎。别担心，这里还有一大堆飞龙四处游荡。赫米特会得到他想要的。",cEN="So old Hemet didn't forget about me, after all. I suppose he's going to want to participate in the hunt once we've done all the hard work. Don't worry, there are plenty of drakes to go around. Hemet will get his wish."}
Q[12596]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a El Confín Argenta, recluta. Soy el comandante Kunz, pero tú... tú puedes llamarme... comandante.\n\nNo creas que vas a pasearte por mi región eligiendo en qué misiones vas a participar, sin rendir cuentas a nadie.\n\nAquí me rindes cuentas a mí y obedeces mis órdenes al pie de la letra. ¡¿Entendido?!\n\nPrimero vas a familiarizarte con mis hombres y con la región que nos han encargado despejar.\n\nPreséntate ante cada uno de ellos y haz lo que te pidan. Vuelve a mí cuando hayas terminado tu patrulla.",dEN="Welcome to The Argent Stand, scrub. I am Commander Kunz, but you - you can call me... Commander.\n\nDon't think you're going to just cruise through my region, picking which missions you're going to participate in, answering to no one.\n\nHere, you report to me and you follow my orders to the letter. Understood?!\n\nFirst, you're going to get familiar with my men and the region we're charged with clearing.\n\nReport to each of them and do as they ask. Return to me when your patrol is done.",o="银色前沿的指挥官库恩斯要你拜访四座银色北伐军的岗哨，并完成那里的上尉交给你的任务，然后回去向他复命。\n\n布兰顿上尉和鲁伯特上尉驻扎在东南面的达克索塔。\n\n格隆迪尔上尉驻扎在正东边的达克迦尔。\n\n炼金师菲肯斯坦驻扎在北边的赫布瓦罗。",oEN="Commander Kunz at The Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their leaders' orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Southeast of here.\n\nCaptain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, due east.\n\nAlchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'Valok, to the north.",p="¿Te has reunido con cada uno de mis capitanes, <race>?",pEN="Have you met with each of my captains, <race>?",c="¡Ya era hora de que trajeras tu cadáver de vuelta aquí! Pensábamos que la Plaga te había llevado, no es que hubiera sido una gran pérdida...\n\nSi vas a seguir sirviendo a la Cruzada, será mejor que hagas una demostración más impresionante.\n\n¡Toma nota, <race>! Tus futuras patrullas serán recompensadas en función de tu puntualidad.\n\nQuedas libre.",cEN="It's about time you got your carcass back here! Thought we'd lost ya to the Scourge - not that it would've been a great loss....\n\nIf you're going to continue to serve the Crusade, you'd best make a more impressive showing.\n\nTake note, <race>! Your future patrols will be rewarded based on your timeliness.\n\nDismissed."}
Q[12597]={d="我的弟兄们虽然坚韧勇猛，但他们毕竟是血肉之躯。\n\n受伤和疼痛削弱了他们完成任务的能力，没有什么训练或者诀窍可以改变这一点。\n\n值得欣慰的是，我们的炼金师发明了一种药膏，与我们的绷带一起使用的话，可以大大缓解士兵的疼痛。\n\n药膏需要用到一种特殊的罂粟，正好这里的巨魔在西边的达克索塔农田中种了不少。去采一些罂粟回来，以保证我们的库存充足。",dEN="Gritty as my men are, they're still mortal.\n\nWounds and pain diminish their ability to perform their missions. No amount of training changes that simple fact of life.\n\nThankfully, one of our alchemists has developed a recipe for a salve that binds to our bandages and greatly reduces the pain our soldiers experience.\n\nThe salve requires a special poppy these trolls cultivate just west of here. Go to Drak'Sotra Fields and harvest some of them to keep our stockpiles from running out.",o="达克索塔的布兰顿上尉希望你从达克索塔农田采集5份成熟的水罂粟。",oEN="Captain Brandon at Drak'Sotra wants you to collect 5 Mature Water-Poppies from Drak'Sotra Fields.",p="¿Has recogido las amapolas de agua, <name>?",pEN="Have you collected the water-poppies, <name>?",c="Buenos especímenes, <name>.\n\nEn nombre de mis soldados, te agradezco tus esfuerzos de hoy.\n\nEs probable que el capitán Rupert sea la siguiente parada de tu patrulla. Está apostado en la muralla justo al este de aquí.",cEN="Fine specimens, <name>.\n\nOn behalf of my soldiers, I thank you for your efforts today.\n\nCaptain Rupert is likely the next stop on your patrol. He's stationed at the wall just east of here."}
Q[12598]={d="真聪明啊……\n\n就在我们自以为已经控制了局面的时候，他们悄悄地在我们脚下挖出隧道，占领了圣殿！\n\n现在我们被两支蛛魔部队夹在中间，而且情况还在迅速恶化。\n\n我们的第一步行动是阻止他们的增援，封闭他们的隧道。\n\n拿着这些手雷，把它们扔到西北方的蛛魔隧道里去。",dEN="Clever...\n\nJust when it seemed we were getting things under control, they tunneled right underneath us and secured the shrine!\n\nNow we're caught between two Nerubian armies and our predicament is worsening by the minute.\n\nAs our first course of action, we must stop them from reinforcing. Their tunnels must be sealed.\n\nTake these grenades and throw them down their craters to the northwest.",o="达克索塔的鲁伯特上尉希望你在5个蛛魔隧道附近使用高能冲击手雷。",oEN="Captain Rupert at Drak'Sotra wants you to use High Impact Grenades near 5 Nerubian Craters.",p="¿Has sellado los túneles nerubianos, <name>?",pEN="Have you sealed the nerubian tunnels, <name>?",c="No hemos salido del todo de problemas, pero tus esfuerzos han ayudado a ralentizar al enemigo.\n\nEs probable que el Capitán Grondel, allá en Drak'Agal, necesite tu ayuda.\n\nAdiós, <name>.",cEN="We're not out of the woods by any means, but your efforts have helped to slow the enemy down.\n\nCaptain Grondel up in Drak'Agal will likely have need of you.\n\nFarewell, <name>."}
Q[12599]={d="好吧，这事可能不怎么有趣，但总要有人去做。\n\n我的部队已经在没膝的死水里连续激战数天了。这样对身体可不好。\n\n他们需要的一堆温暖的篝火，不但能把他们自己烤干，还可以鼓舞士气。\n\n这座城市整天都湿漉漉的，但这些荆木树的枯根却有抗潮的能力。\n\n请帮我们收集一些点火的燃料来，我们会非常感谢你的。",dEN="Well, it ain't glamorous, but it needs doin'.\n\nMy troops have been fightin' their hearts out while knee-deep in stagnant water for days on end. That just can't be good fer ya.\n\nWhat they need is a nice fire to dry 'em out and lighten their spirits.\n\nThis part of the city's soaked, but the dead roots of these thornwood trees have a way of resistin' the moisture.\n\nRound us up some fuel for burnin' and we'll be mighty grateful.",o="达克迦尔的格隆迪尔上尉要你为他收集20份枯死的荆木。",oEN="Captain Grondel at Drak'Agal wants you to bring him 20 pieces of Dead Thornwood.",p="¿Ya tienes madera para una hoguera, <race>?",pEN="Ya got the wood fer a fire, <race>?",c="Muy amable de tu parte, <name>. Muy amable, de verdad.\n\nAhora encontrarás al viejo Finklestein justo al oeste de aquí, tras la colina.",cEN="Mighty kind of ya, <name>. Mighty kind indeed.\n\nNow you'll be findin' ol' Finklestein due west o' here, just over the rise."}
Q[12603]={d="始生龙占据了北边和东边的大片本地，我甚至在这么远的距离都能感受到它们喷吐出的灼热气息。在挑战最强大的始祖龙之前，我们最好拿族群中较弱的成员来试试手。\n\n即便如此，你也不能放松警惕，毕竟它们可以轻易地吞噬你的躯体。等你熟练掌握与始祖龙搏斗的技巧后，再回来找我吧，我会指示你下一步该怎么做。",dEN="The primordial drakes occupy most of the area to the north and east, and I can feel the heat of their breath even at this distance. Before we can challenge the mightiest among the drakes, we must test our skills against the lesser creatures.\n\nStill, don't let your guard down; any one of these beasts can devour a man whole. Once you've familiarized yourself with the combat tactics of these drakes, return and I will tell you our next step.",o="杀死6只始生幼龙，然后与多里安哨站的多里安·达克斯托克谈一谈。",oEN="Kill 6 Primordial Drakes and then speak with Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你测试了你的技巧吗？",pEN="Have you tested your skills?",c="我可以听出你言语中的自信。很好，这些经验将有助于我们对付母龙斯利维娜。",cEN="I can hear the confidence in your words. Good, the experience will come in handy when we face the queen of the drakes."}
Q[12604]={c="Has hecho un tiempo excelente en esa patrulla. Al parecer, después de todo, podrías sernos útil.\n\nTal como prometí, aquí tienes un pequeño extra por tus esfuerzos.\n\nSigue así, <name>.\n\nRetirado.",cEN="You made excellent time on that patrol. It appears that you may be of use to us after all.\n\nAs promised, here's a little something extra for your efforts.\n\nKeep up the good work, <name>.\n\nDismissed."}
Q[12605]={d="我觉得吧，像傻瓜一样手舞足蹈是不可能吸引母龙斯利维娜的注意的。我们应该耍个花招，尽快诱使她与我们作战。这样的话，我们还能为后期计划积攒一些……呃……资源。\n\n<多里安瞥了苏特菲兹一眼。>\n\n暂且不用考虑那么远啦。去营地东边和东北边寻找始生龙卵吧。我要你敲碎蛋壳，把幼龙掳走！等母龙察觉情况有异时，肯定会怒气冲冲地向我们开战。",dEN="We're not likely to get Broodmother Slivina's attention waving our arms around like fools, but if we're smart, we can bait her into fighting us. We'll also secure more, uh, fodder for my little project.\n\n<Dorian glances over at Zootfizzle.>\n\nBut don't worry about that for now. Just look for the primordial drake eggs in the area east and northeast of the camp. Burst them open and scoop up the hatchlings that come out. When the broodmother realizes what we've done, she'll have no choice but to face us.",o="将6只始生龙幼崽交给多里安哨站的多里安·达克斯托克。",oEN="Bring 6 Primordial Hatchlings to Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你弄到用来引诱母龙的饵了吗？",pEN="Have you secured the bait we'll need to get the broodmother's attention?",c="喔，干得好。拿一些龙崽给苏特菲兹！",cEN="Ah, well done. Plenty of little hatchlings for Zootfizzle over there!"}
Q[12606]={d="既然那些隧道已经被封闭了，我们接下来就要关注那些落入敌人手里的同伴。\n\n幸运的是，我们的一些士兵还活着，只是被困在蛛魔的茧子里，情况还不算很糟糕。\n\n去把他们救出来，$c，不然就来不及了！",dEN="Now that the tunnels have been sealed, our next concern is recovering those who have fallen to the enemy.\n\nWith any luck, several of our soldiers are still alive and relatively well inside the nerubian cocoons.\n\nFree them, <class>, while you still can!",o="鲁伯特上尉要你打开达克索塔的蛛魔之茧，释放3个被俘虏的步兵，然后回去向他复命。",oEN="Captain Rupert wants you to open the Nerubian Cocoons in Drak'Sotra and return to him once you have freed 3 Captive Footmen.",p="你把我们的士兵从蛛魔虫族的魔爪中解救出来了吗？",pEN="Have you freed our soldiers from the clutches of the nerubians?",c="Estos nerubianos han pasado una factura alta, <class>.\n\nNo obstante, estoy agradecido por tus esfuerzos.",cEN="These nerubians have taken a heavy toll, <class>.\n\nNevertheless, I am grateful for your efforts."}
Q[12607]={d="在你前去挑战母龙斯利维娜之前，我必须指出，多里安认为你和赫米特最好能骑上猛犸象作战。\n\n营地周围到处都是裂牙猛犸，你只需用这条缰绳套住一头猛犸象的脖子就行啦。我可提醒你，别打公象的主意，它们的性情异常狂野，难以驯服。所以你要挑选一头合适的猛犸象，并将它带回营地。",dEN="Before you go off challenging Broodmother Slivina, Dorian thought it might be a good idea for you and Hemet to coordinate your efforts by riding into battle on the back of a mammoth.\n\nThe area around the camp is full of them. Just take this bridle and skip it over the head of a shattertusk mammoth. Be careful of the bulls, though. They won't tolerate the harness at all. Bring the mammoth back here when you've found a suitable one.",o="将一头裂牙猛犸交给多里安哨站的苏特菲兹。",oEN="Bring a Shattertusk Mammoth to Zootfizzle at Dorian's Outpost.",p="事情都办好了吗？",pEN="Everything taken care of?",c="太完美了！现在，现在我们只要给赫米特找个梯子……",cEN="Perfect! Now, all we need to do is get Hemet a stepladder..."}
Q[12608]={d="<弗蕾亚的推断没错。若不是源血之柱倒塌，亡灵根本不能踏足索拉查盆地——因此，天灾军团派出了诅咒教派的信徒来搞破坏。>\n\n<你最好立即向弗蕾亚的化身汇报，说盆地内有巫妖王的信徒出没。>",dEN="<It appears the Avatar of Freya was right. The undead were not able to enter Sholazar Basin before the Lifeblood Pillar was brought down -- they used their living agents from the Cult of the Damned instead.>\n\n<You'd best warn her about the Lich King's living agents within Sholazar Basin.>",o="转至雨声河，与弗蕾亚的化身谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to the Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids.",c="¿Los vivos... sirven voluntariamente al Rey Liche?\n\nTodo este tiempo he estado buscando al enemigo equivocado, <race>. Démonos prisa y arranquemos a estos cultistas de estas tierras.",cEN="The living... willingly serve the Lich King?\n\nAll this time I've been searching for the wrong enemy, <race>. Let us make haste and uproot these cultists from these lands."}
Q[12609]={d="听着，$c。我知道这个要求有点高……\n\n新鲜的蜘蛛腐液多少有些难找，即使是在这个遍地蜘蛛的地区也是如此。但菲肯斯坦说他至少需要二十份，而且要尽快拿到。\n\n我会让我的士兵继续到野外去收集材料，但他们还需要一些帮助才能赶上炼金师规定的时间。\n\n当你在祖达克的野外冒险时，请留意那些暗门爬行者，把你能找到的所有腐液都拿回来给我。",dEN="Listen, <class>. I realize that it's a lot to ask....\n\nFresh spider ichor is somewhat hard to come by, even in these heavily infested regions. But Finklestein said he'd settle for no less than a vat of it, and that he needs it soon.\n\nI'll keep my men out in the field collecting reagents, but if the alchemist's order is going to be filled in time, they'll require some assistance.\n\nAs you roam the fields of Zul'Drak, keep your eyes peeled for trapdoor crawlers and bring me all of the ichor you can find.",o="赫布瓦罗的阿纳斯上尉要你从祖达克的暗门爬行者身上收集7份新鲜的蜘蛛腐液。",oEN="Captain Arnath in Heb'Valok asked you to collect 7 units of Fresh Spider Ichor from the Trapdoor Crawlers in Zul'Drak.",p="¿Has recogido los reactivos que necesito, <class>?",pEN="Have you collected the reagents I need, <class>?",c="Estas parecen ser muestras excelentes, <name>.\n\nGracias por tu ayuda.",cEN="These look to be excellent samples, <name>.\n\nThank you for your assistance."}
Q[12610]={d="自从菲肯斯坦来了以后，我已经沦为专门为他的实验和配方收集各种材料的下手了。\n\n我会遵守参军时的誓言，无条件执行一切命令。但我毕竟是个老兵，参加过许多战斗。我更愿意上前线去，直接为北伐军做贡献。\n\n帮帮我，$r。为我收集一些蝙蝠翅膀来，这样或许我很快就能回到真正的战斗中去了。",dEN="Ever since Finklestein's arrival, I've been relegated to collecting various ingredients for his experiments and recipes.\n\nI'll follow my orders as I've vowed to do, but I'm a seasoned veteran. I've taken part in dozens of conflicts. I'd much rather be on the front lines, having a more direct impact on the Crusade's outcome here.\n\nHelp me, <race>. Collect some bat wings for me so that I might get back to the real action sooner.",o="赫布瓦罗的阿纳斯上尉要你从祖达克蝙蝠身上收集7对完美的蝙蝠翅膀。",oEN="Captain Arnath in Heb'Valok has asked you to collect 7 Unblemished Bat Wings from Zul'Drak Bats.",p="你替菲肯斯坦收集完那些蝙蝠翅膀没？",pEN="Have you finished collecting those bat wings for Finklestein?",c="Excelente trabajo, <name>.\n\nTe agradezco tu ayuda.",cEN="Excellent work, <name>.\n\nI thank you for your assistance."}
Q[12611]={d="生命的源力在这片土地上涌动，巫妖王手下那些愚蠢的走狗却胆敢贸然入侵。他们造成的所有伤害，我都要七倍地奉还。\n\n指挥天灾军团腐蚀大地的罪魁祸首就是沙格兰·凋零使者，你可以在此地以北找到他。带上这个结界，使用它反射沙格兰的死亡能量。让天灾军团见识一下生命之力的伟大吧。",dEN="The agents of the Lich King have foolishly trespassed upon these lands where the power of life rules supreme. All harm they inflict will be returned to them sevenfold.\n\nThe monster directly responsible for corrupting the land is known as Thalgran Blightbringer; you will find him just to the north of here. Take this ward and use it to reflect the power of death upon him. Show the Scourge that the power of life prevails above all.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要你使用弗蕾亚的结界将沙格兰·凋零使者的死亡之箭以7倍伤害返还，以此击败他。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you defeat Thalgran Blightbringer by using Freya's Ward to reflect his Deathbolts back to him sevenfold.",p="¿Está terminado, <name>?",pEN="Is it done, <name>?",c="Sigues demostrando tu valía, <name>. Quizá me apresuré al juzgarte.\n\nHabía asumido que estabas aquí con los cazarras furtivos que quedaron varados recientemente en mis tierras, pero tal vez estés listo para dejar eso atrás.",cEN="You continue to prove yourself, <name>. Perhaps I was too quick to judge you.\n\nI had assumed you were here with the poachers who were recently stranded in my lands, but perhaps you're ready to put that behind you."}
Q[12612]={d="上古时代，泰坦在这里塑造出所有的生命体，并培育万物茁壮成长。\n\n环绕索拉查盆地的五根擎天水晶柱散发着持久的生命之力，使得天灾军团的势力不能渗透这片土地。但是，有一根柱子突然倒塌了。\n\n我要你转至源血之柱，调查一下到底发生了什么事。亡灵是没可能靠近石柱的，恐怕你需要将注意力放在那些有生命的入侵者身上。倒塌的石柱就在此地的正南方。",dEN="The titans shaped entire life forms here, fostering their unfettered growth.\n\nThe five crystal pillars that surround the basin emanate pure lifeforce. The Scourge should've never been able to penetrate the basin, but one of the pillars was destroyed.\n\nGo to the Lifeblood Pillar and see if you can find out what happened. No undead would've been able to approach the pillar, so keep your eyes out for living intruders. You'll find what remains of the pillar directly south of here.",o="转至源血之柱，寻找石柱倒塌的原因。",oEN="Travel to the Lifeblood Pillar and look for clues to its destruction.",c="<尸体严重地烧毁。附近还散落着一些火药桶的残骸。>",cEN="<The corpse is badly burnt. There appear to be the remains of several powder kegs in the vicinity.>"}
Q[12613]={d="我们不能半途而废，$r。第一道开关已经引导，还需要引导另一道开关才行。\n\n泰坦们在盆地中还有另一处用于监视诸类造物的制高点，就在东部的群山之中。\n\n转至造物者悬台，引导界门开关 - 泰塔，即可打开界门。",dEN="We cannot stop now, <race>. You've triggered the first switch, but one remains.\n\nThe titans constructed a second vantage point where they oversaw their creations. You'll find it to the east, high in the mountains.\n\nPull the activation switch theta inside the overlook and the waygate will open.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要你转至索拉查盆地东部的造物者悬台，引导界门开关 - 泰塔。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you to head to the Maker's Overlook in eastern Sholazar Basin and use the Activation Switch Theta.",c="El portal de vía está activo, <name>. ¡Es hora!",cEN="The waygate is active, <name>. It is time!"}
Q[12614]={d="Es probable que la madre de linaje Slivina sea una iracunda bola de dientes, púas y garras. Acabas de llevarte a sus hijos y eso no le sienta bien a ninguna madre.\n\nEs cierto que salieron de huevos, pero ella ama a esas pequeñas bestias tanto como tu madre te ama a ti.\n\nEstará desesperada y furiosa en igual medida, así es como le gustan los objetivos a Hemet. Él y tú, junto con ese mamut, seréis un rival digno para ella.\n\nElla se encuentra en su nido en el borde norte de El Matorral Silvestre y está sedienta de venganza.",dEN="Broodmother Slivina's likely to be a snarling ball of teeth, spikes, and talons. You've gone and stolen her children away and no mother takes kindly to that.\n\n'Tis true they hatched from eggs, but she loves the little beasts no less than your mother loves you.\n\nShe'll be desperate and fierce in equal measures, everything Hemet loves in a target. You and he, along with that mammoth, should be a match for her.\n\nShe's on her perch at the northern edge of the Savage Thicket and hungers for revenge.",o="杀死母龙斯利维娜，然后向多里安哨站的多里安·达克斯托克复命。",oEN="Kill Broodmother Slivina and return to Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost.",p="嗯，你还活着。你做的怎么样？",pEN="Well, you're alive. How did you fare?",c="嗯，我准备了一整篇的演说，不过那个老家伙有些话想亲自对你说。",cEN="Well, I had a whole speech prepared, but the old man himself has some words he wants to say to you."}
Q[12615]={d="妖术师乌布戈或许曾告诉过你有关如何向祖达克的诸神献上供品的事。希姆埃巴并不是唯一被达卡莱巨魔们所遗忘的神。\n\n我们逃到了这里，在繁荣之母希姆托加的身边寻求庇佑。与希姆埃巴一样，如果你愿意向她献上供品的话，她也将很乐意祝福你。",dEN="Hexxer Ubungo probably told you about making offerings to the gods of Zul'Drak. Zim'Abwa is not the only god that stands forgotten by the Drakkari.\n\nWe have taken refuge within the presence of Zim'Torga, the Mother of Prosperity. As with Zim'Abwa, if you were to give offerings of the Drakkari to her, she is sure to give you her blessing.",o="巫医库弗要求你在希姆托加的雕像前奉上10份达卡莱供品。",oEN="Witch Doctor Khufu wants you to present 10 Drakkari Offerings to the statue of Zim'Torga.",p="<Puedes sentir la mirada de la Madre de la Prosperidad sobre ti. Se pregunta qué hace un <race> como tú plantado ante ella.>",pEN="<You can feel the eyes of the Mother of Prosperity upon you. She is wondering what a <race> such as yourself is doing standing before her.>",c="<希姆托加的思绪渗透进入了你。她感应到你献给她的祭品，并且显得很开心。>\n\n<她告诉你，你将会获得合适的回报。>",cEN="<Zim'Torga's thoughts pervade your own. She senses the offerings you are about give to her and is pleased.>\n\n<She conveys that you will be appropriately rewarded.>"}
Q[12616]={d="Perfecto, un aventurero con experiencia es justo lo que necesitamos.\n\nLos vigilantes de la torre de Medivh del Kirin Tor dicen que algo pasa con Karazhan. Un poder nuevo merodea, pero no responde ni a la magia del Guardián ni a la de la Legión. Por lo que han averiguado, parece ser que se trata de un príncipe elfo llamado Tenris Sangre Penumbra y existen razones para creer que está bajo las órdenes de la Plaga.\n\nVe, $gamigo mío:amiga mía; investiga la cámara de Sangre Penumbra y vuelve con cualquier documento que hayas encontrado.",dEN="Excellent, an experienced adventurer. Precisely what we need.\n\nThere has been talk from the Kirin Tor guarding Medivh's tower that something is amiss with Karazhan. There is a new power lurking within, one that answers neither to the Guardian's magic nor the Legion. From what they've scouted, it appears it is an elven prince called Tenris Mirkblood, and there is reason to believe he serves the Scourge.\n\nGo, my friend, investigate Mirkblood's chamber, and return with any information you might find.",o="银色特使要你进入卡拉赞的仆役宿舍，在特里斯·黯血王子的房间中寻找线索。",oEN="The Argent Dawn Emissary wants you to search the chamber of Tenris Mirkblood within the Servant's Quarters of Karazhan.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you discovered?",c="La información que informas es de verdad funesta si las órdenes que viste son legítimas. Solo podemos esperar que su misión se detuviera lo suficientemente pronto para evitar que el enemigo sepa demasiado sobre nuestras fuerzas.\n\nGracias, <name>. Que permanezcas a salvo en estos tiempos oscuros.",cEN="The information you report is dire indeed if the orders you saw are legitimate. We can only hope that his mission was stopped early enough to prevent the enemy from knowing too much about our strengths.\n\nThank you, <name>. May you remain safe in these dark times."}
Q[12617]={d="我是泰坦之女弗蕾亚的化身之一。作为生命的守护者，我肩负着保卫这片土地的重任，要确保它不被天灾军团染指。\n\n我未曾料到巫妖王竟然派遣生者破坏了水晶柱的防御结界。\n\n虽然我轻易就能捏碎那些教徒，但是我必须留在这里维持结界，阻止天灾军团的势力继续侵入索拉查盆地。去吧，$n。让那些傲慢的入侵者感受到我的愤怒。",dEN="I am an embodiment of but one aspect of Freya, daughter of the titans. I am the Lifewarden -- I was left here to protect this land against the threat of the Scourge.\n\nI never anticipated the Lich King would send willing living servants to do his work.\n\nI could easily crush these cultists myself, but I am all that stands between the undead armies and the rest of the basin. Go, <name>. Deliver my wrath to these insolent trespassers.",o="雨声河的弗蕾亚的化身要求你转至西北方的死亡之手营地，消灭8名诅咒教派入侵者。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids wants you to go to the Death's Hand Encampment to the northwest and slay 8 Cultist Infiltrators.",p="¿Has destruido a los intrusos, <name>?",pEN="Have you destroyed the trespassers, <name>?",c="你所言属实。营地的入侵者已经得到了清楚……但我担心这已经太迟了。",cEN="You speak the truth. The intruders at the camp were dealt with... but I'm afraid it might have been too late."}
Q[12618]={p="<希姆托加冷漠地看着你。她怀疑你是否能贡献更多达卡莱供品来继续获得她的祝福。>",pEN="<Zim'Torga looks on impassively. She wonders if you seek her continued blessings by presenting more Drakkari offerings to honor her.>",c="<希姆托加对你表示赞许。>",cEN="<The Mother of Prosperity beams her approval down upon you.>"}
Q[12619]={d="对于一名死亡骑士来说，最重要的装备无疑就是他的符文之剑。只有通过符文之剑，死亡骑士才能号令冰霜、鲜血与邪恶之力为他战斗。而且，符文之剑也像一尊水瓶一样为死亡骑士存储着他的符文之力。\n\n现在是时候让你去铸造属于自己的第一把符文之剑了。去周围的武器架上找一把破旧的长剑来。找到以后马上拿去符文熔炉旁，将它在熔炉里重新锻造成一把符文之剑。",dEN="The single most important piece of equipment to a death knight is the runeblade. It is through the runeblade that a death knight commands the powers of frost, blood and the unholy. The runeblade also acts as a vessel to store the death knight's runic power.\n\nThe time has come to create your first runeblade. Search the weapon racks on this floor and locate a battle-worn sword. Once found, take the sword to a nearby runeforge and use it to create a runeblade.",o="在黑锋要塞内的武器架上找一把破旧的长剑，并以它为基础，在符文熔炉内锻造出一把符文之剑。\n\n带着你的符文之剑去向黑锋要塞的教官拉苏维奥斯报告。",oEN="Search the weapon racks in Ebon Hold for a Battle-worn Sword and then use it on a runeforge to craft a Runebladed Sword.\n\nReturn the Runebladed Sword to Instructor Razuvious in Ebon Hold.",p="符文之剑是你自身能力的延伸。一个死亡骑士作战时不能没有符文之剑。",pEN="The runeblade is an extension of your being. A death knight cannot battle without a runeblade.",c="干得好，$N。你成功地制造了你第一把的符文之剑。你将会播下混沌与毁灭的种子！你将会在溢满鲜血、布满那些胆敢反抗天灾军团的家伙残尸的战场上苏醒。",cEN="Well done, <name>. You have successfully created your first runebladed weapon. With it you will sow the seeds of chaos and destruction! In your wake will be a bloodied field of battle, littered with the corpses of all that would dare oppose the Scourge."}
Q[12620]={d="$n，我们还是晚了一步。那些肮脏的教徒已经抵达光芒之柱，正在为摧毁这根水晶柱做准备。我可以感觉到空气中涌动的异样。\n\n我们的时间不多了。我要你登上光芒之柱的顶端，吹响这只号角，将我的力量导入水晶。\n\n让这帮渣滓尝尝玷污泰坦造物的后果吧。",dEN="We were not quick enough, <name>. The cultist scum have arrived at the Glimmering Pillar and are making preparations to destroy it, I can sense them.\n\nWe don't have much time. Blow upon this horn atop the Glimmering Pillar to channel my power through the crystal.\n\nWe shall show this scum to not trifle with the titans' creations.",o="雨声河的弗蕾亚的化身要求你登上光芒之柱的顶端，吹响弗蕾亚的号角。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids wants you to use Freya's Horn atop of the Glimmering Pillar.",p="¿Te has encargado de los cultistas, <name>?",pEN="Have you taken care of the cultists, <name>?",c="印象深刻。我没有预期到一个小小的凡人能够像你一样证明自己是个很有价值的盟友。\n\n然而，我担心我们的付出还不够。天灾军团并没有停手的迹象。",cEN="Impressive. I wasn't expecting a mere mortal to prove as worthy an ally as you.\n\nI fear our efforts have not been sufficient, however. The Scourge shows no signs of stopping."}
Q[12621]={d="虽然你消灭了那些教徒，但天灾军团并未停下入侵的脚步。$n，局势愈发严峻了。\n\n我不得不使出最后的绝招。在我向你透露更多秘密之前，你必须博得我毫无保留的信任。",dEN="The cultists have been taken care of, but the Scourge's invasion has not slowed down. The situation is becoming desperate, <name>.\n\nThere exists a last resort. Before I reveal any more, however, I must be sure I have your absolute trust.",o="聆听弗蕾亚的化身的话语。",oEN="Listen to what the Avatar of Freya has to say.",p="我们时间有限。天灾军团正在准备最后一次攻击。",pEN="We have little time. The Scourge is preparing for a final push.",c="现在已经没办法回头了。如果你同意要帮我的话，你应该不要再迟疑。",cEN="There is no turning back now. If you agree to help me, you will do so without hesitation."}
Q[12622]={d="¿'Tas pensando lo mismo que Ahunae, $gtron:titi;?\n\nAlgunos trols Drakkari se han reunío en las Pozas de Jin'Alai al sudoeste. Necesitamos hacer salir a sus líderes y ¡Ahunae sabe cómo hacerlo!\n\nVe y mata a esos trols. En cuanto hayas matao suficientes, aparecerán sus líderes.\n\nCuando aparezcan, asegúrate de conseguir el tesoro de Kutube'sa, Gawanil y Chulo el Loco, $gtron:titi;.",dEN="You thinkin' what Ahunae thinkin', mon?\n\nSome of the Drakkari trolls have gathered at the Pools of Jin'Alai to the southwest. We be needin' to draw out their leaders, and Ahunae knows just how you be doin' it, too!\n\nGo in there and kill those trolls. When you kill enough, their leaders show up.\n\nWhen they show up next to their totems, you make sure to be gettin' the treasure of Kutube'sa, Gawanil, and Chulo the Mad, mon.",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈要求你收集库图比萨的宝藏、疯子克乌罗的宝藏和加瓦尼尔的宝藏。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga has asked you to retrieve the Treasure of Kutube'sa, the Treasure of Gawanil, and the Treasure of Chulo the Mad.",p="El/la <class> debe estar de vuelta hablando con Ahunae porque el/la <class> tiene todo ese tesoro.",pEN="The <class> must be back talkin' to Ahunae because the <class> has all that treasure.",c="¡El escalpador piensa que eres de su clase de <race>!\n\n¿Qué hacen estas barritas de caramelo aquí? ¿Qué hacemos con esto, mon?\n\n¡Ahunae dice que puedes recuperarlas!",cEN="The scalper thinkin' that you be his kind of <race>!\n\nWhat's these candybars doin' in here? What we do with this, mon?\n\nAhunae say that you can have them back!"}
Q[12623]={d="我们赞达拉部族需要你的帮助，$n。我们必须阻止达卡莱巨魔对他们的神灵犯下的恶行！\n\n到东北方去，步上那宏伟的阶梯，进入祖达克的第二层，你会找到一处名叫希姆托加的地方。那里有另一尊神祗的雕像，并且，还有一座小小的避难所，我的族人正在绝望地守卫着它。\n\n我真心希望你能去那里伸出援手。去与巫医库弗谈谈吧，不过路上千万要小心，那个地方一直在被达卡莱巨魔围攻。",dEN="We Zandalari could use your help, <name>. We must put an end to what the Drakkari are doing to their gods!\n\nTo the northeast, up the great steps that lead to the next tier of Zul'Drak, lies Zim'Torga. It is the home to another of the god statues and a refuge that my people are desparately attempting to defend.\n\nI would like for you to travel there and speak to Witch Doctor Khufu. Be warned though, the place is under constant attack from the Drakkari.",o="与希姆托加的巫医库弗谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga.",c="Saludos, <class>. Me alegra saber que Ubungo ha encontrado a alguien en quien confiar.\n\nBienvenido a Zim'Torga.",cEN="Greetings to you, <class>. I am glad to hear that Ubungo found someone that he could trust.\n\nWelcome to Zim'Torga."}
Q[12624]={d="当我得知波利安小姐打算随奈辛瓦里的探险队转至索拉查盆地时，二话不说就去报了名，甘愿成为一名飞艇船员。我追求她好几个月啦，做梦都想娶她！\n\n我早已计划好了一切。飞艇坠毁那晚，我本来要向她求婚的……可现在戒指搞丢了。我到处都找遍了，却一无所获！\n\n你可以不相信我的直觉，但是我知道那枚戒指就在盆地的某处。如果不是被风险投资公司的雇员给偷去了，就是被野兽什么的给吞下了肚。肯定是这样……我知道的！",dEN="When I found out that Miss Boulian was helping Nesingwary with his expedition, I signed up as a deckhand immediately. You see, I'd been meaning to marry her for months!\n\nI had it all planned out. I was going to propose the very night of the shipwreck... but now the ring is gone. I've searched everywhere!\n\nI know it might sound crazy, but I know the engagement ring is in the Basin. If some Venture Company didn't steal it, maybe a wild creature ate it. But it's here somewhere... I just know it!",o="在索拉查盆地的生物身上寻找金色订婚戒指。",oEN="Look for a Golden Engagement Ring on the various creatures in Sholazar Basin.",p="¡El anillo, <name>! Por favor... ¡dime que lo has encontrado!",pEN="The ring, <name>! Please... tell me you've found it!",c="你办到了！你真的找到它了！\n\n我不知道……我不知道我该怎么感谢你！",cEN="You did it! You actually found it!\n\nI don't know... I don't know how to thank you!"}
Q[12627]={d="我一直在想办法与众神取得直接的沟通。但是，金亚莱之池周围那些正在举行某种仪式的巫医给我造成了很大的麻烦。\n\n看来，排除他们的阻挠已经是迫在眉睫了。如果你能进入西南方的沼泽地域，你一定可以把他们那些不知熬着什么的锅全部掀翻。\n\n总之，把那些锅都处理掉，阻断他们那些仪式，为我扫清障碍。",dEN="I have been trying to commune with the gods. However, the medicine men at the Pools of Jin'Alai are performing rituals that are interfering with my attempts.\n\nIt is imperative that we break through their obtrusion. If you were to head southwest into the pools area, I am certain that you would come across the cauldrons they are using for their magic.\n\nDisturb each of the cauldrons to bring down their ritual that is blocking me.",o="希姆托加的巫医库弗要求你破坏蓝色大锅、绿色大锅、紫色大锅和红色大锅。",oEN="Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga has asked you to disturb the Blue Cauldron, Green Cauldron, Purple Cauldron, and Red Cauldron.",p="我还是没有办法创建联系。那些咒医的仪式还是很完整。\n\n请回去扰乱他们的每个锅子。",pEN="I am still unable to make contact. The ritual of the medicine men is still intact.\n\nPlease go back there and disturb each of their cauldrons.",c="是的，我已经可以感受到差异了。谢谢你。\n\n让我们看看现在是否可以和诸神创建联系。",cEN="Yes, I can already feel the difference. Thank you.\n\nLet us see if we can make contact with the gods now."}
Q[12628]={d="我们都已经听到了众神的指示，$n，现在你要做的事已经很清楚了。\n\n你必须立刻转至东南边的哈克娅祭坛，并与猎豹女神交谈。",dEN="The gods have spoken, <name>. We now know what you must do.\n\nYou must now go to the Altar of Har'koa to the southeast and speak with the leopard goddess.",o="与哈克娅祭坛的哈克娅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Har'koa at the Altar of Har'koa.",c="Escucha con atención, pequeño <race>. El tiempo es esencial.",cEN="Listen closely, little <race>. Time is of the essence."}
Q[12629]={d="Cuando a la Plaga se le mete un objetivo entre ceja y ceja, hace lo imposible por conseguirlo.\n\nEstás $gcondenado:condenada; a una existencia sin sentido como cadáver andante...\n\n<La cara de Stefan se convierte en una mueca cruel.>\n\n... A menos que podamos usar sus propios deseos en su contra.\n\nYa te lo explicaré luego. La magia que tengo que elaborar es compleja y requiere ciertos componentes materiales.\n\nViaja al este de aquí, al Relicario de Agonía. Mata a abominaciones y recoge la baba de necrófago que encontrarás allí. Después tráeme sus restos.",dEN="Once the Scourge have a target in their sights, they'll stop at nothing to acquire it.\n\nYou're doomed to a mindless existence as a walking corpse....\n\n<Stefan's face twists into a cruel grin.>\n\n... unless we can use their desires against them.\n\nI'll explain later. I have complex magic to prepare which requires certain material components.\n\nTravel due east of here to the Reliquary of Agony. Slay abominations and gather the ghoul drool you'll find there then return to me with their remnants.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你到折磨之匣下面去，从腐烂憎恶身上收集5份腐烂憎恶之物，并收集5份黏稠的食尸鬼口水。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch asked you to go to the Reliquary of Agony to collect 5 Putrid Abomination Guts from the Putrid Abominations and 5 Gooey Ghoul Drools.",p="¿Me has traído los componentes que te pedí, <name>?",pEN="Have you brought me the components I asked for, <name>?",c="<Stefan sifts through the foul components.>\n\nBueno, está lejos de ser perfecto, pero servirá. Ahora prepárate, <class>. Aquí es donde la cosa se pone interesante....",cEN="<Stefan sifts through the foul components.>\n\nWell, it's far from perfect, but it'll have to do. Now brace yourself, <class>. This is where it gets good...."}
Q[12630]={d="在你去见纳斯之前，有些事情我必须告诉你。\n\n纳斯曾经感染过一丁点瘟疫，所以他现在又聋又瞎，而且基本没有知觉。\n\n但这也不全是坏事。现在他已经对瘟疫之类的玩意完全免疫了，所以能够胜任某些特殊的任务——比如我将要交给你的这个任务。\n\n附近有一些刚刚感染天灾瘟疫的巨魔，我们需要研究一下瘟疫对他们造成的影响。带上纳斯和这只靴子。当你杀死一个巨魔后，就狠狠踢他一脚，这样他就会去收集毛发样本了。",dEN="Before you meet Nass, there's something you should know.\n\nHe got a toxic dose of blight back in the day, and now he's deaf, blind, and mostly numb.\n\nIt's not all bad, though. He's virtually immune to the stuff now, which makes him perfect for certain tasks - like the one I'm about to give you.\n\nThere are many freshly scourged trolls nearby and we need to study the blight's effect on them. Take Nass, and this boot. When you've slain a troll, give him a good kick and he'll know to take a hair sample.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要求你使用纳斯从干瘪的巨魔身上收集10份毛发样本。\n\n如果你把纳斯弄丢了，就回到斯特凡那里去找他。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch wants you to use Nass to collect 10 hair samples from Withered Trolls.\n\nIf you lose Nass, return to Stefan to recover him.",p="¿Cómo va esa bota, <race>?",pEN="How's that boot holding up, <race>?",c="你知道吗，你让我想起我的纳斯。\n\n也许是因为鼻子……",cEN="You know, you remind me an awful lot of my Nass.\n\nMaybe it's just the nose..."}
Q[12631]={d="这条项圈的设计非常复杂。\n\n你盯着它的时候，脑中出现了一个危险的念头——这个念头企图迫使你戴上它。你抑制住了这种冲动，决定把它带回黑锋哨站去。\n\n那里的死亡骑士应该对这种东西有所了解……",dEN="Crafted of bone and dripping with blood, this choker is of intricate and deliberate design.\n\nGazing upon it overwhelms you with an ominous presence - one that compels you to wear it. You fight the urge, and resolve to bring it back to Ebon Watch.\n\nIf anyone can explain this, a death knight can....",o="将尸灵项圈交给黑锋哨站的斯特凡。",oEN="Take the Unliving Choker to Stefan at Ebon Watch.",c="Estoy familiarizado con objetos como este.\n\n<Stefan te mira a los ojos.>\n\nParece que, <name>, has sido... elegido.",cEN="I am indeed familiar with items such as this.\n\n<Stefan looks you in the eye.>\n\nIt would seem, <name>, that you have been... chosen."}
Q[12632]={d="我是所有神祗中最后一个被降伏的，因此我们得先让其它的神祗重获自由。但是，由于身上的魔法束缚，我不能亲自去探察他们的情况。\n\n首先，我需要你帮我一个忙。当前达卡莱巨魔已将我的力量转过来对付我，他们还将我的后裔全部变成了畸形的怪物。\n\n带上一根我的胡须，将我那些被折磨被虐待的孩子们杀死，然后利用胡须上的魔法解放它们的灵魂，并赐予它们新的生命。",dEN="I am the last of the gods to be subdued, so we must first attempt to free the others. Bound by the magics of my subduers, I am unable to discern their fates.\n\nBut first, I would ask that you do me a kindness. Already the Drakkari turn my magic against me. They have transformed my offspring into monstrosities.\n\nTake one of my whiskers. Slay my tortured children and use the magic of it to release them from their nightmare, and bring them back to life.",o="哈克娅要求你对她的孩子们的尸体使用她的胡须，解放并复活它们。完成任务之后回到哈克娅祭坛去向她复命。",oEN="Har'koa has asked you to use her whisker on the corpses of her children to free and resurrect them. Return to her at the Altar of Har'koa when you are done.",p="还有很多我的子嗣身陷折磨之中，你必须解救他们！",pEN="There are more of my offspring that you must free from their torment!",c="Gracias, <name>. Nunca olvidaré lo que has hecho.",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I will never forget what you have done."}
Q[12633]={d="这条仍在滴血的项链是用骨头制成的，设计非常复杂。\n\n你盯着它的时候，脑中出现了一个危险的念头——这个念头企图迫使你戴上它。你抑制住了这种冲动，决定把它带回黑锋哨站去。\n\n那里的死亡骑士应该对这种东西有所了解……",dEN="Crafted of bone and dripping with blood, this choker is of intricate and deliberate design.\n\nGazing upon it overwhelms you with an ominous presence - one that compels you to wear it. You fight the urge, and resolve to bring it back to Ebon Watch.\n\nIf anyone can explain this, a death knight can....",o="将扭曲项圈交给黑锋哨站的斯特凡。",oEN="Take the Writhing Choker to Stefan in Ebon Watch.",c="Estoy familiarizado con objetos como este.\n\n<Stefan te mira a los ojos.>\n\nParece que, <name>, has sido... elegido.",cEN="I am indeed familiar with items such as this.\n\n<Stefan looks you in the eye.>\n\nIt would seem, <name>, that you have been... chosen."}
Q[12634]={d="命运丢给我一颗宛如柠檬般酸涩的苦果！当我们的船横冲直撞地撞毁在这片丛林中时，酒桶全被震裂了，我辛辛苦苦酿出的美酒洒得一干二净！现在只剩下几瓶朗姆酒了，这些怎么能满足嗜酒如命的探险队呢！\n\n我必须尽快酿点什么来给他们喝！\n\n东边的蛮藤谷中生长着许多果树。如今正是果实成熟的季节，可惜我够不着高高的树干。不如你去跑一趟，从树上摇一些果子下来！有什么我就要什么。",dEN="Life's tossed me a cartload of lemons this time! When the ship ran aground, the kegs carrying my best brew burst! All we have now are a few bottles of rum, and it won't sustain a thirsty expedition!\n\nWe need to get some booze cooking, and fast!!\n\nThe trees in the Wildgrowth Mangal, to the east, seem laden with fruit, but it's too high for me to reach. Look for good, strong vines, see if you can use it to shake some of that fruit out of the trees. Bring me whatever you can find.",o="将1颗橙子、2串香蕉和1颗木瓜交给奈辛瓦里营地的葛瑞姆·雷酒。",oEN="Bring 1 Orange, 2 Banana Bunches, and 1 Papaya to Grimbooze Thunderbrew at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="运气怎样，你有没有从那些又高又烦人的树上弄下水果来？",pEN="Did you have luck winning any of that fruit from those darn tall and stingy trees?",c="Bueno, es un surtido mejor de lo que esperaba de este lugar. Ahora, la pregunta importante: ¿podemos destilarlo en algo bebible? Será mejor que empecemos.",cEN="Well, that's a better assortment than I would've expected from this place. Now, for the important question: can we distill it into anything drinkable? We'd better get started."}
Q[12635]={d="我无意中听说你要前去为哈克娅的安宁而奋斗。祝你好运。\n\n不过，既然你要在那座祭坛周围活动的话，能不能顺便帮我收集几件他们的圣物回来呢？祭坛就在东南边不远的地方，我也不需要很多件圣物的。\n\n你看怎么样啊？",dEN="I overheard that you are going to see to the well-being of Har'koa. Good luck to you.\n\nI am wondering if while you are in the vicinity of the altar, you would be willing to recover their relics? I do not require many, and it is only a short trip to the southeast.\n\nWhat do you say?",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼要求你收集10件哈克娅圣物。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga wants you to recover 10 Har'koan Relics.",p="达卡莱巨魔这是在忙着毁灭自己，如果让这些历史意义重大的东西像他们的帝国一样消逝的话真是太可惜了。",pEN="The Drakkari are so busy destroying themselves, it would be a shame if the historical significance of their empire were to be likewise lost.",c="噢，最高级的样本！\n\n你可以看出这个分离形成了象征学的根基。真是杰出。\n\n这些冰巨魔决定自我毁灭真是令人遗憾。\n\n举例来说，你知道吗，达卡莱巨魔是因为他们极度的暴力而被其它的巨魔国家流放？\n\n这是真的！不然你以为巨魔是怎么会跑来这个气候这么严苛的地方呢？",cEN="Aw, prime specimens!\n\nYou can see there the divergence from the root symbology. Quite extraordinary.\n\nWhat a pity that the ice trolls are determined to bring about their own demise.\n\nDid you know, for instance, that the Drakkari were exiled from the rest of the troll nations for their extremely violent ways?\n\nIt's true! How did you think trolls ended up in such a harsh climate as this?"}
Q[12636]={d="Observa Acherus, ¡la gran ciudadela de la muerte! ¡No hay nada igual en este mundo! Ni la poderosa Naxxramas podría soportar un asalto directo de El Bastión de Ébano. El ojo que todo lo ve de Acherus se aprecia en lo alto de la cara de la necrópolis. Desde ahí, el maestro es capaz de ver a largas distancias dentro de los territorios invadidos por nuestros enemigos. Lo que ve el ojo, lo ve el Rey Exánime y ¡ya es hora de que tú mires a través de él! El Rey Exánime te llama, $n.\n\n¡Ve ahora! Sufre bien, $ghermano:hermana;…|n",dEN="Behold, Acherus, the grand citadel of death! It has no equal in this world! Not even the mighty Naxxramas could withstand a direct assault from the Ebon Hold. Looming above the face of the necropolis is the all-seeing eye of Acherus. From it the master is able to see great distances into the territories held by our enemies. What the eye sees, the Lich King sees, and now the time has come for you to peer through the eye! The Lich King has called for you, <name>.\n\nGo now! Suffer well, <brother/sister>...",o="向黑锋要塞的巫妖王报到。",oEN="Report to the Lich King in Ebon Hold.",c="让敌人血流成河的时刻近了。在战斗之前，你必须先了解你要摧毁的目标是什么。这就是一位死亡骑士与一只无脑的食尸鬼的差别。\n\n我会赐予你超乎一切视觉之上的视觉，我的勇士。你将使用阿彻鲁斯之眼来窥探目标的秘密。",cEN="The time to spill the blood of our enemies approaches. You must first learn what it is that you seek to destroy, before rushing headlong into battle. It is what separates a death knight from a mindless ghoul.\n\nI will grant you sight beyond sight, my champion. You will use the eye of Acherus to steal our enemies' secrets."}
Q[12637]={d="Ya fuese sabiduría o suerte, algo te salvó de llevar esta gargantilla, $r.\n\nDe cualquier manera, tu adquisición no fue de casualidad. Has sido $gelegido:elegida; por alguien o algo…\n\nLleva la gargantilla a Rosangre. Deja que te muestre lo que casi te depara el destino.",dEN="It was either wisdom or luck that prevented you from wearing this choker, <race>.\n\nEither way, your acquiring it was no random occurance. You've been targeted by someone, or something....\n\nTake your choker to Bloodrose, here. Let her demonstrate the fate that nearly befell you.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你将尸灵项圈交给血玫瑰达图拉。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to take the Unliving Choker to Bloodrose Datura.",p="¿Sí, <race>?",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="现在你目睹了原本要落在你身上的命运。\n\n就像我先前所说的，这完全不是巧合。制作这样的一件物品是很复杂的，而且所需的资源并不会随便浪费在某一个目标上。\n\n这是个简单的事实：天灾军团想要得到你……",cEN="Now you've observed the fate that was meant to befall you.\n\nAs I mentioned before, this was no coincidence. The creation of such a device is very involved, and the required resources would not be squandered on a random target.\n\nThe simple truth of the matter is this; You're wanted by the Scourge...."}
Q[12638]={d="Ya fuese sabiduría o suerte, algo te salvó de llevar esta gargantilla, $r.\n\nDe cualquier manera, tu adquisición no fue de casualidad. Has sido $gelegido:elegida; por alguien o algo…\n\nLleva la gargantilla a Rosangre. Demuéstrale lo que casi te depara el destino.",dEN="It was either wisdom or luck that prevented you from wearing this choker, <race>.\n\nEither way, your acquiring it was no random occurence. You've been targeted by someone, or something....\n\nTake your choker to Bloodrose, here. Let her demonstrate the fate that nearly befell you.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你将扭曲项圈交给血玫瑰达图拉。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to take the Writhing Choker to Bloodrose Datura.",p="¿Sí, <race>?",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="刚才你看到的是原本会属于你的下场。\n\n就像我先前所说的，这并非偶发的攻击，因为制作这样一件物品的过程非常繁琐，想必你引起了天灾军团领导阶层的注意。\n\n问题并不是怎么引起的、为何引起、甚或到底引起了谁的注意……而是我们该怎么做？",cEN="Now you've observed the fate that was meant to befall you.\n\nAs I mentioned before, this was no random act. The creation of such a device is very involved. You've somehow caught the attention of the Scourge leadership.\n\nThe question is not how, why, or even who... but what will we do about it?"}
Q[12639]={d="我们获取了附近的许多元素生物，并将其驯化成了我的卫兵，这样才保证了这里拥有足够的守卫力量。但是，想要让它们保持足够的战力以应付强敌的话，则需要消耗许多能量。\n\n西北方达克玛瓦的冻土中有着大量我所需要的物质。要想让这些元素卫兵继续活动下去的话，我就需要更多的冻土精华。",dEN="We captured these elementals from nearby, and I have plenty of defenders now. But, it takes a great deal of power to make them strong enough to stand up to our enemies.\n\nThe frozen earth at Drak'Mabwa to the northwest have what I need to maintain our defenses. I'll need more of their essence if I'm to keep this up.",o="希姆托加的元素驯服者德苟达要求你收集7块冻土精华。",oEN="Element-Tamer Dagoda at Zim'Torga wants you to collect 7 Essence of the Frozen Earth.",p="我希望你有带回足够的数量。达克玛瓦的攻势在你做了那些事之后会越来越凶猛的。",pEN="I hope that you've returned with enough. The attacks from the Pools of Jin'Alai have become more desperate after what you did to them.",c="Gracias, <class>. Esas esencias deberían ser suficientes para alimentar mis lanzamientos durante bastante tiempo.",cEN="Thank you, <class>. Those essences should be enough to fuel my casting for quite some time."}
Q[12640]={d="德苟达肯定还会派你去西北方的达克玛瓦，替她和她手下的卫兵拿回更多的东西。\n\n那么，埃霍奈希望你也能顺便帮忙摧毁那些不断有元素生物跑出来的空间裂隙。这可以让我们彻底避免继续遭受它们的攻击！\n\n总之，你千万要小心，冻土中的凶猛生物会在你尝试封印裂隙的时候突然出现并袭击你。",dEN="Dagoda gonna be sendin' you northwest to Drak'Mabwa to get her more stuff for her defenders if she didn't already.\n\nWhile you up there, Ahunae be wantin' you to destroy the rifts those elementals pourin' out of. The last thing we needin' is for them to attack us!\n\nJust watch out, more of those frozen earth'll show up when you try to seal the rifts.",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈要求你封印7处元素裂隙。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga has asked you to seal 7 Elemental Rifts.",p="Tienes unos cuantos de esos rifts más que sellar antes de que volvamos a hablar, <name>.",pEN="You have a few more of those rifts to seal before we be talkin' again, <name>.",c="埃霍奈希望德苟达得到了她想要的防御。现在那些裂隙关闭了，她现在应该比以前安全多了。",cEN="Ahunae hopin' that Dagoda got all of the defenders she wantin'. With those rifts sealed, it's not likely she'll be gettin' any more."}
Q[12641]={d="阿彻鲁斯之眼就放在这个平台的正中央。你可以用它召唤出一只探测之眼，用以侦察分析新阿瓦隆内的血色十字军部署和动向。阿彻鲁斯之眼拥有一些独特的能力，可以让你的情报收集工作更轻松一些。\n\n好好利用它的虹吸技能，侦查敌人的熔炉、市政厅、城堡，以及礼拜堂。平台的周围有数个阿彻鲁斯之眼的控制台，不要浪费时间了，$n。\n\n天灾军团必将全面占领新阿瓦隆。这是巫妖王的命令！",dEN="Towering above this platform is the eye of Acherus. From it you will call forth a probe that you will then use to analyze Scarlet Crusade fortifications at New Avalon. The eye has a host of powers that should make the acquisition of this data simple.\n\nUse the eye's siphon to analyze the forge, town hall, hold, and chapel. The eye's control mechanisms are located on either side of this platform. Waste no more time, <name>.\n\nThe Scourge will have this place. The Lich King commands it!",o="巫妖王命令你使用阿彻鲁斯之眼，侦察并分析血色城堡、新阿瓦隆熔炉、新阿瓦隆市政厅和赤色烈焰礼拜堂的情况。\n\n使用阿彻鲁斯之眼的控制台来控制阿彻鲁斯之眼。",oEN="The Lich King commands you to use the Eye of Acherus to analyze the Scarlet Hold, New Avalon Forge, New Avalon Town Hall and the Chapel of the Crimson Flame.\n\nControl the Eye of Acherus by using the Eye of Acherus Control Mechanism.",p="我们对血色十字军发动的突袭将会成为传奇。",pEN="Our assault upon the Scarlet Crusade will become legend.",c="他们正在准备着战斗，正如我所料，但不过如此。我感觉到一个宿敌的存在——一个我很久以前就已经毁掉的敌人……\n\n不过不重要了。我们会在他们撤离家园并开始防御之前就以天灾军团的全部军力展开攻击。",cEN="They prepare for battle - as expected - but there is something else. I sense an old enemy. An enemy that I destroyed long ago...\n\nIt matters not. We will send the full might of the Scourge against them before they have a chance to evacuate their homes and put in place their defenses."}
Q[12642]={d="我可以清晰地感觉到，伦诺克的时间已经不多了。\n\n这位极地熊神的灵魂已经离开了他虚弱的身躯。你必须与他的灵魂沟通。\n\n他的祭坛就在西北方，达克玛瓦的另一端。",dEN="My feelings tell me that Rhunok doesn't have much time.\n\nI can tell that the arctic bear god's spirit has already separated from his weakened body. It is his spirit with which you must commune.\n\nHis altar lies to the northwest beyond Drak'Mabwa.",o="与伦诺克祭坛的伦诺克之魂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Spirit of Rhunok at the Altar of Rhunok.",c="我只能勉强撑着。你必须迅速行动，否则一切都是空谈。",cEN="I am barely hanging on. You must work quickly or all will be lost."}
Q[12643]={d="Cuando a la Plaga se le mete un objetivo entre ceja y ceja, hacen lo imposible por conseguirlo.\n\nEstás $gcondenado:condenada; a una existencia sin sentido como cadáver andante...\n\n<La cara de Stefan se convierte en una mueca cruel.>\n\n... A menos que podamos usar sus propios deseos en su contra.\n\nYa te lo explicaré luego. La magia que tengo que elaborar es compleja y requiere ciertos componentes materiales.\n\nViaja al este de aquí a las tierras bajo el Relicario de Agonía. Mata a los necrófagos y las abominaciones que encuentres allí y tráeme sus restos.",dEN="Once the Scourge have a target in their sights, they'll stop at nothing to acquire it.\n\nYou're doomed to a mindless existence as a walking corpse....\n\n<Stefan's face twists into a cruel grin.>\n\n... unless we can use their desires against them.\n\nI'll explain later. I have complex magic to prepare which requires certain material components.\n\nTravel due east of here to the land beneath the Reliquary of Agony. Slay the ghouls and abominations you'll find there and return to me with their remnants.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你到折磨之匣下面去，从腐烂憎恶身上收集5份腐烂憎恶之物，并收集5份黏稠的食尸鬼口水。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch asked you to go to the Reliquary of Agony to collect 5 Putrid Abomination Guts from the Putrid Abominations and 5 Gooey Ghoul Drools.",p="¿Has traído los componentes que te pedí, <name>?",pEN="Have you brought the components I asked for, <name>?",c="<Stefan sifts through the foul components.>\n\nBueno, está lejos de ser perfecto, pero servirá.\n\nAhora prepárate, <class>. Aquí es donde se pone interesante....",cEN="<Stefan sifts through the foul components.>\n\nWell, it's far from perfect, but it'll have to do.\n\nNow brace yourself, <class>. This is where it gets good...."}
Q[12644]={d="Ahora que tenemos la materia prima, he mandado a mi ayudante a que prepare la destilería. Va a supervisar el proceso, pero quiero que le ayudes a mantener todo bajo control. Puedes llegar a pensar que nosotros solo echamos todo dentro del alambique y esperamos a que se asiente, pero te equivocas.\n\nSe tienen que añadir ingredientes y regular el calor y la presión de vez en cuando. Solo tendrás 10 segundos para reaccionar. Habla con MacManus \"Chispa\" cuando estés $glisto:lista; para empezar con la destilación.",dEN="Now that we've got the raw materials, I've had my assistant ready the still. He'll oversee the process, but I want you to help keep everything under control. You might be tempted to think that we just throw everything into the still and let it sit, but you're wrong.\n\nIngredients and heat need to be added at certain times, and the pressure regulated at others. You'll have no more than 10 seconds to react to a situation. Speak with \"Tipsy\" McManus when you're ready to start distilling.",o="成功完成蒸馏作业，然后将雷酒的丛林佳酿交给奈辛瓦里营地的葛瑞姆·雷酒。",oEN="Successfully complete the distillation process and bring the completed Thunderbrew's Jungle Punch to Grimbooze Thunderbrew at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="嗯，结果怎么样？",pEN="Well, how did it turn out?",c="<葛瑞姆摇了摇桶。>\n\n这里面有了东西，但最最重要的问题是，这能不能喝呢？你哪儿都别去——你也得负责监督样本测试啊。",cEN="<Grimbooze gives the cask a shake.>\n\nThere's something in here, but the million gold question is, can you drink it? Don't you go anywhere; you'll be responsible for overseeing the sampling of the product, too."}
Q[12645]={d="现在就来揭晓真相吧！\n\n<葛瑞姆轻声地笑了。>\n\n我总是很期待这样的时刻。通常我会举办宴会供大家试饮，但是我们身处丛林，就别那么讲究啦。\n\n一切从简吧，给几位好朋友尝尝就行。让我想想，我得听听赫米特·奈辛瓦里的意见。呃，给哈迪乌斯·哈洛维也送一份。他们俩就在这座营地里。对啦，你最好去跑一趟湖边着陆场，那地方就在索拉查盆地的中央，让塔玛拉也试试。",dEN="And now for the moment of truth!\n\n<Grimbooze chuckles.>\n\nI've always wanted to say that. Normally, I'd debut a new drink at a banquet, but we can't have one in the middle of the jungle.\n\nInstead, just take samples to a few trusted friends and return with their comments. Let's see, we'll definitely want Hemet Nesingwary's opinion, and Hadrius Harlowe's, too. They're here in camp. You'll want to head over to Lakeside Landing, near the center of the Basin and offer Tamara Wobblesprocket a taste.",o="将雷酒的丛林佳酿的酒样交给赫米特·奈辛瓦里、哈迪乌斯·哈洛维和塔玛拉·摇链品尝，然后向奈辛瓦里营地的葛瑞姆·雷酒复命。",oEN="Offer a sample of Thunderbrew's Jungle Punch to Hemet Nesingwary, Hadrius Harlowe, and Tamara Wobblesprocket, then return to Grimbooze Thunderbrew at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="No me hagas esperar, <name>. ¿Cuáles son los resultados?",pEN="Don't keep me waiting, <name>. What are the results?",c="三个里面有两个同意，嗯？以第一次试喝来讲还不赖，真的不赖。我想我得要弄点什么东西向塔玛拉表达歉意才行。\n\n现在……我们应该怎么称呼这种酒呢？",cEN="Two out of three drinkers agree, eh? Not bad for a first try. Not bad at all. I suppose I'll have to whip up something else for Tamara by way of apology.\n\nNow... what should we call this creation?"}
Q[12646]={d="我的先知当初从我身上吸取了太多的力量，而且过程也太快，结果把自己给毁灭了。现在在达克玛瓦南边留下的那处灌满雨水的巨坑就是当时爆炸产生的结果。\n\n在那以后，祭司们又将这位先知复活了，试图让他继续完成未尽的计划。他们将我的力量又重新导向了先知，很快，他就将再次醒来。\n\n趁一切还来得及，你必须去真正终结他的生命，并将我的魔精带回来。",dEN="My prophet absorbed too much of my power too quickly, and subsequently killed himself. You can see the results at the water-filled crater to the south in Drak'Mabwa.\n\nMy former priests have already resurrected him so that he can finish the job. They're channeling my power back into him, and it will not be long now before he reawakens.\n\nYou must put an end to him and return with my mojo before it is too late.",o="伦诺克祭坛的伦诺克之魂要求你找回他的极地熊神魔精。",oEN="The Spirit of Rhunok at the Altar of Rhunok has asked you to acquire his Arctic Bear God Mojo.",p="Rápido, <race>, ¿tienes mi mojo?",pEN="Quickly, <race>, do you have my mojo?",c="你办到了。\n\n但现在我还需要你帮我做一件事。",cEN="You did it.\n\nBut now there is one other thing that I need you to do."}
Q[12647]={d="我的身躯已经不能挽回了，$n。那些祭司迟早会再选出一个新的先知，很快他们又将重新开始执行罪恶的计划。\n\n我将把身上最后的一些力量赐予你。那个折磨我、囚禁我的人当前正躲在祭坛的内部，他身上有一坛熏香，可以唤醒我的身躯，并让它变得不再无懈可击。\n\n请你利用这坛熏香帮我一个忙，结束我痛苦的生命吧。\n\n我要为可能会出现的反抗道歉。即使只是没有灵魂的身躯，它依然留存着极强的生存欲望。",dEN="My body is too far gone now, <name>. It is only a matter of time before a new prophet is elevated and finishes what the other began.\n\nI am going to imbue you with the last of my power. The tormentor inside the altar building carries incense, which will awaken my body and make it vulnerable.\n\nUse the incense and do me the kindness of putting an end to my suffering.\n\nI apologize if I fight back. Even for me, the will to survive is strong.",o="伦诺克祭坛的伦诺克之魂要求你对他的身躯使用折磨者的熏香，使之被唤醒。然后，你要使用伦诺克灌注在你身体内的能量杀死他。\n\n如果你不小心失去了伦诺克魔精光环的影响，可以回到伦诺克之魂那里再次寻求帮助。",oEN="The Spirit of Rhunok has asked you to use the Tormentor's Incense to awaken his body. You are then to slay Rhunok using the power that his spirit has imbued you with.\n\nIf for some reason you lose the Mojo of Rhunok aura, you can return to the Spirit of Rhunok to have it reapplied.",p="Si no pones fin a mi sufrimiento pronto, <name>, todo podría perderse.",pEN="If you do not put an end to my suffering soon, <name>, all may be lost.",c="Has hecho lo que tenías que hacer y me has honrado en el proceso.\n\nTe doy mi más profundo agradecimiento, <name>. Solo espero que tú y Har'koa podáis ayudar a los demás.",cEN="You've done what had to be done and honored me in the process.\n\nI give you my deepest thanks, <name>. I only hope that you and Har'koa will be able to help the others."}
Q[12648]={d="好了……我制作了一种伪装，它可以把你变成天灾军团的成员，而且不易被发现。\n\n只要伪装还没有失效，你就可以在天灾军团中自由行动。只有荒芜卫士能看穿我制造的这种幻象，你要小心它们！\n\n你要注意的另一个问题就是，这个伪装不太稳定，随时可能失效，所以你一定要保持警惕。\n\n现在让我们来测试一下效果吧。你使用项圈激活伪装，到东边去找天灾军团的商人，给我买一瓶苦痛浆液回来。",dEN="There... I've created a disguise that should make you indistinguishable from the Scourge.\n\nYou'll be free to walk among them as long as the disguise holds. Only the blightguards will be able to see through my illusion. Watch out for them!\n\nAnother thing you must know is that the disguise is unstable and may drop unexpectedly, so stay alert.\n\nLet's test it out. Use the choker and visit the Scourge merchant just east of here. Return to me with a bottle of bitter plasma.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你使用迷惑项圈激活天灾伪装。\n\n在天灾形态下，到骨肠那里去购买苦痛浆液。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to use the Ensorceled Choker to apply the Scourge disguise.\n\nWhile in Scourge form, you are to purchase Bitter Plasma from Gristlegut.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="¿Y bien, <name>?\n\n¿Compraste ese frasco?",pEN="Well, <name>?\n\nDid you purchase that flask?",c="所以你还喜欢你的天灾生活吗？\n\n相信我，并不像看起来的那么美好……",cEN="So? How are you enjoying scourge life?\n\nBelieve me, it's not all it's cracked up to be...."}
Q[12649]={d="好了……我制作了一种伪装，它可以把你变成天灾军团的成员，而且不易被发现。\n\n只要伪装还没有失效，你就可以在天灾军团中自由行动。只有荒芜卫士能看穿我制造的这种幻象，你要小心它们！\n\n你要注意的另一个问题就是，这个伪装不太稳定，随时可能失效，所以你一定要保持警惕。\n\n现在让我们来测试一下效果吧。你使用项圈激活伪装，到东边去找天灾军团的商人，给我买一瓶苦痛浆液回来。",dEN="There... I've created a disguise that should make you indistinguishable from the Scourge.\n\nYou'll be free to walk among them as long as the disguise holds. Only the blightguards will be able to see through my illusion. Watch out for them!\n\nAnother thing you must know is that the disguise is unstable and may drop unexpectedly, so stay alert.\n\nLet's test it out. Use the choker and visit the Scourge vendor just east of here. Return to me with a bottle of bitter plasma.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你使用迷惑项圈激活天灾伪装。\n\n在天灾形态下，到骨肠那里去购买苦痛浆液。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to use the Ensorcelled Choker to apply the Scourge disguise.\n\nWhile in Scourge form, you are to purchase Bitter Plasma from Gristlegut.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="¿Y bien, <name>?\n\n¿Compraste ese frasco?",pEN="Well, <name>?\n\nDid you purchase that flask?",c="所以你还喜欢你的天灾生活吗？\n\n相信我，并不像看起来的那么美好……",cEN="So? How are you enjoying Scourge life?\n\nBelieve me, it's not all it's cracked up to be...."}
Q[12650]={d="附近还有一处祭坛中放置有大量理应得到拯救与保护的圣物。\n\n西北边的达克玛瓦苔原另一边有一座伦诺克祭坛，据说那里的达卡莱巨魔发生了暴动，竟然毁灭了自己的圣地，将那里变成了一片焦土。\n\n$C，如果你能从那些卑贱而无知的巨魔手中救回那些圣物，我将感激不尽。",dEN="There is another altar nearby where there are artifacts to be saved.\n\nIt is said that the Drakkari at the Altar of Rhunok to the northwest, beyond the broken tundra of Drak'Mabwa, have already plundered their own holy site.\n\n<class>, I would be appreciative if you could rescue those artifacts from their undeserving hands.",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼要求你收集7件伦诺克圣物。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga wants you to recover 7 Rhunokian Artifacts.",p="我们是没有办法理解达卡莱巨魔的。他们是凶残的野蛮人，而且已经到了一个新的低谷。",pEN="There is no comprehending the Drakkari. They are brutal savages who have sunk to a new low.",c="Déjame echarles un vistazo.\n\n<El cronista examina los artefactos que has recuperado.>\n\nHmph, diría que hemos tenido suerte de que los liberaras cuando lo hiciste, <class>.\n\nQué interesante. Este artefacto representa los eventos de la Fragmentación. Hubo un tiempo en que Northrend era la parte más septentrional de Kalimdor.\n\nPero tras la Fragmentación, la tierra se separó, convirtiéndose finalmente en Northrend.\n\nEsta es, por supuesto, la razón por la que también vemos Drakkari en los continentes del sur, además de aquí.",cEN="Let me look at those.\n\n<The chronicler examines the artifacts that you have recovered.>\n\nHmph, I'd say that we're lucky you liberated these when you did, <class>.\n\nHow very interesting. This artifact here depicts the events of the Sundering. There was a time when Northrend was the far northern portion of Kalimdor.\n\nBut after the Sundering, the land broke off, eventually becoming Northrend.\n\nThis, of course, is why we see Drakkari in the southern continents as well as here."}
Q[12651]={d="风险投资公司刚开始找我们的麻烦时，我就让玛尔文·摇链和他的老婆塔玛拉搭乘飞行器去了东边的河流之心。我让他在那里搭建一座小营地，作为补给中转站以及侦查该地区的前哨站。\n\n不出意外的话，他们现在应该已经开始修筑营地了吧。河流之心位于索拉查盆地的中央位置，顾名思义，就是数条河流的交汇点啦。沿着东北边的河岸寻找湖边着陆场吧。玛尔文说他挑了一处地势最好的位置。",dEN="When the trouble with the Venture Company started, I asked Marvin Wobblesprocket and his wife, Tamara, to take their flying machines east to River's Heart. I asked them to setup a small camp there so that we could use them as a relay to fly in supplies and survey the area.\n\nThey should have arrived by now and started setting up. River's Heart is near the center of the basin where the rivers converge. Search for Lakeshore Landing on the northeast shore. Marvin mentioned it would be the best spot.",o="与湖边着陆场的塔玛拉·摇链谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tamara Wobblesprocket at Lakeside Landing.",c="所以说是赫米特派你来的咯？我们正打算通知他我们这边已经开始运作了。如果我丈夫忽视你的话，请见谅，因为他完全专注在工作上。",cEN="So, Hemet sent you? We were just about to let him know that we've gotten things up and running here. Please forgive Marvin if he seems to be ignoring you, but he gets very absorbed in his work."}
Q[12652]={d="嘿嘿嘿！你，食尸鬼！对！我是在跟你讲话。\n\n现在是开饭时间了。去把饭拿给那些食尸鬼！\n\n今天可是特别加大餐！看看，各种杂碎……嗯，嗯，真鲜美。\n\n去把这些装满了饭的碗丢到那些食尸鬼面前。喂饭是个交朋友的好办法。\n\n想交个食尸鬼朋友吗？啊哈哈哈哈！",dEN="Git o'er heer, gool! Yeh, I talkin' to yoo.\n\nIt feedin' time now. Gotta git da grub ta all da gools!\n\nSpeshal grub dis time! Bowels an' brainz bowl... num, num, num.\n\nJus drop da bowl nexta da gool. Gud way ta make frenz.\n\nYoo got goolfrenz? Ha, ha, hah!",o="折磨之匣的骨肠要求你在10只腐烂的食尸鬼附近使用杂碎大餐。",oEN="Gristlegut at the Reliquary of Agony wants you to use Bowels and Brains Bowl next to 10 Decaying Ghouls.",p="你还没喂食尸鬼？",pEN="Yoo dun feed da goolz?",c="好吃好吃！",cEN="Num num!"}
Q[12653]={d="是时候让你回到猎豹女神的身边了。我预计她还有许多计划要委派给你去执行。\n\n请转告她，无论这世界怎样变化，我们都是永恒不灭的。",dEN="And now it is time for you to return to the leopard goddess. Somehow I sense that she has other plans for you.\n\nTell her that no matter what, we are eternal.",o="与哈克娅祭坛的哈克娅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Har'koa at the Altar of Har'koa.",c="<猎豹女神痛苦的嚎叫。>\n\n我的灵魂因为再度失去一个朋友而哀嚎。但是不要害怕，他会回来，并且它的灵魂将永生不朽。",cEN="<The cat goddess howls in pain.>\n\nMy spirit cries out in grief at the loss of another friend. But fear not, he will return and his spirit will live on forever."}
Q[12654]={d="当赫米特让我陪同玛尔文来这里搭建营地时，我还以为能在修理飞行器或是修筑营地之馀练习一下狩猎技巧呢，哪知道根本忙得脱不开身！\n\n我很想干掉那头名叫匹奇的狮子。据说它就生活在这里的南边，通天之柱北面和蛮藤谷交界的地方。如果你能找到它的话，不如把你干掉它的证据给我带回来？如果小道消息确凿的话，这件战利品肯定可以让赫米特瞠目结舌！",dEN="When Hemet asked me to accompany Marvin out here, I hoped that I might have the opportunity to work on my own hunting skills in between repairing the flying machines and setting up the camp.\n\nI wanted to take down a ferocious lion named Pitch. He's said to make his home south of here, near where the Wildgrowth Mangal meets the northern face of the Skyreach Pillar. If you can find the beast, would you bring back his remains? If the rumors are true, they'd make a trophy even Hemet will respect!",o="将匹奇的遗体交给湖边着陆场的塔玛拉·摇链。",oEN="Bring Pitch's Remains to Tamara Wobblesprocket at Lakeside Landing.",p="你找到匹奇了吗？",pEN="Did you find Pitch?",c="你拿到了！现在我只要把它做成战利品就可以了。这才是最难的部分——找出方法保存它，这样赫米特才不会嘲笑我费的功夫。",cEN="You got it! Now all I have to do is make a trophy out of it. That'll be the hard part -- finding a way to preserve it so that Hemet doesn't have a good laugh at my expense."}
Q[12655]={d="Aquí tenemos a otro dios de Zul'Drak que está un poco abandonado.\n\nLa estatua de Zim'Rhuk yace exactamente al norte. Conocido como \"El sabio\", Zim'Rhuk es también muy protector de sus tierras. Sus guardianes son muy duros con cualquier persona que no tenga la astucia de pasar sin que ellos se den cuenta.\n\nEsquiva a los guardias y presenta las ofrendas Drakkari ante Zim'Rhuk para poder gozar de su bendición.",dEN="There is another god of Zul'Drak that is being neglected.\n\nZim'Rhuk's statue lies directly to the north. Known as \"The Wise One\", Zim'Rhuk is also known to be very protective of his domain. He maintains guardians that deal harshly with anyone that does not have the wits to slip past them.\n\nAvoid the guardians and give the Drakkari offerings to Zim'Rhuk so that you will benefit from his blessing.",o="巫医库弗要求你在希姆鲁克的雕像前奉上10份达卡莱供品。",oEN="Witch Doctor Khufu wants you to present 10 Drakkari Offerings to the statue of Zim'Rhuk.",p="<你感觉到希姆鲁克并不相信你。他正打算要召唤一个守卫。>",pEN="<You sense that Zim'Rhuk does not trust you. He is attempting to call out to one of his guardians.>",c="<希姆鲁克认同了你放在他面前的供品，即便他知道那是从别人的尸体上取来的。>\n\n<如果你将供品献给他，他勉强同意赐予你祝福。>",cEN="<Zim'Rhuk acknowledges the offerings you intend to place before him, though he knows that you took them from the corpses of others.>\n\n<If you give the offerings to him, he reluctantly agrees to grant you his blessing.>"}
Q[12656]={p="<希姆鲁克对你再次躲过他的守卫感到印象深刻又泄气——至少现在是这样。>\n\n<把供品放在他面前，然后他就会再次赐予你祝福。>",pEN="<Zim'Rhuk is impressed and frustrated that once more you seem to have dodged his guardians. At least for now.>\n\n<Place the offerings before him and he will grant you his blessing again.>",c="<希姆鲁克在你心中灌入一个影像，他的守卫将你踩碎在脚底下。也许你该试着用更多祭品来讨好希姆鲁克。>",cEN="<Zim'Rhuk forces an image into your mind of one of his guardians squishing you beneath its foot. Perhaps you should attempt to appease Zim'Rhuk with more offerings.>"}
Q[12657]={d="Escucha bien, caballero de la Muerte, porque te estoy dando las palabras que iniciarán una guerra. He dictado mi sentencia final: muerte para todos. ¡Nadie puede oponerse tan descaradamente ante el poder de la Plaga sin represalias!\n\nComo me has servido bien en tu primera tarea, también debes hacerlo en la próxima. Lleva mi sentencia al alto señor Mograine en el puesto de comandante de Acherus, que se encuentra en el primer piso. Dile que dé comienzo al ataque.\n\nY cuando nos hayamos ocupado de la Cruzada, acabaremos con El Alba Argenta.|n",dEN="Listen well, death knight, for I give to you the words that will start a war. My final judgment has been passed: Death. To. All. None shall stand so boldly against the might of the Scourge without reprisal!\n\nAs you have served me well in your first task, so too shall you serve me in your next task. Take my judgment to Highlord Mograine at the command post of Acherus, found on the first floor. Tell him to begin the assault.\n\nAnd when the Crusade has been dealt with, we will finish off the Argent Dawn.",o="巫妖王要你带着他的命令去找黑锋要塞内的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼。\n\n使用巫妖王身后的传送器，转至大领主达里安·莫格莱尼所在的命令大厅。",oEN="The Lich King commands you to carry his orders to Highlord Darion Mograine at Ebon Hold.\n\nUse the glowing transporter behind the Lich King to reach Highlord Darion Mograine in the Hall of Command.",c="战争的号角将会迅速响彻整片大地，唤醒亡魂，召来天灾战争机器。让胆敢阻挡我们的敌人悲叹吧！\n\n你和你的同袍将领导这场冲锋，$N。当我再次俯视血色领地的时候，我的视野将被阿彻鲁斯的军团所掩盖。现在立刻开始向新阿瓦隆进军。",cEN="The horns of war will soon echo across this land, waking the dead and calling forth the Scourge war machine. Woe unto those that would stand in our way!\n\nYou and your brethren will lead the charge, <name>. When next I look upon the Scarlet lands, my sight will be obscured by the legions of Acherus. The march upon New Avalon begins now."}
Q[12658]={d="多里安将抓来的始祖幼龙交给我训练和喂养，这让我有了新的想法。嗯，我要拥有自己的宠物！\n\n不，我当然不要龙崽子。它们能一口咬断我的胳膊，才不要这样的宠物！\n\n往东北方走，穿过始祖龙的栖息地就是埋骨地了，那里生活着大群的血爪大鹏。我可不指望能驯化成年的大鹏，所以我要你从血爪大鹏的巢穴中偷些蛋回来，等这些小家伙破壳而出时，我就开始调教它们。",dEN="Dorian's had me training and feeding the baby drakes he captures, and it has gotten me thinking. I want a pet of my own!\n\nNo, not a juvenile drake. I don't want a pet capable of biting my hand off!\n\nHowever, in the Bonefields to the northeast of the camp, beyond the area dominated by the drakes, there's a large population of goretalon rocs. The grown ones are beyond hope of domesticating, but if you bring me the eggs from their nests, I can raise them from the time they hatch.",o="将7枚大鹏卵交给多里安哨站的苏特菲兹。",oEN="Bring 7 Roc Eggs to Zootfizzle at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你拿到那些蛋了吗？",pEN="Do you have those eggs?",c="噢，这些很棒！我已经厌倦了跟机械松鼠以及机械小鸡作伴了。如果有只关节不用上油的宠物一定很棒！",cEN="Oh, these are very nice! I've gotten so tired of robotic squirrels and chickens for company. It'll be wonderful to have a pet whose joints won't require oiling!"}
Q[12659]={d="行动现在开始，伙计！\n\n东北边赫布达卡的那帮巨魔就是不错的目标。他们养的破蝙蝠每天晚上都要骚扰我们，这下他们该尝尝报应啦！\n\n拿着，埃霍奈把他的宝贝小刀也借给你，千万要好好干哟。",dEN="I thinkin' it be time to do some scalpin', mon!\n\nThe trolls at Heb'Drakkar to the northeast should do nicely. With their fancy bats and attackin' us, they got it comin'!\n\nAhunae even give you his own knife so that you do the job right.",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈要求你使用埃霍奈的小刀拆下10名赫布达卡巨魔的巫毒头饰。\n\n他还提醒你，要先搜索过他们的 躯体之后再拆卸巫毒头饰。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga wants you to use Ahunae's Knife to scalp 10 Heb'Drakkar trolls.\n\nThe scalper reminds you that you should loot them first.",p="Ahunae sabe que no hay forma de que <name> desprese el cuero de tantos Heb'Drakkar tan rápido.",pEN="Ahunae know there be no way that <name> scalp that many of the Heb'Drakkar so quickly.",c="Ay, yo también pensaba que era muy divertido.\n\n¡<name> es mi tipo de <race>!\n\n¿Aún tienes mi cuchillo?",cEN="Aw, me thinkin' that too funny.\n\n<name> is my kind of <race>!\n\nYou still got my knife?"}
Q[12660]={d="巫妖王的爪牙竟敢将毁灭性的武器带进我的领地，我绝不能容忍这样的行径。\n\n我要你立即转至北方的天灾军团据点，摧毁他们带来的武器。我们不能让天灾军团在这片神圣的土地上再前进哪怕一步！",dEN="The Lich King's lackeys have dared to bring weapons of destruction into my domain. I will not stand for this.\n\nGo to their outpost to the north and destroy the weapons they would use against the land. We cannot let the Scourge taint another inch of these sacred lands.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要求你转至西北方的死亡之手营地，销毁4车不稳定的炸药。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you to go to the Death's Hand Encampment to the northwest and destroy 4 Unstable Explosives.",p="¿Está terminado, <name>?",pEN="Is it done, <name>?",c="Te lo agradezco, <race>. Estás demostrando ser un aliado digno.",cEN="I thank you, <race>. You're proving to be a worthy ally."}
Q[12661]={d="A estas alturas ya debes haber adivinado lo que he planeado.\n\nUtilizamos el interés de la Plaga en ti contra ellos. Vas a ir $gdisfrazado:disfrazada;. Sé que es como una sentencia de muerte, pero si no hacemos nada tu muerte está asegurada.\n\nDirígete al noreste hasta el Relicario de Dolor y quédate de pie en la plataforma mientras llevas tu disfraz. Una vez dentro de Voltarus, tienes que saber ganarte la confianza del comandante de la Plaga.\n\nCuando hayas completado tu misión, llámame con este cuerno e iré volando hasta tu ubicación para recibir tu informe.",dEN="By now you've probably guessed the details of my plan.\n\nWe're using the Scourge's interest in you against them. You're going undercover. I know it's likely a death sentence, but if we do nothing your death is a certainty.\n\nTravel northeast to Reliquary of Pain and stand on the platform while wearing your disguise. Once inside Voltarus, you must earn the trust of the Scourge commander.\n\nWhen you've completed your mission, blow this horn and I'll fly to your location to receive your report.",o="斯特凡你要你使用迷惑项圈进入沃尔塔鲁斯，并按照天灾军团指挥官的命令行动。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan wants you to use your Ensorcelled Choker to get into Voltarus and do whatever the Scourge leader there asks of you.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="¿Te has ganado la confianza de su comandante, <name>?",pEN="Have you earned their commander's trust, <name>?",c="Bueno, ahora... debo admitir que estoy más que un poco sorprendido de verte, <name>.\n\nCuéntame qué has aprendido.",cEN="Well, now... I must admit I'm more than a little surprised to see you, <name>.\n\nTell me what you've learned."}
Q[12662]={d="<Dagoda mira a Ahunae y suspira.>\n\n¿De verdad quieres encargarte de Heb'Drakkar? Reunir cabelleras no bastará. Tienes que acabar con su líder, Heb'Jin.\n\nEl problema es que está arriba, en la colonia de murciélagos, reuniendo fuerzas.\n\nToca su tambor y te aseguro que bajará volando. En ese momento tienes que matarlo.\n\nPuedes coger esta red que conseguimos de uno de sus rebanacabezas. Úsala para atrapar a su murciélago cuando aterrice. De esta manera no tendrás que luchar con los dos.|n",dEN="<Dagoda looks at Ahunae and sighs.>\n\nYou want to really deal with Heb'Drakkar? Collecting scalps isn't going to get the job done. You have to take out their leader, Heb'Jin.\n\nThe problem is, he's up on the bat rookery goading his forces on.\n\nBang his drum and I guarantee that he'll fly down. That's when you kill him.\n\nYou can take this net we got from one of his headhunters. Use it to trap his bat when he lands. That way you won't have to fight both of them.",o="希姆托加的元素驯服者德苟达要求你去杀死赫布金。",oEN="Element-Tamer Dagoda at Zim'Torga wants you to kill Heb'Jin.",p="他还没死。我从这里就听的见他在那里嚷嚷！",pEN="He's not dead. I can still hear him yelling from here!",c="¡Lo has logrado!\n\n<Dagoda te da un gran beso en la mejilla.>\n\n¡No tienes idea de lo mucho que me alivia esto! Defenderse de los trols por todos lados nos está agotando de verdad. Por no mencionar sus incesantes gritos.\n\nPor favor, <name>, elige lo que quieras de lo que tenemos para ofrecer.",cEN="You did it!\n\n<Dagoda gives you a big kiss on the cheek.>\n\nYou have no idea how much of a relief that is to me! Defending against trolls on all sides is really putting a strain on us. Not to mention his incessant yelling.\n\nPlease, <name>, take your pick of what we have to offer."}
Q[12663]={d="$n！\n\n你一定是收到我的礼物了吧！转个身，让我好好看看，伙计，让我仔细看看你……啊，你真令我自豪。\n\n我们历经千辛万苦才走到这一步，现在，你和我，都已经是巫妖王麾下最优秀的仆从了。\n\n你一定要紧跟着我的脚步，还有无数伟大的计划在前面等着我们呢，伙计。嗯，伟大的计划……但首先，我得给你好好补些课，对，补些课。要知道，自我们上次一别之后，发生了许多变故。\n\n去找高尔巴格，让他先带你在祖达克好好逛一圈吧。等你逛完回来之后，我就会把你该知道的所有事情都告诉你的。",dEN="<name>!\n\nYa musta received mah gift! Turn around, mon, lemme get a good look at ya... Ahh, ya make me proud.\n\nWe come such a long way, you and I, and now we be servin' da Lich King together.\n\nStick with me and big things be comin, mon. Big things... but first, we need to be gettin' ya caught up. So much been happenin' since I saw ya last.\n\nGo speak ta Gorebag for a tour of Zul'Drak. Listen for me and I'll tell ya all ya be needin' ta know.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你与高尔巴格交谈，并游览祖达克。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to speak to Gorebag and take the tour of Zul'Drak.",p="你跟我将会拿下古达克，老兄。",pEN="You an' me gunna take Gundrak, mon.",c="现在你知道我们要对付的是什么啦，老兄。\n\n下去花点时间研究这个地方，然后准备点战术。\n\n我很快就会派任务给你啦。",cEN="So, now ya be seein' what we be up against, mon.\n\nGo down, take some time ta learn da land, prepare some strategy.\n\nI'll be havin' some tasks for ya soon."}
Q[12664]={d="Ah, $gotro sumiso:otra sumisa; reh'ponde a la llamada del Rey Exánime.\n\n<Drakuru te huele.>\n\nRecién plagao', ¿eh? ¡Aún ape'tas a vida!\n\nLa'hga es la cola d'aquellos que buscan la bendición d'ese Rey Exánime. Tienes que levantah'te entre la multitú y demostrá qu'eres $gdigno:digna; p'a empleá el verdadero poder.\n\nObservando Zul'Drak, noté que tenías potencial. Así que pedí tu invitación.\n\nEl reh'to dependerá de ti…\n\nVe y habla con Bolsasangrienta p'a dá una vuelta p'o Zul'Drak. Hay mucho que hacer si tienes que llegar a ser $gdigno:digna; de algo.",dEN="Ahh, another supplicant answerin' da Lich King's call.\n\n<Drakuru sniffs you.>\n\nFreshly scourged, eh? Ya still be reekin' of da living!\n\nLong be da line of dem who seek da Lich King's blessings. Ya must rise above da masses and prove yerself worthy of wieldin' true power.\n\nLookin' down over Zul'Drak, I sensed potential in ya. I ordered your - invitation.\n\nDa rest be up ta you....\n\nGo an' speak ta Gorebag for a tour of Zul'Drak. Dere be much ta do if you're to be of any worth to me.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你与高尔巴格交谈，并游览祖达克。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to speak to Gorebag and take the tour of Zul'Drak.",p="你上过战场没啊，老兄？",pEN="Have ya taken in da battlefield yet, mon?",c="现在你知道我们要对付的是什么了，老兄。\n\n我要你下去，研究这地方，跟你的同胞混熟。准备好……\n\n很快就有很多事要你去做。不要令我失望！",cEN="So, now ya be seein' what we be up against, mon.\n\nI want ya ta go down, learn da land, mingle with yer bretheren. Prepare yourself...\n\nSoon, dere be much for ya to do. Don't ya be disappointin' me!"}
Q[12665]={d="Algo le pasa a Quetz'lun, la diosa serpiente alada. No sé qué pasa exactamente, pero sé que criaturas muy poderosas han invadido su altar.\n\nTe enviaré allí a lomos de una de mis crías a las que salvaste. Los dos podréis moveros de manera inteligente y con sutileza para descubrir qué ha pasado con Quetz'lun.\n\nMi cría te traerá $gsano y salvo:sana y salva;. Solo mantén los ojos abiertos.\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista;, dímelo y llamaré a una de mis crías para ti.",dEN="There's something wrong with Quetz'lun, the wind serpent goddess. What it is exactly I cannot sense, but I do know that her altar has been overrun with powerful creatures.\n\nI'm going to send you there on the back of one of my children, which you saved. The two of you will move swiftly and with great stealth to uncover what has become of Quetz'lun.\n\nMy child will see you safely back to me. Just keep your eyes open.\n\nWhen you are ready, ask and I will call one of my kittens for you.",o="哈克娅要求你去查明奎丝鲁恩的状况。你可以与哈克娅交谈，乘在她孩子的背上悄悄潜入奎丝鲁恩祭坛。\n\n完成侦察任务之后，回到哈克娅祭坛向她报告。",oEN="Har'koa has asked you to determine what has happened to Quetz'lun. Speak to her to be able to ride one of her children stealthily into the Altar of Quetz'lun.\n\nReturn to her at the Altar of Har'koa once you have done so.",p="¿A qué se debe el retraso, <name>?",pEN="What seems to be the delay, <name>?",c="谢谢你把我的小猫平安的带回来。\n\n其实我心中早就知道了，只是不想不愿去面对，但你的眼睛已经揭示了真相。\n\n然而，我还感觉到什么别的东西。事情并不是表面看起来的那样。",cEN="Thank you for bringing my kitten back safely.\n\nDeep down I knew it. I wanted to deny it, but your eyes have revealed the truth.\n\nNevertheless, I sense something else. All is not as it seems."}
Q[12666]={d="奎丝鲁恩恐怕已经死了，不过我可以感觉到，她的灵魂仍在祭坛周围的灵界中游荡着。我们必须找到一个可以让你和她直接沟通的办法。\n\n幸运的是，那些曾经负责供奉我的祭司身上带有一些神圣符印，这些符印可以帮助我们做到这一点。当然，事到如今，那些家伙已经不再崇拜我，即使你去把他们全都干掉，我也不会有丝毫的怜悯。\n\n将他们身上的神圣符印抢回来给我，我可以抽出其中的能量，协助你进入奎丝鲁恩那梦魇般的灵界。",dEN="Quetz'lun may be dead, but I can still feel her spirit lingering in the underworld at the altar. We have to find a way to get you to her.\n\nLuckily for us, I just happen to have a supply of former supplicants at hand who are no longer in need of their sacred adornments. Both my subduers and claws are likely to still be wearing them.\n\nBring the adornments to me and I'll draw upon their energy to enable you to cross over into Quetz'lun's underworld nightmare.",o="哈克娅要求你收集8枚神圣符印，并把它们带回哈克娅祭坛交给她。",oEN="Har'koa wants you to collect 8 Sacred Adornments. Deliver them to her at the Altar of Har'koa.",p="我从未想过事情会变成这样。达卡莱巨魔已经彻底迷失了。",pEN="I never imagined that it would come to this. The Drakkari are truly lost.",c="<当你把收集好的符印带到她面前的时候，猎豹女神看起来有些哀伤。>\n\n从前有段时光，这些东西都曾颇具意义……现在，让我们看看能不能把它们用在更好的用途上吧。",cEN="<The leopard goddess looks saddened at the collection of holy symbols that you have brought before her.>\n\nThere was a time when these meant something. Let's see if we can put them to better use."}
Q[12667]={d="Estás $gpreparado:preparada;, pero no estoy segura de que estés $glisto:lista; para lo que se avecina.\n\nCuando cruces la zona del altar de Quetz'lun, entrarás en el reino de los muertos. Por lo que siento, no será agradable.\n\nIntenta no distraerte con lo que veas ahí dentro. Solo sigue recto hasta el edificio del altar y busca el espíritu de Quetz'lun.",dEN="You are prepared, but I'm not certain that you're ready for what is to come.\n\nWhen you cross back over into Quetz'lun's altar area, you will enter the realm of the dead. From what I can feel of it, it's not going to be pleasant.\n\nTry not to be distracted by what you see in there. Simply head for the altar building and seek out Quetz'lun's Spirit.",o="转至奎丝鲁恩祭坛，寻找奎丝鲁恩之魂。",oEN="Seek Quetz'lun's Spirit at the Altar of Quetz'lun.",c="Gusano <race>. Dime, ¿por qué no debería aniquilarte donde estás parado?",cEN="<race> worm. Tell me why I should not annihilate you where you stand?"}
Q[12668]={d="我已经为我亲爱的高阶祭司们准备了特别的惊喜。但首先你要证明一下自己，为我的复仇打好基础。\n\n你还是想活命的，对不对？\n\n如你所见，我的信徒们非常喜欢待在这里，但现在他们该做出最后的补偿了。\n\n如果你愿意的话，请帮我一个小小的忙，$n。把他们引诱到我的灵魂之泉附近来，然后结果他们的性命。\n\n他们是如此美味，而且我向你保证，他们不会白白牺牲的。",dEN="I have something special planned for my favorite high priests. But first you get to prove yourself in laying the foundation for my revenge.\n\nYou do still want to live, yes?\n\nAs you have seen, my devotees are enjoying their stay here, but now it's time for them to make final restitution.\n\nDo me the smallest of favors if you would, <name>. Lure them near my soul fonts and then put an end to their existences.\n\nThey taste so delicious, and their sacrifice will not go in vain, I can assure you.",o="奎丝鲁恩之魂要你在她的灵魂之泉附近杀死12个巨魔，奎丝鲁恩崇拜者或蛇灵狂暴者都可以。\n\n完成任务之后回到奎丝鲁恩祭坛向她复命。",oEN="Quetz'lun's Spirit has tasked you with the destruction of 12 trolls, either Quetz'lun Worshippers or Serpent-Touched Berserkers, near her Soul Fonts.\n\nOnly after you have accomplished this should you return to her at the Altar of Quetz'lun.",p="¿Por qué regresas cuando tu tarea aún no se ha completado? ¿No te das cuenta de que puedo destruirte con tan solo un pensamiento?\n\n¡Vete ahora, pequeño <race>. ¡Completa lo que te ordené!",pEN="Why do you return when your task is not yet complete? Do you not realize that I can destroy you with but a thought?\n\nGo now, little <race>. Complete that which I commanded of you!",c="非常好。也许你真的有点用处。",cEN="Exquisite. Perhaps you will be of some use after all."}
Q[12669]={d="Toda la información que has traído concuerda con lo que sabíamos. Aprender de Drakuru y conseguir su confianza serán la base de tus futuras misiones.\n\nVuelve con él y haz lo que te diga. Haz todo lo que tengas que hacer para parecer $ghonesto:honesta;, $n. Estás haciendo un buen trabajo.\n\nAhora voy a añadirte otra tarea. Mientras estés luchando, tira este aditivo dentro de las calderas de añublo. Tendría que neutralizar a los agentes plagadores y volverlos inútiles.",dEN="Everything you've reported is consistent with what we know. Learning of Drakuru and earning his trust will lay the groundwork for your future missions.\n\nReturn to him and do as he says. Do whatever you must to appear sincere, <name>. A great deal is riding upon your performance.\n\nThis time I'm adding an additional assignment: While you're in the field, pour this additive into their blight cauldrons. It should neutralize the scourging agent and render the batch useless.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你回到达库鲁身边并听从他的指挥。\n\n在痛苦之匣一带对5只瘟疫之锅使用稀释药剂。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to return to Drakuru and complete any tasks he has for you.\n\nWhile at the Reliquary of Pain, you are to use the Diluting Additive on 5 Blight Cauldrons.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="¿Por favor, <name>, dime que no has delatado tu identidad....",pEN="Please, <name>, tell me you haven't blown your cover....",c="¡Buen trabajo, <name>!\n\nDiluir esos calderos no solo salvará vidas, sino que frenará el crecimiento de la Plaga en esta región.\n\nAhora ven, dime qué has aprendido sobre la estrategia de Drakuru en Zul'Drak.",cEN="Nice work, <name>!\n\nDiluting those cauldrons will not only save lives, it will slow the growth of the Scourge in this region.\n\nNow come, tell me what you've learned of Drakuru's strategy in Zul'Drak."}
Q[12670]={d="阿彻鲁斯的下方就是死亡裂口，我们对血色十字军作战的前沿基地。在这个平台上随便找一头天灾狮鹫，骑着它去向瓦拉纳王子报到。听从他的指挥，这样你或许能活着看到我们征服这片土地。",dEN="Below Acherus stands Death's Breach, the staging point for our assault upon the Scarlet Crusade. You are to ride one of my Scourge gryphons, located on either side of this platform, and report to Prince Valanar. Do as he says and you may live to see these lands fall before us.",o="转至死亡裂口，向瓦拉纳王子报到。",oEN="Report to Prince Valanar at Death's Breach.",c="你闻到了吗？\n\n<瓦拉纳王子嗅了嗅空气。>\n\n新鲜的肉……血色十字军的香味随风飘来。\n\n<瓦拉纳流下了口水。>\n\n抱歉，死亡骑士，我想你对我的美食观念一定不感兴趣。你是来工作的！来领导冲锋的！是的……我知道。巫妖王已经把我该知道的都告诉我了，$N。\n\n让他们血溅沙场的时刻已经到了。",cEN="Do you smell it?\n\n<Valanar sniffs at the air.>\n\nFresh meat... The scent of Scarlet Crusader wafts through the air.\n\n<Valanar salivates.>\n\nApologies, death knight, I'm sure you're not interested in my choice of fine cuisine. You are here to work! To lead the charge! Yes... I know. The Lich King has told me all that I need to know about you, <name>.\n\nThe time for bloodshed is now."}
Q[12671]={d="Va siendo hora de que tengamos aviones volando en este lugar. La profesora me ha pedido que investigue el extraño patrón climatológico que viene desde el noreste.\n\nEl tema es que necesitaré un copiloto si vamos a penetrar en territorio inexplorado. De ninguna manera voy a ir hasta allí solo.\n\n¿Qué dices, $gcampeón:campeona;? Puede que aprendas una o dos cosas. Una vez hayas aprendido a desenvolverte con los vientos del norte… podrás pilotar por donde quieras.",dEN="It's about time we had planes up and running in this place. The professor's been asking me to check out a strange weather pattern coming from the northeast.\n\nThing is, I'm going to need a co-pilot if we're going into uncharted territory. No way in hell I'm heading out there alone.\n\nWhat do you say, <tough-guy /hotshot>? You might learn a thing or two. And once you learn to deal with the northern winds... you can pretty much fly anywhere.",o="帮助飞行员维克完成侦察飞行。",oEN="Help Pilot Vic complete the Reconnaissance Flight.",p="¿Sí, <name>?",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你在上头救了我一命啊，伙计。飞得好！",cEN="You saved my life up there, buddy. Nice flying!"}
Q[12672]={d="我可以给你一个活命的机会。\n\n祭坛周围的地上散落着许多能量碎片，它们是用来支撑我身上的诅咒的。我要你帮我去收集一些碎片来。不需要太多，否则我身上的诅咒就会消散了。只要正好让我可以向我的先知复仇就行了。\n\n去吧，爬虫。在我改变主意前，马上去执行我的命令。",dEN="I will give you a chance at continued existence.\n\nThere are fragments of the power that fueled my curse scattered about the altar grounds. It is my desire that you collect some of them for me. Not so many that the curse will be lifted, but enough that I will be able to eventually make use of them to exact revenge upon my prophet.\n\nGo, insect. Run and do my bidding before I change my mind about letting you live.",o="奎丝鲁恩之魂要你收集10块灵界能量碎片。完成任务后返回奎丝鲁恩祭坛向她复命。",oEN="Quetz'lun's Spirit has demanded that you collect 10 Underworld Power Fragments. Return to her at the Altar of Quetz'lun only when you have done so.",p="Qué lástima que Har'koa no te enviara antes.\n\nAunque, pensándolo bien, ella y yo nunca nos llevamos bien.\n\nProbablemente retrasó tu ayuda el tiempo justo para que esto sucediera.",pEN="What a shame that Har'koa didn't send you along sooner. Then again, she and I never did get along.\n\nShe probably held back your help just long enough for this to happen.",c="这些行了。其实我也根本不需要用到它们。\n\n不过看着你听我命令跑来跑去也挺有趣的。",cEN="They'll do. Likely I won't even need them.\n\nBut it was fun watching you run around at my command."}
Q[12673]={d="Si quiereh ser $gdigno:digna; de los doneh del Rey Exánime, tienes que sabé sé $gun:una; gran líder, ¡que se gane el ‘eh'peto!\n\nTengo una tarea que refinará tus habilidades de mando, colega…\n\nMis esbirroh están entrenados en la cosecha de crih'tales d'añublo en lah tierrah que hay abajo, pero son vagos y lentos. Te vas a encargá de ellos, colega.\n\nCoge este cetro y demuéh'trales cómo se hace eh'te trabajo. Cuando estén bajo tu control, ¡haz que recolecten crih'tales!",dEN="If ya ever gonna be worthy of da Lich King's gifts, ya must learn ta be a great leader - one who be commandin' respect!\n\nI got a task dat gonna refine your command skills, mon....\n\nSumma my minions be trained ta harvest blight crystals from da land below, but dey be lazy and slow. You gonna be in charge o' dem, mon.\n\nTake dis scepter and teach 'em how to get da job done. When dey be under your control, make 'em harvest dem crystals!",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的指挥官达库鲁要你对荒芜恶鬼使用暗示节杖，并指挥它们采集7颗荒芜水晶。",oEN="Overlord Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to use the Scepter of Suggestion on the Blight Geists and then order them to harvest 7 Blight Crystals.",p="Ya tienes a mis subordinados en forma, <name>?",pEN="Ya got my underlings whipped into shape, <name>?",c="¡Los cristales se están acumulando como nunca antes!\n\nSigue así, <name>. Tendré más tareas para ti muy pronto.",cEN="Da crystals be pilin' up like never before!\n\nYou keep up da good work, <name>. I got more tasks for ya real soon."}
Q[12674]={d="现在你该去惩罚我那三个高阶祭司了，他们分别是穆弗努、图亚图亚和哈文尼。你可以在祭坛周围找到他们。\n\n带上这根妖术棒。我已经在里面灌注了我的怒火，它肯定会非常有用的。\n\n你只要使用它，然后去毁灭他们就行了。妖术会处理剩下的事。\n\n<奎丝鲁恩露齿一笑。>\n\n成功以后，我或许会放你走。如果你失败了，那就去死吧。",dEN="It is now time for you to punish my three high priests: Mu'funu, Tua-Tua, and Hawinni. You'll find them spread around the altar grounds.\n\nTake this hexxing stick. I've empowered it with my rage and indignation. I'm sure that it will prove potent.\n\nJust use it and proceed to destroy them. The hex will take care of the rest.\n\n<Quetz'lun displays a toothy grin.>\n\nSucceed and I may let you go. Fail and die.",o="奎丝鲁恩祭坛的奎丝鲁恩之魂要你对高阶祭司穆弗努、高阶祭司图亚图亚和高阶祭司哈文尼使用奎丝鲁恩的妖术棒，然后杀死他们。",oEN="Quetz'lun's Spirit at the Altar of Quetz'lun wants you to use Quetz'lun's Hexxing Stick upon High Priest Mu'funu, High Priestess Tua-Tua, and High Priest Hawinni. Once you have done this, slay them.",p="你以为我是个蠢蛋吗？\n\n他们还没有死！",pEN="DO YOU THINK THAT I'M A FOOL?\n\nTHEY'RE NOT DEAD!",c="<你面前的恐怖灵魂发出了一阵令人脊背发冷的笑声。>\n\n他们自找的。我还会再让他们体验同样的事，一次又一次又一次又一次……",cEN="<The terrible spirit before you lets loose a blood-chilling cackle.>\n\nThey had it coming. And I'll give them more of the same again and again and again...."}
Q[12675]={d="还差最后一步，就可以实施我的复仇大计了。你必须为这些能量碎片注入某位仍然健在的神灵的精魄，才能令它们发挥威力。我推荐你请求哈克娅的帮助。\n\n如果你能成功的话，那么当你返回这里时，就不会再进入灵界，而是返回我的祭坛所在的物质世界。我的子嗣和守卫者不会再攻击你，这样你就可以轻而易举地接近我的先知。",dEN="There is one last thing that is needed to enact the final revenge against my prophet. The power fragments you collected must be imbued with a portion of a living gods' spirit. You're going to need to beseech Har'koa for some of hers.\n\nOnce you've done that, when you return here, you will not come to the underworld. Instead, you will return to the physical world of my altar. My children and guardians will no longer attack you, and you'll be able to get to my prophet without having to worry about them.",o="转至哈克娅祭坛，请求哈克娅在灵界能量碎片中注入一丝她的精魄。",oEN="Deliver the Underworld Power Fragments to Har'koa and beseech her for a portion of her spirit. You will still find her at the Altar of Har'koa.",p="<name>, has vuelto.",pEN="You've returned, <name>.",c="我的部分精魄？\n\n<猎豹女神停下来想了一想。>\n\n这是非常过分的要求，尤其是为了复仇这样的目的，况且我已经因为我的镇压者而变的非常虚弱。\n\n不过，我也许知道一个方法。",cEN="A portion of my spirit?\n\n<The snow leopard goddess pauses a moment to consider.>\n\nThat's quite an expensive gift considering that this is for revenge and I'm already greatly weakened by the actions of my subduers.\n\nStill, I may know a way."}
Q[12676]={d="我们一直在尝试解开水晶之谜，因此你必须返回沃尔塔鲁斯，执行达库鲁的命令。\n\n每当你成功地完成一项使命，他对你的信任就增加一分，我们也就更容易揣摩他的心思。\n\n呃，我还有一项任务要交给你。达库鲁的天灾车给我们造成了不小的威胁，我要你炸毁它们。\n\n你要设法靠近那些天灾车，然后引爆炸弹。记得迅速撤离！不然很可能伤到你自己。",dEN="While we're working to discover the purpose of these crystals, we need you back in Voltarus doing Drakuru's bidding.\n\nEvery task you perform successfully gets you closer to him, and brings us that much nearer to knowing his mind.\n\nWhile you're there, I have another mission for you. Drakuru's Scourgewagons pose a significant threat. We need them destroyed.\n\nMake your way to the wagons and activate these charges. Once they're set, get clear! The explosion will expose you if you're too close.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要求你再去为达库鲁执行一项任务。\n\n除此之外，他还要你转至痛苦之匣，使用炸药束摧毁5辆天灾车。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to perform another task for Drakuru.\n\nAdditionally, you are to use the Explosive Charges on 5 Scourgewagons at the Reliquary of Pain.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="¿Tuviste éxito al limpiar esos carros de la Plaga, <name>?",pEN="Were you successful in clearing those scourgewagons, <name>?",c="¡Excelente!\n\nTu trabajo encubierto realmente ha valido la pena, <name>.\n\nAhora echemos un vistazo a ese cetro...",cEN="Excellent!\n\nYour undercover work has truly paid off, <name>.\n\nNow let's have a look at that scepter...."}
Q[12677]={d="¿Cristales de añublo? ¿Qué debe estar planeando este capullo de Drakuru? Seguro que está maquinando algo importante.\n\nContinúa cumpliendo con sus órdenes y quizá, cuando te tenga más $gvisto:vista;, te confesará sus planes. Mientras, tenemos que echar un vistazo a estos cristales.\n\nCuando estés en Voltarus, intenta coger algunas muestras de los cristales recolectados cuando nadie mire.\n\n¡Ten cuidado! Al coger esos cristales, puede que descubran tu disfraz.",dEN="Blight crystals?! What could this scumbag Drakuru be up to? Clearly, he's working on something significant.\n\nContinue to do his bidding and perhaps once he's more familiar with you he'll reveal his plans. In the meantime, we need to have a look at these crystals.\n\nWhile you're in Voltarus, try to get some samples of the harvested crystals when no one's looking.\n\nBe alert! Handling those crystals can trigger your disguise to fail.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你转至沃尔塔鲁斯,并完成达库鲁给予的任务。你还要从那里偷取5块采集到的荒芜水晶。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to go to Voltarus and complete any tasks Drakuru has for you. While there, you are to steal 5 Harvested Blight Crystals.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="Bienvenido de nuevo, <name>.\n\n¿Pudiste robar alguna muestra de los cristales de Drakuru?",pEN="Welcome back, <name>.\n\nWere you able to steal any samples of Drakuru's crystals?",c="¡Fascinante!\n\nInvestigaremos las propiedades de estos cristales de inmediato.\n\nAhora dime, <name>, ¿qué es lo último que se sabe de ese tal Drakuru?",cEN="Fascinating!\n\nWe'll look into the properties of these crystals right away.\n\nNow tell me, <name>, what is the latest with this Drakuru fellow?"}
Q[12678]={d="现在他们准备在死亡裂口外面背水一战，徒劳地想要挽救他们的马匹、矿洞、木材和平民。\n\n你将在天灾军团中学到第一堂军事课：恐惧！\n\n到南方的前线去，击败那些血色十字军。我们可以在死亡远征时用到他们。\n\n但最重要的是：要击败那些胆小如鼠的、假扮成普通人和农夫的预备兵，他们伪装成平民来偷取我们的萨隆邪铁箭矢。在他们弄坏这些宝贵的箭矢之前击败他们，并把恐惧深深埋入那些人的心底。",dEN="They make their stand now, outside of Death's Breach, futilely attempting to push us back in hopes of saving their horses, mines, lumber and citizens.\n\nThis will be your first lesson in Scourge warfare: TERROR!\n\nGo to the front lines, south of here, and destroy Scarlet Crusaders. Leave their corpses so that we may utilize them for the death march.\n\nBut most importantly: kill the fleeing villagers. Soldiers dying are an affordance, but villagers? That is what strikes fear into the hearts of man.",o="死亡裂口的瓦拉纳王子命令你击败10个血色十字军战士或血色农夫，以及10个海文郡预备兵。",oEN="Prince Valanar at Death's Breach commands you to slay 10 Scarlet Crusaders or Scarlet Peasants and 10 Citizens of Havenshire.",p="Esta es la sonata de apertura, <class>. La marcha de la muerte de la Plaga comienza con la erradicación de las líneas de frente.",pEN="This is the opening sonata, <class>. The Scourge death march begins with the eradication of the front lines.",c="你感觉到了吗，$N？那种感觉，就是在你体内流动的全新力量。凡人是体会不到这种感觉的。\n\n前线现在已经崩解了，魂尸将会完成剩下的工作，并且替拉苏维奥斯准备好场地。我们则把注意力转移到更具战术性的目标上。",cEN="Do you feel it, <name>? That sensation is raw power coursing through your body. Such a thing cannot exist for mortals.\n\nThe front lines are now dismantled. The geist will finish the job and prepare the grounds for Razuvious. We turn our attention now to more tactical targets."}
Q[12679]={d="遮天者都是无意识的构造体，它们唯一的用途就是：战斗！\n\n不过眼下有一个小问题……它们使用的是射程极远杀伤力极大的萨隆邪铁箭矢。但萨隆矿石只有诺森德才出产，而且产量非常有限！去帮我回收一些箭矢，我会好好奖赏你的。",dEN="The Sky Darkeners are mindless constructs with one purpose: KILL! Specifically, they are aiming to kill any man or woman that they see fleeing Havenshire for the safety of New Avalon. We certainly can't allow those cowards to make it to safety and then take up arms against us!\n\nThere is one slight problem. They use saronite arrows for maximum range and damage. Saronite, however, is a metal only found in Northrend, so supplies are limited! Retrieve those arrows for me and I will reward you handsomely.",o="死亡裂口的遮天者奥里索斯要你去回收15支萨隆邪铁箭矢。",oEN="Orithos the Sky Darkener at Death's Breach wants you to recover 15 Saronite Arrows.",p="他们发射的射角应该会让大多数的箭枝落在南边的海文郡农场那一带。",pEN="The trajectories they are firing at would have most of the arrows land at or near the Havenshire Farm, south of us.",c="做得好，死亡骑士！你的所作所为替天灾战争机器补给了弹药！\n\n啊，对了，你的奖赏——我答应过的。",cEN="Well done, death knight! You feed the Scourge war machine with your deeds!\n\nAh yes, your reward - as promised."}
Q[12680]={d="真是巧，离这处岗哨仅一箭之遥的地方就有一座十字军的马厩，里面有许多马匹。虽然他们守卫严密，但一个年轻勇敢的死亡骑士完全可以突破他们的防线，带走自己想要的东西！\n\n你从海文郡马厩选到一匹好马后就骑上它回来找我，我会想办法把它转化成死亡战马的。\n\n记住，$n，如果你被制伏了，就要想办法再回去弄一匹。记得当心那个管理员，基特里克！",dEN="How fortuitous it is that the Crusade has a stable full of horses a mere stone's throw from this post. Though they guard it tenaciously, an enterprising young death knight could break through their defenses and take what is rightfully <his/hers>!\n\nOnce you acquire a horse from the Havenshire Stables, return it to me and I will see what can be done about transforming it into a proper deathcharger.\n\nRemember, <name>, it's only stealing if you're caught. Watch out for that deranged stable master, Kitrik!",o="骑手萨拉纳尔要你从海文郡马厩中骑上一匹血色战马，然后回到死亡裂口，把马交给他。",oEN="Salanar the Horseman asks that you steal a horse from the Havenshire Stables and return it to him at Death's Breach.",p="你不想一直徒步行走，对吧？",pEN="You don't want to walk forever, do you?",c="接下来才是真正的试炼。你能够对一头不羁的战骑展现出多少驾驭的本事，然后用蛮力夺取你最想要的东西呢？",cEN="Now for the true test. Can you show mastery over an unbound charger and brutally overtake the thing that you desire most?"}
Q[12681]={d="达拉然的大法师伯塔鲁斯希望我们给他带回各种材料和辟邪物。索拉查盆地的原住民似乎特别迷信动物的肢体，取自血爪大鹏的扭曲的大鹏爪是他们的最爱。\n\n我没有资格评论关于这件辟邪物的传言是否属实，不过这里头总归是有些缘由的。\n\n血爪大鹏生活在东北方的埋骨地，以猛犸象的尸体为食。你能帮我收集一些爪子供大法师研究吗？",dEN="That Archmage Pentarus, back in Dalaran, will be expecting us to return with all kinds of reagents and talismans. It seems the locals are fond of animal parts. Twisted claws from the goretalon rocs are among their favorite.\n\nIt's not my place to say whether the rumors are true or not, but I've a feeling there's something here.\n\nThe rocs live in the Bonefields off to the northeast, where they feed on the corpses of old mammoths. Will you help me gather talons for the archmage's research?",o="将5只扭曲的大鹏爪交给多里安哨站的考尔文·诺灵顿。",oEN="Bring 5 Twisted Roc Claws to Colvin Norrington at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你有找到扭曲的大鹏爪吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any of the twisted talons?",c="<考尔文一脸钦佩地看着你带来的爪子。>\n\n这样就够了。伯塔鲁斯的说法是爪子越扭曲多节，法力就越强。我想大法师为这个营地付出的金币收回票价了。",cEN="<Colvin looks admiringly at the talons you've brought back.>\n\nThese will more than suffice. The gorlocs have a saying that the more gnarled the talon, the more power it holds. I'm sure the archmage will get his money's worth from this expedition."}
Q[12683]={d="El único material cáustico que queda en toda la Cuenca son esputos de hidra Olamarga. Tengo unos recipientes especiales para recoger esas cosas para las investigaciones del archimago Pentarus. Ahora, lo único que me queda es encontrar un valiente voluntario.\n\nTú pareces $gun:una:c; $c $gfuerte y aventurero:fuerte y aventurera;. ¿No te gustaría ganar un poco de dinero y ayudar a la causa de Dalaran al mismo tiempo?\n\nTodo lo que tienes que hacer es llevar este recipiente contigo hasta el lago Olamarga hacia el suroeste. Enfréntate a una hidra y usa el recipiente para recoger muestras de los esputos con los que te rocían.",dEN="There's no more caustic material in all of the basin than bittertide hydra sputum. I've got special containers to collect just such a thing for Archmage Pentarus' studies. Now all I need is a brave, um... collector.\n\nYou look like a hardy, adventurous <class>. How'd you like to make a bit of money and aid Dalaran's cause at the same time?\n\nAll you need to do is take this container with you to Bittertide Lake, to the southwest. Engage the hydra and use the container to sample the sputum they shower you with.",o="多里安哨站的考尔文·诺灵顿要你收集5份多头蛇唾液样本并杀死5只苦潮多头蛇。",oEN="Colvin Norrington at Dorian's Outpost wants you to take 5 Hydra Sputum Samples and kill 5 Bittertide Hydra.",p="你拿到样本了吗？",pEN="Did you get those samples?",c="¡Maravilloso! Aquí tienes tu pago, según lo acordado. Y, eh, un pequeño consejo: puede que quieras disfrutar de baños largos y calientes los próximos días si esa \"sensación de ardor\" persiste.",cEN="Wonderful! Here's your payment, as agreed. And, uh, a bit of advice: you might want to enjoy long, hot baths the next few days if that 'burning sensation' persists."}
Q[12684]={d="猛犸之神犸托斯前些日子亲手毁灭了自己，并将他那伟大的神殿也摧毁了。他宁可死，也不愿意让达卡莱巨魔窃取他一丝一毫的力量。\n\n现在我需要牺牲自己的一部分灵魂，因此需要一些外来的能量以支撑自身的延续。\n\n犸托斯自我毁灭的地方就在东北方，奎丝鲁恩祭坛的正北边不远。他的自爆在那里留下了一个巨大的坑洞，里面满是他的血液。\n\n给我带一些他的血液回来。",dEN="Mam'toth, the god of the mammoths, destroyed himself, and took much of his temple with him, rather than allowing his trolls to gain his power.\n\nIf I'm to sacrifice a portion of my spirit, I will need something with which to bolster myself.\n\nMam'toth left behind an enormous crater to the northeast, just north of the Altar of Quetz'lun. Within the crater his blood yet lives.\n\nBring it to me.",o="哈克娅要求你收集7份犸托斯之血，并把它们带回哈克娅祭坛交给她。",oEN="Har'koa has asked you to collect 7 Blood of Mam'toth. Return them to her at the Altar of Har'koa.",p="我希望有什么方法可以把犸托斯带回这个世界，但很可惜这种方法并不存在。\n\n我们只能持续对抗达卡莱巨魔，以纪念他和他所做的牺牲。",pEN="I wish that there were something that we could do to bring Mam'toth back to life, but there isn't.\n\nWe can honor him and his sacrifice by continuing the fight against the Drakkari.",c="非常好，让我们看看这是否有用……",cEN="Very well. Let us see if this works...."}
Q[12685]={d="复仇……复仇的时候终于到来了。\n\n<哈克娅低沉地叹了一口气。>\n\n把这只包裹里的东西带到奎丝鲁恩的尸体旁去，在她的祭坛上打开包裹，引导仪式。如果一切正常，她的灵魂将被重新拉回物质界，这样一来，她就可以从那个卑贱的先知手中夺回自己的力量。\n\n之后的一切就都指望你了，$n。你一定要在先知失去力量之后立刻杀死他，结束风蛇女神的梦魇。",dEN="This is what it has come down to... revenge.\n\n<Har'koa sighs.>\n\nTake this ritual kit and enact it near Quetz'lun's corpse upon her altar. If everything works properly, her spirit should be drawn into the material world where she will be able to reclaim her power from the prophet.\n\nThe rest will be up to you, <name>. You must slay the prophet in his drained state.",o="杀死虚弱的奎丝鲁恩先知，然后通知希姆托加的巫医库弗。",oEN="Slay the Drained Prophet of Quetz'lun and then inform Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga.",p="¿Qué te trae de vuelta conmigo, <name>?",pEN="What brings you back to me, <name>?",c="<巫医不可置信地摇了摇头。>\n\n听起来你十分惊险地从奎丝鲁恩的灵魂界生还了。\n\n我很高兴你去进行这个工作——我不知道我自己有没有勇气面对那种状况！",cEN="<The witch doctor shakes his head in disbelief.>\n\nIt sounds like you barely escaped Quetz'lun's underworld alive.\n\nI'm glad that it's you out there. I don't know if I would have had the courage to deal with that situation!"}
Q[12686]={d="白痴！蠢货！这是不能容忍的！整整一批的瘟疫菌株居然都变成了废物！\n\n达穆克那个混帐！饭桶！他本应负责保养好那些瘟疫菌株的，太令我失望了！\n\n这对你来说也是个不错的教训，$n。失败往往会像传染病一样迅速传播。发生第一次失败之后，你必须立刻抓住它，消灭它，否则，它就会反过来使得你被别人消灭！\n\n拿上这根能使我们天灾巨魔更加强大的节杖。你要用它杀死达穆克。那混蛋应该就躲在南边的什么地方。\n\n就让那条败狗用自己的性命给所有人提个醒吧。让达库鲁失望，就等于死！",dEN="Ignorance! Dis be intolerable, mon! My entire batch of blight be useless!\n\nDat mongrel, Darmuk! He be responsible for watchin over da blight. He failed me, mon!\n\nDis be a good lesson for ya, <name>. Failure be like a disease dat spreads. Ya gotta catch it and kill it early, before it be killin' you!\n\nTake dis scepter. It make my scourged trolls stronger. Use dem ta kill Darmuk. He be lurkin' down below just to da south.\n\nLet dat be an example to all, mon. Don't be failin' Drakuru!",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你转至痛苦之匣，对一名达库鲁的仆从使用强化节杖，然后使用它的技能击败达穆克。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to go to the Reliquary of Pain and use the Scepter of Empowerment on a Servant of Drakuru. You are then to use its abilities to defeat Darmuk.",p="¿Ha pagado Darmuk por su fracaso, <name>?",pEN="Has Darmuk paid for his failure, <name>?",c="Lo has hecho bien, <name>. Estás aprendiendo más rápido de lo que esperaba.\n\nVete ahora, descansa un poco. ¡Pronto te pondré una prueba aún mayor!",cEN="Ya done good, <name>. You be learnin' faster than I had hoped.\n\nGo now, get ya some rest. Soon I be givin' ya an even greater test!"}
Q[12687]={d="你送来的战马已经被送往暗影界。我的黑暗骑士将在那里训练它，然后把它强化成为一匹死亡战马。你觉得自己有足够的勇气进入暗影界去夺取亡灵战马吗？\n\n如果你愿意的话，我可以把你传送到暗影界，等你到了那里之后，去我们南面的空地上寻找黑暗骑士。为了得到你自己的死亡战马，你必须击败他，夺取他的死亡战马，然后回到死亡裂口来。成功之后，就使用骑手的召唤。",dEN="The horse you stole has been taken to the Realm of Shadows. It is there that my dark rider will slay the beast and raise it as a deathcharger. Do you think yourself brave enough to enter the Realm of Shadows in pursuit of the deathcharger?\n\nIf you accept, I will transport you to the shadow world. Once there, seek out a dark rider in the open fields south of us. To emerge victorious you must slay him, overtake his deathcharger and return it to Death's Breach. Issue the Horseman's Call should you succeed.",o="死亡裂口的骑手萨拉纳尔要求你去消灭阿彻鲁斯黑暗骑士，并夺走他的阿彻鲁斯死亡战马。\n\n如果你成功地将阿彻鲁斯死亡战马带回死亡裂口，就使用“骑手的召唤”技能召唤萨拉纳尔。",oEN="Salanar the Horseman at Death's Breach has challenged you to slay the Dark Rider of Acherus and take his Acherus Deathcharger.\n\nShould you succeed, return the Acherus Deathcharger to Death's Breach and use the Horseman's Call to summon Salanar.",p="¡Debes tomar el cargador de muerte por la fuerza, <class>!",pEN="You must take the deathcharger by force, <class>!",c="Has conseguido lo que la mayoría de principiantes no ha podido conseguir, $N. Por ello recibirás un buen premio.",cEN="You have succeeded where most initiates fail, <name>. For that you will be rewarded handsomely.\n\n<Salanar bows.>"}
Q[12688]={d="这群愚蠢的地精和他们的狗奴才竟然将这根水晶柱视为已有。我原本是来勘探水晶的，可就在我采集样本时，他们冲出来打倒了我，并拒绝让我返回营地。\n\n带我逃离这里吧，我们还可以顺路好好收拾一下这些暴徒！",dEN="These goblin goons and their minions have decided that they own this pillar and its crystals. I came here to explore the crystals and take samples, but they overpowered me and won't let me return to the camp.\n\nIf you'll help me fight our way out of here, we can teach these thugs a lesson they'll never forget!",o="护送工程师赫莉丝逃离斯温迪格林挖掘场，然后与奈辛瓦里营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里谈一谈。",oEN="Help Engineer Helice escape from Swindlegrin's Dig, then speak with Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",c="谢谢你救了赫莉丝，还陪她回来。她外出找水晶一直没有回来，我们实在很担心。",cEN="Thank you for freeing Helice and seeing to her safe return. We all started to get worried when she didn't return from her crystal hunting trip."}
Q[12689]={c="嗨！很高兴再见到你！\n\n我知道我们是朋友。我就知道！你是好朋友。不只是我们的，也是所有神谕者的。\n\n我看到你跟那些小狗人很要好！不死的东西说你以前是他的朋友？我不知道。不过你跟小狗人绝交了，对吧？现在只跟神谕者当好朋友吧？\n\n等等！别随便同意——你确定你不要跟小狗人当朋友了？",cEN="Hi! Really glad see you again!\n\nI knew we friends. I knew it! You good friend. Not just for us, but for all Oracles.\n\nI saw you bonk that puppy-man good! Undead thing said he your friend before? I not know that. You done with puppy-men though, yeah? Just Oracle friend now?\n\nI know you choose right! Thank you for saving us! Thank you, thank you!"}
Q[12690]={d="是时候进军古达克了，朋友。是时候让你去教训教训那些不知好歹的巨魔了！\n\n那群混蛋前几天攻破了我们的城墙，还将一整支军队驻扎在了北面。\n\n哈哈哈哈！\n\n简直是给天灾之火上面浇了一把油！我要把他们的酋长都抓起来，至于其它的蝼蚁……都无关紧要了！这将是我的宏伟计划中最重要的一环……\n\n拿着这根节杖，用它来号令我的憎恶。嗯，你可以带上所有的憎恶转至那群达卡莱巨魔的营地，把他们全部击败！等他们的酋长出现以后，我的宠物岩翼会把他们全部抓回来。",dEN="It be time we start our march to Gundrak, mon. It be time for me ta turn ya loose on dem trolls!\n\nDey breached our wall and put a whole army just north of us.\n\nHahaha!\n\nDey be fuel for da fire, mon! We gunna take da chieftiains an' kill da rest! It all be part of my master plan....\n\nYou take dis scepter and go command my abominations. Bring 'em to da Drakkari army and kill em all! When da chieftains come, my pet Shalewing gunna snatch 'em up and bring 'em here to me.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你对浮肿的憎恶使用命令节杖，然后利用它们的能力在冰冷裂口击败60名达卡莱裂颅者，并将3名达卡莱酋长引诱出来。\n\n只要击败足够数量的达卡莱裂颅者，酋长们就会出现。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to use the Scepter of Command on Bloated Abominations and then use their abilities at the Frigid Breach to kill 60 Drakkari Skullcrushers and lure out 3 Drakkari Chieftains.\n\nChieftains will appear when enough Skullcrushers have been slain.",p="¿Has machacado a los trolls, <name>?",pEN="Did ya smash da trolls, <name>?",c="做得好，老兄！\n\n我把酋长全都关起来了，而你带领着我的憎恶打败了他们的军队。\n\n该去庆祝一下了，老兄！",cEN="We done it, mon!\n\nI got da chieftains all caged up and you led my abominations to victory over their armies.\n\nIt be time ta celebrate, mon!"}
Q[12691]={d="这个石箱似乎被锁住了，看来要在锁眼中插入相配的钥匙才能打开它。\n\n那些石头卫士身上或许带有这把钥匙。",dEN="The stone coffer appears to be locked. It appears that a key fits inside a large stone keyhole.\n\nPerhaps one of the guardians in the vicinity has this key in its possession.",o="从索拉查卫士身上取得巨型石钥匙，用它打开造物者悬台上的古旧石箱。",oEN="Obtain a Huge Stone Key from the nearby Sholazar Guardians and bring it to the Timeworn Coffer at the Maker's Overlook.",p="这个石箱纹丝不动。",pEN="The stone coffer does not budge.",c="巨型石钥匙发出了一声低沉的喀擦声，然后石箱的盖子打开来，显露出里面隐藏的财宝。",cEN="The huge stone key turns with a deep grunt as the coffer lid opens up to reveal hidden treasure inside."}
Q[12692]={d="Vale, yo volver a la Colina Corazón Frenético para asegurarme que todos los Corazones Frenéticos saber lo que tú haber hecho por los wolvar y por Zepik. Tú gran $gcazador:cazadora; y ellos bobos por pensar que no.\n\nTú volver a la colina y hablar con el anciano Harkek… yo asegurarme que él saber que tú no $gtraidor:traidora; antes que ningún otro Corazón Frenético.\n\nGracias, $gcazador:cazadora; de exánimes.",dEN="Okay, I going back to Frenzyheart Hill to make sure all Frenzyheart know what you done for wolvar and for Zepik. You great hunter and they dumb to think you not.\n\nGo back to hill and talk to Elder Harkek... I make sure he knows you not traitor before any other Frenzyheart.\n\nThank you, Lich Hunter.",o="返回狂心岭，与长者哈尔卡克谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Frenzyheart Hill and speak to Elder Harkek.",c="再次见到你真好。我知道你不是叛徒，我很高兴瑟匹克证明了我是对的。\n\n我听说你现在是巫妖猎手了——真棒！你让哈尔卡克觉得很骄傲。",cEN="It good to see you again. I knew you not a traitor, I glad Zepik prove me right.\n\nI hear you Lich Hunter now - that pretty good! You make Harkek proud."}
Q[12695]={d="啊呀！索乌塞很可能在担心我们！你应该回去向他报个平安，好吗？嗯，告诉索乌塞所有的事情。\n\n我要在巫妖的尸体上找个东西——咱们回去再碰面吧！去吧去吧！回去再和你碰面！",dEN="Yay! Soo-say probably worrying about us! Maybe you go back to town and tell him everything okay? Yeah, go tell Soo-say.\n\nI going grab shiny ball thing from dead lich guy - I meet you there! Go go! I meet you there!",o="返回雨声树屋，与高阶神谕者索乌塞谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Rainspeaker Canopy and speak to High-Oracle Soo-say.",c="很高兴又见到你！当你没有马上回来的时候我们有点担心。\n\n亚鲁乌特抢在你之前回来了——他精力充沛，跑得很快。他告诉我你从那个巫妖手中救了他。莫乌德也告诉我你怎么拯救了苔行村。你真是个好人。\n\n我希望你在我们这儿待上一会儿。总是有事情要做。",cEN="Good to see you again! We worried when you not come back right away.\n\nJaloot beat you back - lot of energy in Jaloot, he pretty fast. He told me how you save him from lich thing. Moodle told me how you save mosswalkers too. You really nice.\n\nI hope you stay with us for while. Always something need doing."}
Q[12696]={d="谢谢你帮维斯雷修好了那架飞行器。\n\n你愿意再帮我们一个忙吗？西北方有一股不寻常的气流袭来。我已经指派了飞行员维克去侦察情况，不过他恐怕还需要一名副驾驶员。\n\n如果你觉得自己能胜任的话，就飞往湖边着陆场去找他吧。哦，记得告诉他，是我派你去的。",dEN="You did a good job helping Wes with getting that flying machine back up and running.\n\nIf you'd like to help us further, there is an unusual weather pattern coming in from the northeast. I have a pilot ready to work for me, but I'm afraid he needs a copilot.\n\nIf you think you're up to it, you can take the flight to Lakeside Landing. Tell Vic I sent you.",o="卡尔维特教授要你飞往湖边着陆场，与飞行员维克谈一谈。",oEN="Professor Calvert wants you to take the flight to Lakeside Landing and speak with Pilot Vic there.",c="教授派你来找我？好吧。",cEN="The professor sent you my way? All right."}
Q[12697]={d="一片混乱，$n！血色十字军陷入了疯狂。他们调动了新阿瓦隆外围的所有部队，在东面的圣光哨站设置了封锁。他们正不顾一切地掠夺海文郡矿洞中的所有资源，并把它们运送到停泊在海岸旁的护卫舰上。\n\n我们也去凑凑热闹如何？收割者戈提克——巫妖王的首席通灵师——已经来到了我们中间。他有一件礼物想要送给血色十字军，你去找他吧。",dEN="CHAOS, <name>! The Crusade is in a frenzy. They have diverted all forces outside of New Avalon to set up a blockade at Light's Point, east of here. They are desperately trying to strip the Havenshire Mine of all resources and load the cargo aboard the frigates they have docked on the coast.\n\nLet's stir things up a bit, shall we? Gothik the Harvester, grand necromancer of the Lich King, has graced us with his presence. He has a gift he'd like to bestow upon the Scarlet Crusade. Seek him out.",o="与死亡裂口的收割者戈提克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gothik the Harvester at Death's Breach.",c="虽然你们经历了千难万险才来到收割者的领域……等等。\n\n<戈提克看了看他的笔记。>\n\n抱歉，$r。老习惯很难改。\n\n那么，是瓦拉纳派你来的咯？我相信你一定相当能干。\n\n我确实有份礼物要给血色的杂种。这一定能让他们加快在矿洞的工作。",cEN="You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester... Wait.\n\n<Gothik looks at his notes.>\n\nMy apologies, <race>. Old habits die hard.\n\nValanar sent you, then? I trust you are somewhat competent.\n\nI do have a gift for the Scarlet dogs. One that is sure to speed up their work in the mines."}
Q[12698]={d="我从冰冷的纳克萨玛斯来到这里，以享受灵魂的盛宴，给我们的仇敌带来痛苦的打击——不过我的灵魂储备已经耗尽了。\n\n来，带上我给你的见面礼，把它带到东面的海文郡矿洞去，放在血色矿工干活的地方。用它将矿工变成被控制的矿工，等你手里有了一支小军队后回到我这里来。我给他们在灵魂容器里留了一块特别的地方！",dEN="I have come from the frozen heart of Naxxramas to feast on souls and deliver a vicious thrashing upon our sworn enemies - and I'm all out of souls.\n\nThis device I am about to give to you is a portable plague spreader. Take it east, to the Havenshire Mines, and unleash it near the Scarlet miners working inside. Use it to turn the miners into ghouls and return to me when you have a small army at your side. I have saved a special place for them in the vacuum cleaner of souls!",o="死亡裂口的收割者戈提克让你对血色矿工使用收割者的礼物，制造出5个被控制的血色矿工之后向戈提克复命。",oEN="Gothik the Harvester at Death's Breach has given you the Gift of the Harvester to use on Scarlet Miners. Create 5 Scarlet Ghouls with the device and return the ghouls to Gothik.",p="一点小提醒：矿工不是每次都会变成食尸鬼。有时候他们会变成想要杀了你的愤怒灵魂。",pEN="One small note: miners don't always become ghouls. Sometimes they turn into enraged spirits, hell-bent on killing you.",c="他们现在知道矿洞不再安全了。他们会很快撤出，把弱点暴露出来！",cEN="They now know that the mines are no longer safe. They will double their efforts in retreating, leaving their backs open to us!"}
Q[12699]={d="出发之前，还有个小问题要解决。你看，我怎么都找不到飞行器的钥匙。\n\n除了湖里面，我哪儿都翻遍了……就是没有见着。你能帮我个忙吗？替我去湖里找找钥匙吧。\n\n我可以把我的氧气筒借给你啊。虽然里面的氧气不多，但足够你用的了。",dEN="There's one little problem we have to solve before we head out. You see, I can't seem to find the keys to my flying machine.\n\nI've looked pretty much everywhere for them... maybe you can give me a hand. Only place I haven't looked yet is inside the lake.\n\nI'll even give you my very own air tank. It's almost empty, but it's got a couple of hits left.",o="在河流之心的湖泊中寻找维克的钥匙。",oEN="Look for Vic's Keys inside the lake at River's Heart.",p="¿Has encontrado algo ya, <name>?",pEN="You find anything yet, <name>?",c="太棒了！",cEN="Excellent!"}
Q[12700]={d="看样子只有新阿瓦隆和圣光哨站的十字军部队能够算得上是威胁了！进攻圣光哨站的血色舰队的时机已经成熟。\n\n矿洞那边发生的事情使得他们的士兵乱作一团。他们正在疯狂般清理那个地方，并撤回他们的战舰上。\n\n时机成熟了！瓦拉纳王子正想利用这次机会一举干掉血色舰队。马上去向他报到！",dEN="Only the Scarlet forces at New Avalon and Light's Point challenge us! The time to attack the Scarlet fleet at Light's Point has come.\n\nThe diversion at the mine has caused chaos amidst their ranks. They are frantically working to clear the area and return to their ships.\n\nThe time is ripe! Prince Valanar is seizing this opportunity to finish off the Scarlet fleet. Report to him at once!",o="与死亡裂口的瓦拉纳王子谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Prince Valanar at Death's Breach.",c="你做得很好，死亡骑士。你的同袍在对那些血色入侵者发起的第一波攻势中只有少数活了下来。只有像你这样最强的人才得以幸存。\n\n<瓦拉纳王子点了点头。>\n\n在我们的东边，过了海文郡矿洞，就是被血色十字军称为圣光哨站的海岸。有一千名士兵挡在我们和他们的船舰之间。很难完成？这不是重点……",cEN="You have served us well, death knight. Few of your brethren have survived our initial attack upon the Scarlet interlopers. You remain as one of the strongest.\n\n<Prince Valanar nods.>\n\nEast of us, past the Havenshire Mine, is the coast - called Light's Point by the Scarlet Crusade. A thousand soldiers stand between us and their ships. Insurmountable? Hardly the point..."}
Q[12701]={d="Con las prisas, la Cruzada cometerá un error fatal: olvidar comprobar los vagones de mina.\n\nTienes que volver a Mina Villa Refugio, al este de aquí, y localizar el vagón de mina que han colocado mis esbirros cerca de la letrina. Métete en el vagón de mina y un minero escarlata te llevará sin querer tras las líneas enemigas.\n\nUna vez dentro de uno de sus barcos, ¡usa los cañones contra ellos! ¡MÁTALOS A TODOS SIN PIEDAD!\n\nLlama al grifo de la Plaga desde el cañón cuando estés $glisto:lista; para volver.",dEN="In their haste the Crusade will make one fatal error: forgetting to check the mine cars.\n\nYou are to return to Havenshire Mine, east of here, and locate the mine car that my minions have planted near the outhouse. Climb inside the mine car and a Scarlet miner will unwittingly see to it that you are placed safely behind enemy lines.\n\nOnce aboard one of their ships, use the cannons against them! SLAUGHTER THEM ALL!\n\nCall the Scourge gryphon from the cannon when you are ready to return.",o="死亡裂口的瓦拉纳王子命令你去打倒100个血色防御者。",oEN="Prince Valanar at Death's Breach has commanded you to slaughter 100 Scarlet Defenders.",p="死亡骑士无所畏惧！",pEN="Death knights know no fear!",c="几分钟之内就把整个血色舰队扫平！我将会因此得到巫妖王的嘉奖！现在整个血色十字军只剩下新阿瓦隆的居民了。\n\n我会立刻把恶鬼和通灵法师派去海文郡。你负责把我的报告拿去给大领主！",cEN="The entire Scarlet fleet wiped out in a matter of minutes! I will receive a commendation from the Lich King for this! All that remains of the Scarlet Crusade now are the denizens of New Avalon.\n\nI'll set the fire starters and necromancers upon Havenshire immediately. You will carry my report to the Highlord!"}
Q[12702]={d="我打赌你猜不到又出了什么状况。\n\n错啦，和格利基克无关，也不是鸡舍的事。\n\n好吧，我骗你的。就是格利基克！鸡们又被他吓得跑掉了。愚蠢的格利基克！我的肚子已经饿得咕咕叫了。\n\n如果你需要其它猎手的帮助，告诉我一声就是了……鸡们就躲在附近。",dEN="I bet you not guess what happen again.\n\nNope, not Goregek or chickens.\n\nOkay, I lie. Goregek let chickens out again. Dumb Goregek and rumbly belly.\n\nLet me know if you need help from any of the hunters... they around here somewhere.",o="狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克要你去捕捉12只逃走的小鸡。",oEN="Capture 12 Chicken Escapees for Elder Harkek at Frenzyheart Hill.",p="通常鸡都不会跑太远……如果蓝蜂不会吃掉他们的话，也许下次干脆就让它们呆在外面好了。",pEN="Chickens not get far usually... if wasps not eat them, maybe we just let them stay on field next time.",c="你真擅长这个。\n\n也许我们哪天干脆把格拉克伊克丢进水里，你就不用再做这种事了。",cEN="You good at this.\n\nMaybe someday we just dump Goregek in river so you not have to do this no more."}
Q[12703]={d="Tú ser $gel gran cazador: la gran cazadora; de exánimes, ¿eh? Ser bueno tener un aliado Corazón Frenético tan bueno para la batalla. Quizás seas suficientemente fuerte para llamar a Kartak.\n\nGran batalla en el Bastión de Kartak al suroeste. Ir a matar lenguas-grandes Pavesa hasta conseguir bastante sangre del Oráculo. Traer sangre al altar en el Bastión de Kartak para invocar a Kartak para que se dé un delicioso festín de lenguas-grandes.\n\nKartak quedarse en tu cuerpo, si tú ser $gdigno:digna;... con los poderes de Kartak, tú matar más lenguas-grandes que en tus mejores sueños.\n\n¡Ir a matar muchos, $gcazador:cazadora;!",dEN="You the great Lich Hunter, eh? Good to have such strong Frenzyheart ally for battle. Maybe you strong enough to call Kartak even.\n\nBig battle at Kartak's Hold to southwest. Go kill spark big-tongues until you get good bit of Oracle Blood. Bring blood to altar in Kartak's Hold to call Kartak for delicious feast of big-tongue.\n\nKartak take your body if you worthy... with Kartak's powers, you slaughter more big-tongues than even best dreams.\n\nGo kill lots, hunter!",o="将1份纯净的神谕者的血带去卡塔克的祭坛，召唤出卡塔克。借助他的力量在祭坛附近杀死50个灵鳍鳄鱼人，然后向卡塔克要塞的萨满祭司亚克耶克复命。",oEN="Bring a pure sample of Oracle Blood to the Altar of Kartak to summon Kartak. With the aid of Kartak's shared powers, slaughter 50 of the nearby Sparktouched Gorlocs for Shaman Jakjek in Kartak's Hold.",p="好多大舌头可以杀！好好玩啊，嗯？",pEN="So many big-tongues to kill! So fun, eh?",c="仪式对你来说还真容易！\n\n你之后再回来多杀一点，好吗？",cEN="Ritual went so easy for you!\n\nYou come back later for more killing someday, okay?"}
Q[12704]={d="苔行村遭到攻击，我担心这是我们对雨水巨石不够好的缘故……或许是我们太贪心了吧。我们要向祭坛供奉更多的祭品！\n\n你还记得吗，就是上次要你找的那些闪闪发亮的宝贝……你能再帮我们弄些回来吗？如果你需要某个鳄鱼人帮忙的话，告诉我一声就是了。",dEN="Since mosswalker been attacked I worried maybe we not good to Great Rain Stone... we maybe too greedy. We need more treasures to offer!\n\nYou good at finding shinies last time... maybe you go look more around village for shinies? You maybe need one of good Rainspeakers for help. Just tell us who.",o="雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞要你带上一名同伴，挖掘并收集6份闪闪发亮的宝贝。\n\n记得与雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞谈谈关于帮手的事。",oEN="High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to take a companion to dig up and collect 6 Shiny Treasures.\n\nBe sure to speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy about securing the aid of one of your previous companions.",p="亮晶晶永远不够……雨水巨石对我们很好，我们也要对雨水巨石很好。",pEN="Never enough shinies... Great Rain Stone good to us, we need be good to Great Rain Stone.",c="好多好多亮晶晶！你很擅长这个。\n\n晚点再来收集更多，好吗？",cEN="So many good shinies! You good at this.\n\nCome back for more again later, yes?"}
Q[12705]={d="Los hombres cachorro haber estado atacando a Pavesa... nosotros tener que luchar o ellos atacar a otros Oráculos también.\n\nTú ser $gbuen amigo:buena amiga; de nosotros, así que igual concederte honor especial. Los magnos dejar a protector hace tiempo para santuarios... seguir aquí, pero no saber que algo ir mal hasta que alguien enredar con los santuarios.\n\nHombres cachorro tener cristales malos para crear problemas... Traer un cristal malo a Santuario de Rayos para que Soo-brada averigüe cómo ayudar.\n\nNo asustarte si Soo-brada tomar tu cuerpo... ser muy poderoso, así que mantenerte a salvo.",dEN="Puppy-men been attacking Sparktouched... we need fight or they just attack other Oracles too.\n\nYou been good friend to us, so maybe we allow you special honor. Great Ones left protector long time ago for shrines... it here still, but it not know something wrong til shrines messed with.\n\nPuppy-men down there have bad crystals for making trouble... bring a bad crystal to Lightning Shrine so Soo-holu know to help.\n\nDon't be scared if Soo-holu take your body... he very powerful, so he keep you safe.",o="从灵鳍湾附近的狼獾人身上取得1块被污染的水晶，将它带去闪电巨石处，召唤出索乌霍鲁。借助他的力量在神祠附近杀死50个狂心狼獾人，然后向灵鳍湾的唤雷者索乌米特复命。",oEN="Obtain a Tainted Crystal from the wolvar near Sparktouched Haven and bring it to the Great Lightning Stone to call Soo-holu. With the aid of Soo-holu's shared powers, kill 50 of the nearby Frenzyheart wolvar, then return to Lightningcaller Soo-met near the Great Lightning Stone.",p="谢谢干燥皮肤朋友的帮忙。你对我们很好。",pEN="Thank you for help dryskin. You very good to us.",c="索乌霍鲁很强，对吧？我很高兴他接受你跟他分享身体作战。\n\n他比较相信他遇过的人，所以也许你还可以再回来帮忙，对吧？",cEN="Soo-holu strong, huh? I very glad he accept you to share his body for fight.\n\nHe more trusting of people he met before, so maybe come back another time to help more, yes?"}
Q[12706]={d="<瓦拉纳王子交给你一份封起来的卷轴。>\n\n这是我们在死亡裂口获胜的全面报告。你去把这份报告交给莫格莱尼大人——他就在阿彻鲁斯里面。我已经把你的英雄事迹也写在了报告中。莫格莱尼肯定会好好奖励你的，$n。\n\n现在，出发吧！",dEN="<Prince Valanar hands you a sealed scroll.>\n\nThis is the full report of our victory at Death's Breach. You are to deliver this to Highlord Mograine - inside Acherus. I have made sure to include your heroics in the report. Mograine will undoubtedly reward you greatly for this victory, <name>.\n\nGo now!",o="将瓦拉纳王子的报告交给黑锋要塞阿彻鲁斯的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼。",oEN="Deliver Prince Valanar's Report to Highlord Darion Mograine in Acherus: The Ebon Hold.",p="当我派你出去的时候我很确信你不能活着回来，死亡骑士。也许你比我起初估计的更有潜力。",pEN="I was certain you wouldn't make it back here in one piece, death knight. Perhaps there is more to you than I first surmised.",c="<大领主莫格莱尼读完了报告。>\n\n整个血色舰队？\n\n<大领主莫格莱尼点了点头。>\n\n如此强大的力量，$n……我已经好几年没有看到这样英勇的表现……自从我的父亲手持……\n\n<大领主莫格莱尼摇了摇头。>\n\n这不重要……\n\n哦对了，你的奖赏，差点忘了。",cEN="<Highlord Mograine reads over the report.>\n\nThe ENTIRE Scarlet fleet?\n\n<Highlord Mograine nods.>\n\nSuch power, <name>... I have not seen such a display of domination in years... Since my father wielded...\n\n<Highlord Mograine shakes his head.>\n\nIt's not important...\n\nYes, your commendation, lest I forget."}
Q[12707]={d="埃霍奈听说你已经去过犸托斯巨坑了，朋友。犸托斯的子嗣们被激怒了，迫切地想要讨回公道！\n\n沿着东北这条路往上走到祖达克的更高一层，你可以在右边找到犸托斯祭坛的残馀部分。\n\n等你到了那里之后，在一头狂暴的猛犸象眼前晃一晃这枚犸托斯勋章，它就会冷静一段时间，这样你就可以骑到它的背上了。\n\n骑上它，用它去践踏那些犸托斯信徒吧！",dEN="Ahunae hear about your trip to Mam'toth Crater, mon. The children of Mam'toth are enraged and cry out for justice!\n\nFollow the avenue northeast up the steps to the next tier of Zul'Drak. On your right you will find what's left of the Altar of Mam'toth.\n\nWhen you get there, flash this Medallion of Mam'toth in front of the eyes of one of the enraged mammoths. It'll calm down for a little while, letting you hop on its back.\n\nRide it around, trampling all of the Mam'toth disciples that you can find!",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈希望你使用犸托斯勋章让被激怒的猛犸象冷静下来，然后骑乘它去消灭12个犸托斯信徒。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga wants you to use the Medallion of Mam'toth to calm and ride an Enraged Mammoth. You are then to trample 12 Mam'toth Disciples to death.",p="什么？你已经完成了？\n\n你已经对那些可悲的冰巨魔展现毛茸茸的正义了吗？",pEN="What? You done already?\n\nDid you enact wooly justice upon those sorry ice trolls?",c="我们替受害者报了一箭之仇，老兄！",cEN="Score one for the victims, mon!"}
Q[12708]={d="我知道你正要转至东北方的佐尔玛兹要塞，$c。你到了那边以后，顺便帮我个忙，干掉督军手下的那些特殊守卫。\n\n那些被称为魔化蒂基面具战士的家伙，正如其名，具备强大的实力，对我们构成了显着的威胁。如果达卡莱巨魔能够大量生产出这种战士，恐怕我们很快就只能举白旗投降了。\n\n让我们来共同证明这种战士不堪一击，根本不值得大批量生产吧，怎么样？",dEN="I know that you're headed up to the Zol'Maz Stronghold to the northeast, <class>. While you're there, I need you to deal with the warlord's special guardians.\n\nThe enchanted tiki warriors, as they're called, represent a very real threat. If the Drakkari were to mass produce them, we'd quickly be overrun.\n\nLet's you and I demonstrate that they're not worth the effort to create, shall we?",o="希姆托加的元素驯服者德苟达要求你消灭12名魔化蒂基面具战士。",oEN="Element-Tamer Dagoda at Zim'Torga has asked you to destroy 12 Enchanted Tiki Warriors.",p="想必你不可能那么快就解决了全部的魔化蒂基面具战士吧？",pEN="Surely you couldn't have dealt with all of the enchanted tiki warriors so quickly?",c="这样应该可以让他们掂量一下要不要量产这种东西了。想象一下，如果和那玩意组成的军队作战真叫人发抖。\n\n<元素驯服者沉思了片刻。>\n\n我猜应该就跟对付无尽的天灾军团一样。",cEN="That should make them think twice about making more of those things. I shudder to think what it would be like to have to fight an army of those things.\n\n<The element-tamer is thoughtful for a moment.>\n\nI guess it would be just like fighting the endless waves of the Scourge."}
Q[12709]={d="很抱歉打扰你，$n。我听说你可能会转至东北边的佐尔玛兹要塞。对我们来说，你的这趟冒险也许是一个收集达卡莱巨魔文物的大好机会。\n\n据我所知，那个达卡莱督军十分多疑，因此，他用妖术保护着要塞里面所有保存着重要东西的箱子。不过，据说他手下的那些蒂基面具战士身上带有可以解除妖术的物品，但我也不太确定这一点。\n\n如果你有时间帮我弄几只箱子回来，我一定会好好酬谢你的。",dEN="Pardon me, <name>. I'm given to understand that you might be heading northeast up to the Zol'Maz Stronghold. Such a trip presents a great opportunity for us to conclude our Drakkari goods gathering.\n\nAs I have come to know, the Drakkari warlord is extremely paranoid. He's had all of his caches at the stronghold hexed with dire magic. Rumor has it that his tiki warriors carry the cure, but who can say?\n\nIf you could find the time to acquire some of those goods, I would be most appreciative.",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼要求你为他夺取12只佐尔玛兹要塞宝箱。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga has asked you to acquire 12 Zol'Maz Stronghold Caches.",p="也许在我们谈话的此刻你的包裹里就装着宝箱？",pEN="Perhaps you carry the caches within your pack even as we speak?",c="¡Mira todo eso!\n\nFíjate bien, <name>. Esta pieza que has recuperado ilustra claramente que los drakkari se dieron cuenta del debilitamiento de la tierra que la Plaga causó con su presencia.\n\nEl señor de la guerra se sintió obligado a aprovechar la oportunidad que esto presentaba. Presionó a los profetas para que mataran a sus dioses en un esfuerzo por controlar el poder y luchar contra las fuerzas del Reyllich.\n\nDe cualquier modo, estaban condenados. ¡Sin querer, eligieron ser el instrumento de su propia destrucción!",cEN="Just look at all of that!\n\nSee here, <name>. This piece you recovered vividly illustrates that the Drakkari became aware of the weakening of the land that the Scourge caused by their presence.\n\nThe warlord felt compelled to take the opportunity this presented. He pushed the prophets to kill their gods in an effort to control the power and fight back against the Lich King's forces.\n\nEither way they were doomed. They inadvertently chose to be the instrument of their own destruction!"}
Q[12710]={d="干得很不错，$n。\n\n你再次证明了我没有看走眼！现在，你也明白为什么我能获得巫妖王陛下的祝福了，因为我很少看走眼……\n\n现在，是时候把主人的计划全盘告诉你啦，朋友。\n\n你将看着我们是如何一步步将蝗虫一般的达卡莱巨魔扫出这一地区，并在古达克内获取属于我们自己的地位。\n\n带上这根权杖，它代表着我对你的信任。有了它，你就可以不受任何限制地进入上面的密室，哦……对了，别忘了好好观赏一下我们的秘密武器。",dEN="Ya doin' well, <name>.\n\nYou be provin' dat I got an eye for talent! Now ya see why da Lich King gave me his blessing....\n\nDa time has come for me to reveal my master plan to ya, mon.\n\nNow you be seein' how we gunna sweep through da swarms of Drakkari trolls to take our rightful place in da great palace of Gundrak.\n\nTake dis scepter, mon. It be a token of my trust in ya. With it, you be able ta access my upper chamber and witness for yourself our secret weapons.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你通过传送器转至他的上层密室。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to take the teleporter to his upper chamber.",p="¿Has ido ya a presenciar mis creaciones, <name>?",pEN="Have ya gone ta witness my creations, <name>?",c="Así que, ahí lo tienes, mon.\n\nEstaremos creando el ejército de la Plaga definitivo para servir al Reyllich. ¡Él estará muy complacido!\n\nQuédate con el cetro, <name>. Vas a necesitarlo para comandar mi ejército en batalla....\n\n¡Pronto!",cEN="So, there ya have it, mon.\n\nWe be makin' da ultimate scourge army ta serve da Lich King. He gunna be most pleased!\n\nYou keep da scepter, <name>. You gunna be needin' it ta command my army in battle....\n\nSoon!"}
Q[12711]={c="信箱上面放着几封难以辨认的信件和卷轴。没人要……\n\n也许你该看看里面写了什么？",cEN="Atop the mailbox are several illegible letters and scrolls. Useless...\n\nPerhaps you should check inside?"}
Q[12712]={d="$n，现在我们需要找到那把钥匙，才能解开束缚着犀牛之神阿卡里的锁链。他现在状况非常危险，随时都有可能被巨魔们击败并夺走全身的神力。\n\n那把钥匙，应该就在达卡莱巨魔的督军佐尔玛兹手中。他听说了你的事情之后，已经和他的手下躲进了东北方阶梯之上的要塞里。\n\n这名督军非常强大，你或许需要一些协助才能将其击败。若你能先击败他的手下，并将他们的蒂基面具、剑和巫术这三者融合起来的话，就可以在挑战他本人时召唤到所需的助力。",dEN="<name>, we need a key to unlock the chains of the rhino god, Akali. Even now he is being prepared for the slaughter.\n\nThe Drakkari warlord, Zol'Maz, carries the key. Hearing of your exploits, he has secluded himself and his family at their stronghold up the steps to the northeast.\n\nThe warlord is strong and you will need help. If you were to combine the tiki, sword and incantation of his family members, you would be able to summon such help as you challenge him before his home's gate.",o="希姆托加的哈克娅要求你去夺取督军佐尔玛兹的钥匙。",oEN="Har'koa at Zim'Torga has asked you to acquire the Key of Warlord Zol'Maz.",p="你要不计代价取得督军的钥匙，这件事的重要性我不想一而再再而三的强调了。",pEN="I cannot stress how important it is that you acquire the warlord's key no matter the cost.",c="如果我没有让你把钥匙带回来，就这么直接转至古达克的话就更好了。\n\n然而，我想你最好还是先听听我要告诉你的话。",cEN="It might have been better if I hadn't asked you to bring it back here instead of heading directly to Gundrak.\n\nHowever, I think that it's best that you hear what else I have to say first."}
Q[12713]={d="好了，间谍游戏也该到此结束了，$n。\n\n你带来的情报具备非常重要的价值，现在，我们必须趁达库鲁全面展开计划之前阻止他，并将他杀死，以绝后患。\n\n你手里的这根节杖已经被我们全面改造过了。等到时机合适的时候，你就对达库鲁的瘟血巨魔释放出这根节杖中的能量。这也是你可以击败他的唯一方式。\n\n祝你好运。",dEN="The time has come to end this charade, <name>.\n\nAs valuable as your information has been, we must bring Drakuru down and bring his project to an end before his freaks are unleashed.\n\nWe've modified your scepter for the job. When the time is right, you will be able to use it on Drakuru's Blightbloods and turn them against him. It's your only hope of defeating him.\n\nFight well.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要求你击败达库鲁。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch wants you to defeat Drakuru.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="¿Te has enfrentado a Drakuru en batalla, <name>?",pEN="Have you faced Drakuru in battle, <name>?",c="所以，我们成功了。\n\n我们还有很多事要做，但是此地的工作会因为你的努力而轻松许多。\n\n请收下这个象征我们谢意的礼物。",cEN="So, it is done.\n\nWe still have much to do, but our work here will be much more manageable thanks to your efforts.\n\nPlease accept this as a token of our gratitude."}
Q[12714]={d="是巫妖王的意志在驱使我们前进，$n。没有谁比死亡骑士更清楚这一点了。本质上，我们是依靠他的意志而存在的。你肯定听到过他对你说话，侵入你的思想……\n\n你现在能听到吗？也许对你来说还为时过早。\n\n<莫格莱尼闭上了双眼，对某个你看不见的人点了点头。>\n\n遵命，我的主人。\n\n$n，你现在必须回到死亡裂口，向瓦拉纳王子报到。这是巫妖王的命令！",dEN="It is the will of the Lich King that drives us onward, <name>. None are more aware of this than death knights. Our very existence is intrinsically tied to his consciousness. Surely you have heard him speak to you - invading your thoughts...\n\nCan you hear him now? Perhaps it is too early for you.\n\n<Mograine closes his eyes and nods to an unseen host.>\n\nYes, my lord. It will be done.\n\n<name>, you are to return to Death's Breach and report to Prince Valanar. The Lich King commands it!",o="回到死亡裂口，向瓦拉纳王子报到。",oEN="Return to Death's Breach and report to Prince Valanar.",c="海文郡是我们的了！成千的尸首散布在地上，耐心地等候着新生。我们现在要以觉醒的天灾之力打击我们的敌人！\n\n食尸鬼已经开始攻击新阿瓦隆了。我们的军队已经移到它们的后方，并占领了追忆墓穴。",cEN="Havenshire is ours! A thousand corpses litter the ground, patiently awaiting rebirth. We strike now at our enemy with the awakened strength of the Scourge!\n\nThe ghouls have already begun their assault upon New Avalon. Our forces have moved in behind them and taken the Crypt of Remembrance."}
Q[12715]={d="我们已经开始向血色十字军的最后堡垒发动了进攻。在我们努力加固新的前线基地——追忆墓穴的同时，我们的食尸鬼正在消耗着十字军的外围防线。\n\n勇敢地向南面进发，在新阿瓦隆附近找到那座墓穴，然后向我亲爱的兄弟凯雷塞斯王子报到吧。\n\n他对你的到来充满着期待。\n\n做好准备，$n，也许你即将目睹天灾军团下一阶段的攻势：征服！\n\n出发吧，死亡骑士！",dEN="The attacks upon the gates of the last Scarlet bastion have begun. Our ghouls are wearing the Crusade's front lines down while we labor to fortify our new forward base, the Crypt of Remembrance.\n\nVenture south to the crypt, which borders New Avalon, and report to my dear brother, Prince Keleseth.\n\nHe will be expecting you.\n\nPrepare yourself, <name>, for you are about to witness the next stage of Scourge warfare: DOMINATION!\n\nRide now, death knight!",o="向追忆墓穴的凯雷塞斯王子报到。",oEN="Report to Prince Keleseth at the Crypt of Remembrance.",c="向你问好，死亡骑士。我是凯雷塞斯王子，诺森德东南支队的领导者。巫妖王要利用我的能力来终结这些挑战天灾军团的凡人。就像巫妖王要求我的所有事情一样，我很乐意遵从。当然，能满足我饥渴的无尽灵魂也使得这份工作更加甜美，你不这么认为吗？",cEN="Hail, death knight. I am the blood lord, Keleseth, ruler of the southeastern reaches of Northrend. The Lich King has sought to utilize my talents in ending this mortal affront to the Scourge. As with all things the Lich King asks of me, I am happy to oblige. Of course, a sea of endless souls to sate my thirst certainly sweetened the deal, don't you think?"}
Q[12716]={d="¡Mira esta plantación de calabazas! ¿Notas que falte algo? Claro que no, ¡como eres $gtonto:tonta;...! Tu cerebro fue probablemente lo primero que se te murió.\n\n<Noth suspira.>\n\nMe han ordenado llenar una caldera de peste. Tú me ayudarás. \n\nNada más pasar las puertas de Nuevo Avalon, está la posada. Entra y roba una caldera vacía. Luego ve a la forja, también cerca del portal, y roba algunas cadenas de hierro. Tráeme todo aquí junto con las 10 calaveras de cruzado. ¿También tengo que decirte dónde las puedes encontrar?",dEN="Look at this pumpkin patch! Notice anything missing? Of course you don't, because you're a moron! Your brain was probably the first thing to die.\n\n<Noth sighs.>\n\nI have been commanded to put together a plague cauldron. You will help me.\n\nDirectly inside the gate of New Avalon is the inn. Enter the inn and steal an empty cauldron. Then go to the forge, also near the gate, and steal some iron chains. Bring those back to me along with 10 Crusader skulls. Do I need to tell you where to get those too?",o="药剂师诺斯要求你交给他一口空锅、一条铁链和10块十字军徽记。",oEN="Noth the Plaguebringer has requested that you bring him 1 Empty Cauldron, 1 Iron Chain and 10 Crusader Skulls.",p="你收集到我要的材料没有？",pEN="Have you gathered the materials I requested?",c="太完美了！现在给我一点时间把东西架设好。",cEN="Perfect! Now give me a moment to get things set up."}
Q[12717]={d="天灾之锅已经准备就绪，随时都可以使用！\n\n死亡骑士，现在让我简短地介绍一下天灾之锅。锅中散发出的气体对于活人来说是致命的，不过对于天灾来说正好相反：他们从死亡中获取力量，因此浸染在天灾之锅中的时间越长，就会变得越强大。\n\n拿上这些十字军徽记，把它们扔进锅里。你会对它的结果感到满意的。",dEN="The cauldron is ready to begin spewing its foul corruption across the land!\n\nNow, death knight, a brief lesson in plague cauldrons. The gas that the cauldron emits is deadly to the living, but empowers Scourge. As with all Scourge creations, it feeds off of death and grows stronger the longer it feeds.\n\nTake these Crusader skulls and drop them in the cauldron. You will be quite happy with the results.",o="将一堆十字军徽记放入天灾之锅。",oEN="Place the Pile of Crusader Skulls inside the Plague Cauldron.",p="天灾之锅一动也不动。",pEN="The plague cauldron stands idle.",c="当你把颅骨放进去的时候，天灾之锅突然跳动了起来。\n\n稍后几瓶装着黑色液体的小药瓶浮了上来。",cEN="The plague cauldron jumps to life when the skulls are placed inside.\n\nAfter a few seconds some vials of dark liquid float to the top."}
Q[12718]={p="天灾之锅不断的冒泡翻搅着有毒的液体，朝四周喷洒着浓浊的气体。\n\n你还有更多的十字军颅骨可以放进去吗？",pEN="The plague cauldron bubbles and churns its toxic brew, spewing a thick gas all around.\n\nDo you have more Crusader skulls to place inside?",c="当你把颅骨放进去的时候，天灾之锅突然跳动了起来。\n\n稍后几瓶装着黑色液体的小药瓶浮了上来。",cEN="The plague cauldron jumps to life when the skulls are placed inside.\n\nAfter a few seconds, the plague cauldron grants you the dark and frothy splendor of Noth's Special Brew."}
Q[12719]={d="没有什么能比完全歼灭敌人更令人满足的了，$n。不过想要做到这点，只靠几百个无脑怪物进攻新阿瓦隆的前门是远远不够的。我们必须渗入内部，除掉他们的官员。必须得让他们知道：没人可以逃出天灾的掌心！\n\n转至西南面的新阿瓦隆市政厅，击败在那里发号施令的家伙。在市政厅里找到户籍册，把它带回来交给我。",dEN="Nothing less than total annihilation will suffice, <name>. To that end, a few hundred mindless ghouls assaulting the front gate of New Avalon will not do. We must infiltrate the inner sanctum and dispose of their officials. They must be shown that no one can escape the Scourge's grasp!\n\nMake your way to the New Avalon Town Hall, southwest of here, and assassinate the mayor. Search the building for the New Avalon registry and bring it to me.",o="追忆墓穴的凯雷塞斯王子命令你去击败奎比镇长，并找到新阿瓦隆户籍册。",oEN="Prince Keleseth at the Crypt of Remembrance has ordered you to kill Mayor Quimby and recover the New Avalon Registry.",p="让他们无处可逃！",pEN="There is nowhere to run!",c="El registro nos contará muchas cosas sobre los insectos Escarlatas.\n\n<Keleseth echa un vistazo rápido a las páginas del registro.>\n\nDatos sobre muertes, nacimientos, pero lo más importante, movimientos.\n\nMira aquí, $n, ya han enviado estas naves fuera. Déjame ver aquí… ¿Hacia dónde se dirigen?\n\n¿QUÉ? Es imposible. ¡Se dirigen hacia Rasganorte!\n\nJunto a las coordenadas figuran las palabras \"Alba Carmesí\".",cEN="The registry will tell us many things about the Scarlet insects.\n\n<Keleseth flips through the pages of the registry.>\n\nDeath rates, births, but most importantly, movement.\n\nLook here, <name>, they have already sent three vessels abroad. Let me see here... Where are they headed?\n\n<Keleseth mutters something about latitude and longitude under his breath as he calculates the route.>\n\nWHAT? This is impossible. They sail to Northrend!\n\nBeside the coordinates are the words: \"Crimson Dawn.\""}
Q[12720]={d="En mis viajes por el mundo, he descubierto bastantes cosas interesantes. Por ejemplo, ¿sabías que con el coraje apropiado se pueden extraer todas las verdades que un hombre se atreve a esconder? Por suerte, tengo de casualidad algo de coraje a mano.\n\n<Keleseth saca algo de una caja ornamentada con joyas.>\n\nEstos son mis \"persuasores\". Póntelos y llévalos al campo, caballero de la Muerte. Aplica los extremos puntiagudos a los soldados del Nuevo Avalon y descubre la verdad sobre este \"Alba Carmesí.\"",dEN="In my travels across this world I have made several interesting discoveries. For instance, did you know that with the proper amount of encouragement one can extract all the truths that a man dares hide? As luck would have it, I happen to have some encouragement on hand.\n\n<Keleseth pulls something out of an ornately jeweled box.>\n\nThese are my \"persuaders.\" Equip them and take to the field, death knight. Apply the pointy ends to the soldiers of New Avalon. Discover the truth about this \"Crimson Dawn.\"",o="El príncipe Keleseth de la Cripta de los Recuerdos te ha ordenado que descubras la verdad sobre el \"Alba Carmesí\".\n\nSaca los persuasores de Keleseth de la caja ornamentada con joyas y úsalos para \"persuadir\" a la Cruzada Escarlata para que hable.",oEN="Prince Keleseth at the Crypt of Remembrance has ordered you to discover the truth about the \"Crimson Dawn.\"\n\nRemove Keleseth's Persuaders from the Ornately Jeweled Box and use them to \"persuade\" the Scarlet Crusade into talking.",p="对血色十字军使用说服者吧。他们之中总有人会……说溜嘴。",pEN="Use the persuaders on Scarlet Crusaders. One of them will eventually... crack.",c="¿Un despertar? ¡No sabes lo que dices, chico! ¿Qué clase de loco dejaría a su gente en medio de los fríos baldíos? Puede que este mensajero tenga la respuesta.",cEN="An awakening? What nonsense do you speak, <boy/girl>! What kind of fool would deliver their people into the very heart of the frozen wastes? Perhaps, though, this courier holds the answer."}
Q[12721]={d="$n，我们已经没有时间了。你必须带上这把钥匙，用它释放阿卡里。\n\n他就被关在古达克前面的田野上——那地方是祖达克的首都。阿卡里身上的锁链被四个锚点固定着。你必须打开所有的锚点，才能释放这位犀牛之神。\n\n古达克里面到处都是冰巨魔。但我相信，你只要够小心的话，就可以有惊无险地潜入那里。\n\n成功之后，请把这个消息告知巫医。",dEN="<name>, there is no time left. You must take the key and use it to unlock Akali.\n\nHe is being held in the courtyard in front of Gundrak, the capital of Zul'Drak. Akali's chains are secured by four anchor points. You must unlock each of them to set the rhino god free.\n\nGundrak is teeming with ice trolls. However, I believe that if you're careful, you should be able to slip in without too much danger.\n\nOnce you're done, please inform the witch doctor.",o="希姆托加的哈克娅要你去释放阿卡里，并将这个消息通知巫医库弗。",oEN="Har'koa at Zim'Torga has asked you to free Akali and then to inform Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga.",p="发生了什么事？",pEN="What happened?",c="¡No!\n\nOtro dios destruido, su poder robado. Y ahora el profeta de Akali nos ha amenazado directamente.\n\nCuando venga, vendrá por Har'koa. No podemos permitir que también le arrebate su poder.\n\nDebemos consultar a los dioses una vez más, <name>. Ellos nos dirán qué se debe hacer.",cEN="No!\n\nAnother god destroyed, its power stolen. And now the prophet of Akali has threatened us directly.\n\nWhen he comes, he will come for Har'koa. We cannot allow him to take her power too.\n\nWe must consult the gods once more, <name>. They will tell us what must be done."}
Q[12722]={d="当天灾军团的浮空城出现时，大部分人类都会吓得四处逃散。血色十字军却不会这样！\n\n我必须承认——我有点享受跟十字军之间的交流。这么多年来，天灾与他们之间的战争在人类历史上增添了几件最悲惨的事件。而现在我们又一次在战场上一决胜负！\n\n我们怎么能拒绝他们永久侍奉巫妖王的愿望呢！去新阿瓦隆帮助他们达成心愿吧。",dEN="Most humans would have fled the moment a Scourge necropolis took up residence in their air space. Not the Scarlet Crusade!\n\nI must confess - I rather enjoy our exchanges with the Crusade. Through the years, Scourge battles against them have resulted in several of the most tragic events in human history. Yet here we stand - AGAIN - locked in battle!\n\nWe shan't deny them the pleasures of eternal servitude to the Lich King! Enter New Avalon and fulfill their death wish. Leave no survivors.",o="追忆墓穴的瑞文戴尔男爵命令你去消灭10个血色十字军士兵和15个新阿瓦隆预备兵。",oEN="Baron Rivendare at the Crypt of Remembrance has commanded you to slay 10 Scarlet Crusade Soldiers and 15 Citizens of New Avalon.",p="就像待宰的羔羊一样……",pEN="Like lambs to the slaughter...",c="你剑法不错，$n。如果巫妖王允许的话，也许你会有兴趣当我的手下？斯坦索姆需要一个新的市长。",cEN="You are quite effective with that blade, <name>. Perhaps, Lich King permitting, you would be interested in becoming one of my minions? Stratholme is looking for a new mayor."}
Q[12723]={d="He enviado a Orbaz, Thassarian y Koltira tras las líneas enemigas en busca del mensajero. Han construido una base de operaciones en la Taberna Escarlata, situada al extremo sur de Nuevo Avalon. La taberna está metida detrás de dos huertos, junto a la Capilla de la Llama Carmesí. Tienes que abrirte camino hasta la taberna e informar a Orbaz Malasangre. Te informará sobre su situación.|n",dEN="I have sent Orbaz, Thassarian and Koltira behind enemy lines to search for the courier. They have set up a base of operations at the Scarlet Tavern, located at the southern end of New Avalon. The tavern is tucked away behind the two orchards, adjacent to the Chapel of the Crimson Flame. You are to make your way to the tavern and report to Orbaz Bloodbane. He will update you on their situation.",o="转至新阿瓦隆，向血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒报到。",oEN="Report to Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon.",c="看来最近似乎什么人都可以加入我们的黑锋骑士团啊。在我获得巫妖王垂青的时候，事情可不是这样的，那时候可严苛多了！\n\n至于那个信差……",cEN="Looks like we'll let anyone into the dark order these days. When I was given the gift, things were different. Much different!\n\nAs to this courier..."}
Q[12724]={d="我们迄今为止还没有得到任何与这个信使相关的线索，根本不知道他会在什么时候、什么地点出现。这些人类同样也一无所知。\n\n<奥尔巴兹指了指躺在地上的血色十字军尸体。>\n\n不过我从一个家伙口中得到了一些有用的情报。他们在血色城堡里面保存着一份所有巡逻路线的日程表。我希望你能闯入城堡，拿走日程表。\n\n这座城堡是新阿瓦隆里面最大的建筑物——就在这里的东北边。",dEN="We haven't got a damned clue about when or where this courier is supposed to show up. None of these humans had an answer either.\n\n<Orbaz points to the Scarlet corpses strewn across the floor.>\n\nI did manage to beat something useful out of the last one. Inside Scarlet Hold they keep a schedule of all patrol routes. I want you to break into the hold and steal the schedule.\n\nThe hold is the largest building in New Avalon - northeast of here.",o="血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒命令你进入血色城堡，偷取新阿瓦隆巡逻日程表。",oEN="Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon has ordered you to steal the New Avalon Patrol Schedule from the Scarlet Hold.",p="摧毁那座城堡吧！日程表就在那里！",pEN="Tear the hold apart! The schedule is there!",c="<奥尔巴兹翻阅了日程表。>\n\n这些没用的废物可真忙！北巡路线、南巡路线、西巡路线、东巡路线，但就是没提到信差的路线。等等。这是什么？看起来像是一条从西瘟疫之地过来的西巡逻路线？这个巡逻员今天就会经过这里！我需要时间来好好计划计划。",cEN="<Orbaz flips through the schedule.>\n\nThese worthless cretins have been busy! Northern patrol routes, southern patrol routes, western patrol routes, eastern patrol routes, but nothing about their couriers' routes. Wait a minute. What's this? It looks like a western patrol route, coming out of Western Plaguelands? This patrol will path through here today! I'm going to need time to plan."}
Q[12725]={d="突破血色十字军的防线并不是一个简单的任务。我们在攻击中蒙受了大量的人员伤亡，我们的一位最强大的死亡骑士，库尔迪拉·织亡者，也跟我们失去了联系。我不知道他是否还活着，但是如果我们就这样不去寻找他的话，我会受到诅咒的。\n\n我最后一次看到他被囚禁着运往这里东北方的血色城堡。去踏平那座城堡，死亡骑士。把库尔迪拉找回来！",dEN="Breaking through the Scarlet lines was no easy task. We suffered many casualties during the assault and lost one of our best death knights, Koltira Deathweaver. I don't know whether he's dead or alive, but I'll be damned if we don't search for him.\n\nI last saw him being bound in irons and dragged away to the Scarlet Hold, northeast of here. Tear that keep asunder, death knight. Find Koltira!",o="在血色城堡内寻找库尔迪拉·织亡者。",oEN="Search for Koltira Deathweaver in the Scarlet Hold.",c="Has hecho una tontería al venir a buscarme. He fracasado. Tendrías que haberme dado por muerto. Ahora nos pueden matar a los dos.\n\n<Koltira sacude la cabeza>\n\nSomos caballeros de la Muerte de la Plaga. Esto infringe nuestro pacto de hermandad oscura.\n\nThassarian, ¡maldito necio!",cEN="You were foolish in coming after me. I failed. I should have been left for dead - now two of us might be killed.\n\n<Koltira shakes his head.>\n\nWe are death knights of the Scourge. This flies in the face of the dark brotherhood's covenants.\n\nThassarian, you blasted fool!"}
Q[12726]={d="聆听风暴的呼啸吧。雷暴台地回荡着远古的歌声……那是风与水之歌。\n\n雷雨之王吞噬台风与暴风的子嗣。带上这只鼓……奏响海波恩之歌。\n\n帮助他吞噬狂风与清水，让雷雨持续下去。",dEN="Listen to storm, yes? The Stormwright's Shelf echoes with ancient song.... the Song of Wind and Water.\n\nThe great tempest devours the sons of typhoons and storms. Take this drum and play his song... play Haiphoon's song.\n\nHelp him feed on wind and water so tempest can continue.",o="索乌尼要你在雷暴台地使用雷雨之鼓，帮助海波恩吞噬3个风暴亡魂和3个流水之魂。",oEN="Soo-nee wants you to use the Tempest Drums at the Stormwright's Shelf and help Haiphoon devour 3 Storm Revenants and 3 Aqueous Spirits.",c="Te lo agradezco, <name>. La gran tempestad nos mirará con buenos ojos gracias a ti.",cEN="I thank you, <name>. The great tempest will look upon us favorably thanks to you."}
Q[12727]={d="Las alarmas han sonado. El Alto Inquisidor y sus acólitos llegarán pronto. Estoy demasiado herido para poder ser de gran utilidad, pero haré lo poco que pueda para ayudar.\n\nMata al Alto Inquisidor y a sus compinches. Córtale la cabeza y vuelve con ella a Thassarian. La venganza calmará su alma salvaje.\n\nOtra cosa, $n. Si consigues apañártelas para salir con vida y volver hasta Thassarian, dile que están ejecutando prisioneros en la capilla. Quizás te envíe ahí para que juegues a ser el héroe otra vez.",dEN="The alarms have been sounded. The High Inquisitor and his acolytes will be here soon. I'm too badly injured to be of much use, but I'll do what little I can to help.\n\nSlay the High Inquisitor and his cronies. Tear off his head and return with it to Thassarian. Vengeance will soothe his savage soul.\n\nOne more thing, <name>. If you do manage to survive and make it back to Thassarian, tell him that they're executing prisoners at the chapel. Perhaps he'll send you there to play the hero once more.",o="击败大检查官瓦洛斯，并把瓦洛斯的徽记带回新阿瓦隆的血色旅店，交给萨萨里安。",oEN="Slay High Inquisitor Valroth and take Valroth's Head to Thassarian at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon.",p="库尔迪拉怎么样了？",pEN="What of Koltira?",c="我要把这个混帐的脑袋拿去喂食尸鬼！\n\n<萨萨里安把头颅丢到房间的角落去。>\n\n库尔迪拉有逃出来吗？\n\n<萨萨里安停了一会。>\n\n我相信他一定逃出来了。那些墙壁关不住他的。\n\n现在该来偿债了。",cEN="I'll feed this monster's head to the ghouls!\n\n<Thassarian tosses the head into the back room.>\n\nDid Koltira make it out?\n\n<Thassarian pauses.>\n\nI'm certain he did. Those walls can't hold him.\n\nTime for some payback."}
Q[12728]={d="我要整理一下笔记，准备在达拉然的同僚面前进行演讲。\n\n在我做准备的时候，还得请你去一趟北方的冬鳞洞穴。在洞口处使用奥术测量器。\n\n得到数据后请立即回来找我。没有这些数据，我的文件就是不完整的。",dEN="I need to compile my notes and prepare a presentation for my colleagues in Dalaran.\n\nWhile I do, I must ask that you visit the Winterfin Cavern to the north. You must use the Arcanometer while standing in the mouth of the cavern.\n\nReturn to me at once when you have the data. My documentation will be incomplete without it.",o="琥珀崖的盖伦要你在冬鳞洞穴处使用奥术测量器。",oEN="Librarian Garren at Amber Ledge wants you to use the Arcanometer at Winterfin Caverns.",p="¿Ya has recogido los datos de las Cavernas de Winterfin, <name>?",pEN="Have you collected the data from Winterfin Caverns yet, <name>?",c="Excelente, esto completa mi informe.\n\nMe aseguraré de mencionar tu amabilidad al consejo, <name>.",cEN="Excellent, this completes my report.\n\nI'll be sure to mention your kindness to the council, <name>."}
Q[12729]={d="Los dioses han hablado y hemos de hacer caso a su sabiduría.\n\nViaja hacia el norte, a Zim'Rhuk, para acabar con los guardianes de allí hasta que entreguen el corazón inmaculado. Después, llévalos al este, al Altar de Quetz'lun y perturba a los celadores del altar hasta que consigas su esencia ventosa.\n\nEntrégale ambas cosas a Har'koa y ella las combinará para conseguir aquello que obligará al difunto profeta de Akali a aparecer.",dEN="The gods have spoken and we must heed their wisdom.\n\nGather friends to your side, <name>. Take them north to Zim'Rhuk to destroy guardians there until they yield the unblemished heart. Take them east to the Altar of Quetz'lun and disrupt the altar wardens until you recover their gusty essence.\n\nDeliver both to Har'koa and she will combine them into that which will compel late Akali's prophet to appear.",o="将完美的守卫者精华和充满活力的典狱官精华交给希姆托加的哈克娅。",oEN="Deliver the Unblemished Heart of the Guardian and the Gusty Essence of the Warden to Har'koa at Zim'Torga.",p="¿Tienes lo que se requiere, <name>?",pEN="Do you have that which is required, <name>?",c="Tu valentía parece infinita, <name>.\n\nPor favor, entrégame el corazón y la esencia, y los transformaré en aquello que obligará al profeta a aparecer ante ti.",cEN="Your bravery seems boundless, <name>.\n\nPlease hand me the heart and the essence, and I will fashion them into that which will compel the prophet to appear before you."}
Q[12730]={d="你和你的朋友必须带着这件召唤设备，转至古达克南面的佐尔赫布。\n\n你会在那里发现一个能量法阵，使用召唤设备就可以强行召唤出阿卡里的先知。\n\n我的心与你同在，$n。我们一起经历过许多艰难险阻，你已经竭尽全力来拯救我，以及其它那些已经被达卡莱巨魔毁灭的神灵。\n\n但我担心这次分别后，我们就只能在死后再相见了。",dEN="You and your friends must take this instrument of convocation - of summoning - to Zol'Heb just south of Gundrak.\n\nTherein you will find a circle of power. Use the convocation to force the prophet of Akali to appear.\n\nMy heart goes out to you, <name>. We have been through much together, and you have done all that you can to not only save my life, but those of the other gods the Drakkari have destroyed.\n\nBut I fear this time we may not see each other again until the afterlife.",o="希姆托加的哈克娅要求你杀死阿卡里先知。",oEN="Har'koa at Zim'Torga has asked you to slay the Prophet of Akali.",p="我只能够给你温暖的话语，以及言语中带来的勇气。\n\n磨利你的武器做好准备吧，但我恳求你，不要花太多的时间，否则预言者可能会直接袭击我们。",pEN="I can only offer you the warmth of my words and the encouragement that comes with them.\n\nTake what time you need to steel and prepare yourself, but I implore you not to take too long or the prophet will surely descend upon us.",c="¡Lo has logrado! ¡<name>, eres el campeón de Zul'Drak!\n\nNunca podremos devolverte la deuda que te debemos, pero los Zandalari han confiado en mí una serie de objetos en los que creen que podrías estar interesado.\n\nPor favor, quiero que tengas una muestra de nuestro agradecimiento, pero date prisa. ¡Siento otro asunto de urgencia!",cEN="You did it! <name>, you are the champion of Zul'Drak!\n\nWe will never be able to repay the debt that we owe to you, but the Zandalari have given into my trust a number of objects they believe you might have an interest in.\n\nPlease, I want you to have a token of our appreciation, but hurry. I sense another issue of urgency!"}
Q[12732]={d="总有一天，雷耶克会强壮起来成为伟大的战士，你很快就会看到这一天。\n\n这个瓶子给你，你带上它去遥远的西方，到日灼之柱的顶端，把那里的水装进瓶子。\n\n接着你要去盆地的北部边境，到埋骨地以北的台地去。找到并击败血爪鹏王。\n\n取得它的精华元素后拿回来给雷耶克。",dEN="One day, Rejek will be mighty warrior. Blood and skyfire will make Rejek strong. You see soon.\n\nRejek give you vial, you take to very top of Suntouched Pillar, far to west. Put waters there in vial.\n\nThen go to north edge of basin, to ledge north of Bonefields. You find and kill goretalon matriarch. Take heartblood.\n\nYou combine heartblood and water, bring to Rejek. Rejek drink, make strong.",o="将一瓶日灼精华交给狂心岭的雷耶克。",oEN="Bring a vial of Suntouched Heartblood to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你给雷耶克带礼物来了吗？",pEN="You bring Rejek gift?",c="Rejek te da las gracias. Rejek bebe, crece fuerte, recuerda siempre el regalo del poderoso <name>.",cEN="Rejek thanks you. Rejek drink, grow strong, always remember mighty <name>'s gift."}
Q[12733]={d="Resultado de la victoria del Rey Exánime contra Illidan Tempestira en el corazón de Baldíos Helados, el desafío de la Muerte es un rito que deben superar todos los caballeros de la Muerte.\n\nBusca a otros caballeros de la Muerte de Acherus y desafíalos a un duelo. ¡Tienen que aceptar y luchar hasta que alguien gane!\n\n¡Ve ahora, $n!¡Victoria para la Plaga! ¡Gloria al Rey Exánime!|n",dEN="Born of the Lich King's victory over Illidan Stormrage in the heart of the frozen wastes, Death's Challenge is a rite of passage that all death knights must undergo.\n\nSeek out other death knights of Acherus and challenge them to a duel. They must accept and fight until a victor emerges!\n\nGo now, <name>! Victory for the Scourge! Glory to the Lich King!",o="战斗召唤者奥尔伦命令你在决斗中战胜5名死亡骑士。\n\n你可以选择死亡骑士新兵或玩家作为对手。",oEN="Olrun the Battlecaller has ordered you to win 5 duels against other death knights.\n\nYou may choose to battle death knight initiates or players.",p="你完成死亡挑战了吗？",pEN="Have you completed Death's Challenge?",c="荣耀归于胜者，死亡骑士！做得好！巫妖王今天特别眷顾着你。",cEN="To the victor goes the glory, death knight! Well done! The Lich King looks favorably upon you on this day."}
Q[12734]={d="雷耶克刚刚成为狂心氏族中最年轻的战士。父亲交给雷耶克一柄剑，要用它打败我们的敌人。根据传统，使用前必须首先举行一个仪式。你愿意帮雷耶克吗？\n\n我要你将这柄剑插在被击败的敌人面前。你也知道，狂心氏族的敌人很多，比如西南方的巨蜂和硬皮猩猩还有那些讨厌的大舌头怪。就去找雾语氏族吧，它们生活在遥远的西北方，就在苦潮湖附近。",dEN="Rejek just became youngest warrior in all of Frenzyheart tribe. Father gave Rejek a mighty sword to defeat Frenzyheart enemies, but old tradition say sword need to be blooded first. Older warrior usually do that. You do this honor for Rejek?\n\nTake blade, put in corpses of all Frenzyheart foes: wasps and hardknuckles to southwest, and the big-tongues. Maybe blood blade on Mistwhispers, far to northwest near Bittertide Lake.",o="击败1只蓝玉虫巢巨蜂、1只硬皮冲锋者和3名雾语氏族的成员，完成雷耶克的仪式。你可以选择击败雾语神谕者或是雾语战士。完成任务后，向狂心岭的雷耶克复命。",oEN="Blood Rejek's Blade on the corpses of a Sapphire Hive Wasp, a Hardknuckle Charger, and 3 members of the Mistwhisper Tribe. You may blood the sword on either Mistwhisper Oracles or Mistwhisper Warriors. Return to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill when your task is complete.",p="你用血来清洗雷耶克的剑了吗？",pEN="You blood Rejek's blade?",c="雷耶克看到敌人的血迹沾在剑刃上了。现在雷耶克有了一把配的上伟大战士雷耶克的武器了！",cEN="Rejek sees the stains of the blood of his enemies on the blade. Now Rejek has a mighty weapon for the mighty warrior he will be!"}
Q[12735]={d="索拉查盆地的土地是纯洁的。几个世纪以来，这些柱子一直保护着这片土地。\n\n但这里的水就不那么纯洁了，因为它们来自盆地以外……来自那些海洋、湖泊和河流。有时，水会带来邪恶的灵魂——这时就要净化它。\n\n请你带上这只钟，在苦潮湖、冬拥河和河流之心敲响它。这会激怒邪恶的灵魂……然后你必须杀死它。",dEN="Earth in Sholazar is pure. The pillars have protected the land for centuries.\n\nWater, not as pure, it comes from outside Sholazar.... from oceans, from lakes, from rivers. Water sometimes bring bad spirits - need to be cleansed.\n\nYou take this chime and play at Bittertide Lake, Wintergrasp River and River's Heart. It make bad spirit angry... and then you must kill it.",o="雨声树屋的索乌尼要你在苦潮湖、冬拥河和河流之心敲响净化之钟，杀死污染水源的邪灵。",oEN="Soo-nee, at the Rainspeaker Canopy, wants you to play the Cleansing Chime at Bittertide Lake, Wintergrasp River and River's Heart and slay the evil spirits that plague the waters there.",p="¿Ya has interpretado la canción de purificación, <name>?",pEN="You play cleansing song yet, <name>?",c="Aguas... purificadas. Sí. Todo está bien.\n\nComprendes nuestro modo, <name>.",cEN="Waters... cleansed. Yes. All is well.\n\nYou understand our way, <name>."}
Q[12736]={d="显然你不如鳄鱼人聪明！你只是个头脑简单的$r。\n\n但你还是有点希望的！你显示出了学习的能力。或许水晶能让你聪明起来，就像它能让我们变聪明一样！\n\n我会教你演奏乐曲，让你头脑清晰起来。你要用水晶来演奏乐曲，它能让你的脑子变得好使……虽然比不上鳄鱼人那样聪明，但肯定比你现在强。源血之柱已经倒塌，但其它的柱子还是完好的！",dEN="Of course you not as smart as gorloc! You just simple <race>.\n\nYou not without hope, though! You show you can learn. Maybe crystals make you smart like crystals make us smart!\n\nI teach you to play song to clear your mind. You play song by crystals then crystals make your mind better... not as good as gorloc's but better than you have now. Lifeblood Pillar is broken, but other pillars still good!",o="雨声树屋的索乌尼要你在光芒之柱、日灼之柱、苔光之柱和通天之柱的顶端吹响沉思乐管。",oEN="Soo-nee at Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to use the Didgeridoo of Contemplation at the top of the Glimmering Pillar, the Suntouched Pillar, the Mosslight Pillar and the Skyreach Pillar.",p="¿Todavía te sientes inteligente, <race>?",pEN="You feel smart yet, <race>?",c="看吧？我看的出来你已经变聪明了。如果没更聪明……至少……更快乐！",cEN="You see? I can tell you smarter already. And if not smarter... then... happier!"}
Q[12737]={d="暴风雨是一种破坏性的力量。它会刮倒树木，淹没房屋。\n\n但如果你知道正确的曲子，就可以将暴风雨化为生命的力量。你可以在造物者之座上方的雷暴台地发现一些小土堆。它们的土壤非常肥沃——里面埋着强大的种子。它们所等待的，就是一支正确的曲子。\n\n你就带上这只号角，为它们吹奏曲子吧。",dEN="The storm is a destructive force. Storm burns trees. Storm floods houses.\n\nBut storm can also be life force if you know right song. In Stormwright Shelf, above Maker's Perch, you can find small dirt mounds. They very fertile -- they carry inside a strong seed. All they wait for is the right song.\n\nYou take this horn and play song for them.",o="雨声树屋的索乌尼要你转至造物者之座西北方的雷暴台地，在8堆肥沃的土堆附近吹响丰饶号角。",oEN="Soo-nee at Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to go to the Stormwright's Shelf, northwest of the Maker's Perch, and play the Horn of Fecundity near 8 piles Soaked Fertile Dirt.",c="<name>, aprendes rápido. Aprendes bien esa canción. Quizá la próxima vez te enseñe una canción diferente.",cEN="You learn fast, <name>. You learn that song well. Maybe next time I teach you different song."}
Q[12738]={d="必须有人听到这复仇的呐喊，$n。指挥官普雷菲斯特和一队死亡骑士已经出发去烧毁赤色烈焰礼拜堂了。如果礼拜堂里关有死亡骑士，普雷菲斯特会把他们救出来。\n\n也许你速度够快的话还可以赶上他们。礼拜堂就在正西方。",dEN="The cry for vengeance must be heard, <name>. Commander Plaguefist and a company of death knights are on their way to raze the Chapel of the Crimson Flame. If there are any death knights imprisoned at the chapel, Plaguefist will get them out.\n\nYou can still catch up to them if you hurry. The chapel is due west of here.",o="到赤色烈焰礼拜堂去，向骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特报到。",oEN="Report to Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame.",c="他们只不过由血肉和骨头所构成——敌不过天灾军团。\n\n我们没有找到任何的弟兄，不过倒是碰上了意外的惊喜。",cEN="They're only flesh and bone - no match for the Scourge.\n\nWe didn't find any of our brothers, but we did stumble upon something special."}
Q[12739]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个牛头人，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty tauren in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，玛拉尔·勇角，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Malar Bravehorn, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12740]={d="这些飞在空中的怪物正在残杀我的士兵！被摔死是一个非常可怕的结局。\n\n$C，你必须把这些降落伞分发给我的士兵，这样他们至少有一次挣扎求生的机会。",dEN="Those sky terrors are destroying my men and women! Dying from falling is a horrible way to go.\n\n<class>, you have to get these parachutes out to them! At least then they'll have a fighting chance to survive.",o="银色前沿的指挥官法斯塔夫要你为庭院里的10名银色北伐军战士或银色持盾战士配备降落伞。",oEN="Commander Falstaav at The Argent Stand has asked you to equip 10 Argent Crusaders or Argent Shieldmen out in the courtyard with parachutes.",p="如果你是完成任务后回来跟我汇报的话，为什么我还会看到我的手下摔死呢？",pEN="If you're back here talking to me why do I still see my people falling to their deaths?",c="Eres un buen <man /woman>, <name>. Tenemos suerte de que hayas pasado por aquí.\n\nQuédate un tiempo. Estoy seguro de que tenemos mucho que un <class> capaz como tú puede hacer.",cEN="You're a good <man /woman>, <name>. We're fortunate that you happened to stop by.\n\nStick around a while. I'm sure that we have much that a capable <class> such as yourself can do."}
Q[12741]={d="Estúpidos lenguas-grandes pensar que cantar a las nubes darles poder. ¡Rejek enseñar a lenguas grandes cómo conseguir poder arrebatándolo!\n\nLejos al noroeste, haber una zona grande y lisa que los lenguas-grandes llamar \"La Plataforma del Tormentoso\". Rejek estar seguro de que solo poder llegar allí volando como un pájaro.\n\nRejek haber oído que en esa plataforma haber poderosas fuerzas de agua y viento. Matarlos por ser malos y después llevarlos al Santuario de la Tempestad, al lado oeste de la plataforma. Rejek esperarte a que regresar con el poder definitivo.",dEN="Silly big-tongues think singing to the clouds give them power. Rejek show big-tongues how to get power by taking it!\n\nFar to northwest, there is large, flat area the big-tongues call 'Stormwright's Shelf.' Rejek is sure you can only get there by flying like bird.\n\nOn this shelf, Rejek has heard of mighty forces of wind and water. Kill them for their badness, then take it to the big-tongue 'Shrine of the Tempest' at shelf's western side. Rejek will await your return with ultimate power.",o="收集3份季风精华和3份风暴精华，将它们带到雷雨祭坛去。然后将真正的雷雨之力交给狂心岭的雷耶克。",oEN="Gather 3 Essences of the Monsoon and 3 Essences of the Storm and take them to the Shrine of the Tempest. Return to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill with the True Power of the Tempest.",p="你把元素的真正力量带回来给雷耶克了吗？",pEN="You bring Rejek true power of elements?",c="雷耶克来给大舌头瞧瞧什么才是真正的使用元素！",cEN="Now Rejek show cowardly big-tongues how to really use elements!"}
Q[12742]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个人类，她感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty human in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，艾琳·斯坦布雷，并结束她的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Ellen Stanbridge, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12743]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个暗夜向导，她感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束她的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty night elf in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，亚米娜·橡刺，并结束她的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Yazmina Oakenthorn, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12744]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个矮人，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty dwarf in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，多诺凡·普弗斯特，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Donovan Pulfrost, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12745]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个侏儒，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty gnome in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，戈比·雷管，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Goby Blastenheimer, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12746]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个德莱尼人，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty draenei in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，正义的瓦洛克，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Valok the Righteous, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12747]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个血向导，她感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束她的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty blood elf in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，艾欧妮丝女士，并结束她的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Lady Eonys, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12748]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个兽人，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty orc in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，库格·铁腭，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Kug Ironjaw, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12749]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个巨魔，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty troll in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，伊吉·暗齿，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Iggy Darktusk, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12750]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个被遗忘者，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty Forsaken in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，安东尼·布拉克，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Antoine Brack, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="Se sintió bien, ¿verdad? Ya no eres uno de ellos, <name>. Eres de la Plaga. Eres uno de nosotros. Para siempre...",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12751]={d="Vuelve con Thassarian en la Taberna Escarlata y dile que el grito de venganza de Koltira ha obtenido su respuesta. La Capilla de la Llama Carmesí será un puñado de cenizas en cuestión de horas.\n\nTú eres un monstruo con sangre fría, $n. Un saludo, $ghermano:hermana;.",dEN="Return to Thassarian at the Scarlet Tavern and let him know that Koltira's cry for vengeance has been answered. The Chapel of the Crimson Flame will be a pile of ashes in a matter of hours.\n\nYou're one cold-blooded monster, <name>. I salute you, <brother/sister>.",o="向新阿瓦隆血色旅店的萨萨里安汇报你胜利的消息。",oEN="Return to Thassarian at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon with news of your victory.",c="天灾军团又一次获胜！这些血色的狗杂碎已经无处可逃了。剩下的只是时间上的问题……",cEN="Another Scourge victory! These Scarlet dogs have nowhere left to run and hide. It's only a matter of time now..."}
Q[12754]={d="在你忙着焚烧礼拜堂、清理杂鱼的时候，我制订出了一套新的作战计划。\n\n血色十字军的信使每天都会定期经过血色悬崖，差不多就是这个时候。悬崖周围的道路都非常宽阔，视野很好，而且散布着无数的十字军士兵。等你到了血色悬崖之后，就用这套伪装工具把自己藏起来，准备伏击血色信使。当他走到你附近时，你就冲出来，以最短的时间结束战斗！击败他以后，带着他身上所有的东西回来——包括他的衣服！\n\n血色悬崖就在东边，离这里大概两百步远的地方。",dEN="While you were out burning churches and murdering vermin, I've been busy formulating a plan.\n\nThe Scarlet courier is scheduled to pass by the Scarlet Overlook within the hour. The roads by the overlook are wide open and swarming with Crusaders. Use this makeshift cover to hide at the overlook and wait for the Scarlet Courier to pass. When he's close enough, strike with all your fury! Cut him down and take his belongings - including his clothes!\n\nThe overlook is 200 paces east of here.",o="新阿瓦隆血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒要求你击败血色信使，并收集血色信使的衣物和血色信使的信件。",oEN="Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon has ordered you to kill the Scarlet Courier and retrieve the Scarlet Courier's Belongings and the Scarlet Courier's Message.",p="你要是错过了信差，那样我就不得不杀了你。虽说是不得不，不过我也会很高兴了结你的性命。\n\n动作快！",pEN="You're going to miss the courier and then I'm going to be forced to kill you. By forced I mean I will take great pleasure in ending your life.\n\nHURRY UP!",c="<奥尔巴兹阅读了信息。>\n\n壁炉谷和提瑞斯法的军队将会掉入大屠杀的陷阱之中。\n\n<奥尔巴兹微微一笑。>\n\n现在轮到计划的第二部分了。你要把这个信息送到大将军阿比迪斯的手中。这就是那些衣服的用途……",cEN="<Orbaz reads the message.>\n\nThe armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal will be marching into a massacre.\n\n<Orbaz smiles.>\n\nNow for the second part of the plan. You're going to deliver this message right into the hands of High General Abbendis. That's what the clothes are for..."}
Q[12755]={d="Este mensaje tiene que llegar hasta Abbendis. No queremos que sospechen nada. Deben seguir pensando que todo sigue como planeado.\n\nTú te pondrás la ropa del mensajero y, con la ayuda de un poco de magia negra, también conseguirás su apariencia física.\n\nAbbendis está en Puerto del Rey, al sureste del Mirador Escarlata. Deja el mensaje y sácale tanta información como puedas. Nos contará lo que necesitamos saber sobre el \"Alba Carmesí.\"",dEN="This message must reach Abbendis. We do not want to draw their suspicion. They must continue under the assumption that everything is going as they planned.\n\nYou will don the Scarlet courier's clothes and with the help of some dark magic, take on the form of the courier.\n\nAbbendis is at King's Harbor, southeast of the Scarlet Overlook. Drop off the message and get as much information out of her as you can. She will tell us what we need to know about the \"Crimson Dawn.\"",o="奥尔巴兹·血毒命令你将血色信使的信件交给国王港的阿比迪斯将军。",oEN="Orbaz Bloodbane has commanded you to deliver the Scarlet Courier's Message to High General Abbendis at King's Harbor.",p="你上哪去了？你迟了整整两小时。我们正要派信差去找高级指挥官。",pEN="Where have you been? You are two hours late. We were about to send a courier out to the High Commander.",c="<大将军阿比迪斯读了信。>\n\n该死！壁炉谷和提瑞斯法的军队绝不能到新阿瓦隆去！天灾军团会把他们给屠杀殆尽的。",cEN="<High General Abbendis reads the message.>\n\nDamn it! The armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal must not reach New Avalon! The Scourge will slaughter them all."}
Q[12756]={d="Escucha bien, mensajero. Las tierras Escarlata están perdidas. Nuevo Avalon y Villa Refugio están invadidas por la Plaga. El espectro de la muerte se acerca directamente y amenaza con llevarnos a todos en cualquier momento.\n\nVuelve a Galvar con este mensaje:\n\n\"Reúne a los ejércitos de los alrededores y prepara tus barcos para ir hasta los Baldíos Helados. La próxima vez que nos veamos será en Rasganorte.\"\n\nDale esto a Galvar.\n\n<Abbendis te da un diario.>\n\nEsto lo aclarará todo.\n\nLa Cruzada Escarlata ya no existe. ¡Larga vida a El Embate Escarlata!",dEN="Listen well, courier. The Scarlet lands are lost. New Avalon and Havenshire are overrun by Scourge. The specter of death looms overhead and threatens to overtake us at any moment.\n\nReturn to Galvar with this message:\n\n\"Turn your armies around and prepare your ships for travel to the frozen wastes. When next we meet it will be in Northrend.\"\n\nGive this to Galvar.\n\n<Abbendis hands you a journal.>\n\nIt will explain everything.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade is no more. Long live the Scarlet Onslaught!",o="将《救赎之路》交给新阿瓦隆血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒。",oEN="Deliver The Path of Redemption to Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon.",p="<欧贝兹笑了笑。>\n\n这是什么？某个小孩的绘画簿吗？",pEN="<Orbaz laughs.>\n\nWhat is this? Some child's coloring book?",c="<Orbaz hojea el diario.>\n\n¡Qué basura! ¿Esto es el \"Crimson Dawn?\"\n\n¡Navegan hacia su muerte! Centrémonos en los ejércitos que se aproximan.",cEN="<Orbaz flips through the journal.>\n\nWhat rubbish! This is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"\n\nThey sail to their deaths! Let us turn our focus to the encroaching armies."}
Q[12757]={d="Tenemos que prepararnos para los ejércitos invasores, $n. ¡Llevarás lo que has descubierto al alto señor Mograine inmediatamente! Abriré un portal directo a Acherus. Entra y te transportaré.\n\nDale también la publicación de Abbendis al alto señor Mograine. Quizás le sea de utilidad.|n",dEN="We must prepare for the encroaching armies, <name>. You will take what you have discovered to Highlord Mograine at once! I will open a portal directly to Acherus. Step inside and it will transport you.\n\nGive Highlord Mograine Abbendis' journal as well. Perhaps he'll find it useful.",o="将《救赎之路》交给黑锋要塞阿彻鲁斯内的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼。",oEN="Deliver The Path of Redemption to Highlord Darion Mograine at Acherus: The Ebon Hold.",p="你做了什么？",pEN="You did what?",c="你成长为了一台杀戮机器，死亡骑士！我们将会肆意蹂躏这支向我们逼近的军队，然后将他们复活成我们的亡灵军队！",cEN="You have become an instrument of doom, death knight! We will ravage these approaching armies and raise the dead as our own!"}
Q[12758]={d="雷耶克听说过在遥远的雷暴台地有金属巨人出没。沿着西北方前进，越过盆地边缘就到了。\n\n想象一下，如果能戴上金属巨人的头盔，雷耶克将是不可战胜的！雷耶克将变得无比强大！\n\n你帮雷耶克弄个金属头盔好不好啊？但是金属巨人的头盔不容易得到，所以你要先去日灼之柱附近的斯温迪格林挖掘场，从小绿人和他们的朋友那里偷来一些炸弹。这样，你就可以用炸弹来弄到金属巨人的头盔，然后把它拿来交给雷耶克了。",dEN="Rejek hears tales of giant metal men on faraway Stormwright's Shelf. Far to northwest, outside basin's lip, you will find it.\n\nImagine Rejek using heads of giant metal men as helmet. Make Rejek unstoppable! Make Rejek mighty!\n\nYou get for Rejek, but metal head might not come off metal body easy. Maybe steal bombs from little green men and their friends at Swindlegrin's Dig near Suntouched Pillar? Use bombs to get head off metal body, then bring to Rejek.",o="转至斯温迪格林挖掘场，从风险投资公司的驻地搞到风险投资公司炸药，然后使用它们获得风暴看守的头盔。将风暴看守的头盔交给狂心岭的雷耶克。",oEN="Get Venture Co. Explosives from any of the Venture Company units at Swindlegrin's Dig and use them to obtain a Stormwatcher's Head. Bring the Stomwatcher's Head to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你带了雷耶克的新头盔来了吗？",pEN="You bring Rejek's new helmet?",c="雷耶克知道你成功了！现在雷耶克要试试新的头盔！",cEN="Rejek sees you were successful! Now Rejek try on new war helmet."}
Q[12759]={d="我听瑟匹克说，你是他见过的最好的鳄鱼人猎手……当然，是除了瑟匹克之外最好的猎手。西南方仍然有大规模的战斗——你要去帮忙。\n\n瑟匹克在卡塔克要塞藏了很多厉害的陷阱……告诉维克加，让他利用这些陷阱作战。你也可以挑选自己喜欢的陷阱，用它们多杀些大舌头怪。\n\n越多越好！",dEN="Zepik tell me that you maybe the best gorloc hunter he met... other than Zepik. Still big battle to southwest - you go help.\n\nZepik keeps some of biggest, baddest traps in his stash at Kartak's Hold... told Vekgar to use them for battle, so you use them too. Go pick out any traps you want and kill lots of big-tongues.\n\nLots and lots!",o="转至卡塔克要塞，取出被瑟匹克藏起来的陷阱。利用它们杀死50个灵鳍鳄鱼人，然后向卡塔克要塞的萨满祭司亚克耶克复命。",oEN="Retrieve some of Zepik's traps from his stash in Kartak's Hold. Using the traps, slaughter 50 of the nearby Sparktouched Gorlocs, and then return to Shaman Jakjek in Kartak's Hold.",p="真是一团乱啊！但还是很好玩。",pEN="Kind of messy! But still so fun.",c="你对那些陷阱的使用几乎就像瑟匹克一样棒！",cEN="You almost as good with those traps as Zepik!"}
Q[12760]={d="卡塔克要塞的战斗仍在继续……是时候告诉你狂心氏族的大秘密了。\n\n我们保存着一种浆果，是从我们的故乡带来的……它本身没有什么特别之处，不过一旦与酒精饮料混合饮用，就可以让狂心狼獾人变得非常强壮。现在你也是氏族的一员了……你也要变强。\n\n我给你一些饮料，喝了之后你就会变得强壮，然后就可以碾碎所有的大舌头怪。",dEN="Battle still going at Kartak hold... I think it time for you to learn big secret of Frenzyheart.\n\nWe have berries we keep from other lands we came from... they not so special on their own, but mix them with drunk drinks and they make Frenzyheart super strong. You a Frenzyheart now... it time you get to be strong too.\n\nI give some drink, then you be super strong and you go smash all the spark big-tongues.",o="喝下神秘的狂心氏族饮料，然后在卡塔克要塞附近消灭30个灵鳍鳄鱼人。",oEN="Using the secret Frenzyheart drink, slaughter 30 of the Sparktouched Gorlocs around Kartak's Hold.",p="维克加教了你这个超级秘密，嗯？只有最强的狂心族人才能知道这个秘密。",pEN="Vekgar teach you super secret, eh? Only strongest Frenzyheart get to know secret.",c="你是个凶猛的战士……明天再来进行更多战斗吧。好架永远打不够！",cEN="You a fierce fighter... come back for more battle soon. Never enough good battle!"}
Q[12761]={d="狗狗人并未停止对灵鳍湾的攻击……如果我们不加阻拦的话，他们是不会罢手的。我们有秘密武器……我们把它交给了索乌米特，让他保护所有的鳄鱼人。\n\n秘密武器是伟大的造物主留下的……我们在神圣的造物主祭坛中找到了这些闪闪发光的水晶。你要当心……别弄碎了。\n\n水晶就放在西南方灵鳍湾神殿附近的箱子里。你要用水晶帮助索乌米特打败狗狗人。",dEN="Sparktouched are still being attacked by puppy-men... we think they maybe not stop if we not make them stop. We have secret weapon though... we sent it out to Soo-met so he can use to protect all Oracles.\n\nSecret weapon is from Great Ones themselves... extra shiny crystals found inside sacred Great One temples. Be very careful... no break them.\n\nCrystals are in chest near shrine at Sparktouched Haven, in far southwest. You go use crystals to help Soo-met beat the puppy-men.",o="拿到灵鳍湾的防御水晶，借助水晶的力量杀死附近的50个狂心狼獾人。完成任务后向灵鳍湾的唤雷者索乌米特复命。",oEN="Retrieve the crystal defenses at Sparktouched Haven and use them to kill 50 of the nearby Frenzyheart wolvar. When these tasks are complete, return to Lightningcaller Soo-met in Sparktouched Haven.",p="非常的强大。小狗人不知道伟大诸神的力量。呆呆小狗人。",pEN="Very powerful. Puppy-men not know about power of Great Ones. Dumb puppy-men.",c="感谢你，干燥皮肤的朋友。\n\n我会在这里用水晶继续保护我们的安全。或许你可以明天来再帮忙我们一些。",cEN="Thank you, dryskin.\n\nI hold onto these crystals here to keep us safe. Maybe you come back soon and help us more."}
Q[12762]={d="狗狗人并未停止对灵鳍湾的攻击，我们必须采取一些措施。亚鲁乌特将他在河流之心发现的特殊水晶交给了我……之前我们只见到过一次类似的东西。\n\n这块水晶现在还没有能量，但是如果你将它带到离源血之柱足够近的地方，石柱的能量应该可以传导到水晶中。完成充能之后，就转至西南方的灵鳍湾，使用水晶让你变得强大起来。\n\n接下来，就该好好教训一下狗狗人了。",dEN="We need to do something to stop puppy-men attacking Sparktouched Haven. Jaloot brought me very special crystal that he found in River's Heart... we seen only one like it before.\n\nThe crystal not have power now, but the opened up lifeblood pillar should have energy to recharge it if you just bring it close. Once the crystal is charged, go to Sparktouched Haven in far southwest and let the crystal's energy make you big and strong.\n\nThen it time to kick some puppy-men butt.",o="在源血之柱的暴露部分附近为休眠的无瑕水晶充能。转至灵鳍湾，使用水晶的能量杀死附近的30个狂心狼獾人，然后与灵鳍湾的唤雷者索乌米特谈一谈。",oEN="Charge the Dormant Polished Crystal at the exposed Lifeblood Pillar. Travel to Sparktouched Haven and use the power the crystal bestows to slaughter 30 of the nearby Frenzyheart wolvar, and then speak to Lightningcaller Soo-met in Sparktouched Haven.",p="有你在这里帮我们真好。不知道战斗还要持续多久。",pEN="Good to have you here to help us. Long fight.",c="你身上的能量真强……你充满了造物者的力量！\n\n我没说谎……我只是有点嫉妒。",cEN="So much energy in you... you full of the power of the Great Ones!\n\nI not lie, I little bit jealous."}
Q[12763]={d="Aunque nuestras necesidades aquí sean muy urgentes, tengo noticias de las tierras del norte que no se pueden ignorar.\n\nAcabo de recibir un mensaje de la Cruzada Argenta. Parece que las fuerzas de la Plaga se han reunido allí y amenazan con invadir Zul'drak.\n\nNo hace falta decir, $n, que si eso ocurre todos nuestros esfuerzos habrán sido en vano. Tienes que ir allí y ayudar a los cruzados a expulsar a los ejércitos del Rey Exánime.\n\nHabla con Makki cuando estés $glisto:lista; para el viaje.",dEN="As pressing as our needs are here, there's news from the lands to the north that cannot be ignored.\n\nI've just received a message from the Argent Crusade. It seems that scourge forces are gathering there and are threatening to overrun Zul'drak.\n\nNeedless to say, <name>, if that were to happen our struggle here would be meaningless. You must go there and aid the Crusaders in beating back the Lich King's armies.\n\nSpeak to Makki when you are ready to travel.",o="斥候沃塔肯要你转至祖达克的圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。\n\n欧尼瓦营地的玛吉·冬风会提供转至圣光据点的交通工具。",oEN="Scout Vor'takh wants you to travel to Zul'Drak and report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach.\n\nMakki Wintergale in Camp Onequah will provide you transportation.",c="圣光会战胜一切！",cEN="The Light shall prevail!"}
Q[12766]={d="<向导形态下的巨龙接过你递上去的推荐信，仔细阅读了良久，然后整齐地折叠好，塞进了宽大的袖子中。>\n\n看来一切都在循序渐进。不过，若你不以为扰，我希望你能与你们阵营派来神殿里的大使相谈片刻。\n\n在你得到觐见女王的资格之前，正好可以帮她处理一些棘手的事。\n\n<他轻轻拍了拍那只藏有那封推荐信的袖子。>\n\n放心，在你回来之前，我会妥善保管你这封信的。",dEN="<The dragon in elf form takes your letter of introduction, perusing it for a moment and then stashing it away within his sleeve.>\n\nEverything seems to be in order. However, if you don't mind, I would ask that you speak with your ambassador here at the temple.\n\nShe has something of great import for you that needs taking care of before we send you up to the queen.\n\n<He pats at the letter under his sleeve.>\n\nI'll keep this safe for you until your return.",o="与龙眠神殿的劳莉耶尔·图布雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lauriel Trueblade at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="Debes de ser <name>. Me dijeron que vendrías.\n\nTengo algo que creo que eres el único cualificado para encargarte y, al hacerlo, te ganarás el favor de los dragones de aquí.",cEN="You must be <name>. I was told you'd be coming.\n\nI have something that I think you're uniquely qualified to take care of and by doing it, you'll be ingratiating yourself with the dragons here."}
Q[12767]={d="<向导形态下的巨龙接过你递上去的推荐信，仔细阅读了良久，然后整齐地折叠好，塞进了宽大的袖子中。>\n\n看来一切都在循序渐进。不过，若你不以为扰，我希望你能与你们阵营派来神殿里的大使相谈片刻。\n\n在你得到觐见女王的资格之前，正好可以帮他处理一些棘手的事。\n\n<他轻轻拍了拍那只藏有那封推荐信的袖子。>\n\n放心，在你回来之前，我会妥善保管你这封信的。",dEN="<The dragon in elf form takes your letter of introduction, perusing it for a moment and then stashing it away within his sleeve.>\n\nEverything seems to be in order. However, if you don't mind, I would ask that you speak with your ambassador here at the temple.\n\nHe has something of great import for you that needs taking care of before we send you up to the queen.\n\n<He pats at the letter under his sleeve.>\n\nI'll keep this safe for you until your return.",o="与龙眠神殿的古拉克·石拳谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Golluck Rockfist at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="Debes de ser <name>. Me dijeron que vendrías.\n\n\n\n\nTengo algo que quiero que te encargues. Si lo haces, te demostrarás a ti mismo ante los dragones de aquí.",cEN="You must be <name>. I was told you'd be coming.\n\n\n\nI have something that I want you to take care of. If you do, you'll prove yourself to the dragons here."}
Q[12768]={d="你已经证明了自己有资格获得更多的信任。\n\n现在立刻返回龙眠神殿去，再一次与塔里奥斯塔兹执事谈谈吧，亲爱的$n。",dEN="You've proved that you're to be trusted and more.\n\nYou should return to Wyrmrest Temple and speak with the steward, Tariolstrasz, once more, <name>.",o="与龙眠神殿的塔里奥斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tariolstrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="¿Has vuelto tan pronto, <name>?\n\nCeristrasz envió un mensaje antes de que llegaras. Gracias por lo que hiciste en el Santuario del Dragón de Rubí.",cEN="Back so soon, <name>?\n\nCeristrasz sent word ahead of you. Thank you for what you did at the Ruby Dragonshrine."}
Q[12769]={d="你已经证明了自己有资格获得更多的信任。\n\n现在立刻返回龙眠神殿去，再一次与塔里奥斯塔兹执事谈谈吧，亲爱的$n。",dEN="You've proved that you're to be trusted and more.\n\nYou should return to Wyrmrest Temple and speak with the steward, Tariolstrasz, once more, <name>.",o="与龙眠神殿的塔里奥斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tariolstrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="¿Has vuelto tan pronto, <name>?\n\nVargastrasz envió un mensaje antes de que llegaras. Gracias por lo que hiciste en el Santuario del Dragón de Rubí.",cEN="Back so soon, <name>?\n\nVargastrasz sent word ahead of you. Thank you for what you did at the Ruby Dragonshrine."}
Q[12770]={d="¡Escucha, $c!\n\nAquí tienes los días contados. A pesar de que necesitamos a $gun:una:c; $c hábil entre nuestras filas, lo que está pasando en el norte hace que nuestros problemas parezcan la cabalgata de primavera de Ventormenta.\n\nResulta que la Plaga está concentrando sus esfuerzos, ejerciendo mucha presión para conquistar Zul'Drak. Si lo consiguen, será mejor que dimitamos.\n\nPuedes acabar lo que estés haciendo aquí, pero después te tienes que marchar a la Brecha de la Luz. Habla con Samuel si necesitas un transporte.\n\nPuedes marcharte.",dEN="Listen up, <class>!\n\nYour days here are numbered. As much as we need capable <class>s in our ranks, there's trouble up north that makes our problems look like a mid-summer Stormwind parade.\n\nTurns out the Scourge are concentrating their efforts - making a big push to take over Zul'Drak. If that happens, we may as well pack it in.\n\nYou're free to finish any business here, but then it's off to Light's Breach with you. Speak to Samuel if you need transportation.\n\nDismissed.",o="格里安·斯托曼要你转至祖达克的圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。\n\n萨缪尔·克莱布克会提供转至圣光据点的交通工具。",oEN="Gryan Stoutmantle wants you to report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.\n\nYou may speak to Samuel Clearbook for transportation to Light's Breach.",c="圣光将会战胜一切！",cEN="The Light shall prevail!"}
Q[12778]={d="La trampa ha saltado, caballero de la Muerte. Los ejércitos de Vega del Amparo y Tirisfal han llegado, ¡justo a tiempo para ver su enclave en llamas! Si giran ahora, lucharán contra nosotros de espaldas.\n\n<Mograine sacude la cabeza.>\n\nNo, solo tienen una opción, la cual solo tiene un resultado: ¡APOCALIPSIS!\n\nMientras hablamos, se preparan para hacer un último asalto.\n\nEl Rey Exánime espera tu regreso, $gcampeón:campeona;. Vigila debajo de nosotros, en la Brecha de la Muerte.",dEN="The trap has been sprung, death knight. The armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal have arrived, just in time to see their enclave in flames! If they turn back now, they fight us with their backs turned.\n\n<Mograine shakes his head.>\n\nNo, they have only one option, which has only one outcome: APOCALYPSE!\n\nAs we speak, they prepare to make one final stand.\n\nThe Lich King awaits your return, champion. He stands watch below us, at Death's Breach.",o="在死亡裂口找到巫妖王。",oEN="Seek out the Lich King at Death's Breach.",c="Me has servido bien, <name>. La marca de la Plaga ha quedado grabada en estas tierras escarlatas. Has sembrado muerte y destrucción hasta donde alcanza la vista y me has entregado a los últimos de los ejércitos escarlatas.\n\n<El Rey Exánime señala las ruinas de Havenshire y la ciudad ardiente de New Avalon>\n\nHa llegado el momento de terminar lo que empezaste.",cEN="You have served me well, <name>. The mark of the Scourge has been burned into these Scarlet lands. You have reaped death and destruction for as far as the eye can see and delivered to me the last of the Scarlet armies.\n\n<The Lich King points to the ruins of Havenshire and the burning city of New Avalon.>\n\nIt is now time to finish what you started."}
Q[12779]={d="虽然击败的血色十字军士兵早已不计其数，但你那黑暗之心仍渴求更多的胜利。你对战斗的渴望无穷无尽，$n。\n\n<巫妖王顿了一顿。>\n\n万物皆有始终，我的死亡骑士。血色十字军的部队也将面对他们的宿命。他们无论如何也不能逃脱即将到来的厄运。也因此，他们将如同狂暴的困兽一般，挣扎到最后一刻，而你将见证这一切。\n\n使用这只号角召唤我麾下的冰霜巨龙，爬上它的背脊，并号令它进行战斗，去迎接你的再一次胜利吧。",dEN="You have slaughtered legions beyond number and still your dark heart craves more. Your hunger knows no end, <name>.\n\n<The Lich King pauses.>\n\nThere must come an end to all things, death knight. The Scarlet armies make their final stand against us. For them, there is no escape... no choice. And for this reason they will fight with a ferocity that you have yet to witness.\n\nUse this horn to call forth one of my wyrms. Climb upon its back and command it into battle. With it you will end the Scarlet Crusade.",o="巫妖王命令你消灭血色十字军。\n\n使用冰霜巨龙号角召唤出一条冰霜征服者，和它一起击败150名血色十字军士兵，并摧毁10台血色弩车。灵活地飞出他们的射程，免得自己被乱箭射穿！",oEN="The Lich King has commanded you to eradicate the Scarlet Crusade.\n\nUse the Horn of the Frostbrood to call forth a Frostbrood Vanquisher and with it slay 150 Scarlet Soldiers and destroy 10 Scarlet Ballistas. Avoid incoming projectiles by moving out of their line of fire!",p="把他们全杀光……",pEN="Kill them all...",c="Arrodíllate, campeón. Coloco este yelmo sobre tu cabeza para completar tu aterrador aspecto. Cualquiera que se atreva a mirar tu oscuro semblante sabrá que la muerte acecha. Que nadie se oponga con tal audacia a su rey como para enfrentarse a tu ira implacable, <name>.\n\nSolo queda una última tarea...\n\n<El Rey Exánime mira al oeste>\n\nCapilla de la Esperanza de la Luz.",cEN="Kneel, champion. I place this helm upon your head to complete your terrifying visage. Any that dare look upon your dark countenance will know that death comes. Let none stand so boldly against your king so as to face your merciless wrath, <name>.\n\nThere remains only one final task...\n\n<The Lich King looks west.>\n\nLight's Hope Chapel."}
Q[12781]={d="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al World of Warcraft!\n\nPara agradecerte de forma especial la compra de la edición de coleccionista de World of Warcraft, dale este vale a Siouxsie el alma en pena en El Bastión de Ébano. Después te darán un regalo: un pequeño acompañante que te seguirá en tu búsqueda de aventura y gloria.\n\n¡Gracias otra vez y disfruta tu estancia en World of Warcraft!|n",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将黑锋要塞礼品券交给黑锋要塞的女妖希奥克丝。",oEN="Bring the Ebon Hold Gift Voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold.",p="我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品。",pEN="I see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="我们欢迎您来到艾泽拉斯的世界，并从下列独特礼品中供您挑选一样。",cEN="We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts."}
Q[12789]={d="做好准备，$c。我要派你到东北方的圣光据点去。\n\n我得到消息说，天灾军团正在准备大举进攻祖达克。\n\n<瓦鲁斯紧紧盯着你的眼睛。>\n\n我们不能让那些杂种得逞。\n\n你一定要去全力消灭那里的天灾军团。这是圣光的意愿。\n\n解散。",dEN="Ready yourself, <class>. I'm dispatching you to Light's Breach, northeast of here.\n\nI've received word that the Scourge are making a push to take over Zul'Drak.\n\n<Valus stares you dead in the eyes.>\n\nThis will not come to pass.\n\nSee to it that you assist in the destruction of the Scourge there. The light demands it.\n\nDismissed.",o="圣光之望礼拜堂的北伐军战士瓦鲁斯要你转至祖达克的圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。",oEN="Crusader Valus at Light's Trust wants you to report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.",c="Excelente. Valus debe haber recibido mi informe.\n\nManos a la obra, <race>.",cEN="Excellent. Valus must have received my report.\n\nLet's get to work, <race>."}
Q[12790]={d="有件事不知道你是否了解，是这样，你可以利用我身后平台上的那块水晶，从达拉然传送到下面的晶歌森林废墟中。\n\n当然，你也可以在废墟里找到同样的水晶，然后用它传送回达拉然来，终点就在我上面的那间传送室里。\n\n我推荐你去试一下。",dEN="Just in case you don't already know, you can use the crystal on the platform behind me to teleport to the Violet Stand in Crystalsong Forest beneath Dalaran.\n\nCorrespondingly, you can use the crystal at the stand below to return to the chamber above me.\n\nI would like for you to do this now.",o="达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉要求你使用通向达拉然下方废墟的传送水晶和通向达拉然的传送水晶。",oEN="Archmage Celindra at The Violet Gate in Dalaran wants you to use the Teleport to Violet Stand Crystal and the Teleport to Dalaran Crystal.",p="我感觉到你还没测试那两颗传送水晶。\n\n没关系，慢慢来。",pEN="I sense that you haven't yet tested out both of the teleport crystals.\n\nThat's alright, take your time.",c="Excelente, <class>. Ahora ya sabes cómo bajar al Bosque de la Canción de Cristal y también cómo volver.",cEN="Excellent, <class>. Now you know the way to get down to Crystalsong Forest and also how to return."}
Q[12791]={d="Hola, $n. Puede que ya te hayas dado cuenta, pero nosotros, el Kirin Tor, hemos trasladado nuestra ciudad hasta aquí, en Rasganorte.\n\nDalaran ya no yace bajo su cúpula de protección en las orillas del Lago Lordamere. Ahora la ciudad flota por arte de magia sobre el Bosque Canto de Cristal.\n\nCreemos que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para tu viaje a la ciudad. Habla conmigo otra vez y lanzaré un hechizo de teletransporte para llevarte hasta allí.\n\nCuando llegues, busca a la archimaga Celindra y ofrécele mi sello como prueba de que hemos estado hablando.",dEN="Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",o="将肯瑞托徽记之戒交给达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉。",oEN="Deliver the Kirin Tor Signet to Archmage Celindra at The Violet Gate in Dalaran.",p="Saludos, <class>.",pEN="Greetings, <class>.",c="欢迎来到达拉然。\n\n我会确认戒指已经归还。",cEN="Welcome to Dalaran.\n\nI'll see to it that the ring is returned."}
Q[12792]={d="听着，$r！\n\n这一地区已经完全陷入了危机，到处都需要帮助。\n\n<库恩斯直视着你的眼睛。>\n\n现在最需要你的人是莉安娜。天灾军团已经切断了我们的联系，把她和她的部队孤立了起来。\n\n莉安娜驻守在圣光据点，就在西南方。",dEN="Listen up, <race>!\n\nThis entire region is full of crises. Everywhere you look you'll find those who could use your assistance.\n\n<Kunz looks you squarely in the eye.>\n\nNo one needs your help right now more than Riannah. The scourge have forced their way between us, leaving her and those she commands isolated.\n\nLight's Breach, where her forces are holding out, lies just southwest of here.",o="银色前沿的指挥官库恩斯要你转至圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。",oEN="Commander Kunz at Argent Stand wants you to report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach.",c="看来我的报告一定有送库恩斯的手中。\n\n很高兴知道他还健在。",cEN="My report must have made it through to Kunz.\n\nIt is good to know that he is well."}
Q[12793]={d="¿Oyes eso, $r?\n\nEl clamor de la batalla del oeste llega desde la distancia hasta aquí, incluso por encima del estruendo de nuestra propia refriega.\n\nLa Plaga amenaza con romper las filas de esos que se llaman a sí mismos \"la Cruzada Argenta\". Evitar esto es lo que más prisa corre en toda la región.\n\nViaja a la Brecha de la Luz y únete a ellos. Habla con Maaka, él se encargará de que llegues a salvo.",dEN="You hear that, <race>?\n\nThe clamor of battle far to the west reaches us here, even over the din of our own struggle.\n\nThe Scourge are threatening to break through the lines of those calling themselves the Argent Crusade. Preventing this is as urgent as anything in the region.\n\nTravel to Light's Breach and join in their struggle. Speak to Maaka and he will provide you safe passage.",o="希姆托加的巫医库弗要你转至圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。\n\n玛尔卡会向你提供必需的交通工具。",oEN="Khufu in Zim'Torga wants you to travel to Light's Breach and report to Sergeant Riannah there.\n\nMaaka will provide you with transportation there.",c="圣光会战胜一切！",cEN="The Light shall prevail!"}
Q[12794]={d="Hola, $n. Puede que ya te hayas dado cuenta, pero nosotros, el Kirin Tor, hemos trasladado nuestra ciudad hasta aquí, en Rasganorte.\n\nDalaran ya no yace bajo su cúpula de protección en las orillas del Lago Lordamere. Ahora la ciudad flota por arte de magia sobre el Bosque Canto de Cristal.\n\nCreemos que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para tu viaje a la ciudad. Habla conmigo otra vez y lanzaré un hechizo de teletransporte para llevarte hasta allí.\n\nCuando llegues, busca a la archimaga Celindra y ofrécele mi sello como prueba de que hemos estado hablando.",dEN="Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",o="将肯瑞托徽记之戒交给达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉。",oEN="Deliver the Kirin Tor Signet to Archmage Celindra at the Violet Gate in Dalaran.",p="Saludos, <class>.",pEN="Greetings, <class>.",c="欢迎来到达拉然。\n\n我会确认戒指已经归还。",cEN="Welcome to Dalaran.\n\nI'll see to it that the ring is returned."}
Q[12795]={d="就在不久之前，我突然看见东边的树林另一边突然升起了一发信号弹的火光。\n\n这一定表示银色前沿那里的十字军成员遭遇到了什么麻烦。\n\n但我现在不能离开我们的岗哨，$r，得依靠你了。只要时间允许，你立刻过去寻找指挥官法斯塔夫，并且看看他们那边是否有需要你帮助的地方。",dEN="A few moments ago I spotted a signal flare over the treeline to the east.\n\nThat can only mean that things are not going smoothly for the Crusaders at Argent Stand.\n\nI cannot leave our post here, <race>, but you can. When time permits, make your way up to Commander Falstaav and see if there's anything you can do to lighten their burden.",o="黑锋哨站的血玫瑰达图拉要求你去跟银色前沿的指挥官法斯塔夫谈一谈。",oEN="Bloodrose Datura at Ebon Watch wants you to speak with Commander Falstaav at The Argent Stand.",c="Resulta que hay algo que puedes hacer para ayudar, <class>.",cEN="As it happens there is something you can do to be of assistance, <class>."}
Q[12796]={d="Hola, $n. Puede que ya te hayas dado cuenta, pero nosotros, el Kirin Tor, hemos trasladado nuestra ciudad hasta aquí, en Rasganorte.\n\nDalaran ya no yace bajo su cúpula de protección en las orillas del Lago Lordamere. Ahora la ciudad flota por arte de magia sobre el Bosque Canto de Cristal.\n\nCreemos que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para tu viaje a la ciudad. Habla conmigo otra vez y lanzaré un hechizo de teletransporte para llevarte hasta allí.\n\nCuando llegues, busca a la archimaga Celindra y ofrécele mi sello como prueba de que hemos estado hablando.",dEN="Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",o="将肯瑞托徽记之戒交给达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉。",oEN="Deliver the Kirin Tor Signet to Archmage Celindra at The Violet Gate in Dalaran.",p="Saludos, <class>.",pEN="Greetings, <class>.",c="欢迎来到达拉然。\n\n我会确认戒指已经归还。",cEN="Welcome to Dalaran.\n\nI'll see to it that the ring is returned."}
Q[12797]={d="你说得没错，$r。我可以清晰地感觉到索拉查盆地的能量正在被亡灵天灾腐蚀。\n\n我已经将自己封印在了这枚符文中，$r。将这枚符文交给派你前来的守卫者——只有得到她的允许，我才能踏入她的领地。",dEN="You speak the truth, <race>. I can sense the very essence of Sholazar Basin begin to fray by the blight of undeath even as we speak.\n\nI've bound my being into the rune, <race>. Deliver it to she who sent you here -- for only her power can grant me passage to her lands.",o="将欧米伽符文带回索拉查盆地的雨声河，交给弗蕾亚的化身。",oEN="Bring the Omega Rune to the Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids in Sholazar Basin.",p="<name>, has vuelto.",pEN="You've returned, <name>.",c="你做得很好。\n\n对我们的敌人降下灾难。对服侍巫妖王而威胁泰坦创造物的人降下灾难——源生石像就是为此而来。",cEN="You've done well.\n\nWoe unto our enemies. Woe unto those who serve the Lich King and threaten the titans' creations -- for the Etymidian is here."}
Q[12798]={d="你现在已经收集到了长剑套牌的所有卡片，一张新的卡片神秘地出现在你手中。卡面上描绘着一位占卜师，无论你把卡片转动到何种角度，占卜师似乎都在盯着你。\n\n你觉得似乎可以用这张卡片来联络某些人，或某些事物。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Swords cards together into a deck, another card appears on top. It depicts a fortune teller that seems to stare at you no matter how you hold the card.\n\nYou feel the card could be used to communicate with someone.",o="使用长剑套牌召唤一位暗月占卜师，并把套牌交给占卜师。",oEN="Use the Swords Deck to summon a Darkmoon Fortune Teller and give the deck to them.",p="看来你已集满全套的长剑套牌。太好了。",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Swords. Excellent.",c="暗月马戏团对这些塔罗牌很有兴趣，如果你收集到更多的卡片，不要犹豫，立刻呼唤我们。我们也有自己的商人，所以请让我提供一些东西，来与你交换这些卡片。",cEN="Your inscription ability has grown, scribe. The tarot cards are of great interest to the Darkmoon Faire, so do not hesitate to call upon us if you manage to create more. We are not without our own skilled tradesmen, so please allow us to offer something in trade for the cards."}
Q[12799]={d="Deberías alegrarte de que venga, me dijeron. Disfrutarás de su compañía, me dijeron... \n\nLa verdad es que no me dejaron elección. Finklestein es el mejor alquimista de la Cruzada. Supongo que es un honor que haya elegido mi puesto para establecer una tienda. Pero desde que ha llegado, me he visto relegado a recolectar diversos ingredientes para alquimia.\n\nDime, $r, ¿te apetece echarme una mano? Al sur de aquí hay algunas pozas poseídas por espíritus de trols antiguos. Recoge su ectoplasma para mí.",dEN="You should be happy he's coming, they said. You'll enjoy his company, they said....\n\nWell it's not as if I had a choice in the matter. Finklestein is the Crusade's best alchemist. I suppose I should be honored that he's chosen my post to set up shop. But ever since he's arrived, I've been relegated to collecting various alchemical ingredients.\n\nSay, <race>, how about you give me a hand? Just south of here are some pools that are haunted by spirits of ancient trolls. Collect their ectoplasm for me.",o="赫布瓦罗的阿纳斯上尉要求你转至扎尔金之池，从迷失的达卡莱灵魂身上收集5份上古灵质。",oEN="Captain Arnath at Heb'Valok wants you to collect 5 Ancient Ectoplasms from the Lost Drakkari Spirits at the Pools of Zha'Jin.",p="Buen día, <race>.\n\n¿Has recogido el ectoplasma que Finklestein pidió?",pEN="Good day, <race>.\n\nHave you collected the ectoplasm Finklestein asked for?",c="Gracias, <class>.\n\nEsto debería ahorrarle a mis hombres un tiempo precioso.",cEN="Thank you, <class>.\n\nThis should save my men some precious time."}
Q[12800]={d="血色十字军在这里的领地已经被连根拔除，我们将在诺森德消灭他们的残部。\n\n现在，我军的重点攻击方向将转到圣光之愿礼拜堂。你们的君王决不允许这枚眼中钉继续存在下去！\n\n我已经下达了最后的命令。天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔正在布洛米尔外围等着你。转至西北方，穿过洞穴之后进入剧毒林地，然后沿着边缘的小路转至布洛米尔。\n\n不要让我失望，$n。",dEN="The Scarlet Enclave is no more. What remains of the Crusade will be dealt with in Northrend.\n\nWe now turn all of our efforts to Light's Hope Chapel. No longer will this affront to your master be allowed to exist!\n\nI have issued my final command. Scourge Commander Thalanor awaits your arrival at the edge of Browman Mill. Go northwest, through the cave, into the Noxious Glade and take the path leading out of the glade to the mill.\n\nDo not fail me, <name>.",o="向布洛米尔的天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔报到。",oEN="Report to Scourge Commander Thalanor at Browman Mill.",c="大领主与其它的死亡骑士正在准备进攻！我们将会把此地残留的最后一点生气给榨干。",cEN="The Highlord and the other death knights are preparing to strike! We will squeeze the last remnants of life out of this place."}
Q[12801]={d="El Alba Argenta se mantiene desafiante en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz. Se atreven a hacer frente a la Plaga y, solo por esa razón, ¡debemos acabar con ellos!\n\nLos imponentes ejércitos del Rey Exánime se preparan mientras la batalla final por las Tierras de la Peste se aproxima. ¡Hoy ascendemos al reino inmortal de los héroes de la Plaga!\n\nCuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;, informa al alto señor Darion Mograine. Él te dará las últimas órdenes y comandará a nuestros ejércitos hasta la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz.",dEN="The Argent Dawn stands defiantly against us at Light's Hope Chapel. They dare oppose the Scourge and for that reason alone they must be destroyed!\n\nThe mighty armies of the Lich King stand at the ready as the final battle for the Plaguelands approaches. Today we ascend into the immortal realm of Scourge heroes!\n\nWhen you are ready for battle, report to Highlord Darion Mograine. It is the highlord who will issue the final march orders and command our armies at Light's Hope Chapel.",o="击败银色黎明的部队，揭开黎明之光的秘密。\n\n如果你活着从战场上归来，就去向大领主达里安·莫格莱尼复命。",oEN="Defeat the forces of the Argent Dawn and uncover the Light of Dawn.\n\nReport to Highlord Darion Mograine should you survive.",p="<大领主莫格莱尼点了点头。>",pEN="<Highlord Mograine nods.>",c="No habrá expiación para nosotros, <name>. Estamos condenados para siempre a vagar por la tierra como monstruos. Aunque el Rey Exánime haya soltado su control sobre nosotros, los espectros de nuestro pasado acecharán nuestros recuerdos para siempre.\n\nDebemos reparar el daño de la única forma que conocemos: la muerte...\n\nTe pido ahora que te unas a mí en Acherus como Caballero de la Lanza de Ébano. Juntos destruiremos al Rey Exánime y acabaremos con la Plaga.",cEN="There will be no atonement for us, <name>. We are forever damned to walk the earth as monsters. While the Lich King may have loosed his grip upon us, the specters of our past will forever haunt our memories.\n\nWe must make amends in the only way we know how: Death...\n\nI ask you now to join me in Acherus as a Knight of the Ebon Blade. Together we will destroy the Lich King and end the Scourge."}
Q[12802]={d="<La voz de Drakuru llena tu mente.>\n\n¡Eh, $gtron:titi;! ¡Este ojo de los profetas es genial! ¡Lo he usado para seguih'te y ya he visto que tienes el corazón! No está mal...\n\nAhora solo tienes que llevarlo a mi brasero del Pasaje de Drak'atal, a poca distancia al este.\n\nTienes que beber mi elixir en el pedeh'tal para invocarme. Eh'ta vez tienes que ponerle un poco de mojo de desesperación de los defensores para que funcione.",dEN="<Drakuru's voice fills your mind.>\n\nHey, mon! Dis eye of da prophets be great! I been usin' it to watch ya and I see ya got da heart now! Not bad....\n\nNow ya just gotta bring it to my brazier at Drak'atal Passage, a short walk east of ya.\n\nYa must drink my elixir at da pedestal to summon me there. This time, ya need ta mix in some desperate mojo from the defenders there for it ta be workin'.",o="达克阿塔小径的达库鲁要求你将古树精华宝石交给他。\n\n你还需要收集5份绝望魔精，才能在那里使用药剂。",oEN="Drakuru wants you to bring the Heart of the Ancients to him at Drak'atal Passage.\n\nYou will need to collect 5 Desperate Mojo to use the elixir there.",c="让人印象深刻，老兄！命运让我们相遇真是一件好事。\n\n很快，我就能净化达克萨隆，替我的弟兄们复仇，你也会得到达克萨隆的财宝当作奖赏。",cEN="Impressive, mon! Fate be kind in bringin' us together.\n\nSoon I be avengin' me bruddas by cleansin' Drak'Tharon, and you be awarded Drak'Tharon's greatest treasure."}
Q[12803]={d="No sé muy bien lo que vi mientras volaba hacia el noreste, pero me pareció una mujer gigantesca machacando a la Plaga.\n\nHe oído al profesor hablar de una \"guardiana de vida\" nombrada por los titanes para vigilar Sholazar. No soy historiador de los titanes, pero parece que encaja.\n\nTambién sé que si la Plaga cruza la frontera entre Las Tierras Perdidas y el resto de Sholazar, nuestra expedición puede darse por muerta. ¿Qué te parece si vas a buscarla y le echas una mano?",dEN="I'm not sure about what I saw while flying to the northeast, but to me it looked like a gigantic woman kicking some Scourge butt.\n\nI'd heard the professor talk about a certain \"lifewarden\" appointed by the titans to look over Sholazar. I might not be a titan historian, but it sounds like she fits the bill.\n\nI also know that if the Scourge cross the border between the Lost Lands and the rest of Sholazar, our expedition's as good as dead. What do you say you go look for her and lend a hand?",o="转至索拉查盆地的荒芜边界，寻找弗蕾亚的化身。荒芜边界就在雨声河与迷失之地的交界处。",oEN="Travel to the Blight Line, between Rainspeaker Rapids and the Lost Lands in Sholazar Basin and seek the Avatar of Freya.",c="你不属于这片大地。但你也不是和天灾军团一伙的。\n\n我该拿你怎么办呢？",cEN="You are not of this land. But you also are not with the Scourge.\n\nWhat should I make of you?"}
Q[12804]={d="有些时候呢，最糟糕的事情莫过于有一整个营地的猎人每天出去捕猎，杀死各类大型飞禽走兽，回头来却发现它们的肉都是又干又硬根本难以入口。一整天疲倦的狩猎之后，你回到营地却发现只能吃这些东西，恐怕想死的心都有了。\n\n好在附近不远的地方就有柔软多汁的上等好肉。在河流和营地的南边有不少活蹦乱跳的长颈鹿，这些家伙能给饥肠辘辘的猎人们提供最完美的肉食。去吧，从它们身上切几块最好的肉排回来，让我好好犒劳一下这里的同志们。",dEN="Sometimes, there's nothing worse than a camp full of hunters. They're all so busy taking down prey animals that the only meat I get is tough and stringy. That's hardly the kind of thing you want to come home to after a long day on the hunt.\n\nLucky for us, though, there is a source of tender, succulent meat nearby. To the south of the river and the camp live longneck grazers. They're a perfect source of meat for our hungry hunters. Bring me back the best cuts of meat and we'll properly toast our comrades.",o="将5份食草长颈鹿肉排交给奈辛瓦里营地的菜刀库尔格。",oEN="Bring 5 Longneck Grazer Steaks to Korg the Cleaver at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你弄到那些肉排了吗？",pEN="Did you get those steaks?",c="¡Eso sí que es una comida! Si algo bueno salió del naufragio, ¡tiene que ser que nos hemos librado de comer solo carne salada durante el próximo mes! Gracias de nuevo, <name>.",cEN="Now that's a meal! If anything good came of the shipwreck, it's got to be that we've been spared eating nothing but salt beef for the next month! Thank you again, <name>."}
Q[12805]={d="源血之柱崩塌时，巨大的冲击力使大地受到了重创。\n\n那些原本支撑着巨柱运转的生命能量，现在已经沾染到了崩裂碎片周围的那些元素生物身上。我不能就这样眼看着这些能量白白流失，要知道，我们只剩下四根巨柱了。\n\n你现在立刻转至东南方的崩裂碎片，并寻找那些源血元素。\n\n找到它们之后，先将其杀死，然后对它们的残骸使用这颗宝钻，回收它们释放出来的能量。在一切都结束之后，我们还要用这些能量来抚平大地的创伤。",dEN="The Lifeblood Pillar was toppled over with great force, sending the very earth into an upheaval.\n\nThe elementals that wander the sundered shard carry with them the very life essence that gave the pillar its strength. I cannot allow this energy to be wasted, for only four pillars remain.\n\nHead to the sundered shard, to the southeast, and seek the lifeblood elementals.\n\nUse this gem on their remains to recover their rampant energy. We'll need the energy to heal the land when all this is over.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要求你转至东南方的崩裂碎片，消灭8只源血元素，然后对它们的躯体使用源血宝钻。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you to go to the Sundered Shard to the southeast and use the Lifeforce Gem on 8 destroyed Lifeblood Elementals.",p="¿Has recuperado la energía de los elementales, <name>?",pEN="Have you recovered the elementals' energy, <name>?",c="Te lo agradezco, <name>. Es una lástima que el pilar haya caído, pero debemos salvar lo que podamos.",cEN="I thank you, <name>. It is a shame that the pillar has fallen, but we must salvage what we can."}
Q[12806]={d="有些人或许会说，我们最重要的使命并不是消灭巫妖王，而是彻底毁灭血色先锋军。我对此的评论是：十分愚蠢，可惜我却无力决定或改变这些。\n\n这里西南方，有一处可以俯瞰大海的悬崖，叫作死亡高地。你立刻去那里找到高级指挥官埃雷特，那家伙全权负责消灭先锋军的行动。\n\n<男爵清了清嗓子。>\n\n你要立刻全速赶到那边，并向他报到。他特地点名要求你去协助他。",dEN="Some would say that our most critical mission lies not with the Lich King, but with the utter destruction of the Scarlet Onslaught. I would say that is foolish, but who am I to judge?\n\nDeath's Rise is far to the southwest, overlooking the sea along the cliff wall. There you will find Lord-Commander Arete personally overseeing the Onslaught's destruction himself.\n\n<The baron clears his throat.>\n\nDo see to it that you report to him with all due haste. He asked for you personally.",o="向死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特报到。",oEN="Report to Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise in Icecrown.",c="该死的，也差不多是时候了吧！想必斯利文男爵一定是慢吞吞的派你过来找我。\n\n我真该把他肩膀上的空白军徽给拔掉！",cEN="It's about damned time! No doubt that Baron Sliver took his sweet time in sending you to me.\n\nI should have that empty space above his shoulders removed!"}
Q[12807]={d="Tenemos mucho que hacer, pero primero creo que vendría bien ponerse al día.\n\nLos caballeros de la Muerte tenemos un pasado muy pintoresco con nuestros amigos Escarlatas. Los muy idiotas descansan tan ricamente en el puerto que hay debajo de nosotros, al noroeste.\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista; para una buena charla, vuelve a hablar conmigo y te lo explicaré todo.",dEN="We have much to do, but first I believe a short refresher is in order.\n\nWe death knights have a colorful past with our Scarlet friends who idiotically rest comfortably in the harbor below us to the northwest.\n\nWhen you are ready for an earful, speak with me again and I shall provide enlightenment.",o="聆听死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特讲述的故事。",oEN="Listen to Lord-Commander Arete's tale at Death's Rise.",c="银色北伐军愚蠢地忽视血色先锋军的存在——我们可不会这么做的。\n\n我们不指望他们能否在对抗巫妖王的战争中派上用场，我们不相信他们有资格存在。我们将会是他们的末日，将他们一次解决！",cEN="In their folly, the Argent Crusade has chosen to turn a blind eye upon the presence of the Scarlet Onslaught. We will not.\n\nWe do not care if they might assist in the battle against the Lich King. We do not believe them worthy of existence. We will be their end, once and for all!"}
Q[12810]={d="先锋军港口的狮鹫骑士严密地掩护着他们的地面部队，你需要一匹飞行座骑才能把他们都打下来。不过首先，我们得收集到足够的材料来引导仪式，制造出你所需的飞行座骑。\n\n这个仪式必须要用到大量的鲜血。\n\n<说着，指挥官向西北方指了指。>\n\n若是说血的话，那边的港口里难道不就有无数吗……我是指鲨鱼。在把这个气泡装满它们的血之前不要回来。",dEN="The forces at Onslaught Harbor are heavily reinforced by gryphon riders. You need a mount that will enable you to put them down. But first, we need the components for the ritual that is going to make it all happen.\n\nA great deal of blood is necessary for the ritual to be undertaken.\n\n<The lord-commander points down and to the northwest.>\n\nThere is a readily available supply down there in the harbor... sharks. Do not return to me until you've filled this bladder with their blood.",o="死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特要求你用10只饥饿的巨鲨的血装满血囊。",oEN="Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise wants you to fill the Gore Bladder with the blood of 10 Ravenous Jaws.",p="No es un trabajo glamuroso, pero es necesario.\n\nAhora, ¿por qué estamos hablando de nuevo antes de que hayas terminado, <class>?",pEN="It's not glamorous work, but it is necessary.\n\nNow why is it that we are talking again before you are done, <class>?",c="干得好。稍待一下，等你身上的海水干了我们再继续。",cEN="Well done. Take a moment to let the saltwater dry from your skin before we continue."}
Q[12813]={d="我们的指挥官大人真是太善良……太慷慨了。相比于人见人爱花见花开、到处撒播阳光的他，我的内心深处充满了阴暗的东西，比如仇恨什么的。\n\n在我看来，光是终结他们那悲惨的生命是不够的，远远不够！我还要让他们承受无尽的屈辱！\n\n你想想，有什么能比沦落成你最仇恨最厌恶的事物更令人难以忍受的呢？你的一生都是为了消灭某些东西而存在，可到头来你却变成了它们？\n\n多可悲啊。\n\n带着这些药剂转至西北方的先锋军港口，把它倒在先锋军士兵的尸体上，看看有什么效果。不过，注意避开大教堂。",dEN="How kind... how generous our lord-commander is. Where he is flowers and sunshine, I am filled only with hatred.\n\nIt is not enough to end their miserable lives... I want them humiliated... debased!\n\nWhat could be more unspeakable than to be turned into that which you hate? To dedicate your existence to eradicating a thing, and then in the end to become it?\n\nHow sad.\n\nTake this tincture northwest to Onslaught Harbor. Apply it to their still corpses and watch what happens, but avoid the cathedral.",o="死亡高地的希塔尔·达克门德给了你一份达克门德的药剂，并要求你对先锋军港口一带的任意10具血色先锋军成员的尸体使用它。",oEN="Setaal Darkmender at Death's Rise has given you the Darkmender's Tincture. Apply it to the corpses of 10 of any of the Scarlet Onslaught units found at Onslaught Harbor.",p="想必你没那么快完成吧？",pEN="Surely you're not done so soon?",c="<德莱尼死亡骑士用冰冷的眼神盯着你看。她的眼神和墓穴一样死气沉沉。一丝狡猾的微笑爬上她的脸颊。>\n\n我明天还会准备好更多的药剂。在那之前，好好保重吧。",cEN="<The draenei death knight fixes you with a cold stare, her eyes dead as the grave. A sly grin creeps across her features.>\n\nI'll have more of the tincture prepared tomorrow. Until then, be well."}
Q[12814]={d="你说，能有什么事比起利用他们自己的狮鹫来对付他们更加令人愉快呢？立刻前往先锋军港口，随便干掉哪个倒霉的狮鹫骑士，从他手中抢过狮鹫的缰绳。\n\n然后，你直接回到这里来，把狮鹫交给乌佐·唤亡者。他会妥善地将那只狮鹫做一些改变，并让你骑着它执行下一步任务。",dEN="What could be more fitting than to take one of their own gryphons to use against them? Go to Onslaught Harbor and take the reins to one of their gryphons from the dead clutches of its rider.\n\nReturn with the gryphon, delivering it to Uzo Deathcaller. He will see to its proper transformation and provide you with further instructions.",o="将一只先锋军狮鹫交给死亡高地的乌佐·唤亡者。",oEN="Deliver an Onslaught Gryphon to Uzo Deathcaller at Death's Rise.",p="为什么花了那么久？他们的狮鹫速度很慢吗？我们可得想点办法才行！",pEN="What took so long? Are their gryphons slow? We'll have to do something about that.",c="喔，太好了，这一定很棒！\n\n往后面站……我要举行重塑狮鹫的仪式了！",cEN="Oh yeah this is gonna be good!\n\nStand back... I'm gonna call down the wrath of the blood ritual!"}
Q[12815]={d="Ahora que tienes tu grifo osario, quiero que lo lleves allí todos los días y crees un espacio aéreo protegido sobre el Puerto del Embate.\n\nDebo admitir, $gamigo:amiga;, que me da igual si usas o no el grifo osario para matar a esos jinetes de grifos. Pero supongo que si lo haces te será mucho más fácil llegar hasta ellos.\n\nAdemás, tiene un montón de trucos muy interesantes que puedes utilizar.",dEN="Now that you got your bone gryphon, I wantcha to take it back down there everyday and make a no fly zone over Onslaught Harbor.\n\nI gotta admit, mon, I don't really care if you use the bone gryphon to kill them gryphon riders or not. But I'm guessin' that if you do, you'll find it much easier to get to 'em.\n\nBesides, it's got lots of neat tricks you can use.",o="死亡高地的乌佐·唤亡者要求你杀死10名先锋军狮鹫骑士。",oEN="Uzo Deathcaller at Death's Rise wants you to kill 10 Onslaught Gryphon Riders.",p="你这么快回来做什么？我还看到那些先锋军的小子在下面飞来飞去哪！",pEN="What you back so soon for? I know I can still see those Onslaught boys still flyin' around down there!",c="这就对了！而且你要知道，我们每天都需要有人做这项工作。\n\n希望你明天还会回来。你的白骨狮鹫会等着你。",cEN="That's the spirit! And you know, I need this done everyday that we're here.\n\nI hope you'll come back again tomorrow. Your bone gryphon will be waitin'."}
Q[12816]={d="巫妖王的部队已经在我们鼻子底下扎了营，我们可不能坐以待毙！你会拿起武器跟这些可憎的入侵者作战，保卫银月城的吧？\n\n城外出现了奇怪的符文法阵，它散发着神秘的能量，亡灵和悬浮在半空的浮空城也被同样的能量环绕着。我想这个符文法阵对天灾士兵们必然有着重要的意义，因此想让你调查此事。去和城外的亡灵作战吧，带回你杀死他们的证据，以及你的调查结果，我会奖励你的。去吧！",dEN="The Lich King has sent his undead upon our very doorstep; we cannot remain idle! Surely you will step up to defend Silvermoon from these accursed invaders?\n\nThere are strange runic circles outside, glowing with the same energy that surrounds the undead and the Necropolis above. They have significance, I'm certain, and I want you to find out what. Thin the numbers of those aberrations while you're at it; bring me proof of their death along with your results, and I will reward you. Go!",o="从银月城外面的天灾士兵身上收集3块暗淡的死灵石，并调查天灾营地附近的发光符文法阵。",oEN="Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside Silvermoon and investigate the glowing runic circles near their encampment.",p="你调查过入侵行动了吗？没有时间可以浪费了！",pEN="Have you investigated the invasion yet? There's no time for dawdling!",c="嗯。从你告诉我的事情，法阵里的声音……它们一定是被用来做为某种沟通的工具。我一想到那些邪恶的脑袋会通过这样的魔法联系就不寒而栗。无论如何，你看起来还是很健全很清醒。银色黎明感谢你的努力。",cEN="Hmm. From what you've told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane. The Argent Dawn appreciates your service."}
Q[12817]={d="巫妖王的部队已经在我们鼻子底下扎了营，我们可不能坐以待毙！你会拿起武器跟这些可憎的入侵者作战，保卫埃索达的吧？\n\n城外出现了奇怪的符文法阵，它散发着神秘的能量，亡灵和悬浮在半空的浮空城也被同样的能量环绕着。我想这个符文法阵对天灾士兵们必然有着重要的意义，因此想让你调查此事。去和城外的亡灵作战吧，带回你杀死他们的证据，以及你的调查结果，我会奖励你的。去吧！",dEN="The Lich King has sent his undead upon our very doorstep; we cannot remain idle! Surely you will step up to defend the Exodar from these accursed invaders?\n\nThere are strange runic circles outside, glowing with the same energy that surrounds the undead and the Necropolis above. They have significance, I'm certain, and I want you to find out what. Thin the numbers of those aberrations while you're at it; bring me proof of their death along with your results, and I will reward you. Go!",o="从埃索达外面的天灾士兵身上收集3块暗淡的死灵石，并调查天灾营地附近的发光符文法阵。然后向克雷格尔上尉复命。",oEN="Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside the Exodar and investigate the glowing runic circles near their encampment. Then return to Lieutenant Kregor.",p="你调查过入侵行动了吗？没有时间可以浪费了！",pEN="Have you investigated the invasion yet? There's no time for dawdling!",c="嗯。从你告诉我的事情，法阵里的声音……它们一定是被用来做为某种沟通的工具。我一想到那些邪恶的脑袋会通过这样的魔法联系就不寒而栗。无论如何，你看起来还是很健全很清醒。银色黎明感谢你的努力。",cEN="Hmm. From what you've told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane. The Argent Dawn appreciates your service."}
Q[12818]={d="我们还是来谈正事吧……莉吉特要我组装一些威力更大的地雷，但我手里的零件不多了。\n\n镇子的西边有一堆火箭车的残骸，那是我们最后一辆火箭车……莉吉特在给它加油的时候有点过于激动了，不过我觉得我似乎不应该把喷嘴直接装在排气设备上。所以说活到老学到老，不是吗？\n\n在撞坏的火箭车周围肯定散落着大量零件……你不如去把那些杂七杂八的麻烦鬼赶走，给我收集一些零件回来？",dEN="To the point... Ricket's asked me to put together some stronger land mines, but I'm running low on parts.\n\nJust west of town, you'll find the remains of our last rocket sled... Ricket got a little excited when she was fueling it, but I probably should have thought to not put the nozzle right over the exhaust. Live and learn, eh?\n\nThere should be a good stock of spare parts scattered around the destroyed sled... why don't you go ahead and chase off those scavengers and nab me some of that wreckage?",o="K3的基尔·斯巴索克需要10份烧焦的零件。",oEN="Jeer Sparksocket at K3 would like 10 pieces of Charred Wreckage.",p="我们需要一些可以用来加热引擎来对抗这酷寒的东西……快想啊基尔，快想！\n\n哦嗨！你替我找到残骸上的零件了吗？",pEN="We have to have something we can use to insulate our engines against this cold... think, Jeer, think!\n\nOh hey! Did you get some of that wreckage for me?",c="这些就可以了，谢啦！\n\n你有在那里看到迪姆吗？我之前派了他过去，但他再也没回来过。我希望他没事。\n\n说到这个……我很好奇詹克斯到哪去了……",cEN="These will do nicely, thanks!\n\nDid you happen to see Dim out there? I sent him out a long while back and he never came back. I hope he's alright.\n\nSpeaking of which... I wonder where Janks is..."}
Q[12819]={d="该死的！我的工具呢？刚才还放在这儿的。\n\n噢！我可能在安放地雷的时候把它们忘在西边了。这可有点麻烦。如果你能帮我把它们拿回来，我会非常感激你的。但你可能需要留神脚下……你应该可以沿着我离开的路进去。\n\n哦，不要试图飞进去……我当时灵机一动，在那里安装了专门对付飞行物体的炮台，而且它们是不能辨别目标的。",dEN="Blast it! Where are my tools? I had them here just a moment ago.\n\nOh! I probably forgot them when I was setting up that minefield in the west. That's mildly inconvenient. I'd be quite appreciative if you could go get them for me. You'll need to watch your step though... you should be able to use the same path that I did to get out.\n\nOh, and don't try to fly in... I had the presence of mind to set up turrets to shoot down anything that might fly, and they aren't very discerning in who they target.",o="K3的基尔·斯巴索克要你进入雷区，取回斯巴索克的工具。",oEN="Jeer Sparksocket at K3 would like Sparksocket's Tools retrieved from his minefield.",p="如果詹克斯在这儿的话，我只要派他去跑这腿就好了。噢……再想一想……我也不太确定我告诉他安全的路径怎么走了。\n\n幸亏有很多你们这种冒险者在这附近，嗯？",pEN="If Janks were here, I could have just sent him on this errand. Oh... on second thought... I'm not sure I told him where the safe path is anyway.\n\nGood thing I have you resourceful adventure types around, eh?",c="哈哈！就是它！真谢谢你。我希望你在穿越雷区的时候不算太困扰。",cEN="Ha ha! These are them! Thank you kindly. I hope you didn't have too much trouble traversing the field."}
Q[12820]={d="我等这些地雷已经等了一万年了！好吧，至少有好几天了。他怎么花了这么长时间？\n\n这个地方非常下等……到处都是恶心的猛犸人——你知道啦，他们体格很大，毛茸茸的，还非常丑陋——而且他们似乎非常狂热地想要霸占K3。\n\n但这是不可能的。\n\n我们已经在东北方的必经之路上设置了防御工事。可惜的是，我们的激光炮台能量供应有限……所以就要用到这些地雷了！去把他们都炸上天！",dEN="I've been waiting an eternity for these mines! Well, a few days at least. What took him so long?\n\nHere's the low down, compadre... there's this nasty bunch of magnataur--you know, big, hairy, and extremely ugly--and they seem pretty keen on taking K3 for themselves.\n\nNot going to happen.\n\nWe've got some defenses set up in their path, northeast of here. Sadly, our laser turrets have pretty limited power supplies... that's where these mines come in! Get over there and blow them up good!",o="K3的莉吉特要求你转至加姆雷区，使用改进型地雷杀死12个从加姆方向冲过来的敌人。加姆入侵者和雪盲追随者都算数。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to use Improved Land Mines at Garm's Bane to fend off 12 attackers from Garm. Both Garm Invaders and Snowblind Followers will count towards this goal.",p="我希望你也有顺便宰掉一些恶心的小狗头人，嗯？",pEN="You got some of their gross little snobold buddies too I hope?",c="于是……我就坐在这里，沉浸在我自己的伟大之中，然后我听到远方传来一声——啪！然后又一声——轰！再十几声！然后想到那些热切奔向死亡的猛玛象和狗头人，我的脸上就浮现了一丝微笑。\n\n那是不是很精彩呀？",cEN="So... here I sat, basking in the awesomeness that is me, and in the distance, I hear a pop! Then another! Then a dozen more! And a smile crept onto my face at the thought of all those magnataur and snobolds eagerly rushing to their own deaths.\n\nWas it glorious?"}
Q[12821]={d="¡El escuadrón de zapadores está listo! ¡Significa que es la hora de divertirse, $gquerido:querida;!\n\n¡Solo una cosa nos impide llevar a cabo nuestro asalto total sobre Garm! Envié a un corredor a colocar un teletransportador detrás de Garm, con éxito, por cierto, y volvió para recoger la célula de energía que necesita para funcionar. Todavía no funciona... lo que significa que la célula no ha llegado.\n\nNecesito que cruces Pesadilla de Garm y encuentres la célula de energía. Úsala para activar el teletransportador más allá de Garm, en Alto de Garm.",dEN="The sapper squad is ready. That means it's fun time, my dear!\n\nThere's only one thing holding us up from our full-scale assault on Garm! I sent a runner to set a teleporter up behind Garm--successfully I might add--and he returned to get the power cell it needs to function. It isn't working yet... which means the power cell didn't get there.\n\nI need you to look just on the other side of Garm's Bane for the power cell. When you find it, bring it farther east to Garm's Rise and activate the teleporter.",o="K3的莉吉特要你去找到传送器能量晶格，并用它引导加姆高地的传送器。",oEN="Ricket at K3 would like you to locate the Transporter Power Cell and use it to activate the Transportation Pad at Garm's Rise.",p="就算是猛犸人也该知道不要惹地精。",pEN="Even magnataur should know not to mess with goblins.",c="太棒了！\n\n<莉吉特脸上浮现一副凶狠的笑容。>\n\n让毁灭降临吧！",cEN="Excellent!\n\n<A fierce grin creeps onto Ricket's face.>\n\nLet the destruction begin!"}
Q[12822]={d="Ahora que hemos abierto el teletransportador, mi plan es bastante complejo... Tiene varias fases y requiere una coordinación impecable. ¡Y tenemos que conseguir suministros! ¡Y reclutar tropas! ¡Y seguramente nos lleve varias semanas de duro trabajo!\n\nJa, ja, por un momento te lo has creído, ¿verdad? Es cosa tuya, $gmuchacho:muchacha;. ¡Entra en el teletransportador y acaba con ellos! Nuestros zapadores te servirán de apoyo... No podrán huir.",dEN="Now that we have the teleporter open, my plan is quite complex... it has several facets and will take impeccable coordination. And there are supplies to be gathered! And troops to recruit! Likely, weeks of hard labor as well!\n\nHahah, I had you going there for a moment, didn't I? You've got this, kid. Hop through the teleporter and take the fight to them! Our sappers will back you up... they won't have anywhere to run.",o="K3的莉吉特要你去杀死6个加姆观察者和8个雪盲信徒。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to kill 6 Garm Watchers and 8 Snowblind Devotees.",p="没有什么比地精工兵更能直接对敌人造成恐慌的啦！",pEN="Nothing strikes fear into the enemy quite like a goblin sapper!",c="哈哈！这可给那些浪费我们时间的笨蛋上了一课。从今天开始，绿色的皮肤会让所有的猛犸人打从心底恐惧！",cEN="Haha! That'll teach those brutes to waste our time. From this day forth, green skin will strike fear into the hearts of all magnataur!"}
Q[12823]={d="嘿，你！我猜你是来参加战斗的吧？\n\n我要交给你一项特殊任务……我们要把整个洞穴炸塌！到他们的洞穴顶部去，你可以找到霜胆的祭坛。悄悄靠近祭坛，把这只重磅炸药包放在祭坛附近。\n\n放好炸弹之后，你就在一边等着，确定塔尔玛·霜胆碰到炸弹之后再迅速离开！没人知道那玩意爆炸以后，这座洞穴还能支撑多久！",dEN="Hey there! Joining us for the assault I assume?\n\nI've got a special task for you... we're going to bring the whole cave down on their heads! Towards the back of their cave, you should find Frostgut's Altar. Sneak up and plant this hardpacked explosive bundle somewhere close to it.\n\nOnce the charge is placed, stick around just long enough to make sure Frostgut bites it, then get out quickly! There's no knowing how long the cave will last once that thing goes off!",o="加姆高地的吉诺要你把重磅炸药包偷偷放到霜胆的祭坛附近，炸死塔尔玛·霜胆，然后在洞穴坍塌前逃出来。",oEN="Gino at Garm's Rise wants you to plant the Hardpacked Explosive Bundle near Frostgut's Altar, kill Tormar Frostgut, and then escape the cave before it collapses on you.",p="这个盒装爆裂物可是我的宝贝……花了我好几周的时间才做到完美。好几周！\n\n那可是很长一段时间……好吧。",pEN="That explosive bundle is my baby... it took me weeks to perfect it. WEEKS!\n\nThat's a long time... okay.",c="整座山都在摇晃！一定很灿烂吧？我想一定是！怎么可能不灿烂呢？\n\n发明家协会还说我的东西都只会爆炸。该死的，他们还真说对了！哈！",cEN="The whole mountain shook! Was it gorgeous? I bet it was! How could it not be?\n\nAnd the Inventor's League tells me all of my inventions just blow up. Darn right they do! Hah!"}
Q[12824]={d="¡Tienes unos pies muy veloces, $gmuchacho:muchacha;! Gracias por echarnos una mano con los explosivos... ¡Me moría de ganas de probar ese invento!\n\nVe y dile a Ricket que el frente magnatauro debería estar ya cubierto... mis zapadores se encargarán de los malos que queden.\n\n¡Gracias otra vez!",dEN="You've got some swift feet on you sonny! Thanks for lending a hand with those explosives... I've been waiting to give that invention a good test run for a while!\n\nGo ahead and tell Ricket we should be covered on the magnataur front now... my sappers will clean up any of the remaining baddies.\n\nThanks again!",o="回K3向莉吉特复命。",oEN="Return to Ricket at K3.",c="¿Has volado todo el lugar? ¡Bien hecho! Apuesto a que a Rio le hizo mucha gracia.\n\nRealmente agradecemos toda la ayuda que nos has prestado, <name>. ¿Qué te parece un recuerdo por tus molestias?",cEN="You blew the whole place up? Way to go! I bet Rio got a kick out of that.\n\nWe really appreciate all of the help you've lent us, <name>. How bout a souvenir for your troubles?"}
Q[12826]={d="¡Qué buen aspecto!\n\nNo, tú no, mis nuevas minas. Eres un poco $gpresuntuoso:presuntuosa;, ¿no? Yo, sin embargo, ¡soy absolutamente genial! Mi intelecto no tiene igual.\n\n¿De qué estábamos hablando? ¡Ah, sí, de mis nuevas minas! Nuevas y mejoradas... listas para cualquier uso infame que se le haya ocurrido a Ricket.\n\nSé $gbuen chico:buena chica; y llévaselas a Ricket, ¿quieres? Está justo allí... seguro que es un viaje épico. Eso sí, ten cuidado, está un poco chiflada.",dEN="Looking good!\n\nNo, not you - my new mines. You're just a little full of yourself, aren't you? I, on the other hand, am absolutely brilliant! My intellect cannot be matched.\n\nWhat were we talking about? Oh yes, my new mines! New and improved... ready for whatever devious use Ricket has concocted.\n\nBe a <good lad/doll> and go hand them off to Ricket, will you? She's right over there... it should be quite the epic journey, I'm sure. Be careful though, she's a little loopy.",o="把基尔的改进型地雷交给K3的莉吉特。",oEN="Deliver Jeer's Improved Land Mines to Ricket in K3.",p="基尔做好地雷了？好家伙。",pEN="Jeer finished the mines? Dandy.",c="嗯，你不觉得这是你看过的最可爱的毁灭包裹吗？",cEN="Well, aren't these just the cutest little packets of destruction you've ever seen?!"}
Q[12827]={d="¡Hola! ¡Tú eres $gnuevo:nueva;! ¿Podrías echarle una mano a Ricket?\n\nTenemos un problema inesperado: escasez de comida. Lo sé, lo sé... deberíamos haberlo previsto, pero tú no lo entiendes. Nuestras operaciones suelen ser bastante rápidas, con el escuadrón de zapadores y todo eso, así que normalmente no tenemos que preocuparnos por la comida. Pero mi querido K3 se ha vuelto popular.\n\n¿La mejor solución? Hay campamentos de gnolls al oeste y algunos gnolls desperdigados hurgando en la basura, como es habitual en ellos. ¿Podrías traer algunas de sus raciones?",dEN="Hey hey! You're a new face! Care to lend Ricket a hand?\n\nWe have a somewhat unexpected problem - food shortage. I know, I know... we should have seen that coming, but you don't get it. We tend to have somewhat of a quick turn-around here with our sapper squad and all, so usually we don't have to worry about long term eats. Good old K3's gotten popular though.\n\nConvenient solution? There are gnoll camps to the west and some gnolls scattered, scavenging as gnolls do. Care to go nab some of their rations?",o="K3的莉吉特想让你从附近的野蛮岭豺狼人那里夺取16份豺狼人的干粮。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to repossess 16 Dried Gnoll Rations from the nearby Savage Hill Gnolls.",p="嘿你又来啦！我肚子在叫……进行的如何？",pEN="Hey there again! My belly's rumbling... how'd it go?",c="我希望他们分享财富的时候能少点犹豫。我们至今对他们捡垃圾的行为都很容忍。",cEN="I hope they weren't too hesitant to share the wealth. We've been pretty forgiving with them picking through our leftovers thus far."}
Q[12828]={d="哇！真恶心。且不说豺狼人的口味如何，但我还以为它们的东西至少应该是……可以吃的东西吧。\n\n我们得想一些更有创意的点子。\n\n这样，托莉在镇子北边部署了一台炸弹储备机……离那个大洞穴的入口不远，你一定不会找不到的。我估计她是想要用炸药进行挖掘工作之类的，但我有一个更好的主意。\n\n你去拿一颗炸弹，把它扔向附近的某一头猛犸象……它们大部分都在西边活动。把它们的肉给我拿回来。",dEN="Wow! That stuff is nasty. Not to account for gnoll taste or anything, but I figured whatever they had would at least be... edible?\n\nLet's get more creative.\n\nTore's got an explosive dispenser north of town... not far from the big cavern entrance, can't miss it. I'm sure she intends them for mining purposes of some sort, but I've got a better idea.\n\nGrab one of those things and rush it to one of the nearby mammoths... most of them are to the west. Collect the meat, bring it back.",o="K3的莉吉特要你去拿取一颗D16限时炸弹，用它炸翻一头猛犸象，然后收集8块巨大的猛犸肉。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to retrieve a U.D.E.D, use it to blow up a mammoth, and retrieve 8 Hearty Mammoth Meat.",p="我知道我的计划很棒。别担心啦。\n\n跟大人物相处的感觉怎么样？蛮刺激的对吧？",pEN="I know my plan was brilliant. Don't even worry about it.\n\nDoes it feel good to be in the presence of greatness? A little tingly maybe?",c="都已经全熟啦！我自己改天也来做做看。\n\n谢啦，朋友！",cEN="And it's already well-done! I outdo myself sometimes.\n\nThanks much, friend!"}
Q[12829]={d="你好呀！我叫托莉，是K3的矿业部门的负责人……或者说很快就是了！\n\n这个洞穴里到处都是恶心的蜘蛛。我觉得，在我们进去之前，应该先除掉一些蜘蛛，你说呢？",dEN="Hiya! The name's Tore. I head up the mining operation here at K3... or I will shortly anyway!\n\nThis here cave is full of creepy-crawlies. I think we could do with a few less spiders before we move in - what'd you think?",o="水晶蛛网洞穴外的托莉·兰波维奇要你杀死12只水晶蛛网蜘蛛。",oEN="Tore Rumblewrench outside of Crystalweb Cavern wants you to kill 12 Crystalweb Spiders.",p="小心那些炸弹配给器！那些东西很危险的。",pEN="Be careful near that dispenser! Those things are dangerous.",c="哈哈！很高兴看到你负责处理这些烂工作。\n\n感谢你啊，伙计！",cEN="Ha ha! Good to see you're up for some dirty work.\n\nMuch appreciated there, pal!"}
Q[12830]={d="可以进去啦！\n\n我们刚刚抵达这里的时候，洞里有一些狗头人……但它们在挖矿的时候似乎遇到了某些不幸的事。不过影响不大，我们很快就控制了局面。\n\n我派了几个矿工进去找一些矿石样本，好让我可以调整机器继续前进，但他们一直都没回来。\n\n你能进去帮我拿些样本回来吗？里面的狗头人可能随身带着矿石，不过我猜它们差不多都死光了。",dEN="We're moving in!\n\nThere were some snobolds here when we arrived... their mining operation seems to have met some unfortunate happenings though. Doesn't much matter - we were taking over soon anyway.\n\nI sent some of our miners in there to get me some ore samples that I can use to calibrate our machines for processing, but they haven't come back.\n\nMind going in there and nabbing some samples for me in their stead? The snobolds probably have some on them, though I'd expect most of them are dead by now.",o="水晶蛛网洞穴外的托莉·兰波维奇要你去收集5份不纯的萨隆邪铁矿石。",oEN="Tore Rumblewrench outside of Crystalweb Cavern would like you to retrieve 5 samples of Impure Saronite Ore.",p="你替我弄到矿石没？",pEN="Ya have some ore for me?",c="喔！可真是臭啊！你不得已杀了些极地狗头人对吧？\n\n不过我倒是真的很感激你！",cEN="Woo! That's a ripe stench right there! You had to get hands-on with some of those snobolds, didn't ya?\n\nI do appreciate it though!"}
Q[12831]={d="呕……我的胃里好象装了个螺旋桨。\n\n我应该还能走动，但我被洞穴深处的什么东西给咬了，现在浑身都不舒服。那东西比其它蜘蛛都大……而且色彩非常鲜艳。\n\n莉吉特没准能帮我做出解毒剂来，但她肯定要用到咬我的那个东西身上的毒囊。你能帮我找到毒囊吗？我想托莉是不会进来的。\n\n我会在这里装死，希望它们别来碰我。",dEN="Oi... it's like there's a propeller in my stomach.\n\nI think I can walk, but I got something nasty in my system when I got bit by something in the back of the cave. It was bigger than the other spiders... and brightly colored.\n\nRicket can probably make me an antidote, but she'd need the venom sac from whatever bit me. Would you mind finding it for me? I don't think Tore's coming.\n\nI'll just pretend I'm dead here and hopefully they'll leave me alone.",o="水晶蛛网洞穴里的受伤的地精矿工希望你从冰尖爬行者身上找到一个冰尖毒囊。",oEN="An Injured Goblin Miner in Crystalweb Cavern wants you to bring back an Icetip Venom Sac from an Icetip Crawler.",p="<受伤的地精矿工痛苦地扭曲身子。>",pEN="<The Injured Goblin Miner writhes in pain.>",c="这应该行了……我希望莉吉特能替我调出点东西来。那么，准备好要离开这里了吗？",cEN="That should cut it... I hope Ricket can put something together for me. Ready to get out of there, then?"}
Q[12832]={d="¡Uf, gracias! Estaba seguro de que me convertiría en merienda de arañas. Aunque quizás estoy hablando demasiado pronto. ¡Salgamos de aquí!\n\nAvísame en cuanto estés $glisto:lista; para irnos… que sea rápido.",dEN="Oi - thank you! I thought for sure I'd just be a spider snack. Perhaps I'm speaking a bit soon though - let's get the heck out of here!\n\nLet me know as soon as you're ready to go... make it quick.",o="护送受伤的地精矿工离开水晶蛛网洞穴，然后与K3的莉吉特谈一谈。",oEN="Escort the Injured Goblin Miner out of Crystalweb Cavern and then speak to Ricket at K3.",p="我想洞窟里状况还不错吧？托尔对你好不好？",pEN="I take it that things went well at the cavern? Was Tore decent to you?",c="¡Gracias por ayudar a nuestro minero de allí, <name>! Debería poder preparar un antídoto sin problemas.\n\nSi te vuelves a cruzar con Tore, dile de mi parte que es una imbécil, ¿vale?",cEN="Thanks for helping out our miner back there, <name>! I should be able to put together an antidote no problem.\n\nIf you stumble into Tore again, tell her that she's a jerk for me, will ya?"}
Q[12833]={d="嘿，你好啊！你怎么没有像其它冒险家那样逃走啊？嘿，你真是个讨人喜欢的家伙！我还以为自己身上有什么奇怪的味道呢！\n\n我们仍然需要你的帮忙，而你又正好有着丰富的经验。记得那些猛犸人吗？很显然，山洞并没有完全坍塌……仍然有很多猛犸人活了下来。还有很多需要我们操心的，是不是啊？\n\n幸运的是，基尔制作了足够多的地雷。就靠你了！",dEN="Hey there again! You didn't run off like all the other adventurers did? Well, you're just a peach, aren't ya? I was beginning to think I smelled funny or something!\n\nWe could still use a bit of a hand around here, and you have just the right experience. Remember those magnataur? Well apparently the cave didn't completely collapse... there are still quite a few left. So much for Gino taking care of them, eh?\n\nFortunately, Jeer made way more than enough mines. You've got this!",o="K3的莉吉特要求你转至加姆雷区，使用改进型地雷杀死12个从加姆方向冲过来的敌人。加姆入侵者和雪盲追随者都算数。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to use Improved Land Mines at Garm's Bane to fend off the attackers from Garm. Both Garm Invaders and Snowblind Followers will count towards this goal.",p="磅！哈哈！",pEN="Boom! Ha ha!",c="我喜欢你。老实说，你酷毙了！\n\n为你欢呼！",cEN="I like you. In fact, you rock!\n\nYay for you!"}
Q[12836]={d="¡Tengo la misión perfecta para $gun novato:una novata; con ganas de trabajar! Tenemos un problema con los gnolls. ¡Hasta se podría decir que es una plaga de gnolls! Son muy molestos. No hacen más que aumentar en número, y ahora los tenemos aquí al lado, ¡robándonos las piezas! Inconcebible.\n\nEs todo por culpa de ese líder con ínfulas que tienen, Tuercecuero. Quiero que le bajes los humos. Ve a hacerle una visita en su campamento al oeste, en las Colinas Veloneve.\n\nY cuando digo \"hacerle una visita\", es un eufemismo de \"matarlo de forma dolorosa\". ¿Vale? ¡Vale!",dEN="I know just the job for an eager newcomer! We've got a gnoll problem. You might even call it a gnoll infestation! Pesky things. They keep creeping up more and more, and now they're on our doorstep, stealing our parts! Inconceivable.\n\nIt all begins and ends with their uppity leader, Gnarlhide. I want you to see to that \"ends\" part. Go pay him a visit at his camp all the way to the west, in Snowblind Hills.\n\nAnd when I say \"pay him a visit,\" that's a euphemism for \"kill him painfully.\" Kay? Kay!",o="K3的莉吉特要你去杀死瘤皮。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to kill Gnarlhide.",p="我喜欢莉吉特因为她这个人很妙！\n\n噢，你好啊，又见面了！你的害虫管控做的怎么样了？",pEN="I like Ricket cause she's sooo delicious!\n\nOh, hey there again! How goes the pest control?",c="¡Genial! Eres mi tipo de <race>.",cEN="Groovy! You're my kind of <race>."}
Q[12838]={d="我希望能知道血色先锋军今天的行动计划，而你将是我达成此目标的工具。\n\n立刻飞到先锋军港口去，在他们的辎重箱里找到我要的文档。箱子应该是上了锁的，所以你要采取任何必需的手段，从血色先锋军成员身上抢到钥匙。",dEN="I need to know what the Scarlet Onslaught is planning today. You will be my instrument in this task.\n\nFly to Onslaught Harbor and rifle through their baggage trunks for documents. The trunks will be locked, so you'll have to take the keys from the Scarlet Onslaught members by whatever means.",o="死亡高地的奥卢克斯·邪鬃要求你去收集5份先锋军情报文档。",oEN="Aurochs Grimbane at Death's Rise wants you to collect 5 Onslaught Intel Documents.",p="你替我弄到那些情报了吗？",pEN="You have information for me?",c="交给我吧。我会筛检掉没用的情报，如果找出任何需要采取行动的数据，我会召唤你。\n\n无论如何，明天再过来一趟。他们是以每天改变行动方针闻名的。",cEN="Hand them over. I will sift through the useless ones and if there's anything actionable, I will call upon you.\n\nEither way, return tomorrow. It is well known that they change their plans on a daily basis."}
Q[12839]={d="一开始你以为这封信与其它的情报没什么不同。但在简略地阅览之后，你彻底打消了之前的想法，重视起这封信来。\n\n这封信中指出，巴利·韦斯温元帅当前就躲在这座岛屿上的某个地方，不过，他完全避开其它人，谨慎地掩饰着自己的行踪。他宣称，血色先锋军在不远的将来会消灭巫妖王，进而征服整个世界，让艾泽拉斯重获秩序。\n\n高级指挥官一定会对此很感兴趣。",dEN="At first this note looks like any of the other intel that you've been looking for. However, a quick perusal of its contents disabuses you of this notion.\n\nThe letter conveys that Grand Admiral Westwind is present somewhere on the island, but that he is keeping himself secluded for now. He speaks of a glorious day that is coming soon in which the Scarlet Onslaught will wash over first the Lich King and then the rest of world to finally bring order to Azeroth.\n\nThe lord-commander will want to see this!",o="将韦斯温元帅的便笺交给死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特。",oEN="Deliver the Note from the Grand Admiral to Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise.",p="血色先锋军情报应该要送去给奥卢克斯才对。\n\n<高级指挥官用一种想打发你走的表情看着你。>",pEN="Scarlet Onslaught intel is to be delivered to Aurochs Grimbane.\n\n<The lord-commander gives you an expectant look by way of a dismissal.>",c="韦斯温写的信笺？你为什么不早讲呢？\n\n<埃雷特从你手中把信抢去阅读。>\n\n这个蠢蛋！他真的在这儿？！\n\n<高级指挥官大笑。>\n\n这是全新的情报。我很好奇他是如何幻想要在打倒巫妖王之后征服世界的呢？就算是他，也没办法在自己脑中完成这两个疯狂想象的任何一个吧。",cEN="A note written by Westwind? Why didn't you say so?\n\n<Arete tears the letter from your hand to read it.>\n\nThe fool! He's actually here?!\n\n<The lord-commander laughs.>\n\nThis is new information. I wonder how he imagines that he's going to conquer the world once he's taken down the Lich King? Not that he could accomplish either task in his wildest imaginings."}
Q[12840]={d="先锋军港口内停泊着不少血色先锋军的战舰，这些战舰的船长们恐怕是最了解元帅行踪的人。\n\n<高级指挥官搓了搓双手，继续推理着。>\n\n在我印象中，那两个船长……是叫维辛顿和哈弗德吧。去拷打他们，逼问出这条重要的情报，然后结束他们那悲惨的生命。\n\n我必须弄清楚这个韦斯温元帅到底躲在哪儿！",dEN="If anyone knows where the admiral is, then surely it must be his captains on the ships in Onslaught Harbor.\n\n<The lord-commander rubs his hands together.>\n\nWelsington and Hartford are their names if memory serves. Go beat the information out of them and then end their miserable lives.\n\nI want to know where the grand admiral is hidden!",o="死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特要求你拷打维辛顿船长和哈弗德船长，并从他们口中得到情报。",oEN="Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise wants you to beat information out of Captains Welsington and Hartford.",p="海军上将韦斯温在哪？",pEN="Where is Grand Admiral Westwind?",c="他们把兰德雷复活了？兰德雷就是知道海军元帅所在之处的人！",cEN="They resurrected Landgren? He's the one that will know where the grand admiral is then!"}
Q[12841]={d="Sí, debes estar buscando al prisionero de piel verde... Quizás podamos ayudarnos mutuamente.\n\nNo vas a sacar de aquí al goblin a la fuerza. Vivo no, desde luego.\n\nEntre mi gente se me conoce como una Yrkvinn, una creadora de ilusiones. Como puedes ver, las Hyldnir me han hecho prisionera.\n\nSi tuviera mis runas, podría hacer que pasaras $gdesapercibido:desapercibida; entre ellos. Más al interior, patrullando las minas, encontrarás a una sobrestante llamada Syra. Ella tiene mis runas. Tráemelas y seguiremos hablando.",dEN="Yes, it must be the green-skinned prisoner you're after... We might be able to help each other.\n\nYou're not going to get the goblin out of here by force. Not alive, anyway.\n\nAmong my people I am known as a Yrkvinn, a practitioner of illusions. As you can see, the Hyldnir have made me their prisoner.\n\nIf I had my runes, I could make you go unnoticed among them. Further inside, patrolling the mines, you'll find an overseer named Syra. She has my runes. Retrieve them and we'll talk some more.",o="荒弃矿洞的女巫洛莉拉要求你从监督者希尔拉手中夺回伊克芬符文。",oEN="Lok'lira the Crone inside the Forlorn Mine wants you to retrieve the Runes of the Yrkvinn from Overseer Syra.",p="¿Mis runas, <name>? ¿Las tienes?",pEN="My runes, <name>? Do you have them?",c="我以为你回不来了。我不敢去想象如果我再待下去会怎样。",cEN="I wasn't sure you were coming back. I dread to think what will happen to me if I stay here for much longer."}
Q[12842]={d="战争的烙印早已不可磨灭地蚀刻在了你灵魂的深处，死亡骑士。现在你已经学会了符文熔铸这项高深的黑暗艺术，有了它，你就可以把令人敬畏而恐惧的符文之力封印在武器中。\n\n现在我们必须立刻开始进行战争的准备了。回到阿彻鲁斯之心的符文熔炉边上去，利用符文熔铸技能，为你的武器附着符文之力！\n\n当你的利刃上真正流淌起黑暗的力量时，回来向我复命！",dEN="The mark of war is etched indelibly upon your soul, death knight. You have learned the dark art of runeforging and with it you will engrave runes of power upon your weaponry.\n\nPreparations for battle must be made. Return to one of the runeforges, here in the Heart of Acherus, and use the power of runeforging to emblazon your weapon with a rune of power!\n\nReturn to me when your blade glows with dark energy!",o="黑锋要塞的教官拉苏维奥斯命令你使用“符文熔铸”能力为你的符文之剑附上任意一种由你选择的符文。\n\n只要在符文熔炉旁，你就可以随意替换附着在武器上的符文种类，无需消耗任何材料。",oEN="Instructor Razuvious in Ebon Hold has commanded you to use your Runeforging ability to engrave a rune [of your choosing] upon your Runed Soulblade.\n\nYou may freely replace the engraving upon your weapon at any time, so long as you are near a Runeforge.",p="No pierdas el tiempo, <name>. ¡Estamos al borde del apocalipsis!",pEN="Do not waste time, <name>. We are on the brink of apocalypse!",c="Acuérdate de estas palabras, caballero de la Muerte: la forja de runas es un instrumento de la Plaga. ¡Solo existe en Acherus, Naxxramas y en el corazón de Corona de Hielo! Solo puedes blasonar tus armas en una forja de runas.\n\nVuelve con frecuencia y blasona tus armas. ¡Un caballero de la Muerte debe estar preparado para todo lo que se atreva a combatir con él!",cEN="Remember these words, death knight: The Runeforge is a Scourge instrument. It exists only in Acherus, Naxxramas and the heart of Icecrown! You may only emblazon your weaponry at a Runeforge.\n\nReturn often and emblazon all of your weapons. A death knight must be prepared for all that would dare oppose <him/her>!"}
Q[12843]={d="你一定要帮帮我们！我们受到袭击时正在往山里走，想要在山里建设一座中继塔。\n\n那些人看起来像维库人，但皮肤是蓝色的，上面还结着一层霜……而且都是女性！她们把队伍里的男子都抓走了，把我们这些女性都放了。求求你，$n！他们应该都被关在那个名叫希弗列尔达的村子里了，就在K3的上面。",dEN="You have to help us! We were in the middle of an expedition into the mountains to set up a transmission tower when we were attacked.\n\nThey looked like vrykul, except their skin was blue and layered with frost.... and they were all female! They took all the men in the expedition and let us women go. Please, <name>! We think they're being held in Sifreldar, the village overlooking K3.",o="格莱奇·菲兹巴克要你转至希弗列尔达村，救出5名地精囚犯。",oEN="Gretchen Fizzlespark wants you to go to Sifreldar Village and rescue 5 Goblin Prisoners.",p="¿Has encontrado a nuestros hombres, <name>?",pEN="Did you find our men, <name>?",c="你办到了！我们的男孩子们都回来了！",cEN="You did it! Our boys are back!"}
Q[12844]={d="请你帮帮忙，$n。海德尼尔人在抓走队里的男子时，还把我们所有的设备都抢走了。当然，人能回来是最重要的，但是如果你能找到我们的设备，请顺便把它们拿回来，我们都会非常感激你的。\n\n她们的村子就在我们北边的高山上。",dEN="Please, <name>. When the Hyldnir took our men, they also took all our equipment. Of course, it's more important that we get our boys back, but if you run into any of our equipment, I'd really appreciate it if you brought it back to us.\n\nYou'll find their village just above us, to the north.",o="格莱奇·菲兹巴克要你转至K3北方的希弗列尔达村，找回8件K3设备。",oEN="Gretchen Fizzlespark wants you to obtain 8 pieces of K3 Equipment in Sifreldar Village north of K3.",p="¿Alguna suerte con nuestro equipo, <name>?",pEN="Any luck with our equipment, <name>?",c="¡Gracias, <name>! ¡Veremos qué podemos hacer para recuperar estas piezas!",cEN="Thanks, <name>! We'll see what we can do to salvage these parts!"}
Q[12846]={d="男孩子们都回来了……谢谢你，$n！好吧……其实还有一个没回来。\n\n按照其它人的说法，我的兄弟西弗仍然被困在那里。她们似乎是在强迫囚犯去什么矿洞里面干活。请你去那里看看能否发现什么线索。",dEN="All of our boys are back... thanks to you, <name>! Well... all but one.\n\nMy brother Zeev is still up there according to the others. Apparently they have some sort of mine where they make their prisoners work. Go in there and see if you can find out anything.",o="转至希弗列尔达村的北部，找到荒弃矿洞的入口，并寻找西弗·菲兹巴克的下落。",oEN="Find the entrance to the Forlorn Mine in northern Sifreldar Village and look for clues for Zeev Fizzlespark's whereabouts.",c="你一定不是跟海德尼尔一伙的……那么……你是来做什么的？啊……你一定是在找那个新囚犯！",cEN="You're definitely not with the Hyldnir... so what are you here for? Ah... you must be looking for the new prisoner!"}
Q[12847]={d="我的确听说过在他们的大教堂内有一位大主教，但我怎样也不会想到，他们竟然复活并晋升了兰德雷，这位大主教竟然就是他！大教堂有重兵守卫，而且只有一个入口，所以你需要一些帮助。\n\n我们现在仍然迫切地需要得知韦斯温元帅的位置，但我们要力求稳妥，不能有一丝冒险投机的心理！\n\n带上这个设备，它可以打开一道传送门，让我在你杀死大主教之后转至现场。\n\n到时候，我会亲自从他那卑微而懦弱的灵魂身上找到我想要的答案！我们一定会找到巴利·韦斯温元帅！",dEN="I'd heard they have an archbishop in their cathedral, but I had no idea that they'd resurrected and promoted Landgren! The Crimson Cathedral is heavily guarded with only one entrance, so you'll need help.\n\nWe still need to know where the grand admiral is, but this time we're not taking any chances!\n\nTake this device. It can be used to summon a gate for me to step through once you've killed the archbishop.\n\nI'll have my answers directly from his compelled soul! We will find Grand Admiral Westwind!",o="杀死大主教兰德雷，并在他的尸体旁召唤出埃雷特之门。等高级指挥官埃雷特从大主教的灵魂那里拷问出情报以后，在赤色大教堂内与他谈一谈。",oEN="Kill Archbishop Landgren and then summon Arete's Gate in the presence of his corpse. Speak with Lord-Commander Arete inside The Crimson Cathedral once he's completed his questioning of the archbishop's spirit.",p="嗯？",pEN="Yes?",c="海岛南面的隐藏洞窟。真是有趣。\n\n好吧，至少我现在知道我那些失踪的间谍都哪儿去了。",cEN="Hidden caves on the backside of the island. How very interesting.\n\nWell, at least now I know where all of my missing spies are."}
Q[12848]={d="无尽的痛苦很快就将占据你的身心，$c。你唯一的选择只有服从我的命令。\n\n现在我授予你救赎的钥匙。\n\n你看见那些被锁链锁在阿彻鲁斯之心的叛徒了吗？拿着这把钥匙，去释放一个叛徒，然后将其击败。胜利，将终结你的痛苦；失败，你将永远在痛苦中煎熬。\n\n选择权完全属于你。",dEN="The endless hunger will soon take hold of you, <class>. When it does, you will feel pain immeasurable. There is only one remedy for the suffering: the hunger must be sated.\n\nI give you the key to your salvation.\n\nChained to the Heart of Acherus are those deemed unworthy of the dark brotherhood. Use the key to free an unworthy initiate. Allow them to equip their gear and battle you for their freedom. Kill and the pain will cease. Fail and suffer for eternity.\n\nLive or die - the choice is yours to make.",o="黑锋要塞的教官拉苏维奥斯命令你释放一名黑锋叛徒，并击败他。\n\n不成功，则成仁。",oEN="Instructor Razuvious in Ebon Hold has commanded you to free an Unworthy Initiate and then kill the Unworthy Initiate in cold blood!\n\nIt's your life or theirs!",p="Dos vidas, una llave... No me falles, <name>.",pEN="Two lives, one key... Do not fail me, <name>.",c="如我所料，我所选定的骑士凯旋归来！你已经准备好了，$N。",cEN="As expected, my chosen knight has triumphed! You are ready, <name>."}
Q[12849]={c="在指挥大厅里，你会找到血魄、冰霜、与秽邪的学院。每个学院都有一个训练师会提供你各种黑暗技艺的知识。\n\n我，索瓦尔领主，乃是血魄学院的院长。雅莉丝翠女士统领着秽邪学院，而大巫妖艾默萨札德，则支配着冰霜学院。\n\n当你获得力量之后必得立刻回来这里接受训练！",cEN="Within the Hall of Command you will find the schools of blood, frost and unholy. Each school has a trainer that can provide you with knowledge in the various dark arts.\n\nI, Lord Thorval, am the headmaster of the school of blood. Lady Alistra reigns over unholy and the arch-lich, Amal'thazad, holds dominion over frost.\n\nYou must return here whenever you gain power and train!"}
Q[12850]={d="天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔就在我们东南边的夹层上等着你。立刻去向他报到，并申请让他用天灾狮鹫将你送到下面的死亡裂口去。\n\n瓦拉纳王子应该在那里等着你呢。\n\n好好忍受你的痛苦吧，我的$g兄弟:姐妹！",dEN="Scourge Commander Thalanor awaits your arrival at the overhang located directly southeast of our current position. Report to Thalanor and requisition a Scourge gryphon to deliver you to Death's Breach.\n\nPrince Valanar will be waiting for you down below.\n\nSuffer well, <brother/sister>!",o="向黑锋要塞第一层展望台上的天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔报到。",oEN="Report to Scourge Commander Thalanor at the balcony on the first floor of Ebon Hold.",c="战争已经开始了，死亡骑士！我将让你搭乘我最好的狮鹫，并把你送往死亡裂口。混沌、死亡、毁灭！你将会成为这一切的先锋！",cEN="The war has begun, death knight! I shall place you upon my finest gryphon and deliver you to Death's Breach. Chaos, death, destruction! You will herald in all of this and more!"}
Q[12851]={d="真正的试炼在等着你，女人！\n\n你是想成为战士中的女王呢，还是想做一个拖着鼻涕的缝衣女工？\n\n只要尝试一下战斗的滋味，你就能知道答案了。\n\n或许你可以欺骗你的母亲、姐妹，甚至欺骗你自己，但战场总能让一个人的本性暴露无疑。\n\n一旦你做好准备，就骑上冰牙去参加战斗吧。你必须骑在它的背上，将死亡之雨倾泻到我们敌人的头上。",dEN="The test awaits, woman!\n\nDo you have the heart of a warrior queen? Or that of a sniveling seamstress?\n\nOne taste of war and you'll know the answer.\n\nYou might lie to your mother, your sisters, and even yourself, but the battlefield always exposes one's true nature.\n\nWhen you've made your preparations, mount Icefang and ride into battle. From her back, you must rain down a shower of death upon our enemy.",o="布伦希尔达村的布莉亚娜要求你骑着冰牙转至上古寒冬山谷，在那里射击7头冰霜座狼和15个冰霜巨人。",oEN="Brijana at Brunnhildar Village wants you to mount Icefang and shoot 7 Frostworgs and 15 Frost Giants in the Valley of Ancient Winters.",p="¿Has sobrevivido a la batalla, <name>?",pEN="Have you survived the battle, <name>?",c="也许你的确具备战士之心。\n\n时间将证明一切……",cEN="Perhaps you do have the heart of a warrior.\n\nTime will tell..."}
Q[12852]={d="阿比迪斯将军战死在新壁炉谷的时候，巴利·韦斯温元帅利用一种不能渗透的魔法屏障顺利地逃走了。\n\n我特别擅长让魔法失效。\n\n拿上这个，到隐蔽山洞去对付他。在他使用魔法屏障的时候使用这个东西。真希望能亲自去看看他届时会有什么表情啊……\n\n快去解决掉他之后。",dEN="When High General Abbendis was confronted at New Hearthglen, the grand admiral protected himself within an impenetrable sphere of magic before making his escape.\n\nI am particularly adept at nullifying magic.\n\nTake this to use against him inside The Hidden Hollow when he puts the sphere up. I wish that I could be there to see the look on his face when you do it.\n\nDeal with him.",o="高级指挥官埃雷特希望你去除掉巴利·韦斯温元帅。等你完成任务之后，回到死亡高地向他复命。",oEN="Lord-Commander Arete wants you to deal with Grand Admiral Westwind. Return to the lord-commander upon Death's Rise after you have done so.",c="¿¡MAL'GANIS?!!\n\n<El Lord Comandante ríe con desenfreno.>\n\n¡Los necios se han dejado engañar por los demonios una vez más y ahora han sido destruidos!\n\n¿Confío en que mi <class> favorita se quedará el tiempo suficiente para ayudarnos a acabar con el resto? ¿Quizás uno de estos te convenza?",cEN="MAL'GANIS?!!\n\n<The lord-commander laughs with abandon.>\n\nThe fools were taken in by the demons yet again and now they are destroyed!\n\nI trust that my favorite <class> will stick around long enough to help us finish off the rest of them? Perhaps one of these would convince you?"}
Q[12853]={d="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;!\n\n¿Te gusta la emoción y las explosiones? ¿A quién no? Conozco un sitio perfecto para ti. ¡En el lujoso K3 están siempre creando inventos innovadores y descubriendo maneras nuevas de hacer explotar las cosas! Suena emocionante, ¿verdad? ¡Si quieres formar parte de la diversión, ve hoy mismo y habla con Jeer Encajebujía!\n\nAdvertencia obligatoria: puede necesitarse un manual para tomar parte en la \"emoción\" indicada anteriormente.",dEN="Hey there, pal!\n\nDo you like excitement and explosions?! Who doesn't? I know just the place for you. Down at luxurious K3, they're always making innovative inventions and finding all-new ways to make things blow up! Sounds thrilling, doesn't it? If you want to be part of the fun, head on down today and speak to Jeer Sparksocket!\n\nMandatory disclaimer: manual labor may be required to partake in previously indicated \"excitement.\"",o="转至风暴峭壁的K3，与基尔·斯巴索克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Jeer Sparksocket at K3 in the Storm Peaks.",c="¡Bienvenido a K3!\n\nVinimos aquí para abrirnos paso hacia esos picos y obtener nuestra parte justa de algunas de esas increíbles máquinas de los titanes. Sin embargo, el progreso en ese sentido ha sido algo mínimo. Gnolls, snobolds, magnataur... no faltan problemas por aquí... por no mencionar que no parece que podamos mantener ningún volador en el aire sin que sus motores se congelen.\n\nSin embargo, hay mucho trabajo por hacer. ¿Nos echas una mano?",cEN="Welcome to K3!\n\nWe came here to make our way into those peaks and get our fair share of some of those amazing titan machines. Progress on that end has been somewhat minimal, though. Gnolls, snobolds, magnataur... there's no shortage of trouble to go around... not to mention, we can't seem to keep any fliers in the air without their motors freezing.\n\nThere's plenty of work to be done though - lend a hand, eh?"}
Q[12854]={d="自从我们在灰熊丘陵发现布莱恩的日记之后，就很少得到与布莱恩相关的消息了。不过最近，在铁炉堡的探险者协会总部发现了一张神秘的便笺，谁也不知道这东西究竟是怎么来的。上面只是写着，我们必须转至布莱恩的营地与他碰面，并帮助他寻找某样东西。\n\n据我所知，他的营地应该就在这里的东北方，伯尔之息河的对面，泰坦之路的废墟附近。",dEN="After the discovery of Brann's journal in Grizzly Hills, we've only had one other communication from Brann. A mysterious note found its way to Explorers' League headquarters in Ironforge, with no indication of where it came from. All it said was that we're to meet Brann at his camp and help him with his search.\n\nFrom what I can tell, the camp should be located northeast of here, across the Bor's Breath River and at the foot of some ruins from the Path of the Titans.",o="在布莱恩的营地中找到用麻布裹起来的便笺，把它交给冰霜堡的考古学家安多林。",oEN="Retrieve the Burlap-Wrapped Note from Brann's camp and return it to Archaeologist Andorin at Frosthold.",p="你找到布莱恩的踪迹没？",pEN="Did you find Brann's camp?",c="<考古学家安多林满怀期望的看着你。>\n\n你应该要带布莱恩一起回来的，而不是只带张纸回来。发生了什么事？",cEN="<Archaeologist Andorin looks at you expectantly.>\n\nYou were supposed to come back with Brann, not a piece of paper. What's going on here?"}
Q[12855]={d="布莱恩在日记中暗示道，他将一包东西连同这本日记一起埋了起来。这些就是你能找到的所有线索吗？\n\n这样吧，霜脉矮人利用嗅觉敏锐的冰霜猎犬来跟踪猎物。我同意让你带上一只猎犬转至那座被毁坏的营地，让它闻闻布莱恩的气味。\n\n至少它能带你找到那些失踪的物品。如果运气够好的话，说不定还能找到布莱恩本人呢。",dEN="The tone of Brann's note suggests he meant to bury something with the note, maybe a pack of some kind. You're sure this was all you found?\n\nOkay, I'm going to have you take one of these frosthounds with you. The frostborn use them for tracking. Bring it to the destroyed camp and let it get Brann's scent.\n\nIt should at least lead you to the location of those missing possessions, and if we're lucky, Brann himself.",o="在被遗弃的营地使用冰霜猎犬的项圈，查明是谁偷走了布莱恩的物品。找到这些东西之后，使用通讯设备与你所联系到的人进行交流。",oEN="Use the Frosthound Collar at the Abandoned Camp to track down whoever took Brann's possessions. When you recover them, use the communication device and speak to whoever you can contact.",p="你是谁？",pEN="Who are you?",c="你……你不是探险者协会的一员，至少不是我记得的人。但是，如果你已经找回了通讯器，那么一定是他们派你来的。很好，我几乎就是在期望这样的情形。",cEN="You... you're not a member of the Explorers' League, at least not one I remember. But, if you recovered the communicator, they must've sent you. Good, that's almost what I was hoping for."}
Q[12856]={d="能战死沙场是我们的光荣，好姐妹。但是被冻成冰块并遭受无休止的耻笑并不光荣。\n\n你要飞往上古寒冬山谷的东边，进入冰霜巨人的城市——丹尼芬雷，解救一条被获取的始祖幼龙。有了它的帮助，你就可以把我们的姐妹从冰块里解救出来，并把她们安全地带回家。\n\n你要小心那些巨人的棍棒，免得自己也变成俘虏中的一员。",dEN="To be slain honorably on the field of battle brings us all glory. To be frozen in a block of ice and endlessly taunted does not....\n\nYou are to fly to the frost giant city of Dun Niffelem, just east of the Valley of Ancient Winters, and liberate a captive proto-drake. With her, you will be able to free our sisters from their frozen bonds and carry three of them safely home.\n\nBeware the giants' clubs, sister, lest you find yourself numbered among the captives.",o="布伦希尔达村东边的布莉亚娜要你飞往丹尼芬雷，解救3头被俘虏的始祖幼龙，然后解救9名布伦希尔达囚犯。",oEN="Brijana, just east of Brunnhildar Village, wants you to fly to Dun Niffelem, then free 3 Captured Proto-Drakes and rescue 9 Brunnhildar Prisoners.",p="你的任务成功了吗，姐妹？",pEN="Was your mission successful, <brother/sister>?",c="你的任务似乎成功了，姐妹。\n\n你为布伦希尔达带来了荣耀！",cEN="Your efforts appear to have been successful, sister.\n\nYou have brought glory to the Brunnhildar!"}
Q[12857]={d="Enviado por Jefe Garrafuria:\n\nFiel foca león de Jefe Garrafuria, Crines de Ira, morder mano que darle de comer. Garrafuria decir que Crines de Ira ya no ser bueno por culpa de malvados trols Drakuru. Jefe Garrafuria triste al pedir que matar Crines de Ira y llevar aleta de Crines de Ira a jefe como prueba.\n\nCrines de Ira estar al sureste, en Lago de Garrafuria.\n\nJefe Garrafuria sentir mala letra. Primera vez que usar una cosa de estas; además, Jefe Garrafuria ser wolvar, no persona.|n",dEN="Posted by Chief Rageclaw:\n\nChief Rageclaw trusty lion seal, Ragemane, bite hand that feed him. Rageclaw say Ragemane no more good because of bad Drakuru trolls. Chief Rageclaw very sad to ask that Ragemane be killeded and Ragemane flipper be returned to chief as proof.\n\nYou find Ragemane to southeast, at Rageclaw Lake.\n\nChief Rageclaw sorry for bad writing. First time use one of these things; plus, Chief Rageclaw is wolvar, not person.",o="得到怒鬃的鳍肢，将它交给圣光据点的怒爪酋长。",oEN="Recover Ragemane's Flipper and return it to Chief Rageclaw at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.",p="可怜的怒鬃。它可是我舅舅送我的。",pEN="Poor Ragemane. He was gift from brother-in-law.",c="<怒爪酋长哭了。>\n\n我从小把它养大。真是伤心的一天——先是巨魔攻击怒爪部族，然后巨魔害的怒鬃变坏。怒爪再也不跟巨魔做生意了！",cEN="<Chief Rageclaw cries.>\n\nHad Ragemane since pup. Sad day for Rageclaw. First troll attack Rageclaw, then troll make Ragemane bad. Rageclaw never trade with troll again!"}
Q[12858]={d="感谢圣光，总算有人看懂了我留下的消息。我已经逃出了铁矮人的魔掌，现在很安全。不过我需要你的帮助。解封奥杜尔文件的关键就是诺甘农的钥石，但是泰坦将它分成了两截，分别藏了起来。\n\n其中一截叫做诺甘农之壳，它被藏在奥杜尔以南，位于北部海岸的创世者的图书馆内。首先，你要从图书馆的守卫者手中取得一张圆盘的碎片。",dEN="Thank the Light that someone got my message. Now that I'm safe from the iron dwarves, I need to ask your help with something. I've got a lead on Norgannon's keystone, which guards access to Ulduar's archives, but the Titans divided it into two pieces and secreted them away.\n\nOne of the pieces, the keystone's shell, is held within the Inventor's Library on the northern coast, south of Ulduar itself. The first thing you'll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library's guardians.",o="收集6块创世者的圆盘碎片，将它们组合成创世者的圆盘。",oEN="Gather 6 Inventor's Disk Fragments and use them to assemble the Inventor's Disk.",p="你把圆盘拿到手了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the disk?",c="太棒了！既然我们有了圆盘，那你一定要用它打开发明者的宝库！",cEN="Wonderful! Now that we have the disk, you must use it to open the Inventor's vault!"}
Q[12859]={d="巨魔攻击了怒爪巢穴，把怒爪狼獾人赶了出来！更糟的是，巨魔正在焚烧怒爪狼獾人的村庄，他们都是坏人！酋长让最厉害的萨满祭司莫奇去灭火，但是很奇怪！火还是很热，会烧掉一切。\n\n你能帮怒爪狼獾人去灭火吗？莫奇会给你怒爪狼獾人的特殊灭火器，去扑灭东南方怒爪巢穴里的火焰。有时候要喷很多下才能灭火，不过灭火器总是有足够的水！这就是厉害的怒爪魔法！",dEN="Trolls attack Rageclaw Den and kick Rageclaw out! It get worse. Trolls now burning village! This very bad. Chief make top Rageclaw shaman, Moky, do study on fire. Results very surprising! Fire still hot and can burn things.\n\nWill you help Rageclaw and put fire out? Moky has special Rageclaw fire extinguisher for you. Use special fire extinguisher to put out fire at Rageclaw Den to southeast. Sometimes take many sprays to douse fire, but extinguisher always have water! Rageclaw magic strong!",o="El anciano chamán Moky en la Brecha de la Luz en Zul'Drak quiere que uses el extintor Garrafuria para apagar 15 fuegos de cabañas en la Guarida Garrafuria.|n",oEN="Elder Shaman Moky at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak wants you to use the Rageclaw Fire Extinguisher to douse 15 hut fires at Rageclaw Den.",p="嗯，灭火了？",pEN="Hrm, put fires out?",c="很奇怪，我明知道你把火灭了，但火还是在燃烧。也许这东西没用，呃？不过，莫奇还是会回报你所作的事情！希望巨魔也烧起来！",cEN="It strange because I know you put fire out, but fire still burning. Maybe this thing not so good after all, eh? Still, Moky pay you for what you do! Hopefully troll burn too!"}
Q[12860]={d="你拼出来的那个圆盘……是空的！米米尔这个狡猾的鬼东西肯定把信息藏到了别的什么地方。去调查一下创世者的图书馆，看看里面有没有数据库之类的东西。\n\n或许这张圆盘就是干这个用的，到数据库附近去使用它看看吧。它可能就是用来读入和存储数据库信息的。试过以后再联络我，把你的发现告诉我。同时，我要开始着手寻找钥匙的另一半了。",dEN="That disk you assembled... it's blank! That crafty Mimir must've hidden the information somewhere else. Look around the Inventor's Library; do you see any databanks there?\n\nThat might be what you need to do with the disk. Try using it near some of those databanks. Perhaps it's set to retrieve and store information from them. After you've tried your hand at that, contact me again and let me know what you've found. Meanwhile, I'll be trying to track down the other half of the archive key.",o="使用创世者的圆盘，从数据库中获得7条秘密数据。",oEN="Use the Inventor's Disk to retrieve 7 pieces of Hidden Data from the Databanks.",p="你有没有试着读取数据库？可有什么发现？",pEN="Did you try using the disk? What did you find?",c="<Brann mira el disco mientras lo sostienes>.\n\n¡No puedo saber si hay algo almacenado ahí o no! Tienes que decirme qué ha pasado.\n\n<Describes el proceso de recuperación de datos>.\n\n¿Así que funcionó? Al menos podemos contar con que Mimir sea sistemático. No puedo decir lo mismo del resto de estos Guardianes por lo que he estado oyendo...",cEN="<Brann looks at the disk as you hold it up.>\n\nI can't tell if there's anything stored there or not! You have to tell me what happened.\n\n<You describe the data retrieval process.>\n\nSo it worked? At least we can count on Mimir to be systematic. Can't say that for the rest of these Keepers from what I've been hearing..."}
Q[12861]={d="达库鲁……你知道他是谁吗？我觉得坏巨魔们被达库鲁控制了。他们称自己是达库鲁巨魔——所以我就知道了。现在你知道为什么我能成为怒爪氏族的头儿了吗？因为我是最最聪明的狼獾人！\n\n不过这跟我现在找你的原因没有关系。坏巨魔把怒爪氏族赶出了巢穴，没来得及逃走的怒爪狼獾人都被囚禁在村子里面了。你去东南方的怒爪巢穴解救被俘虏的怒爪狼獾人吧。钥匙就在巨魔身上，也许你需要干掉很多巨魔才能拿到足够多的钥匙。",dEN="Drakuru... You know who this troll is? I think bad troll are controlled by the Drakuru troll. They call themself Drakuru trolls - that how I know. Now you see why I am chief of Rageclaw. Smartest of all wolvar!\n\nBut that not why I talk to you now. Bad troll come and kick Rageclaw out of den. Rageclaw that no run away held as prisoner in village. You go to Rageclaw Den, southeast, and free captured Rageclaw. Kill troll for lock opener. You maybe kill many troll for many lock opener.",o="El jefe Garrafuria en la Brecha de la Luz en Zul'Drak quiere que uses los \"abridores de cerraduras\" Drakuru encontrados en varios trols Drakuru para liberar a 8 Garrafuria capturados.",oEN="Chief Rageclaw at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak wants you to use the Drakuru \"Lock Openers\" found on various Drakuru trolls to free 8 Captured Rageclaw.",p="你救出怒爪？",pEN="You rescue Rageclaw?",c="Rageclaw gracias, <name>. Aunque la Guarida de Rageclaw probablemente se haya perdido para siempre y la amistad entre trol y Rageclaw también se haya perdido para siempre... y ahora que lo pienso, Ragemane también se ha perdido para siempre. También es mi cuñado. Se ha ido. Hrm, ¿has visto a la pareja del Jefe? Creo que ella también se ha ido.\n\nTal vez te vayas ahora. El Jefe está un poco deprimido.",cEN="Rageclaw thank you, <name>. Though Rageclaw Den probably lost forever and troll-Rageclaw friendship also lost forever... and also now I think of it, Ragemane lost forever too. Also brother-in-law. He gone. Hrm, have you seen Chief's mate? I think she gone too.\n\nMaybe you go now. Chief a little depressed."}
Q[12862]={d="看来……看来我们是别想在这层层叠叠的群山中找到一个合适的定居点了。\n\n相信我，我不是那种轻言放弃的人……但是被冻住的引擎、讨厌的维库女人、飞来飞去的恶龙和乱七八糟的其它怪物，换了是你，你能怎么办？\n\n不过，不要慌张！我只是说我们找不到一个合适的定居点，但这并不意味着我们不能送你一程……单线旅行总是很简单的。\n\n<莉吉特指了指附近的火箭。>",dEN="So... so I don't think we're going to be getting a good foothold in those mountains.\n\nTrust me, I'm not one to give up easily... but between freezing engines, nasty vrykul women, territorial dragon want-to-bes and the half a dozen other nasties settled in the area, this just ain't happening.\n\nDon't let that dissuade you though! Just because we can't get a foothold doesn't mean we won't get you there... one-way trips are pretty simple when you get down to it.\n\n<Ricket nods at some nearby rockets.>",o="与莉吉特谈一谈，使用她的D16推进运载器进入风暴峭壁的深处。",oEN="Speak to Ricket to make use of Ricket's D16 Propelled Delivery Device to enter further into Storm Peaks.",c="¡Ay! Eso ha parecido doloroso. ¡Aunque ha sido una entrada bastante grandiosa, muchacho!\n\n¡Bienvenido a Frosthold! ¿Estás aquí para ayudarnos a encontrar un camino hacia la Corona de Hielo?",cEN="Ow! That looked painful. It was a pretty grand entrance though, lad!\n\nWelcome to Frosthold! Are ya here to help us find a path into Icecrown?"}
Q[12863]={d="¡Ah! Gracias por venir, $gmuchacho:muchacha;.\n\nA juzgar por tus ojos abiertos de par en par y tus manos temblorosas, adivino que no llevas mucho tiempo aquí. ¡Entonces parece que te vendría bien conocer a nuestros queridos anfitriones!\n\nTenemos algunos suministros médicos de sobra... a decir verdad, no esperábamos instalarnos con tanta comodidad. Dale esta caja a Glorthal y échales una mano si no te importa. No queremos que piensen que no les agradecemos lo bien que nos han tratado.",dEN="Ah! Thanks for coming up here, <lad/lass>.\n\nJudging by your wide eyes and shivering hands, I'd venture a guess that you're somewhat new. Sounds like it would be good for you to meet our gracious hosts then!\n\nWe've got some extra medical supplies... to be honest, we weren't expecting to have such a comfortable setup. Go ahead and give this crate to Glorthal over there, and lend them a hand if you would too. We don't want them to think we're ungrateful for how welcoming they've been.",o="将医疗物资箱交给冰霜堡的格罗萨·硬须。",oEN="Bring the crate of medical supplies to Glorthal Stiffbeard in Frosthold.",p="嗨。",pEN="Hello.",c="医疗物资箱？谢谢你！不过现在暂时还不确定要怎么用它，但是想必会派上用场。\n\n很高兴见到你……你们的人可真是拥有丰富的多样性啊。这地方不太常有访客？有些新伙伴的感觉挺不错的。",cEN="Medical supplies? Thank you! Not exactly sure what to do with them to be honest, but I'm sure they'll be useful.\n\nIt's good to meet you... there's such a colorful variety among your peoples. We're not used to having visitors up this way very often - it's good to have some fresh company."}
Q[12864]={d="现在我有一些事情需要你帮忙。\n\n我们有几个斥候至今还没有回来。虽然风暴峭壁的环境很恶劣……但这些孩子知道他们该做些什么。\n\n到东边去……沿着伯尔之息山谷，去伯尔瀑布附近看看……他们应该就在那个方向。如果你找到他们中的任何一个，就赶快回来告诉我。有几个敌人对我们虎视眈眈很久了——如果他们之中有人开始变得不安分，我们就该早作准备。",dEN="There is something that I could use a hand with now that I have you.\n\nWe have a few scouts that are extremely late in returning. The peaks are harsh... but these boys know what they're doing.\n\nHead to the east... along the Bor's Breath valley and near Bor's Fall... they should be out that direction. If you find any sign of one of them, bring me back news immediately. We have a few enemies in the area - if any of them are getting a bit uppity, the more warning the better.",o="冰霜堡的格罗萨要求你转至伯尔之息山谷和伯尔瀑布，寻找失踪的霜脉斥候的踪迹。",oEN="Glorthal in Frosthold has requested a search of the Bor's Breath valley and Bor's Fall for any sign of the missing Frostborn Scouts.",c="当一个斥候这么久还没有回来的时候……差不多就该预料到是这种结果了，所以是鹰身人？\n\n雷心国王这几年很努力的训练我们……把我们训练成很棒的战士。如今我了解必要性何在了。在我族中，他是我见过最睿智也最强悍的领导者……别被他桃红色的皮肤给骗了。",cEN="When a scout doesn't come back for this long... that's about the expected result. The harpies then?\n\nKing Stormheart has us train hard year round... he's turned us into amazing fighters. At times like this, I understand why it's necessary. He's the wisest and strongest leader I've yet seen among our people... don't let his peachy skin fool ya."}
Q[12865]={d="新来的！很高兴认识你！如果你有时间的话，我想找你帮个忙。\n\n东边就是山底平原……环境非常恶劣的一片土地，不过有相当多的犀牛在那里生活。我们的猎鹰非常喜欢吃犀牛肉，不过平原上还有许多始祖龙，让它们去那里狩猎始终是件非常危险的事情。\n\n如果你愿意的话，不如去弄些犀牛肉回来，然后回到这里上面的峭壁，喂食居住在那里的猎鹰。",dEN="Fresh blood! Good to meet ya! I've got some work if you've got some time.\n\nOff to the east are the Foot Steppes... pretty hard land, but there's quite a group of rhino that graze there. Our birds have a taste for that rhino meat, but it's always a bit dangerous for them to go hunting with all of the proto-drakes that nest around there.\n\nIf you're keen, head over that way and get some rhino meat, bring it back to the peaks above here, and then use it to feed some of the eagles that nest there.",o="冰霜堡的弗亚林·霜眉希望你收集8块新鲜的冰犀牛肉，然后将它们喂食给小镇上方的雷羽鹰。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold wants you to obtain 8 slabs of Fresh Ice Rhino Meat and use them to feed the Stormcrest Eagles above town.",p="这些雄鹰已被我们驯化已久……一切进展得还不错。",pEN="These birds have been loyal to us for a long time... we get on pretty well.",c="由衷地感谢你……我想它们一定也充满感激之情。它们是坚定而强大的盟友——若你在我们的阵营里，你会因为它们的协助大大受益。",cEN="Thank you, kindly... and I'm sure they're quite appreciative too. They make powerful allies; you'll be well off being on this side of their graces."}
Q[12866]={d="该死的鹰身人，我已经记不得教训它们多少次了……每次被打得落花流水之后，它们总会消停一段时间。这次，我还以为它们已经得到足够的教训了。\n\n显然没有。\n\n它们的记忆力可能很差劲，不过如果它们的数量不足的话，我想它们自己也会收敛一些。到北面和东面的山谷里去，帮我们消灭一些鹰身人吧，怎么样？",dEN="Damn harpies. We've beat that bunch into submission more times than I can remember... and they stay quiet for a time after each bout. This time, I'd thought that maybe it sunk in.\n\nApparently not.\n\nTheir memory may be a bit short, but if their numbers are thinned enough, they'll keep to themselves. Head into the valleys in the north and east and clear out a fair chunk of them for me, will ya?",o="冰霜堡的格罗萨·硬须希望你去杀死8个霜羽尖啸者和8个霜羽女巫。",oEN="Glorthal Stiffbeard at Frosthold wants you to kill 8 Frostfeather Screechers and 8 Frostfeather Witches.",p="顽强的畜生……好像永远都摆脱不了他们。他们繁殖的跟兔子一样快。",pEN="Persistent buggers... can't ever seem to rid ourselves of all of them. They breed like rabbits.",c="这不是什么好工作，我懂，但是我们很感谢你的帮忙。你说斥候提到的那个名字是什么……希尔拉娜？",cEN="It's dirty work, I know, but we appreciate it. Now what was the name the scout mentioned... Sirana?"}
Q[12867]={d="几周前，只要你抬头仰望，就可以随时看到一群群漂亮的猎鹰在天空中翱翔。现在呢？就算有，也就只剩下那么几只了。由于鹰身人一直在偷取猎鹰的卵，它们只好整天守在巢里。\n\n鹰身人对鹰肉越来越感兴趣了，似乎……这群变态的家伙想把卵中的小鹰孵化出来，然后好好地美餐一顿。去把鹰卵夺回来交给我，我会负责把它们送回鸟巢里去的。",dEN="A few weeks ago, if you looked up, you'd see dozens of those beautiful eagles soaring the skies. Now, only a few if any. They've taken to staying with their nests nearly all the time now because the harpies have been stealing their eggs.\n\nThe harpies have grown a taste for eagle flesh, it seems... the sick wretches are caring for the eggs long enough to feast on the hatchlings. Go into the valleys to the north or the east and find the eggs... bring them back here, and I'll take them back to the nests.",o="冰霜堡的弗亚林·霜眉希望你交给他15枚雷羽鹰卵。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold would like you to bring back 15 Stormcrest Eagle Eggs.",p="我们会把这些鹰身人处理好的……这些雷羽鹰很快就可以再度盘旋于天空中了。",pEN="We'll get this harpy problem taken care of... the eagles will be free to soar the skies again soon.",c="Buen trabajo, <lad/lass>. Estás haciendo amigos rápidamente.\n\nSi vuelves pronto, estoy seguro de que podremos encontrar uno que te deje montar... ya deberían saber que eres de confianza.",cEN="Good stuff, <lad/lass>. You're making fast friends.\n\nIf you stop back by soon, I'm sure we can find one that will let you ride... they should know that you're trustworthy now."}
Q[12868]={d="似乎这个希尔拉娜·冰啸就是煽动鹰身人的幕后主使。如果我们干掉她，也许它们的进攻就会很快消停下来。\n\n我们的一位风暴骑士声称，发现她在西北方的峭壁附近徘徊。去把她找出来，消灭她。",dEN="This Sirana Iceshriek sounds like the one that's spurring the harpies to be more aggressive. If we kill her, I suspect their attacks won't last long afterwards.\n\nOne of our stormriders claims to have spotted her circling the peak directly northwest of here. Go find the wench and put her down. Let's see this done.",o="冰霜堡的格罗萨·硬须要求你去杀死希尔拉娜·冰啸。",oEN="Glorthal Stiffbeard at Frosthold wants you to kill Sirana Iceshriek.",p="这里太冷了，没有一般常见的害虫……幸亏我们还有鹰身人。真幸运。",pEN="It's too cold here the usual pests... we get harpies. Lucky us.",c="那么就解决了。谢谢你。\n\n我跟弗亚林·霜眉谈过了——他说他的手下会负责对付鹰身人。只要我们不放松防备，他们就没胆攻击我们的人。\n\n我知道这不是什么愉快的工作——请把这个当作是谢礼收下吧。",cEN="It's done then. Thank you.\n\nI've spoken with Fjorlin - he said that his men will take charge of keeping the harpies down a bit. As long as we don't let up again, they won't find the courage to think they can attack our people.\n\nI know this wasn't the most tasteful work - take this as a token of my appreciation."}
Q[12869]={d="你知道洛肯这个混账吧？铁矮人抓走了始祖龙的首领维拉努斯，搞得那些始祖龙极度沮丧……而且变得极具进攻性。\n\n它们开始闯入雷羽峰一带，而山上的雷羽鹰则倾巢而出，与它们交战。雷羽鹰一直对我们忠心耿耿，现在我们该报答这些朋友了。我们正准备转至山底平原，剿灭一些始祖幼龙。\n\n约尔格·雷心国王陛下将这柄战锤传给了我——要好好使用它，用完了还给我。",dEN="You were there with Loken, weren't you? The iron dwarves captured Veranus, the brood mother of the proto-drakes. The drakes don't seem even a little bit happy about the situation... they've gotten very aggressive.\n\nThey've pushed into stormcrest territory and the eagles have taken to an all out fight with them. It's time to return the favor. We're riding to the Foot Steppes and slaughtering them there.\n\nKing Stormheart left this hammer to me - make good use and see to it that I get it back.",o="弗亚林·霜眉要你骑上雷羽鹰转至山底平原，杀死16条风暴峭壁巨龙。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold wants you to ride with a Stormcrest Eagle and kill 16 Stormpeak Wyrms in the Foot Steppes.",p="局面简直一发不可收拾。",pEN="This is completely out of control.",c="我不认为这些始祖龙会这么轻易放弃。如果你还有时间帮忙的话，明天记得再回来。",cEN="I don't see the drakes being dissuaded so easily. Stop back by tomorrow if you think you can spare more time to help."}
Q[12870]={d="¡Vaya, hola!\n\nAntes de que te vayas a seguir con tus misiones y aventuras, ¿podría pedirte un favor minúsculo, $gmuchacho:muchacha;?\n\nEstas montañas están repletas de valiosos adornos y reliquias... es un sueño hecho realidad para la liga. Te estaría muy agradecido si pudieras traerme los tesoros que encuentres. ¡Hasta puedes probar mi cerveza a cambio! ¡Créeme, $gmuchacho:muchacha;, es un buen trato!",dEN="Why hello thar!\n\nBefore you be headin' off to do your grand questin' and adventure, might I beg a wee favor of ya, <lad/lass>?\n\nThese mountains be packed full'a precious relics and baubles... this place be a dream come true for tha league. I'd be much obliged if ya could bring any such treasures you stumble upon back ta me. You can even share in me ale for tha trouble! Trust me <lad/lass>, that's a rich deal!",o="将10件奥杜尔的圣物交给冰霜堡的洛尔克·锐须。",oEN="Return 10 Relics of Ulduar to Rork Sharpchin in Frosthold.",p="你有替我找到圣物吗？",pEN="Did ya find some o' dem relics for me?",c="赞！你真是个好家伙。\n\n跟我一起干一杯吧！让我们庆祝这伟大的发现！",cEN="Beaut! Yer a good one you are.\n\nTilt one back wi' me! Let us celebrae' this glorious find!"}
Q[12871]={d="有意思。我没有在诺甘农之壳上发现任何锁定设备，也许仅仅是找到另一半钥石可能还不够。\n\n把诺甘农之壳交给冰霜堡的探险队长拉格努斯吧。只要他能克服自己对“泰坦造物”的敬畏之心，或许就能通过诺甘农之壳推测出它的核心部分应该是什么样子。没准他们还能说服冰霜矮人帮忙寻找它呢。\n\n我要去研究一下怎么把这两半东西拼合起来，等我们都有了进展之后再联络吧。",dEN="Interesting. I don't see any locking mechanisms on the shell. That suggests to me that it may take more than just finding the other piece to combine the keystone.\n\nTake the shell back to the expedition leader, Lagnus, at Frosthold. Once he gets over his awe, he should be able to glean what the core looks like based on the shell, and maybe they can get the Frost Dwarves to help find it.\n\nI'm going to see if I can find out how to combine the two pieces. We'll catch up once we've both made some progress.",o="将诺甘农之壳交给冰霜堡的拉格努斯。",oEN="Take Norgannon's Shell to Lagnus at Frosthold.",p="你好啊！",pEN="Hello there!",c="穆拉丁的胡子啊！这是我想的那个东西吗？布莱恩这次真的超越自我了……还有你也是！家乡那些孩子们一定不会相信的。",cEN="By Muradin's beard! Is that what I think it is?! Brann's really outdone himself this time... and you too for that matter! The boys back home are never going to believe this."}
Q[12872]={d="正在为创世者的圆盘充能。\n\n已完成充能。\n\n准备引导紧急协议：伽玛。\n\n紧急协议已加载。请使用已充能的圆盘激活诺甘农之壳的守护者，文件员麦卡顿。在确认了你的身份之后，文件员会交出诺甘农之壳。\n\n祝你愉快一千年。",dEN="Charging inventor's disk.\n\nDisk charging completed.\n\nPreparing emergency protocol gamma.\n\nEmergency protocol loaded. Please use the charged disk to activate the guardian of Norgannon's shell, Archivist Mechaton. The archivist will release the shell once your identity has been verified.\n\nPlease have a pleasant millennium.",o="从文件员麦卡顿那里拿到诺甘农之壳。",oEN="Recover Norgannon's Shell from Archivist Mechaton.",p="好啦，别傻站在那儿了，让我看看诺甘农之壳！",pEN="Well, don't just stand there, show me the shell!",c="¡Eso es! Esa es la primera mitad de la piedra angular de Norgannon. Bien hecho, <name>. ¡Cuando vuelva a Forjaz, haré que te induzcan como miembro honorario de la Liga de Exploradores!",cEN="That's it! That's the first half of Norgannon's keystone. Well done, <name>. When I get back to Ironforge, I'm going to have you inducted as an honorary member in the Explorers' League!"}
Q[12873]={d="嗯……我已经可以精确地描绘出核心部分的样子了。只要霜脉部族中的矮人见过它，他们就一定可以认出我所描述的东西。\n\n时间已经不多了，我们直接谈重点吧。你要去跟约尔格·雷心国王谈一谈，请求他的帮助……他一定知道谁能帮我们找到核心部分。哦，记得要对他表现出足够的尊重——他可是非常德高望重的领袖。",dEN="Definitely... I can see exactly what the core must look like. If any of the frostborn have seen it, they'll be sure to recognize the description.\n\nThere's no time to waste, let's get straight to business. Go talk to King Stormheart and request his aid... he's sure to know someone who can help us find the core. And be nice about it will you - he's very respected around here.",o="与冰霜堡的约尔格·雷心谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Yorg Stormheart in Frosthold.",c="诺甘农之核？没听过。不过我也许知道谁有听说过。",cEN="Norgannon's Core? Never heard of it. I might well know someone that has though."}
Q[12874]={d="我非常乐意为旅行者提供庇护所，但我不会强迫族人插手你们的事情。\n\n我跟你说啊……我的族人都是战士，性格非常直爽，而且很真诚。当一个霜脉矮人成长为男子汉的时候，他就必须通过战斗来证明自己。他必须向所有族人证明，他会在战场上勇往直前，毫不退缩。\n\n如果你能向我证明，你和我的族人一样强壮勇敢，那么我就允许他们帮助你。去和悬崖那边的弗亚林·霜眉谈一谈，他会为你安排试炼的。",dEN="I be more than willing ta lend my shelter and home ta travelers in need, but I'm nae too keen ta force my people inte yer affairs.\n\nI'll tell ye what... my people are warriors, straight and true. On the day a frostborn becomes a man, he has ta prove himself in battle. He has ta show us that he'll not let size hold'm back.\n\nShow me yer as strong and fierce as one of my men, and I'll have them lend ye an ear or a blade. Speak ta Fjorlin over by the cliff to the south there and he'll put ye ta the test.",o="冰霜堡的约尔格·雷心要你去和弗亚林·霜眉谈一谈，从他那里获得一匹坐骑，并迎接挑战。",oEN="Yorg Stormheart at Frosthold has requested that you speak to Fjorlin Frostbrow to secure a ride and face your challenge.",p="你回来了。你是凯旋而归的吗？",pEN="Ye've come back to me. Have ye come back to me victorious?",c="¡Ja! Una gran historia, muchacho... tal vez tengas un poco de sangre de nacido de la escarcha en ti, ¿eh? De todos modos, no eres solo palabras, y eso es lo que necesitaba oír.",cEN="Ha! Grand tale lad... perhaps ye have a bit of frostborn blood in ye, eh? Yer not just talk anyway, and that's what I needed to hear."}
Q[12875]={d="我不知道这个核心藏在哪里，这你应该早就预料到了。不过我说了会帮忙，就一定会帮忙。\n\n北边的一处山洞里有一位名叫德鲁姆·霜握的隐士……就在山谷里面。我们的生活方式早已与泰坦没有太多联系了，保留下来的有关知识也很少。但是德鲁姆仍然过着传统的生活……他一直在关注着一些重要的泰坦遗迹，还经常和守护者克莱特乌斯谈话。\n\n你可以在他的山洞里面找到他……告诉他是我让你去的，他肯定会向你伸出援手。",dEN="I don't know where this core is hiding, but ye knew that. I said I'd help though, and that I shall.\n\nThere's a hermit by the name of Drom Frostgrip who lives in a cave north of here... down in tha valley. We've strayed away from the titans a bit ourselves being that there are so few about, but Drom's loyal to the old ways... he keeps an eye on their most precious places and speaks te the keeper Creteus often.\n\nYer sure to find him in the back of his cave... tell'm I sent ye and he'll help ye.",o="找到德鲁姆·霜握。",oEN="Locate Drom Frostgrip.",c="<德鲁姆咳出了一点血。>\n\n诺甘农之核，嗯？我自己花了许多时间想要找出关于它的线索，但它似乎是至今仍旧受到保护的圣物之一。我想这是有理由的。\n\n如果是雷心国王派你来的，他一定是感受到了你身上高贵的特质……此外，我也不会拒绝国王的命令。",cEN="<Drom coughts up a bit of blood.>\n\nNorgannon's Core, eh? I've spent a fair number of days trying to find anything I could about it myself, but it seems to be one of the relics that's still guarded. With reason I suppose.\n\nIf King Stormheart sent you, he surely must see something noble in ye... and I'm not one to refuse my king."}
Q[12876]={d="我们的斥候在北边的山谷里发现了铁矮人。听说国王陛下让你去拜访德鲁姆，我有点担心他的安全。\n\n如果你在路上碰到铁矮人，能帮我干掉他们吗？我想他们还不知道我们的具体位置，以及抵达这里的路线，而我希望这种情况能继续保持下去。",dEN="Our scouts have spotted iron dwarves in the valley north of here. I overheard King Stormheart sending you to visit Drom and I'm admittedly a bit worried about'm.\n\nIf you find any iron dwarves when you head down there, put'm down hard and fast for me, eh? I dun think they know exactly where we are or how to get here just yet, and I'd prefer to keep it that way.",o="冰霜堡的弗亚林·霜眉要你杀死10个雷铸铁矮人入侵者。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold wants you to kill 10 Stormforged Invaders.",p="斥候说的是正确的吗？下头有很多矮人吗？",pEN="Were the scouts right? Were there dwarves down there?",c="Noticias sombrías, muchacho. Esos enanos de hierro parecen estar aumentando en número... los hemos estado viendo por todas las montañas. Huelo que se avecina una guerra.\n\nGracias por encargarte de este grupo... has ganado un poco más de tiempo.",cEN="Grim news, lad. Those Iron Dwarves seem to be increasing in numbers... we've been seeing them all over the mountains. I smell war coming.\n\nThank you for dealing with this bunch... a little more time bought."}
Q[12877]={d="我从来没找到过核心……但我经常和守护者克莱特乌斯谈话，他曾因为疏忽透露了一些信息给我。你可以在山底平原东部的山上找到克莱特乌斯，他一直在守护着造物者引擎。核心可能就在那里，但你必须获得克莱特乌斯的支持。\n\n铁矮人正在这一带寻找某些东西……可能就是在找核心。他们拿走了我的戒指，去找到他们的首领，拿回戒指。只要把戒指拿给克莱特乌斯看，他就会知道是我让你去的。",dEN="I never found the core... but I've often spoken to the keeper Creteus, and his omissions give him away. You'll find Creteus over the mountains to the east, in the Foot Steppes, keeping watch on the Engine of the Makers. The core might well be in there, but you'll need to win Creteus's favor.\n\nThe iron dwarves were here looking for something... it might well be the core. They took my ring. Find their leader, get the ring back, and show it to Creteus so that he knows I sent you.",o="从一个铁矮人监督者手中夺回德鲁姆·霜握的徽记之戒，并把它交给山底平原的克莱特乌斯。",oEN="Recover Frostgrip's Signet Ring from an Iron Dwarf Monitor and then bring it to Creteus in the Foot Steppes.",p="Hola, <race>.\n\nMe complace que hayas optado por usar tu lengua en lugar de tu hoja al conocer de mi persona. He descubierto que es una cualidad cada vez más rara entre los tuyos últimamente.",pEN="Hello, <race>.\n\nI am pleased that you have opted to utilize your tongue over your blade when making my acquaintance. I have found that a more and more rare quality among your kind of late.",c="德鲁姆的戒指？我想他没有亲自介绍你给我认识，那么他现状一定不是很好，我很遗憾。德鲁姆是一位高贵的矮人，虽然有些好问。\n\n那么，你是为了什么事情来的？",cEN="Drom's ring? I am to assume Drom is not well if he did not introduce you directly. I am sorry to hear of that. Drom is a noble dwarf, if an inquisitive one.\n\nOn what business have you come then?"}
Q[12878]={d="你不在的时候，我有幸和矮人布莱恩·铜须交谈过。这位矮人展示了他找到钥石的决心，他的动机符合获得钥石的条件，这一点令我非常高兴……我相信钥石就是为他而生的。\n\n诺甘农之核就在东南方的严寒墓穴里。古代的冰雪生物守卫着那里，它们肯定不会对你笑脸相迎。带着我的祝福去击败那些守卫，取得钥石吧，$r。",dEN="During your absence, I was privileged enough to parley with the dwarf Brann Bronzebeard. This dwarf indicated his purpose for seeking the keystone, and I am satisfied that it is for satisfactory intent... I believe this dwarf may be the entity for which the keystone was created.\n\nNorgannon's Core is located in the Frigid Tomb to the southeast. Its guardians are ancient beings of ice, and they will not welcome your presence. Best these guardians and retrieve the keystone with my blessing, <race>.",o="山底平原的克莱特乌斯已经把诺甘农之核的位置告诉了你。",oEN="Creteus in the Foot Steppes has provided you with the information to locate Norgannon's Core.",c="<当箱子打开的时候，空气从里面流泄而出，使室内充满了漫长时光所累积的霉味。诺甘农之核就躺在箱子的底部，丝毫不带一点岁月的痕迹。>",cEN="<As the chest opens, air rushes out into the chamber, carrying with it the musty smell of something that has been here for countless years. Norgannon's Core rests in the bottom of the chest, undisturbed by the ages.>"}
Q[12879]={d="<当你从箱子里取出诺甘农之核时，你听到从走廊里传来了沉重的脚步声，正在一步步向你逼近。远处则隐隐传来战斗的声音。>",dEN="<As you retrieve the core from the chest, you hear the thumping of heavy footsteps rushing towards you from the corridor. There is the faint sound of battle in the distance.>",o="将诺甘农之核交给山底平原的克莱特乌斯。",oEN="Bring Norgannon's Core back to Creteus in the Foot Steppes.",c="Alguien está usando la Forja de Voluntades para crear este ejército... Ulduar ya no es segura.\n\n<race>, me alegra que hayas podido llegar al núcleo antes que estas abominaciones.",cEN="Someone is using the Forge of Wills to create this army... Ulduar is no longer safe.\n\n<race>, I am pleased that you were able to reach the core before these abominations were."}
Q[12880]={d="组合钥石需要用到诺甘农的拼合器……这个设备就在造物者引擎里，也就是我们旁边这个大坑。布莱恩已经带着另一半钥石到下面去了，我已经把使用这个设备的方法都告诉了他。他正在等着你。\n\n我会尽量拖住那些铁矮人，但恐怕不能阻挡他们太久。约尔格·雷心国王很快就要带着他的一部分属下回去防守冰霜堡了，你要快一点，$r。",dEN="Combining the keystone will require Norgannon's Binding - a device located in the Engine of the Makers, the large pit beside us. Brann should be down there with the other half of the keystone now. I have instructed him on the use of the device. He awaits your presence.\n\nI will do what I can to keep the iron dwarves occupied, but I do not have confidence that I will hold them for long. King Stormheart is returning to the defense of Frosthold with some of his men shortly. Please hurry, <race>.",o="将诺甘农之核交给造物者引擎里的布莱恩·铜须。",oEN="Bring Norgannon's Core to Brann Bronzebeard in the Engine of the Makers.",p="¡Hola, <lad/lass>! Es un placer conocerte en persona. ¿Lo encontraste?",pEN="Hey there, <lad/lass>! Good to meet ya in person. Did you find it?",c="¡Eres brillante, muchacho! ¡Brillante! Este será un día glorioso, de hecho.\n\nRápido, pásame el núcleo antes de que esos enanos de hierro bajen hasta aquí.",cEN="You're brilliant, lad! Brilliant! This will be a glorious day indeed.\n\nQuickly, hand me the core before those iron dwarves make their way down here."}
Q[12881]={o="Relacionado",oEN="Related"}
Q[12882]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a las cumbres.\n\nTengo una petición muy sencilla antes de que te embarques en tu próximo viaje. Hay reliquias y tesoros de la antigua Ulduar desperdigados por estas montañas. La mayoría estarán seguramente en manos de las diversas razas que aquí viven.\n\nTráeme todas las que encuentres y te recompensaré con algo a cambio. Puede que incluso te deje probar alguna de mis potentes cervezas.",dEN="Welcome to the peaks.\n\nI have a simple request before you head off on whatever grand jaunt you have planned. There are relics and treasures of ancient Ulduar scattered through these mountains. Most are likely in possession of the various sentient races.\n\nReturn any that you find to me, and I will reward you in kind. Perhaps I'll even let you partake on my many potent ales.",o="将10件奥杜尔的圣物交给格罗玛什坠毁点的奥鲁特·埃雷古。",oEN="Return 10 Relics of Ulduar to Olut Alegut at the Grom'arsh Crash-site.",p="你有找到我说的圣物吗？",pEN="Were you able to find the relics of which I spoke?",c="这些真是太棒了！我很感激你，同你的烦恼忧愁喝一杯如何？",cEN="These will do nicely! I am much obliged. Perhaps a drink for your troubles?"}
Q[12883]={d="小的们，听从主人的号令！巫妖王派我来全权管理祖达克的天灾部队。我们要做的就是消灭一切。\n\n消灭一切！！！\n\n我们正在死亡旷野对所有的尸体进行处理，然后把它们派去泽尔拉玛斯的纳瓦留斯王子手下，加强天灾军团的实力。在达库鲁的管理下，什么都不会浪费的！\n\n很快我们就将变得前所未有的强大！不久之后，祖达克和古达克就将属于天灾军团！",dEN="Minions be hearin' da call of your masta! Da Lich King be givin' Drakuru full control of da armies of da Scourge in Zul'Drak. We be commanded ta kill everyting.\n\nEVERYTING MUST DIE!\n\nWe be processin' all da corpses in da Dead Fields and sendin' em up ta Prince Navarius' crew in Zeramas for Scourgin'! Notin' goes ta waste on Drakuru's watch!\n\nSoon we be drinkin' da blood of da prophets ta become stronger dan eva before! Zul'Drak and Gundrak gonna fall to da Scourge!",o="将达库鲁的命令交给祖达克圣光据点的北伐军领主兰迪加。",oEN="Return the Orders From Drakuru to Crusader Lord Lantinga at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.",p="达库鲁，呃？我听过这个名字……",pEN="Drakuru, eh? I've heard the name before...",c="要是这跟达克萨隆要塞的达库鲁是同一个的话，我们就会需要……支援。\n\n阿彻鲁斯的死亡骑士就在附近驻扎，毫无疑问跟我们银色北伐军一样，都是追寻着天灾军团的破坏痕迹而来。我们一半的军力都在银色前沿跟疯狂的达卡莱巨魔奋战，我们得跟黑锋骑士团会合。\n\n<兰迪加低声地抱怨了几句。>\n\n我本来想着能不用再看到那些混蛋的，圣光在上呀。",cEN="If this is the same Drakuru from Drak'Tharon Keep we are going to need... outside assistance.\n\nDeath knights of Acherus are stationed nearby, undoubtedly following the same trail of Scourge destruction that lead the Argent Crusade here. As half of our army is tied up at the Argent Stand, battling crazed Drakkari trolls, we will have to join forces with the Knights of the Ebon Blade.\n\n<Lantinga mutters under his breath.>\n\nI was hoping I'd never have to see those scoundrels again after Light's Hope..."}
Q[12884]={d="这里的西面，穿过荒废的道路和建筑之后，就是死亡骑士的营地——黑锋哨站。\n\n<北伐军领主兰迪加卷起达库鲁的命令。>\n\n把这些命令交给斯特凡·瓦杜，他是黑锋哨站死亡骑士的指挥官。告诉他，银色北伐军会对付纳瓦留斯王子，他们要做的就是解决达库鲁。\n\n对了，多加小心，$n。转至黑锋哨站的路上到处都是天灾军团。",dEN="West of here, across the ruined roads and structures, is the death knight encampment of Ebon Watch.\n\n<Crusader Lord Lantinga rolls up Drakuru's orders.>\n\nTake these orders and deliver them to Stefan Vadu. He is the death knight in command at Ebon Watch. Let him know that the Argent Crusade will deal with Prince Navarius. They'll have to handle Drakuru.\n\nBe careful, <name>. The way to Ebon Watch is teeming with Scourge.",o="将达库鲁的命令交给祖达克黑锋哨站的斯特凡·瓦杜。",oEN="Deliver the Orders From Drakuru to Stefan Vadu at Ebon Watch in Zul'Drak.",p="¿Qué tienes ahí, <race>?",pEN="What have you got there, <race>?",c="<斯特凡读了信，将它撕成碎片，丢入火中。>\n\n老掉牙的消息了。银色北伐军又一次晚了一步。我们从灰熊丘陵就在注意达库鲁了——他已经在我们的死亡名单上了。",cEN="<Stefan reads the missive, then crumples it up and tosses it into the fire.>\n\nOld news. The Argent Crusade is - once again - late to the party. We've been tracking Drakuru since Grizzly Hills. He is slated for eradication."}
Q[12885]={d="风暴峭壁是个充满吸引力的地方，这里不仅仅只有泰坦遗迹。居住在这里的人民遭受着由洛肯和他的部下带来的巨大威胁。\n\n他派出了他的亲信——铁矮人，残忍地向所有的岩石生物发动进攻。他把土灵赶出了奥杜尔，迫使他们只能在创世者的图书馆西面的山上避难，也就是那处被称为布德克拉格庇护所的地方。布德克拉格和他的同胞被铁矮人围困在那里。去找到他们，帮助他们，$n。",dEN="The Storm Peaks are an intriguing place, but there's far more here than titan ruins. The peoples who live here face a dire threat in Loken and his minions.\n\nHe sent his favorite servants, the iron dwarves, on a brutal campaign against all the creatures of stone. He expelled the earthen from Ulduar, forcing them to take shelter at Bouldercrag's Refuge, on the face of a mountain west of the Inventor's Library. Bouldercrag and his brethren are beset by the iron dwarves there. Find and help them, <name>.",o="与布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",c="所以说你认识布莱恩·铜须了？他是我们在血肉之躯的生物中最亲近的盟友。我们像兄弟一样的对抗洛肯与他的手下，像兄弟一样的在奥杜尔奋战。",cEN="So you know Brann Bronzebeard, then? He is our closest ally among those of the flesh. We are as brothers in the struggle against Loken and his followers, in the struggle for Ulduar."}
Q[12886]={d="时机已经成熟。你通过了海德比武会的绝大多数试炼……如今只剩下最后一项。在过去的战斗中，你逐渐跻身最强大最凶残的女武士之列。\n\n最后的试炼即将开始——驭龙赛，海德比武会的价值与尚武精神的完美体现。我要你骑上幼龙，使用鱼叉击败所有竞争者。\n\n不要仁慈。没有谁会对你手下留情的。",dEN="This is it. You've passed all the tests of the Hyldsmeet... all but one. You've risen among our sisters' best and fiercest.\n\nThe final test is at hand. The Drakkensryd - the true test of a Hyldnir's worth and warrior spirit. It'll be you, your riding drake, a chained harpoon and a score of your sisters vying for dominance.\n\nShow no quarter. None will be expected.",o="使用海德尼尔鱼叉，在风暴神殿击败10名海德比武会龙骑士。获胜后对装饰石柱使用海德尼尔鱼叉以完成驭龙赛，然后与托里姆谈一谈。",oEN="Use the Hyldnir Harpoon to defeat 10 Hyldsmeet Drakeriders at the Temple of Storms. Use the Hyldnir Harpoon on a Column Ornament to exit the Drakkensryd and speak to Thorim when you've succeeded.",p="走开！",pEN="Begone!",c="西芙……是你吗？",cEN="Sif... is that you?"}
Q[12887]={d="Los Caballeros de la Espada de Ébano quieren tomar la base de la Plaga al noroeste conocida como La Cámara de las Sombras. Tengo un contacto en su grupo que me ha pedido ayuda.\n\nEl primer paso es cegar al Rey Exánime. Para observar la zona está usando un artefacto llamado El Ocular que flota sobre las agujas de la cámara.\n\nNuestros enanos han creado algo para que lo uses contra él. Cuando el \"ojo\" haya sido destruido, encuentra al Barón Tajada dentro de la cámara. Está fingiendo que sigue bajo la voluntad del Rey Exánime.",dEN="The Knights of the Ebon Blade want to take the Scourge base known as The Shadow Vault to the northwest. I have a contact in their group who has asked for help.\n\nThe first step is to blind the Lich King. He's using a device known as The Ocular to watch the area, which floats above the vault's spires.\n\nOur dwarves have created something for you to use against it. After the 'eye' has been destroyed, find Baron Sliver on the vault grounds. He's pretending to still be under the Lich King's will.",o="摧毁魔眼，然后向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报告。",oEN="Destroy The Ocular and then report to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",p="魔眼依然完好无损！萨萨里安会相信你真是一件蠢事。\n\n不管你是谁，在摧毁魔眼之前不要再来找我。我在这里的身份一定要保密！",pEN="The Ocular still stands! Thassarian was a fool to trust you.\n\nWhoever you are, don't return again until it is destroyed. My position here must not be compromised!",c="也许我们终于能做点什么了。不过不要被蒙蔽了，巫妖王还是能通过天灾军团的爪牙“监视”。\n\n那就是你来此的理由。",cEN="Perhaps now we can really get something done. Don't be fooled though, the Lich King can still 'see' through his Scourge minions.\n\nThat's why you're here."}
Q[12888]={d="这张卡片可以让用户进入名为“E型检修员”的机器人的控制面板，对机器人进行维护或重新编写机器人的指令。\n\nE型检修员似乎被指派进入创世者的图书馆内部工作。这张卡片上列出了已损坏的部件和瘫痪的系统，只要有合适的零件，机器人就能恢复到正常的工作状态。",dEN="This card allows the user to access the control panel of the scrapbot designated SCRAP-E, in order to perform maintenance and reprogram the bot's directives.\n\nSCRAP-E appears to be assigned to the interior of the building at The Inventor's Library. The card displays a list of the bot's broken components and failing systems. With the proper parts, the bot can be restored to working condition.",o="将E型检修员控制卡、4份钴螺丝和5份过载电容器交给创世者的图书馆中的E型检修员。",oEN="Bring the SCRAP-E Access Card along with 4 Handfuls of Cobalt Bolts and 5 Overcharged Capacitors to SCRAP-E at The Inventor's Library.",p="<你打开了E型检修员的控制面板。>",pEN="<You open SCRAP-E's access panel.>",c="<你开始依照操作卡片上面的数据修复机器人。当修复完成时，你关了操作面板，打开开关。>",cEN="<You begin performing the repairs indicated by the access card. When the repairs are complete, you close the access panel and throw the power switch.>"}
Q[12889]={d="名称：E型检修员。\n\n任务：在守护者米米尔离开时维护创世者的图书馆中的控制台和数据库。\n\n距离上一次维护时间：489天。\n\n结构图数据状态：未知。\n\n当前任务：修理原型机控制台。",dEN="Designation SCRAP-E.\n\nDirective: Maintain consoles and databases of Inventor's Library in Keeper Mimir's absences.\n\nTime since last maintenance cycle: 489 days.\n\nStatus of schematic data: unknown.\n\nCurrent tasks: Repair prototype console.",o="使用创世者的图书馆中的原型机控制台。",oEN="Interact with the Prototype Console in The Inventor's Library.",c="你检查了修复以后的原型机控制台的外观。起码有一张米米尔隆的图样仍在这台机器许久没保养的情况下存留下来。从图样上的图表和指示中，你知道你可以把那只机械侏儒给修复。",cEN="You examine the display on the repaired prototype console. At least one of Mimir's schematics seems to have survived the long period between maintenance cycles. From the diagrams and instructions displayed in the schematic's file, you could easily construct the mechagnome shown."}
Q[12891]={d="在我为巫妖王——啊咳——效力的时候，我们经常使用一种“统治魔棒”控制一些比较聪明的天灾成员。\n\n我要你帮忙制作一根新的统治魔棒。\n\n你很幸运，所需的材料都在附近：一根教徒的魔棒、一根憎恶的弯钩、一条恶鬼的绳子，外加一些天灾精华。\n\n这应该不难，$c。",dEN="When I was in the - ahem - employ of the Lich King, we would often use a device known as a sovereign rod to keep some of the more intelligent Scourge in line.\n\nI require that you assist me in the construction of a new one.\n\nLuckily for you, all of the necessary components are at hand: a cultist rod, an abomination hook, a geist rope, and a handful of Scourge essences.\n\nThis should not be difficult, <class>.",o="暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵要求你去收集一根教徒的魔棒、一根憎恶的弯钩、一条恶鬼的绳子和5份天灾精华。",oEN="Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault has asked you to collect a Cultist Rod, an Abomination Hook, a Geist Rope, and 5 Scourge Essences.",p="当你收集好我交代给你的材料，我就可以开始制作，加上一点我们所需的小小改造，就可以工作了。",pEN="When you've managed to acquire that which I have asked of you, I will fashion the device, with a few modifications for our purposes, and we'll be on with our business.",c="快，把他们交给我，离开我的视线！\n\n魔棒、弯钩、绳子都不用再加工。不过组成之后，我还得附上精华的浓缩，这样我们还可以再进行下一步。\n\n看起来很组成很简单，功能却很特别！",cEN="Quickly, hand them to me and stay out of sight!\n\nThe rod, the hook, and the rope are all very self-evident in their usage when combined. I just need to infuse the result with the essences and we'll be ready to proceed.\n\nIt's all very mundane in its composition, but extraordinary in its application!"}
Q[12892]={d="Los Caballeros de la Espada de Ébano quieren tomar la base de la Plaga al noroeste conocida como La Cámara de las Sombras. Tengo un contacto en su grupo que me ha pedido ayuda.\n\nEl primer paso es cegar al Rey Exánime. Para observar la zona está utilizando un artefacto llamado El Ocular que flota sobre las agujas de la cámara.\n\nNuestros enanos han creado algo para que lo uses contra él. Cuando el \"ojo\" haya sido destruido, encuentra al Barón Tajada dentro de la cámara. Está fingiendo que sigue bajo la voluntad del Rey Exánime.",dEN="The Knights of the Ebon Blade want to take the Scourge base known as The Shadow Vault to the northwest. I have a contact in their group who has asked for help.\n\nThe first step is to blind the Lich King. He's using a device known as The Ocular to watch the area, which floats above the vault's spires.\n\nOur goblins have created something for you to use against it. After the 'eye' has been destroyed, find Baron Sliver on the vault grounds. He's pretending to still be under the Lich King's will.",o="摧毁魔眼，然后向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报告。",oEN="Destroy The Ocular and then report to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",p="魔眼依然完好无损！库尔迪拉会相信你真是一件蠢事。\n\n不管你是谁，在摧毁魔眼之前不要再来找我。我在这里的身份一定要保密！",pEN="The Ocular still stands! Koltira was a fool to trust you.\n\nWhoever you are, don't return again until it is destroyed. My position here must not be compromised!",c="也许我们终于能做点什么了。不过不要被蒙蔽了，巫妖王还是能通过天灾军团的爪牙“监视”。\n\n那就是你来此的理由。",cEN="Perhaps now we can really get something done. Don't be fooled though, the Lich King can still 'see' through his Scourge minions.\n\nThat's why you're here."}
Q[12893]={d="Vil, Lady Bosqueténebro y El Saltador serían armas excelentes en la lucha contra el Rey Exánime si lográsemos liberarlos de su dominio. Para eso es la vara soberana.\n\nLos encontrarás en los salientes al este y oeste de la cámara, y en la zona media de la cámara de arriba. Hay que usar la vara sobre los cadáveres de los tres.\n\nDate prisa. ¡Serán nuestros!",dEN="Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper would make excellent weapons in the fight against the Lich King if they can be broken from his will. That is what the Sovereign Rod is for.\n\nYou'll find them on the ledges to the east and west of the vault, as well as on the mid-tier of the vault above us. The rod is to be used upon the corpses of the three.\n\nFly now. We will have them as our own!",o="暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵希望你在劣尸维尔、奈丝伍德夫人和跳线者的尸体上使用统治魔棒。",oEN="Baron Sliver at the Shadow Vault wants you to use the Sovereign Rod on the corpses of Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper.",p="AÚN no los has convertido. ¡No insultes mi inteligencia, <class>!",pEN="You have NOT turned them yet. Do not insult my intelligence, <class>!",c="当我们拿下暗影拱顶以后，我们会好好的利用他们三个的。\n\n说到这个……",cEN="We will put those three to good use once we finally take the vault.\n\nSpeaking of which...."}
Q[12894]={d="几天前，北伐军战士达加斯、马克拉尔、工程师里德、双胞胎戈尔克和布尔被派往死亡旷野创建前沿阵地。我最后一次同他们通信时，他们已经在西北方死亡旷野的边界上创建起了一座营地。\n\n根据这份新近发现的与达库鲁和纳瓦留斯王子相关的情报来看，我想我们必须马上派人转至北伐军前线营地。\n\n做好准备，$n。现在就出发！",dEN="Crusader Dargath, Crusader MacKellar, Engineer Reed and the twins, Gerk and Burr, were sent to the Dead Fields to establish a battle front days ago. As of my last correspondence with them, they had successfully established a camp on the border of the Dead Fields, northwest of here.\n\nIn light of this newfound information about Drakuru and Prince Navarius I think it would be prudent to send someone to the Crusader Forward Camp post-haste.\n\nPack up your belongings, <name>. You must leave at once!",o="在祖达克的北伐军前线营地寻找北伐军战士马克拉尔。",oEN="Seek out Crusader MacKellar at the Crusader Forward Camp in Zul'Drak.",c="在天灾军团发动攻击之前，事情都进行得很顺利。他们抓走了达加斯、戈尔克和布尔，而且也毁掉了我们的坦克车。猜猜是谁领导这波攻击的？\n\n<马克拉尔拉点了点头。>\n\n纳瓦留斯……\n\n这整个地方似乎是天灾军团的某种工厂。而我们正处在天杀的天灾雷区正中央！",cEN="Everything was fine until the Scourge attacked. They took off with Dargath, Gerk and Burr and they also destroyed our ride. Guess who led that attack?\n\n<MacKellar nods.>\n\nNavarius...\n\nSeems this whole area is some type of factory for Scourge. We're in the middle of a damned undead mine field!"}
Q[12895]={d="在动身出发之前，我曾经收到斥候沃塔肯翻译整理的有关布莱恩·铜须的文件。从布莱恩的日记和灰熊丘陵的发现来看，布莱恩肯定已经动身转至风暴峭壁了。在我们坠机之前，我发现在这里南边的山底平原对面有个露营地，俯瞰着冻结的伯尔之息河。\n\n如果布莱恩不在那里的话，就在营地一带找找，看那个该死的矮人有没有留下什么线索。如果你找到任何线索的话，把它带回来给我。",dEN="Before we left, I received the file Scout Vor'takh compiled on this Brann Bronzebeard. There can be no doubt that Brann was headed for the Storm Peaks from his journal entries and findings in Grizzly Hills. Before we crashed, I caught sight of a campsite south of here, across the Foot Steppes, and overlooking the frozen Bor's Breath River.\n\nIf Brann isn't there, search the camp and its environs for any clues as to where that blasted dwarf might've gone. Bring back anything you find.",o="在布莱恩的营地中找到用麻布裹起来的便笺，把它交给格罗玛什坠毁点的伯克塔·血怒。",oEN="Retrieve the Burlap-Wrapped Note from Brann's camp and return it to Boktar Bloodfury at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",p="你在铜须的营地找到什么吗？",pEN="Did you have any luck finding Bronzebeard's camp?",c="当然以我们的运气来说，我早就预料到了。嗯，我们不会让他这么简单地就跑走。让我们看看信笺上写些什么。",cEN="Of course, with our luck, I probably could've predicted this. Well, we're not going to let him get away that easily. Let's see what that note says."}
Q[12896]={d="除非是最特别的情况下，像莱斯班恩将军这样强大的死亡骑士，都被巫妖王紧紧地控制着，根本不能转化。\n\n莱斯班恩将军在拱顶内部监督着新武器的制作流程。我向你保证，只要弄乱北部熔炉那里的武器架，他一定会冲过来的。我会派劣尸维尔、奈丝伍德夫人和跳线者去帮助你。\n\n如果我们想得到暗影拱顶，就必须干掉莱斯班恩将军！",dEN="Death knights, such as General Lightsbane, are held on too tight of a leash to be able to be turned from the Lich King's will except under the most extraordinary circumstances.\n\nThe general keeps himself within the vault overseeing the creation of new weapons. Disturb one of his weapon racks at the northern forge and I assure you, he will come. I'll send Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper in to help you.\n\nIf we are to finally own The Shadow Vault, General Lightsbane must fall!",o="击败莱斯班恩将军，然后向联盟飞行战舰上的萨萨里安报捷。",oEN="Defeat General Lightsbane and then report your success back to Thassarian aboard the gunship, The Skybreaker.",p="<name>, te pregunto, ¿por qué estaríamos hablando de nuevo si el General Lightsbane aún existiera?",pEN="I ask you, <name>, why would we be speaking again if General Lightsbane yet exists?",c="莱斯班恩将军和他的部队都被击败了？暗影拱顶已经陷落了？",cEN="General Lightsbane and his forces are defeated? The Shadow Vault is taken?"}
Q[12897]={d="除非是最特别的情况下，像莱斯班恩将军这样强大的死亡骑士，都被巫妖王紧紧地控制着，根本不能转化。\n\n莱斯班恩将军在拱顶内部监督着新武器的制作流程。我向你保证，只要弄乱北部熔炉那里的武器架，他一定会冲过来的。我会派劣尸维尔、奈丝伍德夫人和跳线者去帮助你。\n\n如果我们想得到暗影拱顶，就必须干掉莱斯班恩将军！",dEN="Death knights, such as General Lightsbane, are held on too tight of a leash to be able to be turned from the Lich King's will except under the most extraordinary circumstances.\n\nThe general keeps himself within the vault overseeing the creation of new weapons. Disturb one of his weapon racks at the northern forge and I assure you, he will come. I'll send Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper in to help you.\n\nIf we are to finally own The Shadow Vault, General Lightsbane must fall!",o="击败莱斯班恩将军，然后向部落飞行战舰上的库尔迪拉·织亡者报捷。",oEN="Defeat General Lightsbane and then report your success back to Koltira Deathweaver aboard the gunship, Orgrim's Hammer.",c="莱斯班恩将军和他的部队都被击败了？暗影拱顶已经陷落了？",cEN="General Lightsbane and his forces are defeated? The Shadow Vault is taken?"}
Q[12898]={d="你干得非常好。而且你还为黑锋骑士团赢得了三位非常重要的伙伴。\n\n<萨萨里安注视着远方的地平线。>\n\n你应该回去了。现在，斯利文男爵和其它的死亡骑士正在为了保卫暗影拱顶，与天灾军团进行着激烈的战斗。\n\n我相信他们需要你的帮助。",dEN="It sounds like you did extremely well. And you secured three very important allies for the Knights of the Ebon Blade in the process.\n\n<Thassarian gazes out over the horizon.>\n\nYou should head back. By now, Baron Sliver and the other death knights will be fighting tooth and nail to hold The Shadow Vault against the might of the Scourge.\n\nI'm sure they'll need your help.",o="向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报到。",oEN="Report back to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",c="你回来了，做得好。如你所见，我们在这里忙到无暇分身。",cEN="Good of you to return. As you can see, we have our hands full here."}
Q[12899]={d="你干得非常好。而且你还为黑锋骑士团赢得了三位非常重要的伙伴。\n\n<库尔迪拉注视着远方的地平线。>\n\n你应该回去了。现在，斯利文男爵和其它的死亡骑士正在为了保卫暗影拱顶，与天灾军团进行着激烈的战斗。\n\n我相信他们需要你的帮助。",dEN="It sounds like you did extremely well. And you secured three very important allies for the Knights of the Ebon Blade in the process.\n\n<Koltira gazes down at the map on the floor.>\n\nYou should head back. By now, Baron Sliver and the other death knights will be fighting tooth and nail to hold The Shadow Vault against the might of the Scourge.\n\nI'm sure they'll need your help.",o="向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报到。",oEN="Report back to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",c="你回来了，做得好。如你所见，我们在这里忙到无暇分身。",cEN="Good of you to return. As you can see, we have our hands full here."}
Q[12900]={d="这么说你想骑熊咯？好吧，既然你已经到了这一步，那么你肯定得去海德比武会试一试了。\n\n先做重要的事，我们要给你制作一副挽具。\n\n你可以在南面的峭壁上找到三五成群的雪人。它们的毛皮非常坚韧，而且厚度也正合适。帮我拿些毛皮回来，我们开始朝着让你骑上熊的目标努力吧。",dEN="So you want to ride? Well, if you've made it this far someone must think you've got a shot at the Hyldsmeet.\n\nFirst things first; we'll have to make you a harness.\n\nIn the cliffs to the south, you'll find scattered groups of yeti. Their hides are tough and just the right thickness. Bring me some and we'll get you started on the path of the bear-rider.",o="布伦希尔达村的艾丝崔·约利塔尔希望你交给她3张冰鬃雪人的毛皮。",oEN="Astrid Bjornrittar in Brunnhildar Village wants you to obtain 3 Icemane Yeti Hides.",p="你找到毛皮了没？你可以在下方的山丘找到雪人。",pEN="Did you find the hides yet? You'll find yeti in the hills below.",c="这些毛皮很不错。我立刻就会为你准备好挽具。",cEN="These will do nicely. I'll have the harness ready for you in no time."}
Q[12901]={d="我们一定要阻止纳瓦留斯王子。不能让天灾继续把这个地方当作他们的僵尸制造场。如果我们能让坦克运转起来的话，也许还有机会。现在，我需要一些配件来修补坦克。\n\n在这里的西北方，有个被称为塞穆之末的地方，天灾军团把那里当作基地。基地周围散布着它们到来之后留下的废料，零碎的天灾金属被扔得到处都是。帮我拿些天灾金属废料回来，我会让它们物尽其用的。",dEN="Prince Navarius must be stopped. We can't let the Scourge continue to use this area as a zombie factory. If we can get the tank operational we might stand a chance. What I need right now are spare parts.\n\nNorthwest of here is an area called Thrym's End. The Scourge armies are using the area as a base of sorts. Spread out across the base is the wreckage from their arrival. Bits and pieces of Scourge scrap metal litter the landscape. Get that stuff to me and I'll try and put it to good use.",o="北伐军前线营地的工程师里德要求你收集10块天灾金属废料。",oEN="Engineer Reed at Crusader Forward Camp in Zul'Drak has asked that you recover 10 pieces of Scourge Scrap Metal.",p="<name>, de verdad no sé si este plan funcionará. Solo tráeme el metal de desecho y haré lo que pueda.",pEN="I really don't know if this plan will work, <name>. Just bring me the scrap metal and I'll do what I can.",c="这个垃圾到底是什么！啊，全都去死吧！这没有用。天灾金属没办法利用。我们到底该怎么办？",cEN="What is this junk! Ah, damn it all! It's useless. Scourge metal isn't gonna do the trick. What are we going to do?"}
Q[12902]={d="这群可怜的家伙是仅存的幸存者。\n\n按照他们酋长话来说，达卡莱巨魔同怒爪狼獾人已经结盟几千年了。他们世世代代同巨魔一起生活在这里，完全没有注意到周围发生的变化。对于怒爪狼獾人来说，巨魔依然是原来的巨魔，所以当巨魔向他们的巢穴发动进攻时，狼獾人完全吓傻了。\n\n我们需要答案，$n。去东南方的狼獾人村庄寻找线索，找出是谁该为这件事情负责。",dEN="These poor creatures are the only survivors.\n\nAccording to their chief, the Drakkari trolls and Rageclaw wolvar have been allies for thousands of years. They've been living here, alongside the trolls, for generations, completely unaware of the ever changing world around them. To the Rageclaw, a troll is a troll, so the troll attack upon their den took them by surprise.\n\nWe need some answers, <name>. Scour their village - southeast of here - for clues as to who or what is in charge of these attacks.",o="转至怒爪巢穴寻找线索，查出向怒爪狼獾人发动进攻的幕后主使。",oEN="Search Rageclaw Den for a clue about who or what initiated the attacks against the Rageclaw Wolvar.",c="在这座奇怪的祭坛上方漂浮着一个卷轴。这一定就是北伐军领主兰迪加要找的东西！",cEN="There is a scroll floating in the air above the strange altar. This must be what Crusader Lord Lantinga is looking for!"}
Q[12903]={d="Nos atacaron el príncipe Navarius y al menos una docena de seres de la Plaga. Les dije a Dargath y a los gemelos que se quedaran en el tanque, pero no me hicieron caso. Dargath me miró a los ojos y dijo: \"Si no sale alguien de este tanque, nos matarán a todos.\" Entonces hizo que Carrizo apagara el motor y se lanzó a la carga. Fue lo más heroico que he visto en mi vida.\n\nOí al príncipe gritar instrucciones a los monstruos. Parecía que se los llevaba al Fin de Thrym, al noroeste de aquí. Tenemos que rescatar a nuestros amigos. ¿Puedes ir a buscarlos?",dEN="We were attacked by Prince Navarius and at least a dozen Scourge. I told Dargath and the twins to stay inside the tank, but they wouldn't listen. Dargath looked me in the eyes and said, \"If somebody doesn't get out of this tank, they'll kill us all.\" He then made Reed cut the engine and charged. Most heroic thing I've ever seen.\n\nI heard the Prince barking orders to the monsters. Sounded like he was taking them to Thrym's End, northwest of here. We have to rescue our friends. Will you go look for them?",o="北伐军前线营地的北伐军战士马克拉尔要求你找到北伐军战士达加斯、戈尔克和布尔。",oEN="Crusader MacKellar at Crusader Forward Camp has asked that you find Crusader Dargath, Gerk and Burr.",c="他们三个做出了伟大的牺牲，我们不会忘记的。他们的死亡不会白费。我们终将获胜！",cEN="It was a great sacrifice that those three made and it won't soon be forgotten. Their passing will not be in vain. We will be victorious!"}
Q[12904]={d="他们……他们杀死了我的兄弟。\n\n<戈尔克强忍着泪水。>\n\n他们……他们就像宰杀动物一样把他杀死了。现在他们还把我的兄弟放在营地另一端的石板上，准备进行实验。达加斯也死了。这位圣骑士在东北方的废墟中英勇抵抗，但瓦古维库人的首领奥贾尔实在是太强大了。\n\n我是唯一的幸存者，但我也支撑不了多久了。我……我快要不行了。\n\n如果圣光不能为我复仇，或许你可以，$c。把他们全部消灭。",dEN="They... They killed my brother.\n\n<Gerk fights back tears.>\n\nSlaughtered him like he was some sort of animal. Now they got him laid out on one of their tables on the other side of the camp, ready for their grizzly experiments. Dargath's dead too. The paladin made a heroic stand at the ruins to the northeast, but the leader of the Vargul, Algar, was too strong.\n\nI'm all that's left and I'll be dead soon too. I... I'm turning.\n\nIf the Light won't grant me vengeance, maybe you will, <class>. Kill them all.",o="Gerk en el Fin de Thrym en Zul'Drak quiere que mates a 15 vargul.|n",oEN="Gerk at Thrym's End in Zul'Drak wants you to kill 15 Vargul.",p="你是在帮这世界的忙，朋友。一定得阻止这些怪物！",pEN="You're doing the world a favor, friend. These monsters must be stopped!",c="<戈尔克濒死，并断断续续对你说着话。>\n\n他……他们说这些瓦古是……是巫妖王觉得没用的家伙们。你……你能想……想象吗？想想……想想那些有……用的家伙会有多强……\n\n我会在另一个世界为你祈祷，英雄……愿你永远也不会面对他们。",cEN="<Gerk is dying.>\n\nTh... They say these Vargul are the... the ones that weren't found worthy by the Lich King. Can... Can you im... imagine it? Just th... think how powerful the... the... worthy must be...\n\nI'll say a prayer for you in the hereafter, hero... May you never have to face them in number."}
Q[12905]={d="Trato hecho pues, $n. Tú me ayudas a quitarme estas cadenas y yo te ayudo a encontrar tu amiguito verde.\n\nLa Hyldnir que controla esta mina se llama Mildred la Cruel, y con razón.\n\nDile que te han enviado a echar una mano en las minas. Haz lo que te pida hasta que te confíe las llaves de mis grilletes.",dEN="Our deal is made then, <name>. You help me get out of these chains and I'll help you find your little green friend.\n\nThe Hyldnir who runs this mine is known as Mildred the Cruel -- and with good reason.\n\nTell her you've been sent to lend a hand with the mines. Do whatever she asks until she trusts you with the keys to my shackles.",o="在荒弃矿洞内与残酷的米尔德蕾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Mildred the Cruel inside the Forlorn Mine.",c="我正期待有人能来替换我的其中一个监工。你也差不多该出现了。\n\n来吧，让我们替你安排一些工作。",cEN="I was expecting a replacement for one of my overseers. It's about time you showed up.\n\nLet's put you to work."}
Q[12906]={d="我就直接了当地说吧。在矿洞里为我们工作的男性维库人都不是心甘情愿的……他们只是暂时屈服而已。\n\n每隔一段时间，他们中总是会有几个人失去动力。找到那些不合作的维库人，用这根训诫之杖好好吓唬一下他们。\n\n他们也该清醒清醒了。",dEN="Let's start you off with something straightforward. The male vrykul that work the mines for us do so against their will... purely out of fear of our blades.\n\nOnce in a while, one of them will lose their motivation. Find any uncooperative vrykul and put them in their place.\n\nTake this disciplining rod. You'll want to inflict pain, not death. Well, most of the time anyway.",o="荒弃矿洞中的残酷的米尔德蕾要求你使用训诫之杖威吓6个筋疲力尽的维库人。",oEN="Mildred the Cruel at the Forlorn Mine wants you to use the Disciplining Rod on 6 Exhausted Vrykul.",p="完成了吗？我希望你没有杀掉太多维库杂种。我们还需要人手。",pEN="Is it done? I hope you didn't slay too many of the mongrels. We need the manpower.",c="对一个新任监工来说还算不错了。如果你还有足够的勇气，我还有另一项任务要给你。",cEN="Not bad for a new overseer. I've another task for you if you're feeling brave today."}
Q[12907]={d="任何事情都会有两面性，我的姐妹。维库人已经不能再忍受高压了，他们逐渐开始有了反抗的念头。\n\n带头的家伙名叫加哈尔。为了进一步证明你的忠诚，去把他干掉……记得一定要当众下手，好好警告一下那些维库人。",dEN="For every action there is an opposite reaction, sister. In the case of us applying pressure on the males, this has meant newly spread rumors of insurrection.\n\nThe bearded pig behind this rabble-rousing is called Garhal. Put an end to him... and make sure the other males see his demise. They must learn that insubordination will not be tolerated.",o="荒弃矿洞内的残酷的米尔德蕾命令你去处死加哈尔。",oEN="Mildred the Cruel at the Forlorn Mine wants you to slay Garhal.",p="你回来了。你有没有杀死那头不听话的猪？",pEN="You're back. Did you kill the insubordinate pig?",c="如果说你刚来的时候我对你的能力有任何存疑，那么现在都烟消云散了——只要再努力一点，你就能够成为我的永久成员。",cEN="If I had any reservations regarding your commitment when you first arrived, I no longer have any. With just a little more effort you could be a permanent member of my operation."}
Q[12908]={d="你真是心狠手辣啊，不错，我相信你会表现得非常好。\n\n我还有一个任务要交给你。有一个女性维库人囚犯越来越让我不能容忍了。\n\n她竟敢宣称要有参加海德比武会的权利，那可是我们最神圣的格斗比赛！\n\n这是打开她枷锁的钥匙。下手快一点，让她少吃点苦。尽管她不是我们的人，但她毕竟是个女性。",dEN="You are without mercy. You will do well around these parts.\n\nI have another task to ask of you. There is a female vrykul prisoner that's become more of a liability than I had anticipated.\n\nShe had the gall to claim the right to take part in the Hyldsmeet, our sacred competition of strength and fighting prowess.\n\nHere's the key to her shackles. Make it as painless as possible. She's a female after all, even if not one of us.",o="把米尔德蕾的钥匙交给荒弃矿洞的女巫洛莉拉。",oEN="Take Mildred's Key to Lok'lira the Crone in the Forlorn Mine.",p="时间也差不多了。",pEN="It's about time.",c="我就知道你会回来！快把这些镣铐弄掉，我就会帮你找到那个地精。",cEN="I knew you'd be back! Get me out of these shackles and I'll help you find the goblin."}
Q[12909]={d="我们必须依赖嗅觉敏锐而且跟踪能力超强的动物才有可能找到布莱恩。虽然地精飞艇上没有猎犬，但是也并非只有猎犬才能承担起这样的任务。\n\n飞艇坠毁后，我派凯尔莉丝去东边的山里打猎了。她那只名叫霜齿的小豹子是很擅长雪地狩猎的，你不如和她谈谈，让她把宠物借给你一用。就算没有霜齿，她也能获取猎物。但是对我们来说，想要寻找布莱恩·铜须，这是唯一的办法。",dEN="In order to track down Brann, we're going to need a creature with a keen sense of smell and a good tracking ability. There weren't any hounds on the zeppelin, but I think I have a substitute.\n\nAfter the crash, I sent Khaliisi down the east face of the mountain to start hunting for food. Her cat, Frostbite, excels at tracking prey in the snow. Tell her that she'll have to part with her companion for a while, at least. She can hunt on her own, but we have no other way of catching up to Brann Bronzebeard.",o="转至格罗玛什坠毁点以东的山麓，与凯尔莉丝谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Khaliisi at the foot of the mountain east of the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",c="所以说伯克塔给霜齿派了份任务？好吧，这最好是特别重要的任务——他应该知道宠物跟猎人是不能分开的！",cEN="So Boktar has volunteered Frostbite for an errand, eh? Well, this had better be important. He knows better than to try to separate a hunter from her pet!"}
Q[12910]={d="Esta vez Boktar se saldrá con la suya, pero espero que me compense. No me mires así. Boktar estará al mando, pero nadie le dice a un cazador lo que tiene que hacer.\n\n'Aparta a esa bestia', me dice. 'Dile que deje de gruñir.'\n\nDe repente cambia de opinión cuando le apetece. La próxima vez que se queje, Mordisquielo le dará un mordisquito. No te preocupes, buscará tu presa de un modo admirable. Cuando localice a su objetivo, tendrás que enfrentarte $gsolo:sola; con los enanos férreos, con Brann, o con lo que encuentres.",dEN="Boktar can have his way this time, but I'll expect him to make it up to me. Don't look at me like that. Boktar may be in command, but no one tells a hunter what to do.\n\n'Put that beast away,' he says. 'Make it stop growling.'\n\nAll of a sudden he changes his mind when it suits him. Next time he complains, Frostbite'll just nip him a bit. Don't worry, she'll do an admirable job tracking your prey. After she locates her target, you're on your own to deal with iron dwarves, or Brann, or whatever you find.",o="骑上霜齿，让它带你寻找布莱恩的便笺上的气味的源头。然后找到布莱恩的通讯器，使用它与布莱恩·铜须取得联系。",oEN="Mount Frostbite and ride her to the source of the scent from Brann's note. Then, recover Brann's Communicator and use it to make contact with Brann Bronzebeard.",p="你……你是谁？",pEN="Who... who're you?",c="<当你引导了通讯器之后一个矮人的影像浮现出来。他一定就是布莱恩·铜须。>\n\n<从他脸上的表情看来，布莱恩看到你似乎很震惊，然后他开始狂乱的比划手势。>",cEN="<An image of a dwarf appears as you activate the communicator. It can only be Brann Bronzebeard.>\n\n<From the look on his face, Brann seems shocked to see you and begins gesturing furiously.>"}
Q[12912]={d="No eres como los demás, $gpequeño:pequeña;. No apestas a la muerte antigua. Quizás se pueda confiar en ti.\n\nSoy Gymer, rey de los gigantes de tormenta. Me trajo aquí mi hermano, Thiassi, ahora es un sirviente no-muerto del Rey Exánime. Cuando me di cuenta de que su petición de ayuda era una trampa, ya era demasiado tarde. Ahora soy prisionero de la Plaga y me temo que muy pronto sufriré el mismo destino que muchos de los demás gigantes de tormenta.\n\nBusca un modo de liberarme de esta celda y te ayudaré en todo lo que pueda.",dEN="You are not like the others, little one. You do not reek of the ancient death. Perhaps you can be trusted.\n\nI am Gymer, king of the storm giants. I was lured here by my brother, Thiassi, now an undead servant of the Lich King. By the time I realized that his cry for help was a trap, it was too late. I am now a prisoner of the Scourge and I fear that soon I will suffer the same fate as many of the other storm giants.\n\nFind a way to release me from this cage and I will aid you to the best of my ability.",o="风暴巨人之王盖米尔要求你想办法把他从笼子里面救出来。与北伐军前线营地的工程师里德谈谈该怎么办。",oEN="Gymer, King of Storm Giants, has asked you to find a way to release him from his cage. Speak with Engineer Reed at the Crusader Forward Camp.",c="¿Un... un gigante de tormenta? No estoy seguro de esto, <name>. Parece arriesgado. Por otro lado, no creo que tengamos muchas otras opciones.\n\nSi hago esto, tienes que prometerme que harás que tu amigo gigante nos ayude a lidiar con Navarius y sus secuaces.",cEN="A... A storm giant? I don't know about this, <name>. That sounds risky. On the other hand, I don't think we have too many other options.\n\nIf I do this you have to promise me that you will get your giant friend to help us deal with Navarius and his cronies."}
Q[12913]={d="<布莱恩手上比划着，用他的母语说道。>\n\nRuk MogOth red a mogoth ta eft Thros-garE Haldir。\n\nKha gor ruk khaz ta ke ruk hrim eft thros-am-kha ruk kost-um havar go kost。\n\nA modoss hine ruk bergum eft thros-am-kha ga eft Haldir ke loch Thon we lo gefrunon ta mitta。\n\nGar Ruk dagUm loch angor-magi ta har ruk！\n\n<过了一会儿，你意识到这种谈话根本不会有任何结果。或许格罗玛什坠毁点的萨满祭司莫塔哈·风魂知道该怎么办。>",dEN="<Brann begins gesticulating wildly and rambling in his native language.>\n\nRuk MogOth red a mogoth ta eft Thros-garE Haldir.\n\nKha gor ruk khaz ta ke ruk hrim eft thros-am-kha ruk kost-um havar go kost.\n\nA modoss hine ruk bergum eft thros-am-kha ga eft Haldir ke loch Thon we lo gefrunon ta mitta.\n\nGar Ruk dagUm loch angor-magi ta har ruk!\n\n<After a few moments, you realize the conversation is going nowhere. Perhaps the shaman, Moteha Windborn, at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site will know what to do.>",o="与格罗玛什坠毁点的莫塔哈·风魂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Moteha Windborn at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",c="你没找到布莱恩，伯克塔一定会不高兴的。不过起码你不是空手而回。现在，让我们来看看该如何处理这个唠唠叨叨的矮人。",cEN="Bartok will not be happy that you didn't find Brann, but at least you didn't come back empty-handed. Now, let's see what we can do about this babbling dwarf."}
Q[12914]={d="你说他被锁在了一只100尺高的笼子里？\n\n如果我的计算无误的话，我们至少应该能让笼子的转轴变得不那么坚固，这样巨人就可以逃出来了。\n\n如果想要实施这个计划，我就需要一些增塑剂和稳定剂。\n\n女妖精华应该是很好的增塑剂，你可以到东北边的死亡旷野去，从那里的女妖身上得到它们。西南方黑锋哨站附近的大地狂怒者身上有我要的稳定剂。\n\n开始行动吧！",dEN="Now you say that he's locked up in a 100 foot tall cage, eh?\n\nIf my calculations are correct, we should be able to at least weaken the hinges on the cage, giving the giant enough leeway to break out.\n\nIf this is going to work I'm going to need some plasticizers and stabilizers.\n\nBanshee essence should do nicely for the plasticizer. You can get that from the banshees in the Dead Fields, northeast of us. The stabilizer can be found on the earthragers to the southwest, near Ebon Watch.\n\nGet a move on!",o="北伐军前线营地的工程师里德希望你交给他6份女妖精华和6份硅藻土。",oEN="Engineer Reed at Crusader Forward Camp in Zul'Drak wants you to bring him 6 Banshee Essence and 6 Diatomaceous Earth.",p="没有塑化剂与稳定剂的话我永远不能做出能够破坏囚牢的炸药。",pEN="Without the plasticizers and stabilizers I'll never be able to make the explosives necessary to break your friend out of jail.",c="幸亏我们并不缺炸药。有了你带来的材料要组装出超超超大爆盐炸药就很简单。",cEN="Thankfully we weren't in short supply of explosives. Putting together the jumbo seaforium charge should be no problem with the materials you brought me."}
Q[12915]={d="如果要从我兄弟手中夺到造物者圣台的控制权，我就必须先想办法修复与旧日盟友之间的关系。\n\n或许我与冰霜巨人可以通过对抗共同的敌人，开始着手恢复彼此的友谊。\n\n弗约恩正在率领铁巨人围攻丹尼芬雷。你必须在东边的弗约恩之砧击败他，并痛击他的部队，帮助霍迪尔之子赢得胜利。\n\n带上这枚符咒吧，$n。你可以用它召唤我的土灵助阵。",dEN="If I hope to wrest control of the Temple of the Makers from my brother, I must make amends with my old allies.\n\nPerhaps by eliminating a common enemy, we may at least take a step towards renewing my friendship with the frost giants.\n\nFjorn has besieged Dun Niffelem with giants of iron. You must defeat him at Fjorn's Anvil, far to the east of here, and weaken his forces sufficiently for the Sons of Hodir to emerge victorious.\n\nTake this charm, <name>. Use it to summon my earthen to your aid.",o="风暴神殿的托里姆要你转至丹尼芬雷东边的弗约恩之砧，杀死弗约恩和5名雷铸铁巨人。\n\n你可以使用托里姆的大地符咒召唤他的土灵助战。必须借助弗约恩之砧附近的花岗岩石块才能使用这枚符咒。",oEN="Thorim at the Temple of Storms wants you to Kill Fjorn and 5 Stormforged Iron Giants at Fjorn's Anvil, east of Dun Niffelem.\n\nUsing Thorim's Charm of Earth will summon his Earthen to fight by your side. The charm requires a Granite Boulder from nearby Fjorn's Anvil.",p="¿Sigue vivo Fjorn, <class>?",pEN="Does Fjorn still live, <class>?",c="所以，你已经完成了任务。\n\n希望这样足够了。",cEN="So, it is done then.\n\nLet us hope it is enough."}
Q[12916]={d="我要给你的东西被称为爆盐炸弹，它是使用特殊材料制成的强力炸药。由于它的可塑性，你可以把它塞进牢笼的转轴结合处，以寻求最大的爆炸威力。\n\n去你朋友那里，用这枚巨型爆盐炸弹把他救出来吧。\n\n希望他是个守信的家伙。他是我们唯一的希望了。",dEN="What I'm about to give you is called seaforium. It is a highly volatile explosive with some unique properties. Due to its malleable nature, you will be able to fill in the hinges and cracks of the cage for maximum damage.\n\nReturn to your friend and use the jumbo seaforium charge to set him free.\n\nLet's hope he honors the bargain. He's our only hope.",o="在祖达克的塞穆之末使用巨型爆盐炸弹，打开囚禁着盖米尔的天灾围栏，然后与盖米尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Gymer at Thrym's End in Zul'Drak once you have used the Jumbo Seaforium Charge to open the Scourge Enclosure that is holding him prisoner.",p="我是个信守诺言的巨人，小家伙。",pEN="I am a giant of my word, little one.",c="自由！\n\n不要害怕，小家伙。盖米尔是值得敬重的巨人。就像你与你的人民一样，我也希望看到天灾军团被逐出这块土地，也希望看到巫妖王被消灭。我会尽我所能地帮助你，就像我答应过你的一样。",cEN="FREEDOM!\n\nDo not be afraid, little one. Gymer is an honorable giant. Like you and your people, I too wish to see the Scourge driven away from this land and the Lich King destroyed. I will help you, as promised, to the best of my ability."}
Q[12917]={d="如果不是运气够好的话，我们恐怕不能这么轻易地找到布莱恩。如果我们能知道布莱恩在说些什么，你就能劝他说出自己的位置了。\n\n附近群山中的风力很强，这对我们而言是件好事。一个知识渊博的萨满祭司可以通过风的声音理解全世界所有的语言。\n\n我要你到西北方的雪流平原去，寻找由风构成的生物——风暴骑士。去捕捉它们的声音，把那声音带回来给我。",dEN="I suppose we shouldn't have expected to find Brann so easily, not with our luck. If we can make sense of what Brann is saying, you can persuade him to give up his location.\n\nThe power of the wind is strong in these mountains, and it may prove a great boon to us. A knowledgeable shaman can hear the sound of all the world's tongues on the wind.\n\nTo the northwest, on the Snowdrift Plains, you will find beings made of wind, the stormriders. Capture their voices and bring them to me.",o="将5份寒风之声交给格罗玛什坠毁点的莫塔哈·风魂。",oEN="Bring 5 Voices of the Wind to Moteha Windborn at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",p="你把寒风之声带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought the wind's voices?",c="现在你应该能与矮人沟通了，去问问伯克塔对你有什么要求。我们不能再浪费时间了。",cEN="You should be able to communicate with the dwarf now. Ask Boktar what he requires of you. There is little time to lose."}
Q[12918]={d="看来刺骨的寒风已经吹到这里来了？现在不仅仅是缺少欣赏我手艺的顾客，而且我也没有库存的宝石可以出售了！如果你能弄些未切割的宝石来补充我的库存，我可以教你切割完美宝石的技术。切割完美宝石能让你在切割诺森德地区出产的优秀质量宝石时，有机会切割出一颗具有更高属性的完美宝石。",dEN="It has the cold of the Icewyrm's breath up here does it not? Not only do I lack customers for my crafting skills, but I also lack stock of gems to sell! If you can bring me several uncut gems to replenish my stocks, I can teach you the skill of gem perfection. This will allow you to sometimes cut a perfect gem with increased bonuses when cutting a uncommon quality gem from Northrend.",o="将茶晶石、黑玉和暗影水晶各两颗交给瓦加德的恩霍罗。",oEN="Return two Huge Citrines, two Dark Jade and two Shadow Crystals to Ounhulo in Valgarde.",p="你真大方。我会教你如何切割完美宝石作为回报的。",pEN="You are most generous. The least I can do is to teach you the skills of gem perfection.",c="这些用来补充我的货架再适合不过了。我不仅要教你如何切割完美宝石，我也会帮你把这些宝石的其中一颗切成完美宝石当作对你的回报。",cEN="These are perfect for replenishing my stock. Not only will I teach you the art of gemcutting perfection, but I cut one of them gems into its perfect form which you may have as a reward."}
Q[12919]={d="Mi pueblo ha sido diezmando por el Rey Exánime. Ahora la Plaga utiliza los cadáveres de los gigantes de tormenta para crear gigantes de carne descerebrados, o peor aún, aberraciones hechas de retales como Thrym.\n\nNo me detendré ante nada hasta que sean expulsados de este mundo. Colaboraremos para destruir la Plaga que amenaza Zul'Drak.\n\nLos mataremos a todos: ¡Navarius, Algar y Thrym!\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista;, avísame y empezaremos nuestro viaje de destrucción.",dEN="My people have been decimated by the Lich King. The Scourge now use the corpses of storm giants to create mindless flesh giants, or worse, stitched together aberrations like Thrym.\n\nI will stop at nothing to see them all driven from this world. We will work together to destroy the Scourge that threaten Zul'Drak.\n\nWe will kill them all: Navarius, Algar and Thrym!\n\nWhen you are ready, let me know and we will begin our destructive journey.",o="与盖米尔交谈以开始行动。\n\n骑着盖米尔去消灭100个天灾士兵，并消灭天选者奥贾尔、塞穆和纳瓦留斯王子。成功之后，向北伐军前线营地的北伐军战士马克拉尔报告。",oEN="Speak with Gymer to begin.\n\nWhile riding Gymer, destroy 100 Scourge and kill Algar the Chosen, Thrym and Prince Navarius. Report to Crusader MacKellar at Crusader Forward Camp should you succeed.",p="怎么样了？我们的敌人全死了吗？",pEN="What is going on? Are our enemies dead?",c="¡Increíble! ¡Esta será una historia para la eternidad, <name>! ¡Un hombre cabalgó sobre la cabeza del rey de los gigantes de tormenta y diezmó a todo un ejército de la Plaga!\n\nY yo estuve allí para verlo todo...",cEN="Unbelievable! This will be a story for the ages, <name>! One man rode upon the head of the king of storm giants and decimated an entire Scourge army!\n\nAnd I was there to see it all happen..."}
Q[12920]={d="你还在等什么？多亏了莫塔哈的帮助，语言障碍已经解决了。去联络布莱恩·铜须吧，找出他的藏身之所，问问他究竟在跟踪什么。\n\n或许我们还能在这场灾难中挽救一点什么。",dEN="What are you waiting for? The language barrier has been broken, thanks to Moteha. Contact Brann Bronzebeard and find out anything you can about where he's hiding and what he's chasing after.\n\nMaybe we can still salvage something from this disaster.",o="使用布莱恩的通讯器与布莱恩·铜须联络并与他交谈，然后与格罗玛什坠毁的伯克塔·血怒谈一谈。\n\n如果你遗失了布莱恩的通讯器，可以找格罗玛什坠毁点的莫塔哈·风魂再要一个。",oEN="Use Brann's Communicator to contact Brann Bronzebeard and speak with him, then speak to Boktar Bloodfury at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.\n\nIf you lose Brann's Communicator, speak with Moteha Windborn at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What did you find out?",c="<伯克塔聆听你叙述与布莱恩的对话。>\n\n矮人说的是真的，沃塔肯的计划不是部落的手法。如果布莱恩·铜须知道阻止铁矮人和他们幕后黑手的方法，那么帮助他对我们来说也很有利。",cEN="<Boktar listens as you describe your conversation with Brann.>\n\nThere's truth to the dwarf's words. Vor'takh's plan is not the way of the Horde. If Brann Bronzebeard knows of a way to stop these iron dwarves and their patron, it serves us to help him."}
Q[12921]={d="好极了。矿井的东面尽头处有一个通向布伦希尔达村的出口。沿着这条路走，我们在村子里汇合。\n\n不能让别人看见我们在一起，这样就不会有人怀疑你在帮我了。我会用魔法给自己加上伪装。别担心，$r——我们很快就能找到你的朋友了。",dEN="Excellent. There's an exit in the eastern end of the mine that leads to Brunnhildar Village. Follow it and I'll meet you there.\n\nWe must not be seen together so no one suspects you of aiding me. I'll use my magic to disguise my appearance. Do not worry, <race> -- we'll find your friend in no time.",o="到布伦希尔达村与女巫洛莉拉汇合。",oEN="Reconvene with Lok'lira the Crone in Brunnhildar Village.",c="你来了——很好。我想我知道你的地精在哪里了。",cEN="You're here -- good. I think I know where your goblin is."}
Q[12922]={d="Bajo su poroso exterior, este montón de metal brilla con una misteriosa cualidad.\n\nNotas que lo más seguro sería quemar la escoria en el Yunque de Fjorn.\n\nMientras piensas en qué lugar de este erial helado podrías encontrar algo lo bastante caliente para hacerlo, un aparecido de fuego se cruza en tu camino...|n",dEN="Beneath its porous exterior, this hunk of metal gleams with a mysterious quality.\n\nYou feel it would only be prudent to burn off the slag at Fjorn's Anvil.\n\nAs you ponder where in this frozen waste you might find something hot enough for the job, a fire revenant crosses your path...",o="从霜原湖的火热的亡魂身上收集10份狂怒火花，然后转至弗约恩之砧，使用那里的铁砧。",oEN="You must collect 10 Furious Sparks from the Seething Revenants at Frostfield Lake and then use the anvil at Fjorn's Anvil.",p="铁砧的表面十分灼热，与周遭寒冷的空气形成强烈对比。",pEN="The surface of the anvil is scalding, in sharp contrast with the wintry air.",c="你把金属放在铁砧上，当你一把火花加进去，立刻猛烈的与矿石作用。\n\n当它们终于烧完了以后，你带着一大块发着光芒的金属离开。",cEN="You place the metal on the anvil and immediately upon adding the sparks they work the ore furiously.\n\nWhen at last they burn out, you are left with a large piece of metal that gleams with a light of its own."}
Q[12924]={d="<托里姆微笑起来，这是你第一次见到他笑。>\n\n终于，命运向我伸出了手，$r。\n\n你发现的这块金属，原本是我的盔甲的一部分。很久以前，我在极度的悲伤中脱下了它，并把它丢给了那些元素生物。\n\n只有霍迪尔的子孙才能修复它，因为它本来就是他们锻造出来的。\n\n或许你的行动已经减轻了他们对我的仇恨。去找到他们的国王，约库姆。如果他还活着，就请他帮忙吧。",dEN="<Thorim, for the first time since your meeting him, smiles.>\n\nThis is all beginning to have the smell of fate's hand, <race>.\n\nYour discovery is what remains of my armor, long ago cast off in a fit of grief and left to the elements. Only the sons of Hodir are capable of its reforging, for they are its original creators.\n\nPerhaps you've done enough to soften their hatred of me. Seek out their king, Jokkum, if he still breathes.\n\nFind your way into his good graces and plead for his assistance.",o="转至丹尼芬雷，请求约库姆国王帮忙重铸托里姆的护甲。完成约库姆交付的任务之后，与丹尼芬雷的亚米尔德谈一谈。",oEN="You are to go to Dun Niffelem and ask King Jokkum to allow Thorim's armor to be reforged. After completing Jokkum's task, you are to speak with Njormeld in Dun Niffelem.",c="看来我的技术似乎精进不少。不然就是这个铁砧的传说是真的。\n\n这套盔甲比以前更精良，而且所用的材料更少。\n\n用这些剩下的材料，我可以替你铸造一件装备作为你的酬劳。",cEN="It would seem that I have refined my technique considerably. That, or the legends surrounding this anvil are true.\n\nThis suit of armor is superior to the last, and took less material to create.\n\nWith the excess, I was able to fashion you a little something as payment for your assistance."}
Q[12925]={d="巫妖王已经派密使来找过我们三次了，每次都被我们当场拒绝。\n\n但是瓦基里安的那些姐妹们却不那么忠于传统，她们接受了巫妖王的诱惑。现在，她们不再从野外捕捉幼龙，转而用瘟疫和天灾军团的邪恶力量培育龙卵。\n\n从瓦基里安的海德尼尔人身上夺取冰霜油膏，把那些已经感染了瘟疫的龙卵冻僵。据说那些龙卵都放在一个发臭的瘟疫池塘里。",dEN="The Lich King sent emissaries to us on three different occasions. All three were promptly dismembered.\n\nOur sisters in Valkyrion were not as dedicated to our traditions and accepted the Scourge's advances. Now instead of capturing their drakes from the wild, they raise them from the blight and filth that the Scourge wallow in.\n\nTake the frost oil that the Valkyrion Hyldnir carry on them and use it to freeze any blighted eggs you find. Rumors speak of a fetid pool of blight where the eggs are kept.",o="布伦希尔达村的塞拉·克文沙尔要你转至瓦基里安，从瓦基里安候选者身上夺取冰霜油膏，并用冰霜油膏摧毁30枚瘟疫始祖龙卵。",oEN="Thyra Kvinnshal in Brunnhildar Village wants you to go to Valkyrion and obtain Vials of Frost Oil from the Valkyrion Aspirants. Use the Vials of Frost Oil to destroy 30 Plagued Proto-Drake Eggs.",p="你摧毁那些染疫的蛋了没？",pEN="Did you destroy the blighted eggs?",c="我们感谢你，姐妹。我们不能让英勇的传统遭受腐化。",cEN="You have our thanks, sister. We cannot allow our valiant traditions to be corrupted."}
Q[12926]={d="我们发现铁矮人和他们控制的构造体正在与某种石头生物及其巨人盟友作战。布莱恩将这种石头生物称为土灵。我希望你能联络一下布莱恩，尽可能地帮助他。记住，他的调查结果或许能帮助我们击败铁矮人和他们的主子。",dEN="We've seen the iron dwarves and their constructs making war on the creatures of stone that Brann calls the earthen, along with their giant allies. Contact him and aid him in any way you can, and remember that anything we can learn from his search may aid us in fighting against the iron dwarves and their master.",o="使用布莱恩的通讯器联络布莱恩·铜须，并了解下一步的行动计划。",oEN="Use Brann's Communicator to contact Brann Bronzebeard and find out what to do next.",p="你完成圆盘了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the disk?",c="动作真快！现在我们有了圆盘，该找出如何用它来解开数据库钥匙的前半部了。",cEN="That was quick! Now that we have the disk, we have to find out how to use it to unlock the first half of the archive key."}
Q[12927]={d="你拼出来的那个圆盘……是空的！建造这个图书馆的守护者米米尔肯定把信息藏到了别的什么地方。去调查一下创世者的图书馆，看看里面有没有数据库之类的东西。\n\n或许这张圆盘就是干这个用的，到数据库附近去使用它看看吧。它可能就是用来读入和存储数据库信息的。试过以后再联络我，把你的发现告诉我。同时，我要开始着手寻找钥匙的另一半了。",dEN="That disk you assembled... it's blank! Keeper Mimir, the tinker who built this library, must've hidden the information elsewhere. Look around the Inventor's Library; do you see any databanks there?\n\nThat might be the disk's purpose. Try using it near some of those databanks. Perhaps it's set to retrieve and store information from them. After you've tried your hand at that, contact me again and let me know what you've found. Meanwhile, I'll be trying to track down the other half of the archive key.",o="使用创世者的圆盘，从数据库中获得7条秘密数据。",oEN="Use the Inventor's Disk to retrieve 7 pieces of Hidden Data from the Databanks.",p="你有没有试着使用这个圆盘？你发现了什么？",pEN="Did you try using the disk? What did you find?",c="<Brann mira el disco mientras lo sostienes aloft.>\n\nNo puedo saber si hay algo almacenado ahí o no, muchacho. Tendrás que decirme qué ha pasado.\n\n<Describes el proceso de recuperación de datos.>\n\n¿Así que funcionó? Al menos podemos contar con que el Guardián Mimir sea sistemático.",cEN="<Brann looks at the disk as you hold it up.>\n\nI can't tell if there's anything stored there or not, lad. You'll have to tell me what happened.\n\n<You describe the data retrieval process.>\n\nSo it worked? At least we can count on Keeper Mimir to be systematic."}
Q[12928]={d="正在为创世者的圆盘充能。\n\n已完成充能。\n\n准备引导紧急协议：伽玛。\n\n紧急协议已加载。请使用已充能的圆盘激活诺甘农之壳的守护者，文件员麦卡顿。在确认了你的身份之后，文件员会交出诺甘农之壳。\n\n祝你愉快一千年。",dEN="Charging inventor's disk.\n\nDisk charging completed.\n\nPreparing emergency protocol gamma.\n\nEmergency protocol loaded. Please use the charged disk to activate the guardian of Norgannon's shell, Archivist Mechaton. The archivist will release the shell once your identity has been verified.\n\nPlease have a pleasant millennium.",o="从文件员麦卡顿那里拿到诺甘农之壳。",oEN="Recover Norgannon's Shell from Archivist Mechaton.",p="你发现诺甘农之壳了吗？",pEN="Did you find Noragannon's shell?",c="¡Eso es! Esa es la primera mitad de la piedra angular de Norgannon. Bien hecho, <name>. He tenido al arqueólogo Andorin buscando pistas sobre el paradero de la concha durante mucho tiempo. No me va a creer cuando le diga que fue un <race> intrépido quien la encontró.",cEN="That's it! That's the first half of Norgannon's keystone. Well done, <name>. I've had Archaeologist Andorin on the lookout for clues to the shell's whereabouts for a long time. He's never going to believe me when I tell him it was an intrepid <race> who found it instead."}
Q[12929]={d="土灵建造了奥杜尔，并在那里快乐地生活着。直到有一天，洛肯占领整座城市，把他们赶出了家园。从那时起，他的铁矮人随从们就一直在无情地向流亡的土灵发动攻击。\n\n他们现在躲藏在创世者的图书馆西面的山坡上，以古老的泰坦建筑为家，他们把那里称为布德克拉格庇护所。布德克拉格和他的同胞英勇地抵挡着妄图侵入庇护所的铁矮人，不过他们这样坚持不了多久的。去找到他们，帮助他们，$n。",dEN="The earthen who once inhabited, built, and maintained Ulduar were ousted from their home when Loken took over the city. Since then, his iron dwarf followers have relentlessly attacked the exiles.\n\nThey have taken refuge in an old titan building, which they now call Bouldercrag's Refuge, on the face of a mountain west of the Inventor's Library. Bouldercrag and his brethren fight to keep the irons from overrunning their haven, but they cannot hold their ground long. Find and help them, <name>.",o="与布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",c="所以说你认识布莱恩·铜须咯？他是我们在血肉之躯的生物中最亲近的盟友。我们像兄弟一样的对抗洛肯与他的手下，为了奥杜尔一同奋战。",cEN="So you know Brann Bronzebeard, then? He is our closest ally among those of the flesh. We are as brothers in the struggle against Loken and his followers, in the struggle for Ulduar."}
Q[12930]={d="一直以来，这些锤子只被用来敲击石头，而不是敲击铁矮人。被驱逐出奥杜尔之后，我们亲眼目睹了柔弱的伙伴一个个地死去，而我们最强壮的工匠作为战士重生。\n\n当铁矮人逼得我们节节败退时，即使最强壮的战士也无力回天。\n\n我们对伤者毫无办法，除非能有一些魔化土壤的储备。我们以前一直都是在西北方的峭壁表面上采集它们，但持续不断的战争让我们根本没有机会补充储备。你能帮助我们吗？",dEN="It seems so long ago that these hammers pounded and hewed stone instead of iron. Our expulsion from Ulduar saw the weakest of us dead and the strongest of our craftsmen reborn as warriors.\n\nAs the irons beat us back, even the strongest find themselves failing.\n\nWe can do little for the wounded, save when we have a stock of enchanted earth. We used to mine it from the deposits on the sheer cliff face to the northwest, but the constant battle has prevented us from replenishing our stock. Would you help?",o="使用土灵采矿锄收集7块魔化土壤。将这些土壤和5张霜纹布交给布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格。",oEN="Use the Earthen Mining Pick to mine 7 clumps of Enchanted Earth. Bring the earth and 5 Frostweave Cloth to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你有找到土壤吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any of the earth?",c="Esto nos permitirá reparar a más de los caídos. Gracias, <name>, en nombre de todos los que defienden el refugio.",cEN="This will allow us to patch up more of the fallen. Thank you, <name>, on behalf of all who defend the refuge."}
Q[12931]={d="庇护所的卫兵已经尽了最大的努力来抵挡铁矮人的攻击，但是我们仍然在节节败退。我的部下非常勇敢，但他们并非不知疲倦。如果没有增援的话，我们全面溃败恐怕只是个时间问题而已。\n\n你愿意帮我们保卫庇护所吗？这样可以会大大提升卫兵的士气，并给他们——还有我——带来发动反击的希望。\n\n消灭庇护所外面的铁矮人，以及他们的创造物。",dEN="The refuge's defenders have done their best to blunt the iron dwarves' attacks, but we keep losing ground inch by inch. My men are hardy, but not tireless. Without reinforcements, it's only a matter of time until we will be overrun.\n\nWould you lend your skills to the refuge's defense? It would greatly improve the morale of the defenders and give them -- and me -- hope of mounting a counterattack.\n\nKill any of the stormforged or their creations you encounter outside the refuge.",o="塑石者布德克拉格希望你杀死总计10名雷铸袭击者或雷铸掠夺者，然后返回布德克拉格庇护所向他复命。",oEN="Bouldercrag the Rockshaper wants you to slay 10 Stormforged Attackers and return to him at Bouldercrag's Refuge. You may kill either Stormforged Raiders or Stormforged Reavers.",p="战况如何？",pEN="How goes the battle?",c="你带来了令防御者欢欣鼓舞的消息。看到敌人被手刃使他们再度振作起来，也激励了他们的勇气。",cEN="You've given the defenders something to cheer about. Seeing the enemy fall by your hand has reinvigorated them and bolstered their courage."}
Q[12932]={d="Te diré una cosa, colega, este lugar es muy distinto a las colinas de Nagrand. Estos trols son más sucios que ogros, pero oye, ¡yo voy a donde está el oro! Así que $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a Zul'Drak, colega.\n\nEres $gnuevo:nueva; en esto, así que deja que te ponga al día. Soy el promotor de las peleas y este vivaracho trol a mi lado es Wodin, mi guardaespaldas. Tú eres el entretenimiento. Cuando quieras luchar, dímelo y te prepararé una pelea.\n\n¡Si estás $glisto:lista; y tienes contigo a un grupo de amigos, podemos empezar! ¿Qué me dices?|n",dEN="I'll tell you what, buddy, this place is a far cry from the rolling plains of Nagrand. These trolls are dirtier than ogres; but hey, I go where the gold's at! So welcome to Zul'Drak, pal.\n\nYou're new to this racket, so let me set you straight. I'm the fight promoter and this feisty troll next to me is Wodin, my bodyguard. You're the entertainment. When you wanna fight, let me know and I'll set up the match.\n\nIf you're ready and got a group of friends with you, we can start! What do you say?",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败伊戈达斯！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Yggdras! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="嘿！我认识你。人们讨论你在嘲颅竞技场的胜利讨论了好几个月！因为没有出场打卫冕赛而输掉你的勇士头衔真是太可惜了！来的快，去的也快，嗯？至少你还活着。",cEN="Not bad, friend. You might make some gold out here - if you manage to stay alive."}
Q[12933]={d="¡El siguiente combate es complicado, $gamigo:amiga;! Al parecer un magnatauro del Cementerio de Dragones quiere algo de acción. ¿Has luchado con alguno de ellos antes? ¡Solo puedo decirte que apuntes alto!\n\nEmpezaremos la fiesta cuando tú me digas.",dEN="This next match is a doozy, buddy! Apparently some magnataur from the Dragonblight wants a piece of the action. You ever fought one of those before? All I can tell you is to aim high!\n\nWe'll get this party started when you give me the word.",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败恶臭之须！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Stinkbeard! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="哇！当我刚看见恶臭之须的时候，我还以为你死定了！打得好！",cEN="Wow! When I first saw Stinkbeard, I thought you were done for! Nice work!"}
Q[12934]={d="$gAmigo:Amiga;, no te voy a mentir. Puede que aquí te superen un poco. ¡El siguiente es un ser de los planos elementales! ¡Ni siquiera sé qué va a aparecer en la arena!\n\n¡Si crees que estás $gpreparado:preparada; entra en la arena y dale caña!",dEN="I'm not gonna lie to you, pal. You might be overmatched here. This next one is a being from the elemental planes! I don't even know what's gonna show up in that arena!\n\nIf you think you're up to it, get in there and give 'em hell!",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败一位元素领主！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat one of the elemental lords! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="难以置信！当它出现的时候我还以为整个场地都要炸了！你可真是主宰了这个场子啊！",cEN="Unbelievable! I thought this whole place was going to explode when it first appeared! You really dominated that round!"}
Q[12935]={d="El siguiente lucha desde un lugar oscuro, $gchico:chica;. La clase de oscuridad que solo puede tener lugar cuando has estado al otro lado. Tiene hambre y hará lo que sea para ganar. ¡Ten cuidado! ¡He oído que pelea con yetis para entrenarse!\n\nEmpezaremos cuando estés $glisto:lista;.",dEN="This next one's fightin' from a dark place, kid. The kind of dark that can only happen when you've been on the flip-side. He's hungry and willing to do whatever it takes to win. Watch yourself! I've heard he wrestles yetis for exercise!\n\nWe'll start when you're ready.",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败奥里努克·碎牙！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Orinoko Tuskbreaker! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="<name>, estuve preocupado por un tiempo. Cuando rompió los sellos y los pingüinos... Bueno, para ser sincero, no sabía qué pensar. Parecía malditamente ridículo.",cEN="I was worried for a while there, <name>. When he busted out the seals and penguins... Well, I didn't know what to think to be honest. It looked pretty damn ridiculous."}
Q[12936]={d="$gTío:Tía;, no te lo vas a creer. ¡Tu siguiente pelea es contra Korrak el Sanguinario! ¡Parece que los trols Drakkari están sacando a los pesos pesados! Y déjame decirte una cosa, $gamigo:amiga;, ha estado bebiendo del zumo del dios animal. Es bueno y está preparado para machacarte contra el suelo.\n\n¿Estás $glisto:lista;?",dEN="You're not gonna believe this, pal. Your next fight is against Korrak the Bloodrager! Looks like the Drakkari trolls are pulling a power play! And let me tell you, buddy, he's been sippin' the animal god juice. He's good and ready to pound you into the ground.\n\nAre you ready?",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败血怒者科尔拉克！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Korrak the Bloodrager! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="¡Maldición!, recuerdo a Korrak de mis tiempos de juventud, cuando solía trabajar para el Clan Lobo de Escarcha. ¡Nunca se callaba! Creo que acabas de hacerle un gran servicio al mundo, <name>.",cEN="Damn, I remember Korrak from way back in my younger days when I used to work for the Frostwolf Clan. He would never shut up! I think you just did the world a great service, <name>."}
Q[12937]={d="庇护所的卫兵非常勇敢，但他们也抵挡不住铁矮人无休止的冲击。\n\n有了你找来的土壤，我可以制造绷带来治疗受伤的卫兵。被我们救治的卫兵越多，我们所能坚持的时间就越久。\n\n拿上这些药膏，用它们去治疗庇护所外面受伤的卫兵，尽可能多救几个人回来，$n。每一个卫兵的伤亡都是我们的重大损失。",dEN="The refuge's defenders fight bravely, but they cannot keep up with the iron onslaught.\n\nWith the earth you collected, I can make bandages to help heal the wounds of some of the fallen. The more defenders we can patch up, the longer we'll last out there.\n\nTake these poultices and use them to heal the wounds of the fallen defenders outside the refuge. Get as many back into the battle as possible, <name>. Every casualty is one too many.",o="使用土质药膏治疗8名倒下的土灵防御者，然后返回布德克拉格庇护所，向塑石者布德克拉格复命。",oEN="Use the Telluric Poultice to heal 8 Fallen Earthen Defenders, then return to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你救治了倒下的防卫者吗？",pEN="Have you healed the fallen defenders?",c="你所治愈的战士将能帮我们把防线支撑更久一点。如果我们真的要完全摆脱铁矮人的威胁，我们就得想个方法越过战线打击他们。",cEN="The warriors that you've healed will aid us in holding the line even longer. If we are to truly be free of the iron threat, we must find a way to strike at them behind the lines."}
Q[12938]={d="Te necesitamos $gconcentrado:concentrada;, $n. Apenas mantenemos La Cámara de las Sombras. Como puedes ver, hemos enfurecido mucho al Rey Exánime.\n\n<El barón se ríe.>\n\nNecesito que hables con el duque Lankral. Él está ahora al mando. Lo encontrarás dentro del edificio de la cámara.\n\nSi yo fuera tú, no le haría esperar.",dEN="We need you focused, <name>. We're barely holding The Shadow Vault as it is. As you can see, we've greatly angered the Lich King.\n\n<The baron chuckles.>\n\nI need you to speak with Duke Lankral. He's in charge here now. You'll find him inside the vault building proper.\n\nWere I you, I would not keep him waiting.",o="与暗影拱顶的兰克拉尔公爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Duke Lankral at The Shadow Vault.",c="Es un placer conocerte por fin, <name>. Te debemos mucho, pero aún no hemos terminado contigo.\n\nHay una ciudad vrykul justo al otro lado de las montañas, al oeste, un lugar llamado Jotunheim.\n\nLos vrykul de allí están en un constante estado de desafío para \"ascender\". Los ganadores van a Ymirheim para servir como la casta de guerreros de élite del Rey Exánime, los Ymirjar, y los perdedores son reducidos a Vargul de la Plaga.\n\nVas a ser mi instrumento para asegurar que surjan más Vargul que Ymirjar.",cEN="It's a pleasure to finally meet you, <name>. We owe you a great deal, but we're not done with you yet.\n\nThere is a vrykul city just over the mountains to the west, a place called Jotunheim.\n\nThe vrykul there are in a constant state of challenge to 'ascend'. The winners go to Ymirheim to serve as the Lich King's elite warrior caste, the Ymirjar, and the losers are reduced to Scourged Vargul.\n\nYou are going to be my instrument to see to it that more Vargul than Ymirjar emerge."}
Q[12939]={d="El primer paso lo daremos en un lugar de Jotunheim llamado Cornisa Salvaje. Está pasando las montañas al oeste.\n\nEn la cornisa los guerreros vrykul siempre están entrenando con los hombres de sus señores feudales para mejorar su habilidad en la batalla.\n\nQuiero que lleves esta bandera y desafíes a varios de ellos. Vamos a desmoralizarlos con las \"meras\" habilidades de $gun:una:r; $r, ¿quieres?\n\n<El duque sonríe y sus dientes podridos brillan a la oscura luz de la cámara.>",dEN="The first step we're going to take is at a place in Jotunheim called the Savage Ledge. It's just over the mountains to the west.\n\nOn the ledge the vrykul warriors are always sparring, being instructed in the finer arts of battle by their thane's men.\n\nI want you to take this flag and issue a challenge to a number of them. Let's demoralize them with the 'mere' skills of a <race>, shall we?\n\n<The duke grins, his rotting teeth flashing in the dim light of the vault.>",o="暗影拱顶的兰克拉尔公爵要你使用挑战之旗向6名尤尔丁格斗者发起挑战，并击败他们。",oEN="Duke Lankral at The Shadow Vault has asked you to use the Challenge Flag to challenge and defeat 6 Mjordin Combatants.",p="也许你可以回去再多挑战几个人？",pEN="Perhaps you could go back and challenge a few more?",c="Ya estoy recibiendo informes de la destreza que demostraste en el Saliente Salvaje. ¡Excelente, <name>... excelente!\n\n\n\nY ahora creo que es hora de emitir un decreto al thane de esos vrykul que derrotaste con tanta facilidad.",cEN="Already I'm hearing reports of the prowess you displayed on the Savage Ledge. Excellent, <name>... excellent!\n\n\n\nAnd now I think it's time to issue a decree to the thane of those vrykul that you so easily defeated."}
Q[12940]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[12941]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[12942]={d="叛徒。我们海德尼尔人绝对不会怜悯这种渣滓。\n\n瓦基里安的那帮家伙已经逍遥法外太久了。我们依然忠于托里姆，而她们却成了巫妖王的走狗！\n\n她们把那些接受了巫妖王恩典的人称为“瓦格里”。她们长着羽翼，就像鹰身人一样。\n\n瓦基里安就在遥远的西北方，比风暴神殿更遥远的地方。去杀死那些长着翅膀的母狼吧，姐妹。杀了她们，我会奖励你一件我最珍贵的宝物。",dEN="Traitors. We Hyldnir have little love for them.\n\nThe dwellers of Valkyrion have gone unpunished for far too long. While we remained loyal to Thorim, they became the Lich King's lapdogs!\n\nThey call the ones who receive his gift val'kyr. They fly on feathered wings, like the harpies they are.\n\nYou will find Valkyrion far to the northwest, beyond the Temple of Storms. Slay these winged she-wolves, sister. Slay them and I will reward you with one of my most prized possessions.",o="布伦希尔达村的复仇者伊芬要你去瓦基里安杀死12个初生的瓦格里。",oEN="Iva the Vengeful in Brunnhildar Village wants you to go to Valkyrion and slay 12 Nascent Val'kyr.",p="你有没有好好惩罚我们偏离正道的同胞？",pEN="Did you punish our wayward brethren?",c="瓦格里不过是巫妖王的走狗。我们会像杀死野狗一样地杀死她们。她们自己做出了决定，现在就要自己承担后果。",cEN="The val'kyr are nothing but the Lich King's lapdogs. They will be put down like the scum they are. They've made their choice, now they have to live with the consequences."}
Q[12943]={d="强大的乌弗朗领主就坐在野蛮之台旁边的大厅里。我研究过他的数据，这是一个极具耐心和战略头脑的维库人。他喜欢等待时机速战速决，不喜欢搞持久战斗。\n\n我要除掉他！\n\n我已经写好了他的裁决令，去当着他的面大声宣读吧。\n\n<公爵开心地扬起了眉毛。>\n\n至少……这样可以让他失去勇气。",dEN="Thane Ufrang the Mighty sits within his hall overlooking the Savage Ledge. I've studied him. The thane is a patient vrykul, with a head for strategy and warfare. He's also shown a penchant for biding his time and not wanting to overplay his hand in the ongoing battle.\n\nI need him dead!\n\nI've written a decree. Stand before the thane and read it aloud.\n\n<The duke arches his eyebrow in amusement.>\n\nIt should... unnerve him at the least.",o="暗影拱顶的兰克拉尔公爵命令你向强大的乌弗朗领主宣读暗影拱顶裁决令，然后杀死他。",oEN="Duke Lankral at The Shadow Vault has ordered you to read the Shadow Vault Decree in the presence of Thane Ufrang the Mighty, and then to slay him.",p="Mis exploradores me informan de que Ufrang aún vive.\n\n¿Es que no sabes leer, <race>?",pEN="My scouts inform me that Ufrang yet lives.\n\nDo you not know how to read, <race>?",c="<兰克拉尔公爵对你的报告点头表示满意。>\n\n我们面对的对手远比我们壮大，不只是在身材上，在数量上也是如此。如果我们在冰冠冰川的战斗想要获胜的话，我们就得想的比他们多！\n\n现在乌弗朗死了，我们对尤顿海姆的进攻就有了优势。一定要好好利用这个机会。",cEN="<Duke Lankral nods his approval at your report of success.>\n\nWe face a foe that dwarfs us, not only in stature, but also numerically. If we are to win the battle for Icecrown, we must outthink them!\n\nWith Ufrang dead, that gives us an advantage in Jotunheim. Let us see if we can capitalize on it."}
