Q[13476]={d="与联盟作战是为部落效劳的莫大荣耀！那些在各条战联机和联盟作战的士兵是我们最伟大的成员。我们要消灭我们的对手，而不是仅仅进行小规模的遭遇战，我们要打精心准备的大战。\n\n去每一条战联机消灭联盟吧！为了荣耀！为了部落！",dEN="Serving the Horde in one of the great battles against the Alliance is a source of great honor! The few however, that have served the Horde in ALL of our active battlefronts are our truly great fighters. We shall vanquish our opponents, not by fighting isolated skirmishes, but by waging a well-coordinated war.\n\nGo forth and crush the Alliance on every front! For Honor! For the Horde!",o="在每个战场上都取得1枚荣誉奖章，并将它们交给任意部落主城、沙塔斯、达拉然或冬拥湖的部落战争使者。",oEN="Bring a Mark of Honor from each battleground to a Horde Warbringer in any Horde capital city, Shattrath, Dalaran, or Wintergrasp.",p="阿拉希到处流淌着战士的鲜血，奥特兰克的金属碰撞声不绝于耳。除非你从前线带回了消息，否则不要浪费我的时间！",pEN="Arathi is still wet with the blood of great warriors and the clash of steel still rings throughout Alterac. Do not waste my time unless you bring news from the front!",c="Tus pruebas no han sido fáciles, pero tu valor no se te escapó y tus fuerzas no fallaron. Parte con marcas de victoria anteriores, $n. Nadie los necesitará como recordatorio de su valía. Ponte de pie, $n. ¡Hoy caminarás con mucho orgullo porque eres $gun héroe:una heroína;!",cEN="Your trials have not been easy, but your courage did not escape you and your strength did not fail. Part with past tokens of victory, <class>. None shall need them as a reminder of your worth. Stand up straight, <name>. Today you will walk with great pride for you are a hero!"}
Q[13479]={d="El Jardín Noble, ¡la celebración de la vida y de la primavera! Espero que te estés divirtiendo con la búsqueda de huevos, $gamigo:amiga;, porque me gustaría hacer uso de alguien tan capaz como tú.\n\nNo sé con certeza qué tipo de magia se usó para crear los huevos, y los druidas no parecen querer explicármelo. Quizás puedas recogerme unos trozos de cáscara mientras buscas huevos. Te puedes quedar con lo que hay dentro. Solo necesito una muestra suficiente de los huevos en sí.",dEN="Noblegarden, celebration of life and spring! I hope you've been enjoying the egg hunt, friend, because I could use the services of a capable individual like you.\n\nI'm not certain what form of magic was used in the creation of the eggs, and the druids aren't keen on explaining it to me. Perhaps you could collect some shell fragments for me during your egg collection. You can keep the contents of the eggs; all I require is a sufficient sample of the eggs themselves.",o="春季收集者要你去收集20块蛋壳碎片。",oEN="The Sping Gatherer wants you to get 20 shell fragments.",p="你拿到碎片了吗？",pEN="Do you have the fragments?",c="太好了，太好了，谢谢你！我大概会需要更多的样本才能得到最终的结果，但你今天已经做得够好了。",cEN="Excellent, excellent, thank you! I may need more of a sample to get truly conclusive results, but you've done well today."}
Q[13480]={d="El Jardín Noble, ¡la celebración de la vida y de la primavera! Espero que te estés divirtiendo con la búsqueda de huevos, $gamigo:amiga;, porque me gustaría hacer uso de alguien tan capaz como tú.\n\nNo sé con certeza qué tipo de magia se usó para crear los huevos, y los druidas no parecen querer explicármelo. Quizás puedas recogerme unos trozos de cáscara mientras buscas huevos. Te puedes quedar con lo que hay dentro. Solo necesito una muestra suficiente de los huevos en sí.",dEN="Noblegarden, celebration of life and spring! I hope you've been enjoying the egg hunt, friend, because I could use the services of a capable individual like you.\n\nI'm not certain what form of magic was used in the creation of the eggs, and the druids aren't keen on explaining it to me. Perhaps you could collect some shell fragments for me during your egg collection. You can keep the contents of the eggs; all I require is a sufficient sample of the eggs themselves.",o="春季收藏者要你去收集20块蛋壳碎片。",oEN="The Spring Collector wants you to get 20 shell fragments.",p="你拿到碎片了吗？",pEN="Do you have the fragments?",c="太好了，太好了，谢谢你！我大概会需要更多的样本才能得到最终的结果，但你今天已经做得够好了。",cEN="Excellent, excellent, thank you! I may need more of a sample to get truly conclusive results, but you've done well today."}
Q[13481]={d="La Luz me sonríe. Aún no he muerto en esta pesadilla viviente, pero la Plaga me matará y hará pedazos mi cuerpo para usarlo en su \"trabajo\" si no consigo escapar.\n\nNo puedo conseguirlo solo, $c, pero con tu ayuda puede que viva para volver a luchar contra la Plaga.\n\n¿Me ayudarás a escapar antes de que los carniceros de la Plaga vengan a darme el golpe de gracia?",dEN="The Light smiles upon me. I have not yet died in this living nightmare, but the Scourge will kill me and tear my body apart for use in their 'work' here if I cannot escape.\n\nI cannot make it on my own, <class>, but with your help, I may yet live to fight the Scourge again.\n\nWill you help me make my escape before the Scourge's butchers come to finish me off?",o="护送卡玛洛斯神父逃离险境，然后向奥格瑞姆之锤的凯尔坦修士报告。",oEN="Escort Father Kamaros to safety and then report to Brother Keltan aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="我们以为我们失去了卡玛洛斯神父。你的英勇将会成为所有对抗天灾军团人的榜样。",cEN="You have done well. We thought Father Kamaros lost, for certain. Your bravery will serve as an example to all those who oppose the Scourge."}
Q[13482]={d="La Luz me sonríe. Aún no he muerto en esta pesadilla viviente, pero la Plaga me matará y hará pedazos mi cuerpo para usarlo en su \"trabajo\" si no consigo escapar.\n\nNo puedo conseguirlo solo, $ghijo mío:hija mía;, pero con tu ayuda puede que viva para volver a luchar contra la Plaga.\n\n¿Me ayudarás a escapar antes de que los carniceros de la Plaga vengan a darme el golpe de gracia?",dEN="The Light smiles upon me. I have not yet died in this living nightmare, but the Scourge will kill me and tear my body apart for use in their 'work' here if I cannot escape.\n\nI cannot make it on my own, my child, but with your help, I may yet live to fight the Scourge again.\n\nWill you help me make my escape before the Scourge's butchers come to finish me off?",o="护送卡玛洛斯神父逃离险境，然后向破天号上的虔诚的阿布萨兰报告。",oEN="Escort Father Kamaros to safety and then report to Absalan the Pious aboard the Skybreaker.",c="感谢圣光。我以为卡玛洛斯神父死了或是落得更惨的下场。你的勇气和同情心救回了银色北伐军的一位重要盟友。我替北伐军感谢你。",cEN="Thank the Light. I'd thought Father Kamaros dead, or worse. Through your bravery and compassion, you have restored a great ally to the Argent Crusade. You have my thanks and those of the crusade."}
Q[13483]={d="如果你想找些活干的话，可以到主城附近的村庄里去看看——比如剃刀岭，布瑞尔，血蹄村或者鹰翼广场。我听说那些地方有几位法师正在搞什么研究工作，希望能找到收集彩蛋的人去帮忙。具体的情况我也不很清楚，不过他们肯定会告诉你的。",dEN="If you're looking for something to do, I hear there are mages in the settlements near capital cities - Razor Hill, Brill, Bloodhoof Village, and Falconwing Square - who have been recruiting egg hunters for help with some research they're doing. I'm not sure of the particulars, but I'm sure they'd tell you.",o="与剃刀岭、布瑞尔、血蹄村或鹰翼广场的春季收集者谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to a Spring Gatherer in Razor Hill, Brill, Bloodhoof Village, or Falconwing Square.",c="没错！是的，我想我有些任务可以托付给你……",cEN="Yes! Yes, I think I have just the task for you..."}
Q[13484]={d="如果你想找些活干的话，可以到主城附近的村庄里去看看——比如闪金镇，卡拉诺斯，多兰纳尔或者碧蓝岗哨。我听说那些地方有几位法师正在搞什么研究工作，希望能找到收集彩蛋的人去帮忙。具体的情况我也不很清楚，不过他们肯定会告诉你的。",dEN="If you're looking for something to do, I hear there are mages in the settlements near capital cities - Goldshire, Kharanos, Dolanaar, and Azure Watch - who have been recruiting egg hunters for help with some research they're doing. I'm not sure of the particulars, but I'm sure they'd tell you.",o="与闪金镇、卡拉诺斯、多兰纳尔或碧蓝岗哨的春季收藏者谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to a Spring Collector in Goldshire, Kharanos, Dolanaar, or Azure Watch.",c="没错！是的，我想我有些任务可以托付给你……",cEN="Yes! Yes, I think I have just the task for you..."}
