Q[13502]={d="给你……拿着这只彩蛋篮，去寻找鲜艳的彩蛋吧。找到十块复活节巧克力以后，带着篮子回来找我。",dEN="Here... take this Egg Basket and go hunting for Brightly Colored Eggs. Return to me with the basket when you've found ten Noblegarden Chocolates.",o="复活节小贩要你收集10块复活节巧克力，将它们和彩蛋篮一起带回来。",oEN="The Noblegarden Vendor wants you to collect 10 Noblegarden Chocolates and return them along with the Egg Basket.",p="你拿到10个复活节巧克力了吗？",pEN="Do you have the ten Noblegarden Chocolates?",c="干得好！喔，拜托……请拿好你的篮子！\n\n记住你总是可以带着更多的复活节巧克力回来交换额外的物品。",cEN="Well done! And here, please... keep the basket!\n\nRemember, you can always return with more Noblegarden Chocolates to trade for additional items."}
Q[13503]={d="给你……拿着这只彩蛋篮，去寻找鲜艳的彩蛋吧。找到十块复活节巧克力以后，带着篮子回来找我。",dEN="Here... take this Egg Basket and go hunting for Brightly Colored Eggs. Return to me with the basket when you've found ten Noblegarden Chocolates.",o="复活节商人要你收集10块复活节巧克力，将它们和彩蛋篮一起带回来。",oEN="The Noblegarden Merchant wants you to collect 10 Noblegarden Chocolates and return them along with the Egg Basket.",p="你拿到10个复活节巧克力了吗？",pEN="Do you have the ten Noblegarden Chocolates?",c="干得好！喔，拜托……请拿好你的篮子！\n\n记住你总是可以带着更多的复活节巧克力回来交换额外的物品。",cEN="Well done! And here, please... keep the basket!\n\nRemember, you can always return with more Noblegarden Chocolates to trade for additional items."}
Q[13538]={d="冬拥河南边的三座塔楼正在从堡垒中吸取能量！\n\n去摧毁影目塔楼、火光塔楼或冬缘塔楼，然后回来向我报告。记住，只有攻城车辆可以对塔楼造成伤害，所以你要保护好我们的攻城车，别让部落把它们给拆了！",dEN="The three towers south of the Wintergrasp river are draining power from the Fortress!\n\nDestroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower or Winter's Edge Tower, then return to me. Remember, only siege vehicles can damage a tower, so make sure to protect them from the Horde!",o="摧毁影目塔楼、火光塔楼或冬缘塔楼，然后向冬拥湖的参谋官安布拉米斯复命。",oEN="Destroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower or Winter's Edge Tower and return to Tactical Officer Ahbramis in Wintergrasp.",p="你带来了南方的消息吗？",pEN="Do you bring word from the south?",c="我从这里就可以听到爆炸声！太出色了——我们已经将能量重新导向泰坦圣物，让它强化我们的力量。",cEN="I heard the explosion from here! Excellent job - we've already begun rerouting the power into the Titan relic to super-charge our own forces."}
Q[13539]={d="Aunque la Alianza esté aporreando nuestras puertas, un verdadero táctico ve más allá de lo que es evidente.\n\n\"Atacar cuando no están preparados, aparecer cuando nadie te espera.\"\n\n$n, Necesito que vayas a través del Río Conquista del Invierno y que destruyas una de las tres torres al sur. Nuestros brujos nos han informado de que las torres drenan poder que podemos usar para reforzar nuestras tropas.\n\nVuelve a verme cuando hayas destruido una torre.",dEN="While the Alliance may be pounding on our doors, a true tactician looks beyond the obvious.\n\n\"Attack him where he is unprepared, appear where you are not expected.\"\n\n<name>, I need you to travel across the Wintergrasp River and destroy one of the three towers to the south. Our Warlocks report that the towers are draining power we could use to bolster our own troops.\n\nReturn to me once you've destroyed a tower.",o="摧毁影目塔楼、火光塔楼或冬缘塔楼，然后向冬拥湖的参谋官基尔拉斯复命。",oEN="Destroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower, or Winter's Edge Tower and return to Tactical Officer Kilrath in Wintergrasp.",p="我对术士的嫌弃几乎快跟我对不死生物的憎恨差不多了。不过，他们在某些时候总还是派得上用场。",pEN="My disgust for Warlocks is only exceeded by my hate for the undead. However, they can both prove useful at times.",c="要杀光我们的敌人，我们的士兵必须要愤怒激昂，而击败敌人刚好能提供这些优势，一定要好好奖励他们。我希望这些能配得上你对部落的贡献。",cEN="Now in order to kill the enemy, our men must be roused to anger; that there may be advantage from defeating the enemy, they must have their rewards. I hope that these are sufficient for your service to the Horde."}
Q[13548]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[13549]={d="除了达卡莱巨魔的古物之外，我还打算带一些祖达克地区的野生动物回到赞达拉去。我收集了一些雄性冰霜豹和冰爪熊，但是没有雌性怎么行呢？\n\n糟糕的是，我的猎人在一次不幸的事故中死亡了。也许你愿意替换他的位置？\n\n使用这支吹管催眠冰霜豹和冰爪熊，然后拎起它们的尾巴检查一下，如果是雌性的，就把它们带回这里。你可以在伦诺克、奎丝鲁恩和哈克娅的祭坛周围找到它们。",dEN="Along with the Drakkari artifacts, I'm interested in returning to Zandalar with some of the Zul'Drak wildlife. I have males of both the frost leopards and icepaw bears, but I need females!\n\nToo bad that my trapper was killed in a most unfortunate accident. Perhaps you would be willing to fill in for him?\n\nPut the leopards and bears to sleep with this blowgun then lift their tails and return with some females if you would be so kind. They can be found near the Altars of Rhunok, Quetz'lun, and Har'koa.",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼希望你对冰霜豹和冰爪熊使用麻醉飞镖，并给他带回三头雌性冰霜豹和三头雌性冰爪熊。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga wants you to use To'kini's Blowgun on Frost Leopards and Icepaw Bears. Return to him with 3 females of each.",p="不，这样不行。拜托你带着三只雌豹和三只雌熊回来，好让我带着它们踏上艰难的归乡之路。",pEN="No, that just won't do. Please return when you have the female leopards and bears that I'll need for the arduous journey back home.",c="¡Qué especímenes tan finos, <name>! Seguramente proporcionarán muchas horas de curiosa especulación entre mis colegas de mi hogar.",cEN="Very fine specimens indeed, <name>! These are sure to provide many hours of curious speculation amongst my colleagues back home."}
Q[13556]={d="¿Qué passa, $gtron:titi;? ¿Me puedes echar una mano? Bah'Kini necesita muchos huevos de raptor p'al sacrificio en honor a Dubra'Jin.\n\n¿Por qué crees que aún no nos han invadío los Drakkari? ¡Dubra'Jin nos preh'ta su ayuda!\n\nNecesitamos que recojas huevos de raptor de alrededor de los árboles que hay a las afueras de Gundrak. A veces los raptores los llevan encima p'a mantene'hlos calientes.",dEN="How ya doin', mon? Thinkin' ya might be helpin' me out? Bah'Kini be needin' lots o' the raptor eggs to be sacrificin' to Dubra'Jin.\n\nHow ya thinkin' we not be overrun yet by the Drakkari? Dubra'Jin be lendin' us his aid!\n\nWe need ya to gather up the raptor eggs from around the trees outside here in Gundrak. Sometimes the raptors carry 'em to keep 'em warm, too.",o="杜布拉金的哈瓦纳希望你去收集12枚古达克迅猛龙卵。",oEN="Ha'wana at Dubra'Jin needs you to collect 12 Gundrak Raptor Eggs.",p="谁会想到伟大的杜布拉金要这么多的蛋？他又要拿它们做什么咧？",pEN="Who woulda thought the great Dubra'Jin be wantin' so many eggs? What he gonna do with them anyway?",c="一，二，三……嘿嘿，还真是多啊，老兄！这下我们可以高枕无忧一段时间啦！",cEN="One, two, three,... hehe, that be a good number o' them, mon! Now we be safe for quite some time!"}
Q[13559]={p="Los tributos ordinarios no eran suficientes para el gran Hodir cuando caminaba entre los gigantes de escarcha.\n\nPuede que ya no esté con nosotros, pero hemos mantenido la tradición de ofrecer tributos a su fuerza y sabiduría. Participar en esta tradición aumentaría mucho tu renombre, pequeño <class>.",pEN="No ordinary tributes were good enough for the great Hodir when he walked among the frost giants.\n\nHe might not be with us anymore, but we've kept the tradition of offering tribute to his strength and wisdom. It would do much for your renown to partake in this tradition, small <class>.",c="霍迪尔之子接受你的献礼，小朋友。你在许多方面都证明了自己身为盟友的价值。",cEN="The Sons of Hodir accept your tribute, small one. You continue to prove your worth as an ally in more ways than one."}
Q[13592]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的马库斯·巴洛爵士要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Sir Marcus Barlowe at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="Bienvenido de nuevo de tus ejercicios, <name>. Aunque estemos practicando para la competición, es bueno recordarnos que el Azote sigue ahí fuera.",cEN="Welcome back from your exercises, <name>. Even while we practice for the competition, it's good to remind ourselves that the Scourge is still out there."}
Q[13593]={d="Te doy la bienvenida, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Han llegado hasta mí las noticias de tu habilidad en combate. ¿Buscas unirte a la delegación de Ventormenta en el torneo?\n\nTe instruirás y avanzarás por las filas como has hecho anteriormente, pero cuando seas $gCampeón:Campeona; de Ventormenta, tu escudero podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. Do you seek to join Stormwind's tournament delegation?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Stormwind, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla con el mariscal Jacob Alerius de nuevo si quieres convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Ventormenta.",oEN="Speak with Marshal Jacob Alerius again if you wish to become a valiant of Stormwind.",c="我们很荣幸能有你的加入，也很期待你为我们争光。",cEN="We are proud that you have agreed to train with us and compete on our behalf."}
Q[13600]={d="¡Maldita sea mi suerte!\n\n¡He perdido la espada del torneo! He oído que los bardos cuentan historias de viajantes que ofrecían jacintos de invierno a una doncella solitaria a cambio de obsequios. Esos jacintos solo crecen en el hielo de la Presa del Muro de Hierro, en el extremo noroeste del Bosque Canto de Cristal que limita con Corona de Hielo. Recoge las flores y llévalas al círculo de luces del Lago Drak'Mar al noreste del Cementerio de Dragones, cerca de Zul'Drak y las Colinas Pardas. Pídele a la doncella solitaria una espada digna.",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="<元帅从你手上接过达克玛尔之剑。>\n\n真是一把好剑，完美的平衡性。这一定能让我在下一场比赛好好发挥。",cEN="<The marshal accepts the Blade of Drak'Mar from you.>\n\nA fine weapon, and perfectly balanced. It will serve me well in the next match."}
Q[13603]={d="El buen acero afilado y honesto no triunfa. Los demás combatientes usan espadas encantadas y estoy en desventaja, pero aún hay esperanza.\n\nCuenta una antigua leyenda de las Colinas Pardas que hay una doncella bajo el aspecto de una rana que protege la espada que tanto tiempo lleva custodiando. Vive entre las ranas de lago a las orillas del Lago Fresno, al este del Puesto Fresno. Cuentan que solo un beso voluntarioso puede romper la maldición. Ponte este cacao antes de besar nada, $n, si no te saldrán pupas.",dEN="Good, honest, honed steel may not carry the day. The other combatants are using enchanted blades and I find myself at a disadvantage, but all is not lost.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="¿Así que los relatos eran ciertos? Es una hoja magnífica y no tengo dudas de que me servirá de mucho en el torneo. Te agradezco tu ayuda, <name>.",cEN="So the tales were true? This is a fine blade and I have no doubt that it will serve me well in the tournament. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13604]={d="El disco de platino es sorprendentemente simétrico y no tiene ni un solo arañazo o imperfección. En el borde hay unas runas grabadas que forman la palabra \"ARCHIVUM\".\n\nDebe de haber un dispositivo en Ulduar capaz de leer el disco.",dEN="This platinum disc is surprisingly symmetrical and devoid of any scratches or imperfections. Engraved along its edge, bold runes spell out the word \"ARCHIVUM.\"\n\nThere must be a device inside Ulduar capable of reading the disc.",o="将文件馆数据圆盘带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Archivum Data Disc to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="当控制台的圆形插座打开时，能量在控制台中呼啸流窜。",pEN="The console whirrs with energy as the round receptacle opens.",c="白金圆盘完美无缺地勘合进控制台中。它开始旋转而白色的光束扫过圆盘。",cEN="The platinum disc fits perfectly inside the console. It begins to spin as its contents are scanned by white beams of light."}
Q[13606]={d="我想弗蕾亚的徽记可能是最难得到的一块。\n\n根据文件馆的数据，徽记与弗蕾亚身边的三位古树仆从密切关联，它们是明叶长老、铁枝长老和石树长老。一旦它们之中有任何一位受到伤害，徽记的完整性就不能保障了。\n\n然而，如果你们对这三位长老手下留情，弗蕾亚的力量就会变得更加强大。\n\n我又能说什么呢，$n，我们现在真是进退维谷。",dEN="Freya's Sigil is going to be one of the tougher ones, I reckon.\n\nAccording to the Archivum, the essence of the Sigil is tied to her three elder servants, Brightleaf, Ironbranch and Stonebark. Should any of the elders be harmed, the Sigil's integrity will be compromised.\n\nSparing the elders, however, means that Freya will be more powerful when you face her.\n\nWhat can I say, <name>. We're stuck between a rock and hard place.",o="将弗蕾亚的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得弗蕾亚的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Freya's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Freya's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="El sigilo de Freya, <name>, ¿lo tienes?",pEN="Freya's sigil, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="Excelente trabajo, <name>. ¡Estamos un paso más cerca de salvar Azeroth!",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. We're one step closer to saving Azeroth!"}
Q[13607]={d="听着，$g小伙子:小姑娘，艾泽拉斯的命运危在旦夕。\n\n我们唯一的机会是到天文台去，找到奥尔加隆，阻止他向他的泰坦主人发送信息。\n\n赶快找到天文台。如果你发现了任何有价值的信息，就立即回来向我报告。奥尔加隆抵达之前，我们还有一些时间可以准备。",dEN="Listen, <lad/lass>! Azeroth's fate is at stake here.\n\nOur only chance is to get to the Celestial Planetarium in time to find this Algalon and stop him from beaming back any messages to his Titan masters.\n\nLocate the Celestial Planetarium and come back with any information you get. We might still have some time to prepare for Algalon's arrival.",o="奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦要你找到天文台的入口。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to locate the entrance to the Celestial Planetarium.",c="锁住了？意料之中！\n\n让我们来瞧瞧能从这堆垃圾里面找到什么数据……",cEN="It's locked? Figures!\n\nLet's see what information this junk heap can give us..."}
Q[13609]={d="要拿到霍迪尔的徽记可不容易。你不但要击败霍迪尔，而且必须抢在他打碎装着徽记的箱子之前击败他！\n\n如果你想了解更多信息的话，可以去查查文件馆的控制台。那里面的知识比世界上所有的图书馆加在一起还要多！",dEN="Hodir's Sigil won't be easy to obtain. Not only are ye going to have to defeat Hodir himself, but yer going to have to do it before he destroys the chest that contains it!\n\nCheck the Archivum console if you need more information. That thing contains more knowledge than all of the world's libraries put together!",o="将霍迪尔的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得霍迪尔的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Hodir's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Hodir's Sigil, consult the Archivum Console.",p="¿Has obtenido el sigilo, <name>?",pEN="Did ye obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="你办到了！我不知道你怎么做到的，但你居然成功了！",cEN="Ye did it! I don't know how, but ye did!"}
Q[13610]={d="托里姆已经失去了自我，$n。一股黑暗的力量正在影响着他。\n\n某个邪恶的家伙假扮成他死去的妻子西芙，蒙蔽了他的心智。\n\n你要阻止那个冒牌货控制托里姆。如果托里姆被这股力量征服，我们就永远都不能找到他的徽记了！\n\n你要让他清醒过来，越快越好！\n\n和以往一样，文件馆的控制台会给你提供所有必要的消息……包括那些你不喜欢听到的消息。",dEN="Thorim's not himself, <name>. He's come under a dark influence.\n\nAn evil presence under the guise of an illusion pretends to be his lost wife, Sif.\n\nYe can't let him be overcome by this impostor's spell. If he does, the location of his sigil might forever be lost!\n\nYer going to have to beat some sense into him and yer going to have to do it quick.\n\nAs always, the Archivum Console will give ye all the gory details... even the ones ye don't like.",o="将托里姆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得托里姆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Thorim's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Thorim's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="¿Y bien, <name>? ¿Lo tienes?",pEN="Well, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="Nunca dejas de impresionarme, <name>.\n\nTú y yo nos tomaremos una pinta juntos cuando todo esto haya terminado, ¿me oyes?",cEN="Ye never cease to impress, <name>.\n\nYe and me are having a pint together after all this is done, ye hear me?"}
Q[13611]={d="米米尔隆是个聪明的家伙，他给自己的地盘装上了一套自毁设备。\n\n很不幸，如果你想要拿到徽记，就必须争分夺秒。如果你需要了解什么详细的数据，可以去文件馆控制台那里查询。",dEN="Mimiron's a clever one. His entire abode is rigged with some sort of self-destruction mechanism.\n\nUnfortunately yer gonna have to race against it if ye want to get his sigil. Check the Archivum Console for more details if ye need them.",o="将米米尔隆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得米米尔隆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Ulduar Archivum wants you to obtain Mimiron's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Mimiron's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="¿Pudiste obtener el sigilo, <name>?",pEN="Were you able to obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="Tengo que reconocerlo, <name>. Puede que nuestras probabilidades no sean las mejores, pero me siento mucho mejor con tu ayuda.",cEN="I've got to hand it to you, <name>. Our odds might not be the best, but I feel a lot better with you lending a hand."}
Q[13614]={d="你成功了，$n。把这些徽记拿到文件馆的控制台那里去，看看你能否进入天文台。\n\n你最好快一点，$g伙计:小丫头，时间紧迫。",dEN="You really did it, <name>. Take the sigils to the Archivum Console and see if you can gain access to the Celestial Planetarium.\n\nYou best hurry, <lad/lass>. Time is of the essence.",o="将守护者的徽记带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Sigils of the Watchers to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="控制台的亮光迅速地扫过玻璃的表面，似乎在等待某些输入。",pEN="The console's bright lights scan the glass surface repeatedly, as if awaiting some form of input.",c="准备确认。\n\n准许进入星穹浑天仪。请取出你的钥匙。",cEN="Stand by for verification.\n\nAccess to the Celestial Planetarium granted. Please retrieve your key."}
Q[13616]={d="¡Maldito sea ese caballero de la Muerte por romper mi espada!\n\nAl sur del Bosque Canto de Cristal, vigilando la salida hacia el Vicio de Cristal está Lord Llama Perpetua. Mátalo y toma su ascua de llama perpetua.\n\nLlévala al centro del Lago Aliento Invernal, en la parte norte del Fiordo Aquilonal y úsala para liberar a la doncella encerrada en hielo. Es la guardiana de una espada ancestral y recompensará a su libertad$gor:ora;.\n\nDemuestra tu valía y consigue la espada que ha estado custodiando durante tanto tiempo, $n.",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅。",oEN="Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你拿到我要找的剑了吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade I seek?",c="La hoja es tan fina como dicen las historias. Parece que hay poca razón para completar las reparaciones de mi hoja habitual. Winter's Edge es muy superior y seguiré llevándola conmigo. Te doy las gracias, <name>.",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13622]={d="这些碎片组合在一起，拼成了一把华丽的战锤。从构造上来看，它至少有一部分是由泰坦制造的。\n\n也许你可以在文件馆的控制台那里找到更多关于这把古代神器的消息。",dEN="The pieces fit together to form an elegant hammer. Its construction appears to be at least partially Titan in nature.\n\nThe console inside the Archivum might have some information regarding this artifact.\nRelated",o="将瓦兰奈尔的碎片拿到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台那里去。",oEN="Bring the Shattered Fragments of Val'anyr to the Archivum Console in the Archivum in Ulduar."}
Q[13625]={d="锦标赛中的大部分项目都要求参赛者熟练掌握骑乘战斗的技巧。为了让大家熟悉一边驾驭坐骑一边战斗的方式，我们在赛场北部布置了一些训练用的假人。\n\n到大帐外面的兽栏中去，拿起你的长枪，跨上奎尔多雷战马吧。你可以熟悉一下骑乘战斗中能够使用的战术，然后击败三种不同种类的训练假人。",dEN="Most of the tournament's competitions require competitors to master the command of a mount in battle. In order to familiarize you with mounted combat, we've put up training dummies all over the northern part of the tournament grounds.\n\nVisit the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up on the Quel'dorei steed. Familiarize yourself with the tactics available to you and use them to defeat the three different kinds of training dummies.",o="使用刺击技能攻击一个近战目标5次，使用碎盾技能攻击2个脆弱的远程目标，使用冲锋技能攻击2个脆弱的冲锋目标，然后回到银色比武场，向斥候沙琳蒂亚复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Strike a Melee Target with Thrust 5 times, use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, use Charge on 2 vulnerable Charge Targets and then return to Scout Shalyndria at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="骑乘战斗练习得如何了？",pEN="How goes the mounted combat practice?",c="Bien hecho, <name>. El combate montado suele ser difícil de aprender para aquellos acostumbrados a luchar a pie. No tengo dudas de que seguirás mejorando con la práctica, algo que no puedo decir de algunos guerreros.",cEN="Well done, <name>. Mounted combat is often hard to pick up for those accustomed to fighting on foot. I have no doubt that you'll continue to improve with practice, which is more than I can say for some warriors."}
Q[13629]={d="根据文件馆控制台的提示，也许这个办法可以将瓦兰奈尔的碎片重新组合起来：你要把碎片放入尤格萨伦的体内。\n\n这方案听起来风险极大，不过为了这柄强大的上古神器，冒多大的风险都是值得的。",dEN="The Archivum Console has hinted at a possible way to rebind the fragments of Val'anyr: you must get the fragments inside the physical form of the being known as Yogg-Saron.\n\nIt sounds like a long shot, but for an artifact of such power you think the risk might just be worth it.",o="在尤格萨伦发出震耳咆哮时，将瓦兰奈尔的碎片投入尤格萨伦张开的嘴中，然后击败尤格萨伦，获得重铸的远古王者之锤。\n\n只能在英雄模式下完成，且至少需要有一位奥杜尔的守护者没有协助你。",oEN="Throw the Shattered Pieces of Val'anyr into Yogg-Saron's maw while he's casting Deafening Roar and defeat Yogg-Saron and recover the Reforged Hammer of Ancient Kings.\n\nThis can only be completed in Heroic mode and only if at least one Ulduar Watcher is not assisting you."}
Q[13631]={d="我们必须抓紧时间，$n。必须回到达拉然，在那里把恢复代码发射出去。\n\n带着它去找罗宁吧，我会在那里等你。",dEN="We'd best hurry now, <name>. We're going to have to transmit the reply-code from Dalaran.\n\nTake it to Rhonin, I will meet you there.",o="将恢复代码阿尔法交给达拉然的罗宁。",oEN="Take the Reply-Code Alpha to Rhonin in Dalaran.",c="你在这儿。希望这样行得通吧。我们全都靠它了。",cEN="You're here. Let us hope this works. For all our sakes."}
Q[13633]={d="最近有不少关于那个被称为“黑骑士”的选手的传闻，你肯定也听说了吧？据说凡是将要与他对阵竞技的骑士都会惨遭横死。\n\n当然了，我们手里还没有确切的证据，不过调查一下他的后台总不会错的。\n\n他自称来自西部荒野的库珀系列。你能不能到西部荒野的月溪镇去一趟，在镇子里的西部本地调查一下这个系列的住所？看看你能不能查出些什么线索。",dEN="No doubt you've heard the disturbing rumors about the contestant the others are calling the Black Knight. It's said that any rider who was scheduled to face him in combat has met an untimely end.\n\nOf course, we have no definitive proof of anything, but it wouldn't hurt to look into this knight's background.\n\nHe claims to be descended from the Cooper family of Westfall. Would you visit their residence in the western part of Moonbrook in Westfall? See if you can find any proof of his story.",o="调查黑骑士的身世是否属实，然后回到银色比武场，向北伐军战士莱达拉汇报你的发现。",oEN="Investigate the Black Knight's claims and return to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds with your findings.",p="你有找到任何东西能证实黑骑士的身份吗？",pEN="Have you found anything related to the Black Knight's story?",c="Entonces, ¿estás diciendo que la historia de este caballero es una farsa? Muy sospechoso. Deshonroso como mínimo, y asesino como máximo. Aun así, no podemos enfrentarnos a él hasta que sepamos con certeza si estuvo implicado en estos asesinatos.\n\nNo hagas nada que despierte sus sospechas, <name>. La discreción nos vendrá bien mientras continuamos investigando.",cEN="So you're saying this knight's story is a sham? Most suspicious. Dishonorable at the least, and murderous at the worst. Still, we can't confront him until we know for certain whether he was involved in these murders.\n\nDo nothing to arouse his suspicions, <name>. Discretion will serve us well as we continue to investigate."}
Q[13634]={d="最近有不少关于那个被称为“黑骑士”的选手的传闻，你肯定也听说了吧？据说凡是将要与他对阵竞技的骑士都会惨遭横死。\n\n当然了，我们手里还没有确切的证据，不过调查一下他的后台总不会错的。\n\n他自称出生于银松森林的瓦尔甘农场。这个小农场就坐落在洛丹米尔湖的西岸。你能否到农场去调查一下，看看他说的是不是实话？",dEN="No doubt you've heard the disturbing rumors about the contestant the others are calling the Black Knight. It's said that any rider who was scheduled to face him in combat has met an untimely end.\n\nOf course, we have no definitive proof of anything, but it wouldn't hurt to look into this knight's background.\n\nHe claims to hail from Valgan's Field in Silverpine Forest. It's a small farm on the western shore of Lordamere Lake. Would you visit the farm and let me know if there's any truth to his story?",o="调查黑骑士的身世是否属实，然后回到银色比武场，向北伐军战士莱达拉汇报你的发现。",oEN="Investigate the Black Knight's claims and return to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds with your findings.",p="你有找到任何东西能证实黑骑士的身份吗？",pEN="Have you found anything related to the Black Knight's story?",c="Entonces, ¿estás diciendo que la historia de este caballero es una farsa? Muy sospechoso. Deshonroso como mínimo, y asesino como máximo. Aun así, no podemos enfrentarnos a él hasta que sepamos con certeza si estuvo implicado en estos asesinatos.\n\nNo hagas nada que despierte sus sospechas, <name>. La discreción nos vendrá bien mientras continuamos investigando.",cEN="So you're saying this knight's story is a sham? Most suspicious. Dishonorable at the least, and murderous at the worst. Still, we can't confront him until we know for certain whether he was involved in these murders.\n\nDo nothing to arouse his suspicions, <name>. Discretion will serve us well as we continue to investigate."}
Q[13641]={d="Ahora que sabemos que todas las historias del Caballero Negro son mentira, hay que encontrar la manera de vincularlo a los caballeros asesinados.\n\nSé cómo descubrir la verdadera causa de su muerte, pero necesito un material raro. Tenemos que conseguir un cristal de vidente, se encuentra solo entre los sátiros que se congregan cerca de las ruinas de los elfos de la noche en el Bosque Desolado y en el área central del Bosque Canto de Cristal. Encuentra a uno de esos videntes, $n, y tráeme el cristal que posee.",dEN="Now that we know there's no truth to the Black Knight's stories, we must find a way to connect him to the murdered knights.\n\nI know a way to reveal the truth about how they died, but it requires a rare material. We must gain a seer's crystal, found only among the unbound seers who congregate near night elf ruins in the Forlorn Woods in the central part of Crystalsong Forest. Find one of these seers, <name>, and bring me the crystal it holds.",o="将一块先知的水晶交给银色比武场的北伐军战士莱达拉。",oEN="Bring a Seer's Crystal to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你找到先知的水晶了吗？",pEN="Have you located a seer's crystal?",c="嗯，这块就够用了。现在只需要将圣光之力灌注其中，赋予它揭露真相的能力。",cEN="This one will do nicely. All that remains is to imbue it with the power of the Light, giving it the ability to find truth amid deception."}
Q[13643]={d="这块水晶将揭开那三名选手的死亡真相。把它带到比赛场东边的墓地里去，并在温德尔·巴尔弗爵士、洛林·阳焰和康纳尔·铁拳的墓前使用它。\n\n如果他们真的是被谋杀的，那我们必须在黑骑士再次行动前抓住他的把柄。你要仔细观察水晶所展示的东西，$n，我们必须确证这些死亡不是巧合。",dEN="The crystal will reveal the truth about how three of the tournament's combatants died. Take it with you to the graveyard east of the Tournament Grounds and use it before the graves of Sir Wendell Balfour, Lorien Sunblaze, and Conall Irongrip.\n\nIf indeed these men were murdered, then we must find a way to tie it to the Black Knight before he strikes again. Look closely at what the crystal tells you, <name>, for we must be certain these deaths were not accidental.",o="在温德尔·巴尔弗爵士、洛林·阳焰和康纳尔·铁拳的坟墓前使用先知的水晶，查出他们死亡的真相，然后将结果报告给北伐军战士莱达拉。",oEN="Use the Seer's Crystal at the graves of Sir Wendell Balfour, Lorien Sunblaze, and Conall Irongrip to determine how they died, then return to Crusader Rhydalla.",p="你去造访那些被杀害参赛者的墓地了吗？",pEN="Have you visisted the graves of the slain combatants?",c="所以你说洛林·阳焰是死于中毒，而温德尔·巴尔弗爵士被活活烧死？真是可怕的死法，两个人都是。只有康纳尔·铁拳是被刀剑所杀，而照你所说那是胆小鬼的偷袭——他死于一场不光彩的战斗。\n\n这三个人原本都排定要和黑骑士竞技——这可不是巧合。现在我们一定要找出方法来证明这是黑骑士所为。",cEN="So you say Lorien Sunblaze was done in by poison and Sir Wendell was burnt alive? Dreadful ways to die, both of them. Only Conall was killed by cold steel, and from your description, it was a coward's strike, not honorable combat that laid him in his grave.\n\nAll three sparred with and were scheduled to fight the Black Knight. This cannot be a coincidence. Now, we must find a way to prove it was the Black Knight's work."}
Q[13654]={d="每天，黑骑士的侍从玛洛里克都会扛着斧子，大摇大摆地离开营地，转至晶歌森林。他必然是想让我们相信他是出去砍柴了，但每次他都只带回几根小树枝。\n\n他经常到暮色之镜西南方的废墟去。也许他的骑士领主的确是让他去办什么事情，但即使如此，他在那里待的时间也太长了些。\n\n想点什么办法吸引他的注意力，或者把他打昏，然后搜搜他身上的东西。如果他真的在打什么鬼主意，我们可不能蒙在鼓里。",dEN="Every day, the Black Knight's squire, Maloric, makes a big show of heading to Crystalsong Forest with his axe over his shoulder. He wants us to believe he's chopping wood, but he never returns with more than a few twigs.\n\nHe usually goes toward the ruins southwest of the Mirror of Twilight. He spends a lot of time out there, even for a squire with responsibilities to his knight.\n\nFind a way to distract or incapacitate him and search him. If he's up to something, we'll know it.",o="从一个骷髅伐木工身上取下一根大腿骨，用它打昏玛洛里克。在玛洛里克身上搜查一番，找到证据后向银色比武场的北伐军战士莱达拉报告。",oEN="Obtain a Large Femur from a Skeletal Woodcutter and use it to incapacitate Maloric. Search Maloric for evidence, then report back to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="侍从的举止有透露出什么线索吗？",pEN="Did the squire's behavior yield any clues?",c="<Crusader Rhydalla examina el contenido de la bolsa con una expresión de disgusto en su rostro.>\n\nTodo está aquí, <name>: el veneno que mató a Lorien, una colección de cuchillos, antorchas y aceite. Ningún hombre tiene motivo para poseer estas cosas aquí y ningún escudero lo haría sin órdenes de su señor caballero. Hemos encontrado a nuestro asesino, <name>, pero ¿para quién trabaja?",cEN="<Crusader Rhydalla examines the bag's contents with a look of disgust on her face.>\n\nIt's all here, <name>: the poison that killed Lorien, a collection of knives, torches, and oil. No man has cause to possess these things here and no squire would do so without orders from his knightly master. We've found our murderer, <name>, but who is he working for?"}
Q[13662]={p="Has ascendido en la jerarquía corporativa de la Hermandad, <race>. Hemos empezado a verte con buenos ojos. ¡Es todo un logro!\n\nSi te interesa trabajar más y ganarte más respeto entre nosotros, escucha.\n\nPodemos refinar el flujo ardiente añadiendo un simple residuo de hierro negro a la mezcla. El residuo de hierro negro se puede encontrar en las Profundidades de la Montaña Negra.\n\n¡Tráeme todo el residuo de hierro negro que encuentres!",pEN="You've worked your way up through the Brotherhood's corporate hierarchy, <race>. We have begun to look favorably upon you. Quite an accomplishment!\n\nIf you're interested in more work and earning more respect amongst us, listen up.\n\nWe can refine the fiery flux by adding a simple Dark Iron residue to the mix. The Dark Iron residue can be found in Blackrock Depths.\n\nBring me all the Dark Iron residue you find!",c="继续拿残油来！",cEN="Keep the residue pouring in!"}
Q[13663]={d="我们必须调查清楚，是谁把这个黑骑士派到锦标赛上来的，杀死这些参赛者又会给他的主人带来什么好处。\n\n肯瑞托的代表愿意帮助我们调查这件事情，他为我们提供了一件必要的工具。\n\n拿着这条魔法缰绳，到比武场东侧的黑骑士营地去，用它控制黑骑士的狮鹫。缰绳上的魔法会强迫狮鹫把你带到它主人的家里去。调查那个地方，然后回来向我报告。",dEN="We must discover who sent the Black Knight to the tournament and what his master hopes to gain by killing the competitors.\n\nThe Kirin Tor has offered to help in this matter and provided us with something to help our search.\n\nTake this enchanted bridle to the Black Knight's camp on the eastern edge of the tournament grounds and use it to gain control over the Black Knight's gryphon. The bridle's magic will force the gryphon to take you to his master's home. Search it and return with anything you find.",o="使用魔法缰绳控制黑骑士的狮鹫，骑着它飞到目的地，然后找到被偷走的锦标赛邀请函和黑骑士的命令，并把它们带回银色比武场，交给北伐军战士莱达拉。",oEN="Use the Enchanted Bridle to gain control of the Black Knight's Gryphon and ride it to its destination. Once you have arrived, recover the Stolen Tournament Invitation and the Black Knight's Orders and bring them to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你有何发现？",pEN="What did you discover?",c="<El rostro de la Crusader Rhydalla palidece al leer las órdenes.>\n\nEsto solo puede significar una cosa, <name>. ¡El Caballero Negro es miembro del Culto de los Malditos y ha sido enviado por Arthas para desbaratar el torneo!\n\nEl Caballero Negro ha demostrado ser un combatiente temible, y tendrás que ser igual de bueno si quieres enfrentarte a él. Cuando seas un campeón, regresa a mí y encontraremos la forma de asegurar su derrota.",cEN="<Crusader Rhydalla's face pales as she reads the orders.>\n\nThis can only mean one thing, <name>. The Black Knight is a member of the Cult of the Damned and has been sent by Arthas to disrupt the tournament!\n\nThe Black Knight has proven himself a fearsome combatant, and you will need to be every bit as good if you wish to face him. When you are a champion, return to me and we'll find a way to ensure his defeat."}
Q[13664]={d="我们必须阻止黑骑士的计划，并且让我们的敌人知道，我们不会就这样坐视不管，听任他们杀害我们的勇士。\n\n现在，他应该已经开始怀疑有人在跟踪他了。$n，你必须在光天化日、众目睽睽之下挑战他，这样他就没法拒绝应战，也不能借着夜色的掩护搞些谋杀之类的勾当。\n\n骑着我的银色军马去作战吧，它就在兽栏中休息。\n\n与冠军赛场中的侍从加文谈一谈，他会把黑骑士叫来参加战斗，而你要让他为自己的罪行付出代价。",dEN="We must put an end to the Black Knight's scheming, and show those who oppose us that we will not stand by and allow our champions to be murdered.\n\nBy now, he will suspect that someone is on his trail. Challenge him in the light of day, where he cannot refuse or murder in the dark, <name>.\n\nUse my argent charger for the battle. It's housed in the stables.\n\nSpeak to Squire Cavin at the Ring of Champions. The squire will call the Black Knight to battle, but you will make him answer for his crimes.",o="击败黑骑士，然后向银色比武场的北伐军战士莱达拉复命。",oEN="Defeat the Black Knight and then speak to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="Con la muerte del Caballero Negro, el torneo podrá cumplir su propósito una vez más. Los campeones de la Horda y la Alianza podrán demostrar su destreza con las armas y entrenar para el día en que Arthas y sus esbirros dejen de amenazarnos.\n\nTienes el agradecimiento de la Cruzada Argéntea, <name>, y el de todos los que han respondido a nuestra llamada.",cEN="With the death of the Black Knight, the tournament may once again serve its purpose. The champions of the Horde and Alliance may demonstrate their skill at arms and train for the day when Arthas and his minions will no longer threaten us.\n\nYou have the thanks of the Argent Crusade, <name>, and that of all who have answered our call."}
Q[13665]={d="El gran combate cuerpo a cuerpo es la competición más importante del torneo. El pueblo de Ventormenta adora a sus caballeros y espera verlos alzarse con la victoria. A tal fin, han perfeccionado sus habilidades contra otros valerosos.\n\nSugiero que hagas lo mismo.\n\nVe a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón, equipa tu lanza, monta el corcel de Elwynn y desafía a los valerosos. Aguardan en La Liza de los Valerosos de la Alianza que hay justo al salir de nuestra tienda.|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. The people of Stormwind adore their knights and are looking forward to seeing us win the melee. To that end, they've been honing their skills against the other valiants.\n\nI suggest you do the same.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Elwynn steed, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Alliance Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的约瑟夫·霍雷上尉。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Captain Joseph Holley at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="Bien hecho. Entrenar contra los otros valientes es una de las mejores formas de prepararte para la competición del torneo. Sé que harás que Ventormenta se sienta orgullosa, <name>.",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make Stormwind proud, <name>."}
Q[13666]={d="Algunos campeones creen que un arma antigua originaria de Rasganorte les dará suerte en el torneo. He accedido a ayudarles a buscar esa arma.\n\nCuenta una antigua leyenda de las Colinas Pardas que hay una doncella bajo el aspecto de una rana que protege la espada que tanto tiempo lleva custodiando. Vive entre las ranas de lago a las orillas del Lago Fresno, al este del Puesto Fresno. Cuentan que solo un beso voluntarioso puede romper la maldición. Ponte este cacao antes de besar nada, $n, si no te saldrán pupas.",dEN="Some of the champions believe an ancient weapon born of Northrend will bring them luck in the tourney. I have agreed to help them search for these weapons.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="Entonces, ¿hay algo de verdad en esos viejos relatos? Parece que no mentían sobre la calidad de la hoja. Bien hecho, <name>. El campeón que la empuñe será un hombre afortunado, sin duda.",cEN="So there is some truth to those old tales? It seems they did not lie about the quality of the blade. Well done, <name>. The champion who wields it will be a lucky man, indeed."}
Q[13667]={d="我们诚挚地邀请你参加银色锦标赛，与那些英勇抗击天灾军团的战士们共同磨练作战技巧与勇气。我们之间有许多分歧，然而现在，英雄们，我们必须团结在同一面旗帜下，考验彼此的战斗能力，准备对抗我们共同的敌人。\n\n奥术师泰利斯是银色盟约派驻锦标赛的代表，他会将你的名字登记在名单上，安排你开始训练。你可以在场地东北方的联盟大帐中找到他。",dEN="We have invited you here to test your skill and valor against others who have bravely opposed the Scourge. Many have been our divisions, but the time has come for heroes fighting under all banners to test their blades against one another in preparation for facing our mutual enemy.\n\nArcanist Taelis is the Silver Covenant's representative to the tournament and he'll enter your name into the rolls and begin your training. Seek him out inside the large Alliance tent in the northeastern part of the grounds.",o="与银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯谈一谈，报名参加锦标赛。",oEN="Speak with Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament grounds to enroll in the tournament.",c="He anotado tu nombre en las listas, <name>. Como aspirante, entrenarás con otros que deseen competir en el torneo y perfeccionarás tus habilidades de combate montado. Una vez que te hayas demostrado capaz, se te permitirá entrar en el rango de competición más bajo en nombre de tu capital.",cEN="I have entered your name in the rolls, <name>. As an aspirant you will train with others who wish to compete in the tournament and hone your mounted combat skills. Once you have proven yourself, you will be allowed to enter the lowest rank of competition on behalf of your capital city."}
Q[13668]={d="我们诚挚地邀请你参加银色锦标赛，与那些英勇抗击天灾军团的战士们共同磨练作战技巧与勇气。我们之间有许多分歧，然而现在，英雄们，我们必须团结在同一面旗帜下，考验彼此的战斗能力，准备对抗我们共同的敌人。\n\n魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷是夺日者派驻锦标赛的代表，他会将你的名字登记在名单上，安排你开始训练。你可以在场地东南方的部落大帐中找到他。",dEN="We have invited you here to test your skill and valor against others who have bravely opposed the Scourge. Many have been our divisions, but the time has come for heroes fighting under all banners to test their blades against one another in preparation for facing our mutual enemy.\n\nMagister Edien Sunhollow is the Sunreaver representative to the tournament and he'll enter your name into the rolls and begin your training. Seek him out inside the large Horde tent in the southeastern part of the grounds.",o="与银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷谈一谈，报名参加锦标赛。",oEN="Speak with Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament grounds to enroll in the tournament.",c="He anotado tu nombre en las listas, <name>. Como aspirante, entrenarás con otros que deseen competir en el torneo y perfeccionarás tus habilidades de combate montado. Una vez que te hayas demostrado capaz, se te permitirá entrar en el rango de competición más bajo en nombre de tu capital.",cEN="I have entered your name in the rolls, <name>. As an aspirant you will train with others who wish to compete in the tournament and hone your mounted combat skills. Once you have proven yourself, you will be allowed to enter the lowest rank of competition on behalf of your capital city."}
Q[13669]={d="我们的勇士对诺森德出产的古代武器都很有兴趣。\n\n一位吟游诗人告诉我，如果哪位旅人能给一位孤独的女士带去几朵冬水仙，就可以获得她的礼物。那些花只生长在铁墙大坝下游的浮冰上，就在晶歌森林的西北部，与冰冠冰川交界的地方。去摘些这种花，然后把花带到龙骨荒野东北部的达克玛尔湖去，就在该地区与祖达克、灰熊丘陵的交界处。",dEN="Our champions have taken a liking to ancient weapons produced here in Northrend.\n\nI've heard the bards telling tales of travelers offering winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to the circle of lamps in Drak'Mar Lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills. Ask the lonely maiden for a worthy blade.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的的奥术师泰利斯。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这把剑刃的精致的质量与平衡度是无可挑剔的。现在我知道为何联盟的勇士们如此渴求这些武器。",cEN="There's no doubt that this is a blade of exquisite quality and balance. Now I understand why these weapons are so coveted among the champions of the Alliance."}
Q[13670]={d="El escudero del Gran Campeón de Forjaz me contó una historia intrigante.\n\nAl sur del Bosque Canto de Cristal, vigilando la salida hacia el Vicio de Cristal está Lord Llama Perpetua. Mátalo y toma su ascua de llama perpetua.\n\nLlévala al centro del Lago Aliento Invernal, en la parte norte del Fiordo Aquilonal y úsala para liberar a la doncella encerrada en hielo. Es la guardiana de una espada ancestral y recompensará a su libertad$gor:ora;.\n\nDemuestra tu valía y consigue la espada que ha estado custodiando durante tanto tiempo, $n.",dEN="The Ironforge grand champion's squire told me an intriguing story.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯。",oEN="Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑真的跟侍从说得一样好，但是他怎么知道这件事的？不管他了，它一定能让新的持有者大显神威。或许铁炉堡的冠军正是适合的人。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the squire said it would be, but where did he find out about it? No matter; it will serve its new owner well. Perhaps it's only fair that Ironforge's grand champion be the one to wield it."}
Q[13671]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。虽然你已经学会了骑乘作战的要领，也不要把这么多年来积累的战斗技巧都给抛到脑后去。我们需要你用实际行动证明，你可以充满荣誉与勇气地面对天灾军团，这样你才有资格参加我们的锦标赛。\n\n到冰冠冰川去，把你在那里遇到的所有天灾军团成员都给干掉。不过你要离轰炸场远一些，那里的敌人实在是太多了。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you learn to master mounted combat, do not forget to practice the skills that have served you well all these years. Show us that you can face the Scourge with honor and bravery, and you will earn your right to compete in this tournament.\n\nTravel to Icecrown and slay any Scourge you see there, but stay clear of the Bombardment, where you would be overwhelmed.",o="银色比武场的阿瓦雷斯·迅击要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭8名天灾军团士兵。除了轰炸场之外，在冰冠冰川的任何地方遇到的天灾都可以。",oEN="Avareth Swiftstrike at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 8 Icecrown Scourge. You may kill Scourge in any part of Icecrown except the Bombardment.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="['Has demostrado ser un combatiente capaz, <name>, y servirás de ejemplo para el resto de los aspirantes que claman por competir en nombre de la Alianza.']",cEN="You have shown yourself a capable combatant, <name> and you will serve as an example to the rest of the aspirants who clamor to compete on behalf of the Alliance."}
Q[13672]={d="Cuando domines las habilidades del aspirante, podrás optar a aceptar el desafío del aspirante. El desafío probará tus habilidades en combate sobre montura y evaluará si estás a punto para recibir el título de $gValeroso:Valerosa;. Si pasas la prueba, podrás unirte a la delegación de tu capital en calidad de $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista; para aceptar el desafío, ven a verme.",dEN="When you have mastered the skills of the aspirant, you may choose to take the aspirant's challenge. The challenge will test your mounted combat skills and assess whether or not you're prepared to become a valiant. Should you pass, you will be able to join your capital city's delegation as a valiant.\n\nWhen you are ready to begin the challenge, return to me.",o="将15枚候选者的徽记交给银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯，证明你已经准备好迎接候选者的挑战了。",oEN="Present Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament with 15 Aspirant's Seals to signify you're ready to undergo the aspirant's challenge.",p="你想要接受勇士的挑战吗？",pEN="Do you wish to take the aspirant's challenge?",c="很好，让我安排一下。",cEN="Very well, I will make the arrangements."}
Q[13673]={d="Algunos campeones creen que un arma antigua originaria de Rasganorte les dará suerte en el torneo. He accedido a ayudarles a buscar esa arma.\n\nCuenta una antigua leyenda de las Colinas Pardas que hay una doncella bajo el aspecto de una rana que protege la espada que tanto tiempo lleva custodiando. Vive entre las ranas de lago a las orillas del Lago Fresno, al este del Puesto Fresno. Cuentan que solo un beso voluntarioso puede romper la maldición. Ponte este cacao antes de besar nada, $n, si no te saldrán pupas.",dEN="Some of the champions believe an ancient weapon born of Northrend will bring them luck in the tourney. I have agreed to help them search for these weapons.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="Entonces, ¿hay algo de verdad en esos viejos relatos? Parece que no mentían sobre la calidad de la hoja. Bien hecho, <name>. El campeón que la empuñe será un hombre afortunado, sin duda.",cEN="So there is some truth to those old tales? It seems they did not lie about the quality of the blade. Well done, <name>. The champion who wields it will be a lucky man, indeed."}
Q[13674]={d="我们的勇士对诺森德出产的古代武器都很有兴趣。\n\n一位吟游诗人告诉我，如果哪位旅人能给一位孤独的女士带去一朵冬水仙，就可以获得她的礼物。那些花只生长在铁墙大坝下游的浮冰上，就在晶歌森林的西北部，与冰冠冰川交界的地方。去摘些这种花，然后把花带到龙骨荒野东北部的达克玛尔湖去，就在该地区与祖达克、灰熊丘陵的交界处。在一圈明灯中找到那位女士。你可以找她要一把珍贵的宝剑。",dEN="Our champions have taken a liking to ancient weapons produced here in Northrend.\n\nI've heard the bards telling tales of travelers offering winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to the circle of lamps in Drak'Mar Lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills. Ask the lonely maiden for a worthy blade.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这把剑刃的精致的质量与平衡度是无可挑剔的。现在我知道为何联盟的勇士们如此渴求这些武器。",cEN="There's no doubt that this is a blade of exquisite quality and balance. Now I understand why these weapons are so coveted among the champions of the Alliance."}
Q[13675]={d="有一位来自奥格瑞玛的勇士给我讲了一个有趣的故事。\n\n转至晶歌森林的南部，你可以在水晶裂痕的出口上方找到恒焰领主。杀死他，拿到他身上的恒焰灰烬。\n\n带着恒焰灰烬转至嚎风峡湾北部的冬息湖中心，解救一位被寒冰困在那里的女士。她守护着一把古代宝剑，能够解救她的人就可以获得那把宝剑作为奖励。\n\n证明你的能力，拿到她守护了许久的宝剑吧，$n。",dEN="I heard an interesting story from one of the Ogrimmar valiants.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷。",oEN="Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑真的跟骁士说得一样好，但是他怎么知道这件事的？不管他了，它一定能让新的持有者大显神威。或许奥格瑞玛的冠军正是适合的人。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the valiant said it would be, but where did he find out about it? No matter; it will serve its new owner well. Perhaps it's only fair that Orgrimmar's grand champion be the one to wield it."}
Q[13676]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。虽然你已经学会了骑乘作战的要领，也不要把这么多年来积累的战斗技巧都给抛到脑后去。我们需要你用实际行动证明，你可以充满荣誉与勇气地面对天灾军团，这样你才有资格参加我们的锦标赛。\n\n到冰冠冰川去，把你在那里遇到的所有天灾军团成员都给干掉。不过你要离轰炸场远一些，那里的敌人实在是太多了。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you learn to master mounted combat, do not forget to practice the skills that have served you well all these years. Show us that you can face the Scourge with honor and bravery, and you will earn your right to compete in this tournament.\n\nTravel to Icecrown and slay any Scourge you see there, but stay clear of the Bombardment, where you would be overwhelmed.",o="银色比武场的阿玛里尔·火盟要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭8名天灾军团士兵。除了轰炸场之外，在冰冠冰川的任何地方遇到的天灾都可以。",oEN="Amariel Sunsworn at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 8 Icecrown Scourge. You may kill Scourge in any part of Icecrown except the Bombardment.",c="Te has mostrado como un combatiente capaz, <name>, y servirás de ejemplo para el resto de los aspirantes que claman por competir en nombre de la Horda.",cEN="You have shown yourself a capable combatant, <name> and you will serve as an example to the rest of the aspirants who clamor to compete on behalf of the Horde."}
Q[13677]={d="En la mayoría de las competiciones del torneo es indispensable que domines una montura en combate. Hemos instalado muñecos de entrenamiento en la parte norte de los Campos del Torneo para que te acostumbres al combate sobre montura.\n\nVe a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón, equipa tu lanza y monta sobre un halcón zancudo Atracasol. Acostúmbrate a la montura y usa sus habilidades para derrotar a los tres tipos de muñecos de entrenamiento.|n",dEN="Most of the tournament's competitions require competitors to master the command of a mount in battle. In order to familiarize you with mounted combat, we've put up training dummies all over the northern part of the tournament grounds.\n\nVisit the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up on the Sunreaver hawkstrider. Familiarize yourself with the mount and use its abilities to defeat the three different kinds of training dummies.",o="使用刺击技能攻击一个近战目标5次，使用碎盾技能攻击2个脆弱的远程目标，使用冲锋技能攻击2个脆弱的冲锋目标，然后回到银色比武场，向加拉希亚·晨光复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Strike a Melee Target with Thrust 5 times, use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, use Charge on 2 vulnerable Charge Targets, and then return to Galathia Brightdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or the Sunreaver Pavilion.",c="Bien hecho, <name>. El combate montado suele ser difícil de aprender para aquellos acostumbrados a luchar a pie. No tengo dudas de que seguirás mejorando con la práctica, algo que no puedo decir de algunos guerreros.",cEN="Well done, <name>. Mounted combat is often hard to pick up for those accustomed to fighting on foot. I have no doubt that you'll continue to improve with practice, which is more than I can say for some warriors."}
Q[13678]={d="Cuando domines las habilidades del aspirante, podrás optar a aceptar el desafío del aspirante. El desafío probará tus habilidades en combate sobre montura y evaluará si estás a punto para recibir el título de $gValeroso:Valerosa;. Si pasas la prueba, podrás unirte a la delegación de tu capital en calidad de $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nCuando estés $glisto:lista; para aceptar el desafío, ven a verme.",dEN="When you have mastered the skills of the aspirant, you may choose to take the aspirant's challenge. The challenge will test your mounted combat skills and assess whether or not you're prepared to become a valiant. Should you pass, you will be able to join your capital city's delegation as a valiant.\n\nWhen you are ready to begin the challenge, return to me.",o="将15枚候选者的徽记交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷，证明你已经准备好迎接候选者的挑战了。",oEN="Present Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament with 15 Aspirant's Seals to signify you're ready to undergo the aspirant's challenge.",p="你想要接受勇士的挑战吗？",pEN="Do you wish to take the aspirant's challenge?",c="很好，让我安排一下。",cEN="Very well, I will make the arrangements."}
Q[13679]={d="Te has entrenado duro como aspirante, $n, y ha llegado la hora de que se pongan a prueba tus habilidades en combate sobre montura frente a un contrincante diestro.\n\nEquipa tu lanza, luego ve a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón y monta el corcel Quel'dorei de establo.\n\nEn La Liza de los Aspirantes en la parte norte de los Campos del Torneo, encontrarás a un joven escudero humano llamado David. Te preguntará si estás $glisto:lista; y llamará a tu contrincante.\n\nBuena suerte, $n. Que tu montura se mantenga firme y que tu puntería sea buena.",dEN="You have trained hard as an aspirant, <name>, and now the time has come to test your mounted combat skills against a skilled opponent.\n\nEquip your lance, then go to the stables outside the pavilion and mount up on the stabled Quel'dorei steed.\n\nAt the Aspirants' Ring on the northern side of the tournament grounds, you'll find Squire David. He'll make certain that you're ready for the fight and call out your opponent.\n\nGood luck, <name>. May your horse be steady and your aim true.",o="和侍从大卫谈一谈，召唤你的对手。击败银色勇士之后回到银色比武场，向奥术师泰利斯复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire David to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Valiant, return to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你面对了你的挑战吗？",pEN="Have you faced your challenge?",c="Es hora de felicitarte, <name>. Has vencido a tu oponente y te has ganado el derecho a ascender al rango de valiente.",cEN="Congratulations are in order, <name>. You have bested your challenger and earned the right to advance to the rank of valiant."}
Q[13680]={d="Te has entrenado duro como aspirante, $n, y ha llegado la hora de que se pongan a prueba tus habilidades en combate sobre montura frente a un contrincante experto.\n\nEquipa tu lanza, luego ve a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón y monta el halcón zancudo Atracasol.\n\nEn La Liza de los Aspirantes en la parte norte de los Campos del Torneo, encontrarás a un joven escudero humano llamado David. Te preguntará si estás $glisto:lista; y llamará a tu contrincante.\n\nBuena suerte, $n. Que tu montura se mantenga firme y que tu puntería sea buena.",dEN="You have trained hard as an aspirant, <name>, and now the time has come to test your mounted combat skills against an experienced opponent.\n\nEquip your lance, then go to the stables outside the pavilion and mount the Sunreaver hawkstrider.\n\nAt the Aspirants' Ring on the northern side of the tournament grounds, you'll find a human child called Squire David. He'll ask if you're ready for the fight and call out your opponent.\n\nGood luck, <name>. May your mount be steady and your aim true.",o="和侍从大卫谈一谈，召唤你的对手。击败银色勇士之后回到银色比武场，向魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷复命。",oEN="Speak with Squire David to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Valiant, return to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你面对了你的挑战吗？",pEN="Have you faced your challenge?",c="Es hora de felicitarte, <name>. Has vencido a tu oponente y te has ganado el derecho a ascender al rango de valiente.",cEN="Congratulations are in order, <name>. You have bested your challenger and earned the right to advance to the rank of valiant."}
Q[13682]={d="在你找出诅咒教派的间谍以后，大领主提里奥·弗丁安排了双倍的卫兵。弗丁大人认为诅咒教派不会仅仅因为失去一个黑骑士就善罢甘休。\n\n根据天爪龙斥候的报告，有一支诅咒教派的部队正准备袭击我们，他们的首领是一条名叫冰喉的冰霜巨龙。如果不阻止他们的话，赛场就会受到攻击。斥候们说，冰喉就盘旋在我们的西南方向，铁墙大坝和奥尔杜萨交界的地方。",dEN="Highlord Tirion Fordring has doubled the guard since your exposure of the Cult of the Damned's infiltrator. He doesn't believe that they will stop just because their Black Knight has been defeated.\n\nOur skytalon scouts have reported sighting a frost wyrm named Chillmaw leading a cult raiding party. If we don't intercept them, the tournament will come under attack. The scouts reporting seeing Chillmaw to the southwest, flying over the area between the Ironwall Rampart and Aldur'thar.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要你消灭3名诅咒教派投弹手，并击败冰喉。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament wants you to defeat Chillmaw and 3 Cultist Bombardiers.",p="你击败了诅咒教派的突袭队吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the Cult of the Damned raiding party?",c="<name>, tú y tus aliados habéis salvado el torneo de un ataque devastador. Aunque nuestros jinetes de skytalon son valientes, lo tienen difícil para mantener la paz en los terrenos del torneo y les costaría mucho defender los cielos contra el ataque del culto. Tienes el agradecimiento de la Cruzada Argenta y de todos los que se han reunido aquí para competir.",cEN="<name>, you and your allies have spared the tournament from a devastating attack. Though our skytalon riders are brave, they have their hands full keeping the peace on the tournament grounds and would be hard-pressed to defend the skies against the cult's attack. You have the thanks of the Argent Crusade and all who have gathered here to compete."}
Q[13684]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Ventormenta, $n. Ahora preséntate ante el mariscal Jacob Alerius, que dirige la delegación de Ventormenta. Como Gran Campeón de Ventormenta, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Stormwind, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Marshal Jacob Alerius, who leads the Stormwind delegation. As Stormwind's grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con el mariscal Jacob Alerius en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Ventormenta.",oEN="Speak with Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Stormwind.",c="Bienvenido a bordo, entonces, valiente <name>. La delegación de Ventormenta se enorgullece de contarte entre sus miembros.",cEN="Welcome aboard then, Valiant <name>. The Stormwind delegation is proud to count you among its members."}
Q[13685]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Forjaz, $n. Ahora preséntate ante Lana Martillotenaz, que dirige la delegación de Forjaz. Como Gran Campeona de Forjaz, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Ironforge, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Lana Stouthammer, who leads the Ironforge delegation. As Ironforge's grand champion, she will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Lana Martillotenaz en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Forjaz.",oEN="Speak with Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Ironforge.",c="很高兴见到你，勇士。铁炉堡需要像你这样的参赛者好在联赛中获胜。",cEN="It's good to meet you, valiant. Ironforge needs competitors like you to prevail in the tournament."}
Q[13688]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Gnomeregan, $n. Ahora preséntate ante Ambrose Chisparrayo, que dirige la delegación de Gnomeregan. Como Gran Campeón de los gnomos, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Gnomeregan, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Ambrose Boltspark, who leads the Gnomeregan delegation. As the gnomish grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Ambrose Chisparrayo en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Gnomeregan.",oEN="Speak with Ambrose Boltspark at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Gnomeregan.",c="Bienvenido a bordo, entonces, valiente <name>. La delegación de Gnomeregan se enorgullece de contarte entre sus miembros.",cEN="Welcome aboard then, Valiant <name>. The Gnomeregan delegation is proud to count you among its members."}
Q[13689]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Darnassus, $n. Ahora preséntate ante Jaelyne Unicanto, que dirige la delegación de Darnassus. Como Gran Campeona de los elfos de la noche, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Darnassus, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Jaelyne Evensong, who leads the Darnassus delegation. As the night elf grand champion, she will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Jaelyne Unicanto en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Darnassus.",oEN="Speak with Jaelyne Evensong at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Darnassus.",c="Bienvenido a la delegación del torneo de Darnassus, <name>. Será un placer entrenar y competir junto a ti.",cEN="Welcome to the Darnassus tournament delegation, <name>. It will be a pleasure to train and compete alongside you."}
Q[13690]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de El Exodar, $n. Ahora preséntate ante Colosos, que dirige la delegación de El Exodar. Como Gran Campeón draenei, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of the Exodar, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Colosos, who leads the Exodar delegation. As the draenei grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Colosos en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de El Exodar.",oEN="Speak with Colosos at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of the Exodar.",c="Bienvenido a bordo, valiente <name>. La delegación de Exodar se enorgullece de contarte entre sus miembros.",cEN="Welcome aboard then, Valiant <name>. The Exodar's delegation is proud to count you among its members."}
Q[13691]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Orgrimmar, $n. Ahora habla con Mokra el Trituracráneos, que dirige a los competidores de Orgrimmar. Como Gran Campeón de Orgrimmar, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Orgrimmar, <name>. Now, you should speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher, who leads Orgrimmar's competitors. As Orgrimmar's grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Mokra el Trituracráneos en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Orgrimmar.",oEN="Speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Orgrimmar.",c="你想要替奥格瑞玛参赛？别以为你打赢了几个假人就觉得自己赢了，不过你将会和最精英的高手一起接受训练。",cEN="So you want to compete for Orgrimmar? Just because you've beaten up a few dummies doesn't mean you'll win, but you'll be training with the best from now on."}
Q[13693]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Sen'jin, $n. Ahora habla con Zul'tore, que dirige a los guerreros de Sen'jin. Como Gran Campeón trol, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Sen'jin, <name>. Now, you should speak with Zul'tore who leads Sen'jin's warriors. As the troll grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Zul'tore en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Sen'jin.",oEN="Speak with Zul'tore at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Sen'jin.",c="你觉得自己能够替森金出赛？我想我们很快就知道。",cEN="You think you have what it takes to compete for Sen'jin? I think we'll be finding out."}
Q[13694]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Cima del Trueno, $n. Ahora habla con Runok Ferocrín, que dirige a los competidores de Cima del Trueno. Como Gran Campeón de Cima del Trueno, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Thunder Bluff, <name>. Now, you should speak with Runok Wildmane, who leads Thunder Bluff's competitors. As Thunder Bluff's grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Runok Ferocrín en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Cima del Trueno.",oEN="Speak with Runok Wildmane at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Thunder Bluff.",c="En nombre de Thunder Bluff y sus guerreros, te doy la bienvenida, <name>. Lucha siempre con honor y valentía bajo nuestro estandarte.",cEN="On behalf of Thunder Bluff and its warriors, I welcome you, <name>. Always fight honorably and bravely beneath our banner."}
Q[13695]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Entrañas, $n. Ahora habla con el mortacechador Visceri, que dirige la delegación de Entrañas. Como Gran Campeón, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of the Undercity, <name>. Now, you should speak with Deathstalker Visceri, who leads the Undercity delegation. As grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con el mortacechador Visceri en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Entrañas.",oEN="Speak with Deathstalker Visceri at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of the Undercity.",c="Bienvenido a la delegación de Entrañas, <name>. Como valiente, entrenarás con nosotros para prepararte para el nivel más alto de competición.",cEN="Welcome to the Undercity delegation. <name>. As a valiant, you'll train with us to prepare you for the highest level of competition."}
Q[13696]={d="Has demostrado que eres $gdigno:digna; de competir bajo el estandarte de Lunargenta, $n. Ahora habla con Eressea Cantoalba, que dirige la delegación de Lunargenta. Como Gran Campeona de Lunargenta, te inscribirá en el torneo en nombre de la ciudad, supervisará tu entrenamiento y te pondrá a prueba para convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa;.\n\nHa sido un honor trabajar contigo, $n, te deseo suerte en la competición que te espera.",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Silvermoon, <name>. Now, you should speak with Eressea Dawnsinger, who leads the Silvermoon delegation. As Silvermoon's grand champion, she will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="Habla con Eressea Cantoalba en los Campos del Torneo Argenta para convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Lunargenta.",oEN="Speak with Eressea Dawnsinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Silvermoon.",c="所以你要为银月城参赛？很好。我会把你加入名单中，你可以立刻开始跟其它骁士一起活动。",cEN="So you want to compete for Silvermoon? Very well. I'll add you to the rolls and you may begin working with the other valiants immediately."}
Q[13697]={d="En tu entrenamiento como $gValeroso:Valerosa; tendrás la oportunidad de poner a prueba tu habilidad contra valerosos que representan a otras ciudades. Aunque las batallas de $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; no son parte formal de la competición, aprenderás una valiosa lección sobre los estilos de lucha y las debilidades de tus oponentes.\n\nLos valerosos son gente voluntariosa que compite entre sí en pos del honor y la notoriedad.\n\nEntrénate como $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; hasta que confíes en tu habilidad para derrotar a todo aquel que se enfrente a ti. Después tráeme los sellos que hayas ganado.",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
Q[13699]={d="Ya casi estás $glisto:lista; para competir en el gran combate cuerpo a cuerpo en nombre de Ventormenta. Para demostrar que eres $gdigno:digna; de entrar en las listas en nombre de nuestra ciudad, debes derrotar a un campeón de la Cruzada Argenta.\n\nVe a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón, equipa tu lanza y monta. Habla con el escudero Danny en La Liza de los Valerosos Argenta en el extremo oeste de los campos. El escudero llamará a tu oponente cuando estés $glisto:lista;.\n\nCuando la batalla haya concluido, hablaremos del resultado.",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete on behalf of Stormwind in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy to enter the lists on behalf of our city, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",c="Has demostrado ser digno del título de campeón, <name>. Competirás en el nivel más alto del torneo en nombre de Ventormenta, participando en la gran batalla cuerpo a cuerpo con tu arma lista y nuestro poderoso estandarte a tus espaldas.",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level on behalf of Stormwind, riding in the grand melee with your weapon at the ready and our mighty pennant at your back."}
Q[13702]={d="Felicidades, $n. Has dominado muchos tipos de combate y has superado todos los desafíos a los que te has enfrentado. No cabe duda de que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para competir con los mejores guerreros que se han reunido en este torneo, contra los campeones de las ciudades capitales.\n\nLa justicar Mariel Corazón Veraz ha solicitado hablar contigo, $n, e introducirte formalmente en el gran combate cuerpo a cuerpo de los campeones.",dEN="Congratulations, <name>. You have mastered many kinds of combat and overcome all the challenges you've faced. There can be no doubt that you are ready to compete with the best warriors who have gathered at the tournament, against the champions of the capital cities.\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="Te doy la bienvenida como campeón del torneo, <name>. Como campeón, podrás competir por el gran campeonato del torneo. También puedes optar por convertirte en un valiente con la delegación de otra ciudad de la Alianza y, con el tiempo, también en un campeón para esa ciudad.\n\nTodos los campeones deben contar con la asistencia de un escudero, <name>, y tú no eres la excepción. Permíteme nombrar a uno de los nuestros para que te acompañe en la batalla. Él llevará con orgullo el estandarte de cualquier ciudad que te haya nombrado campeón.",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Alliance city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13703]={d="Te doy la bienvenida, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Ya he oído hablar de tu destreza en el combate. ¿Deseas unirte a la delegación de Forjaz en el torneo?\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como has hecho antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Forjaz tu escudero tendrá la opción de llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. Do you seek to join Ironforge's tournament delegation?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Ironforge, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla de nuevo con Lana Martillotenaz si quieres convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de Forjaz.",oEN="Speak with Lana Stouthammer again if you wish to become a valiant of Ironforge.",c="你决定加入我们让我倍感骄傲，我知道你一定会在战场上大放异彩。",cEN="We are proud that you have decided to join us and I know you will shine on the field."}
Q[13704]={d="Te doy la bienvenida, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Ya he oído hablar de tu destreza en combate. La delegación de Gnomeregan podría sacar partido de verdad a $gun:una; $c como tú.\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Gnomeregan tu escudero podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. Gnomeregan's delegation could really benefit from a <class> like you.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Gnomeregan, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla de nuevo con Ambrose Chisparrayo si quieres convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de Gnomeregan.",oEN="Speak with Ambrose Boltspark again if you wish to become a valiant of Gnomeregan.",c="Estamos orgullosos de contarte entre nosotros, <name>, y estamos deseando entrenar contigo.",cEN="We're proud to count you among us, <name>, and we look forward to training with you."}
Q[13705]={d="Te doy la bienvenida, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Ya he oído hablar de tus gestas. ¿Deseas unirte a la delegación de El Exodar en el torneo?\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de El Exodar, tu escudero podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your deeds has already reached my ears. Do you wish to join the Exodar's tournament delegation?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of the Exodar, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla con Colosos de nuevo si deseas convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de El Exodar.",oEN="Speak with Colosos again if you wish to become a valiant of the Exodar.",c="Es bueno tenerte en nuestro equipo, <name>. Todos nos beneficiaremos de entrenar contigo.",cEN="It's good to have you on our team, <name>. We will all benefit from training with you."}
Q[13706]={d="Te doy la bienvenida, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Ya he oído hablar de tus logros y nos honraría que te unieras a la delegación de Darnassus.\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Darnassus, tu escudero podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Welcome, champion. I have heard of your accomplishments and we would be honored if you would join the delegation from Darnassus.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Darnassus, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla de nuevo con Jaelyne Unicanto si quieres convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de Darnassus.",oEN="Speak with Jaelyne Eveonsong again if you wish to become a valiant of Darnassus.",c="达纳苏斯的勇士将很荣幸与你并肩战斗与训练。",cEN="The warriors of Darnassus are honored to fight and train beside you."}
Q[13707]={d="¿Así que ahora eres $gun Campeón:una Campeona;? Entonces has demostrado ser $gun combatiente digno:una combatiente digna; y me llena de orgullo darte la bienvenida a nuestra delegación de Orgrimmar.\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Orgrimmar, tu brutito podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="So, you have become a champion? Then, you have proven yourself a worthy combatant and I would proudly welcome you into Orgrimmar's delegation.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Orgrimmar, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla de nuevo con Mokra el Trituracráneos si quieres convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de Orgrimmar.",oEN="Speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher again if you wish to become a valiant of Orgrimmar.",c="Bienvenido, entonces, <name>. Tengo ganas de verte entrenar con mis hombres.",cEN="Welcome, then, <name>. I look forward to watching you train with my men."}
Q[13708]={d="Saludos, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Si lo deseas, te doy la bienvenida a nuestra delegación de Sen'jin en el torneo.\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Sen'jin, tu brutito podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Greetings, champion. If you are willing, I would welcome you into Sen'jin's tournament delegation.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Sen'jin, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla de nuevo con Zul'tore si deseas convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Sen'jin.",oEN="Speak with Zul'tore again if you wish to become a valiant of Sen'jin.",c="我很高兴你决定加入我们，很期待你的表现。",cEN="I am glad that you have decided to join us and look forward to seeing you in action."}
Q[13709]={d="Te doy la bienvenida, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Como Gran Campeón de la delegación de Cima del Trueno, me honraría darte la bienvenida a nuestra organización, si así lo deseas.\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando te nombren $gCampeón:Campeona; de Cima del Trueno, tu brutito podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Welcome, champion. As grand champion of the Thunder Bluff delegation, I would be honored to welcome you into our ranks, if you are willing.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Thunder Bluff, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla de nuevo con Runok Ferocrín si quieres convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de Cima del Trueno.",oEN="Speak with Runok Wildmane again if you wish to become a valiant of Thunder Bluff.",c="Es un honor para mí que hayas elegido unirte a nuestra delegación. Sé que nos harás sentir orgullosos, <name>.",cEN="I am honored that you have chosen to join our delegation. I know you will make us proud, <name>."}
Q[13710]={d="Te doy la bienvenida, $gCampeón:Campeona;. La delegación de los Renegados siempre podría emplear a $gun:una; $c como tú. ¿Te gustaría unirte a nosotros?\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas nombrad$go Campeón:a Campeona; de Entrañas, tu brutito podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="Welcome, champion. The Forsaken delegation could always use more <class>s like you. Would you join us?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of the Undecity, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想要成为幽暗城的勇士，就再找死亡猎手维瑟里谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Deathstalker Visceri again if you wish to become a valiant of the Undercity.",c="Has elegido sabiamente, <name>. Ambos nos beneficiaremos de este acuerdo.",cEN="You have chosen wisely, <name>. Both of us will benefit from this arrangement."}
Q[13711]={d="¿Así que ahora eres $gun Campeón:una Campeona;? Entonces has demostrado ser $gun combatiente digno:una combatiente digna; y me llena de orgullo darte la bienvenida a nuestra delegación de Lunargenta.\n\nTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Lunargenta, tu brutito podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.",dEN="So, you have become a champion? Then, you have proven yourself a worthy combatant and I would proudly welcome you into Silvermoon's delegation.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Silvermoon, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="Habla de nuevo con Eressea Cantoalba si quieres convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de Lunargenta.",oEN="Speak with Eressea Dawnsinger again if you wish to become a valiant of Silvermoon.",c="Será un honor entrenar y competir contigo, <name>.",cEN="It will be an honor training and competing with you, <name>."}
Q[13713]={d="Ya casi estás $glisto:lista; para competir en el gran combate cuerpo a cuerpo en nombre de Forjaz. Para demostrar que eres $gdigno:digna; de entrar en las listas en nombre de nuestra ciudad, debes derrotar a un campeón de la Cruzada Argenta.\n\nVe a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón, equipa tu lanza y monta. Habla con el escudero Danny en La Liza de los Valerosos Argenta en el extremo oeste de los campos. El escudero llamará a tu oponente cuando estés $glisto:lista;.\n\nCuando la batalla haya concluido, hablaremos del resultado.",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete on behalf of Ironforge in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy to enter the lists on behalf of our city, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向兰娜·硬锤复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",c="Has demostrado ser digno del título de campeón, <name>. Competirás al nivel más alto del torneo en nombre de Forjaz, participando en la gran batalla cuerpo a cuerpo con tu arma lista y nuestro poderoso estandarte a tus espaldas.",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level on behalf of Ironforge, riding in the grand melee with your weapon at the ready and our mighty pennant at your back."}
Q[13714]={d="En tu entrenamiento como $gValeroso:Valerosa; tendrás la oportunidad de poner a prueba tu habilidad contra valerosos que representan a otras ciudades. Aunque las batallas de $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; no son parte formal de la competición, aprenderás una valiosa lección sobre los estilos de lucha y las debilidades de tus oponentes.\n\nLos valerosos son gente voluntariosa que compite entre sí en pos del honor y la notoriedad.\n\nEntrénate como $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; hasta que confíes en tu habilidad para derrotar a todo aquel que se enfrente a ti. Después tráeme los sellos que hayas ganado.",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的兰娜·硬锤。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
