Q[13759]={d="Es la última vez que entreno con un caballero de la Muerte.\n\nAl sur del Bosque Canto de Cristal, vigilando la salida hacia el Vicio de Cristal está Lord Llama Perpetua. Mátalo y toma su ascua de llama perpetua.\n\nLlévala al centro del Lago Aliento Invernal, en la parte norte del Fiordo Aquilonal y úsala para liberar a la doncella encerrada en hielo. Es la guardiana de una espada ancestral y recompensará a su libertad$gor:ora;.\n\nDemuestra tu valía y consigue la espada que ha estado custodiando durante tanto tiempo, $n.",dEN="That's the last time I ever spar with a death knight.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的亚琳·永歌。",oEN="Jaelyne Evensong at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring her Winter's Edge.",p="你拿到我要找的剑了吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade I seek?",c="La hoja es tan fina como dicen las historias. Parece que hay poca razón para completar las reparaciones de mi hoja habitual. Winter's Edge es muy superior y seguiré llevándola conmigo. Te doy las gracias, <name>.",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13760]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的伊蕾丝蒂亚·刃歌要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Illestria Bladesinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="Bienvenido de nuevo de tus ejercicios, <name>. Aunque estemos practicando para la competición, es bueno recordarnos que el Azote sigue ahí fuera.",cEN="Welcome back from your exercises, <name>. Even while we practice for the competition, it's good to remind ourselves that the Scourge is still out there."}
Q[13761]={d="总决赛是锦标赛中最重要的一场比赛。达纳苏斯的人民期待着我们获得这场比赛的胜利。为了这个目标，我们要不断地与其它的勇士们比武练习，提升自己的战斗能力。\n\n我推荐你也参加。\n\n到大帐外面的兽栏中去，拿起你的长枪，骑上兽栏中的达纳苏斯雾刃豹，去挑战其它的勇士吧。联盟勇士的练习场就在我们的帐篷外面，他们在那里等待你的挑战。",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. The people of Darnassus are looking forward to seeing us win the melee. To that end, they've been honing their skills against the valiants representing the other Alliance capitals.\n\nI suggest you do the same.\n\nThe Alliance Valiants' Ring is just outside our tent. Go to the stables on the outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Darnassian mistsaber, and challenge the valiants.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的艾莱·觅星。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Airae Starseeker at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="Bien hecho. Entrenar contra los otros valientes es una de las mejores formas de prepararse para la competición del torneo. Sé que harás que Darnassus se sienta orgulloso, <name>.",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make Darnassus proud, <name>."}
Q[13762]={d="He oído que los campeones de la Alianza están buscando espadas antiguas para sus guerreros. No podemos permitir que obtengan semejante ventaja.\n\nCuenta una antigua leyenda de las Colinas Pardas que hay una doncella bajo el aspecto de una rana que protege la espada que tanto tiempo lleva custodiando. Vive entre las ranas de lago a las orillas del Lago Fresno, al este del Puesto Fresno. Cuentan que solo un beso voluntarioso puede romper la maldición. Ponte este cacao antes de besar nada, $n, si no te saldrán pupas.",dEN="I've heard that the Alliance champions are seeking after ancient blades for their warriors. We can't afford to let them have that kind of advantage.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以传说是真的？这柄剑足以胜过所有联盟参赛者的配剑。",cEN="So the tales were true? This blade should be enough to best anything those Alliance entrants can come up with."}
Q[13763]={d="¡Maldita sea mi suerte!\n\n¡He perdido la espada del torneo! He oído que los bardos cuentan historias de viajantes que ofrecían jacintos de invierno a una doncella solitaria a cambio de obsequios. Esos jacintos solo crecen en el hielo de la Presa del Muro de Hierro, en el extremo noroeste del Bosque Canto de Cristal que limita con Corona de Hielo. Recoge las flores y llévalas al círculo de luces del Lago Drak'Mar al noreste del Cementerio de Dragones, cerca de Zul'Drak y las Colinas Pardas. Pídele a la doncella solitaria una espada digna.|n",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="Esta es una gran arma que me ayudará a aplastar a la competencia. Gracias, <name>.",cEN="This is a fine weapon that will help me crush the competition. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[13764]={d="¡Maldito sea ese caballero de la Muerte por romper mi espada!\n\nAl sur del Bosque Canto de Cristal, vigilando la salida hacia el Vicio de Cristal está Lord Llama Perpetua. Mátalo y toma su ascua de llama perpetua.\n\nLlévala al centro del Lago Aliento Invernal, en la parte norte del Fiordo Aquilonal y úsala para liberar a la doncella encerrada en hielo. Es la guardiana de una espada ancestral y recompensará a su libertad$gor:ora;.\n\nDemuestra tu valía y consigue la espada que ha estado custodiando durante tanto tiempo, $n.",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="La hoja es tan fina como dicen las historias. Parece que hay poca razón para completar las reparaciones de mi hoja habitual. Winter's Edge es muy superior y seguiré llevándola conmigo. Te doy las gracias, <name>.",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13765]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的埃基诺斯要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Akinos at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up.",c="一整天的训练没什么害处。很高兴看见你持续锻炼。",cEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up."}
Q[13767]={d="El gran combate cuerpo a cuerpo es la competición más importante del torneo. La victoria no será fácil, pero confío en que ganaremos. Debes practicar con tu montura hasta que los dos seáis uno.\n\nTe ayudará a prepararte para los rigores del combate en el torneo.\n\nVe a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón, equipa tu lanza, monta el lobo de Orgrimmar de establo y desafía a los valerosos. Aguardan en La Liza de los Valerosos de la Horda que está justo al salir de nuestra tienda.|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. Victory will not be easy, but I am confident that we will win. You must practice with your mount until the two of you work as one.\n\nIt will help prepare you for the rigors of tournament combat.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Orgrimmar wolf, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Horde Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的茉拉·狼女。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Morah Worgsister at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="和其他勇士彼此对战训练将能磨利你的爪子，锻炼你的战斗直觉。等到竞赛开始时，你将会做好准备。",cEN="Training against the other valiants will sharpen your claws and hone your battle insticts. When the competition begins, you will be ready."}
Q[13768]={d="He oído que los campeones de la Alianza están buscando espadas antiguas para sus guerreros. No podemos permitir que obtengan semejante ventaja.\n\nCuenta una antigua leyenda de las Colinas Pardas que hay una doncella bajo el aspecto de una rana que protege la espada que tanto tiempo lleva custodiando. Vive entre las ranas de lago a las orillas del Lago Fresno, al este del Puesto Fresno. Cuentan que solo un beso voluntarioso puede romper la maldición. Ponte este cacao antes de besar nada, $n, si no te saldrán pupas.",dEN="I've heard that the Alliance champions are seeking after ancient blades for their warriors. We can't afford to let them have that kind of advantage.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的祖尔托。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Zul'tore at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以传说是真的？这柄剑足以胜过所有联盟参赛者的配剑。",cEN="So the tales were true? This blade should be enough to best anything those Alliance entrants can come up with."}
