Q[13786]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的克希尔·炎枪要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Kethiel Sunlance at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up.",c="一整天的训练没什么害处。很高兴看见你持续锻炼。",cEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up."}
Q[13787]={d="El gran combate cuerpo a cuerpo es la competición más importante del torneo. La victoria no será fácil, pero confío en que ganaremos. Debes practicar con tu montura hasta que los dos seáis uno.\n\nTe ayudará a prepararte para los rigores del combate en el torneo.\n\nVe a los establos que hay fuera del pabellón, equipa tu lanza, monta el halcón zancudo de Lunargenta de establo y desafía a los valerosos. Aguardan en La Liza de los Valerosos de la Horda que está justo al salir de nuestra tienda.|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. Victory will not be easy, but I am confident that we will win. You must practice with your mount until the two of you work as one.\n\nIt will help prepare you for the rigors of tournament combat.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Silvermoon hawkstrider, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Horde Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的安妮拉·索隆。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Aneera Thuron at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="和其他勇士彼此对战训练将能磨利你的爪子，锻炼你的战斗直觉。等到竞赛开始时，你将会做好准备。",cEN="Training against the other valiants will sharpen your claws and hone your battle insticts. When the competition begins, you will be ready."}
Q[13789]={d="这座竞技场坐落在在世界上最危险的地方，$n。为了把这块土地从天灾军团手中夺过来，我们历经苦难，付出了极其沉重的代价。然而敌人仍然在持续不断地向我们发动攻击，仿佛他们有着无穷无尽的后备队。\n\n到冰冠冰川去，干掉你遇到的所有天灾士兵。",dEN="The coliseum is perched in the most dangerous part of the world, <name>. The territory we've taken from the Scourge has been paid for in blood and misery, yet the enemy continues to strike back with a seemingly limitless army. To make matters worse, this undead army is supported and assisted by mortal sympathizers, the Cult of the Damned.\n\nGo forth into Icecrown and slay any cultists you encounter.",o="银色比武场的塞利安·碎日要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭15名诅咒教派成员。你可以在冰冠冰川的任何地方消灭这些诅咒教派的成员。",oEN="Cellian Daybreak at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 members of the Cult of the Damned. You may kill Cult of the Damned members in any part of Icecrown.",p="你有在战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="Eres un auténtico campeón, <name>, tanto dentro del ringue como en el campo. Todos debemos estar vigilantes contra la Plaga y tú eres un gran ejemplo para nuestros hermanos y para tu propio pueblo.",cEN="You are a true champion, <name>, both inside the ring and on the field. We must all be vigilant against the Scourge and you are a great example to our brethren and your own people."}
Q[13790]={d="Como Campe$gón:ona; has dominado el arte del combate sobre montura y has ganado a rivales de todos los niveles. Cuando empiece el torneo, aquellos a los que has derrotado habrán doblado sus esfuerzos y ansiarán vengar su derrota ante ti.\n\nSería sensato continuar perfeccionando tus habilidades contra los competidores que esperan en La Liza de los Campeones. Equipa tu lanza, ve a los establos que hay al sur de los campos, luego sube a cualquier montura que puedas usar y enfréntate a los campeones.",dEN="As a champion, you have mastered the art of mounted combat, besting challengers of all levels. When the tournament begins, those you have defeated will have redoubled their efforts and will seek to avenge their losses to you.\n\nIt would be wise to continue practicing your skills against the combatants waiting in the Ring of Champions. Equip your lance, go to the stables on the southern side of the grounds. then mount up on any mount you're permitted to use, and face the champions.",o="Lleva 4 marcas del Campeón a Luuri en los Campos del Torneo Argenta.\n\nSi pierdes tu lanza puedes obtener otra de cualquiera de los expositores de lanzas cerca de los establos o en el pabellón de El Pacto de Plata.|n",oEN="Bring 4 Marks of the Champion to Luuri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了和其它勇士的练习吗？",pEN="Have you finished training with the other champions?",c="Bien hecho. Entrenar contra los otros campeones es una de las mejores formas de prepararte para la competición del torneo. Sé que harás que la Alianza se sienta orgullosa, <name>.",cEN="Well done. Training against the other champions is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make the Alliance proud, <name>."}
Q[13794]={d="在我的提议下，银色北伐军的兄弟和新晋的冠军展开了紧密的合作。北伐军的总冠军——纯洁者耶德瑞克——负责帮助来自各个城市的冠军进行训练，为锦标赛的总决赛做好准备。\n\n去找他做个自我介绍吧，他肯定已经急着要见你，帮助你进行训练，准备与艾泽拉斯世界最伟大的冠军同台竞技。",dEN="I have asked my brothers of the Argent Crusade to work closely with those who rise to the rank of champion. Eadric the Pure, our brotherhood's grand champion, helps oversee training exercises for champions from all cities and helps them make their final preparations for tournament competition.\n\nPlease go and introduce yourself to him. I know he'll be eager to meet you and work with you on your way to competing against Azeroth's greatest champions.",o="与银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="很高兴终于见到你，勇士。大领主要我负责协助各勇士的一同练习与努力，必且强化联赛场地的防御。",cEN="It's good to finally meet you, champion. The highlord has asked me to help coordinate the efforts of all champions to train together and bolster the defenses of the tournament grounds."}
Q[13795]={d="黑锋骑士代表团的领袖要和你谈谈，$c。科罗克·斩亡者是一位令人胆寒的斗士，他肯定有很多话要和你说。\n\n黑锋骑士团在比武场的北部扎了营，就在联盟代表团的大帐西边。",dEN="The leader of the Knights of the Ebon Blade delegation has asked to speak you, <class>. Crok Scourgebane is as fearsome a combatant as they come and I have no doubt he'll have much to ask of you.\n\nThe Knights of the Ebon Blade have made camp on the north side of the tournament grounds, west of the tent housing the Alliance delegations.",o="与银色比武场的科罗克·斩亡者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Crok Scourgebane at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="Así que te has convertido en un campeón, <name>. No tenía dudas de que sucedería. Nosotros, los caballeros, hemos sido entrenados en el fragor de la batalla, no frente a maniquíes de madera. Vamos a mostrarles a los paladines y a sus invitados lo que la batalla ha hecho de nosotros.",cEN="So you have become a champion, <name>. I had no doubt that it would happen. We knights have been trained in the heat of battle, not in front of wooden dummies. Let's show the paladins and their guests what battle has made us."}
Q[13809]={d="在你找出诅咒教派的间谍以后，大领主提里奥·弗丁安排了双倍的卫兵。弗丁大人认为诅咒教派不会仅仅因为失去一个黑骑士就善罢甘休。\n\n根据天爪龙斥候的报告，有一支诅咒教派的部队正准备袭击我们，他们的首领是一条名叫冰喉的冰霜巨龙。如果不阻止他们的话，赛场就会受到攻击。斥候们说，冰喉就盘旋在我们的西南方向，铁墙大坝和奥尔杜萨交界的地方。",dEN="Highlord Tirion Fordring has doubled the guard since your exposure of the Cult of the Damned's infiltrator. He doesn't believe that they will stop just because their Black Knight has been defeated.\n\nOur skytalon scouts have reported sighting a frost wyrm named Chillmaw leading a cult raiding party. If we don't intercept them, the tournament will come under attack. The scouts reporting seeing Chillmaw to the southwest, flying over the area between the Ironwall Rampart and Aldur'thar.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要你消灭3名诅咒教派投弹手，并击败冰喉。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament wants you to defeat Chillmaw and 3 Cultist Bombardiers.",p="你击败了诅咒教派的突袭队吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the Cult of the Damned raiding party?",c="<name>, tú y tus aliados habéis salvado el torneo de un ataque devastador. Aunque nuestros jinetes de skytalon son valientes, lo tienen difícil para mantener la paz en los terrenos del torneo y les costaría mucho defender los cielos contra el ataque del culto. Tienes el agradecimiento de la Cruzada Argenta y de todos los que se han reunido aquí para competir.",cEN="<name>, you and your allies have spared the tournament from a devastating attack. Though our skytalon riders are brave, they have their hands full keeping the peace on the tournament grounds and would be hard-pressed to defend the skies against the cult's attack. You have the thanks of the Argent Crusade and all who have gathered here to compete."}
Q[13810]={d="El coliseo se encuentra en la parte más peligrosa del mundo, $n. El territorio que hemos arrebatado a la Plaga nos ha costado sangre y penurias, pero el enemigo sigue contraatacando con un ejército aparentemente ilimitado. Para empeorar las cosas, este ejército de no-muertos cuenta con el apoyo y la ayuda de simpatizantes mortales, el Culto de los Malditos.\n\nAdéntrate en Corona de Hielo y elimina a los cultores que encuentres.",dEN="The coliseum is perched in the most dangerous part of the world, <name>. The territory we've taken from the Scourge has been paid for in blood and misery, yet the enemy continues to strike back with a seemingly limitless army. To make matters worse, this undead army is supported and assisted by mortal sympathizers, the Cult of the Damned.\n\nGo forth into Icecrown and slay any cultists you encounter.",o="银色比武场的塞利安·碎日要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭15名诅咒教派成员。你可以在冰冠冰川的任何地方消灭这些诅咒教派的成员。",oEN="Cellian Daybreak at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 members of the Cult of the Damned. You may kill cultists in any part of Icecrown.",p="你有在战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="Eres un auténtico campeón, <name>, tanto dentro del ringue como en el campo. Todos debemos estar vigilantes contra la Plaga y tú eres un gran ejemplo para nuestros hermanos y para tu propio pueblo.",cEN="You are a true champion, <name>, both inside the ring and on the field. We must all be vigilant against the Scourge and you are a great example to our brethren and your own people."}
Q[13811]={d="Como Campe$gón:ona; has dominado el arte del combate sobre montura y has ganado a rivales de todos los niveles. Cuando empiece el torneo, aquellos a los que has derrotado habrán doblado sus esfuerzos y ansiarán vengar su derrota ante ti.\n\nSería sensato continuar perfeccionando tus habilidades y aprender más sobre tus oponentes. Campeones que representan a todas las ciudades se entrenan en La Liza de los Campeones. Equipa tu lanza, sube a cualquier montura que puedas usar en los establos y enfréntate a los campeones.",dEN="As a champion, you have mastered the art of mounted combat, besting challengers of all levels. When the tournament begins, those you have defeated will have redoubled their efforts and will seek to avenge their losses.\n\nIt would be wise to continue honing your own skills and learning from your opponents. Champions representing all cities practice in the Ring of Champions. Equip your lance, mount up on any mount you're entitled to use at the stables, and face the champions.",o="将四枚冠军的印记交给银色比武场的鲁莉。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 4 Marks of the Champion to Luuri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你完成了和其它勇士的练习吗？",pEN="Have you finished training with the other champions?",c="Bien hecho. Entrenar contra los otros valientes es una de las mejores formas de prepararse para la competición del torneo. Sé que harás que la Horda se sienta orgullosa, <name>.",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make the Horde proud, <name>."}
Q[13816]={d="听着，$g小伙子:小姑娘，艾泽拉斯的命运危在旦夕。\n\n我们唯一的机会是到天文台去，找到奥尔加隆，阻止他向他的泰坦主人发送信息。\n\n赶快找到天文台。如果你发现了任何有价值的信息，就立即回来向我报告。奥尔加隆抵达之前，我们还有一些时间可以准备。",dEN="Listen, <lad/lass>! Azeroth's fate is at stake here.\n\nOur only chance is to get to the Celestial Planetarium in time to find this Algalon and stop him from beaming back any messages to his Titan masters.\n\nLocate the Celestial Planetarium and come back with any information you get. We might still have some time to prepare for Algalon's arrival.",o="奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦要你找到天文台的入口。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to locate the entrance to the Celestial Planetarium.",c="锁住了？意料之中！\n\n我会通知布莱恩……或许他能从大数据库里找出点什么。",cEN="It's locked? Figures!\n\nI'll let Brann know... maybe he can uncover something in the Archivum."}
Q[13817]={d="El disco de platino es sorprendentemente simétrico y no tiene ni un solo arañazo o imperfección. En el borde hay unas runas grabadas que forman la palabra \"ARCHIVUM\".\n\nDebe de haber un dispositivo en Ulduar capaz de leer el disco.",dEN="This platinum disc is surprisingly symmetrical and devoid of any scratches or imperfections. Engraved along its edge, bold runes spell out the word \"ARCHIVUM.\"\n\nThere must be a device inside Ulduar capable of reading the disc.",o="将文件馆数据圆盘带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Archivum Data Disc to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="当控制台的圆形插座打开时，能量在控制台中呼啸流窜。",pEN="The console whirrs with energy as the round receptacle opens.",c="白金圆盘完美无缺地勘合进控制台中。它开始旋转而白色的光束扫过圆盘。",cEN="The platinum disc fits perfectly inside the console. It begins to spin as its contents are scanned by white beams of light."}
Q[13818]={d="你成功了，$n。把这些徽记拿到文件馆的控制台那里去，看看你能否进入天文台。\n\n你最好快一点，$g伙计:小丫头，时间紧迫。",dEN="You really did it, <name>. Take the sigils to the Archivum Console and see if you can gain access to the Celestial Planetarium.\n\nYou best hurry, <lad/lass>. Time is of the essence.",o="将守护者的徽记带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Sigils of the Watchers to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="控制台的亮光迅速地扫过玻璃的表面，似乎在等待某些输入。",pEN="The console's bright lights scan the glass surface repeatedly, as if awaiting some form of input.",c="准备确认。\n\n准许进入星穹浑天仪。请取出你的钥匙。",cEN="Stand by for verification.\n\nAccess to the Celestial Planetarium granted. Please retrieve your key."}
Q[13819]={d="我们必须抓紧时间，$n。必须回到达拉然，在那里把恢复代码发射出去。\n\n带着它去找罗宁吧，我会在那里等你。",dEN="We'd best hurry now, <name>. We're going to have to transmit the reply-code from Dalaran.\n\nTake it to Rhonin, I will meet you there.",o="将恢复代码阿尔法交给达拉然的罗宁。",oEN="Take the Reply-Code Alpha to Rhonin in Dalaran.",c="你在这儿。希望这样行得通吧。我们全都靠它了。",cEN="You're here. Let us hope this works. For all our sakes."}
Q[13821]={d="我想弗蕾亚的徽记可能是最难得到的一块。\n\n根据文件馆的数据，徽记与弗蕾亚身边的三位古树仆从密切关联，它们是明叶长老、铁枝长老和石树长老。一旦它们之中有任何一位受到伤害，徽记的完整性就不能保障了。\n\n然而，如果你们对这三位长老手下留情，弗蕾亚的力量就会变得更加强大。\n\n我又能说什么呢，$n，我们现在真是进退维谷。",dEN="Freya's Sigil is going to be one of the tougher ones, I reckon.\n\nAccording to the Archivum, the essence of the Sigil is tied to her three elder servants, Brightleaf, Ironbranch and Stonebark. Should any of the elders be harmed, the Sigil's integrity will be compromised.\n\nSparing the elders, however, means that Freya will be more powerful when you face her.\n\nWhat can I say, <name>. We're stuck between a rock and hard place.",o="将弗蕾亚的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得弗蕾亚的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Freya's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Freya's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="El sigilo de Freya, <name>, ¿lo tienes?",pEN="Freya's sigil, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="Excelente trabajo, <name>. ¡Estamos un paso más cerca de salvar Azeroth!",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. We're one step closer to saving Azeroth!"}
Q[13822]={d="要拿到霍迪尔的徽记可不容易。你不但要击败霍迪尔，而且必须抢在他打碎装着徽记的箱子之前击败他！\n\n如果你想了解更多信息的话，可以去查查文件馆的控制台。那里面的知识比世界上所有的图书馆加在一起还要多！",dEN="Hodir's Sigil won't be easy to obtain. Not only are ye going to have to defeat Hodir himself, but yer going to have to do it before he destroys the chest that contains it!\n\nCheck the Archivum console if you need more information. That thing contains more knowledge than all of the world's libraries put together!",o="将霍迪尔的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得霍迪尔的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Hodir's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Hodir's Sigil, consult the Archivum Console.",p="¿Has obtenido el sigilo, <name>?",pEN="Did ye obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="你办到了！我不知道你怎么做到的，但你居然成功了！",cEN="Ye did it! I don't know how, but ye did!"}
Q[13823]={d="托里姆已经失去了自我，$n。一股黑暗的力量正在影响着他。\n\n某个邪恶的家伙假扮成他死去的妻子西芙，蒙蔽了他的心智。\n\n你要阻止那个冒牌货控制托里姆。如果托里姆被这股力量征服，我们就永远都不能找到他的徽记了！\n\n你要让他清醒过来，越快越好！\n\n和以往一样，文件馆的控制台会给你提供所有必要的消息……包括那些你不喜欢听到的消息。",dEN="Thorim's not himself, <name>. He's come under a dark influence.\n\nAn evil presence under the guise of an illusion pretends to be his lost wife, Sif.\n\nYe can't let him be overcome by this impostor's spell. If he does, the location of his sigil might forever be lost!\n\nYer going to have to beat some sense into him and yer going to have to do it quick.\n\nAs always, the Archivum Console will give ye all the gory details... even the ones ye don't like.",o="将托里姆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得托里姆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Thorim's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Thorim's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="¿Y bien, <name>? ¿Lo tienes?",pEN="Well, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="Nunca dejas de impresionarme, <name>.\n\nTú y yo nos tomaremos una pinta juntos cuando todo esto haya terminado, ¿me oyes?",cEN="Ye never cease to impress, <name>.\n\nYe and me are having a pint together after all this is done, ye hear me?"}
Q[13824]={d="米米尔隆是个聪明的家伙，他给自己的地盘装上了一套自毁设备。\n\n很不幸，如果你想要拿到徽记，就必须争分夺秒。如果你需要了解什么详细的数据，可以去文件馆控制台那里查询。",dEN="Mimiron's a clever one. His entire abode is rigged with some sort of self-destruction mechanism.\n\nUnfortunately yer gonna have to race against it if ye want to get his sigil. Check the Archivum Console for more details if ye need them.",o="将米米尔隆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得米米尔隆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Ulduar Archivum wants you to obtain Mimiron's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Mimiron's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="¿Pudiste obtener el sigilo, <name>?",pEN="Were you able to obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="Tengo que reconocerlo, <name>. Puede que nuestras probabilidades no sean las mejores, pero me siento mucho mejor con tu ayuda.",cEN="I've got to hand it to you, <name>. Our odds might not be the best, but I feel a lot better with you lending a hand."}
Q[13828]={d="La competición del torneo gira en torno al combate cuerpo a cuerpo sobre montura. Toma esta lanza y monta sobre el corcel Quel'dorei de establo justo frente al pabellón.\n\nUna vez hayas montado, busca a Jeran Cierramadera. Está en el extremo norte de los Campos del Torneo, en el área de entrenamiento al este de la Liza de los Aspirantes. Jeran te instruirá en el uso de tus defensas para mantenerte $gprotegido:protegida; mientras atacas a un objetivo cuerpo a cuerpo de cerca.",dEN="The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的奎尔多雷战马。和耶兰·洛克伍德谈一谈，然后对一个近战目标使用5次刺击。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向奥术师泰利斯复命。",oEN="Equip your lance, then mount the Stabled Quel'dorei Steed outside the pavilion. Speak to Jeran Lockwood and use Thrust 5 times on a Melee Target, then return to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你和耶兰·洛克伍德谈过了吗？练习了近距骑乘战斗？",pEN="Did you speak to Jeran Lockwood and practice close range mounted melee?",c="在你和那些假人训练时，牢记大师的教导。",cEN="Keep the words of the master in mind as you practice with the training dummies."}
Q[13829]={d="La competición del torneo gira en torno al combate cuerpo a cuerpo sobre montura. Toma esta lanza y monta sobre el halcón zancudo Atracasol de establo justo frente al pabellón.\n\nUna vez hayas montado, busca a Jeran Cierramadera. Está en el extremo norte de los Campos del Torneo, en el área de entrenamiento al este de la Liza de los Aspirantes. Jeran te instruirá en el uso de tus defensas para mantenerte $gprotegido:protegida; mientras atacas a un objetivo cuerpo a cuerpo de cerca.",dEN="The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的夺日者陆行鸟。和耶兰·洛克伍德谈一谈，然后对一个近战目标使用5次刺击。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷复命。",oEN="Equip your lance, then mount the Stabled Sunreaver Hawkstrider outside the pavilion. Speak to Jeran Lockwood and use Thrust 5 times on a Melee Target, then return to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你学会如何利用近战标靶训练了吗？",pEN="Did you speak to Jeran Lockwood and practice close range mounted melee?",c="在你和那些假人训练时，牢记大师的教导。",cEN="Keep the words of the master in mind as you practice with the training dummies."}
Q[13830]={d="Cualquier pescado$gr:ra; de Rasganorte que se precie conoce a la rémora pigmea. No es comestible pero a veces le sirve a los alquimistas.\n\nPero hay un pez sigiloso que se oculta entre las rémoras pigmeas en el Corazón del Río de la Cuenca de Sholazar. Se trata del espeztro. Cuando está fuera del agua se vuelve translúcido y luego desaparece completamente. Algunos plantean la hipótesis de que vuelve a Sholazar, pero otros son más... supersticiosos.\n\n¡Quiero que pesques este pez y que descubras el secreto cueste lo que cueste!",dEN="Any Northrend angler worth <his/her> salt knows about the pygmy suckerfish. It's not edible, but sometimes useful to alchemists.\n\nThere is, however, a stealthy fish that hides among the suckerfish in the River's Heart of Sholazar Basin. The phantom ghostfish. When out of water, they become increasingly translucent until they fade away completely. Some hypothesize they return to Sholazar, and others are more... superstitious.\n\nI want you to catch this fish and discover its secret by any means!",o="达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯希望你去揭开幽灵鱼的秘密。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to discover the mystery of the Phantom Ghostfish.",p="你发现了幽灵鱼的秘密了吗？\n\n<玛西娅目不转睛地盯着你。>",pEN="Is the ghostfish haunting your best efforts?\n\n<Marcia looks particularly proud of herself for her pun.>",c="Así que comerlo te hace invisible... qué defensa tan extraña ha desarrollado este pez tan listo.\n\nMe gustaría digerir esto un poco. No es un juego de palabras, <name>. De verdad. ¿Por qué no vienes a verme mañana?",cEN="So eating it makes you invisible... what a strange defense this clever fish has developed.\n\nI'd like to digest this for a bit. Pun not intended, <name>. Really. Why don't you come see me tomorrow?"}
Q[13832]={d="我真不敢相信，有那么多人去达拉然下水道钓鱼，只为几只大老鼠或是变异鱼。难道他们不知道，有许多伤心欲绝的傻子、走投无路的窃贼和心不在焉的醉汉，把数不清的无价之宝扔到了下水道里吗？\n\n在那里钓鱼的秘诀是把鱼钩沉到水底去，如果钓到了什么东西，就缓缓地把线收上来。去试试吧，$n，我会用我收藏的宝贝和你钓上来的东西交换的。",dEN="Hard to believe that most people fish in the Dalaran Sewers for giant rats and mutated fish. Especially when those waters are filled with priceless jewelry - discarded by broken hearted fools, thieves, and careless drunks.\n\nThe trick is to let your hook drag the bottom and don't pull up too hard when you get something. Try it out, <name>. I'd be willing to trade whatever you find for a few trinkets of my own.",o="将一块被腐蚀的珠宝交给达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to bring her a piece of Corroded Jewelry.",p="运气如何？",pEN="Any luck?",c="很好，这看起来挺有价值的。但是在清理完毕和估价前很难知道值多少，不过我还是愿意跟你交易。",cEN="Well now, that looks like it could be valuable. Difficult to know until it's cleaned up and appraised, but I'm still willing to make the trade if you are."}
Q[13833]={d="El sangradientes es un pez pequeño y escurridizo que se emplea en una receta para curar heridas infectadas. Nos vendrían bien unos cuantos, si estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta;.\n\nComo el nombre sugiere, adoran la sangre. El único modo de pescar los pequeños diablos es crear un charco de sangre y pescar en él.\n\nPríngate de sangre, sencillamente mata una bestia en la Tundra Boreal, y salta después al agua. La sangre pasará al agua y creará el sitio perfecto para pescar.",dEN="The bloodtooth is a feisty little fish used in a recipe to cure infected wounds. We could use some of them, if you're up to it.\n\nAs the name suggests, they've a hunger for blood. The only way I know how to catch the little devils is by creating a blood pool and fishing in it.\n\nGet yourself covered in blood - just slaughter a beast in the Borean Tundra - and then jump in the water. It'll wash right off and create the perfect fishing spot.",o="达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯希望你为她带去5条血齿狂鱼。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to bring her 5 Bloodtooth Frenzies.",p="钓到血齿狂鱼了吗？别忘了我教你的制造血池的办法。",pEN="Any luck with the bloodtooth? Don't forget what I told you about making blood pools.",c="Eres valiente, <name>. Espero que no hayas perdido ninguna extremidad buscando tu lugar de pesca. Si todavía tienes la fiebre de la pesca, vuelve mañana y hablaremos más.",cEN="You are a brave one, <name>. I hope you didn't lose any extremities making your fishing spot. If you've still got the fishing bug, come back tomorrow and we'll talk some more."}
Q[13834]={d="最好的钓鱼地点总是最危险的。冬拥湖里有无数的战利品等待着大胆的垂钓者。\n\n事实上，只有在冬拥湖才能钓到传说中最危险也最美味的恐怖鱼。给我带些这种鱼来，然后我们再好好聊聊。",dEN="The best fishing is often the most dangerous. Wintergrasp boasts a bountiful catch for the brazen.\n\nIn fact, it's the only place to catch the fabled Terrorfish - a fish both lethal and delicious. Bring me some, and we'll have something to discuss.",o="将10条恐怖鱼交给达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to bring her 10 Terrorfish.",p="在你追踪恐怖鱼时要小心戒备。",pEN="Be on your guard when you're after the Terrorfish.",c="喔喔喔！你抓到恐怖鱼了。唉，这可让我想起过去……\n\n<玛西娅开始叨絮大串的冒险与钓鱼故事，似乎只要你愿意听，她就能没完没了地讲下去。>",cEN="My, my, my! You've caught yourself some Terrorfish. Why, that reminds me of the time...\n\n<Marcia regales you with stories of adventure and fishing for as long as you're willing to listen.>"}
Q[13835]={d="想要在骑乘战斗中获得胜利，你就必须先学会如何突破对手的防御。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上奎尔多雷战马吧。\n\n骑上战马以后，去找瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。瓦利斯会向你传授使用远程武器击破对手盾牌的基础技巧，这样就可以更容易地击败你的目标。",dEN="You'll need to learn how to break through an opponent's defenses to succeed in mounted combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Valis Windchaser. He'll be on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Valis will teach you the basics of using a ranged shield breaker attack to make a ranged target vulnerable.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的奎尔多雷战马。和瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈，然后对两个脆弱的远程目标使用碎盾技能。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向斥候沙琳蒂亚复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Quel'dorei Steed outside the pavilion. Speak to Valis Windchaser and use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, then return to Scout Shalyndria at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你练习使用破盾了吗？",pEN="Have you practiced using your shield-breaker?",c="Memoriza la lección de Valis, <name>. Marcará la diferencia entre ganar y perder tus combates de montura.",cEN="Commit Valis's lesson to memory, <name>. It will mean the difference between winning and losing your mounted combat matches."}
Q[13836]={d="我得到消息，在达拉然监狱发生了一桩非常不幸的意外。一名卫兵的胳膊被一个邪恶的囚犯砍断，又被扔进了水里。\n\n我们的急救医生说，如果能找回那条胳膊，他们就能为那名卫兵接好断肢。\n\n你在那座监狱外面的水域去垂钓一下。我用我最好的鱼竿打赌，只要你用的时间足够长，就一定能找到那条胳膊。然后你把它带回达拉然来，交给善良的欧莉萨拉。她知道该怎么做。",dEN="I've received word of an unfortunate accident at the Dalaran prison; a guard had his arm severed and thrown into the water by a particularly vicious inmate.\n\nOur first aid clinic promises they can reattach the arm if we bring it back.\n\nYou fish long enough in the water outside the prison, and I'd bet my favorite fishing pole that arm will surface. Find that arm, and bring it to Olisarra the Kind here in Dalaran. She'll know what to do.",o="将断臂交给达拉然城中的善良的欧莉萨拉。",oEN="Olisarra the Kind in Dalaran City wants you to return the Severed Arm to her.",p="你好啊，你有什么东西要带给我吗？",pEN="Hi there. Do you have something for me?",c="Oh, hola, <name>. Marcia dijo que vendrías con el brazo que le falta a ese pobre hombre.\n\nTambién me dio esta bolsa para que te la entregue como recompensa. Huele fatal y tengo ganas de hacer el intercambio, si no te importa.",cEN="Oh, hello there <name>. Marcia said you'd be coming by with that poor man's missing arm.\n\nShe also gave me this bag to give you as a reward. It smells horrible, and I'm anxious to make the trade if you don't mind."}
Q[13837]={d="在骑乘战斗中，冲锋是最强大的攻击方式。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上奎尔多雷战马吧。\n\n骑上战马之后，去和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。卢格安会告诉你如何使用这项强大的技能，还会教你一些其它的基本战术。",dEN="Your strongest attack in mounted combat is undoubtedly the charge. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, speak with Rugan Steelbelly. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Rugan will tell you how to use this powerful ability and teach you some basic strategies.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的奎尔多雷战马。和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈，然后向两个脆弱的冲锋目标发动冲锋。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向阿瓦雷斯·迅击复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Quel'dorei Steed outside the pavilion. Speak to Rugan Steelbelly and Charge 2 vulnerable Charge Targets, then return to Avareth Swiftstrike at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你精通于冲锋的使用了吗？",pEN="Have you mastered the use of the charge?",c="有了阿瓦雷斯这样的老师，你很快就会成为骑乘战斗的专家。",cEN="With a teacher like Rugan, you'll be an expert at mounted combat in no time."}
Q[13838]={d="想要在骑乘战斗中获得胜利，你就必须先学会如何突破对手的防御。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上夺日者陆行鸟吧。\n\n骑上陆行鸟以后，去找瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。瓦利斯会向你传授使用远程武器击破对手盾牌的基础技巧，这样就可以更容易地击败你的目标。",dEN="You'll need to learn how to break through an opponent's defenses to succeed in mounted combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Valis Windchaser. He'll be on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Valis will teach you the basics of using a ranged shield breaker attack to make a ranged target vulnerable.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的夺日者陆行鸟。和瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈，然后对两个脆弱的远程目标使用碎盾技能。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向加拉希亚·晨光复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Sunreaver Hawkstrider. Speak to Valis Windchaser and use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, then return to Galathia Brightdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你完成了破盾的训练吗？",pEN="Have you practiced using your shield-breaker?",c="Memoriza la lección de Valis, <name>. Marcará la diferencia entre ganar y perder tus combates de montura.",cEN="Commit Valis's lesson to memory, <name>. It will mean the difference between winning and losing your mounted combat matches."}
Q[13839]={d="在骑乘战斗中，冲锋是最强大的攻击方式。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上夺日者陆行鸟吧。\n\n骑上陆行鸟之后，去和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。卢格安会告诉你如何使用这项强大的技能，还会教你一些其它的基本战术。",dEN="Your strongest attack in mounted combat is undoubtedly the charge. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, speak with Rugan Steelbelly. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Rugan will tell you how to use this powerful ability and teach you some basic strategies.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的夺日者陆行鸟。和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈，然后向两个脆弱的冲锋目标发动冲锋。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向阿玛里尔·火盟复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Sunreaver Hawkstrider outside the pavilion. Speak to Rugan Steelbelly and Charge 2 vulnerable Charge Targets, then return to Amariel Sunsworn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="通过经验与练习，你可以让你的冲锋非常致命。",cEN="With experience and practice, you will become deadly with the charge."}
Q[13845]={d="这只装着毒药的小瓶子看上去很危险。也许达拉然城中的某人会对它感兴趣。",dEN="This vial of poison looks particularly dangerous. Perhaps someone in Dalaran might be interested in it.",o="将密封的毒药瓶交给达拉然下水道的炼金师辛奈斯拉。",oEN="Bring the Seal Vial of Poison to Alchemist Cinesra in the Dalaran Sewers.",p="¿Es eso lo que creo que es, <class>?",pEN="Is that what I think it is, <class>?",c="把这东西带过来的你真是勇敢。只要这东西摔破并碰到你的皮肤，你就会在痛苦中死去。\n\n让我买下它……我能够让毒药发挥意料之外的效果。",cEN="You are brave to have carried this. If even one drop were to touch your skin, you'd have died an agonizing death.\n\nAllow me to pay you for it... I can always use venom of exceptional potency."}
Q[13846]={d="最优秀的冠军们每天都来礼拜堂，聆听银色神官的演讲。\n\n你应该看看她给予了这些人多大的鼓舞，$n。他们不仅坚定了为银色北伐军作战的信心，还向我的捐赠篮中放入了大把的金币。\n\n你要不要也捐赠一点？",dEN="The bestest of the champions come to the chapel to hear the argent confessor speak every day.\n\nYou should see how much she inspires them, <name>. Not only do they fight for the Argent Crusade, but they put a lot of money into the collection basket when I take it around.\n\nMaybe you'd like to contribute too?",o="与侍从亚迪再次交谈，为银色北伐军的事业捐献10枚金币。",oEN="Speak with Squire Artie to contribute 10 gold to the Argent Crusade's cause.",p="你想要捐款吗？",pEN="Do you want to contribute?",c="谢谢你。北伐军会好好运用这笔钱的！",cEN="Thank you. I just know the crusade will put it to good use!"}
Q[13847]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的约瑟夫·霍雷上尉要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Captain Joseph Holley at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明了一件众所皆知的事——我们的战士绝不仅只是节庆游行的装饰品而已。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders what they already knew -- that our warriors are more than just parade ground decorations."}
Q[13850]={d="你想骑毒皮暴掠龙吗？恐怕我有些坏消息要告诉你。\n\n毒皮暴掠龙全身都是毒，从血液到唾沫，连皮肤表面都有毒素。你要是爬上去，不出几个小时就会中毒而死。\n\n在我卖给你毒皮龙之前，你必须先获得抵抗毒素的能力，这要花很长的时间，非常长……你需要去在战斗中沐浴毒血，要洗许多次。如果你真的对此感兴趣，那么你要知道，毒皮暴掠龙经常会出现在沼泽地的北部本地，你一直向西北方走，就能找到那里了。",dEN="You want to ride a Venomhide? Then I've got bad news for you.\n\nThe Venomhide Ravasaurs, they're all poison: Poison blood, poison spit, poison skin. You climb on one, you fall off dead in a few hours.\n\nYou'd have to build up a resistance to their toxins before I sold you one, and that takes a long, LONG time... you'd need to be splashed with poisonous blood while fighting one numerous times. If you're really interested, the venomhides prefer the northern area of of the Marshlands, northwest of here.",o="安戈洛环形山的莫维克说，如果你能被毒皮暴掠龙的血染上20次毒，就可以安全地骑它了。攻击毒皮魔暴龙，有一定几率会中毒。",oEN="Mor'vek in Un'goro Crater claims that if you were poisoned by Venomhide Ravasaur blood 20 times, you could ride one without dying. Attack Venomhide Ravasaurs for a chance to be poisoned.",p="还没免疫？放弃吧。那太累了！",pEN="Still not immune, eh? Give up. It takes too long!",c="你做到了？你真的做到了？！\n\n喔呵！你跟我太太一样固执。",cEN="You did it? You actually did it?!\n\nHo ho! Stubborn as my wife, you are."}
Q[13851]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的克拉拉·沸酒要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Clara Tumblebrew at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明和我们是值得的盟军。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are worthy allies."}
Q[13852]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的弗林克·扳钳要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Flickin Gearspanner at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们是他们的战友。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the that we are a match for the Argent Crusade's own."}
