Q[13856]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的茉拉·狼女要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Morah Worgsister at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明了一件众所皆知的事——我们是艾泽拉斯最好的战士。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders what they already knew -- that our warriors are the best in Azeroth."}
Q[13857]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的加尔祖要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Gahju at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们在面对巫妖王的爪牙时毫无畏惧。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are fearless in the face of the Lich King's minions."}
Q[13858]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的安卡·爪蹄要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Anka Clawhoof at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们在对抗巫妖王的战斗中是坚定的盟军。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are steadfast allies in the battle against the Lich King."}
Q[13859]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的安妮拉·索隆要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Aneera Thuron at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们已准备好面对任何敌人。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are ready to face any enemy."}
Q[13860]={d="Incluso mientras nos disponemos para el torneo, las fuerzas de la Cruzada Argenta preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los esbirros del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的马夫德雷奇要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Handler Dretch at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="银色北伐军看到了我们的决心并且知道我们的战士将会看着这一切直到结束。",cEN="The Argent Crusade has seen our resolve and they know that our warriors will see this through to the end."}
Q[13861]={d="Incluso mientras algunos de nosotros trabajamos en el torneo, nuestros hermanos preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero de campaña de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los comandantes del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as some of us labor on the tournament, our brothers prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's commanders.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要求你消灭3名白骨卫士指挥官。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 3 Boneguard Commanders.",p="你对抗白骨之廷的敌人了吗？",pEN="Have you fought against the enemy in the Court of Bones?",c="La Cruzada Argentina se siente alentada de tener <class>s como tú luchando a nuestro lado en la batalla contra el Rey Exánime.",cEN="The Argent Crusade is heartened to have <class>s like you fighting alongside us in the battle against the Lich King."}
Q[13862]={d="Incluso mientras algunos de nosotros trabajamos en el torneo, nuestros hermanos preparan el terreno para el asalto del bastión enemigo de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nEn El Patio de los Huesos, al suroeste de Corona de Hielo, unos pocos cruzados valientes han establecido una avanzada en la parte sur de Corp'rethar. Equipa tu lanza y monta el destrero Argenta de establo del campamento, luego acaba con los comandantes del Rey Exánime.\n\nNo temas las hordas de lacayos Guardahuesos, $n, pues los puedes pisotear fácilmente con las patas de tu caballo.",dEN="Even as some of us labor on the tournament, our brothers prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled argent charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's commanders.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要求你消灭3名白骨卫士指挥官。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 3 Boneguard Commanders.",p="你对抗白骨之廷的敌人了吗？",pEN="Have you fought against the enemy in the Court of Bones?",c="La Cruzada Argentina se siente alentada de tener <class>s como tú luchando a nuestro lado en la batalla contra el Rey Exánime.",cEN="The Argent Crusade is heartened to have <class>s like you fighting alongside us in the battle against the Lich King."}
Q[13887]={d="现在你对毒皮暴掠龙的毒素已经有了免疫力，可以安全地对付这种猛兽和它们的蛋了。毒皮暴掠龙极为凶猛。如果要驯化它们，就必须从它们刚出生时开始。\n\n如果你想要骑上一头毒皮暴掠龙，你就需要先找到一颗尚未孵化的毒皮暴掠龙蛋。在沼泽地各处分布着一些暴掠龙巢。你应该在那些巢里寻找颜色较浅的龙蛋。那些才是能孵化出毒皮暴掠龙的蛋。\n\n如果你能带给我几颗那种蛋。我会让你自己保留一颗，并指导你用它孵化出毒皮暴掠龙崽。",dEN="Now that you've built up an immunity to venomhide toxin, you can safely handle the animals and their eggs. Venomhides are vicious and must be trained from the moment they hatch.\n\nIf you want to ride one, you'll need an unhatched egg. Scattered throughout the Marshlands are a number of ravasaur nests. Look for the eggs with lighter colored shells -- those are the ones that will hatch venomhides.\n\nIf you bring me several of the eggs, I'll allow you to keep one and raise its hatchling, with my guidance.",o="把4枚毒皮暴掠龙蛋带给位于沼泽地东南的莫维克。",oEN="Bring 4 Venomhide Ravasaur Eggs to Mor'vek in the southeast part of the Marshlands.",p="你找到那些蛋了吗？",pEN="Did you find those eggs?",c="做得好。老实说我有点讶异，你竟然能找到这么多颗蛋，因为每窝蛋的数量并不多。\n\n我会让你抚养一只刚孵出来的毒皮暴掠龙。它可不会客气的对你提出它的需求。",cEN="Good work. Honestly, I'm amazed you were able to find this many. With each clutch, they seem fewer in number.\n\nI'll let you raise one of the freshly-hatched venomhides. It shouldn't be shy about letting you know what it needs."}
Q[13889]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙幼崽用期待的眼神看着你，然后又在土地上画出了一些图案。\n\n这些图案都很粗糙，不过你还是能依稀从里面看出双帆龙，剑龙和翼手龙的形象。这只龙崽画完之后，又向你抬起了头，还露出了牙齿，做了一个咬的动作。\n\n你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽一定是想要吃这些恐龙的肉了。你要在安戈洛环形山找到并猎杀这些双帆龙、剑龙和翼手龙，取得恐龙肉，喂饱你饥饿的龙崽。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling looks at you expectantly, then begins to scrawl a pictogram into the dirt.\n\nThe drawings are rough, but you can make out the shapes of diemetradons, stegodons, and pterrordaxes. As the raptor finishes the sketch, it looks up at you, bares its teeth, and makes a biting motion.\n\nYour venomhide hatchling must be craving fresh meat from these animals. Find and kill any type of diematradon, stegodon, or pterrordax in Un'Goro Crater and feed its meat to your hungry hatchling.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它15片鲜嫩的恐龙肉。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 15 pieces of Fresh Dinosaur Meat.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽舔了舔嘴唇并将头偏向一边。",pEN="The hatchling cocks its head and looks at you.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽似乎很满足你提供的大餐，但不知道何时它又会饿。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling seems satisfied with the giant meal you've provided, but there's no way of telling when it will be hungry again."}
Q[13903]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙幼崽用期待的眼神看着你，然后又在土地上画出了一些图案。\n\n这些图案所表现的似乎是一些大型昆虫，一些格里什异种蝎。龙崽画完以后，就用前臂指指图画，凭空猛咬了一口，又舔舔嘴唇。\n\n它一定是想让你去位于安戈洛环形山南部中心处的巨痕谷，在那里收集一些异种蝎肉。得到异种蝎肉之后，就用它来喂养你饥饿的龙崽吧。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling looks at you expectantly, then begins to scrawl a pictogram into the dirt.\n\nThe hatchling's drawings seem to resemble various types of large insects, perhaps the gorishi silithids. The hatchling finishes his picture, then gestures at it with one short arm, snaps its jaws, and licks its lips.\n\nIt must want you to go to the Slithering Scar, in center of the southern part of Un'Goro Crater, and gather silithid meat. When you have the meat, feed it to your hungry hatchling.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它10块异种蝎肉。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 10 Silithid Meat.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽歪着头看着你。",pEN="The hatchling cocks its head and looks at you.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽对着你露齿微笑并开始休憩打盹。",cEN="Your venomhide hatchling flashes you a toothy smile and then settles in for a nap."}
Q[13904]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙崽的肚皮发出“咕咕”的响声。它挥舞胳膊，引起了你的注意。然后它在土地上画出一些异种蝎，又在蝎子下面画了一些小的椭圆形。\n\n那一定是异种蝎的卵。你可以到位于塔纳利斯西部，靠近安戈洛环形山边界的腐化之巢去。那里可是一个收集异种蝎卵的好地方。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling's stomach growls as it gestures to get your attention. It begins scratching pictures of silithids into the dirt, adding small ovals underneath them. It looks at you hopefully and gestures at the circles.\n\nThey can only mean silithid eggs. The Noxious Lair, in western Tanaris and near the border with Un'Goro Crater, would probably be a great place to find the eggs your little hatchling wants.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它12枚异种蝎卵。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 12 Silithid Eggs.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽看着你。",pEN="The hatchling looks at you.",c="在吞完异种虫蛋大餐后，你的暴掠龙幼崽舔了舔它的嘴唇。有一瞬间，你觉得它似乎对已经结束的用餐时间感到失望。",cEN="Your hatchling licks its lips after devouring the meal of silithid eggs. For a moment, you think it seems disappointed that feeding time has come to an end."}
Q[13905]={d="这只幼崽一直在看着你，仿佛正在考虑你是否能明白它的意思。它在土地上用爪子画出两根羽毛的图案，然后又指了指绑在它臂肘和膝盖上的东西。\n\n它看上去并不饿，那么它要羽毛干什么？\n\n它一定是想用羽毛做装饰，就像你在其它暴掠龙身上见到过的那样。炎鹏身上的羽毛是所有羽毛之中最大的。这种猛禽生活在塔纳利斯西部，灌木谷的东北方。它们总喜欢聚集在巨大野兽的尸骨周围。",dEN="The hatchling looks at you for a moment, almost as if wondering whether you'll understand. It scrawls a picture of a pair of feathers in the dirt, then points with one claw to the bindings at its elbows and knees.\n\nIt doesn't seem hungry, but what could the feathers be for?\n\nIt must want them for adornments like the ones you've seen on other raptors. The largest feathers come from the searing rocs that congregate around the bones of large creatures in western Tanaris, northeast of Thistleshrub Valley.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你给它弄来5根炎鹏的羽毛。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to get 5 pieces of Searing Roc Plumage.",p="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽期待地看着你。",pEN="Your venomhide hatchling looks at you with anticipation.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽收下这些羽毛，开始打量着它们，并且把羽毛装饰在它的臂环上。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling accepts the feathers and begins looking them over, holding several up to its armbands."}
Q[13906]={d="在你的悉心照料和喂养下，你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽长大得很快。它的乳齿很快就会被成年暴掠龙的牙齿取代了。如果你注意保留你的龙崽在成长过程中脱落的牙齿，那么你就能明确地判断它在何时成长到了可以被训练成坐骑的程度。\n\n你的毒皮暴掠龙会让你知道它需要什么。所以，你要密切注意它的一举一动。等到它的全部乳齿都已脱落的时候，就带着它和制作龙鞍的材料回来见我。我会帮你完成其馀的事情。",dEN="With your expert feeding and care, your venomhide hatchling will grow quickly. As they grow, their hatchling teeth will be replaced by adult teeth. If you keep the teeth shed by your hatchling as it grows, you'll have an easy way to tell when it's mature enough to be trained as a mount.\n\nYour venomhide will let you know what it needs, so pay close attention. When it has shed all of its baby teeth, return to me with your venomhide and the materials for your saddle and I'll do the rest.",o="将20枚毒皮暴掠幼龙牙齿、你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽，还有20块符文布、20块硬甲皮和80金币交给位于安戈洛环形山沼泽地东南的莫维克。",oEN="Return 20 Venomhide Baby Teeth, the Venomhide Hatchling, 20 Runecloth, 20 Rugged Leather, and 80 gold to Mor'vek in the southeastern part of the Marshlands in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你有好好照顾那只迅猛龙吗？",pEN="Have you been taking good care of that raptor?",c="看来你们一同成长，也没有害死对方。\n\n那么，事情都办妥了。我已经帮你把毒皮暴掠龙给训练好，它已经学会顺从你的哨音了。\n\n很少人能像你这么有毅力，愿意亲手饲养与照料一头毒皮暴掠龙，但你的努力非常值得。",cEN="It looks like both of you have managed to do some growing without killing one another.\n\nThere, everything's finished. I've trained your venomhide ravasaur to respond when you blow this whistle.\n\nFew have the dedication to hand-feed and raise a venomhide, but they're well worth the effort."}
Q[13908]={d="你的毒皮暴掠龙强壮而又健康。看来你的确是有了一个好战友。等我给你做好了鞍子和缰绳，你就要准备骑上它了。就像你一样，这些骑乘用具必须进行特殊加工，好让它们能够承受毒皮暴掠龙所产生的剧毒。\n\n你要给我拿来一些硬甲皮，符文布，以及一些用来购买其它必需物品的资金。这样我立刻就能给你作出毒皮暴掠龙鞍了。",dEN="Your venomhide is strong and healthy and you've developed quite a bond. You'll be ready to ride him once I've completed your saddle and bridle. Just like you, they have to be specially conditioned to stand up to the toxins the raptor produces.\n\nAll you'll need to do is bring me some rugged leather, runecloth, and money to buy the rest of the supplies and I'll have that saddle for you in no time.",o="给位于安戈洛环形山沼泽地东南的莫维克带去20块硬甲皮、20张符文布和80金币。",oEN="Bring 20 Rugged Leather, 20 Runecloth, and 80 gold to Mor'vek in the southeast part of the Marshlands in Un'Goro Crater."}
Q[13914]={d="这只幼崽一直在看着你，仿佛正在考虑你是否能明白它的意思。它在土地上用爪子画出两根羽毛的图案，然后又指了指绑在它臂肘和膝盖上的东西。\n\n它看上去并不饿，那么它要羽毛干什么？\n\n它一定是想用羽毛做装饰，就像你在其它暴掠龙身上见到过的那样。炎鹏身上的羽毛是所有羽毛之中最大的。这种猛禽生活在塔纳利斯西部，灌木谷的东北方。它们总喜欢聚集在巨大野兽的尸骨周围。",dEN="The hatchling looks at you for a moment, almost as if wondering whether you'll understand. It scrawls a picture of a pair of feathers in the dirt, then points with one claw to the bindings at its elbows and knees.\n\nIt doesn't seem hungry, but what could the feathers be for?\n\nIt must want them for adornments like the ones you've seen on other raptors. The largest feathers come from the searing rocs that congregate around the bones of large creatures in western Tanaris, northeast of Thistleshrub Valley.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你给它弄来5根炎鹏的羽毛。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to get 5 pieces of Searing Roc Plumage.",p="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽期待地看着你。",pEN="Your venomhide hatchling looks at you with anticipation.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽收下这些羽毛，开始打量着它们，并且把羽毛装饰在它的臂环上。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling accepts the feathers and begins looking them over, holding several up to its armbands."}
Q[13915]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙幼崽用期待的眼神看着你，然后又在土地上画出了一些图案。\n\n这些图案都很粗糙，不过你还是能依稀从里面看出双帆龙，剑龙和翼手龙的形象。这只龙崽画完之后，又向你抬起了头，还露出了牙齿，做了一个咬的动作。\n\n你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽一定是想要吃这些恐龙的肉了。你要在安戈洛环形山找到并猎杀这些双帆龙、剑龙和翼手龙，取得恐龙肉，喂饱你饥饿的龙崽。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling looks at you expectantly, then begins to scrawl a pictogram into the dirt.\n\nThe drawings are rough, but you can make out the shapes of diemetradons, stegodons, and pterrordaxes. As the raptor finishes the sketch, it looks up at you, bares its teeth, and makes a biting motion.\n\nYour venomhide hatchling must be craving fresh meat from these animals. Find and kill any type of diematradon, stegodon, or pterrordax in Un'Goro Crater and feed its meat to your hungry hatchling.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它15片鲜嫩的恐龙肉。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 15 pieces of Fresh Dinosaur Meat.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽舔了舔嘴唇并将头偏向一边。",pEN="The venomhide hatchling licks its lips and tilts its head to the side.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽似乎很满足你提供的大餐，但不知道何时它又会饿。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling seems satisfied with the giant meal you've provided, but there's no way of telling when it will be hungry again."}
