Q[18174]={d="Los threshadons del lago están royendo agujeros en las redes y espantando a los peces buenos. Si no reducimos la población de los jóvenes, no habrá ninguna captura de la que presumir.\n\nDirígete al agua y elimina a los Young Threshadons antes de que crezcan demasiado para controlarlos. Vuelve para informar cuando hayas terminado.",dEN="The threshadons in the Loch are gnawin' holes through the nets and scarin' off the good fish. If we don't thin the young ones, there won't be any catch worth braggin' about.\n\nHead down to the water and cull the Young Threshadons before they grow too big to handle. Bring word back once it's done.",o="Kazrik Deepdelve quiere que elimines a los Young Threshadons en el Loch. Mata 8 Young Threshadons.",oEN="Kazrik Deepdelve wants you to cull the Young Threshadons in the Loch. Slay 8 Young Threshadons.",p="¿Esos threshadons siguen mordisqueando nuestras líneas? ¡Empújalos un poco para que podamos seguir pescando!",pEN="Those threshadons still chompin' our lines? Push 'em back a bit so we can keep fishin'!",c="¡Buen trabajo!\n\nLa captura aguantará un poco más si reducimos el número de esas bestias.\n\nAquí tienes tu parte, y si las redes se mantienen intactas, quizá saquemos beneficios de verdad.",cEN="Good work!\n\nThe catch will hold for a while longer with those beasties thinned out.\n\nHere's your share, and if the nets stay whole, maybe we'll have real profit yet."}
Q[18175]={d="¡Ese maldito crustáceo conspirador!\n\n¡Old Scuttles lleva semanas rompiendo sedales y robando cebo! Apenas podemos conseguir una captura diaria con ese cangrejo gigante que acecha en los bajíos. Los muchachos están desesperados, y yo también.\n\nHaznos un favor, ¿quieres? Reúne a unos cuantos muchachos robustos y acaba con Old Scuttles y sus travesuras de robar cebos.",dEN="That blasted conniving crustacean!\n\nOld Scuttles has been snapping lines, and stealing bait for weeks now! We can scarce make a day’s catch with that overgrown crab lurkin’ in the shallows. The lads are at their wits’ end, and so am I.\n\nDo us a favor, will ye? Gather a few stout lads and put an end to Old Scuttles and his bait-nabbin’ mischief.",o="Warg Deepwater quiere que cacen a Old Scuttles en Loch Modan. Reúne un grupo pequeño y derrota a Old Scuttles.",oEN="Warg Deepwater wants you to hunt down Old Scuttles in the Loch. Gather a small group and defeat Old Scuttles.",p="¿El viejo Scuttles sigue por ahí? ¡Necesito que ese ladrón de líneas desaparezca para que podamos pescar en paz!",pEN="Old Scuttles still out there? I need that line-thief gone so we can fish in peace!",c="¡Ja! Ese ladrón mugriento no nos dará más problemas. ¡Muchas gracias!",cEN="Ha! That crusty thief won't be causin' us any more grief, Many thanks!"}
Q[18176]={d="Me estoy quedando sin suministros, y Thorgrum me debe un favor. Llévale esta nota a la torre de vuelo; él sabrá qué enviar de vuelta.\n\n¡No la pierdas! Necesito esos bienes antes de la próxima captura.",dEN="I'm running low on supplies, and Thorgrum owes me a favor. Take this note to him at the flight tower—he'll know what to send back.\n\nDon't lose it! I need those goods before the next catch.",o="Lemma necesita que le lleves su nota a Thorgrum Borrelson en Loch Modan.",oEN="Lemma needs you to take her note to Thorgrum Borrelson in Loch Modan.",p="¿Una nota de Lemma, eh? ¡Ja! Sabía que ese favor llegaría tarde o temprano. Veamos... \"se nos está acabando\", dice. Sí, suena a ella. La próxima vez que la veas, dile que espero que ese favor se dé por pagado esta vez.",pEN="A note from Lemma, is it? Hah! Knew that favor would come due sooner or later. Let’s see… “running low,” she says. Aye, that sounds like her. Next time you see her tell her I expect that favor marked paid this time.",c="¿Lo tienes? Bien.",cEN="Got it? Good."}
Q[18177]={d="Lemma necesita esa nota en Forjaz y tú vas hacia allá. Llévasela a Gearcutter Cogspinner en Tinker Town para que pueda poner en marcha los suministros.\n\nNo la pierdas durante el vuelo.",dEN="Lemma needs that note in Ironforge and you're heading that way. Take this to Gearcutter Cogspinner in Tinker Town so she can get the supplies moving.\n\nDon't lose it on the flight.",o="Thorgrum quiere que lleves la nota de Lemma a Gearcutter Cogspinner en Forjaz.",oEN="Thorgrum wants you to carry Lemma's note to Gearcutter Cogspinner in Ironforge.",p="¿Lemma tiene una nota para mí? Interesante...",pEN="Lemma's has a note for me? Interesting..",c="¡Ah, Lemma necesita suministros! Me aseguraré de que tenga todo lo necesario y esté instalada. Prepararé todo para el vuelo.",cEN="Ah, Lemma is in need of supplies! I'll make sure she's stocked and settled. I'll pack everything up for the flight."}
Q[18178]={d="¡Las mercancías de Lemma están empaquetadas! Llévalas de vuelta a Gryth Thurden en la estación de grifos para que puedan volarte a Thelsamar.\n\n¡No pierdas el paquete!",dEN="Lemma's goods are packed! Get them back to Gryth Thurden at the gryphon post so they can fly you to Thelsamar.\n\nDon't lose the package!",o="Gearcutter quiere que lleves el paquete de Lemma de vuelta a Gryth Thurden.",oEN="Gearcutter wants you to carry Lemma's package back to Gryth Thurden.",p="¿Lemma necesita que le entreguen un paquete?\n\n¡No te preocupes, tengo el grifo ideal para ti!",pEN="Lemma needs a package delivered?\n\nNot to worry, I got just the right gryphon for ye!",c="Tan rápido como el viento de la montaña y solo muerde cuando tiene hambre. Intenta no parecer el almuerzo.\n\n¡Y asegúrate de sujetar bien ese paquete! Los vientos de estas cumbres no tienen mucha paciencia con la carga suelta, y apuesto a que Lemma tampoco.",cEN="Fast as the mountain wind and only bites when he’s hungry. Try not to look like lunch.\n\nAnd see that ye hold on tight to that package! The winds around these peaks don’t care much for loose cargo, and neither does Lemma, I’d wager."}
Q[18179]={d="¡Súbete al grifo de una vez!\n\nLleva el paquete de Lemma de vuelta a ella en el campamento junto a Thelsamar.",dEN="Get on the gryphon already!\n\nTake Lemma's package back to her at the camp by Thelsamar.",o="Gryth quiere que lleves el paquete de Lemma a Lemma Brasscog en Loch Modan.",oEN="Gryth wants you to take Lemma's package back to Lemma Brasscog in Loch Modan.",p="¿Lo has mantenido intacto? ¡Bien!",pEN="You kept it intact? Good!",c="Justo a tiempo. Esto seguramente hará feliz a la tripulación. Aquí tienes tu parte.",cEN="Right on time. This'll surely make the crew happy. Here's your cut."}
Q[18180]={d="Cambia tu anillo actual por una versión de Núcleo del Magma más fuerte y sintonizada.",dEN="Exchange your current ring for a stronger Molten Core attuned version.",o="Entrega tu anillo actual y 200g para mejorar a la versión de Núcleo de Magma.",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Molten Core version."}
Q[18181]={d="Cambia tu anillo actual por una versión de Guarida de Blackwing más fuerte y sintonizada.",dEN="Exchange your current ring for a stronger Blackwing Lair attuned version.",o="Entrega tu anillo actual y 200g para mejorar a la versión de Guarida de কালোala.",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Blackwing Lair version."}
Q[18182]={d="Cambia tu anillo actual por una versión sintonizada de Ahn'Qiraj más fuerte.",dEN="Exchange your current ring for a stronger Ahn'Qiraj attuned version.",o="Entrega tu anillo actual y 200g para mejorar a la versión de Ahn'Qiraj.",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Ahn'Qiraj version."}
Q[18183]={d="Cambia tu anillo actual por la versión sintonizada final de Naxxramas.",dEN="Exchange your current ring for the final Naxxramas attuned version.",o="Entrega tu anillo actual y 200g para mejorarlo a la versión de Naxxramas.",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Naxxramas version."}
Q[20438]={d="Meterte en el Santuario Atracasol va a ser más difícil de lo que parece. Solo les permiten entrar a aquellos que llevan tabardos de los Atracasol. Si nos hacemos con uno, un sencillo encantamiento hará el resto.\n\nEn el balcón que hay sobre Los Hilos del Destino encontrarás a Shandy Lustre Brillo. Le he echado una mano otras veces, así que me debe un favor. Les hace la colada a muchos habitantes de la ciudad. Quizás él te pueda \"prestar\" un tabardo por un tiempo.",dEN="Getting you inside the Sunreaver's Sanctuary will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Sunreaver tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.\n\nOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while.",o="从山迪·格罗斯那里取得“借来的战袍”。",oEN="Obtain a Borrowed Tabard from Shandy Glossgleam.",p="山迪帮你弄到件夺日者战袍了吗？",pEN="Was Shandy able to help you get a Sunreaver tabard?",c="我就知道山迪肯定会帮我们这个忙的。让我给它附魔一下方便你使用。你越快穿上这件战袍，我们就能越快还给山迪，毕竟万一丢了，它的主人可接受不了。",cEN="I knew Shandy would find a way to come through for us. Let me get this enchanted and ready for you to use. The sooner you get done with the tabard, the sooner we can get it back to Shandy and the better the chances that its owner will never have missed it."}
Q[20439]={d="我已经在这件衣服上施加了魔法。你穿上它，就能在短时间内进入夺日者圣殿的防御。你应该有足够的时间找路进入那里的一座建筑：“肮脏的野兽”，与夺日者的联系人见面。那个人是魔导师哈瑟尔。\n\n你要借助伪装取得上古龙铸之刃的抄本。那是魔导师哈瑟尔的部下从龙眠神殿借来的。取得那本书以后，就把它交给我。",dEN="I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Sunreaver Sanctuary's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way into The Filthy Animal and meet up with the Sunreaver contact there, one Magister Hathorel.\n\nObtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest while your disguise holds, and return it to me.",o="从魔导师哈瑟尔那里取得上古龙铸之刃典籍。",oEN="Retrieve the Ancient Dragonforged Blades tome from Magister Hathorel.",p="你拿回那本书了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered that book?",c="Excelente trabajo. Ahora que esto está en nuestras manos, debemos llevárselo a Caladis Brightspear lo antes posible. No podemos arriesgarnos a que el libro vuelva a manos de los Sunreaver.\n\nMe aseguraré de que Shandy Glossgleam recupere su tabardo sin incidentes, junto con una generosa recompensa por su ayuda.",cEN="Excellent work. Now that this is in our hands, we must get it to Caladis Brightspear as soon as possible. We can't risk the book falling back into Sunreaver hands.\n\nI'll ensure that Shandy Glossgleam gets his tabard back without incident, along with a healthy reward for his help."}
Q[24428]={d="Has conseguido algo verdaderamente imposible. La madre de linaje del Vuelo Negro yace muerta a tus pies. Córtale la cabeza y llévasela a Zardeth de los Zarpanegra.",dEN="You have accomplished the truly impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Seize her head and deliver it to Zardeth of the Black Claw or Neeru Fireblade.",o="Llévale la cabeza de Onyxia a Zardeth de los Zarpanegra al sótano de El Cordero Degollado.",oEN="Take the Head of Onyxia to Zardeth of the Black Claw in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb in Stormwind or to Neeru Fireblade in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",p="以诺兹多姆之牙的名义！",pEN="By Nozdormu's teeth!",c="什么？你是从哪弄到手的？她不是……算了，我想这并不重要。你应当为此获得一些奖赏，这点毋庸置疑。",cEN="What? How did you get this? Isn't she... Never mind the details, I suppose. You'll be wanting one of these baubles as recompense, no doubt."}
Q[24429]={d="Has conseguido algo verdaderamente imposible. La madre de linaje del Vuelo Negro yace muerta a tus pies. Córtale la cabeza y llévasela a Neeru Hojafuego.",dEN="You have accomplished the truly impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Seize her head and deliver it to Zardeth of the Black Claw or Neeru Fireblade.",o="Llévale la cabeza de Onyxia a Neeru Hojafuego al Circo de las Sombras.",oEN="Take the Head of Onyxia to Zardeth of the Black Claw in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb in Stormwind or to Neeru Fireblade in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",p="你带来的该不会是……？！",pEN="What is the meaning of this?!",c="你带来的头颅是属于……。不，我想我还是别想太多。你的英勇行径应当获得奖赏，这点毋庸置疑。",cEN="You've brought me the head of someone who is... No, best not to think about it too hard. You'll be wanting recompense for your heroic deeds, no doubt."}
Q[24431]={d="看起来，这张被水浸透的纸上应该是记录着一种烈性酒的酿造配方。也许达拉然“再来一杯”的店主会对这个感兴趣……",dEN="This appears to be the remains of a mixture for potent wine. Perhaps the proprietor of One More Glass in Dalaran would be interested in it....",o="将被浸透的配方交给达拉然城中的克莉丝蒂·斯多克顿。",oEN="Bring the Waterlogged Recipe to Christi Stockton in the Dalaran city.",p="正如我所说的，美酒只配识货的人。",pEN="Wine is only as fine as the person drinking it, I always say.",c="Esto es un hallazgo importante, <name>. No puedo permitir que se lo vendas a nadie más, así que estoy dispuesta a ofrecer generosamente.",cEN="This is quite a find, <name>. I can't have you selling this to anyone else, so I'm willing to offer generously."}
Q[24442]={d="Al ojear los planes de ataque requisados, te encuentras con un mapa de los Reinos del Este y de Kalimdor en el que hay varios grandes asentamientos marcados. Lees las órdenes y descubres que los capitanes Kvaldir están planeando una serie de asaltos devastadores.\n\nSegún las órdenes, los ataques comenzarán cuando el clamaneblina Yngvar \"consulte con el corazón de la neblina\". Quizás puedas retrasar los ataques si capturas el objeto profético de la Cueva del Clamaneblina, en el lado oeste del Desembarco de Hrothgar, y notificas a la justicar Mariel Corazón Veraz.",dEN="Looking over the captured attack plans, you find a map of the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor with major settlements marked. Reading over the orders, you learn that Kvaldir captains have drafted plans for a series of devastating raids.\n\nAccording to the orders, the attacks are to begin after Mistcaller Yngvar \"consults the Heart of the Mists.\" Perhaps you could delay the attacks by capturing the omen from the Mistcaller's Cave on the western side of Hrothgar's Landing and notify Justicar Mariel Trueheart.",o="取得迷雾之心，将它和克瓦迪尔进攻计划一同交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Recover the Heart of the Mists and bring it and the Kvaldir Attack Plans to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="¿Qué es lo que has encontrado, <name>?",pEN="What is it that you've found, <name>?",c="<Mariel acepta los pedidos y el cristal de visión capturado y examina ambos.>\n\nBuen trabajo, <name>, y qué rapidez de mente. Estoy segura de que el robo de este baratija no los detendrá por mucho tiempo, pero creo que nos has ganado tiempo para avisar a los líderes de la Horda y la Alianza sobre los ataques inminentes.",cEN="<Mariel accepts the orders and the captured seeing crystal and examines both.>\n\nGood work, <name>, and quick thinking. I'm sure the theft of this trinket won't slow them down for long, but I think you've bought us time to warn the leaders of the Horde and Alliance about the impending attacks."}
Q[24451]={d="我已经在这件衣服上施加了魔法。你穿上它，就能在短时间内进入银色领地的防御。你应该有足够的时间找路进入那里的一座建筑：“英雄之家”，与银色盟约的联系人见面。那个人是奥术师泰拜林。\n\n你要借助伪装取得上古龙铸之刃的抄本。那是奥术师泰拜林的部下从龙眠神殿借来的。取得那本书以后，就把它交给我。",dEN="I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Silver Enclave's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way up to the top level of the Silver Enclave and meet up with the Silver Covenant's man there, known as Arcanist Tybalin.\n\nWhile disguised, obtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest, and return the book to me.",o="从奥术师泰拜林那里取得上古龙铸之刃典籍。",oEN="Retrieve the Ancient Dragonforged Blades tome from Arcanist Tybalin.",p="¿Has recuperado el libro de Reposo del Dragón?",pEN="Did you recover the book from Wyrmrest?",c="干得漂亮。现在宝典重回我手，我们必须尽快把它交给麦雷昂·阳炎，绝不能再让它被银色盟约抢走了。\n\n我确信山迪·格罗斯已经拿回了战袍，这是给你的奖励。",cEN="Excellent work. Now that this is in our hands, we must get it to Myralion Sunblaze as soon as possible. We can't risk the Silver Covenant taking the book from us again.\n\nI'll get that tabard back to Shandy and see that he's well compensated for his assistance. Once the book is in Myralion's hands, the Silver Covenant won't be a threat anymore."}
Q[24454]={d="我们必须立刻将这本书交给卡莱迪斯·亮矛。你能帮我这个忙吗？你已经证明自己有足够的实力击败夺日者，除了你以外，我不能信任其它人能够完成这个任务。\n\n带着这本书转至奎尔德拉之冢。它就在冰冠冰川银色比武场的南边。卡莱迪斯和那把剑都会等着你。我们越早鉴别出这件武器，我们就能越早拥有它。",dEN="We must get this book to Caladis Brightspear immediately. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at keeping the Sunreavers at bay.\n\nTake it with you to Quel'Delar's rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Caladis and the sword will be waiting. The sooner we can identify the blade, the sooner we can claim it.",o="将上古龙铸之刃交给奎尔德拉之冢的卡莱迪斯·亮矛。",oEN="Bring Ancient Dragonforged Blades to Caladis Brightspear at Quel'Delar's Rest.",p="我们猜到你还回来的。你拿着什么？",pEN="We've been expecting your return. What has kept you?",c="<Caladis acepta el pesado libro y empieza a hojearlo>\n\nSabía que los símbolos de la hoja eran familiares. La arma fue, con toda seguridad, forjada por los dragones y entregada a una de las razas mortales, pero ¿qué hoja es esta y cómo ha acabado en la Corona de Hielo?",cEN="<Caladis accepts the heavy book and begins leafing through it.>\n\nI knew the symbols on the blade were familiar. The weapon was most certainly forged by the dragons and gifted to one of the mortal races, but which blade is this, and how did it come to rest in Icecrown?"}
Q[24461]={d="我们不能让奎尔德拉就这样只是一堆耻辱的碎片。带上这把剑的残片和你发现的剑柄，到冰冠堡垒的萨隆矿坑去。\n\n巫妖王强迫许多奴隶在那里采掘熔炼萨隆邪铁矿石。我们要用萨隆邪铁重铸奎尔德拉。\n\n你必须取得注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的大锤，然后用它们在熔炉之主的铁砧上重铸这把剑。",dEN="We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.\n\nYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword.",o="取得5块注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的巨锤，用它们重铸奎尔德拉。",oEN="Obtain 5 Infused Saronite Bars and the Forgemaster's Hammer and use them to make the Reforged Quel'Delar.",p="你重铸奎尔德拉了吗？",pEN="Were you able to reconstruct Quel'Delar?",c="你已重铸了奎尔德拉之剑，尽管鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔说我们无法办到！这把剑必须继续淬火，不过她和她的主人可不会站在我们这边！",cEN="You have remade the blade of Quel'Delar, although Blood-Queen Lana'thel proclaimed we could not! The blade must still be tempered, but she and her master will not stand in our way!"}
Q[24476]={d="破碎的奎尔德拉终于完整如初了，但如果不经过适当的锻打，你还不能使用它作战。它参差不齐的萨隆邪铁边缘仍然脆弱易碎。\n\n你可以在冰冠堡垒深处的灵魂洪炉对它进行深度锻造。把奎尔德拉带到噬魂者的住所去，找到那里的坩埚。将这把剑放进坩埚里，对它进行锻造，然后再回来见我。我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.\n\nDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me in The Frozen Halls.",o="在灵魂坩锅锻造已经重铸的奎尔德拉。",oEN="Temper the Reforged Quel'Delar in the Crucible of Souls.",p="在它被再次锻造之前，它无法发挥作用。",pEN="Until the sword is tempered, it will be useless.",c="我……我简直不敢相信，需要回到锻造它的诞生地修复这把剑。发生了什么？",cEN="I... I don't understand. Tempering the sword should've restored the blade to its original condition. What has happened here?"}
Q[24480]={d="你已经重铸了这把剑，并对它进行了锻造，但它仍然只是静静地躺在剑鞘里，丝毫没有显示出它应有的力量。你说这把剑在吸引你，就好象它拥有自己的意志？\n\n你敢把它带到它想去的地方吗？这把剑不应该如此沉默，但如果你不把它带去那个地方，也许我们将永远不知道这是为什么。把它带进冰冠堡垒的映像大厅。在那里一定要万分小心！我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="You have reforged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, showing no signs of the power it should possess. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?\n\nDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It's not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Take it into Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard! I'll be waiting for you in The Frozen Halls.",o="将淬火的奎尔德拉带到映像大厅里面的剑冢去。",oEN="Bring your Tempered Quel'Delar to Sword's Rest inside the Halls of Reflection.",p="映像大厅里发生什么事了？",pEN="What happened inside the Halls of Reflection?",c="No creía posible que la maldad pudiera apoderarse de una espada así, pero supongo que fui ingenuo. Si las mayores creaciones de la raza de los dragones pudieron ser corrompidas y volverse contra ellos, ¿por qué no una simple espada?\n\nEl consejo de Uther es sabio, <name>, y te insto a que lo sigas pronto.",cEN="I had not thought it possible for evil to take hold in such a sword, but I suppose it was naive of me. If the greatest of dragonkind's creations could be corrupted and turned against them, why not a mere sword?\n\nUther's advice is wise, <name>, and I would urge you to heed it quickly."}
Q[24487]={d="Escucha bien, mon. Bwonsamdi estará esperando tu visita en su reino, ¡así que date prisa! Tengo asuntos importantes que discutir contigo sobre tu petición. No me hagas esperar demasiado, que el viejo Bwonsamdi no es conocido por su paciencia, ¡ja, ja! Vuelve al reino de los espíritus y hablaré contigo sobre lo que has venido a buscar. Tenemos un trato que cerrar, tú y yo. ¡Así que búscame en mi reino y nos ocuparemos de los negocios!",dEN="Listen here, mon. Bwonsamdi be expectin' your visit in his realm, so make haste! I got important matters to discuss witcha about your request. Don't be makin' me wait too long now - ol' Bwonsamdi not known for his patience, haha! Return to the spirit realm, and I gonna talk witcha 'bout what ya came for. We got a deal to be makin', you and me. So find me in me realm, and we take care of business!",o="Reúnete con Bwonsamdi en el reino espiritual.",oEN="Meet Bwonsamdi in the spirit realm.",c="¡Vaya, mira nada más, Héroe! Estás ante mí, luciendo la bendición del Barón como una insignia de honor. Eso significa que eres digno.\n\nAhora es el momento, mon, de que reúna todo lo que has aprendido y le demuestre que eres digno de esta bendición. Has logrado que dos Loas te den su bendición, y yo te daré la mía; con esto podrás ser parte de los Zandalari para siempre. Así que lleva esta bendición con orgullo, deja que guíe tu camino como un auténtico Windreavah.",cEN="Well, look at ya, Hero! Ya stand before me, wearin' da Baron's blessin' like a badge of honor. Dat means ya're worthy.\n\nNow it's time, mon, for me to bring all ya've learned togetha an' show 'im dat ya be worthy of dis blessin'. Ya've managed to make two Loas give ya their blessin', an' I'll give ya mine, with this ya can be part of da Zandalari forevah. So carry dis blessin' wit' pride, let it guide yer path as a true Windreavah."}
Q[24490]={d="Xi'ri, naaru primordial y faro de la Luz para el pueblo Draenei, ha sentido una grave perturbación. ¡Uno de los fragmentos sagrados que canalizan sus energías sagradas ha sido robado por siniestros agentes del Vacío!\n\nSin este fragmento desaparecido, la conexión de Xi'ri con la Luz se ve amenazada, dejando a los Draenei vulnerables a la oscuridad que acecha. Ella te implora que recuperes este precioso artefacto robado por siniestras criaturas del vacío antes de que su resplandor se extinga.\n\n¡Adéntrate en las guaridas sombrías de los caminantes del vacío retorcidos para reclamar el fragmento antes de que la luz de Xi'ri se atenúe! Solo restaurando el faro de la Luz del naaru se podrá devolver el equilibrio a los Draenei y mantener la vigilia protectora de Xi'ri.\n\n¡El destino del fragmento, y la guía de Xi'ri, descansan ahora en tus manos, campeón! ¡Restaura esta reliquia sagrada para que la benevolencia de Xi'ri sobre los Draenei perdure contra las fuerzas oscuras que buscan extinguir su Luz!",dEN="Xi'ri, prime naaru and beacon of the Light for the Draenei people, has sensed a grave disturbance. One of the sacred Shards channeling her holy energies has been stolen by sinister agents of the Void!\n\nWithout this missing Shard, Xi'ri's connection to the Light is threatened, leaving the Draenei vulnerable to the encroaching darkness. She implores you to recover this precious artifact taken by sinister void creatures before her radiance is extinguished.\n\nVenture into the shadowy lairs of the void-twisted netherwalkers to reclaim the Shard before Xi'ri's light dims! Only by restoring the naaru's beacon of the Light can balance be returned to the Draenei and Xi'ri's protective vigil be maintained.\n\nThe fate of the Shard, and Xi'ri's guidance, now rests in your hands, champion! Restore this holy relic so Xi'ri's benevolence over the Draenei endures against the dark forces that seek to extinguish her Light!",o="Devuelve el Fragmento de luz robado a Xi'ri",oEN="Return The Stolen Shard of Light to Xi'ri",p="¿Has encontrado el Fragmento robado?",pEN="Did you find the Stolen Shard?",c="Muy impresionante, <name>... ¡el Fragmento de luz robado no debió de ser fácil de conseguir! Me alivia ver que has regresado sano y salvo con el Fragmento de luz. Su resplandor es una señal de esperanza para nuestra causa, pero también de un grave peligro si cayera en las manos equivocadas. Has demostrado tu valor y habilidad al liberarlo del alcance de la Legión.",cEN="Most impressive, <name>... the Stolen Shard of Light could not have been easy to get! I am relieved to see you have returned safely with the Shard of Light. Its radiance signals hope for our cause, yet also grave danger should it fall into the wrong hands. You have proven your courage and skill in liberating it from the Legion's grasp."}
Q[24491]={d="Los temidos Hijos de Gruul por fin han sido decapitados. Sus cabezas cortadas, contenidas en este saco, son prueba de tus heroicas hazañas en nombre del pueblo de Terrallende.\n\nGruul engendró a su progenie para ser tan astuta como brutal, pero su siglos de cruel dominio han llegado a su fin. Las temibles sombras proyectadas sobre la tierra por sus formas ciclópeas no se extenderán más.\n\nLleva el saco de cabezas cortadas al Traidor Grondstok. Él sabrá qué rituales de limpieza deben realizarse para la purificación contra cualquier vestigio de corrupción demoníaca que portaran los Hijos. La gratitud de todo el pueblo libre te acompaña.",dEN="The dreaded Sons of Gruul have been decapitated at last. Their severed heads contained in this sack are evidence of your heroic deeds on behalf of the people of Outland.\n\nGruul bred his progeny to be as cunning as they were brutal, but their centuries of cruel dominion have been brought to an end. The fearful shadows cast across the land by their cyclopean forms will stretch no longer.\n\nTake the sack of severed heads to Betrayer Grondstok. He will know what cleansing rituals must be done to purification against any vestiges of demonic corruption the Sons carried. The gratitude of all free people goes with you.",o="Lleva el Saco pesado de cabezas a Betrayer Grondstok",oEN="Take the Heavy Sack of Heads to Betrayer Grondstok",p="¿Tienes las cabezas?",pEN="Do you have the heads?",c="¡SÍ! ¡Eres guerrero fuerte, guerrero valiente, más fuerte que un ogro, más fuerte que un gronn! Con cabezas, los ogros escuchan a Grondstok. Grondstok ordena a los ogros que se vuelvan contra Gruul, que dejen en paz a la gente de <name>. ¡Las cabezas tienen poder, el poderoso poder de los hijos de Gruul, de la piedra y la montaña y el gronn! ¡Dadle cabezas a Grondstok, y este poder será nuestro!\n\n<name>..., veo que has logrado la hazaña monumental de reunir las cabezas cortadas de los Hijos de Gruul. No puedo negar la habilidad y la valentía que has mostrado en esta tarea. Pocos se atreverían a enfrentar la furia de la descendencia de Gruul. Si entregas las cabezas al traidor como prometiste, grandes recompensas podrían llegar a ti.",cEN="YES! You are strong warrior, brave warrior, stronger than ogre, stronger than gronn! With heads, ogres listen to Grondstok. Grondstok command ogres to turn on Gruul, leave <name>'s people alone. Heads have power, mighty power of Gruul's son's, of stone and mountain and gronn! Give Grondstok heads, and this power become ours!\n\n\n<name>..., I see you have accomplished the monumental feat of gathering the severed heads of the Sons of Gruul. I cannot deny the skill and bravery you showed in this task. Few would dare face the rage of Gruul's offspring. Should you give the heads to the betrayer as promised, great rewards may come your way."}
Q[24492]={d="Poderosos ogros habitan en las montañas cercanas, brutos salvajes leales a su amo. El traidor desea socavar a este amo pero carece de la fuerza para enfrentarse a estos ogros directamente.",dEN="Powerful ogres dwell in the mountains nearby, savage brutes loyal to their master. The betrayer wishes to undermine this master but lacks the strength to face these ogres directly.",o="El traidor se ha embarcado en una tarea espeluznante. No sabes para qué ritual sombrío está destinada, pero el traidor promete una gran recompensa por completar esta sangrienta cosecha.",oEN="The betrayer has set out on a gruesome task. You know not what grim ritual they are meant for, but the betrayer promises great reward for completing this gory harvest."}
Q[24493]={d="Gruul controla ogros, en la cueva, demasiado fuertes para luchar sin un ejército. Los hijos de Gruul son los segundos más fuertes, pero solo los segundos. Siguen siendo más fuertes que Grondstok, pero Grondstok conoce formas de quitarles su fuerza, hacerla suya. No, hacerla nuestra. Grondstok no quiere la guerra con los Draenei, no quiere servir a Gruul. Con las cabezas de los hijos de Gruul, iniciaremos la rebelión.\n\nLos Hijos son demasiado fuertes, así que Grondstok espera, pero tú consigues ayuda, matas a los hijos, y Grondstok te otorga la fuerza de un gronn.",dEN="Gruul control ogres, in cave, too strong to fight without army. Gruul's sons second strongest, but only second. Still stronger than Grondstok, but Grondstok know ways to take their strength, make it his. No, make it ours. Grondstok not want war with Draenei, not want serve Gruul. With heads of Gruul sons, we start rebellion.\n\nSons too strong, so Grondstok waits, but you get help, slay sons, and Grondstok give you strength of gronn.",o="El traidor se ha embarcado en una tarea espeluznante. No sabes para qué ritual sombrío está destinada, pero el traidor promete una gran recompensa por completar esta sangrienta cosecha.",oEN="The betrayer has set out on a gruesome task. You know not what grim ritual they are meant for, but the betrayer promises great reward for completing this gory harvest."}
Q[24494]={d="La investigación sobre las propiedades de la sangre de fel progresa lentamente, como era de esperar. Se ha avanzado algo respecto a cómo se relaciona con la corrupción de fel estándar que experimentan otros orcos. Varias sustancias podrían ayudar potencialmente a comprender las propiedades de la sangre de fel.\n\n- La Sangre de Mannoroth: la mayoría parece haber sido consumida ya por los orcos, y ningún método para llegar al demonio Mannoroth ha resultado viable.\n\n- Sangre de Señor del Foso: potencialmente del demonio Magtheridon, que está prisionero en esta zona, para comprender las propiedades específicas de la sangre de Mannoroth.\n\nAdemás de estas, parece haber varias sustancias artificiales creadas por la Horda de Fel. Quizás algunas de estas hayan logrado replicar las propiedades de la sangre demoníaca, siempre que no sean\n\n- Elixir Abismal: parece ser una poción creada para potenciar a los orcos.\n\n- Sangre de las Legiones: además de la vaga denominación de los Orcos de Fel, ¿podría proporcionar propiedades diferentes para estudiar?\n\n- Elixir Demoníaco: posiblemente similar al Elixir Abismal, aunque los Orcos de Fel parecen describirlo como una sustancia distinta.\n\nLamentablemente, carezco de los medios para luchar contra los Orcos de Fel y obtener cualquiera de estas, y no he podido conseguir apoyo adicional para mi investigación más allá de estos prisioneros. Esta plataforma en la Ciudadela de la Llama Infernal parece permanecer aislada al menos, y espero que se mantenga segura en el futuro previsible.",dEN="Research into the properties of the fel blood is progressing slowly as expected. Some progress has been made regarding how it relates to the standard fel corruption other orcs experience. Several substances may potentially aid in understanding the properties of fel blood.\n\n- The Blood of Mannoroth, most seems to have been consumed by the orcs already, and no method of reaching the demon Mannoroth has proven feasible.\n\n- Pit Lord's Blood, potentially from the demon Magtheridon imprisoned in this area, for understanding properties specific to Mannoroth's blood.\n\nBesides these, there seem to be several artificial substances created by the Fel Horde. Perhaps some of these have managed to replicate properties of demon blood, provided they are not\n\n- Abyssal Elxir, seems to be a potion created to empower the orcs.\n\n- Blood of the Legions, besides the Fel Orc's vague naming, may provide different properties to study?\n\n- Demonic Elixir, possibly similar to Abyssal Elixir, Fel Orcs seem to describe it as a separate substance though.\n\nUnfortunately I lack the means of fighting past the Fel Orcs to obtain any of these, and have not been able to procure additional support in my research besides these prisoners. This platform on Hellfire Citadel seems to remain isolated at least and it is my hope that it remains secure for the foreseeable future.",o="Lleva las muestras de sangre que hayas recogido a Sakari para que podamos estudiar las propiedades de la vitalidad del señor del abismo y comprender mejor el verdadero poder y peligro de la sangre fel.",oEN="Bring your gathered blood samples to Sakari so that we may study the properties of pit lord vitae and better understand the true power and danger of fel blood.",p="Hola, ¿necesitas algo?",pEN="Hello, do you need something?",c="¿Has encontrado las muestras? Abandoné ese manifiesto después de que quedara expuesto a la sangre de fel, no esperaba que nadie fuera realmente a buscarlas...\n\nBueno, gracias. He pasado la mayor parte de mi vida intentando comprender las propiedades de la corrupción de fel y, lo que es más importante, cómo eliminarla por completo de mi pueblo. Puede que encontrara una forma una vez... bueno, no es una que pueda volver a intentar por un tiempo. Vine aquí con la esperanza de que la corrupción más intensa de los orcos de fel de aquí pudiera ayudarme a comprenderla mejor.\n\nCon esto, tal vez pueda progresar de verdad.",cEN="You found the samples? I'd abandoned that manifest after it was exposed to the fel blood, I didn't expect anyone to actually go looking for these...\n\nWell, thank you. I've spent most of my life trying to understand the properties of fel corruption, and more importantly, how to fully remove it from my people. I may have found a way once...well, it's not one I can try again for a while yet. I came here hoping that the more intense corruption of the fel orcs here might help me understand it better.\n\nWith these, maybe I can actually make some progress."}
Q[24495]={d="Ya que estás aquí, me vendría bien algo de ayuda con una cosa más, si estás dispuesto, por supuesto. Puede que haya encontrado una forma de revertir por completo la corrupción de uno de estos orcos fel. Aunque creo que debería funcionar, el hecho de que haya revertido parcialmente la influencia fel en ellos no hace que sean menos leales a Kargath.\n\nNo soy muy buen luchador y no he podido conseguir a nadie que lo sea. Si pudieras quedarte un momento mientras libero al orco para probar esto, te lo agradecería mucho. En caso de que no pueda sedarlo adecuadamente y este intente algo.",dEN="While you're here, I could use some help with one more thing, if you're willing of course. I may have found a way to fully revert the corruption of one of these fel orcs. While I believe it should work, the fact that I've partially reverted the fel influence on them doesn't make them any less loyal to Kargath.\n\nI'm not much of a fighter, and I haven't been able to secure anyone who is. If you could stay for a moment while I release the orc to try this, it would be much appreciated. If I'm not able to sedate it properly and it tries something.",o="Sakari tiene un sujeto para probar el antídoto contra la sangre fel. Cree que estudiar sus efectos podría otorgar un gran poder, pero advierte que los resultados pueden ser impredecibles.",oEN="Sakari has a subject to test the fel blood antidote on. She believes studying its effects could yield great power, but cautions the results may be unpredictable.",p="¡Esto no ha funcionado en absoluto!",pEN="This didn't work at all!",c="Bueno, eso... eso no ha funcionado...\n\nLo siento, yo... bueno, normalmente, si realizo ingeniería inversa de propiedades mágicas, puedo invertirlas. Está claro que no entiendo esto tan bien como creía. Más tiempo y más investigación, supongo. Primero esa arpía y luego esto... aunque, si una solución fuera fácil, alguien la habría encontrado ya. Lo resolveré, tarde o temprano.\n\nAun así, me has salvado la vida. Logré averiguar qué es la \"Sangre de las Legiones\", es bastante intrigante como una forma más controlada de corrupción de fel. Una que, basándome en las propiedades que estoy observando, es una forma de corrupción de fel mucho más controlada. Una que no dañará tu mente y tu cuerpo... bueno, no tanto.\n\nPara que quede claro, sigo sin sugerir el uso de este tipo de poder, ni que confíes en mi juicio al respecto considerando... los eventos recientes. Pero no creo que sirva de mucho para mi investigación, y al menos te debo algo, así que el elixir es tuyo. Puedes usarlo como desees. Solo ten cuidado.",cEN="Well, that...that didn't work...\n\nI'm sorry, I...well, usually, if I reverse engineer magical properties I can invert them. Clearly I don't understand this as well as I believed. More time and more research, I suppose. First that harpy and then this...then again, if a solution was easy, someone would have found one by now. I'll solve it, eventually.\n\nStill, you saved my life. I did manage to figure out what \"Blood of Legions\", it's actually rather intriguing as a more controlled form of fel corruption. One that, based on the properties I'm observing, is a much more controlled form of fel corruption. One that won't damage your mind and body...well, as much.\n\nTo be clear, I still don't suggest using this sort of power, or trusting my judgement on it considering...recent events. But I don't believe it's much use to my research, and I do owe you something at least, so the elixir is yours. You can use it how you wish. Just be careful."}
Q[24496]={d="marcador de posición",dEN="placeholder",o="marcador de posición",oEN="placeholder"}
Q[24497]={d="BRUCE",dEN="BRUCE",o="BRUCE",oEN="BRUCE"}
Q[24498]={d="¡A nuestros soldados capturados los han puesto a trabajar en la cantera!\n\nMata a sus captores y libéralos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Necesitaremos su ayuda cuando nos enfrentemos al Señor de la Plaga Tyrannus.",dEN="They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry! Kill their captors and set them free, hero, and do it quickly. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus.",o="解救15名联盟奴隶，消灭熔炉领主加弗斯特。",oEN="Free 15 Alliance Slaves and kill Forgemaster Garfrost.",c="你今天做的很好。随着士兵们被解救和熔炉入口的打开，不用多久我就可以协助大家一起打败天灾领主泰兰努斯以及通过这个肮脏的矿洞了。",cEN="You've done well this day. With many of the slaves freed and now with access to the forges, it will not be long before I have a strong force to aid in delivering us from Scourgelord Tyrannus and this foul pit."}
Q[24499]={d="Somos muy pocos para arriesgarnos a entrar en la Ciudadela, pero las oportunidades como esta son demasiado escasas como para dejarlas pasar.\n\nAbre un camino hasta el otro lado y asegura el paso al Foso de Saron. Tendremos que controlarlo para poder introducir a nuestros hombres en la Ciudadela.",dEN="I cannot thank you enough for coming. We're severely undermanned to be risking a venture into the citadel, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.\n\nI'm awaiting the arrival of champions from the coliseum, but if your reputation holds true, you should be more than equipped to fight through the forge yourself. Clear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the citadel.\n\nPlease hurry, <name>. We're counting on you.",o="消灭布隆亚姆和噬魂者，夺取萨隆矿坑的入口。",oEN="Kill Bronjahm and the Devourer of Souls to secure access to the Pit of Saron."}
Q[24500]={d="乌瑟尔知道该如何击败阿尔萨斯。很难相信，最有可能击败阿尔萨斯的地方恰恰就是在他王座前的阶梯上。如果阿尔萨斯倒下，谁又会戴上巫妖王的王冠？\n\n有许多问题还悬而未决，但你发现的答案对于击败阿尔萨斯也许会起到关键性的作用。你需要找到吉安娜，并逃过巫妖王的攻击。",dEN="Uther knew a great deal about how Arthas might be defeated. It's hard to believe that there is much hope of defeating Arthas upon the steps of his own throne. And who will take up the crown of Lich King if it comes to that?\n\nMany questions remain, but the answers that you've uncovered may be critical to ensuring Arthas' defeat. You need to find Jaina and escape the Lich King while there's still time.",o="找到吉安娜·普罗德摩尔，并逃出映像大厅。",oEN="Find Lady Jaina Proudmoore and escape the Halls of Reflection",p="我们要把这个消息带给联盟，它可能是击败阿尔萨斯的关键。",pEN="We need to get this information to the Alliance! It may well be the key to Arthas' defeat.",c="<吉安娜微微地喘息。>\n\n难以相信我们还活着。追随过他是我最大的愚行，我犯过太多错误了。你呢……你宁愿鲁莽地选择为我断后，也不愿先逃走把消息传出去……但是……嗯……谢谢。你是个真正的英雄。\n\n有了乌瑟尔的指导，我们有希望打败阿尔萨斯。绝不能让今天的战士白白牺牲。",cEN="<Jaina is still catching her breath.>\n\nI can barely believe we're still alive. It was foolish of me to follow him. I've made that mistake too many times. And you... it was reckless of you to come after me instead of escaping with the information! But... well... thank you. You truly are a hero.\n\nWith Uther's guidance, we may stand a chance at defeating Arthas. All the lives lost today were not in vain."}
Q[24501]={d="La investigación sobre las propiedades de la sangre de fel progresa lentamente, como era de esperar. Se ha avanzado algo respecto a cómo se relaciona con la corrupción de fel estándar que experimentan otros orcos. Varias sustancias podrían ayudar potencialmente a comprender las propiedades de la sangre de fel.\n\n- La Sangre de Mannoroth: la mayoría parece haber sido consumida ya por los orcos, y ningún método para llegar al demonio Mannoroth ha resultado viable.\n\n- Sangre de Señor del Foso: potencialmente del demonio Magtheridon, que está prisionero en esta zona, para comprender las propiedades específicas de la sangre de Mannoroth.\n\nAdemás de estas, parece haber varias sustancias artificiales creadas por la Horda de Fel. Quizás algunas de estas hayan logrado replicar las propiedades de la sangre demoníaca, siempre que no sean\n\n- Elixir Abismal: parece ser una poción creada para potenciar a los orcos.\n\n- Sangre de las Legiones: además de la vaga denominación de los Orcos de Fel, ¿podría proporcionar propiedades diferentes para estudiar?\n\n- Elixir Demoníaco: posiblemente similar al Elixir Abismal, aunque los Orcos de Fel parecen describirlo como una sustancia distinta.\n\nLamentablemente, carezco de los medios para luchar contra los Orcos de Fel y obtener cualquiera de estas, y no he podido conseguir apoyo adicional para mi investigación más allá de estos prisioneros. Esta plataforma en la Ciudadela de la Llama Infernal parece permanecer aislada al menos, y espero que se mantenga segura en el futuro previsible.",dEN="Research into the properties of the fel blood is progressing slowly as expected. Some progress has been made regarding how it relates to the standard fel corruption other orcs experience. Several substances may potentially aid in understanding the properties of fel blood.\n\n- The Blood of Mannoroth, most seems to have been consumed by the orcs already, and no method of reaching the demon Mannoroth has proven feasible.\n\n- Pit Lord's Blood, potentially from the demon Magtheridon imprisoned in this area, for understanding properties specific to Mannoroth's blood.\n\nBesides these, there seem to be several artificial substances created by the Fel Horde. Perhaps some of these have managed to replicate properties of demon blood, provided they are not\n\n- Abyssal Elxir, seems to be a potion created to empower the orcs.\n\n- Blood of the Legions, besides the Fel Orc's vague naming, may provide different properties to study?\n\n- Demonic Elixir, possibly similar to Abyssal Elixir, Fel Orcs seem to describe it as a separate substance though.\n\nUnfortunately I lack the means of fighting past the Fel Orcs to obtain any of these, and have not been able to procure additional support in my research besides these prisoners. This platform on Hellfire Citadel seems to remain isolated at least and it is my hope that it remains secure for the foreseeable future.",o="Lleva las muestras de sangre que hayas recogido a Sakari para que podamos estudiar las propiedades de la vitalidad del señor del abismo y comprender mejor el verdadero poder y peligro de la sangre fel.",oEN="Bring your gathered blood samples to Sakari so that we may study the properties of pit lord vitae and better understand the true power and danger of fel blood.",p="Hola, ¿necesitas algo?",pEN="Hello, do you need something?",c="¿Has encontrado las muestras? Abandoné ese manifiesto después de que quedara expuesto a la sangre de fel, no esperaba que nadie fuera realmente a buscarlas...\n\nBueno, gracias. He pasado la mayor parte de mi vida intentando comprender las propiedades de la corrupción de fel y, lo que es más importante, cómo eliminarla por completo de mi pueblo. Puede que encontrara una forma una vez... bueno, no es una que pueda volver a intentar por un tiempo. Vine aquí con la esperanza de que la corrupción más intensa de los orcos de fel de aquí pudiera ayudarme a comprenderla mejor.\n\nCon esto, tal vez pueda progresar de verdad.",cEN="You found the samples? I'd abandoned that manifest after it was exposed to the fel blood, I didn't expect anyone to actually go looking for these...\n\nWell, thank you. I've spent most of my life trying to understand the properties of fel corruption, and more importantly, how to fully remove it from my people. I may have found a way once...well, it's not one I can try again for a while yet. I came here hoping that the more intense corruption of the fel orcs here might help me understand it better.\n\nWith these, maybe I can actually make some progress."}
Q[24502]={d="<name>...los viajeros que pasan cerca de Honor Hold han informado de ruidos extraños que emanan de una estatua de grifo de piedra conocida como el Grypholith. Existe la preocupación de que este constructo pueda estar poseído por magia oscura y pueda suponer una amenaza para el pueblo. Necesitamos que entres en combate con el Grypholith para detener cualquier fuerza malévola que lo controle antes de que pueda dañar Honor Hold.",dEN="<name>...travelers passing near Honor Hold have reported strange noises emanating from a stone gryphon statue known as the Grypholith. There are concerns that this construct may be possessed by dark magic and could pose a threat to the town. We need you to engage the Grypholith in combat to stop whatever malevolent force controls it before it can harm Honor Hold.",o="Investiga los ruidos extraños que provienen de la estatua de Grypholith.",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Grypholith statue.",c="Has prestado un gran servicio al destruir al Grypholith, <name>. Sea cual sea la presencia oscura que poseía esa estatua, su poder ha sido roto gracias a ti. Por favor, permíteme recompensar tu valor al proteger Honor Hold.",cEN="You've done a great service destroying the Grypholith, <name>. Whatever dark presence had possessed that statue, its power is broken thanks to you. Please, allow me to reward your valor in protecting Honor Hold."}
Q[24503]={d="<name>...los aventureros que visitan la ciudad de Shattrath han informado de ruidos extraños que provienen de una estatua de piedra de un wyvern conocida como Teralis cerca de Mag'har Post. Existe la preocupación de que este constructo pueda haber sido poseído por magia elemental inestable y pueda suponer una amenaza para nuestra ciudad. Necesitamos que investigues estos informes y elimines cualquier amenaza potencial. Una vez que hayas contenido este problema, regresa con Khadgar en Shattrath para informarle de tus hallazgos.",dEN="<name>...adventurers visiting Shattrath City have reported strange noises coming from a stone wyvern statue known as the Teralis around Mag'har Post. There are concerns that this construct may have become possessed by unstable elemental magic and could pose a threat to our city. We need you to investigate these reports and eliminate any potential threat. Once you have contained this issue, return to Khadgar in Shattrath to report your findings.",o="Investiga los ruidos extraños que provienen de la estatua de Teralis.",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Teralis statue.",c="Has prestado un gran servicio al evitar la amenaza en el puesto Mag'har, <name>. Sea cual sea la presencia elemental que poseía esa estatua, su poder ha sido roto gracias a ti. Por favor, permíteme recompensar tu valor al proteger Shattrath.",cEN="You've done a great service preventing the threat at Mag'har post, <name>. Whatever elemental presence had possessed that statue, its power is broken thanks to you. Please, allow me to reward your valor in protecting Shattrath."}
Q[24504]={d="<name>...los viajeros que pasan cerca de Honor Hold han informado de ruidos extraños que emanan de una estatua de grifo de piedra conocida como el Grypholith. Existe la preocupación de que este constructo pueda estar poseído por magia oscura y pueda suponer una amenaza para el pueblo. Necesitamos que entres en combate con el Grypholith para detener cualquier fuerza malévola que lo controle antes de que pueda dañar Honor Hold.",dEN="<name>...travelers passing near Honor Hold have reported strange noises emanating from a stone gryphon statue known as the Grypholith. There are concerns that this construct may be possessed by dark magic and could pose a threat to the town. We need you to engage the Grypholith in combat to stop whatever malevolent force controls it before it can harm Honor Hold.",o="Investiga los ruidos extraños que provienen de la estatua de Grypholith.",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Grypholith statue."}
Q[24505]={d="<name>...los aventureros que visitan la ciudad de Shattrath han informado de ruidos extraños que provienen de una estatua de piedra de un wyvern conocida como Teralis cerca de Mag'har Post. Existe la preocupación de que este constructo pueda haber sido poseído por magia elemental inestable y pueda suponer una amenaza para nuestra ciudad. Necesitamos que investigues estos informes y elimines cualquier amenaza potencial. Una vez que hayas contenido este problema, regresa con Khadgar en Shattrath para informarle de tus hallazgos.",dEN="<name>...adventurers visiting Shattrath City have reported strange noises coming from a stone wyvern statue known as the Teralis around Mag'har Post. There are concerns that this construct may have become possessed by unstable elemental magic and could pose a threat to our city. We need you to investigate these reports and eliminate any potential threat. Once you have contained this issue, return to Khadgar in Shattrath to report your findings.",o="Investiga los ruidos extraños que provienen de la estatua de Teralis.",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Teralis statue."}
Q[24506]={d="¡$C! ¡Ven rápido, tengo que hablar contigo!\n\nMi reina, Lady Sylvanas Brisaveloz, ha descubierto un hueco en las defensas de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo. Es un lugar al que se refirió como \"La Forja de Almas\". Antes de irse me dijo que le enviara guerreros feroces... Creo que tú servirás.\n\nReúnete con ella en la entrada de la forja, $c.",dEN="<class>! Come close quickly, I must have a word!\n\nMy queen, the Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as \"The Forge of Souls.\" She sent word before she left for me to find fierce fighters to send her way. I think you'll do.\n\nGo to her within the entrance to the forge, <class>.",o="从冰冠堡垒一侧进入到灵魂洪炉，在那里找到希尔瓦娜斯·风行者女王。",oEN="Enter The Forge of Souls from the side of Icecrown Citadel and locate Lady Sylvanas Windrunner.",c="Bien. <name>, te conozco. Serás perfecto para estas tareas.\n\nSe nos ha presentado una oportunidad poco común para adentrarnos en la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo, pero debemos movernos rápido si queremos evitar que Arthas se dé cuenta.",cEN="Good. <name>, I know of you. You'll be perfect for these tasks.\n\nWe've been afforded a rare chance to delve into Icecrown Citadel, but we must move quickly if we're to avoid Arthas' notice."}
Q[24507]={d="¡A nuestros soldados capturados los han puesto a trabajar en la cantera!\n\nMata a sus captores y libéralos, $c. Necesitaremos su ayuda cuando nos enfrentemos al Señor de la Plaga Tyrannus.",dEN="They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry. Kill their captors and set them free, <class>, and do it quickly. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus.",o="解救15名部落奴隶，消灭熔炉领主加弗斯特。",oEN="Free 15 Horde Slaves and kill Forgemaster Garfrost.",c="你今天做的很好。随着士兵们被解救和熔炉入口的打开，不用多久我就可以协助大家一起打败天灾领主泰兰努斯以及通过这个肮脏的矿洞了。",cEN="You've done well this day. With many of the slaves freed and now with access to the forges, it will not be long before I have a strong force to aid in delivering us from Scourgelord Tyrannus and this foul pit."}
Q[24510]={d="¡$C! ¡Ven rápido, tengo que hablar contigo!\n\nMi superior, Lady Jaina Valiente, ha descubierto una brecha en las defensas de la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo. Es un lugar al que se refirió como \"La Forja de Almas\". Antes de irse me dijo que buscara toda la ayuda que pudiera... Y, bueno, esperaba que fueras tú.\n\nPor favor, reúnete con ella lo antes posible.",dEN="<class>! Come close quickly, I must have a word!\n\nMy patron, the Lady Jaina Proudmoore, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as \"The Forge of Souls.\" She sent word before she left for me to find any help that I could... and, well, I was hoping that might be you.\n\nPlease, find her there as soon as you can.",o="从冰冠堡垒一侧进入到灵魂洪炉，在那里找到吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士。",oEN="Enter The Forge of Souls from the side of Icecrown Citadel and find Lady Jaina Proudmoore."}
Q[24511]={d="Entrar en la Ciudadela con tan poca gente es arriesgado en el mejor de los casos, pero las oportunidades como esta son demasiado raras como para dejarlas pasar.\n\nAbre un camino hasta el otro lado y asegura el paso al Foso de Saron. Tendremos que controlarlo para poder introducir a nuestros hombres en la Ciudadela.",dEN="I'm glad we have someone capable to aid us in this. Delving into the citadel with so few is risky at best, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.\n\nI'm awaiting the arrival of champions from the coliseum, but if your reputation holds true, you should be more than equipped to fight through the forge yourself. Clear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the Citadel.\n\nBe quick about it, <name>. Time is short.",o="消灭布隆亚姆和噬魂者，夺取萨隆矿坑的入口。",oEN="Kill Bronjahm and the Devourer of Souls to secure access to the Pit of Saron.",c="¡Bien hecho, <class>!\n\nEl Foso de Saron se encuentra más adelante y, si nuestros exploradores tienen razón, después de eso estarán los Salones de la Reflexión. Es allí donde Arthas baja la guardia, y es allí donde esperamos encontrar una pista sobre su debilidad... y una ruta para la venganza que tanto se ha hecho esperar.",cEN="Well timed, <class>!\n\nThe Pit of Saron lies ahead, and if our scouts are correct, past that will be the Halls of Reflection. It is there that Arthas lets his guard down, and it is there that we hope to find a clue to his weakness... and a route to vengeance long overdue."}
Q[24522]={d="尽快将奎尔德拉带到太阳之井，$n。要相信乌瑟尔的话，他说过，当这把剑受到巫妖王邪恶力量的影响时，你不能彻底控制它。你必须转至奎尔丹纳斯岛，在那里，设法进入太阳之井，只有在那你才能净化这把剑。\n\n太阳之井的守卫不会轻易放行的，所以你必须找到哈杜伦·明翼，他会在那里巡视那些守卫。",dEN="Take Quel'Delar to the Sunwell as quickly as possible, <name>. Trust in Uther's words when he says that you will not always be able to control the blade while it is subject to the evil of the Lich King's influence. You must travel to the Isle of Quel'Danas, and there, seek entry to the Sunwell itself, where you can cleanse the sword.\n\nThe guardians of the Sunwell will not simply allow you to walk in, so you must find Halduron Brightwing, who will be inspecting the guards there.",o="在奎尔丹纳斯岛，太阳之井高地入口处同哈杜伦·明翼交谈。",oEN="Speak with Halduron Brightwing at the entrance to the Sunwell Plateau on the Isle of Quel'Danas.",p="什么风把你吹来了？",pEN="What brings you here?",c="允许你进入太阳之井？不可能！太阳之井对于我的人民来说是最神秘、最神圣、最重要之地。我们最近才在破碎残阳的帮助下重夺太阳之井。它可不是随随便便一个游客就能进的地方。",cEN="Admit you to the Sunwell? That's impossible! The Sunwell is the most sacred and important site of our people. We have only recently reclaimed it with the help of the Shattered Sun Offensive. It is not a place for tourists or travelers."}
Q[24535]={d="$n，如果你真的拥有奎尔德拉，我也许可以让你进入太阳之井。也许你知道这把剑的历史，知道萨洛瑞安·寻晨者曾经挥舞它对抗天灾军团，守卫太阳之井。他牺牲的地方就是今天的死亡之痕。正是因为他舍身血战，才为他的族人赢得了进行战争准备的时间。你可以在这座岛的死亡之痕南端找到他的遗迹。去那里看看，如果他的灵魂赐予你祝福，我就会让你进入太阳之井。",dEN="If you truly bear Quel'Delar, <name>, I might be able to admit you to the Sunwell. If you know the blade's history, you recall that it was borne by Thalorien Dawnseeker in defense of the Sunwell against the Scourge. He fell in what is now the Dead Scar, buying time for his men to make their own preparations. You will find his remains near the southern end of the Dead Scar on this isle. Visit them, and if his spirit gives you its blessing, I will allow you to enter the Sunwell.",o="访问萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的遗体，获得他的祝福，以使用奎尔德拉。",oEN="Visit Thalorien Dawnseeker's Remains and obtain his blessing to wield Quel'Delar.",p="怎么样？你找到萨洛瑞安的遗体了吗？",pEN="Did you visit the ground where Thalorien fell defending the Sunwell?",c="我承认我真没想到萨洛瑞安的灵魂会认为你能胜任奎尔德拉的继承人，不过我相信他的选择。你可以进入太阳之井，但是我提醒你你作为我们最神圣之地的客人，你可要注意你的行为举止。",cEN="I confess that I did not expect Thalorien's spirit to recognize you as the heir to Quel'Delar, but I defer to his judgment. You may enter the Sunwell, but I remind you that you are a guest in our most sacred of precincts, and you should act accordingly."}
Q[24536]={d="¡Fíjate en estos tíos! Bonvapor se ha estado encargando del negocio de las fiestas todos estos años, y de repente estos tipos invaden el mercado. No son Bonvapor, así que el cártel me ha contratado para investigar. Algo apesta, y no solo el perfume.rnrnLleva este aparato que me he traído y analiza las nubes de perfume que hay alrededor de los guardias. Quiero saber qué ponen en esa sustancia. No es natural.",dEN="Get a load of these guys, would ya? Steamwheedle's been handling the business of holidays for years, and all of a sudden, these guys bust into the market. They're not Steamwheedle; the cartel hired me to get to the bottom of this. Something stinks here and it ain't just perfume.\n\nTake this device I brought and go analyze the perfume clouds around the guards. I want to know what they're putting in that stuff. Things ain't natural.",o="使用滑栓的空气分析器测试6位带有浓郁香气的卫兵周围的空气，然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Use Snagglebolt's Air Analyzer to test the air around 6 heavily perfumed guards, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你分析过那股气息吗，孩子？",pEN="You analyze that reek yet, kid?",c="嘿谢谢，孩子。拿过来让我看看。\n\n<他从你手中拿走了设备，来回摆弄。>\n\n哦，这看起来可不太妙。",cEN="Hey, thanks, kid. Give it over, let's take a look.\n\n<He takes the device from you and fiddles with it.>\n\nOh, that ain't good."}
Q[24541]={d="¡Sabía que no tramaban nada bueno! Aquí hay algún tipo de compuesto químico que afecta a la mente, pero con una muestra tan pequeña no consigo aislarlo. Necesito el de verdad.rnrn¡Ni se te ocurra comprarlo sin más! No quiero que les des ni una moneda a esos sinvergüenzas. No, quiero que lo cojas de la fuente, con discreción.rnrnTe disfrazaré de mensajero. He visto un montón de cajones custodiado por sus guardias, fuera de las puertas. Pasa corriendo, ¡y no te pares, o te descubrirán! Te tirarán un cajón. Tráemelo.",dEN="I knew they were up to no good! There's some sort of mind-affecting chemical in here, but I can't get a handle on it with such a small sample. I need the real stuff.\n\nDon't just go over there and buy it! I don't want you giving these scumbags one copper. Nah, you gotta get it from the source, discreet-like.\n\nI'll disguise you as a package runner. I saw a stockpile guarded by their goons outside the gates. Go run by, and DON'T stop, or they'll make you! They'll toss you a crate. Bring it back here.",o="Mientras estés $gdisfrazado:disfrazada; de mensajero, ve al montón de cajones de Químicos La Corona, S.L. fuera de las puertas de Orgrimmar y vuelve con el paquete que te lancen a ver al detective Snap Tuerceganzúas en Orgrimmar.",oEN="While disguised as a package-runner, go to the Crown Chemical Company's stockpile outside the gates of Orgrimmar, then return the package they toss you to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgimmar.",p="他们怎么处理的？",pEN="Did they toss ya a crate to deliver?",c="Lo has conseguido, ¿eh? Buen trabajo, chico. De primera. Veamos qué tenemos aquí.",cEN="You got it, huh? Good job, kid. Top notch. Let's see what we what we got here."}
Q[24545]={d="$r，我其实不该把这个任务交给你，也许这会导致你的毁灭。\n\n不要理会我的这些话了，听听我要你去完成的任务吧。我会为你提供足够的信息和资源帮助你完成这个任务。\n\n你必须返回霜之哀伤洞穴，取得圣光的复仇——那把被阿尔萨斯丢弃的锤子。用萨隆邪铁重新铸炼它，在它上面用巫妖王奴仆的酸性血液雕刻符文。它会成为我们实行计划的基础。",dEN="It is against my judgment that I present you this errand, <race>, as it will likely end in your undoing.\n\nIgnore my counsel and embark on the endeavor, and I shall provide you with the knowledge and resources to see it through.\n\nYou must return to Frostmourne Cavern and recover Light's Vengeance, Arthas' discarded hammer. Reforged with saronite and etched with the acidic blood of the Lich King's abominations, it will provide the foundation for our work.",o="将圣光的复仇、25块源生萨隆邪铁、腐面的酸性血液和烂肠的酸性血液放进冰冠堡垒大领主莫格莱尼的符文熔炉中。\n\n腐面的酸性血液和烂肠的酸性血液只能在25人模式的冰冠堡垒中获得。",oEN="Place Light's Vengeance, 25 Primordial Saronite, Rotface's Acidic Blood, and Festergut's Acidic Blood in Highlord Mograine's runeforge in Icecrown Citadel.\n\nRotface's Acidic Blood and Festergut's Acidic Blood may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting of Icecrown Citadel.",p="伴随着你的出现，熔炉里的火焰似乎烧的更凶残了……",pEN="As you draw near, the forge's flame seems to burn even more ravenously..."}
Q[24547]={d="El Filo de las Sombras está entre las mejores armas que podría desear $gun:una; $c.\n\n¿Se ha saciado tu ansia de poder, $r?\n\n<Sientes la mirada penetrante de Mograine.>\n\nYa sabía que no. Una última advertencia, entonces...\n\nTe estás embarcando en la parte más peligrosa de tu misión. Refrena tus aspiraciones, pues si tus objetivos son impuros tu vida, tu alma, está perdida.\n\nEl arma que blandes es una cáscara vacía, una simple sombra de lo que puede ser.",dEN="Shadow's Edge is among the greatest weapons a <class> could hope to obtain.\n\nIs your lust for power sated, <race>?\n\n<You feel Mograine's penetrating gaze.>\n\nI thought not. A final warning then...\n\nYou now embark on the most treacherous leg of your quest. Bridle your aspirations, for if your aims are impure then your life, your very soul, is forfeit.\n\nThe weapon you hold is but an empty husk, a mere shadow of what it may become. Only by devouring a thousand souls shall its true potential be unlocked.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼希望你用影锋在冰冠堡垒消灭1000个巫妖王的爪牙。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to use Shadow's Edge to slay 1000 of the Lich King's minions in Icecrown Citadel. Souls can be obtained in 10 or 25 person difficulty.",c="<Highlord Mograine te observa en silencio por un momento.>\n\nParece que has soportado este tramo de tu prueba de forma admirable, <race>.\n\nReza para que el destino siga sonriéndote en tu empeño...",cEN="<Highlord Mograine eyes you in silence for a moment.>\n\nYou seem to have endured this leg of your trial admirably, <race>.\n\nPray that fate continues to smile upon you in your endeavor..."}
Q[24548]={d="巫妖王的王座再一次成为了他的牢狱。它是基尔加丹亲手从扭曲的下层位面中雕刻出来的冰晶容器。制作它的唯一目的就是封锢耐奥祖的灵魂。\n\n当阿尔萨斯用霜之哀伤击中这块冰晶的时候，他就释放了耐奥祖的灵魂，并让这个充满仇恨的灵魂和他融为一体。而这次打击所迸出的冰封王座碎片也散落在冰冠堡垒各处。\n\n我需要用这些碎片封印你的剑刃中蕴含的力量。而这些碎片都在巫妖王最强大的仆人手中。",dEN="The Lich King's throne once served as his prison. Kil'jaeden himself crafted the vessel of icy crystals from the twisting nether, its sole purpose to hold Ner'zhul's vengeful spirit.\n\nWhen Arthas struck the crystal with Frostmourne, he released Ner'zhul's soul, allowing it to merge with his own. Splinters from that impact are now scattered throughout the citadel.\n\nI shall require those shards, held only by the Lich King's most powerful servants, to seal the power contained in your blade.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼要你收集50块影霜碎片。\n\n影霜碎片只能在25人英雄难度模式下获得。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to collect 50 Shadowfrost Shards.\n\nShadowfrost Shards may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting.",c="<class>, esto debería bastar.\n\nHabla conmigo cuando Shadow's Edge haya sido completamente potenciado e intentaré completarlo.",cEN="These should suffice, <class>.\n\nSpeak to me when Shadow's Edge has been thoroughly empowered and I will attempt its completion."}
Q[24549]={o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼想要你将影锋带给他。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to bring him Shadow's Edge.",c="Enhorabuena, <class>.\n\nContra todo pronóstico, has resistido la tormenta.\n\nConfío en que tu recompensa sea proporcional a tu convicción...",cEN="Congratulations, <class>.\n\nAgainst insurmountable odds, you have weathered the storm.\n\nI trust that you shall find your reward proportionate to your conviction..."}
Q[24553]={d="我承认，我一直怀疑你不可能重铸奎尔德拉，也不相信萨洛瑞安的灵魂会赐予你祝福。你不可能明白，奎尔德拉的重生对于我们一族意味着什么。\n\n我会履行诺言，让你进入太阳之井。你将在那里找到银月的领导者。将这把剑浸入到太阳之井中。当这把剑恢复了力量的时候，如果你举起它，就像萨洛瑞安说的那样，它就会与你绑缚在一起。",dEN="I admit, I was skeptical that you had actually re-forged Quel'Delar and I did not expect Thalorien's spirit to reveal itself to you. You cannot understand what it means to me and to the rest of my people that Quel'Delar has been recovered.\n\nAs promised, I will admit you to the Sunwell and you will find the leaders of Silvermoon within. Carry the sword to the chamber of the Sunwell and immerse it. The blade will bond to you. When that happens, carry it to Caladis Brightspear at Quel'Delar's Rest.",o="Sumerge la Quel'Delar templada en La Fuente del Sol. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",oEN="Immerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你在太阳之井里发生了什么事？",pEN="What happened during your time in the Sunwell?",c="Esto es increíble, <name>. ¡Realmente lo has logrado! Todos los quel'dorei han oído hablar de Thalorien Dawnseeker y Quel'Delar, pero nadie pensó jamás que la espada sería restaurada.",cEN="This is unbelievable, <name>. You've really done it! All of the quel'dorei have heard of Thalorien Dawnseeker and Quel'Delar, but no one ever thought the sword would be restored."}
Q[24554]={d="这把残破的剑柄也有过好日子。当它的剑刃还没有折断的时候，它应该是代表着高超铸造工艺的一件杰出作品。\n\n它上面的精致雕刻和奇异宝石表明这件武器可能属于一个非常强大的人。夺日者一定会对它感兴趣的。去找到他们在奎尔德拉之冢的代表人。他应该就在银色比武场的南边。",dEN="This battered old sword hilt has seen better days. Before the hilt was snapped from the blade, it must've been a magnificent example of the blacksmith's art.\n\nThe graceful symbols and exotic gemstones decorating the hilt suggest that the weapon may have belonged to a powerful person. Surely, the Sunreavers would be interested in hearing about the recovery of such an artifact. Seek out their representatives at Quel'Delar's Rest, to the south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.",o="将残破的剑柄交给奎尔德拉之冢的麦雷昂·阳炎。他就在银色比武场的南边。",oEN="Bring the Battered Hilt to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="¿Qué has descubierto?",pEN="What have you discovered?",c="<麦雷昂从你手中接过剑柄，仔细观察了它一会。>\n\n它来自堡垒里？它怎么会在那里？这东西肯定不是天灾军团能造出来的。\n\n这种质量的兵器只能由极少数的艾泽拉斯的生物制造。我们必须去问问他们，看看他们是否能认出它。",cEN="<Myralion takes the hilt from you and scrutinizes the artifact.>\n\nThis came from the citadel? What was it doing there? This blade is certainly not of Scourge manufacture.\n\nWeapons of this quality can only be crafted by a few of Azeroth's creatures. We will have to consult them and see if they can help us identify it."}
Q[24555]={d="肯定错不了——这把剑柄曾经是一件古老强大的武器。但具体情况我就不清楚了。我从没有见过或听说过有这种花纹标记的剑。但这不代表没有人认识它。\n\n克里奥斯塔兹，他更广为人知的名字是克拉苏斯。他一直都是奎尔多雷和肯瑞托的朋友，并拥有广博无边的知识学养。对此他一定知道些什么。到龙眠神殿的顶端，向他询问一下这件事。然后向达拉然夺日者圣殿的魔导师哈瑟尔报告。",dEN="There's no mistaking it - this hilt comes from a powerful, ancient weapon, but which one? I do not recognize these particular markings, but we haven't hit a dead end yet.\n\nKorialstrasz, better known as Krasus, has long been a friend to the quel'dorei and the Kirin Tor. With his vast knowledge and resources, he's certain to know something. Travel to the top of Wyrmrest Temple and seek his counsel, then report to Magister Hathorel inside Sunreaver's Sanctuary in Dalaran.",o="同龙眠神殿顶端的克拉苏斯交谈。",oEN="Speak to Krasus at the top of Wyrmrest Temple.",c="我们必须从银色盟约受众夺回那本书。没有来自克拉苏斯的那本书，我们就不能解开来自冰冠堡垒的那把剑的秘密，并且没法解封它的力量。",cEN="We must recover that book from the Silver Covenant. Without that book from Krasus, we stand little chance of solving the mystery of the sword in Icecrown or unlocking its power."}
Q[24556]={d="Meterte en el Enclave de Plata va a ser más difícil de lo que parece. Solo les permiten entrar a aquellos que llevan tabardos de El Pacto de Plata. Si nos hacemos con uno, un sencillo encantamiento hará el resto.\n\nEn el balcón que hay sobre Los Hilos del Destino encontrarás a Shandy Lustre Brillo. Le he echado una mano otras veces, así que me debe un favor. Les hace la colada a muchos habitantes de la ciudad. Quizás él te pueda \"prestar\" un tabardo por un tiempo.",dEN="Getting you inside the Silver Enclave will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Silver Covenant tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.\n\nOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while.",o="从山迪·格罗斯那里取得“借来的战袍”。",oEN="Obtain a Borrowed Tabard from Shandy Glossgleam.",p="山迪有没有帮你弄到一件银色盟约战袍呢？",pEN="Was Shandy able to help you get a Silver Covenant tabard?",c="我就知道山迪能帮我们。我会对它施法让你穿上它。运气好的话，它的主人甚至都不知道我们用过——毕竟山迪也会帮我们处理掉一些痕迹的。",cEN="I knew Shandy would find a way to make it work. Let me get this enchanted and ready for you to use. With any luck, the tabard's owner won't even know it's missing and Shandy will cover the rest of our tracks."}
Q[24557]={d="我在达拉然下水道的一个线人发现一名银色盟约密探正在咒语和乌鸦旅店收集情报。银色盟约通常不会出现在那些下水道里。他们在那里一定有着某种不可告人的计划。\n\n到达拉然下水道去，找到那名银色盟约密探，把他处理掉，然后在他身上寻找一切有用的情报。也许我们能从他身上知道那部龙眠宝典的所在位置。我们绝不能让银色盟约的人把它带回到冰冠冰川去。",dEN="One of my contacts in the Underbelly caught sight of a Silver Covenant agent gathering information at the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Silver Covenant members aren't normally found in the sewers, so they must be plotting something.\n\nGo into the Underbelly, find this Silver Covenant agent, and eliminate him. Search the body for any information that might give us a lead on the location of that tome from Wyrmrest. We can't let those simpering Silver Covenant weaklings get it back to Icecrown before we do.",o="取得银色盟约命令。",oEN="Capture the Silver Covenant Orders.",p="你从密探身上发现什么有用的信息了吗？",pEN="Did you find anything of use on that agent?",c="<La Magister Hathorel lee las órdenes capturadas.>\n\nSe suponía que el agente que interceptaste debía entregar el tomo de Reposo del Dragón a Cerro de la Corona, tras reunirse con un Arcanista Tybalin dentro del Enclave de Plata. Tenemos que reclamar ese libro, <name>, y solo tenemos una oportunidad antes de que salga de la ciudad. Tenemos que trabajar rápido.",cEN="<Magister Hathorel reads the captured orders.>\n\nThe agent you intercepted was supposed to deliver the Wyrmrest tome to Icecrown, after meeting with one Arcanist Tybalin inside the Silver Enclave. We have to reclaim that book, <name>, and we only have one chance before it leaves the city. We have to work quickly."}
Q[24558]={d="我们必须立刻将这本书交给麦雷昂·阳炎。你能帮我这个忙吗？你已经证明自己有足够的实力击败银色盟约，除了你以外，我不能信任其它人能够完成这个任务。\n\n带着这本书转至奎尔德拉之冢。它就在冰冠冰川银色比武场的南边。麦雷昂会等着你。如果他能鉴别出这把剑，我们就能以艾萨斯·夺日者的名义拥有它，让达拉然和联盟都明白，进攻巫妖王的冲锋将由我们来统率。",dEN="We must get this book to Myralion Sunblade. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at evading the Silver Covenant's men.\n\nTake it with you to Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Myralion will be waiting for you. If he can identify that blade, we may be able to claim it in the name of Aethas Sunreaver and show Dalaran and the Alliance that we will lead the charge against the Lich King.",o="将上古龙铸之刃交给奎尔德拉之冢的麦雷昂·阳炎。",oEN="Bring Ancient Dragonforged Blades to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest.",p="我们已经预料到你的归来，你拿的什么？",pEN="We've been expecting your return. What has kept you?",c="<Myralion acepta el pesado libro y empieza a hojearlo>.\n\nEsos símbolos en la hoja parecían familiares y ahora no es de extrañar por qué. Esta es, sin duda, una hoja de dragón, entregada a una de las razas mortales, pero ¿qué hoja es esta y cómo ha acabado en la Corona de Hielo?",cEN="<Myralion accepts the heavy book and begins leafing through it.>\n\nThose symbols on the blade seemed familiar and now there's little wonder why. This is certainly a dragon blade, gifted to one of the mortal races, but which blade is this, and how did it come to rest in Icecrown?"}
Q[24559]={d="我们不能让奎尔德拉就这样只是一堆耻辱的碎片。带上这把剑的残片和你发现的剑柄，到冰冠堡垒的萨隆矿坑去。\n\n巫妖王强迫许多奴隶在那里采掘熔炼萨隆邪铁矿石。我们要用萨隆邪铁重铸奎尔德拉。\n\n你必须取得注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的大锤，然后用它们在熔炉之主的铁砧上重铸这把剑。",dEN="We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.\n\nYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword.",o="取得5块注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的巨锤，将它们和奎尔德拉的残片融为一体，制造出重铸的奎尔德拉。",oEN="Obtain 5 Infused Saronite Bars and the Forgemaster's Hammer, then combine them with the Remnants of Quel'Delar to create the Reforged Quel'Delar.",p="你已重铸奎尔德拉了吗？",pEN="Were you able to reconstruct Quel'Delar?",c="尽管鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔说我们没法重铸奎尔德拉，不过我们做到了！现在这把剑必须要完成淬火，我们要让她知道她的言行有多么愚蠢。",cEN="You have remade the blade of Quel'Delar in defiance of that Blood-Queen Lana'thel's pronouncement! Now, the blade must be tempered before we can show her the folly of her words."}
Q[24560]={d="破碎的奎尔德拉终于完整如初了，但如果不经过适当的锻打，你还不能使用它作战。它参差不齐的萨隆邪铁边缘仍然脆弱易碎。\n\n你可以在冰冠堡垒深处的灵魂洪炉对它进行深度锻造。把奎尔德拉带到噬魂者的住所去，找到那里的坩埚。将这把剑放进坩埚里，对它进行锻造，然后再回来见我。我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.\n\nDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me. I'll be waiting in The Frozen Halls.",o="在灵魂坩锅锻造已经重铸的奎尔德拉。",oEN="Temper the Re-forged Quel'Delar in the Crucible of Souls.",p="它在被重铸之前无法发挥出任何作用。",pEN="Until the sword is tempered, it will be useless.",c="重铸这把剑需要修复，这是怎么回事？",cEN="Tempering the sword should've restored the blade. Why hasn't it worked?"}
Q[24561]={d="你已经重铸了这把剑，并对它进行了锻造，但它仍然只是静静地躺在剑鞘里，丝毫没有显示出它应有的力量。你说这把剑在吸引你，就好象它拥有自己的意志？\n\n你敢把它带到它想去的地方吗？这把剑不应该如此沉默，但如果你不把它带去那个地方，也许我们将永远不知道这是为什么。把它带进冰冠堡垒的映像大厅。在那里一定要万分小心！我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="You have re-forged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, little different from a mundane blade. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?\n\nDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It is not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Bear it with you to Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard. I will wait for you in The Frozen Halls.",o="将淬火的奎尔德拉带到映像大厅里面的剑冢去。",oEN="Bring Quel'Delar to Sword's Rest inside the Halls of Reflection.",p="映像大厅里发生什么事了？",pEN="What happened inside the Halls of Reflection?",c="¿Cómo puede el mal echar raíces en una espada así? No habría pensado que fuera posible si la evidencia no estuviera aquí ante mis ojos. Si las mayores creaciones de la estirpe de los dragones pudieran corromperse y volverse contra ellos, ¿por qué no una simple espada?\n\nCreo que Uther tiene razón. Debes seguir su consejo rápidamente, <name>.",cEN="How can evil take root in such a sword? I would not have thought it possible if the evidence wasn't here before my eyes. If the greatest of dragonkind's creations could be corrupted and turned against them, why not a mere sword?\n\nI believe Uther is right. You must heed his advice quickly, <name>."}
Q[24562]={d="尽快将奎尔德拉带到太阳之井，$n。要相信乌瑟尔的话，他说过，当这把剑受到巫妖王邪恶力量的影响时，你不能彻底控制它。你必须转至奎尔丹纳斯岛，在那里，设法进入太阳之井，只有在那你才能净化这把剑。\n\n太阳之井的守卫会阻拦你转至太阳井高地，所以你必须找到哈杜伦·明翼，他会在那里巡视那些守卫。",dEN="Take Quel'Delar to the Sunwell as quickly as possible, <name>. Trust in Uther's words when he says that you will not always be able to control the blade while it is subject to the evil of the Lich King's influence. You must travel to the Isle of Quel'Danas, and there, seek entry to the Sunwell itself, where you can cleanse the sword.\n\nThe guardians will try to stop you from entering the Sunwell Plateau, but make yourself known to Halduron Brightwing, who will be inspecting the guards there.",o="在奎尔丹纳斯岛，太阳之井高地入口处同哈杜伦·明翼交谈。",oEN="Speak with Halduron Brightwing at the entrance to the Sunwell Plateau on the Isle of Quel'Danas.",p="你怎么来了？",pEN="What brings you here?",c="Espero que comprendas que no puedo simplemente dejarte entrar en el Pozo del Sol, <name>. Este es el lugar más sagrado conocido por los sin'dorei y hace poco que hemos recuperado el control sobre él.\n\n¿Pretendes despertar las esperanzas de nuestro pueblo con historias sobre Quel'Delar? Sin pruebas de la veracidad de tus afirmaciones, no veo motivo para creerte.",cEN="I hope you understand that I can't just admit you to the Sunwell, <name>. This is the most sacred place known to the sin'dorei and we have only recently regained control over it.\n\nYou would raise the hopes of our people with tales of Quel'Delar? Without proof of the truth of your claims, I see no reason to take you at your word."}
Q[24563]={d="Tú eres $gel:la; que trabaja con Myralion Resplandor, ¿no? Sé de una forma de probar la espada.\n\nSi conoces la historia de la hoja, sabrás que la llevaba Thalorien Buscalba en la defensa de La Fuente del Sol contra la Plaga. Cayó en lo que ahora llamamos La Cicatriz Muerta, intentando ganar tiempo para que sus hombres pudieran prepararse. Encontrarás sus restos cerca del extremo sur de La Cicatriz Muerta, en esta isla. Visítalos, y si su espíritu te da su bendición te permitiré entrar a La Fuente del Sol.",dEN="You are the one working with Myralion Sunblaze, arent you? I know of a way we can test the sword.\n\nIf you know the blade's history, you recall that it was borne by Thalorien Dawnseeker in defense of the Sunwell against the Scourge. He fell in what is now the Dead Scar, buying time for his men to make their own preparations. You will find his remains near the southern end of the Dead Scar on this isle. Visit them, and if his spirit gives you its blessing, I will allow you to enter the Sunwell.",o="访问萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的遗体，获得他的祝福，以使用奎尔德拉。",oEN="Visit Thalorien Dawnseeker's Remains and obtain his blessing to wield Quel'Delar.",p="¿Visitaste el lugar donde Thalorien cayó defendiendo el Pozo del Sol?",pEN="Did you visit the ground where Thalorien fell defending the Sunwell?",c="Realmente llevas Quel'Delar. Este es un gran día para todo Quel'Thalas y para los sin'dorei. Tienes mi permiso para entrar en el Poel del Sol y terminar la restauración de la espada. Mantén la cabeza alta, <name>. Los hijos de Silvermoon han soñado con este día durante años.",cEN="You truly do carry Quel'Delar. This is a great day for all of Quel'Thalas and the sin'dorei. You have my leave to enter the Sunwell and finish the sword's restoration. Keep your head high, <name>. The children of Silvermoon have dreamt of this day for years."}
Q[24564]={d="Te esperan La Fuente del Sol y el fin del exilio de Quel'Delar, $n.\n\nEn el interior encontrarás a Lor'themar Theron, el regente de Quel'Thalas, y al gran magister Rommath. Ten cuidado con ellos y no permitas que te enreden en sus maquinaciones políticas.\n\nConcéntrate en tu misión. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol. Sumerge a la Quel'Delar modificada en La Fuente del Sol para completar su restauración. Después muéstrasela a Myralion Resplandor en el Reposo de Quel'Delar.",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the restoration. Afterward, show the blade to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest.",o="Sumerge la Quel'Delar templada en La Fuente del Sol. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",oEN="Immerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="太阳之井平台里发生了什么事？",pEN="What happened inside the Sunwell?",c="¿De verdad estoy contemplando el arma de Thalorien Dawnseeker? ¡Este es un día maravilloso para los Saqueadores de Sol y para todos los sin'dorei!",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24576]={d="<你向洛卡讲述为什么要追查斯内维尔。洛卡的脸上露出厌恶的表情。>\n\n你是说，我们一直被一名炼金师的法术控制着？真是不能相信，我竟然会蒙受这样的欺骗！如果我抓住那个奸诈的小地精，我一定会将它撕碎！\n\n如果他已经完成了使命，那么他现在应该正赶往奥格瑞玛大门东边的飞艇塔！$n，绝对不能让他登上飞艇逃跑！\n\n赶快到飞艇塔去！",dEN="<Roka listens with disgust as you tell her why you're trying to track down Snivel.>\n\nYou mean I've been under the spell of an alchemist all this time? I can't believe I fell for that fraud! If I ever get my hands on that conniving little goblin, I'll tear him apart!\n\nIf he's finished his errands, he's on his way down to the zeppelin tower east of Orgrimmar's gates! Whatever you do, <name>, you can't let him board that zeppelin and get away with all this!\n\nHurry to the zeppelin tower before you miss him!",o="转至奥格瑞玛城外的飞艇塔，向斯内维尔·拉斯罗凯特询问关于供给物资的事情。然后带着他给你的证据回去。",oEN="Go to the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar and question Snivel Rustrocket about the supplies. Return with any evidence he gives you.",p="你找到那家伙了吗，他是不是在石头下面瑟瑟发抖呢？",pEN="Did you find the guy, or did he crawl under a rock?",c="<name>, ¿has conseguido su libro de contabilidad? ¿En serio? Eso es genial. Probablemente haya un montón de información útil aquí dentro.",cEN="You got his ledger? Really? That's great, <name>. There's probably loads of good information in here."}
Q[24579]={d="黑岩守护者萨塔里奥正在看守着暮光巨龙的卵。他就在龙眠神殿下方龙神之厅的黑曜石圣殿里。\n\n六人议会已经决定要消灭萨塔里奥！",dEN="Sartharion, the Onyx Guardian, watches over the eggs of the Twilight Dragonflight. He rests within the Obsidian Sanctum in the Chamber of the Aspects underneath Wyrmrest Temple.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Sartharion must die!",o="消灭萨塔里奥。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Sartharion.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="Con la muerte de Sartharion, seguramente los planes de Deathwing y Sinestra se han estancado.",cEN="With Sartharion slain, surely Deathwing and Sinestra's plans are now stalled."}
Q[24580]={d="阿努布雷坎曾经是尼拉布帝国强大的蜘蛛君王。而现在，巫妖王夺取了他的帝国，并将那里变成亡灵之地。\n\n现在阿努布雷坎变成了一个坟墓君王，盘踞在纳克萨玛斯的蜘蛛区，为克尔苏加德经营着各种阴谋。\n\n六人议会已经做出决定，必须消灭阿努布雷坎。",dEN="Anub'Rekhan, once-mighty Spider Lord of the nerubian empire, has been taken by the Lich King and corrupted into a state of undeath.\n\nNow a crypt lord, he sits in his parlor in the Arachnid Quarter of Naxxramas, spinning strategies for Kel'Thuzad.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Anub'Rekhan must die!",o="消灭阿努布雷坎。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度或者任何规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Anub'Rekhan.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="La noticia de tu éxito te precede, <class>. Anub'Rekhan ya no existe. Le has hecho un gran favor, <name>.",cEN="Word of your success precedes you, <class>. Anub'Rekhan is no more. You did him a great service, <name>."}
Q[24581]={d="药剂师诺斯是一个懦夫和叛徒！他所犯下的罪行仅次于巫妖王！\n\n赶快到纳克萨玛斯去。他就在瘟疫区，躲在他的亡灵爪牙后面。\n\n一定要消灭他！这是六人议会做出的决定！",dEN="Noth the Plaguebringer, traitor and coward! Second only to the Lich King himself for the number of souls that have been Scourged!\n\nMake haste to Naxxramas. You will find him within the Plague Quarter hiding behind his undead minions.\n\nDestroy him! The Council of Six has decreed that Noth must die!",o="消灭药剂师诺斯。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Noth the Plaguebringer.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="Eso es una espina menos en nuestro costado. Con la destrucción de Noth, la investigación de la Plaga para perfeccionar los medios de creación de no muertos se detendrá en seco.",cEN="That's one less thorn in our side. With Noth destroyed, Scourge research into refining the means of creating the undead will grind to a halt."}
Q[24582]={d="教官拉苏维奥斯昂首阔步地走在纳克萨玛斯军事区，一副自鸣得意的样子。据说，只有他亲自训练出来的死亡骑士才可能有机会抵挡住他的剑威。\n\n你和你的队员将去推翻这一说法。\n\n六人议会已经下令除掉拉苏维奥斯！",dEN="Instructor Razuvious smugly struts about the Military Quarter of Naxxramas. It is said that only a death knight personally trained by him could possibly even withstand the prowess of his blade.\n\nYou and your group are going to prove everyone wrong.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Razuvious must die!",o="消灭教官拉苏维奥斯。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Instructor Razuvious.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="Bien hecho, <class>. El mando militar de la Plaga en Naxxramas ha quedado sumido en el caos tras la muerte de Razuvious.",cEN="Well done, <class>. The Scourge military command out of Naxxramas has been thrown into disarray by Razuvious's demise."}
Q[24583]={d="La supuesta \"encarnación de la guerra\", Remendejo, es la abominación definitiva. Está diezmando nuestras fuerzas en el Cementerio de Dragones.\n\nQuiero que reúnas a tus compañeros y entres en el Arrabal de los Ensamblajes de Naxxramas. Desmonta el ensamblaje.\n\n¡El Consejo de los Seis ha decretado que Remendejo debe morir!",dEN="The so-called \"avatar of war\", Patchwerk is the ultimate abomination. It is also taking a heavy toll upon on our forces in the Dragonblight.\n\nI want you to assemble your companions and enter the Construct Quarter of Naxxramas. Disassemble the construct.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Patchwerk must die!",o="消灭帕奇维克。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Patchwerk.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="Los niños de todas partes dormirán más tranquilos sabiendo que Patchwerk ya no existe.",cEN="Children everywhere will sleep easier knowing that Patchwerk is no more."}
Q[24584]={d="我们的资源相当紧张。织法者玛里苟斯正在将这个世界的全部魔法力量吸干，灌入永恒之眼里。如果没有了魔法，我们只有死路一条。\n\n$C，魔枢战争必须结束。六人议会已经做出决定，玛里苟斯必须被消灭！",dEN="Our resources are strained. Malygos, the Spell-Weaver, is draining all of the magic out of the world, consolidating it in the Eye of Eternity. Without magic, we are doomed.\n\n<class>, the Nexus War must be brought to an end. The Council of Six has decreed that Malygos must die!",o="消灭玛里苟斯。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Malygos.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="Con la derrota de Malygos, la Guerra del Nexo debería llegar a su fin rápidamente. Tienes la gratitud del Kirin Tor, <name>.",cEN="With Malygos defeated, the Nexus War should come to a swift conclusion. You have the gratitude of the Kirin Tor, <name>."}
Q[24585]={d="在练兵场中坐落着奥杜尔的第一道防线：烈焰巨兽。\n\n肯瑞托得到的情报表明，这些守护者制造的机器即将被送往一处秘密地方，它们将对艾泽拉斯的生灵造成灾难性的破坏。\n\n必须阻止这一切的发生。六人议会已经宣布了烈焰巨兽必须死！",dEN="Within the Formation Grounds sits Ulduar's first line of defense: Flame Leviathan.\n\nThe Kirin Tor have been provided with information suggesting that this Keeper-created machine is soon to be transported to an undisclosed location and let loose to wreak havoc upon the mortals of Azeroth.\n\nThis must not come to pass. The Council of Six has decreed that Flame Leviathan must die!",o="消灭烈焰巨兽。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度或规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Flame Leviathan.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="我对通过使用这些技术制造的怪兽一向感到惊奇。",cEN="I never cease to be amazed by the horrors that can be created through the use of technology."}
Q[24586]={d="锋鳞通常都待在奥杜尔巨人熔炉附近她的巢穴中。但最近，她经常出现在那片巨型建筑群以外横行肆虐。\n\n虽然这头母龙有自己悲伤的故事，但她现在对于整个诺森德都是一个严重的威胁。六人议会已经下达命令，锋鳞必须被消灭！",dEN="Razorscale normally keeps to her aerie near the Colossal Forge in Ulduar. Of late, however, she has been spotted reigning fire down upon lands outside of the titan complex.\n\nThough the broodmother's is a sad tale, she poses an imminent threat to all of Northrend. The Council of Six has decreed that Razorscale must die!",o="消灭锋鳞。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Razorscale.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="维拉努斯终于可以安息了。",cEN="Now Veranus can finally rest in peace."}
Q[24587]={d="巨大的火焰巨人——掌炉者伊格尼斯在奥杜尔的巨人熔炉奋力工作。依照洛肯的命令，伊格尼斯打造了充斥着他们那可怕力量的武器。\n\n六人议会已下令除掉伊格尼斯！",dEN="The great fire giant, Ignis the Furnace Master toils away inside of Ulduar's Colossal Forge. Under orders from Loken, Ignis creates weapons that are terrifying in their power.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Ignis must die!",o="消灭掌炉者伊格尼斯。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Ignis the Furnace Master.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="我只希望你当时没碰到太多他的钢铁爪牙吧。",cEN="I trust that you did not have to face too many of his iron construct assistants?"}
Q[24588]={d="米米尔隆的怪异制造物还有一个，实际上，XT-002拆解者一直认为自己是米米尔隆的儿子。不要被它伪装的天真所欺骗。那可是一部致命的机器！\n\n你会在Ulduar's Scrapyard找到那部拆解者。六人议会已经决定，必须消灭XT-002拆解者！",dEN="Yet another strange construct of Mimiron, the XT-002 Deconstructor actually thinks that it is the keeper's son. Do not be fooled by its feigned innocence. It is a deadly machine!\n\nYou will find the Deconstructor within Ulduar's Scrapyard. The Council of Six has decreed that XT-002 Deconstructor must die!",o="消灭XT-002拆解者。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill XT-002 Deconstructor.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="奥杜尔的最大弱点就是它的主人盲目地信任那些发明能很好地保护他。",cEN="The greatest weakness of Ulduar is its masters' blind faith in their inventions to protect it."}
Q[24589]={d="大法师提迈尔预见到了一件可怕的事情。一名愚蠢的侏儒术士将无意中召唤一个燃烧军团的艾瑞达君主进入到十字军的试炼之中。\n\n在这件事发生的时候，你必须赶到，$c。如果加拉克苏斯大王逃脱了，他就会打开传送门，让燃烧军团再一次涌入我们的世界。\n\n六人议会已经做出决定，必须消灭加拉克苏斯大王！",dEN="Archmage Timear has foreseen a horrible event, which is about to transpire. A foolish gnome warlock is about to accidentally summon an Eredar lord of the Burning Legion into the middle of the Trial of the Crusader.\n\nYou must be there when it happens, <class>. If Lord Jaraxxus escapes, he will open a portal and the Burning Legion will spill forth into our world once more.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Lord Jaraxxus must die!",o="消灭加拉克苏斯大王。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Lord Jaraxxus.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="艾泽拉斯的所有人民都应该庆幸大法师提迈尔预见了艾瑞达领主的到来，而你也及时赶到击败了他。",cEN="All of Azeroth is fortunate that Timear foresaw the Eredar lord's arrival and that you were there in time to slay him."}
Q[24590]={d="玛洛加尔领主是冰冠尖塔内部的冰封王座守卫。巫妖王用一千名冒险者的骨殖将他拼凑而成，并让他能够操纵寒冰王座本身的力量。\n\n如果不消灭这头怪物，我们就绝无可能占领冰冠堡垒。\n\n六人议会已经决定将他彻底消灭！",dEN="Lord Marrowgar is the guardian of the Frozen Throne within the Spire Chamber. Pieced together by the Lich King from the bones of a thousand vanquished adventurers, Marrowgar wields the power of the throne itself.\n\nWithout the destruction of this bone wraith, there is no hope of taking Icecrown Citadel.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Lord Marrowgar must die!",o="消灭玛洛加尔领主ar。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Lord Marrowgar.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="多亏有你，现在冰封王座没有了守门人。我们与巫妖王战斗的胜算又多了几分。",cEN="The Frozen Throne is without its chief guardian thanks to you. Our attacks upon the Lich King's forces will be all the more successful now."}
Q[24594]={d="$n，你的面前就是太阳之井和奎尔德拉流亡的终点。\n\n你会在太阳之井中找到奎尔萨拉斯的摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆和大法师罗曼斯。一定要对他们保持警惕，不要掉进他们的政治陷阱中。\n\n但你主要的精力必须集中在你的任务上。当你准备进入太阳之井高地时，就和一名太阳之井守卫谈谈。将新的奎尔德拉放进太阳之井中，完成这把神剑的重生。如果你举起它，就像萨洛瑞安说的那样，它就会与你绑缚在一起。",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell to enter the Sunwell Plateau. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the restoration. Show the blade to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest once it is restored.",o="Sumerge la Quel'Delar corrupta en La Fuente del Sol. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",oEN="Immerse your Tainted Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你从太阳之井回来了？",pEN="You have returned from the Sunwell?",c="我简直不敢相信我的眼睛，这居然是萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的武器？今天对于夺日者来说，对所有的辛多雷来说简直是不可思议的一天！",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24595]={d="我承认，我一直怀疑你不可能重铸奎尔德拉，也不相信萨洛瑞安的灵魂会赐予你祝福。你不可能明白，奎尔德拉的重生对于我们一族意味着什么。\n\n我会履行诺言，让你进入太阳之井。你将在那里找到银月的领导者。将这把剑浸入到太阳之井中。你最好将这件武器托付给银色十字军，它将成为反抗巫妖王的力量团结一致的标志。",dEN="I admit, I was skeptical that you had actually re-forged Quel'Delar and I did not expect Thalorien's spirit to reveal itself to you. You cannot understand what it means to my people that Quel'Delar has been recovered.\n\nAs promised, I will admit you to the Sunwell and you will find the leaders of Silvermoon within. Carry the sword to the chamber of the Sunwell and immerse it. Once the blade is restored, return with it to Caladis Brightspear at Quel'Delar's Rest.",o="Sumerge la Quel'Delar corrupta en La Fuente del Sol. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",oEN="Immerse your Tainted Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="Cuéntame qué ocurrió en el Poel del Sol, <name>.",pEN="Tell me of what happened in the Sunwell, <name>.",c="Esto es increíble, <name>. ¡Realmente lo has logrado! Todos los quel'dorei han oído hablar de Thalorien Dawnseeker y Quel'Delar, pero nadie pensó jamás que la espada sería restaurada.",cEN="This is unbelievable, <name>. You've really done it! All of the quel'dorei have heard of Thalorien Dawnseeker and Quel'Delar, but no one ever thought the sword would be restored."}
Q[24596]={d="Te esperan La Fuente del Sol y el fin del exilio de Quel'Delar, $n.\n\nEn el interior encontrarás a Lor'themar Theron, el regente de Quel'Thalas, y al gran magister Rommath. Ten cuidado con ellos y no permitas que te enreden en sus maquinaciones políticas.\n\nConcéntrate en tu misión. Sumerge a la Quel'Delar modificada en La Fuente del Sol para completar su restauración y luego habla con Myralion Resplandor en el Reposo de Quel'Delar. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the its restoration, then speak with Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",o="Sumerge la Quel'Delar corrupta en La Fuente del Sol. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",oEN="Immerse your Tainted Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你从太阳之井平台带回了什么消息？",pEN="What happened during your visit to the Sunwell?",c="¿De verdad estoy contemplando el arma de Thalorien Dawnseeker? ¡Este es un día maravilloso para los Saqueadores de Sol y para todos los sin'dorei!",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24597]={d="你想要为暴风城之王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the king of Stormwind? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="Regálale una pulsera de talismanes preciosos al rey Varian Wrynn.",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Prince Anduin Wrynn in Stormwind."}
Q[24598]={d="Te esperan La Fuente del Sol y el fin del exilio de Quel'Delar, $n.\n\nEn el interior encontrarás a Lor'themar Theron, el regente de Quel'Thalas, y al gran magister Rommath. Ten cuidado con ellos y no permitas que te enreden en sus maquinaciones políticas.\n\nConcéntrate en tu misión. Sumerge a la Quel'Delar modificada en La Fuente del Sol para completar su restauración y luego muéstrasela a Myralion Resplandor en el Reposo de Quel'Delar. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete its restoration, then show it to Myralio Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",o="Sumerge la Quel'Delar templada en La Fuente del Sol. Habla con un celador de La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista; para entrar en la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol.",oEN="Immerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你从太阳之井平台带回了什么消息？",pEN="What news do you bring from the Sunwell?",c="¿De verdad estoy contemplando el arma de Thalorien Dawnseeker? ¡Este es un día maravilloso para los Saqueadores de Sol y para todos los sin'dorei!",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24605]={d="¡Escucha bien, alma marinera! Los susurros por estos lares cuentan historias de que Narkk está estableciendo su propio refugio en Bahía de Bocce, enseñando el delicado arte de manejar aves. Un aventurero experimentado como tú seguramente anhela que uno de estos majestuosos compañeros alados se una a tus filas.",dEN="Listen up, ye sea-faring soul! The whispers 'round these parts tell tales of Narkk establishin' his own haunt in Booty Bay, teachin' the fine art of bird-handlin'. A seasoned adventurer like yerself surely yearns to have one of these majestic winged companions joinin' yer ranks.",o="Visita a Narkk en Bahía de Booty",oEN="Visit Narkk in Booty Bay",c="¡Escucha bien, aventurero! Camina con cuidado y elige sabiamente, pues solo un aliado alado puede acompañarte en este gran viaje.",cEN="Listen close, adventurer! Tread carefully and pick wisely, for only one winged ally can join ye on this grand voyage."}
Q[24606]={d="¡Escucha bien, alma marinera! Los susurros por estos lares cuentan historias de que Narkk está estableciendo su propio refugio en Bahía de Bocce, enseñando el delicado arte de manejar aves. Un aventurero experimentado como tú seguramente anhela que uno de estos majestuosos compañeros alados se una a tus filas.",dEN="Listen up, ye sea-faring soul! The whispers 'round these parts tell tales of Narkk establishin' his own haunt in Booty Bay, teachin' the fine art of bird-handlin'. A seasoned adventurer like yerself surely yearns to have one of these majestic winged companions joinin' yer ranks.",o="Visita a Narkk en Bahía de Booty",oEN="Visit Narkk in Booty Bay",c="¡Escucha bien, aventurero! Camina con cuidado y elige sabiamente, pues solo un aliado alado puede acompañarte en este gran viaje.",cEN="Listen close, adventurer! Tread carefully and pick wisely, for only one winged ally can join ye on this grand voyage."}
Q[24607]={d="¡Me ha llegado la noticia de que Narkk ha ampliado su oferta en Bahía de Bocce para eclosionar este misterioso huevo!",dEN="Word has reached me that the Narkk has expanded his offerings in Booty Bay to unhatch this mysterious egg!",o="Visita a Narkk en Bahía de Booty",oEN="Visit Narkk in Booty Bay",c="¡Escucha bien, aventurero! Camina con cuidado y elige sabiamente, pues solo un aliado alado puede acompañarte en este gran viaje.",cEN="Listen close, adventurer! Tread carefully and pick wisely, for only one winged ally can join ye on this grand voyage."}
Q[24609]={d="你想要为铁炉堡国王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Lord of Ironforge? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向铁炉堡的国王麦格尼·铜须献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge.",p="¿Has preparado la Pulsera de amuletos encantadora? Vuelve cuando tengas un regalo digno del Rey.",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the King.",c="¡Qué detallista! Una preciosa pulsera de colgantes.\n\nTu generoso regalo ha alegrado el espíritu de todos los que llaman a Forjaz su hogar.",cEN="How thoughtful! A Lovely Charm Bracelet.\n\nYour generous gift has brightened the spirits of all who call Ironforge home."}
Q[24610]={d="你想要为艾露恩的高阶祭司制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信她一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the High Priestess of Elune? I'm sure she'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向达纳苏斯的泰兰德·语风献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",p="¿Has preparado la Pulsera de amuletos encantadora? Vuelve cuando tengas un regalo digno de la Suma Sacerdotisa.",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the High Priestess.",c="¡Qué detallista! Una preciosa pulsera de colgantes.\n\nElune sonríe a quienes comparten su bondad con los demás. Gracias, <name>.",cEN="How thoughtful! A Lovely Charm Bracelet.\n\nElune smiles upon those who share their kindness with others. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[24611]={d="你想要为埃索达先知制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Prophet of the Exodar? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向埃索达的先知维伦献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Prophet Velen in the Exodar."}
Q[24612]={d="你想要为酋长制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Warchief? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向奥格瑞玛的萨尔献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",p="¿Has preparado la Pulsera de amuletos encantadora? Vuelve cuando tengas un regalo digno del Jefe de la Horda.",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the Warchief.",c="¿Un regalo? ¿Para mí?\n\nTu gesto honra a la Horda, <name>. En estos tiempos difíciles, tales actos de buena voluntad nos recuerdan aquello que luchamos por proteger.",cEN="A gift? For me?\n\nYour gesture honors the Horde, <name>. In these troubled times, such acts of goodwill remind us of what we fight to protect."}
Q[24613]={d="你想要为黑暗女王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信她一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Banshee Queen? I'm sure she'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向幽暗城中的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者女王献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity.",p="¿Has preparado la Pulsera de amuletos encantadora? Vuelve cuando tengas un regalo digno de la Dama Oscura.",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the Dark Lady.",c="Qué... inesperado. Una encantadora pulsera de charms.\n\nSupongo que incluso la Reina Banshee puede apreciar un gesto de... sentimiento. No te acostumbres a ello.",cEN="How... unexpected. A Lovely Charm Bracelet.\n\nI suppose even the Banshee Queen can appreciate a gesture of... sentiment. Do not make a habit of it."}
Q[24614]={d="你想要为大酋长制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the High Chieftain? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向雷霆崖的凯恩·血蹄酋长献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="¿Has preparado la Pulsera de amuletos encantadora? Vuelve cuando tengas un regalo digno del Gran Jefe.",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the High Chieftain.",c="Un regalo del corazón vale más que cualquier tesoro, joven <class>. La Madre Tierra sonríe ante tu amabilidad.",cEN="A gift from the heart is worth more than any treasure, young <class>. The Earth Mother smiles upon your kindness."}
Q[24615]={d="你想要为奎尔萨拉斯的摄政王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Regent Lord of Quel'Thalas? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向银月城的洛瑟玛·塞隆献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City."}
Q[24629]={d="Pareces $gtodo un triunfador:toda una triunfadora;, $c. ¿Por qué no trabajamos en beneficio mutuo?\n\nEn La Corona queremos ofrecer muestras de nuestros últimos productos temáticos a tantos posibles clientes como sea posible. ¡Ayúdanos a repartir amor y te haremos un descuento en algunos productos magníficos de La Corona!\n\nTu tiempo, nuestro dinero, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Qué dices?",dEN="You look like a real go-getter, <class>. How about we work out a little win-win scenario?\n\nCrown's looking to offer samples of our latest holiday-themed products to as many potential customers as possible. Help us share the love, and we'll give you discounts on some great Crown merchandise!\n\nYour time, our money, friend. What do you say?",o="用皇冠古龙水瓶向10个人喷洒古龙水。",oEN="Spray 10 people with the Crown Perfume Sprayer.",p="香水可不会自动喷，你懂吧？\n\n继续吧！",pEN="That perfume's not going to spray itself, you know.\n\nGet going!",c="¡Buen trabajo, <name>! La gente vendrá corriendo a comprar perfumes Crown ahora que han tenido la oportunidad de probar sus maravillas.\n\nAquí tienes un detalle por ayudarnos.",cEN="Great work, <name>! People will come running to buy Crown perfumes now that they've had a chance to sample their wonders.\n\nHere's a little something for helping us out."}
Q[24635]={d="Pareces $gtodo un emprendedor:toda una emprendedora;, $c. ¿Te parece si hacemos un trato?\n\nLa Corona quiere ofrecer muestras de nuestros últimos productos temáticos a tantos clientes en potencia como sea posible. ¡Ayúdanos a extender nuestro amor al mismo tiempo que te ganas unos fantásticos productos La Corona!\n\nTu tiempo, nuestro dinero, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Qué opinas?",dEN="You seem the enterprising sort, <class>. How about we make a little deal?\n\nCrown wants to offer samples of our latest holiday-themed products to as many potential customers as we can. Help us share the love while earning some fantastic Crown merchandise!\n\nYour time, our money, friend. What do you think?",o="用皇冠古龙水瓶向10个人喷洒古龙水。",oEN="Spray 10 people with the Crown Cologne Sprayer.",p="香水可不会自动喷，你懂吧？\n\n继续吧！",pEN="The cologne isn't going to give itself out, you know.\n\nGet spraying!",c="¡Buen trabajo, <name>! La gente comprará colonias Crown a granel ahora que han tenido la oportunidad de probarlas.\n\nAquí tienes un detalle por ayudarnos.",cEN="Nice work, <name>! People will be buying Crown colognes by the crate-load now that they've had a chance to try them.\n\nHere's a little something for helping us out."}
Q[24636]={d="Parece que tienes buen ojo para la oportunidad, $c. ¿Qué te parece si entre los dos nos ganamos unas monedas?\n\nLa Corona tiene que entregar muestras de nuestros últimos productos temáticos a todos los clientes en potencia de la ciudad. ¡Ayúdanos a compartir el amor y compartiremos algunos de estos fantásticos productos La Corona contigo!\n\nTu tiempo, nuestro dinero, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Tenemos un trato?",dEN="I can see you've got an eye for opportunity, <class>. What do you say we make a little coin together?\n\nCrown needs to push samples of our latest holiday-themed products to every potential customer in the city. Help us share the love, and we'll share some of that amazing Crown merchandise with you!\n\nYour time, our money, friend. We got a deal?",o="将皇冠巧克力样品抛掷给10个人。",oEN="Toss 10 people samples from the Crown Chocolate Sampler.",p="巧克力可不会自动分给人们的。\n\n你需要继续工作！",pEN="You know, those chocolates aren't going to fling themselves at people.\n\nYou need to get to work!",c="¡Un trabajo fantástico, <name>! La gente se matará por conseguir los chocolates Crown ahora que han tenido la oportunidad de probar esos dulces y románticos manjares.\n\nAquí tienes un detalle por ayudarnos.",cEN="Lovely work, <name>! People will be tripping over one another to get Crown chocolates now that they've had a chance to taste those sweet, romantic treats.\n\nHere's a little something for helping us out."}
Q[24638]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está justo a las afueras de las puertas de Orgrimmar, al oeste. No puede ser bueno. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's right outside Orgrimmar's gates, to the west! That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠仆从，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在杜隆塔尔的奥格瑞玛大门西方的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Lackeys and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to damage one Chemical Wagon just west of Orgrimmar's gates in Durotar, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24645]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está justo a las afueras de Molino Ámbar en el Bosque de Argénteos. No puede ser bueno. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just outside Ambermill in Silverpine Forest. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠暴徒，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁银松森林中安伯米尔外面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Thugs and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon outside of Ambermill in Silverpine Forest, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24647]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está justo a las afueras de la ciudad de Trabalomas en, sí, acertaste, Laderas de Trabalomas. No puede ser bueno. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just outside the village of Hillsbrad in -- you guessed it -- Hillsbrad Foothills. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠清洁者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁希尔斯布莱德村镇外面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Dusters and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon just outside of Hillsbrad Village in Hillsbrad Foothills, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24648]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está justo a las afueras de Theramore en Marjal Revolcafango. No me mires así, ¿vale? También es un problema para nosotros. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's near Sentry Point, just outside Theramore in Dustwallow. Don't give me that look, okay? This is a problem for us, too. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠恶霸，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁尘泥沼泽塞拉摩外面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Hoodlums and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon outside of Theramore in Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24649]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está justo al este de Pico Nidal en las Tierras del Interior. No me mires así, ¿vale? También es un problema para la Horda. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's to the east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands. Don't give me that look, okay? This is a problem for the Horde, too. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠密探，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁辛特兰鹰巢山的东面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Agents and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24650]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está en Cuna del Invierno, justo al este de Vista Eterna. Ah, ahora sí es algo personal. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's in Winterspring, just east of Everlook. Oh, now this is personal. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠洒水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁冬泉谷永望镇东面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprinklers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Everlook in Winterspring, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24651]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: parece que está al este de Shattrath, en el Bosque de Terokkar. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's just east of Shattrath, in Terokkar Forest. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠杂兵，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁泰罗卡森林沙塔斯城东面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Underlings and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24652]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: parece que está en El Bosque Desolado de Canto de Cristal, al noroeste de El Espejo del Crepúsculo. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong, northwest of the Mirror of Twilight. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠喷水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁晶歌森林绝望之林中的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprayers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong Forest, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24655]={d="¡Fíjate en estos tíos! Bonvapor se ha estado encargando del negocio de las fiestas todos estos años, y de repente estos tipos invaden el mercado. No son Bonvapor, así que el cártel me ha contratado para investigar. Algo apesta, y no solo el perfume.rnrnLleva este aparato que me he traído y analiza las nubes de perfume que hay alrededor de los guardias. Quiero saber qué ponen en esa sustancia. No es natural.",dEN="Get a load of these guys, would ya? Steamwheedle's been handling the business of holidays for years, and all of a sudden, these guys bust into the market. They're not Steamwheedle; the cartel hired me to get to the bottom of this. Something stinks here and it ain't just perfume.\n\nTake this device I brought and go analyze the perfume clouds around the guards. I want to know what they're putting in that stuff. Things ain't natural.",o="使用滑栓的空气分析器测试6位带有浓郁香气的卫兵周围的空气，然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Use Snagglebolt's Air Analyzer to test the air around 6 heavily perfumed guards, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="测试完那些臭气了吗，孩子？",pEN="You analyze that reek yet, kid?",c="嘿，谢谢，孩子。拿来让我看看。\n\n<他拿着设备摆弄着>\n\n哦，情况不对啊。",cEN="Hey, thanks, kid. Give it over, let's take a look.\n\n<He takes the device from you and fiddles with it.>\n\nOh, that ain't good."}
Q[24656]={d="¡Sabía que no tramaban nada bueno! Aquí hay algún tipo de compuesto químico que afecta a la mente, pero con una muestra tan pequeña no consigo aislarlo. Necesito el de verdad.rnrn¡Ni se te ocurra comprarlo sin más! No quiero que les des ni una moneda a esos sinvergüenzas. No, quiero que lo cojas de la fuente, con discreción.rnrnTe disfrazaré de mensajero. He visto un montón de cajones custodiado por sus guardias, fuera de las puertas. Pasa corriendo, ¡y no te pares, o te descubrirán! Te tirarán un cajón. Tráemelo.",dEN="I knew they were up to no good! There's some sort of mind-affecting chemical in here, but I can't get a handle on it with such a small sample. I need the real stuff.\n\nDon't just go over there and buy it! I don't want you giving these scumbags one copper. Nah, you gotta get it from the source, discreet-like.\n\nI'll disguise you as a package runner. I saw a stockpile guarded by their goons outside the gates. Go run by, and DON'T stop, or they'll make you! They'll toss you a crate. Bring it back here.",o="Mientras estés $gdisfrazado:disfrazada; de mensajero, ve al montón de cajones de Químicos La Corona, S.L. fuera de las puertas de Ventormenta y vuelve con el paquete que te lancen a ver al inspector Snip Tuerceganzúas en Ventormenta.",oEN="While disguised as a package-runner, go to the Crown Chemical Company's stockpile outside the gates of Stormwind, then return the package they toss you to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="他们有没有扔给你一个包裹？",pEN="Did they toss ya a crate to deliver?",c="Lo has conseguido, ¿eh? Buen trabajo, chico. De primera. Veamos qué tenemos aquí.",cEN="You got it, huh? Good job, kid. Top notch. Let's see what we what we got here."}
Q[24657]={d="<你向玛丽恩讲述追查斯内维尔的原因，玛丽恩的脸上露出惊恐的表情。>\n\n你是说，他很可能给我下了药？哦！我竟然受到这样的欺骗，真是难以置信！\n\n如果他已经完成了使命，那么他应该正赶往码头，想要搭上转至南海的船只！$n，绝不能让他逃走。\n\n赶快到暴风城港口去！",dEN="<Marion listens with horror as you tell her why you're trying to track down Snivel.>\n\nYou mean, he might've used some kind of chemical on me? Ew! I can't believe I fell for that fraud!\n\nIf he's finished all of his errands, he's on his way down to the docks to catch a ship to the South Seas! Whatever you do, <name>, you can't let him get away with this.\n\nHurry down to Stormwind Harbor before you miss him!",o="转至暴风城港口，向斯内维尔·拉斯罗凯特询问关于供给物资的事情。然后带着他给你的证据回去。",oEN="Go to Stormwind Harbor and question Snivel Rustrocket about the supplies. Return with any evidence he gives you.",p="你找到那家伙了吗，或者他正躲在哪块石头下面？",pEN="Did you find the guy, or did he crawl under a rock?",c="<name>, ¿has conseguido su libro de contabilidad? ¿En serio? Eso es genial. Probablemente haya un montón de información útil aquí dentro.",cEN="You got his ledger? Really? That's great, <name>. There's probably loads of good information in here."}
Q[24658]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está al noreste del Cuartel de Arroyoeste, a las afueras de Elwynn. No puede ser bueno. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's northeast of Westbrook Garrison right outside in Elwynn! That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠仆从，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁艾尔文森林西泉要塞东北方的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Lackeys and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to damage one Chemical Wagon northeast of Westbrook Garrison in Elwynn Forest, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24659]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está al sur del Páramo de los Ancianos en Costa Oscura. No puede ser bueno. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just south of the Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠暴徒，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁黑海岸古树之林南面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Thugs and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon south of the Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24660]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es una entrada que quiero que investigues: está justo al sureste de Villa Oscura en el Bosque del Ocaso. No puede ser bueno. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just outside the village of Hillsbrad in -- you guessed it -- Hillsbrad Foothills. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠清洁者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁希尔斯布莱德村镇外面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Dusters and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon just outside of Hillsbrad Village in Hillsbrad Foothills, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24662]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está cerca del Alto del Centinela, justo a las afueras de Theramore en Marjal Revolcafango. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's near Sentry Point, just outside Theramore in Dustwallow. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠恶霸，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁位于尘泥沼泽的塞拉摩外面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Hoodlums and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon outside of Theramore in Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24663]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está justo al este de Pico Nidal en las Tierras del Interior. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's to the east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠密探，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在辛特兰鹰巢山东面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Agents and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24664]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está en Cuna del Invierno, justo al este de Vista Eterna. Ah, ahora sí es algo personal. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's in Winterspring, just east of Everlook. Oh, now this is personal. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠洒水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在冬泉谷永望镇东面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprinklers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Everlook in Winterspring, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24665]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: parece que está al este de Shattrath, en el Bosque de Terokkar. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's just east of Shattrath, in Terokkar Forest. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠杂兵，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在泰罗卡森林沙塔斯城东面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Underlings and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24666]={d="Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.\n\nEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: parece que está en El Bosque Desolado de Canto de Cristal, al noroeste de El Espejo del Crepúsculo. Ve y dales una paliza.\n\nAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong, northwest of the Mirror of Twilight. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠喷水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在晶歌森林绝望之林的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprayers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong Forest, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="Buen trabajo, chaval. Te mereces un pequeño detalle. Y oye, vuelve mañana si tienes tiempo; puede que tenga algún trabajo para ti.",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24682]={d="赶快行动，穿过这道传送门！我会在传送门的另一边与你汇合。",dEN="Quickly, through the portal! I'll find you on the other side.",o="在萨隆矿坑和希尔瓦娜斯·风行者见面。",oEN="Meet Lady Sylvanas Windrunner inside the entrace to the Pit of Saron.",c="真是一群无能的蠢货。我开始怀疑通过试炼的是不是都是傻瓜。但愿你能证明是我错了。",cEN="Incapable fools. I begin to wonder if any of these louts from the tournament will be of any use at all. Perhaps you'll prove me wrong."}
Q[24683]={d="赶快行动，穿过这道传送门！我会在传送门的另一边与你汇合。",dEN="Quickly, through the portal! I'll meet you on the other side.",o="在萨隆矿坑和吉安娜·普罗德摩尔见面。",oEN="Meet Lady Jaina Proudmoore just inside the Pit of Saron.",c="是我低估了天灾领主，我的人为此付出了代价。就在我因为阿尔萨斯的背叛感到愧疚到不可自拔时，他又一次证明我错了。\n\n我们必须振作起来，绝不能让战士们白白牺牲。",cEN="I underestimated this Scourgelord, and it's my men that paid for it. When I think that my guilt over Arthas' betrayal cannot go any deeper, he proves me wrong yet again.\n\nWe have to press on. We cannot let their sacrifice be meaningless."}
Q[24710]={d="Tenemos que seguir por el camino principal y cruzar la cueva hasta la guarida de Tyrannus.\n\nSe verá obligado a enfrentarse a nosotros allí para evitar que entremos en la ciudadela propiamente dicha.\n\nVe, $c. Mis hombres y yo estaremos contigo cuando comience el enfrentamiento contra Tyrannus.",dEN="We need to make our way up the main path and through the cave to Tyrannus' rise. There, he will be forced to confront us there lest we make our way into the citadel proper.\n\nGo now, <class>. My men and I will be there to stand by you when the confrontation with Tyrannus comes.",o="杀死天灾领主泰兰努斯。",oEN="Kill Scourgelord Tyrannus.",c="¡Qué desperdicio tan insensato! ¡Arthas va demasiado lejos! Solo puedo esperar que lo que encontremos en las Salas de la Reflexión haga que esto valga la pena de alguna manera.\n\nSi lo que dijo ese vil gnomo es de fiar, la Agonía de Escarcha debería estar allí y, con ella, las respuestas para enfrentarse a Arthas.",cEN="Such a senseless waste! Arthas goes too far! I can only hope what we find in the Halls of Reflection makes this somehow worth it.\n\nIf what that vile gnome said is to be trusted, Frostmourne should be there, and with it, answers to confronting Arthas."}
Q[24711]={d="Debemos continuar, $ghéroe:heroína;. Hemos llegado tan lejos... Estamos muy cerca de nuestro objetivo.\n\nDebo detenerme un momento para mandar a Elandra de vuelta a la nave. No estoy segura de cómo vamos a escapar tras perder a tantos hombres, con tan poca gente para asegurar nuestro camino.\n\nSigue. Me reuniré contigo en las Cámaras de Reflexión.",dEN="We must press on, hero. We've come so far... we're so close to our goal. I must delay a moment to send Elandra back to the airship. I'm uncertain how we're going to escape with so many men lost and so few to keep our path in secure - we will need any help they can send.\n\nContinue on. I will meet you in the Halls of Reflection.",o="在映像大厅的入口与吉安娜女士汇合。",oEN="Meet Lady Jaina Proudmoore at the entrance to the Halls of Reflection.",c="Las Salas de la Reflexión. Por fin.\n\nAvísame cuando estés listo. Puede que Arthas no esté aquí, pero sería ingenuo pensar que dejaría la Agonía de Escarcha sin vigilancia por completo.",cEN="The Halls of Reflection. Finally.\n\nLet me know when you are ready. Arthas may not be here, but it would be naive to think that he would leave Frostmourne unguarded entirely."}
Q[24712]={d="Tenemos que seguir por el camino principal y cruzar la cueva hasta la guarida de Tyrannus.\n\nAllí se verá obligado a enfrentarse a nosotros para evitar que entremos en la ciudadela.\n\nVe, $c. Mis hombres y yo estaremos contigo cuando comience el enfrentamiento contra Tyrannus.",dEN="We need to make our way up the main path and through the cave to Tyrannus' rise. There, he will be forced to confront us there lest we make our way into the citadel proper.\n\nGo now, <class>. My men and I will be there to stand by you when the confrontation with Tyrannus comes.",o="杀死天灾领主泰兰努斯。",oEN="Kill Scourgelord Tyrannus.",c="映像大厅就在前面了。假如那个卑鄙的侏儒的话可信，霜之哀伤就该也在那了，对抗阿尔萨斯的关健也在那里。",cEN="The Halls of Reflection lie ahead. If what that vile gnome said is to be trusted, Frostmourne should be there, and with it, answers to confronting Arthas."}
Q[24713]={d="继续前进，霜之哀伤就近在咫尺了。\n\n我需要耽误一会送我的一名黑暗游侠回到飞艇上。在损失这么多战友之后，我不会再执行准备不足的行动——我们需要他们的鼎力帮助。\n\n去吧。我会在映像大厅与你汇合。",dEN="Keep moving, the sword is close.\n\nI need a moment to send one of my Dark Rangers back to the airship. With all of our fodder gone, I will not be caught unprepared - we will need any help they can send.\n\nGo. I will meet you in the Halls of Reflection.",o="在映像大厅的入口与希尔瓦娜斯汇合。",oEN="Meet Lady Sylvanas Windrunner inside the entrance to the Halls of Reflection.",c="Las Salas de la Reflexión. Por fin.\n\nAvísame cuando estés listo, <class>. No seré tan ingenuo como para pensar que Arthas dejó su preciosa espada sin vigilancia por completo.",cEN="The Halls of Reflection. Finally.\n\nLet me know when you are ready, <class>. I will not be so naive as to think that Arthas left his precious sword entirely unguarded."}
Q[24745]={d="这张卡片里面记录了一个疯狂而详细的计划。其目的是感染艾泽拉斯的全部生物。你应该立刻把它交给热砂集团的一名调查员！",dEN="The inside of the card is scribbled with mad, detailed plans to infect most of Azeroth. You should show this to one of Steamwheedle's investigators immediately!",o="将褪色的情人节卡片交给暴风城的探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Bring the Faded Lovely Greeting Card to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你有没有“照顾”好那些不怀好意的恶棍？",pEN="Did you take care of those no-good scheming villains?",c="¿Qué tienes ahí?\n\nOh, vaya, esto es importante. Muy importante. La mayoría de los detalles locos en un solo paquete pequeño. Gracias, de verdad nos has ayudado a controlar todo esto. Ha sido un placer trabajar contigo.",cEN="What've you got there?\n\nOh hey, this is big. Real big. Most of the crazy details in one little package. Thanks - you really helped us reel this all in. Good working with ya."}
Q[24748]={d="影之哀伤，这件武器刚刚问世不久，却已经改写了这个世界的历史。它初生便背负着无与伦比的命运。\n\n手握这件武器的你同样背负着巨大的责任，而且现在就是你履行这一责任的时候。\n\n举起这件传奇武器，向敌人发起冲锋吧。为我们牺牲的无数英雄复仇，让他们饱受折磨的灵魂得到安息。\n\n坚定你的意志，$c，引领影之哀伤去实现它的命运吧。",dEN="Shadowmourne; a newly forged weapon already steeped in this world's history, reborn into an unrivaled destiny.\n\nWith this weapon you bear a solemn responsibility, and the time to carry out that charge is at hand.\n\nTake this weapon of myth and legend and march on the enemy. Avenge the countless heroes lost in his merciless campaign. Bring rest to their tortured souls.\n\nSteel yourself, <class>, and guide Shadowmourne to fulfill the purpose of its creation.",o="冰冠堡垒中的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼希望你去消灭巫妖王。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine in Icecrown Citadel wants you to kill the Lich King.",c="终于，我们做到了。\n\n愿艾泽拉斯的人民永远铭记我们在这里的事迹，愿如此多的牺牲能像熊熊火焰一样在他们的心中燃烧，愿他们在面对恶魔时永远不会怯懦和退缩。",cEN="So, at last it is done.\n\nMay the people of Azeroth remember our deeds here forevermore. May the sacrifices of so many burn in their hearts eternally. May they never fail to risk mortal peril in the face of great evil."}
Q[24749]={d="你的武器必须注入足够的力量，才能发挥出它真正的潜力。第一种要注入的力量就是邪恶。\n\n你必须找到并击败那个名叫普崔塞德教授的人。但消灭他并非你唯一的目标。你还要利用他的力量来对抗他。\n\n想办法吸收他的变异粘液。使用那种邪恶的物质为你的武器注入邪恶力量。然后我会指示你下一步的任务。",dEN="Before your weapon can reach its full potential it must be endowed with its signature powers. First among them is unholiness.\n\nYou must seek out and defeat the one called Professor Putricide, but his death is not your only goal. You must use his resources against him.\n\nFind a way to absorb his mutated slime. Use the foul substance to infuse your weapon with the power of the unholy. Only when this has been done shall I reveal your next task.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼要你用邪恶能量灌注影锋，并杀死普崔塞德教授。\n\n该任务只能在冰冠堡垒25人英雄难度模式下完成。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to infuse Shadow's Edge with Unholy power and slay Professor Putricide.\n\nThis quest may only be completed in 25 person difficulty of Icecrown Citadel.",c="Bien hecho, <class>.\n\nLa conclusión de nuestro trabajo se acerca.",cEN="Well done, <class>.\n\nThe completion of our work draws near."}
Q[24756]={d="Tu arma ya está preparada para dotarla con el poder de la sangre.\n\nDebes enfrentarte a la reina Lana'thel en combate y someterte a su Espejo de sangre. Este poder provocará que el Filo de las Sombras beba la sangre del ser viviente más cercano. $gEse:Esa; serás tú, $r.\n\nUna vez se haya despertado la espada, permite que la Sed de sangre frenética de la Reina se apodere de ti, cede a sus apetitos tres veces y dale una muerte ignominiosa a la Reina.\n\nQue sus gritos perforen los oídos del Rey Exánime mientras espera su destino.",dEN="Your weapon is ready to be endowed with the power of blood.\n\nYou must face Queen Lana'thel in battle and subject yourself to her Blood Mirror. This will cause Shadow's Edge to drink the blood of the nearest living being. That being would be you, <race>.\n\nOnce the blade has been thus awakened, allow the Queen's Frenzied Bloodthirst to take hold of you, feed the blade thrice to sate it, and then give the queen an ignominious death.\n\nMay her screams pierce the ears of the Lich King as he awaits his fate.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼要你使用鲜血灌注影锋，并击败鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔。\n\n该任务只能在25人难度的冰冠堡垒中完成。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to infuse Shadow's Edge with blood and defeat Queen Lana'thel.\n\nThis quest may only be completed in 25 person difficulty of Icecrown Citadel.",c="Bien hecho, <class>.\n\nShadowmourne está casi al alcance de la mano.",cEN="Well done, <class>.\n\nShadowmourne is nearly within reach."}
Q[24757]={d="影锋已经准好要接收其最终的力量灌注了。\n\n辛达苟萨，敌人的坐骑，必须死。但是在杀死她之前，你必须要在不死的情况下经受住她的四次冰霜气息。\n\n没有了他的龙之后，在你和巫妖王之间就不再有真正意义上的对手了。",dEN="Shadow's Edge is prepared to receive its final infusion of power.\n\nSindragosa, the enemy's own mount, must fall. But before she is brought down, you must sustain four of her frozen breath attacks without tasting death.\n\nWithout his dragon, nothing shall stand between you and the Lich King.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼对你做出了指示，他要你在使用影锋与辛达苟萨战斗时，经受住辛达苟萨的四次气息攻击，然后再杀死她。\n\n该任务只能在25人难度的冰冠堡垒中完成。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine has instructed you to slay Sindragosa after subjecting yourself to 4 of her breath attacks while wielding Shadow's Edge.\n\nThis quest may only be completed in 25 person difficulty of Icecrown Citadel.",c="El hacha ha bebido hasta saciarse, <race>, y la forja está casi lista para la creación de Shadowmourne...",cEN="The axe has drunk its fill, <race>, and the forge is nearly ready for the creation of Shadowmourne..."}
Q[24792]={d="看样子你有足够的智慧和力量完成我的任务。这本帐簿的内容表明他正待在影牙城堡。所以我现在要派你去那里。\n\n我们已经向那里派了一个人，但他还没有取得任何进展。赶快行动。我们的侦查员会在那里和你碰头。记得带上你的朋友一起过去。",dEN="You look like you're fit enough to take on the mastermind behind this operation. The ledger says he's holed up in Shadowfang Keep, so that's where I'm sending you.\n\nWe have a man there already but he's not fit to take down an operation by himself. Head on in; the investigator will meet you there. And bring friends.",o="向影牙城堡的调查员费岑·布莱斯塔克报告。",oEN="Report to Investigator Fezzen Brasstacks in Shadowfang Keep.",c="Fantástico. La ayuda es exactamente lo que necesito.",cEN="Fantastic. Help is exactly what I need."}
Q[24793]={d="看样子你有足够的智慧和力量完成我的任务。这本帐簿的内容表明他正待在影牙城堡。所以我现在要派你去那里。\n\n我们已经向那里派了一个人，但他还没有取得任何进展。赶快行动。我们的侦查员会在那里和你碰头。记得带上你的朋友一起过去。",dEN="You look like you're fit enough to take on the mastermind behind this operation. The ledger says he's holed up in Shadowfang Keep, so that's where I'm sending you.\n\nWe have a man there already but he's not fit to take down an operation by himself. Head on in; the investigator will meet you there. And bring friends.",o="向影牙城堡的调查员费岑·布莱斯塔克报告。",oEN="Report to Investigator Fezzen Brasstacks in Shadowfang Keep.",c="Fantástico. La ayuda es exactamente lo que necesito.",cEN="Fantastic. Help is exactly what I need."}
Q[24795]={d="在鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔自吹自擂的时候，而你，$n，却已经取得了奎尔德拉。\n\n银色盟约和全体奎尔多雷都对你心怀感激。\n\n奎尔德拉似乎知道你是一名$c，不能使用它。那么它的下一个主人该是谁？也许银色十字军能为它找到新主人。到北边的银色比武场去，代表银色盟约将这把剑交给裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",dEN="In spite of Queen Lana'thel's boasting, you have restored Quel'Delar, <name>. Long have we dreamt of reclaiming Quel'Delar.\n\nThe Silver Covenant, and indeed all quel'dorei owe you a debt of gratitude.\n\nAs a <class>, the sword seems to know you lack the training to wield it and hasn't bonded to you. Where, then, will its next master come from? Perhaps the Argent Crusade can find one. Go north to the Argent Tournament Grounds and present the sword to Justicar Mariel Trueheart on behalf of the Silver Covenant.",o="将奎尔德拉交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="Que un arma de tal poder haya sido rescatada de las garras del mal es un gran presagio en estos tiempos, <name>. Con Quel'Delar y aliados leales del Pacto Plateado a nuestro lado, el Rey Exánime tendrá motivos de sobra para temernos.\n\nLa cruzada mantiene un arsenal de armas excepcionales para nuestros aliados más fuertes. Permíteme ofrecerte a elegir una de ellas a cambio de confiar en nosotros el cuidado de Quel'Delar.",cEN="That a weapon of such power has been redeemed from the clutches of evil is a great omen in these times, <name>. With Quel'Delar and staunch Silver Covenant allies at our side, the Lich King will have good reason to fear.\n\nThe crusade maintains an arsenal of exceptional weapons for our strongest allies. Allow me to offer you your choice from among them in return for entrusting us with the care of Quel'Delar."}
Q[24796]={d="在鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔自吹自擂的时候，而你，$n，却已经取得了奎尔德拉。\n\n银色盟约和全体奎尔多雷都对你心怀感激。\n\n银色盟约的领袖温蕾萨·风行者希望你从太阳之井返回以后能去见她一面。请带着奎尔德拉转至达拉然的紫罗兰城堡，她正在那里等你，$n。",dEN="In spite of Queen Lana'thel's boasting, you have restored Quel'Delar, <name>. Long have we dreamt of reclaiming Quel'Delar.\n\nThe Silver Covenant, and indeed all quel'dorei owe you a debt of gratitude.\n\nVereesa Windrunner, the leader of the Silver Covenant, asked to see you after you returned from the Sunwell. Take Quel'Delar with you and go to Dalaran's Violet Citadel where she waits, <name>.",o="将奎尔德拉交给达拉然紫罗兰城堡中的温蕾萨·风行者。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Vereesa Windrunner at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="Esto es nada menos que un logro increíble, <name>. El día en que Thalorien y Anasterian cayeron, el mismo día en que se perdió Quel'Delar, fue uno de los más oscuros de mi vida. Ver Quel'Delar restaurada... es algo que no se puede expresar con palabras.\n\nSin duda, estás destinado a ser el verdadero portador de la hoja. La magia de Quel'Delar ya está adaptando la hoja a tus habilidades y tus fuerzas.",cEN="This is nothing short of an amazing accomplishment, <name>. The day that Thalorien and Anasterian fell, the same day that Quel'Delar was lost, was one of the darkest of my life. To see Quel'Delar restored... it is beyond words.\n\nWithout a doubt, you are meant to be the true bearer of the blade. Quel'Delar's magic is already adapting the blade to your skills and your strengths."}
Q[24798]={d="¡Por fin, Quel'Delar ha sido restaurada por la gloria de los Atracasol y los sin'dorei!\n\nToda Lunargenta te aclamará como $gun héroe:una heroína;, $n.\n\nComo $c, la espada parece saber que no tienes la formación para blandirla y no se ha ligado a ti. ¿De dónde vendrá su próximo maestro? No ha aparecido ningún sin'dorei digno. Pidamos ayuda a la Cruzada Argenta. Ve al norte, a los Campos del Torneo Argenta y presenta la espada a la justicar Mariel Corazón Veraz en nombre de los Atracasol.",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers and the sin'dorei!\n\nAll of Silvermoon will celebrate you as a hero, <name>.\n\nAs a <class>, the sword seems to know you lack the training to wield it and hasn't bonded to you. Where, then, will its next master come from? No worthy sin'dorei has come forward. Let us seek the Argent Crusade's counsel. Go north to the Argent Tournament Grounds and present the sword to Justicar Mariel Trueheart on behalf of the Sunreavers.",o="将奎尔德拉交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="Que un arma de tal poder haya sido rescatada de las garras del mal es un gran presagio en estos tiempos, <name>. Con Quel'Delar y aliados leales de los Saqueadores de Sol a nuestro lado, el Rey Exánime tendrá motivos de sobra para temernos.\n\nLa cruzada mantiene un arsenal de armas excepcionales para nuestros aliados más fuertes. Permíteme ofrecerte a elegir una de ellas a cambio de confiar en nosotros el cuidado de Quel'Delar.",cEN="That a weapon of such power has been redeemed from the clutches of evil is a great omen in these times, <name>. With Quel'Delar and staunch Sunreaver allies at our side, the Lich King will have good reason to fear.\n\nThe crusade maintains an arsenal of exceptional weapons for our strongest allies. Allow me to offer you your choice from among them in return for entrusting us with the care of Quel'Delar."}
Q[24799]={d="¡Por fin, Quel'Delar ha sido restaurada por la gloria de los Atracasol!\n\nToda la Horda te aclamará como $gun héroe:una heroína;, $n.\n\nComo $c, la espada parece saber que no tienes la formación para blandirla y no se ha ligado a ti. ¿De dónde vendrá su próximo maestro? No ocultaré mi desilusión; esperaba que fuera un sin'dorei digno. Pidamos ayuda a la Cruzada Argenta. Ve al norte, a los Campos del Torneo Argenta y presenta la espada a la justicar Mariel Corazón Veraz en nombre de los Atracasol.",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers!\n\nAll the Horde will celebrate you as a hero, <name>.\n\nAs a <class>, the sword seems to know you lack the training to wield it and hasn't bonded to you. Where, then, will its next master come from? I will not conceal my disappointment; I had hoped it would be a worthy sin'dorei. Let us seek the Argent Crusade's counsel. Go north to the Argent Tournament Grounds and present the sword to Justicar Mariel Trueheart on behalf of the Sunreavers.",o="将奎尔德拉交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="Que un arma de tal poder haya sido rescatada de las garras del mal es un gran presagio en estos tiempos, <name>. Con Quel'Delar y aliados leales de los Saqueadores de Sol a nuestro lado, el Rey Exánime tendrá motivos de sobra para temernos.\n\nLa cruzada mantiene un arsenal de armas excepcionales para nuestros aliados más fuertes. Permíteme ofrecerte a elegir una de ellas a cambio de confiar en nosotros el cuidado de Quel'Delar.",cEN="That a weapon of such power has been redeemed from the clutches of evil is a great omen in these times, <name>. With Quel'Delar and staunch Sunreaver allies at our side, the Lich King will have good reason to fear.\n\nThe crusade maintains an arsenal of exceptional weapons for our strongest allies. Allow me to offer you your choice from among them in return for entrusting us with the care of Quel'Delar."}
Q[24800]={d="¡Por fin, Quel'Delar ha sido restaurada por la gloria de los Atracasol y los sin'dorei! Toda Lunargenta y toda la Horda te proclamará $gun héroe:una heroína;.\n\nEl archimago Aethas Atracasol, líder de los Atracasol, ha pedido verte tras tu regreso de La Fuente del Sol. Viaja a La Ciudadela Violeta en Dalaran en cuanto puedas, $n, y lleva contigo a Quel'Delar. ¡El Archimago quiere felicitarte personalmente!",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers and the sin'dorei! All of Silvermoon will proclaim you a hero, as will all of the Horde.\n\nArchmage Aethas Sunreaver, the leader of the Sunreavers, asked to see you after you returned from the Sunwell. Travel to the Violet Citadel in Dalaran as soon as you can, <name> and bring Quel'Delar with you. The archmage wishes to congratulate you personally!",o="将奎尔德拉交给达拉然紫罗兰城堡的大法师艾萨斯·夺日者。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="Quel'Delar resurge, tal como nosotros, los sin'dorei, nos hemos alzado de las cenizas de la derrota y la traición. Tanto el corazón como el arma de Thalorien Dawnseeker están contigo, <name>.\n\nVeo que la hoja ya ha empezado a adaptarse a tus capacidades, <name>. Mantén la cabeza alta y ten siempre a Quel'Delar a tu lado.",cEN="Quel'Delar rises again, as we sin'dorei have risen from the ashes of defeat and betrayal. The heart and the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker are both with you, <name>.\n\nI see the blade has already started adapting itself to your strengths, <name>. Hold your head high and always keep Quel'Delar at your side."}
Q[24801]={d="奎尔德拉终于回到了我们的手中，这是夺日者和部落的光荣！也是这场对抗巫妖王的战争中我们得到的祝福。\n\n夺日者的领袖，大法师艾萨斯·夺日者希望你从太阳之井回来以后去见他一面。$n，带着奎尔德拉转至达拉然的紫罗兰城堡。大法师要亲自向你祝贺胜利！",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers and the Horde! This is a blessing for our efforts against the Lich King.\n\nArchmage Aethas Sunreaver, the leader of the Sunreavers, asked to see you after you returned from the Sunwell. Travel to the Violet Citadel in Dalaran as soon as you can, <name> and bring Quel'Delar with you. The archmage wishes to congratulate you personally!",o="将奎尔德拉交给达拉然紫罗兰城堡的大法师艾萨斯·夺日者。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="Quel'Delar resurge, tal como los sin'dorei nos hemos alzado de las cenizas de la derrota y la traición. Sin embargo, de algún modo, el arma de Thalorien Dawnseeker ha elegido servir a un forastero.\n\nNo te inquietes, <name>. No pretendo menospreciar tu logro, pues has hecho lo que ninguno de mis hermanos pudo, aunque no sé por qué. Está claro que estás destinado a ser su portador; la hoja ya se está adaptando a tus habilidades. Empuña Quel'Delar con orgullo contra nuestros enemigos comunes.",cEN="Quel'Delar rises again, as the sin'dorei have risen from the ashes of defeat and betrayal. Yet, somehow, the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker has chosen to serve an outsider.\n\nBe at ease, <name>. I do not mean to diminish your accomplishment, for you have done what none of my brothers could, although I do not know why. You are clearly meant to be its bearer; the blade is already adapting itself to your abilities. Wield Quel'Delar proudly against our common foes."}
Q[24802]={d="乌瑟尔知道该如何击败阿尔萨斯。很难相信，最有可能击败阿尔萨斯的地方恰恰就是在他王座前的阶梯上。如果阿尔萨斯倒下，谁又会戴上巫妖王的王冠？\n\n有许多问题还悬而未决，但你发现的答案对于击败阿尔萨斯也许会起到关键性的作用。你需要找到希尔瓦娜斯，并逃过巫妖王的攻击。",dEN="Uther knew a great deal about how Arthas might be defeated. It's hard to believe that there is much hope of defeating Arthas upon the steps of his own throne. And who will take up the crown of Lich King if it comes to that?\n\nMany questions remain, but the answers that you've uncovered may be critical to ensuring Arthas' defeat. You need to find Sylvanas and escape the Lich King while there's still time.",o="找到希尔瓦娜斯·风行者，并逃出映像大厅。",oEN="Find Lady Sylvanas Windrunner and escape the Halls of Reflection",c="Una vez más, la venganza se escapa de mis manos. Es difícil creer lo mucho que se ha fortalecido.\n\nFue una insensatez que vinieras a por mí, pero es bueno saber que todavía hay algunos campeones de la Horda que no son cobardes inútiles. La información que Uther nos dio bien podría ser la clave para matar finalmente a Arthas, aunque cada vez queda más claro que la Horda no será capaz de lograrlo por su cuenta.\n\nVe, <class>. Espero que tu destreza pueda ser necesaria de nuevo muy pronto.",cEN="Yet again, vengeance slips through my grasp. It's hard to believe how much stronger he's gotten.\n\nIt was foolish of you to come for me, but it's good to know that there are still some champions of the Horde that aren't useless cowards. The information Uther gave us may well be key to finally killing Arthas, though it is becoming more and more clear that the Horde will not be able to accomplish this on their own.\n\nGo, <class>. I expect your prowess may be needed again very soon."}
Q[24803]={p="卡鲁亚克通过每周举办大赛一直在延续钓鱼的传统。\n\n奖杯会颁给第一个钓到黑鳍鲨的人，这家伙将会成为诺森德最出名的钓手……额，至少出名几天吧。\n\n黑鳍鲨最喜欢吃侏儒亚口鱼了，所以通常情况就是你总钓到侏儒亚口鱼而不是黑鳍鲨。",pEN="The Kalu'ak have a long tradition of honing our fishing skills by putting them to the the test every week.\n\nThe first person to catch and bring a blacktip shark to me will be rewarded handsomely, and be known as the greatest fisherman of the north... for a couple days at least.\n\nThe blacktip shark's favorite food is the pygmy suckerfish. Try fishing for the blacktip wherever you would normally catch the suckerfish.",c="别傻站着！把鱼给我，我会宣布你是获胜者！",cEN="Don't just stand there! Give me the shark and I'll declare you the winner!"}
Q[24804]={d="皇冠药剂公司有些不对劲的地方。热砂集团已经开始注意他们了。我们要对此采取行动。\n\n如果你有兴趣帮助我们，就请到暴风城去。探员斯尼普·滑栓正在那里进行调查，他很需要你的帮助。",dEN="Something's not right about this Crown Chemical Company. Steamwheedle's got eyes on 'em, and we could use a few more.\n\nHead to Stormwind if you're interested in helping us out. Inspector Snip Snagglebolt is heading up the investigation there, and he can use all the help he can get.",o="向暴风城的探员斯尼普·滑栓报告。",oEN="Report to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",c="嘿，你有时间吗？我这有点事情想交给你办。",cEN="Hey. You got some time on your hands? I could use someone like you."}
Q[24805]={d="皇冠药剂公司有些不对劲的地方。热砂集团已经开始注意他们了。我们要对此采取行动。\n\n如果你有兴趣帮助我们，就请到奥格瑞玛去。侦探斯奈普·滑栓正在那里进行调查，他很需要你的帮助。",dEN="Something's not right about this Crown Chemical Company. Steamwheedle's got eyes on 'em, and we could use a few more.\n\nHead to Orgrimmar if you're interested in helping us out. Detective Snap Snagglebolt is heading up the investigation there, and he can use all the help he can get.",o="向奥格瑞玛的侦探斯奈普·滑栓报告。",oEN="Report to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",c="嘿，你有时间吗？我这有点事情想交给你办。",cEN="Hey. You got some time on your hands? I could use someone like you."}
Q[24806]={p="Me temo que ya tenemos un ganador por hoy, joven <name>. Sin embargo, si traes un tiburón, me encargaré de que sea devuelto a las aguas, y puede que tenga algo para ti...",pEN="I'm afraid we've already had a winner for today, young <name>. However, if you bring a shark, I'll see that it's released back into the waters, and I might just have a little something for you...",c="Bueno, es un detalle que lo hayas intentado, <race>. No quiero que pienses que tus esfuerzos han sido en vano, así que tengo algo para ti.",cEN="Well, it's nice that you tried <race>. I don't want you to think your efforts were wasted, so I've got something for you."}
Q[24815]={c="Para expiar los pecados que cometí como uno de los Caballeros de la Muerte del Rey Liche, me he dedicado a crear anillos de gran poder para que nuestros hermanos y hermanas los usen en la lucha.\n\nHas demostrado ser un aliado valioso en la lucha contra la Plaga, <name>. A medida que tu dedicación continúe, podré mejorar el diseño original del anillo.\n\nElige tu camino con cuidado. Un cambio de parecer tendrá un precio.",cEN="To atone for the sins I committed as one of the Lich King's Death Knights, I've dedicated myself to creating rings of great power for our brothers and sisters to use in the struggle.\n\nYou've proven yourself as a valuable ally in the fight against the Scourge, <name>. As your dedication continues I can improve on the ring's original design.\n\nChoose your path carefully. A change of heart will come at a price."}
Q[24819]={p="¿Buscas cambiar el camino que recorres, <name>?",pEN="You seek to change the path you walk, <name>?",c="Que encuentres lo que buscas, <brother/sister>.",cEN="May you find what you're looking for, <brother/sister>."}
Q[24823]={p="你愿在毁灭之路上走下去吗？",pEN="You seek to continue down the path of destruction?",c="Sigues demostrando tu valía, <name>. Acepta esto, no como un regalo, sino como una herramienta para la lucha contra la Plaga.",cEN="You continue to prove yourself, <name>. Accept this, not as a gift, but as a tool for the fight against the Scourge."}
Q[24828]={p="你愿在毁灭之路上走下去吗？",pEN="You seek to continue down the path of destruction?",c="Sigues demostrando tu valía, <name>. Acepta esto, no como un regalo, sino como una herramienta para la lucha contra la Plaga.",cEN="You continue to prove yourself, <name>. Accept this, not as a gift, but as a tool for the fight against the Scourge."}
