Q[24848]={d="$gChico:Chica;, no se trata solo del perfume. Había cohetes en ese cajón, y contenían una especie de carga química. No la puedo analizar aquí, pero te ahorraré el viaje al laboratorio.\n\nNo, tienes que encontrar al tipo que los fabricó. Reconozco su modus operandi. Quejica Misilóxido.\n\nUna fuente de fiar me ha soplado que Quejica se encuentra aquí, en Ventormenta, dándose la gran vida en La Rosa Áurea. Es más, tenía a una señorita colgada del brazo. Se llama Marion Sutton. Ve a La Rosa Áurea a ver qué sabe.",dEN="Kid, this is about more than just perfume. There were some rockets in that crate, and they had some kind of chemical payload inside. I can't analyze it here, but I'll spare ya the trip to the lab.\n\nNah, you gotta find the guy who made these. I know the maker's mark. Snivel Rustrocket.\n\nI got a tip from a reliable source that Snivel's here in Stormwind, livin' it up at the Gilded Rose. What's more, he had some dame on his arm. Marion Sutton was the name. Go to the Gilded Rose and see what she knows.",o="到暴风城贸易区的镶金玫瑰旅店去，同那里的玛丽恩·桑顿交谈。",oEN="Speak to Marion Sutton at the Gilded Rose in Stormwind's Trade District.",c="你……你不是斯内维尔。是他让你来的？他总是迟到，我等到花都谢了……\n\n<当这女人发现你不是替斯内维尔送口信的，她泪如泉涌。>\n\n这不像是斯内维尔的，他怎么了？",cEN="You... You're not Snivel. Did he send you? He's so late, I had started to give up hope...\n\n<Tears start welling up in the woman's eyes once she realizes that you aren't there to deliver a message from Snivel.>\n\nThat's not like my Snivel, but what choice is there?"}
Q[24849]={d="我最好从头开始说。起初是爱情，$n。那是我一眼就看中的一个地精。\n\n我们共度了一个星期的美好时光，斯内维尔说他弄到了一大笔钱，打算和我一起去南海度个长假！你能相信吗？\n\n不管怎么说，他让我收拾好行李，自己去银行、拍卖行和理发店跑趟差，但他再没回来过！我开始意识到他就是个大骗子！",dEN="I'd better start from the beginning. It was love at first sight, <name>. There was just something about that goblin from the moment I set eyes on him.\n\nAfter a wonderful week together, Snivel said he had come into a lot of money and that he was going to take me on a long vacation to the South Seas! Can you believe it?\n\nAnyway, he told me to pack while he ran some errands to the bank, the auction house, and the barber shop, but he never came back! I'm beginning to think he's nothing but a big liar!",o="在暴风城的会计室、拍卖行和理发店寻找斯内维尔·拉斯罗凯特。",oEN="Look for Snivel Rustrocket in the Stormwind Counting House, the Auction House, and the Barbershop in Stormwind City.",p="你是谁？",pEN="Who are you?",c="¿Todo lo que decía era que se iría de la ciudad con todo su dinero? Entonces de verdad me ha abandonado, ¿verdad?\n\nOh, <name>. Fui una tonta al enamorarme de él, ¿pero cómo iba a evitarlo? ¡Era tan irresistible!",cEN="All he talked about was leaving town with all his money? Then he really has abandoned me, hasn't he?\n\nOh, <name>. I was such a fool to fall for him, but how could I help myself? He was so irresistible!"}
Q[24850]={d="$gChico:Chica;, no se trata solo del perfume. Había cohetes en ese cajón, y contenían una especie de carga química. No la puedo analizar aquí, pero te ahorraré el viaje al laboratorio.\n\nNo, tienes que encontrar al tipo que los fabricó. Reconozco su modus operandi. Quejica Misilóxido.\n\nMe han soplado que Quejica se está dando la gran vida aquí, en Orgrimmar. Es más, se ha echado novia, una señorita orco llamada Roka. Se supone que han quedado en el Equipo de viaje de Gotri, en la Calle Mayor, antes de huir.",dEN="Kid, this is about more than just perfume. There were some rockets in that crate, and they had some kind of chemical payload inside. I can't analyze it here, but I'll spare ya the trip to the lab.\n\nNah, you gotta find the guy who made these. I know the maker's mark. Snivel Rustrocket.\n\nI hear Snivel's livin' it up here in Orgrimmar. What's more, he's got himself a girlfriend -- some orc dame named Roka. She's supposed to meet him at Gotri's Travelling Goods in the Drag before they make their escape.",o="在奥格瑞玛暗巷区的旅行杂货店 同洛卡交谈。",oEN="Speak to Roka at the Gotri's Travelling Goods in Orgrimmar's Drag district.",c="你不是斯内维尔。他本该一小时前到这的！你对他做了什么？\n\n<当你告诉罗卡尔你也在找斯内维尔时，她冷静下来了。然后她泪如泉涌>\n\n这不像是斯内维尔的。你觉得他发生了什么事？",cEN="You're not Snivel. He was supposed to be here an hour ago! What have you done with him?\n\n<Roka seems to calm down when you tell her that you're looking for Snivel, too. Then the tears start to well up in her eyes.>\n\nThis isn't like my Snivel. Do you think something's happened to him?"}
Q[24851]={d="我最好从头开始说。起初是爱情，$n。那是我一眼就看中的一个地精。\n\n我们共度了一个星期的美好时光，斯内维尔说他弄到了一大笔钱，打算和我一起去南海度个长假！你能相信吗？\n\n不管怎么说，他让我收拾好行李，自己去银行、拍卖行和理发店跑趟差，但他再没回来过！我开始意识到他就是个大骗子！",dEN="I'd better start from the beginning. It was love at first sight, <name>. There was just something about that goblin from the moment I set eyes on him.\n\nAfter a wonderful week together, Snivel said he had come into a lot of money and that he was going to take me on a long vacation to the South Seas! Can you believe it?\n\nAnyway, he told me to pack while he ran some errands to the bank, the auction house, and the barber shop, but he never came back! I'm beginning to think he's nothing but a big liar!",o="在奥格瑞玛的银行、拍卖行和理发店寻找斯内维尔·拉斯罗凯特。",oEN="Look for Snivel Rustrocket in the Orgrimmar Bank, the Auction House, and the Barbershop in Orgrimmar.",p="你是谁？",pEN="Who are you?",c="¿Todo lo que decía era que se iría de la ciudad con todo su dinero? Entonces de verdad me ha abandonado, ¿verdad?\n\n¡No puedo creer que cayera ante un goblin tan horrible! Pero era irresistible cuando nos conocimos por primera vez.",cEN="All he talked about was leaving town with all his money? Then he really has abandoned me, hasn't he?\n\nI can't believe I fell for such a horrible goblin! But he was so irresistible when we first met."}
Q[24857]={d="在仔细查看了地图之后，你意识到刺背野猪人的酋长正计划着对纳拉其营地展开进一步攻击。\n\n鹰风酋长必须马上得知这个消息。",dEN="After carefully evaluating the map, you realize that what you discovered are the plans made by the Bristleback warchief for an extended siege on Camp Narache.\n\nSurely Chief Hawkwind could use this information!",o="将刺背野猪人的进攻计划交给纳拉其营地的鹰风酋长。",oEN="Bring the Bristleback Attack Plans to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache.",p="Tienes una expresión de preocupación, <name>. ¿Qué noticias traes?",pEN="You have a look of concern about you,<name>. What news do you bring?",c="¡Esto es realmente alarmante! Pero con esta información podemos pedir ayuda a nuestros hermanos de la aldea de Bloodhoof para frustrar el ataque. Has salvado las vidas de muchos tauren, <name>.",cEN="This is quite alarming indeed! But with this information we can call on our brethren from Bloodhoof Village to help thwart the attack. You have saved the lives of many tauren, <name>."}
Q[24869]={d="我们本打算在诅咒教派中安排一名线人，以刺探巫妖王的计划，但是，我们……低估了阿尔萨斯和他的黑暗部下，亡语者女士，的煽动能力。\n\n我们的线人，达尔纳文，现在已经投靠他们了。\n\n请务必留意达尔纳文的踪迹。如果你能将他活着带回来，我们可以尝试解除诅咒教派对他所做的洗脑工作。",dEN="We had hoped to place a man on the inside of the Cult of the Damned, to give us an inside angle on the Lich King's machinations, but we... underestimated the persuasive powers of Arthas and his dark minister, Lady Deathwhisper.\n\nOur man, Darnavan, is one of them now.\n\nIf you plan on fighting your way through the Oratory ahead, please keep your eyes peeled for Darnavan. If you can bring him back to us alive, we can attempt to reverse the Cult's brainwashing.",o="击败亡语者女士，同时确保达尔纳文活着。",oEN="Defeat Lady Deathwhisper while ensuring that Darnavan survives."}
Q[24870]={d="仿佛现在的局势还不够疯狂一样，我们又要在两条战联机作战了！我们面前是天灾军团，而那些该死的联盟却在偷袭我们的后方！\n\n我们在这里的任务是为我们的飞艇清理出一片安全的着陆点，但在那道城垒的另一侧，一个大家伙正在向所有靠近的东西投掷弹药。这让我们的规模船只根本不能着陆。\n\n说实话，它对于我们来说的确是有些太大了。但你和你的朋友们似乎能够对付它。",dEN="As if this place weren't enough of a madhouse to begin with, we're fighting a war on two fronts up here, with the Scourge on one side and those blasted Alliance dogs on our other flank!\n\nWe are here to clear a safe landing for our vessels, but a behemoth of a giant on the other side of the Ramparts is hurling debris at anything that comes close and keeping our smaller ships at bay.\n\nI'll be honest -- he's a bit much for us to handle, but you and your companions look up to the task.",o="消灭腐烂的冰霜巨人。",oEN="Slay the Rotting Frost Giant."}
Q[24871]={d="仿佛现在的局势还不够疯狂一样，我们又要双线作战了！我们面前是天灾军团，而那些该死的部落却在偷袭我们的后方！\n\n我们在这里的任务是为我们的飞艇清理出一片安全的着陆点，但在那道城垒的另一侧，一个大家伙正在向所有靠近的东西投掷弹药。这让我们的规模船只根本不能着陆。\n\n说实话，它对于我们来说的确是有些太大了。但你和你的朋友们似乎能够对付它。",dEN="As if this place weren't enough of a madhouse to begin with, we're fighting a war on two fronts up here, with the Scourge on one side and those blasted Horde dogs on our other flank!\n\nWe are here to clear a safe landing for our vessels, but a behemoth of a giant on the other side of the Ramparts is hurling debris at anything that comes close and keeping our smaller ships at bay.\n\nI'll be honest -- he's a bit much for us to handle, but you and your companions look up to the task.",o="消灭腐烂的冰霜巨人。",oEN="Slay the Rotting Frost Giant.",c="冰霜巨人死了？感谢圣光！\n\n我们前方和空中的敌人都扫清了。拿上些战利品权当我们的谢意吧，等攻占冰封王座的那天咱们一定要好好庆祝，一起喝一杯！",cEN="The giant is dead? Praise the Light!\n\nThe way onward and upward is clear. Take some of these spoils of the battle as a token of our gratitude, and we will drink together in celebration once the Frozen Throne has been ground to dust!"}
Q[24872]={d="带上这颗生命水晶，也让你的同伴们都各拿上一颗。它蕴含着龙骨荒野巨龙圣地的力量。正是靠着这种力量，我才能抵抗黑暗魔法这么长的时间。\n\n当你与辛达苟萨作战的时候，要先尽量削弱他，然后让你们队伍中的四个人一同使用生命水晶，吸出被封锁在她躯体内的灵魂。然后当你击败辛达苟萨之后，就可以收取她的灵魂，并将这个灵魂送到龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿。",dEN="Take this Life Crystal, and have your companions take one as well. It contains potent energies from the verdant Dragonshrine in Dragonblight, and it was my own secret to resisting the dark magics of this place for so long.\n\nWhen you face Sindragosa, battle her until she is weakened, and then have your companions use these Crystals to coax out the essence that is dormant within her. If you then defeat her, you should be able to recover it and return it to Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",o="使用生命水晶，保护辛达苟萨的灵魂。",oEN="Use the Life Crystals to preserve Sindragosa's Essence."}
Q[24873]={d="El profesor Putricidio está encerrado en su repugnante laboratorio, haciendo experimentos y refinando cepas cada vez más letales de añublo para usarlo contra nosotros. Si pudiéramos obtener muestras puras de las toxinas, nuestros investigadores podrían elaborar un antídoto que salvaría innumerables vidas.\n\nPero hay una pega: para obtener una muestra adecuada es necesario mezclar dos cepas activas en un anfitrión vivo. Si tienes el... infortunio... de ser $gel anfitrión:la anfitriona;, vuelve inmediatamente para que podamos estudiarte.",dEN="Professor Putricide has been holed up in his foul laboratory, experimenting and refining increasingly lethal strains of blight to be used against us. If only we could obtain pure samples of the toxins, our researchers could concoct an antidote that would save countless lives.\n\nBut there's a catch -- a proper sample will need to mix two active strains within a living host. Should you have the... misfortune... of becoming such a host, please return here immediately so that we can harvest you for study.",o="Vuelve con la alquimista Adrianna cuando estés $ginfectado:infectada; con añublo naranja y verde.",oEN="Return to Alchemist Adrianna while infected with Orange and Green Blight.",c="¡Por fin tenemos especímenes vivos para estudiar! Has ayudado a salvar incontables vidas este día, <name>.\n\nPor favor, toma esto como muestra de agradecimiento por esta gran hazaña.",cEN="At last, we have live specimens to study! You have helped to save countless lives this day, <name>.\n\nPlease, take this as a token of thanks for this great deed."}
Q[24874]={d="这些自称萨莱因的天灾吸血者们真让我毛骨悚然。我们原本派了一名优秀的部下去监视他们，但是今天早上他一时疏忽被那些怪物给抓住了。他现在正在被女王亲自刑审，他的凄惨叫声一直回荡在血色厅堂。拜托你了，救救他，否则一切都晚了！",dEN="These Scourge bloodsuckers -- San'layn they call themselves - give me the creeps. We've had one of our best men keeping an eye on them. But this morning he got sloppy and got himself taken prisoner. He's being interrogated by the Queen herself right now, and his cries echo through the Crimson Halls. Please, save him before it's too late!",o="在内线米查尔被处死之前将他救出来。",oEN="Rescue Infiltrator Minchar before he is executed."}
Q[24875]={d="我们本打算在诅咒教派中安排一名线人，以刺探巫妖王的计划，但是，我们……低估了阿尔萨斯和他的黑暗部下，亡语者女士，的煽动能力。\n\n我们的线人，达尔纳文，现在已经投靠他们了。\n\n请务必留意达尔纳文的踪迹。如果你能将他活着带回来，我们可以尝试解除诅咒教派对他所做的洗脑工作。",dEN="We had hoped to place a man on the inside of the Cult of the Damned, to give us an inside angle on the Lich King's machinations, but we... underestimated the persuasive powers of Arthas and his dark minister, Lady Deathwhisper.\n\nOur man, Darnavan, is one of them now.\n\nIf you plan on fighting your way through the Oratory ahead, please keep your eyes peeled for Darnavan. If you can bring him back to us alive, we can attempt to reverse the Cult's brainwashing.",o="击败亡语者女士，同时确保达尔纳文活着。",oEN="Defeat Lady Deathwhisper while ensuring that Darnavan survives."}
Q[24876]={d="仿佛现在的局势还不够疯狂一样，我们又要在两条战联机作战了！我们面前是天灾军团，而那些该死的部落却在偷袭我们的后方！\n\n我们在这里的任务是为我们的飞艇清理出一片安全的着陆点，但在那道城垒的另一侧，一个大家伙正在向所有靠近的东西投掷弹药。这让我们的规模船只根本不能着陆。\n\n说实话，它对于我们来说的确是有些太大了。但你和你的朋友们似乎能够对付它。",dEN="As if this place weren't enough of a madhouse to begin with, we're fighting a war on two fronts up here, with the Scourge on one side and those blasted Horde dogs on our other flank!\n\nWe are here to clear a safe landing for our vessels, but a behemoth of a giant on the other side of the Ramparts is hurling debris at anything that comes close and keeping our smaller ships at bay.\n\nI'll be honest -- he's a bit much for us to handle, but you and your companions look up to the task.",o="消灭腐烂的冰霜巨人。",oEN="Slay the Rotting Frost Giant."}
Q[24877]={d="仿佛现在的局势还不够疯狂一样，我们又要在两条战联机作战了！我们面前是天灾军团，而那些该死的联盟却在偷袭我们的后方！\n\n我们在这里的任务是为我们的飞艇清理出一片安全的着陆点，但在那道城垒的另一侧，一个大家伙正在向所有靠近的东西投掷弹药。这让我们的规模船只根本不能着陆。\n\n说实话，它对于我们来说的确是有些太大了。但你和你的朋友们似乎能够对付它。",dEN="As if this place weren't enough of a madhouse to begin with, we're fighting a war on two fronts up here, with the Scourge on one side and those blasted Alliance dogs on our other flank!\n\nWe are here to clear a safe landing for our vessels, but a behemoth of a giant on the other side of the Ramparts is hurling debris at anything that comes close and keeping our smaller ships at bay.\n\nI'll be honest -- he's a bit much for us to handle, but you and your companions look up to the task.",o="消灭腐烂的冰霜巨人。",oEN="Slay the Rotting Frost Giant."}
Q[24878]={d="普崔塞德教授一直藏在他肮脏的实验室里，配制各种可怕的药剂来戕害我们。如果我们能取得他的药剂样品，我们的研究人员就能研制出解药。无数生命都将因此而得救。\n\n如果你恰巧遭遇了这种活体样品，请立刻回到这里来，这样我们就能进行研究了。",dEN="Professor Putricide has been holed up in his foul laboratory, experimenting and refining increasingly lethal strains of blight to be used against us. If only we could obtain pure samples of the toxins, our researchers could concoct an antidote that would save countless lives.\n\nIf you happen to come across live specimens, please return here immediately so that we can harvest them for study.",o="Vuelve con la alquimista Adrianna cuando estés $ginfectado:infectada; con añublo naranja y verde.",oEN="Return to Alchemist Adrianna while infected with Orange and Green Blight."}
Q[24879]={d="这些自称萨莱因的天灾吸血者们真让我毛骨悚然。我们原本派了一名优秀的部下去监视他们，但是今天早上他一时疏忽被那些怪物给抓住了。他现在正在被女王亲自刑审，他的凄惨叫声一直回荡在血色厅堂。拜托你了，救救他，否则一切都晚了！",dEN="These Scourge bloodsuckers -- San'layn they call themselves -- give me the creeps. We've had one of our best men keeping an eye on them. But this morning he got sloppy and got himself taken prisoner. He's being interrogated by the Queen herself right now, and his cries echo through the Crimson Halls. Please, save him before it's too late!",o="在内线米查尔被处死之前将他救出来。",oEN="Rescue Infiltrator Minchar before he is executed."}
Q[24880]={d="带上这颗生命水晶，也让你的同伴们都各拿上一颗。它蕴含着龙骨荒野巨龙圣地的力量。正是靠着这种力量，我才能抵抗黑暗魔法这么长的时间。\n\n当你与辛达苟萨作战的时候，要先尽量削弱他，然后让你们队伍中的四个人一同使用生命水晶，吸出被封锁在她躯体内的灵魂。然后当你击败辛达苟萨之后，就可以收取她的灵魂，并将这个灵魂送到龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿。",dEN="Take this Life Crystal, and have your companions take one as well. It contains potent energies from the verdant Dragonshrine in Dragonblight, and it was my own secret to resisting the dark magics of this place for so long.\n\nWhen you face Sindragosa, battle her until she is weakened, and then have your companions use these Crystals to coax out the essence that is dormant within her. If you then defeat her, you should be able to recover it and return it to Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",o="使用生命水晶，保护辛达苟萨的灵魂。",oEN="Use the Life Crystals to preserve Sindragosa's Essence."}
Q[24914]={d="你在这只箱子上找不到任何开关铰链或缝隙。如果不是你在摇晃这只箱子的时候能听到里面发出物体碰撞的声音，你一定会以为它是一整块金属。\n\n很可能只有大领主莫格莱尼才知道打开这只箱子的办法。",dEN="You can detect no hinges or openings on this box. Were it not for the shifting of items inside,it could easily be mistaken for solid metal.\n\nIf anyone could know the method of its opening,it would be Highlord Mograine.",o="将密封的金属箱交给冰冠堡垒的大领主莫格莱尼。",oEN="Bring the Sealed Chest to Highlord Darion Mograine in Icecrown Citadel."}
Q[24915]={p="¿Qué es eso que sostienes, <class>?\n\nMe llama, despertando sentimientos que creía muertos hace mucho tiempo.",pEN="What is that you hold, <class>?\n\nIt calls out to me, stirring feelings I thought to be long dead.",c="不可能……\n\n父亲，是你吗？\n\n你完成了一项壮举，英雄。我会把我最忠诚的坐骑缰绳送给你。它是你的了，不过可不要忘记了与你一起完成那些壮举的人。",cEN="Impossible...\n\nFather, is it you?!\n\nYou have done me a great service, hero. I offer you the reins of my faithful steed. Do with it as you please, but do not forget those that assisted you in this monumental feat."}
Q[24916]={p="¿Sí, <class>? ¿Cómo puedo ayudarte?",pEN="Yes, <class>? How can I assist you?",c="什么……你是如何做到这些的呢？！\n\n你完成了一项壮举，英雄。我激动得都几乎无法拿住这个吊坠了，不过我会给它施以咒语以为你提供点用途。它是你的了，不过不要忘记那些和你一起完成这项壮举的朋友。",cEN="What... how did you manage to come by this!?\n\nYou have done me a great service, hero. My heart could not bear to keep this locket, but I will place an enchantment upon it that you may find useful. Do with it as you please, but do not forget those that assisted you in this monumental feat."}
Q[24917]={p="¿Qué tienes ahí, <race>?",pEN="Whatdya got there, <race>?",c="Sí. Conozco esta hoja... y la atesoraré siempre; un momento en el tiempo que se perderá para siempre.\n\nMe has prestado un gran servicio, héroe. Te ofrezco un regalo de los enanos Frostborn. Haz con él lo que quieras, pero no olvides a quienes te ayudaron en esta hazaña monumental.",cEN="Aye. I know this blade... and I will treasure it always - a moment of time that will be lost forever.\n\nYou have done me a great service, hero. I offer you a gift from the Frostborn dwarves. Do with it as you please, but do not forget those that assisted you in this monumental feat."}
Q[24918]={p="¿Qué pasa, <race>?",pEN="What is it, <race>?",c="<Sylvanas reflexiona en silencio un momento antes de volver a dirigirte la mirada.>\n\nMe has prestado un gran servicio, héroe. Te ofrezco la bendición de la Reina Banshee. Haz con ella lo que quieras, pero no olvides a quienes te ayudaron en esta hazaña monumental.",cEN="<Sylvanas silently reflects for a moment before returning her gaze to you.>\n\nYou have done me a great service, hero. I offer you the boon of the Banshee Queen. Do with it as you please, but do not forget those that assisted you in this monumental feat."}
Q[24919]={p="¿En qué puedo ayudarte, <race>?",pEN="How may I be of service, <race>?",c="<Uther mira la medalla, sin palabras por un momento.>\n\nLa medalla de Arthas.\n\nRecuerdo bien el día que se la entregué...\n\nMe has prestado un gran servicio, héroe. Mi alma ahora puede descansar en paz. Te ofrezco un recuerdo perdido en el tiempo. Haz con él lo que quieras, pero no olvides a quienes te ayudaron en esta hazaña monumental.",cEN="<Uther stares at the medal, speechless for a moment.>\n\nArthas' medal.\n\nI remember well the day I presented it to him...\n\nYou have done me a great service, hero. My soul may now rest in peace. I offer you a memory lost in time. Do with it as you please, but do not forget those that assisted you in this monumental feat."}
Q[25000]={d="Día 1:\n\nHoy emprendí mi viaje para convertirme en sanador. Siempre he sentido una profunda conexión con la naturaleza y las fuerzas que la moldean, y he llegado a comprender que tengo un don para la magia de sanación. He oído que los druidas tienen un profundo conocimiento de la magia de la naturaleza, así que los he buscado.\n\nDía 5:\n\nHe estado estudiando con los druidas los últimos días y ya estoy aprendiendo muchísimo. Me han enseñado cómo comulgar con la naturaleza y aprovechar su poder. Puedo sentir la magia fluyendo a través de mí y estoy ansioso por continuar mi entrenamiento.\n\nDía 10:\n\nHoy realicé mi primer ritual de sanación. Fue una experiencia increíble. Sentí la magia de la naturaleza recorriéndome y pude sanar a un ciervo herido. Pude ver la gratitud en sus ojos y sentí una profunda satisfacción al saber que pude ayudar.\n\nDía 20:\n\nHe progresado mucho en mi entrenamiento. Los druidas están contentos con mi progreso y me han enseñado muchas técnicas avanzadas de sanación. Ahora puedo sanar heridas, calmar el dolor e incluso purificar el agua. Estoy seguro de que podré ayudar a mucha gente con mi magia.\n\nRecoge algo de madera de hierro.\n\nRecoge algo de cuerda elfa resistente. Hay rumores de que uno de los hermanos Shindigger podría tener formas de conseguir algo de ella.\n\nRecoge algo de medicina que se sabe que tiene propiedades para curar la fiebre de la selva.",dEN="Day 1:\n\nToday I set out on my journey to become a healer. I have always felt a deep connection to nature and the forces that shape it, and I have come to understand that I have a gift for healing magic. I have heard that the druids have a deep understanding of nature magic, so I have sought them out.\n\nDay 5:\n\nI have been studying with the druids for the past few days and I am already learning so much. They have taught me how to commune with nature and tap into its power. I can feel the magic flowing through me, and I am eager to continue my training.\n\nDay 10:\n\nToday I performed my first healing ritual. It was an amazing experience. I felt the magic of nature coursing through me, and I was able to heal a wounded deer. I could see the gratitude in its eyes, and I felt a deep sense of satisfaction knowing that I was able to help.\n\nDay 20:\n\nI have made great progress in my training. The druids are pleased with my progress and they have taught me many advanced techniques for healing. I can now heal wounds, soothe pain, and even purify water. I am confident that I will be able to help many people with my magic.\n\nGather some Iron wood.\n\nGather some sturdy, Elven string. There are rumours that one of the Shindigger brothers may have ways to acquire some.\n\nGather some medicine that is known to have properties for curing jungle fever.",o="Reúne los componentes para crear el arco",oEN="Gather components to create the bow",p="¡Has reunido los componentes! Ahora podemos combinar el arco. Nuestro siguiente paso será recibir la bendición de los druidas.",pEN="You''ve gathered the components! Now we may combine the bow. Our next step will be to receive the a blessing from the druids.",c="¡Has reunido los componentes! Ahora podemos combinar el arco. Nuestro siguiente paso será recibir la bendición de los druidas.",cEN="You''ve gathered the components! Now we may combine the bow. Our next step will be to receive the a blessing from the druids."}
Q[25001]={d="Te has embarcado en una misión para llevar un arco a un guardián de la arboleda que reside en Claroscuro. El arco que has fabricado con los mejores materiales es un símbolo de tu determinación y habilidad, pero aún no está terminado.\n\nEl paso final de tu viaje es hacer que el poder de los druidas bendiga el arco. Solo entonces se convertirá verdaderamente en un arma de gran poder, capaz de defender a tus aliados y vencer a tus enemigos.\n\nDebes llevar el arco al Guardián Remulos, quien lo imbuirá con la magia del bosque y la sabiduría de los antiguos druidas. Él convertirá el arco en un verdadero instrumento del equilibrio entre la vida y la muerte, y te otorgará el poder para usarlo para el bien.\n\nTen cuidado en tu viaje, ya que el camino hacia Claroscuro es traicionero y está lleno de peligros. Pero no temas, pues el poder del arco y la bendición de los druidas estarán contigo.",dEN="You have set out on a quest to bring a bow to a keeper of the grove who resides in Moonglade. The bow you have crafted with the finest materials is a symbol of your determination and skill, but it is not yet complete.\n\nThe final step in your journey is to have the bow blessed by the power of the druids. Only then will it truly become a weapon of great power, capable of defending the your allies and vanquishing your foes.\n\nYou must bring the bow to Keeper Remulos, who will imbue it with the magic of the forest and the wisdom of the ancient druids. He will make the bow a true instrument of the balance between life and death, and grant you the power to use it for good.\n\nBe wary on your journey, as the road to Moonglade is treacherous and filled with danger. But fear not, for the power of the bow and the blessing of the druids will be with you.",o="Lleva el arco sin encantamientos a Remulos en Monte Luna.",oEN="Take the Unenchanted Bow to Remulos in Moonglade.",p="¿Así que deseas recibir la bendición de la naturaleza? Que así sea.",pEN="So you wish to receive the blessing of nature? May it be so.",c="¿Así que deseas recibir la bendición de la naturaleza? Que así sea.",cEN="So you wish to receive the blessing of nature? May it be so."}
Q[25002]={d="Vuelve con Thu'lis y recibe tu entrenamiento para convertirte en Guardabosques",dEN="Return to Thu'lis and receive your training on becoming a Grove Ranger",o="Entrega el arco a Thu'lis en Bosque de Fuego",oEN="Deliver the bow to Thu'lis in Felwood",p="¡Lo has logrado, héroe! Con este nuevo poder podemos empezar a sanar este mundo, un héroe a la vez. Deseo compartir este conocimiento contigo y, juntos, salvaremos muchas vidas.",pEN="You've done it, hero! With this newfound power we can begin to heal this world, one hero at a time. I wish to share this knowledge with you, and together we will save the lives of many.",c="¡Lo has logrado, héroe! Con este nuevo poder podemos empezar a sanar este mundo, un héroe a la vez. Deseo compartir este conocimiento contigo y, juntos, salvaremos muchas vidas.",cEN="You've done it, hero! With this newfound power we can begin to heal this world, one hero at a time. I wish to share this knowledge with you, and together we will save the lives of many."}
Q[25003]={d="Objetos necesarios:\n\nCapucha de explorador oscuro\nArco de explorador oscuro\nFlechas de explorador oscuro\nCráneo élfico prístino\n\nRecupera el conjunto robado de un explorador oscuro.\n\nLa Capucha de explorador oscuro se puede obtener de figuras encapuchadas por todas las Tierras de la Peste.\nEl Arco de explorador oscuro puede ser adquirido por aquellos que visten el uniforme de la Cruzada Escarlata en las Tierras de la Peste occidentales.\nLas Flechas de explorador oscuro se pueden encontrar en aquellos que han sido víctimas del explorador oscuro en las Ruinas de Andorhal en las Tierras de la Peste occidentales.\nEl Cráneo élfico prístino se puede encontrar en exploradores de alto elfo que residen en las Tierras de la Peste.",dEN="Items Needed:\n\nDark Ranger's Hood\nDark Ranger's Bow\nDark Ranger's Arrows\nPristine Elven Skull\n\nRecover the stolen ensemble of a Dark Ranger.\n\nThe Dark Ranger's Hood can be obtained from hooded figures throughout the Plaguelands.\nThe Dark Ranger's Bow can be acquired by those who don the Scarlet uniform in Western Plaguelands.\nThe Dark Ranger's Arrows can be found from those who've become victim to the Dark Ranger within the Ruins of Andorhal in Western Plaguelands.\nThe Pristine Elven Skull can be found from High Elven rangers who reside within the Plaguelands.",o="Recoge la Regalia de la Exploradora Oscura.",oEN="Collect the Dark Ranger's Regalia.",p="Sientes un subidón de adrenalina y una sensación de poder tras completar un acto tan malvado. Te regodeas en el caos que has creado, sintiendo la emoción de tu capacidad para causar destrucción y daño. Al contemplar las secuelas de tus acciones, sientes satisfacción y orgullo por el miedo y el caos que has provocado. Tus principios, antes inquebrantables, han sido dejados de lado, sustituidos por el hambre de poder y la sed de violencia. El subidón de adrenalina de cometer actos malvados era embriagador, y sientes una retorcida sensación de alegría ante tu nuevo poder.",pEN="You feel a rush of adrenaline and a sense of power after completing such an evil act. You revel in the chaos you've had created, feeling a thrill of excitement from your ability to cause destruction and harm. As you survey the aftermath of your actions, you felt a sense of satisfaction and pride in the fear and chaos you've wrought. Your once-principled morals had been cast aside, replaced by a hunger for power and a thirst for violence. The adrenaline-fueled high of committing evil acts was intoxicating, and you feel a twisted sense of joy in your newfound power.",c="Sientes un subidón de adrenalina y una sensación de poder tras completar un acto tan malvado. Te regodeas en el caos que has creado, sintiendo la emoción de tu capacidad para causar destrucción y daño. Al contemplar las secuelas de tus acciones, sientes satisfacción y orgullo por el miedo y el caos que has provocado. Tus principios, antes inquebrantables, han sido dejados de lado, sustituidos por el hambre de poder y la sed de violencia. El subidón de adrenalina de cometer actos malvados era embriagador, y sientes una retorcida sensación de alegría ante tu nuevo poder.",cEN="You feel a rush of adrenaline and a sense of power after completing such an evil act. You revel in the chaos you've had created, feeling a thrill of excitement from your ability to cause destruction and harm. As you survey the aftermath of your actions, you felt a sense of satisfaction and pride in the fear and chaos you've wrought. Your once-principled morals had been cast aside, replaced by a hunger for power and a thirst for violence. The adrenaline-fueled high of committing evil acts was intoxicating, and you feel a twisted sense of joy in your newfound power."}
Q[25004]={d="Lei'shen fue una vez el gobernante de un gran imperio, conocido por su maestría en la magia de trueno y relámpago. Antes de su caída, creó un ídolo poderoso del que se decía que otorgaba a su portador un poder inmenso y control sobre los elementos. Sin embargo, el ídolo fue destrozado en cuatro reliquias y esparcido por la tierra para evitar que su poder cayera en las manos equivocadas.\n\nReúne las cuatro reliquias y aprovecha el poder del Rey del Trueno.\n\nSe dice que estas cuatro reliquias han sido esparcidas por todas las ruinas dentro del desierto.",dEN="Lei'shen was once the ruler of a great empire, known for his mastery of thunder and lightning magic. Before his downfall, he created a powerful idol that was said to grant its wielder immense power and control over the elements. However, the idol was shattered into four relics and scattered across the land, to prevent its power from falling into the wrong hands.\n\nGather and reunite all four relics, and harness the power of the Thunder King.\n\nThese four relics are said to have been scattered throughout the ruins within the desert.",o="Reúne las reliquias perdidas de Lei'Shen",oEN="Gather the lost relics of Lei'Shen",p="Ahora di mi nombre...\n\nEres el Rey Trueno...",pEN="Now say my name..\n\nYou're the Thunder King..",c="Ahora di mi nombre...\n\nEres el Rey Trueno...",cEN="Now say my name..\n\nYou're the Thunder King.."}
Q[25050]={d="El Refugio Cenariano reconoce tu valor al ayudar a los druidas y estudiar a los hechiceros naga. Impresionada por tu dedicación, Ysiel Windsinger conoce a alguien que busca a una persona de tu calibre; busca a Akino Solarsong en Nagrand.\n\nEs una adepta del sol y la naturaleza, así que lo más probable es que la encuentres en un lugar con mucha exposición solar. Suele ser una \"loba solitaria\", así que no esperes encontrarla en lugares concurridos.",dEN="The Cenarion Refuge recognizes your valor in assisting the Druids and studying the Naga sorcerers. Impressed by your dedication, Ysiel Windsinger knows someone that is looking for a person of your caliber, find Akino Solarsong in Nagrand.\n\nShe is an adept of the sun and nature, so you'll most likely find her in a place with a lot of sun exposure. She tends to be a \"lone wolf\", so don't expect to find her in crowded places.",o="Habla con Akino Solarsong",oEN="Speak with Akino Solarsong",c="Tú... Para estar aquí interrumpiendo mi toma de sol, Ysiel debe haberte enviado. Parece que has demostrado tu valía. El equilibrio de la naturaleza se regocija en tus triunfos. Puedo enseñarte el camino para empuñar el Sol y la Naturaleza juntos. Úsalo para el bien; toma esta 'Convergencia Verdante' como símbolo de mi confianza en tus habilidades y en Ysiel. Deja que su poder irradie a través de ti, otorgándote la fuerza del Sol y de los elementos.",cEN="You... To be here disturbing my sunbathing Ysiel must have sent you. Seems like you have proven your worth. The balance of nature rejoices in your triumphs. I can teach you the way to wield the Sun and Nature together. Use it for good, take this 'Verdant Convergence' as a symbol of my trust in your abilities and Ysiel. Let its power radiate through you, granting you the strength of the Sun and the elements."}
Q[25199]={d="¡Oye! ¡Tú nos podrías echar una mano!\n\nSi estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a apoyar nuestra causa, tenemos que entrenarte. El entrenamiento gnomo es brutal y riguroso, así que espero que estés $gpreparado:preparada;.\n\nPreséntate ante el sargento de maniobras Mecavapor; él te enseñará todo lo que necesitas saber. Asegúrate de que cumples sus órdenes cuando te las dé, o si no, nunca lo conseguirás.\n\nPero te aviso, no es fácil. Vuelve a verme... Si lo consigues.",dEN="Hey! You look like you could give us a hand!\n\nIf you're willing to help our cause,we have to get you through training. Gnome training is brutal and rigorous,so I hope you're ready.\n\nHead over to Drill Sergeant Steamcrank and he'll walk you through what you need to know. Make sure you follow his orders when he gives them,or else you'll never make it\n\nI'm warning you though,it's tough over there. Come back to see me,if you make it.",o="完成军士教练斯蒂姆兰克的命令，然后回去向崔德·火钻队长报告。",oEN="Follow Drill Sergeant Steamcrank's cues and then report back to Captain Tread Sparknozzle."}
Q[25212]={d="Pensábamos que podríamos esperar que la radiación se redujera en los alrededores de Gnomeregan, pero no parece que esté mejorando.\n\nSi queremos recuperar nuestra ciudad, tenemos que garantizar que es segura antes de que entren nuestras tropas.\n\nToma estos Radiageigatrones, súbete a mi \"Velocirrayo\" y lánzalos en los conductos de ventilación de las afueras de Gnomeregan. Me enviarán los índices de radiación directamente.",dEN="We thought that we could wait for the radiation to subside around Gnomeregan,but it doesn't appear to be getting better.\n\nIf we want to take back our city,we need to make sure it's safe for our troops to enter.\n\nTake these Radiageigatrons,hop in 'Thunderflash' here, and toss them at the ventilation shafts outside of Gnomeregan. They'll report the radiation levels directly to me.",o="使用飞行员杰夫·玛兹斯波克的飞行工具，将辐射计量仪投放到诺莫瑞根周围的通风口去。",oEN="Use Pilot Muzzlesprock's flying machine to toss Radiageigatrons at the vents surrounding Gnomeregan."}
Q[25246]={p="¿Buscas cambiar el camino que recorres, <name>?",pEN="You seek to change the path you walk, <name>?",c="Que encuentres lo que buscas, <brother/sister>.",cEN="May you find what you're looking for, <brother/sister>."}
Q[25247]={p="¿Buscas cambiar el camino que recorres, <name>?",pEN="You seek to change the path you walk, <name>?",c="Que encuentres lo que buscas, <brother/sister>.",cEN="May you find what you're looking for, <brother/sister>."}
Q[25248]={p="¿Buscas cambiar el camino que recorres, <name>?",pEN="You seek to change the path you walk, <name>?",c="Que encuentres lo que buscas, <brother/sister>.",cEN="May you find what you're looking for, <brother/sister>."}
Q[25249]={p="¿Buscas cambiar el camino que recorres, <name>?",pEN="You seek to change the path you walk, <name>?",c="Que encuentres lo que buscas, <brother/sister>.",cEN="May you find what you're looking for, <brother/sister>."}
Q[25283]={d="梅卡托克国王要我写一份战前演讲稿，但我还不能确定哪些话的演讲效果好，哪些的演讲效果会很糟糕。\n\n你能不能在本地侏儒居民面前试一下这些演讲？这个设备能产生一个梅卡托克的影像，并说出几句我写的演讲稿。\n\n让我知道演讲稿的哪部分比较好，行不？",dEN="High Tinker Mekkatorque asked me to write a speech that he could give before the battle starts, but I just can't tell which draft is good and which ones just stink.\n\nCould you try some of them out on the local gnome residents? This device creates an image of Mekkatorque saying a few lines from each of my speech drafts.\n\nLet me know which one works, okay?",o="分别在卡拉诺斯北边的奥齐·电环面前，钢架补给站的米利·羽哨面前和卡拉诺斯旅店外面的托格·锈链面前使用侏儒播放器。当所有演讲都播放完毕之后，回去见托比·速轮。",oEN="Use the Gnomish Playback Device in front of Ozzie Togglevolt north of Kharanos,Milli Featherwhistle at Steelgrill Depot and Tog Rustsprocket outside the Kharanos Inn. Return to Toby Ziegear when all the speeches have been given.",p="告诉我哪个方式效果好，行不？",pEN="Let me know which one works, okay?",c="我的天。他们反应不一？\n\n这可出乎我预料了，但我想我起码对这个演讲有点头绪了。\n\n让我再想想该如何措辞……",cEN="Oh my. Their reactions were that different?\n\nNot completely what I was expecting, but I think I have a speech that will do.\n\nJust let me find where I put it..."}
Q[25286]={d="Aquí está. ¡Este es el discurso, $n!\n\nTiene todos los elementos para ser una buena arenga: es inspirador, tiene un lenguaje elocuente y va dirigido a los gnomos. ¡Nunca se ha escrito un discurso mejor!\n\nLlévale esto al capitán Tread Chispaboquilla y consigue un transporte hasta el Manitas Mayor Mekkatorque.",dEN="Here we go. This is the speech, <name>!\n\nIt has everything to be a great battle starter: It's inspirational, has eloquent language and speaks directly to gnomes. Never has a finer speech been written!\n\nTurn this in to Captain Tread Sparknozzle and get some transportation to High Tinker Mekkatorque!",o="将演讲稿交给钢架补给站的崔德·火钻队长。",oEN="Give the speech to Captain Tread Sparknozzle at Steelgrill Depot.",c="¿Toby ha terminado ya con el discurso? Déjame ver...\n<Lee el discurso> ¡Pistones de bombeo! ¡Qué discurso tan fantástico! Sabía que Toby era un buen escritor, pero este es quizá el mejor que ha escrito jamás.\nCreo que es hora de que salgas a la batalla.",cEN="Toby is all done with the speech? Let me see...\n<Reads the speech> Pumping pistons! What a fantastic speech! I knew Toby was a good writer, but this is perhaps the best he's ever written.\nI think it's time to get you out to the battle."}
Q[25293]={d="除了那个神秘教派在城市中散布的混乱和猜疑之外，我们还收到了无数关于失踪人口的报告。人们的母亲、父亲、兄弟姐妹都在无缘无故地消失。我有一种感觉，这些失踪的人可能都在那个教派位于城外的某个基地中。如果我给你一些失踪者的名字，你是否能在那个教派的一座营地中找到他们？那座营地就在奥格瑞玛南边的野猪农场。如果你要进入那座营地，首先要从暗巷区的末日预言者手中得到一件信徒长袍。",dEN="Aside from the disturbances and the paranoia spread by the cult,we've been inundated with reports of missing people. Mothers,fathers,brothers,and sisters have seemingly disappeared,but I have a feeling that they can be found in one of the cult's compounds outside the city. If I give you the names of some of the missing people,would you try to locate them in the cultist camp at the Jaggedswine Farm south of Orgrimmar? To blend in,you'll need to get a robe from one of the doomsayers in the Drag.",o="穿上教派伪装，同杜隆塔尔野猪农场中的教徒卡加恩、教徒艾格塔、教徒托卡和教徒洛卡迦交谈。",oEN="While wearing your Cult Disguise,speak to Cultist Kagarn,Cultish Agtar,Cultist Tokka,and Cultist Rokaga at the Jaggedswine Farm in Durotar."}
Q[25295]={d="安全系统连通！马达引导！现在我们只需要确认它的火炮能正常射击。\n\n这应该不太难，$n。我们背后山丘上的步行坦克已经填装好教练弹。你只需要向附近的目标发射几轮炮火，然后就可以向我报告了。",dEN="Safety systems,online! Motor functions,functioning! Now all we need is to make sure that the guns will fire.\n\nThis shouldn't be too hard,<name>. The mechano-tank on the hill behind us has been loaded with harmless pellets. Just fire off a couple rounds at the nearby targets and report back to me.",o="利用附近的目标来测试射击型步行坦克的武器系统。",oEN="Test out the Shooting Mechano-Tank weapon systems on the nearby targets."}
Q[25306]={d="[ph] War!",dEN="[ph] War!\nRelated",o="[ph] Log Description",oEN="[ph] Log Description"}
Q[25343]={d="$n，你在这里干得很好。不过我们要做的不止是日常工作和传播消息。相信你在加入我们的时候对我们的任务已经有所了解了。\n\n就像你所知道的那样，这个世界即将结束。没有准备的人只能痛苦地死去\n\n而我们已经得到了一份赠礼，一个让自己更加强大的机会。先知戈拜兹正在这座农场东边的祭坛准备一场祭典。去那里找他。你可以从他那里了解更多关于我们的知识。",dEN="You're fitting in well here,<name>,but there is more to us than daily chores and spreading the message. I'm sure you heard a little bit about it when you first joined.\n\nAs you know,this world is ending and the unprepared will die painful deaths.\n\nWe have been given a gift,an opportunity to become something greater and more powerful. Overseer Golbaz is will be preparing a ritual before the altar at the eastern end of the farm. Wait there for him,and learn more of your new brothers and sisters.",o="在野猪农场东边的祭坛了解更多关于末日教的计划。",oEN="Learn more about the cult's plans at the altar in the eastern part of the Jaggedswine Farm."}
Q[25347]={d="第一批元素设备已经准备好了。你的任务就是将它们藏在奥格瑞玛人口密集的地方。等时刻一到，这些设备就会爆发出它们的火元素力量。不要担心，$n，那时你早已经到达安全地点了。\n\n注意不要引起任何人的注意。\n\n<那名监工递给你一个装了几个元素设备的包袱。这正是血卫士托雷克想要得到的证据。你应该尽快把这些设备交给他。>",dEN="The first batch of elemental devices are ready. Your task will be to conceal them inside the city of Orgrimmar. The devices will unleash their fire elementals at the proper time. Don't worry,<name>,you'll be safely away before that happens.\n\nDo not do anything that would draw attention to yourself.\n\n<The overseer hands you a package containing several of the elemental devices. This is just the kind of proof that Blood Guard Torek was hoping you'd uncover. You should probably bring the devices to him.>",o="将元素设备交给奥格瑞玛力量谷的血卫士托雷克。",oEN="Take the Elemental Devices to Blood Guard Torek in Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength."}
Q[25348]={d="No debes de ser $gel único al:la única a la; que hayan enviado a Orgrimmar a desplegar esos dispositivos con elementales de fuego. Tenemos que encontrar y desactivar el resto de los dispositivos antes de que liberen a sus elementales cautivos y quemen la ciudad.\n\n¿Estás suficientemente $gfamiliarizado:familiarizada; con los dispositivos como para destruirlos? Tienes que forzarlos y abrirlos antes de que los elementales de fuego que hay dentro tengan tiempo de alcanzar su fuerza máxima. Debería resultar fácil derrotarlos si abres los dispositivos pronto. Probablemente los cultores los habrán puesto por toda la ciudad.",dEN="You can't have been the only person sent into Orgrimmar to deploy those devices containing fire elementals. We have to find and disable the rest of the devices before set their captive elementals free and burn down the city.\n\nAre you familiar enough with the devices to destroy them? You need to break them open before the fire elementals inside have had time to reach full strength. They should be easy to defeat if you open the devices early. The cultists have probably put them all over the city.",o="打破元素设备，释放其中的元素。你必须击败5个暴怒的火元素。",oEN="Break Elemental Devices to release their elementals. You must defeat 5 Raging Fire Elementals."}
Q[25351]={d="$n，你战胜了暮光之锤，成功地保卫了奥格瑞玛，同时又没有让我们的人民有任何牺牲。当然，我们的敌人不会善罢甘休。古加尔不可能如此轻易就接受失败。\n\n你必须把这个消息带给萨尔。到智慧谷的格罗玛什堡垒去觐见萨尔。让我们的酋长知道，我们的敌人已经出现，我们必须准备好抵抗他们的反击。",dEN="You have successfully defended Orgrimmar from the threat posed by this Twilight's Hammer cult,<name>,and without shedding the blood of our own people. Our enemy will not rest for long. I cannot imagine that Cho'Gall will accept defeat so easily.\n\nYou must take word to Thrall. Go to the Valley of Wisdom and speak to him in Grommash Hold. Tell the warchief that our enemies have shown themselves and we must be prepared for their return.",o="同智慧谷中格罗玛什堡垒的萨尔交谈。",oEN="Speak with Thrall at Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom."}
Q[25380]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a La Pocilga, $n. Aquí todo el mundo trabaja para ganarse el sustento. Para algunos, eso significa cuidar de los animales. Otros se ocupan de nuestros proyectos de construcción. Otros trabajan para difundir nuestro mensaje entre la gente y creo que ese es un buen comienzo para ti.\n\nCoge esta pizarra. Contiene un breve mensaje sobre nuestras creencias. Lleva la pizarra y muéstrala en las torres de zepelines este y oeste a las puertas de Orgrimmar y en la plaza de Cerrotajo, al sur.",dEN="Welcome to the farm,<name>. Everyone here works to earn <his/her> keep. For some,that means caring for the animals. Others are responsible for working on our construction projects. Still others work to spread our message among the people and I think that's a good place for you to start.\n\nTake this board. It bears a short message about our beliefs. While wearing the board,visit the eastern and western zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar's gates,as well as the town square of Razor Hill,to the south.",o="带着灾难预言转至东飞艇塔，西飞艇塔和剃刀岭小镇广场。",oEN="While wearing your Doomsday Message,visit the East Zeppelin Tower,the West Zeppelin Tower,and the town square of Razor Hill."}
Q[25414]={d="除了那个神秘教派在城市中散布的混乱和猜疑之外，我们还收到了无数关于失踪人口的报告。人们的母亲、父亲、兄弟姐妹都在无缘无故地消失。我有一种感觉，这些失踪的人可能都在那个教派位于城外的某个基地中。如果我给你一些失踪者的名字，你是否能在那个教派的一座营地中找到他们？那座营地就在城门外西南方的明镜湖果园。如果你要进入那座营地，首先要在旧城区找到一名末日预言者，通过他加入那个教派，并从他手中得到一件信徒长袍。",dEN="The cult isn't just spreading fear and paranoia anymore. Now,I'm receiving reports of missing people. Mothers,fathers,brothers,and sisters have seemingly disappeared,but I have a feeling they can be found in one of the cult's camps outside the city. If I give you the names of some of the missing people,would you try to locate them in the cultist camp at Mirror Lake Orchard? It's southwest of the city gates. To blend in,you'll need join the cult and get a robe from one of the doomsayers in Old Town.",o="穿上末日教信徒长袍，同艾尔文森林中明镜湖果园的教徒莱瑟琳、教徒卡伊玛、教徒维曼和教徒奥伦交谈。",oEN="While wearing your Doomdsay Recruit's Robe,speak to Cultist Lethelyn,Cultish Kaima,Cultist Wyman,and Cultist Orlunn at Mirror Lake Orchard in Elywnn Forest."}
Q[25415]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a nuestro vergel, $n. Aquí todo el mundo trabaja para ganarse el sustento. Para algunos, eso significa cuidar de los árboles frutales. Otros se ocupan de trabajar en nuestros proyectos de construcción. Otros trabajan para difundir nuestro mensaje entre la gente y creo que ese es un buen comienzo para ti.\n\nCoge esta pizarra. Contiene un breve mensaje sobre nuestras creencias. Lleva la pizarra y muéstrala en el Cuartel de Arroyoeste, al suroeste de aquí, en la Plaza de la Ciudad de Villadorada al este y en el Valle de los Héroes en Ventormenta.",dEN="Welcome to our orchard,<name>. Everyone here works to earn <his/her> keep. For some,that means tending the fruit trees. Others are responsible for working on our construction projects. Still others work to spread our message among the people and I think that's a good place for you to start.\n\nTake this board. It bears a short message about our beliefs. While wearing it,visit the Westbrook Garrison,southwest of here,the town square of Goldshire just to the east,and the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind.",o="带着末日信息转至西泉要塞、暴风城的英雄谷和闪金镇的城镇广场。",oEN="While wearing your Doomsday Message,visit the Westbrook Garrison,the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind,and the town square of Goldshire."}
Q[25416]={d="$n，你在这里干得很好。不过我们要做的不止是日常工作和传播消息。相信你在加入我们的时候对我们的任务已经有所了解了。\n\n就像你所知道的那样，这个世界即将结束。没有准备的人只能痛苦地死去\n\n而我们已经得到了一份赠礼，一个让自己更加强大的机会。先知塔拉索正在这座果园北边的祭坛准备一场祭典。去那里找他。你可以从他那里了解更多关于我们的知识。",dEN="You're fitting in well here,<name>,but there is more to us than daily chores and spreading the message. I'm sure you heard a little bit about it when you first joined.\n\nAs you know,this world is ending and the unprepared will die painful deaths.\n\nWe have been given a gift,an opportunity to become something greater and more powerful. Overseer Talathor is preparing for a ritual at the altar just north of the orchard. Wait there for him,and learn more of your new brothers and sisters.",o="在明镜湖果园北边的祭坛了解更多关于末日教的计划。",oEN="Learn more about the cult's plans at the altar in the northern part of Mirror Lake Orchard."}
Q[25417]={d="第一批元素设备已经准备好了。你的任务就是将它们藏在暴风城人口密集的地方。等时刻一到，这些设备就会爆发出它们的元素力量。不要担心，$n，那时你早已经到达安全地点了。\n\n注意不要引起任何人的注意。\n\n<那名监工递给你一个装了几个元素设备的包袱。这正是安顿上尉想要得到的证据。你应该尽快把这些设备交给他。>",dEN="The first batch of elemental devices are ready. Your task will be to conceal them inside populated areas of Stormwind. The devices will unleash their elementals at the proper time. Don't worry,<name>,you'll be safely away before that happens.\n\nDo not do anything that would draw attention to yourself.\n\n<The overseer hands you a package containing several of the elemental devices. This is just the kind of proof that Captain Anton was hoping you'd uncover. You should probably bring the devices to him.>",o="将元素设备交给暴风城贸易区的安顿上尉。",oEN="Take the Elemental Devices to Captain Anton in Stormwind's Trade District."}
Q[25418]={d="No debes de ser $gel único al:la única a la; que hayan enviado a Ventormenta a desplegar esos dispositivos con elementales de viento. Tenemos que encontrar y desactivar el resto de los dispositivos antes de que liberen a sus elementales cautivos y creen tormentas por la ciudad.\n\n¿Estás suficientemente $gfamiliarizado:familiarizada; con los dispositivos como para destruirlos? Nuestra mejor baza es romperlos antes de que los elementales que hay dentro tengan tiempo de alcanzar su fuerza máxima. Busca los dispositivos por el Distrito de Mercaderes, la Plaza de la Catedral y el Barrio de los Magos. ¡Date prisa!",dEN="You can't have been the only person sent into Stormwind to deploy those devices containing wind elementals. We have to find and disable the rest of the devices before set their captive elementals free to create storms in the city.\n\nAre you familiar enough with the devices to destroy them? Our best chance is to break the devices before the elementals inside can reach full strength. Look for the devices in the Trade District,Cathedral Square and the Mage District. Hurry!",o="打破元素设备，释放其中的元素。你必须击败5个暴怒的风元素。",oEN="Destroy Elemental Devices to release their captive elementals. Defeat 5 Raging Wind Elementals."}
Q[25425]={d="$n，你战胜了暮光之锤，成功地保卫了暴风城，同时又没有让我们的人民有任何牺牲。当然，我们的敌人不会善罢甘休。古加尔不可能如此轻易就接受失败。\n\n你必须把这个消息带给瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王。到暴风要塞的王座大厅去觐见他。让我们的国王知道，我们的敌人已经出现，我们必须准备好抵抗他们的反击。",dEN="You have successfully defended Stormwind from the threat posed by this Twilight's Hammer cult,<name>,and without harming our own citizens. Our enemy will not rest for long. Indeed,Cho'Gall must already be busy planning his next move.\n\nYou must take word to King Varian Wrynn. Go directly to him in the throne room of Stormwind Keep. Tell the king that our enemies have shown themselves and we must be prepared for their return.",o="同暴风要塞的瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王交谈。",oEN="Speak with King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind Keep."}
Q[25444]={d="盲目行动是愚蠢的，所以我要制造一些小间谍，为沃金收集情报。他需要知道那些岛上都发生了什么。\n\n如果你愿意帮助我，我会非常高兴。让我告诉你该怎样做。首先，你要捉住那里的青蛙。它们很喜欢躲藏在森金周围棕榈树的阴影里。\n\n捉到青蛙以后，就把它们带到我的岗哨图腾来，在我的面前对它们施法。",dEN="Now,it would be foolish to go in blind 'ere,so I be creatin' some tiny spies to gather information for Vol'jin. He got to know what's goin' on over on de islands.\n\nI could use da help,if you be feelin' up to it. I tell ya how it's done. First,ya gotta catch de frogs. Dey like to stay in de shade of da palm trees around Sen'jin.\n\nOnce ya have de frogs,bring 'em over here to my sentry totem an' attune dem to me sight.",o="捉住5只森金青蛙，把它们带到瓦妮拉的岗哨图腾旁，在她的面前对它们施法。",oEN="Capture 5 Sen'jin Frogs and attune them to Vanira's sight at her Sentry Totem.",c="这些够我达成目的了。现在开始进行困难的部分。",cEN="These be enough for me purposes. Now comes de hard part."}
Q[25446]={d="这些青蛙都已经准备好了，我需要你帮我把它们送到那些岛屿上去。\n\n在森金村的东边，你能找到管理员曼雷克。他负责照管所有沃金哨兵的蝙蝠。所以他可以给你一只蝙蝠，让你飞到那些岛屿上空去。\n\n带上这口袋青蛙。我已经请求了英灵的指引。他们会升起烟雾，让你知道我需要探查哪些地方。你可以在蝙蝠背上将这些青蛙扔到冒白烟的地方。",dEN="Wit de frogs ready to go,I be needin' ya to help me send 'em out to the isles.\n\nOn de eastern side of Sen'jin Village,ya can find Handler Marnlek. He be handlin' all the bats for Vol'jin's scouts and he can loan ya a bat to get ya out to de isles.\n\nTake dis sack' o frogs with ya. I been askin' de spirits for guidance. Dey've sent smoke to show ya where I need de eyes most. While ridin' de bat,reach into de sack and toss de frogs toward de white smoke.",o="骑在蝙蝠背上，使用青蛙口袋，将12只被施法的青蛙投放到回音群岛的标志地点。",oEN="While riding a bat,use the Sack o' Frogs to place 12 attuned frogs on the markers in the Echo Isles.",c="Ya empiezo a ver lo que ven las ranas. Lo has hecho perfectamente, <name>. Ahora Vol'jin y yo veremos qué está planeando Zalazane.",cEN="I'm already beginnin' to see what de frogs are seein'. Ya done it perfectly, <name>. Now Vol'jin and I will see what Zalazane be plannin'."}
Q[25461]={d="沃金将他的战鼓交给我，让我负责训练这里的新兵。现在我唯一的问题就是找不到新兵。\n\n如果我把这面鼓借给你，你能不能在剃刀岭敲响它，代表沃金发布战争号召？只要你能激励几个巨魔来追随你，情况就完全不一样了。召集到志愿者以后，就把他们带回来，让我能训练他们。去找南边的管理员曼雷克谈谈。他会借给你一只蝙蝠，载你飞往剃刀岭。",dEN="Vol'jin has given me his war drums and put me in charge of trainin' da new recruits here. Only problem is we be short on new recruits.\n\nSupposin' I loaned ya dis drum,would ya use it to sound de call to war on Vol'jin's behalf in Razor Hill? If ya could even inspire just a few trolls to join da cause,it would make a difference. Once ya've convinced dem to volunteer,bring dem back to me for trainin'. Go over an' talk to Handler Marnlek to de south. He can lend you a bat for de ride to Razor Hill.",o="使用沃金战鼓，在剃刀岭招募5名巨魔平民。\n\n你可以从管理员曼雷克那里借来一只蝙蝠，飞往剃刀岭。",oEN="Use Vol'jin's War Drums to recruit 5 Troll Citizens in Razor Hill.\n\nYou can speak to Handler Marnlek for a bat ride to Razor Hill.",c="你找来不错的新兵蛋子啊。我会把他们严格训练，不驱逐扎拉赞恩不罢休。",cEN="Ya found some good ones. I be trainin' them hard and we won't stop until we've driven Zalazane from our islands."}
Q[25470]={d="还记得那些你帮我制作的间谍青蛙吗？现在它们发现了一些非常有趣的信息。\n\n在东南方的一座岛上，它们发现了一头猛虎。我从没有见过那样的猛虎，就算是其它老虎在它面前也都噤若寒蝉。\n\n而且，它不但有猫科动物的野性直觉，还有人类的心智。这头强大的野兽会成为我们有力的盟友。\n\n我会为你召唤那头猛虎之魂，利用它找到那头猛虎。这样你就能向那头猛虎发起挑战。如果你能战胜它，我们夺回家园的战役就会多一份战力。",dEN="Remember de frogs ya made into me eyes and ears? Well,dey've found somethin' interestin'.\n\nOn an island to de southeast,dey've spied a tiger even de other cats seem to fear. Dis tiger,I've never seen anythin' like it.\n\nIt hunts wit' da instincts of a cat,but de mind of a person. It could be a powerful spirit and a strong ally.\n\nI'll be callin' down the spirit o' the tiger upon ya. Use its gifts to locate this cat and challenge it. See if ya can win its aid in our battle for the isles.",o="在被注入猛虎之魂以后，将猛虎女王从它的藏身之地引诱出来，利用你的新能力战胜它。",oEN="While imbued with the Spirit of the Tiger,lure the Tiger Matriarch out of hiding and use your new abilities to best it in combat.",p="¿Has averiguado algo sobre ese tigre?",pEN="Did you find out anythin' about that tiger?",c="瓦妮拉的青蛙发现了真相吗？这头猛虎到底是个德鲁伊，还是说它是我们的盟友？我们不敢奢望有什么乐观结果。只希望在接下来的战斗中能有个好的预兆。",cEN="Vanira's frogs be tellin' de truth, den? Dis tiger be a druid and an ally? We couldn't be hopin' for a better outcome. Dis be a good omen for de coming battle."}
Q[25480]={d="Ha llegao el momento d'empezá a pensá sobre nue'tro primé movimiento. El Campeón Uru'zin me dice que sus hombres e'tán preparaos. Tú y Vanira hacé un buen trabajo reuniendo información del enemigo y encontrando nuevos aliaos.\n\nAhora, leemos los augurios. Averiguamos cuándo lanzar el ataque.\n\nBusca al médico brujo Hez'tok ce'ca del círculo de bailarines rituales. Empezará el ritual cuando e'tés $gli'to:li'ta;.",dEN="De time has come to start thinkin' about when to make our move. Champion Uru'zin tells me his men be ready. You and Vanira done good work gatherin' information on de enemy and findin' us new allies.\n\nNow,we read de omens. We find out when to launch de attack.\n\nFind Witch Doctor Hez'tok near the circle of ritual dancers. He be startin' de ritual as soon as ya be ready.",o="Habla con el médico brujo Hez'tok cerca del círculo de bailarines rituales fuera del Poblado Sen'jin cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada; para consultar los augurios.",oEN="Talk to Witch Doctor Hez'tok near the circle of ritual dancers outside Sen'jin Village when you're ready to consult the omens.",p="Bueno, ¿qué nos dicen los presagios?",pEN="Well, what do de omens tell us?",c="我会用心接受这个源自灵魂的忠告。有了他们和暗矛部族的支持，我们就要去夺回本属于我们的东西了！",cEN="I will take de spirits' advice to heart. Wit' dem behind us and de power of de ancient loas of de Darkspear Tribe, we be ready to reclaim what's ours!"}
Q[25495]={d="沃金正在指挥他的战士们为战斗进行准备。他要我转告你，去东边的那座岛上去找他和瓦妮拉。\n\n他和战士们就要向扎拉赞恩发动进攻了。$n，愿祖先之灵与你同在。如果没有你，这场战役对我们来说将只不过是一场泡影。同南边的管理员曼雷克谈一谈，他会给你一只蝙蝠，载你飞到部队的集结地去。",dEN="Vol'jin be gatherin' his gear and readyin' de warriors. He ask me to tell ya to meet with him an' Vanira on de island to de east.\n\nFrom dere,he and de warriors will launch de attack on Zalazane. May de ancestors go wit' you,<name>. Without ya,dis campaign would only be a shadow of what it become. Speak to Handler Marnlek,just to de south,an' he give you a bat to fly out to de stagin' area.",o="同管理员曼雷克交谈，乘蝙蝠飞到集结地去。在战争营地东边的岛屿上与沃金会面。",oEN="Speak to Handler Marnlek for a flight to the staging area. Meet Vol'jin on the island east of the war camp.",c="终于，一切就绪了。现在，我们要让扎拉赞恩明白藐视暗矛部族将有什么后果！",cEN="At last, everythin' be ready. Now, we show Zalazane what happen to dose who defy de Darkspears!"}
Q[25500]={d="Aquí está. ¡Este es el discurso, $n!\n\nTiene todos los elementos para ser una buena arenga: es inspirador, tiene un lenguaje elocuente y va dirigido a los gnomos. ¡Nunca se ha escrito un discurso mejor!\n\nLlévale esto al capitán Tread Chispaboquilla y pregúntale si puedes ayudarle en algo más.",dEN="Here we go. This is the speech, <name>!\n\nIt has everything to be a great battle starter: It's inspirational, has eloquent language and speaks directly to gnomes. Never has a finer speech been written!\n\nTurn this in to Captain Tread Sparknozzle and see if there's anything else he needs of you.",o="将演讲稿交给钢架补给站的崔德·火钻队长。",oEN="Give the speech to Captain Tread Sparknozzle at Steelgrill Depot.",c="托比的演讲稿？不是做梦吧？\n新兵，你完成了我们委托做的所有工作，我代表诺莫瑞根感谢你！\n我们正要率领一支精兵赶赴诺莫瑞根，你的帮忙就像雪中送炭。鉴于你的卓越贡献，我们邀请你加入诺莫瑞根预备队！\n这些聊表谢意，你值得拥有这些时尚的头盔。拿着吧，有一天也许会用到的！",cEN="This is the speech from Toby? Fantastic!\nRecruit, you've done all we could possibly ask for and the Gnomeregan Army thanks you!\nWe've got a strike team heading to Gnomeregan now and that wouldn't have been possible without your assistance. For all of your help, we'd like you to join the Gnomeregan Reserves!\nIt doesn't pay very well, but you do get this snazzy helmet. Hang on to that, you might need it someday!"}
Q[26012]={d="我的老朋友克拉苏斯送来消息，说龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿发生了可怕的事情。他的信非常简短。不过看样子，那座神殿下的红玉圣殿正遭受攻击。\n\n然而当下达拉然有些紧迫的事情让我不能立马亲自赶过去。我听说过你在巫妖王城堡中的事迹，相信你一定能胜任这个任务。也许你能代替我去帮助克拉苏斯？",dEN="My old friend Krasus sends word of dire happenings at Wyrmrest, in Dragonblight. His missive was brief, but it seems that there has been some sort of attack on the Ruby Sanctum beneath the Temple.\n\nPressing business here in Dalaran keeps me from attending to the matter personally, but I have heard word of your exploits in the Lich King's Citadel and you are doubtless up to the task -- perhaps you could assist Krasus in my stead?",o="转至龙骨荒野，和龙眠神殿中的克拉苏斯交谈。",oEN="Speak with Krasus at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",c="感谢你带来罗宁的消息，勇敢的冒险家。\n\n我来告诉你我们目前掌握的情报，必要时非常期待你能伸出援手。",cEN="Thank you for heeding Rhonin's call, brave adventurer.\n\nLet me share with you what we know regarding recent events, and any assistance you might offer would be greatly appreciated."}
Q[26013]={d="$R，这座神殿下面的红玉圣殿发生了可怕的事情。\n\n进入那座圣殿的入口已经被摧毁，那里的卫士们被屠戮殆尽。我们已经派遣斥候前去调查，但他们至今还没有回来。我禁不住开始为那里感到深切的担忧。\n\n进入红玉圣殿，去看看我的家园都发生了什么。当我们得到更多信息之后，我们就能相应制定下一步策略了。",dEN="<race>, something terrible has transpired within the Ruby Sanctum beneath the Temple.\n\nThe entry to the Sanctum is in ruins, and its guardians violently slain. We sent scouts to investigate, but they have not returned. I cannot help but fear the worst.\n\nEnter the Ruby Sanctum and discover what has befallen the home of my flight. Once we have more information, we can plan our next steps accordingly.",o="调查龙眠神殿之下的红玉圣殿。",oEN="Investigate the Ruby Sanctum beneath Wyrmrest Temple.",c="¡Gracias de nuevo, <class>, por rescatarme de las garras de Baltharus!\n\nSin embargo, aún queda mucho trabajo por hacer...",cEN="Thank you again, <class>, for rescuing me from Baltharus's clutches!\n\nThere is still much work to be done, however...."}
Q[26034]={d="这绝不是无谋的进攻，而是一场预谋已久，处心积虑针对红龙圣地的突袭，敌人的作战计划精细而狡猾。\n\n萨瑞瑟里安正在那边的山崖上指挥着这次攻势，但这支军队真正的首领是一头强大而自负的暮光巨龙——海里昂。他是希奈丝特拉的扭曲试验所塑造的巨龙怪物——继卓贡纳克斯之后的又一头成年暮光龙。\n\n$n，消灭他。击退这次入侵之后，去向克拉苏斯报告你在这里所见到的一切。",dEN="This was no reckless attack, but rather a carefully orchestrated strike against the heart of the Red Dragonflight.\n\nZarithrian, on the bluff over there, is overseeing the assault, but the true leader of this force is a brash and powerful Twilight dragon named Halion. Not since Dargonax has a full-grown spawn of Sinestra's twisted experiments been seen.\n\nSlay him, <name>, and then when the invasion has been fully repelled, report to Krasus regarding all you have seen here.",o="击败海里昂和入侵红玉圣殿的敌人。",oEN="Defeat Halion and repel the invasion of the Ruby Sanctum."}
Q[26035]={d="¡Héroe, necesitamos tu ayuda!\n\n¡Nuestros soldados que combaten a la Legión están cayendo en el camino y nuestro suministro de vendajes se está agotando!\n\nRecoge 16 vendajes de tejido de vacío. Naturalmente, serás generosamente recompensado por tu ayuda, héroe.",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur soldiers taking the fight to the legion are falling by the wayside, and our supply of bandages is running low!\n\nCollect 16 Netherweave Bandages. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Recoge 16 vendaje de trama abisal",oEN="Collect 16 Netherweave Bandage",p="Se necesitan más vendajes. Vuelve cuando hayas recogido los suministros necesarios.",pEN="More bandages are needed. Return when you have collected the required supplies.",c="Estas vendas salvarán vidas en el frente. Tu contribución al esfuerzo bélico es inestimable, héroe.",cEN="These bandages will save lives on the front lines. Your contribution to the war effort is invaluable, Hero."}
Q[26036]={o="Recoge 500 cristales de espíritu.",oEN="Collect 500 Spirit Crystals."}
Q[26037]={o="Recoge 500 cristales de espíritu.",oEN="Collect 500 Spirit Crystals."}
Q[26038]={d="¡Héroe, necesitamos tu ayuda!\n\n¡Nuestros soldados que combaten a la Legión están cayendo en el camino y nuestro suministro de vendajes se está agotando!\n\nRecoge 8 vendajes de tejido de vacío pesados. Naturalmente, serás generosamente recompensado por tu ayuda, héroe.",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur soldiers taking the fight to the legion are falling by the wayside, and our supply of bandages is running low!\n\nCollect 8 Heavy Netherweave Bandages. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Recoge 8 vendaje de trama abisal pesado",oEN="Collect 8 Heavy Netherweave Bandage",p="Se necesitan más vendajes. Vuelve cuando hayas recogido los suministros necesarios.",pEN="More bandages are needed. Return when you have collected the required supplies.",c="Estas vendas salvarán vidas en el frente. Tu contribución al esfuerzo bélico es inestimable, héroe.",cEN="These bandages will save lives on the front lines. Your contribution to the war effort is invaluable, Hero."}
Q[26039]={d="¡Héroe, necesitamos tu ayuda!\n\n¡Nuestros soldados necesitan desesperadamente un refuerzo de moral! Y entonces, me puse a pensar que tal vez podríamos levantarles el ánimo con una comida abundante.\n\nRecoge 10 basilisco ennegrecido. Naturalmente, serás generosamente recompensado por tu ayuda, héroe.",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur soldiers are in desperate need of a morale boost! And then, I got to thinking, maybe we could raise their spirits with a hearty meal!\n\nCollect 10 Blackened Basilisk. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Recoge 10 Basilisco ennegrecido",oEN="Collect 10 Blackened Basilisk",p="La despensa sigue vacía. Vuelve con los platos requeridos para completar este pedido.",pEN="The pantry is still bare. Return with the required dishes to complete this order.",c="¡Qué banquete tan fantástico! Las cocinas estarán ocupadas esta noche. Tus contribuciones culinarias son muy apreciadas, héroe.",cEN="What a fine spread! The kitchens will be busy tonight. Your culinary contributions are most appreciated, Hero."}
Q[26040]={d="¡Héroe, necesitamos tu ayuda!\n\n¡Nuestros soldados necesitan desesperadamente un aumento de moral! Y entonces, me puse a pensar que tal vez podríamos levantarles el ánimo con una comida abundante.\n\nRecoge 10 Clefthoof asado. Naturalmente, serás generosamente recompensado por tu ayuda, héroe.",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur soldiers are in desperate need of a morale boost! And then, I got to thinking, maybe we could raise their spirits with a hearty meal!\n\nCollect 10 Roasted Clefthoof. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Recoge 10 Pezuña de clefthoof asada",oEN="Collect 10 Roasted Clefthoof",p="La despensa sigue vacía. Vuelve con los platos requeridos para completar este pedido.",pEN="The pantry is still bare. Return with the required dishes to complete this order.",c="¡Qué banquete tan fantástico! Las cocinas estarán ocupadas esta noche. Tus contribuciones culinarias son muy apreciadas, héroe.",cEN="What a fine spread! The kitchens will be busy tonight. Your culinary contributions are most appreciated, Hero."}
