Q[407491]={d="El Overlord Runthak te espera en el Valle de la Fuerza.\n\n<Thrall te saluda.>\n\nNo hagas esperar a tu público, héroe.",dEN="Overlord Runthak awaits your arrival in the Valley of Strength.\n\n<Thrall salutes you.>\n\nDo not keep your public waiting, hero.",o="Busca al Soberano Runthak en el Valle de la Fuerza.",oEN="Seek out Overlord Runthak in the Valley of Strength.",c="Elige tu recompensa y que comience la celebración de tu gloriosa victoria.",cEN="Choose your reward and let the celebration of your glorious victory begin."}
Q[407496]={d="Busca al Mayor Mattingly en el Valle de los Héroes, <name>. Te estará esperando...",dEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes, <name>. He will be expecting you...",o="Busca al Mayor Mattingly en el Valle de los Héroes.",oEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes.",c="<name>, pocos son agraciados con tal ceremonia. Por favor, elige tu recompensa para que podamos comenzar la celebración.",cEN="Few are graced with such ceremony, <name>. Please, choose your reward so that we may begin the celebration."}
